{"job":{"id":20020208,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Park Place Technologies","title":"Remote Hands - SHI/Air Liquide - PPT1010199 - Wilson","description":{"html":"<p>We need someone at the location US085 on OCTOBER 5th at 11AM EDT<br />\n<br />\nThe scope of work is the following:<br />\nWe need someone there to help us on a major change that consists in re-create subnets from the switch and router.<br />\nA tech is being required because maybe we lost access when we apply some changes, so we need your help on this in case anything goes wrong.<br />\n<br />\nIMPORTANT: The PP tech needs console cables for:<br />\nHP JL725B / HP J9623A and Palo Alto Network PA220/440 (RJ-45 to USB console cable) and (USB C to C)<br />\nIMPORTANT 2: Please have in your computer:<br />\nPutty software, Webex APP and your OWN hotspot.<br />\nPlease plan for a 4 hour dispatch. Local Contact must be contacted upon arrival.<br />\n<br />\nPhysical requirements:<br />\nFire resistant Long sleeves, metallic boots, no shorts, hardhat, Safety glasses</p>","markdown":"We need someone at the location US085 on OCTOBER 5th at 11AM EDT  \n  \nThe scope of work is the following:  \nWe need someone there to help us on a major change that consists in re-create subnets from the switch and router.  \nA tech is being required because maybe we lost access when we apply some changes, so we need your help on this in case anything goes wrong.  \n  \nIMPORTANT: The PP tech needs console cables for:  \nHP JL725B / HP J9623A and Palo Alto Network PA220/440 (RJ-45 to USB console cable) and (USB C to C)  \nIMPORTANT 2: Please have in your computer:  \nPutty software, Webex APP and your OWN hotspot.  \nPlease plan for a 4 hour dispatch. Local Contact must be contacted upon arrival.  \n  \nPhysical requirements:  \nFire resistant Long sleeves, metallic boots, no shorts, hardhat, Safety glasses","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T11:00","end":"2026-10-05T13:00"},"payRange":{"mi