 MDF.\n- The printer management tool has an \"add printer\" button as well. We can ask the store to do the physical swap. After the swap is done, we ask techs to place the old printer in the box.\n- Will have a smart-sheet checkout and can provide the username/password for the printer management tool\n- Please see attached for the runbook\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Work with remote support to confirm placement, angle/aim, etc.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Pre Requirements**\n\n1. Confirm ETA: Call assigned manager one day prior to scheduled service to confirm arrival time/scope\n\n**Job Tasks**\n\n1. Pre-call: Call assigned manager prior to beginning survey\n2. Check-in: Enable GPS for check in OR submit photo of current location with time stamp\n3. Perform scope: Complete scope of work\n4. Enter closeout notes: Enter detailed description of work performed, must include:\n5. Site contact full name (that was present during service)\n6. Details of the work performed unless noted elsewhere; *can be referenced if runbook/form was submitted*.\n7. Any reimbursable materials must be noted with approving managers name.\n8. Upload deliverables/expenses: Upload deliverables/expenses.\n9. Post-call: Call assigned manager at conclusion of service to confirm receipt.\n10. Check-out: Enable GPS for check out OR submit photo of current location with time stamp\n\n***Required Deliverables***\n\n1. Photos - upload pictures of any/all completed work, including, but not limited to...\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- **Pre-approval:** *Provider must obtain approval from assigned PM by presenting reason and details for additional hours/expenses prior to incurring.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T09:00","end":"2026-09-24T11:00","latestStart":"2026-09-24T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":150},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/24/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Site Audit | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 04:00:00 - 07:00:00 GMT-4 | Requested Window (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (W