{"job":{"id":20021220,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pinnacle Communication Corporation","title":"N54600 - Guest Room Phone NDT  (REQUIRES REAL ID)","description":{"html":"<p>Technician to call tech support at 240-912-2529 opt. 1 then opt. 2 upon arrival and before departure from site.</p><p>Customer reports no dial tone in guest room 2193</p><p>Remote technician determined we need a tech on site to work with remote support to complete the following scope of work:</p><p>Troubleshoot / restore service to room 2193 on Carolina gateway 12 port 3.</p><p><u>NOTE: This jobsite is located inside a US army base.&nbsp;To gain entry, technician must be a US citizen, pass a background check, have a current secure driver's license, current registration and valid insurance for vehicle.&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></p><p><strong><em>Technician must take the following tools to the jobsite:</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Windows laptop with HSIA capability</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Serial cable with DB9 and DB25 to USB ends and Null Modem connections</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Telephone test set a.k.a. butt set</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Tone generator with tracking wand</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Punch down tool for both 66 and 110 blocks</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Cat 5 inserts and faceplates</em></strong></p><p><strong>TECH TO CALL TECH SUPPORT EVERY 15 MINUTES UNTIL A SUPPORT TECH IS AVAILABLE.</strong></p><p><strong>TECH MUST RECORD NAME OF PCC TECH THEY ARE CHECKING IN AND OUT WITH.</strong></p>","markdown":"Technician to call tech support at 240-912-2529 opt. 1 then opt. 2 upon arrival and before departure from site.\n\nCustomer reports no dial tone in guest room 2193\n\nRemote technician determined we need a tech on site to work with remote support to complete the following scope of work:\n\nTroubleshoot / restore service to room 2193 on Carolina gateway 12 port 3.\n\nNOTE: This jobsite is located inside a US army base. To gain entry, technician must be a