{"job":{"id":20022155,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"National Loss Prevention Solutions","title":"CCTV Install EXT Speaker Post Camera - J7832","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Must call Project Manager prior to entering the service location. If no response from PM's direct line please call 737-284-9228.</u></strong></li><li>Seeking a technician with experience in Local Low Voltage and Security Industry Licenses/Certifications skilled in Structured Data cabling installation, Camera and Alarm system installation, Access Control System installation</li><li>Tech is required to Check in upon Arrival, Unpack inventory materials, Provide materials listed per site scope of work and Verify installation layout and plans with either remote support or project Management.</li><li>Install \"EXT Faceshot\" located on the EXT speaker post - Example photo in WO</li><li>Camera is located inside speaker post</li><li>Wire is located inside old speaker post, there's a conduit connecting the old to the new. Wire may need a coupler and wire to reach new speaker post.</li><li>You'll be drilling through the metal speaker post to mount the camera</li><li>Insure camera displays on Drive Thru Monitor</li><li>Focus camera with WO manager</li></ul><p><strong><u>Reimbursements</u></strong></p><ul><li>All wire will be reimbursed($0.35 per FT)</li><li>This is a fixed rate job. All materials(with the exception of wire) are included in the initial rate unless discussed and approved by WO Manager.</li><li>Going over the \"Approximate Hours to Complete\" # will not be reimbursed for a fixed rate job with the exception of outlying circumstances discussed and approved by WO Manager.</li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong> Clean Shirt and Pants, Industry standard PPE as required</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li><em>﻿L</em>adder</li><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>RJ45 Cable Tester/Toner</li><li>Laptop with ethernet port or RJ45-USB Dongle and Patch Cable</li><li>Hotspot</li><li>RJ45 Crimper with RJ45s</li><li>CAT6 cable</li><li><u>Additional items per SOW</u></li><li><u>Caulk</u></li><li><u>Exterior screws(Tapcons/Wood/Self Tapping)</u></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Check in arrival with PM. <strong><u>PLEASE CALL 737-284-9228 for check-in</u></strong></p><p>Unpack and Inventory materials, Provide materials as listed per site scope of work.</p><p>Verify installation layout and plans with remote support/project management.</p><ul><li>Install \"EXT Faceshot\" located on the EXT speaker post - Example photo in WO</li><li>Camera is located inside speaker post</li><li>Wire is located inside old speaker post, there's a conduit connecting the old to the new. Wire may need a coupler and wire to reach new speaker post.</li><li>You'll be drilling through the metal speaker post to mount the camera</li><li>Insure camera displays on Drive Thru Monitor</li><li>Focus camera with WO manager</li></ul><p><strong><u>Cleanup</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Put all ceiling tiles back up and sweep up any drilling dust or insulation on the floor from your installation</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Upload/email images of installed materials.</p><p>Verify system online/functionality with remote support.</p><p>Provide cable and miscellaneous hardware for installation as details in SOW.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent National Loss Prevention Solutions while onsite.</li><li>&nbsp;Check in time with PM</li><li>&nbsp;Upload/Email photos of installation once completed.</li></ol><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Upload/email images of installed materials.</li><li>Check out time with PM&nbsp;</li><li>Check-out of work order</li></ol><p><strong>Directory Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Call Project Manager or Remote Support</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to Call Project Manager or Remote Support</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;As approved by Work Order/Project Manager</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- **Must call Project Manager prior to entering the service location. If no response from PM's direct line please call 737-284-9228.**\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Local Low Voltage and Security Industry Licenses/Certifications skilled in Structured Data cabling installation, Camera and Alarm system installation, Access Control System installation\n- Tech is required to Check in upon Arrival, Unpack inventory materials, Provide materials listed per site scope of work and Verify installation layout and plans with either remote support or project Management.\n- Install \"EXT Faceshot\" located on the EXT speaker post - Example photo in WO\n- Camera is located inside speaker post\n- Wire is located inside old speaker post, there's a conduit connecting the old to the new. Wire may need a coupler and wire to reach new speaker post.\n- You'll be drilling through the metal speaker post to mount the camera\n- Insure camera displays on Drive Thru Monitor\n- Focus camera with WO manager\n\n**Reimbursements**\n\n- All wire will be reimbursed($0.35 per FT)\n- This is a fixed rate job. All materials(with the exception of wire) are included in the initial rate unless discussed and approved by WO Manager.\n- Going over the \"Approximate Hours to Complete\" # will not be reimbursed for a fixed rate job with the exception of outlying circumstances discussed and approved by WO Manager.\n\n**Dress Code:** Clean Shirt and Pants, Industry standard PPE as required\n\n·\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- *﻿L*adder\n- Basic hand tools\n- RJ45 Cable Tester/Toner\n- Laptop with ethernet port or RJ45-USB Dongle and Patch Cable\n- Hotspot\n- RJ45 Crimper with RJ45s\n- CAT6 cable\n- Additional items per SOW\n- Caulk\n- Exterior screws(Tapcons/Wood/Self Tapping)\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nCheck in arrival with PM. **PLEASE CALL 737-284-9228 for check-in**\n\nUnpack and Inventory materials, Provide materials as listed per site scope of work.\n\nVerify installation layout and plans with remote support/project management.\n\n- Install \"EXT Faceshot\" located on the EXT speaker post - Example photo in WO\n- Camera is located inside speaker post\n- Wire is located inside old speaker post, there's a conduit connecting the old to the new. Wire may need a coupler and wire to reach new speaker post.\n- You'll be drilling through the metal speaker post to mount the camera\n- Insure camera displays on Drive Thru Monitor\n- Focus camera with WO manager\n\n**Cleanup**\n\n- **Put all ceiling tiles back up and sweep up any drilling dust or insulation on the floor from your installation**\n\nUpload/email images of installed materials.\n\nVerify system online/functionality with remote support.\n\nProvide cable and miscellaneous hardware for installation as details in SOW.\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent National Loss Prevention Solutions while onsite.\n2. Check in time with PM\n3. Upload/Email photos of installation once completed.\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Upload/email images of installed materials.\n2. Check out time with PM\n3. Check-out of work order\n\n**Directory Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Call Project Manager or Remote Support\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to Call Project Manager or Remote Support\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- As approved by Work Order/Project Manager","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T14:00","end":"2026-09-25T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payTyp