{"job":{"id":20012892,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Promotion Technology Group","title":"Chili's #1393  - Call #68383  - Site Survey","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Site reported: </strong>Tv #5 on right side of bar not working, checked every step in self help. No image at all</p><p><strong>**IF TV HAS AN ASSET TAG STICKER, TAKE A PICTURE OF THE TAG AND SERIAL #**</strong></p><p><u>For TV with \"Antenna Cable: Disconnected\" issue, please refer and perform the attached Samsung troubleshooting steps.</u></p><p><u> If issues are DirecTV related including their remotes, please advise the site to call DirecTV and schedule service with them.</u></p><ul><li>Technician to conduct a site survey of <u>ALL the TV</u>s in the restaurant and locate the ones that need replacements.</li><li>Troubleshoot and diagnose issue</li><li>Note down installation plan, TV sizes, and parts needed for the installation/replacement.</li><li>Take pictures of the make/model and serial #'s of TVs needing replacements.</li><li>Update MOD</li><li>Take necessary photos for the installation.</li><li>Do not exceed the agreed labor amount without prior authorization. Failure to get authorization can lead to non payment of overage.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Site reported:** Tv #5 on right side of bar not working, checked every step in self help. No image at all\n\n**\\*\\*IF TV HAS AN ASSET TAG STICKER, TAKE A PICTURE OF THE TAG AND SERIAL #\\*\\***\n\nFor TV with \"Antenna Cable: Disconnected\" issue, please refer and perform the attached Samsung troubleshooting steps.\n\n If issues are DirecTV related including their remotes, please advise the site to call DirecTV and schedule service with them.\n\n- Technician to conduct a site survey of ALL the TVs in the restaurant and locate the ones that need replacements.\n- Troubleshoot and diagnose issue\n- Note down installation plan, TV sizes, and parts needed for the installation/replacement.\n- Take pictures of the make/model and serial #'s of TVs n