o FA Panel. Work with Monitoring Co/HNOC to confirm lines are calling out  \nFXS Port-1 2392216870  \nFXS Port-2 2392216871  \n  \nSee work scope  \n  \nPlease review the following requirements and protocols for your upcoming assignment with Lit Networking:  \n  \nTo ensure the successful completion of this site visit, you must arrive with the following tools and materials: - A fully charged laptop with an Ethernet port and a cellphone with a hotspot device. - Cabling tools: Multimeter wire tester, butt set, punch down tool, crimpers, and wire cutters. - Hardware: RJ11 and RJ45 connectors, biscuit jacks, and 100 feet of Cat 5e/6 cable for potential device relocation. - Standard mounting kit: Drill, level, hammer, screwdrivers, screws, and anchors. - General supplies: Adjustable or open-end wrenches, a 4–6 ft ladder, and a 100 ft extension cord.  \n  \nWork Order and Payment Procedures All work orders must be signed by the onsite Point of Contact and must clearly list your arrival and departure times. Please upload the signed Lit Networking work order directly to Field Nation. Please be advised that any forged signatures will be reported to Field Nation and will result in non-payment. Adhering to these documentation requirements is essential to avoid any delays in your payment processing. If you encounter any issues while onsite, please leave a detailed message through the Field Nation platform.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T09:00","end":"2026-09-25T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":15},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end"