{"job":{"id":20023398,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Blueprint RF","title":"To Troubleshoot/Recover Offline Meraki Switch","description":{"html":"<p>Dispatch Requirements&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must call Tier 3/BlueprintRF NOC at 949-418-1336 before entering the site to obtain any special instructions, upon arrival, and prior to departure&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must send an email to dispatch@blueprintrf.com after the pre-site call confirming contact was made and noting any applicable instructions&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must follow all instructions provided by NOC/Tier 3 throughout the dispatch&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must arrive neatly dressed and professional&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must have all required tools, equipment, and materials necessary to complete the work order&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required Equipment</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Laptop with wired and wireless capability&nbsp;</p><p>Personal hotspot for temporary wireless connectivity&nbsp;</p><p>AeroAdmin/AnyDesk, LogMeIn, and TeamViewer installed and ready for remote access&nbsp;</p><p>Appropriate cabling and troubleshooting tools&nbsp;</p><p>Labeler&nbsp;</p><p>Console cable compatible with the installed MS350&nbsp;Meraki Switch</p><p>Tech will troubleshoot down switches and console into it and must provide access to NOC for configuration purposes (if applicable)</p><p>If cable run/uplink cable is bad, Tech will repunch, reterminate, repair or rerun the cable.</p><p>Cables used will be reimbursed as long as the price is reasonable.&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must troubleshoot offline access points accordingly once the switch is online</p><p>Tech must make sure all devices are online and wifi is working before leaving the site.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Before-Work Documentation</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Before beginning any SOW activities, Tech must take clear photos of the site, equipment, and work area&nbsp;</p><p>Photos must be uploaded to Field Nation before work begins&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>After-Work Documentation</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Upon completion of the SOW, Tech must take clear photos documenting the completed work, equipment, and work area&nbsp;</p><p>Tech must upload all after-work photos to FN</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Final Site Confirmation</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Before leaving the property, Tech must:&nbsp;</p><p>Confirm the final status of the Meraki Switch with NOC&nbsp;</p><p>Confirm the switch connection is operational&nbsp;</p><p>Provide NOC with a complete summary of all troubleshooting performed&nbsp;</p><p>Complete and upload all required after-work photos to Field Nation&nbsp;</p><p>Call Tier 3/BlueprintRF NOC at 949-418-1336 prior to departure&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"Dispatch Requirements\n\nTech must call Tier 3/BlueprintRF NOC at 949-418-1336 before entering the site to obtain any special instructions, upon arrival, and prior to departure\n\nTech must send an email to dispatch@blueprintrf.com after the pre-site call confirming contact was made and noting any applicable instructions\n\nTech must follow all instructions provided by NOC/Tier 3 throughout the dispatch\n\nTech must arrive neatly dressed and professional\n\nTech must have all required tools, equipment, and materials necessary to complete the work order\n\n**Required Equipment**\n\nLaptop with wired and wireless capability\n\nPersonal hotspot for temporary wireless connectivity\n\nAeroAdmin/AnyDesk, LogMeIn, and TeamViewer installed and ready for remote access\n\nAppropriate cabling and troubleshooting tools\n\nLabeler\n\nConsole cable compatible with the installed MS350 Meraki Switch\n\nTech will troubleshoot down switches and console into it and must provide access to NOC for configuration purposes (if applicable)\n\nIf cable run/uplink cable is bad, Tech will repunch, reterminate, repair or rerun the cable.\n\nCables used will be reimbursed as long as the price is reasonable.\n\nTech must troubleshoot offline access points accordingly once the switch is online\n\nTech must make sure all devices are online and wifi is working before leaving the site.\n\n**Before-Work Documentation**\n\nBefore beginning any SOW activities, Tech must take clear photos of the site, equipment, and work area\n\nPhotos must be uploaded to Field Nation before work begins\n\n**After-Work Documentation**\n\nUpon completion of the SOW, Tech must take clear photos documenting the completed work, equipment, and work area\n\nTech must upload all after-work photos to FN\n\n**Final Site Confirmation**\n\nBefore leaving the property, Tech must:\n\nConfirm the final status of the Meraki Switch with NOC\n\nConfirm the switch connection is operational\n\nProvide NOC with a complete summary of all troubleshooting performed\n\nComplete and upload all required after-work photos to Field Nation\n\nCall Tier 3/BlueprintRF NOC at 949-418-1336 prior to departure","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T09:00","end":"2026-09-25T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":69},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $140) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Site Audit | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 04:00:00 - 07:00:00 GMT-4 | Requested Window (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17: