{"job":{"id":20023686,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"South Bay International","title":"HEAD OR FOOT MOTOR REPLACEMENT","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU CALL THE CUSTOMER BEFORE ARRIVING TO THEIR RESIDENCE AND TO MAKE SURE THE PARTS ARE ON SITE.&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>HOW TO INSTALL A HEAD MOTOR</u></strong></p><p>https://youtu.be/q5jnyOe7wKs</p><p><strong><u>HOW TO INSTALL A CONTROL BOX AND RESYNC THE REMOTE</u></strong></p><p>https://youtu.be/HzYcanaecZg</p><p>We need a&nbsp;head motor&nbsp;and control box replaced for a residential customer<strong>. <u>The parts are ON SITE WITH THE CUSTOMER and you will need to call the customer to schedule an appointment</u></strong>. The remotes will&nbsp;also need to be re-synched.&nbsp;&nbsp;Please call us while on site if you have any issues, 1-800-723-0316 M-F 730AM-5PM PST</p>","markdown":"**PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU CALL THE CUSTOMER BEFORE ARRIVING TO THEIR RESIDENCE AND TO MAKE SURE THE PARTS ARE ON SITE.**\n\n**HOW TO INSTALL A HEAD MOTOR**\n\n<https://youtu.be/q5jnyOe7wKs>\n\n**HOW TO INSTALL A CONTROL BOX AND RESYNC THE REMOTE**\n\n<https://youtu.be/HzYcanaecZg>\n\nWe need a head motor and control box replaced for a residential customer**. The parts are ON SITE WITH THE CUSTOMER and you will need to call the customer to schedule an appointment**. The remotes will also need to be re-synched. Please call us while on site if you have any issues, 1-800-723-0316 M-F 730AM-5PM PST","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T10:00","end":"2026-10-02T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":165,"max":165},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/24/2026, 10:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.