{"job":{"id":20024937,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Infinity Retail Services","title":"Place 15 Inch Touch Screen in Store (30 Mins Max)","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Overview</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Seeking a technician with experience in Digital Signage and monitor installations.</span></li><li>A technician is required to acquire the digital signage player from the store and place it in the location called out in our video, plug it in, connect it to WiFi and wait for content to download. </li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">The new digital signage </span>player will be&nbsp;<strong>on-site before the technician arrives.</strong></li><li>The estimated on-site duration is&nbsp;Less than 30 minutes.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Dress Code</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Business Casual</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Tools Required</strong></p><ul><li>#2 and #3 Phillips bits</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Pre-Site Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Watch 5 Minute Youtube Video explaining where to put device and how to connect to WiFi</li></ul><p><strong>Check-In</strong></p><ul><li>Check in to the work order and introduce yourself to the on-site contact.</li><li>You are representing <strong>Infinity Retail Services</strong> while on-site.</li></ul><p><strong>Locate the Digital Signage Player</strong></p><ul><li>Ask the Manager for the Bluefin box.</li><li>Unbox the Bluefin and locate placement</li><li>Install the bluefin device</li></ul><p><strong>Connect to WiFi</strong></p><ul><li>Connect the player to the WiFi using the credentials in the confidential information</li><li>Reboot player and verify in the admin screen that status's are green</li></ul><p><strong>Installation</strong></p><ul><li>Wait for new content to download. This should take about 10 minutes max. </li></ul><p><strong>Equipment Handling</strong></p><p>Toss the box in the dumpster behind the store if applicable</p><p><strong>Documentation &ndash; After Installation</strong></p><ul><li>Upload/take clear photos of the player itself as well as fixture that is playing content.</li><li>Upload/take a storefront</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Communication Directory</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on the work order, contact the <strong>WO Manager</strong>.</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated directly to the <strong>WO Manager</strong>.</li><li>WO Manager is Alan Gabe. If you have questions, you can contact him at 715-641-0369</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Any additional hours or expenses must be <strong>pre-approved</strong> by the WO Manager.</li><li>Any additional hours or costs incurred <strong>without prior approval will be denied</strong>.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Digital Signage and monitor installations.\n- A technician is required to acquire the digital signage player from the store and place it in the location called out in our video, plug it in, connect it to WiFi and wait for content to download.\n- The new digital signage player will be **on-site before the technician arrives.**\n- The estimated on-site duration is Less than 30 minutes.\n\n**Dress Code**\n\nBusiness Casual\n\n**Tools Required**\n\n- \\#2 and #3 Phillips bits\n\n**Pre-Site Requirements**\n\n- Watch 5 Minute Youtube Video explaining where to put device and how to connect to WiFi\n\n**Check-In**\n\n- Check in to the work order and introduce yourself to the on-site contact.\n- You are representing **Infinity Retail Services** while on-site.\n\n**Locate the Digital Signage Player**\n\n- Ask the Manager for the Bluefin box.\n- Unbox the Bluefin and locate placement\n- Install the bluefin device\n\n**Connect to WiFi**\n\n- Connect the player to the WiFi using the credentials in the confidential information\n- Reboot player and verify in the admin screen that status's are green\n\n**Installation**\n\n- Wait for new content to download. This should take about 10 minutes max.\n\n**Equipment Handling**\n\nToss the box in the dumpster behind the store if applicable\n\n**Documentation – After Installation**\n\n- Upload/take clear photos of the player itself as well as fixture that is playing content.\n- Upload/take a storefront\n\n**Communication Directory**\n\n- If clarification is needed on the work order, contact the **WO Manager**.\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated directly to the **WO Manager**.\n- WO Manager is Alan Gabe. If you have questions, you can contact him at 715-641-0369\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Policy**\n\n- Any additional hours or expenses must be **pre-approved** by the WO Manager.\n- Any additional hours or costs incurred **without prior approval will be denied**.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-30T10:00","end":"2026-09-30T10:30","latestStart":"2026-09-30T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":120},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":0.5,"distance":52},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 0597