{"job":{"id":20030170,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Integral Tech Services","title":"Workstation Onboarding (4x) & IT Branch Assessment ","description":{"html":"<p><u>Hours</u>: 8-5, Mon-Fri</p>\n<p><strong><u>Summary</u></strong>:</p>\n<p>Onboard <strong>(4x)</strong> New Dell OptiPlex 7020 workstations using the provided workstation onboarding runbook &amp; complete the IT Branch Assessment form.</p>\n<p><strong>**<u>Attached to the WO</u>- PLEASE READ PRIOR TO REQUESTING WO**</strong></p>\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Workstation Onboarding Runbook</strong></p>\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>List of Old Workstation Serial Number &amp; New Workstation Serial Number that will replace it. Workstation Name for Labeling.</strong></p>\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>IT Branch Assessment Form</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>REQUIRED</u></strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PPE – Safety vest, safety glasses, harness, steel toe boots</li>\n<li>Label-maker, labels</li>\n<li>Cable Tester/Toner</li>\n<li>2x 3ft Patch Cables (Just in case for replacement)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>SCOPE</u></strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><u>Check-in</u>: Once onsite, TEXT the ITS Contact to check in. Then check in with the BRANCH Manager and Remote Herc Engineer.</li>\n<li>Complete workstation onboarding using “Workstation Deployment Runbook” in WO documents.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE: We’ve included documentation of each old device’s serial number and the new device serial number that will replace it.</p>\n<p>Tech MUST follow these instructions. Additionally, All new machines MUST be labeled (New Device Name)</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Complete “IT Branch Assessment” form in WO documents.</li>\n<li>Request Branch Manager to scan completed IT Branch Assessment form and email to CourtneyP@iconvergence.com. &amp; JohnD@iConvergence.com. Email must be received prior to technician release from site.</li>\n<li>Text final pictures of labele