BEFORE CHECKING OUT.</li></ol><p>6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Check out with remote engineer, Branch Manager and ITS Contact.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>Contact info:</u></strong></p><ul><li>ITS Contact/Project Manager: <del>******* *************</del></li><li>Site Contact: <del>****** *******</del></li><li>Remote Herc IT Support- <del>***** ***** * ******************</del></li></ul>","markdown":"Hours: 8-5, Mon-Fri\n\n**Summary**:\n\nOnboard **(3x)** New Dell OptiPlex 7020 workstations using the provided workstation onboarding runbook & complete the IT Branch Assessment form.\n\n**\\*\\*Attached to the WO- PLEASE READ PRIOR TO REQUESTING WO\\*\\***\n\n· **Workstation Onboarding Runbook**\n\n· **List of Old Workstation Serial Number & New Workstation Serial Number that will replace it. Workstation Name for Labeling.**\n\n· **IT Branch Assessment Form**\n\n**REQUIRED**:\n\n- PPE – Safety vest, safety glasses, harness, steel toe boots\n- Label-maker, labels\n- Cable Tester/Toner\n- 2x 3ft Patch Cables (Just in case for replacement)\n\n**SCOPE**:\n\n1. Check-in: Once onsite, TEXT the ITS Contact to check in. Then check in with the BRANCH Manager and Remote Herc Engineer.\n2. Complete workstation onboarding using “Workstation Deployment Runbook” in WO documents.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: We’ve included documentation of each old device’s serial number and the new device serial number that will replace it.\n\nTech MUST follow these instructions. Additionally, All new machines MUST be labeled (New Device Name)\n\n1. Complete “IT Branch Assessment” form in WO documents.\n2. Request Branch Manager to scan completed IT Branch Assessment form and email to CourtneyP@iconvergence.com. & JohnD@iConvergence.com. Email must be received prior to technician release from site.\n3. Text final pictures of labeled workstations & MDF/IDF to ITS Project Manager BEFORE CHECKING OUT.\n\n6\\. Check out with remote engineer, Branch Manager and ITS Contact.\n\n**Contact info:**\n\n- ITS Contact/Project Manager: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Site Contact: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Remote Herc IT Support- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T08:30","end":"2026-10-05T14:30"},"payRange":{"min":400,"max":450},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":6,"amount":400},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":58},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"blended","counterRate":66.66666666666667,"baseAmount":466.6666666666667,"estHours":6,"travelExpense":85,"payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":6,"amount":400},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":66.66666666666667}},"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T18:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise Conversion — Oxford, NC"}],"action":"COUNTER","ts":1790300228047}
{"job":{"id":20030703,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Comm-Works","title":"Chase Branch/ATM | New Era ticket: BF-13242: NDI | Tech to check backup router down","description":{"html":"<p>BF-13242: NDI | Tech to check backup router down</p><p>Technician should certify the cabling and replace any faulty cables. The technician needs to bring the necessary tools to certify the cabling.</p><p>Tech to reboot&nbsp;router</p><p>Tech will validate if the&nbsp;connection issue is solved</p><p>Tech will need a fully powered laptop with a console cable in case a webex session is required</p><p>Date/Time: 09/25 at 09:00 Local Time</p><p>Address: 8101 Brier Creek Pkwy</p><p>Raleigh, NC 27617</p><p>Photograph register and device status please be send me: JPMC_NRR_Retail@jpmchase.com</p><p>Call GNOC 8885305499</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Kindly Call CSC Hotline: 888-566-8900 to Check in/Check out. Provide Ticket#: BF-13242</strong></p><p><strong>And Call GNOC Hotline: 888-530-5499 to Check in/Check Out and for Remote Support. Provide ticket#:  IMTASK1928270</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT: Get the Name and SID of your Remote Support and take a summary of resolution notes.</strong></p><p><strong>Provide those details when you check-out with CSC 888-566-8900.</strong></p><p><strong>NO INFO PROVIDED, NO PAY. It will serve as your clearance for work, please make sure to get it.&nbsp;</strong></p>","markdown":"BF-13242: NDI | Tech to check backup router down\n\nTechnician should certify the cabling and replace any faulty cables. The technician needs to bring the necessary tools to certify the cabling.\n\nTech to reboot router\n\nTech will validate if the connection issue is solved\n\nTech will need a fully powered laptop with a console cable in case a webex session is required\n\nDate/Time: 09/25 at 09:00 Local Time\n\nAddress: 8101 Brier Creek Pkwy\n\nRaleigh, NC 27617\n\nPhotograph register and device status please be send me: JPMC\\_NRR\\_Retail@jpmchas