{"job":{"id":"1993224428","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Shelf Level Retail Solutions LLC","title":"8381C - BUG SOOTHER MAX 8OZ - Merchandising QR code placement. and product purchase","description":"<p>Before Visit: Print off 1 page of the QR code promotion and cut out two of the QR promotions. Bring tape with you to the store. During store visits, reps will perform the following tasks: 1. Check to ensure the assigned sidekick display is located on the sales floor. 2. If the display is not on the sales floor, work with the store manager to locate the display and place it on the sales floor. Sidekick was supposed to be set out for 4th of July promo. 3. If the manager states that the display has already been broken down, ask whether it is possible to merchandise the product in a feature location. 4. Verify that the display price tag is properly placed on the display. If it is missing, work with the manager to obtain and place the correct display price tag. 5. Replenish and straighten product on the display to ensure it is full and properly merchandised. 6. Tape both copies of the QR code promo sheets to the side of the sidekick display. 6. Take clear photos of the completed display on the sales floor with the QR codes taped to the display. If display placement is not permitted, take photos of the product on the shelf instead. 7. Purchase 4 units of each sku for a total of 8 units.</p><p>Visit Wrap-up: • If you receive pushback on any requested task during the visit, document the reason provided and capture the store manager's name in your reporting.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T10:18","end":"2026-09-24T14:18"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":31.5},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":0},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/24/2026, 10:18:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-