{"job":{"id":"4754588599","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Shift4 Payments","title":"Support/Service - Dine","description":"<p>Estimated Time Onsite: 1-3 Hours</p><p><strong>*Any additional time spent onsite must be approved by the POS Support Supervisor or the Internal Owner of the Assignment.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>*Please note Shift4 does not offer cabling/cable run services any cabling must be handled by the merchant (we recommend by a low voltage electrician)</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Upon arrival:</p><ul><li>Check-in with location contact, do a walkthrough of location and talk to them about the issues they are experiencing</li><li>Check-in on the WorkMarket app</li><li>Call your Support Contact to touch base, provide them with case # and start troubleshooting</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>If it is determined that hardware needs to be replaced, please inform your support contact immediately so they can make the determination and place an equipment swap.</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>If there is any equipment/cabling that could be tidied up, use zip ties or Velcro straps to make sure the merchant's location is presentable.</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;Within 24 hours after the appointment:</strong></p><ul><li>1. Enter&nbsp;DETAILED&nbsp;appointment resolution notes on the work order, notes must be entered in the Work Summary section, not messages. Failure to provide detailed notes in the correct section could lead to delays in payment.</li><li>2. Make sure all deliverables/photos are uploaded</li><li>3. Close the work order for review/payment</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Required Tools:</strong></p><p>Laptop - Basic Hand tools &amp; Drill - RJ45 Crimper and Punch Down Tool -&nbsp;RJ 45 Ends - Keystone jacks - Biscuit jacks - Network Line Tester - Phone Camera - USB keyboard / Mouse -&nbsp;Zip Ties or Velcro - Usb Flash Drive</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Other Compensation:</strong></p><p>Power Strips</p><p>Switches</p><p>Other - Price of equipment + Tax&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Out of scope expenses must be approved by POS Support Supervisor</strong></p><p><strong>If you purchase any equipment we require you to provide a photo of the receipt prior to additional funds being provided to you.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>For Feedback or Escalations:</strong></p><p>Please email ossmanagement@shift4.com or reach out directly to the internal owner of your assignment for any feedback or if escalation is needed. The assignment owner is the best point of contact for addressing any concerns or additional steps required.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Assignment Cancellation / Reschedule Policy:</strong></p><p>If an assignment gets cancelled, you may not be entitled to the full payment for the work that was expected to be performed. However, Shift4 has a policy to compensate you for the travel expenses and the time you have already spent on-site.</p><p><br></p><p>If a site cancels with Over 24 hours notice - $0.00</p><p>If a site cancels with Under 24 hours notice - $30.00</p><p>If a site cancels after tech arrives to site - Travel Comp + Comp for Wait time on site.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00","end":"2026-09-25T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":165},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":12.1},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $165 (countered: $75) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25