{"job":{"id":20006332,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Axper","title":"Talbots 307 - Cabling and IP camera installation","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Talbots Store – IP People-Counter Camera Installation and Cabling</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Short Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Installation for advanced cabling technicians, two technicians are required.</li>\n<li>The store is equipped with 2 entrances to be cabled from each entrance to the back office. The access to the ceiling appears to be limited.</li>\n<li>A site survey (15-20 min.) is mandatory at least one week before the installation to evaluate the cable route, required materials, ceiling conditions and equipment needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Included in estimated pay rate:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Survey: $150</li>\n<li>Travel Fees: $55</li>\n<li>Material and consumable: $65 (per entrance)</li>\n<li>Labor for two technicians</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Scope of Work</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install IP people-counter camera near the store entrance. Usually around 3 feet from the door, centered as much as possible.</li>\n<li>Run and terminate one network cable from the network room to the camera.</li>\n<li>Test and label the cable.</li>\n<li>Provide completion photos and cable-test results.</li>\n<li>Estimated duration: 3-4 hours on site for both technicians.</li>\n<li>Work must begin at 6:00 a.m. (The store opens at 10:00 a.m.)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Technician Requirements</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong cabling experience.</li>\n<li>Two technicians must be present.</li>\n<li>Properly equipped for difficult cable routes</li>\n<li>Cat5e or better solid-copper cable; appropriate CMP/plenum-rated cable when required; no CCA.</li>\n<li>Termination tools, cable tester, toner, fish rods, fish tape, drill and appropriate ladder 8 feet and up.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Check-In and Installation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Upon arrival, technicians must call Axper before starting<strong><u>1-866-658-2360 option 470</u></strong>.</li>\n<li>The store opens at 10am. Axper will communicate with you a 9 am for a check point if the installation is not yet completed.</li>\n<li>Any additional work or material must be approved by Axper before proceeding. Technicians must receive Axper’s approval before leaving the site.</li>\n<li>Any issues must be reported immediately to <strong><u>Axper 1-866-658-2360 option 470&nbsp;</u></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>","markdown":"**Talbots Store – IP People-Counter Camera Installation and Cabling**\n\n **Short Description**\n\n- Installation for advanced cabling technicians, two technicians are required.\n- The store is equipped with 2 entrances to be cabled from each entrance to the back office. The access to the ceiling appears to be limited.\n- A site survey (15-20 min.) is mandatory at least one week before the installation to evaluate the cable route, required materials, ceiling conditions and equipment needed.\n\n **Included in estimated pay rate:**\n\n- Survey: $150\n- Travel Fees: $55\n- Material and consumable: $65 (per entrance)\n- Labor for two technicians\n\n **Scope of Work**\n\n- Install IP people-counter camera near the store entrance. Usually around 3 feet from the door, centered as much as possible.\n- Run and terminate one network cable from the network room to the camera.\n- Test and label the cable.\n- Provide completion photos and cable-test results.\n- Estimated duration: 3-4 hours on site for both technicians.\n- Work must begin at 6:00 a.m. (The store opens at 10:00 a.m.)\n\n **Technician Requirements**\n\n- Strong cabling experience.\n- Two technicians must be present.\n- Properly equipped for difficult cable routes\n- Cat5e or better solid-copper cable; appropriate CMP/plenum-rated cable when required; no CCA.\n- Termination tools, cable tester, toner, fish rods, fish tape, drill and appropriate ladder 8 feet and up.\n\n **Check-In and Installation**\n\n- Upon arrival, technicians must call Axper before starting**1-866-658-2360 option 470**.\n- The store opens at 10am. Axper will communicate with you a 9 am for a check point if the installation is not yet completed.\n- Any additional work or material must be approved by Axper before proceeding. Technicians must receive Axper’s approval before leaving the site.\n- Any issues must be reported immediately to **Axper 1-866-658-2360 option 470**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T06:00","end":"2026-10-09T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":815,"max":815},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":57},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No in-hours counter slot available\nRequested: Fri, Oct 9, 6:00 AM\nChecked: Fri, Oct 9, Mon, Oct 12, Tue, Oct 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cu