{"job":{"id":20033442,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Trooh","title":"C#5004 Alamance Community College","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: black;\">Hello! We need a technician to troubleshoot our</span><strong style=\"color: black;\"> TV screen(s)</strong><span style=\"color: black;\"> on site.</span></p><ul><li>Download WhatsApp -&nbsp;https://wa.me/19298379142</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Some Important info to know to get the job done successfully</p><ul><li>Issue: Lost connectivity</li><li>Location: Student Lounge, Left TV when facing screens</li><li>DIMS: 55\"</li><li>Quantity:1</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Parts required: USB mouse and keyboard, 8-10ft ladder, </span>Laptop with HDMI &amp; Ethernet ports/adapter, SIM Pin<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">​</span></li><li>Special Instructions: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">provide hotspot connection (200 Megabytes per hr)</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Special instructions:</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Before your leave</u></strong></p><p>Upload photos (Proof of Performance)</p><ul><li>Ensure Picture Area is Clean – No Clutter</li><li>Take wide angled photos showing the entire space</li><li>Take close up shots of the tower</li><li>Make Screen the Main Object of the Picture</li><li>5 Pictures Minimum</li><li>Ensure No Glare on Screens</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Skills Needed:</strong></p><ul><li>Knowledge of remote applications (TeamViewer or GoToAssist)</li><li>Connect to Network: Wireless, Wired or Router with SIM card</li><li>Basic windows knowledge &amp; computer troubleshooting skillset</li><li>Required to use WhatsApp</li><li>SIM card ejector (pin) needed</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Please contact us if you have any questions</p><p>Trooh Support - support@trooh.com</p>","markdown":"Hello! We need a technician to troubleshoot our **TV screen(s)** on site.\n\n- Download WhatsApp - <https://wa.me/19298379142>\n\nSome Important info to know to