{"job":{"id":20033365,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Network Engineering Technologies","title":"ShopperTrak - Service Call Ticket - Petsmart - Garner - Technician must arrive on time. -- If you run into an issue onsite and a","description":{"html":"<p>ShopperTrak - Service Call Ticket - Petsmart - Garner - Technician must arrive on time. -- If you run into an issue onsite and are unable to resolve it yourself within 15-20 minutes please call NET. Do not discuss or comment on the Orbit technology with store managers.<br>_______________________________________________________________________________________<br><br></p><p>Description: TECH SHOULD Call 312-529-5304 (24/7 Support line) or ZARROD at 312-676-8336 for service support.</p><p><br></p><p>Current issue:</p><p>Orbit 8 (EP2) is offline&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Instructions:&nbsp;</p><p>TECH ---- ST has lost connection to the Orbit 8 connected to the ST600 on-site. <span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;>Troubleshoot the Orbit 8.</span> No EQ needed. Be prepared to rerun HR cable. All unused ST eq, tech will need to be placed in the shipping box. Please tell the tech to initiate the Call Tag or follow the RMA process. Ensure the homerun cable and patch panel ports are labeled “ST” or “ShopperTrak”.</p><p><br></p><p>Tools Required: Label Maker, 314 Punch Tool, Wire Strippers, Wire Cutters,Ladder,Tape Measure, Level, Fish Tape, Wire Ties, RJ315 Crimp Tool, RJ315 Male Modular Connectors, Punch tool, cable tester, laptop, Standard tools required&nbsp;</p><p>Ladder or Lift needed: Ladder</p><p>Ceiling Height:9'&nbsp;</p><p># Of Orbits in the store: 2</p><p><br></p><p>Special Instructions: 2.9 and 2.1</p><br><p><br>*Required Materials:<br>**Tech should bring patching compound to fill any holes left when mounting orbit/s.**<br>Cat5e or cat6 cable<br>Minimum 10ft ladder<br>Misc Cat5 materials: jacks, surface mount boxes, patch cords, etcetera…<br><br>*Required Tools:<br>Digital camera or smartphone 