{"job":{"id":20034476,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"*PRE SITE PART PICKUP REQUIRED* Reg 7 replace printer","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p>Scope of Work: The technician is required to replace the faulty Epson TM-H6000V printer at Register 07, as it is not powering on and is unresponsive even after cable reseating and swapping with another printer. The replacement printer must be installed, configured, and tested to ensure proper functionality, including verifying power, connectivity, and printing capabilities. Testing should confirm that the printer is recognized in the device manager and operates correctly with the register. If any issues persist, the technician should contact FE support at <del>************</del>for further assistance.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Site Security Code #</p>\n<p>Customer Incident # INC0131023</p>\n<p>Clients present issue: Printer offline at Register 07</p>\n<p>Estimated time: 2 hours</p>\n<p>Part shipped to the site? Yes</p>\n<p>Helpdesk number of the customer: Victoria’s Secret<del>**************</del></p>\n<p>Please review the repair plans in the link below</p>\n<p>https://uploads.tdsynnex.com/f/0cc67a88e7289aa4</p>\n<p>Other Instructions:</p>\n<p>If assistance is needed, please call:<del>************************ * *</del></p>\n<p>Required Tool List:</p>\n<p>https://sigtech.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/i0000000JqJY/a/5A000000YQTH/9gnaImll4VecAy1sI2UPOKqG7leVPWHltq_ila4IVaA</p>\n<p>Completion Requirements:</p>\n<p><strong>Closing Notes</strong> – <strong>Should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only.</strong> If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be a detailed and concise statement about the work performed. <strong>Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay 