{"job":{"id":20034786,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"DarTex Technical Services","title":"Two Issues 1 The AV console's Ethernet  connection test cabling replace or recrimp ends/ 2 Check audio DSP for errors and gain  structure. make minor tweaks if  necessary","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of work:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p> Work order 1Cenero Work Order - WON1033658&nbsp;</p><p>Client room: Kiewit - Raleigh, NC - Hatteras 577. The AV console's Ethernet connection needs to be plugged in and out often for it to start working again. Test and verify cabling. Replace or re-crimp ends. Verify the connection port is not damaged.&nbsp;</p><p>Work order 2 Cenero Work Order - WON1033659</p><p> Client room Kiewit - Raleigh, NC - Divisible Training Room Greensboro 505/507 Shared&nbsp;</p><p>People on Teams calls frequently complain it is difficult to hear people in the conference room. Hard to hear an/or cuts out.</p><p>Check audio DSP for errors and gain structure. Make minor tweaks if necessary. work with Cenero support if extra help is needed.</p><p>Site contack Scott Duckworth&nbsp;720.375.5375&nbsp;</p><p>Cenero support Evan Rose 888 454-6863, Option 2</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>","markdown":"**Scope of work:**\n\n Work order 1Cenero Work Order - WON1033658\n\nClient room: Kiewit - Raleigh, NC - Hatteras 577. The AV console's Ethernet connection needs to be plugged in and out often for it to start working again. Test and verify cabling. Replace or re-crimp ends. Verify the connection port is not damaged.\n\nWork order 2 Cenero Work Order - WON1033659\n\n Client room Kiewit - Raleigh, NC - Divisible Training Room Greensboro 505/507 Shared\n\nPeople on Teams calls frequently complain it is difficult to hear people in the conference room. Hard to hear an/or cuts out.\n\nCheck audio DSP for errors and gain structure. Make minor tweaks if necessary. work with Cenero support if extra help is needed.\n\nSite contack Scott Duckworth 720.375.5375\n\nCenero support Evan Rose 888 454-6863, Option 2","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-29T09:00","end":"2026-09-29T12:00","latestStart":"2026-09-29T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":180,"max":240},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":3,"amount":180},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $240 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise Conversion — Oxford, NC"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1790355520797}
