e to MOD.<br>-tech will run 3x speed tests and 200ct ping test. <br>6) Tech will reconnect Grid Jack to customer Router on site and NOC will verify with MCON that site is up &amp; running.<br>7) Tech will clean any cabling detritus caused by job.<br>8) Tech will check out via WorkMarket.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T02:00","end":"2026-09-25T06:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":300},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":56.1},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/25/2026, 2:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 