{"job":{"id":"3722598671","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"CallTek Inc","title":"To assist us to troubleshoot the CCTV's network connection and make it online.","description":"<p><strong>SNA ID: </strong>WO-000007921</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Please Note:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>The job is posted for one hour, but this does not guarantee it will be completed within that time.&nbsp;</p><p>- Be prepared to stay on-site until the work is fully completed.&nbsp;</p><p>- Carefully review the scope of work in advance to ensure you have enough time to finish the task.&nbsp;</p><p>- Once the job is completed, a budget increase will be applied accordingly.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><em><u>***Do not begin the job unless you are actively connected to the Remote Support. Call Dispatch again for assistance. Work completed without their assistance will not be compensated.***</u></em></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>STATEMENT OF WORK:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>CCTV system is offline. We need a technician to assist us to troubleshoot the CCTV's network connection and make it online.</p><p><br></p><p>Location - IT/PBX Room</p><p><br></p><p>Skills Required</p><p>Basic Network Troubleshooting</p><p><br></p><p>Tech Tools Required </p><p><br></p><p>MUST HAVE TOOLS/ HARDWARE &gt;TONE OUT DEVICE &gt;4-PAIR WIRE TESTER &gt;Windows laptop with a wireless and wired connection &gt;Charged laptop &amp; cell phone w/ power adapters Ladder 6ft. Camera (Cell phone camera is ok) Patch cables Serial cables Working serial to USB adapter (THIS IS NOT A CONSOLE CABLE) Serial to RJ45 (This IS a console Cable) Cable toner/cable certifier CAT5e (or better) cable, RJ45 adapters Hand tools including crimper and punch-down tool Cable labeler Diagnostic tools (digital multimeter, loopback adapter, toner probe) Basic hand tools </p><p><br></p><p>Others: Mobile data connection that will be used</p><p><br></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T10:00","end":"2026-09-28T11:00"},"payRange"