actual obligation, and a cancellation fee will not be granted.</li><li>Bring the Required Tools &amp; Material with you to the site</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>ARRIVAL:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER</strong>–if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ 855-612-2183 to check in.</li><li><strong>CHECK IN with Onsite POC / Manager: Introduce yourself as the QSIC Technician onsite for the Speaker Install Project, present the LOA and Verify Store Number</strong></li><li><strong>Call &amp; Check-In with</strong> the <strong style=\"color: black;\">Essintial Project Technical Support @ 717-610-3070</strong></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>ONSITE:</u></strong></p><ul><li>REFER TO and FOLLOW Instructions called out in the Onsite Installation Guide - Any questions escalate to&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: black;\">Essintial Project Technical Support @&nbsp;717-610-3070</strong></li><li><strong>Ensure you clean up after yourself and dispose of any trash</strong></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>CLOSING OUT | COMPLETE BEFORE LEAVING SITE:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Confirm device operation with Onsite POC</li><li><strong>Complete and Submit Online Deliverable</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">(Due back to Essintial PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE):</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tech will be asked to confirm site/location details</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tech will be asked to upload requested photos (Tech 1 / Lead Tech)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">You will be asked to enter closing/completion notes</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">You will be asked to obtain Manager/POC Signature</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tech will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverables.</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">Call &amp; Check-Out</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">&nbsp;with the&nbsp;</span><strong style=