{"job":{"id":20037459,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVIT, LLC","title":"Field Service Dispatch 569566 : check DTV RXs and connections at av rack","description":{"html":"<p>Notice: No travel expenses will be approved without prior discussion with the work order manager before accepting the work order</p><p>**********************************************************************************************</p><p><strong>PLEASE CALL AVIT TO CHECK IN PRIOR TO ENTERING THE BUILDING- AVIT Support: 888-520-5229 ext. 1&nbsp;Failure to call and speak to a live person at AVIT will activate a 75% reduction on over all pay</strong></p><p>**********************************************************************************************</p><p>&nbsp;*** Scope of work***</p><p><br></p><p>Issue; DTV RXs having issues changing or displaying&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Objective; check DTV RXs and connections at av rack</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>*Mission;</p><p>-check DTV RXs connections (power, component, HDMI)</p><p>-check connections to AMX (check for loose, damaged, broken lines)</p><p>-confirm all power connections are secure</p><p>-verify each DTV RX works and changes without rebooting</p><p>-swap DTV 6 and 7 (they currently are wrong with control)</p><p>-DTV 5 and 8 will reboot when changing channels or going into the menu</p><p>-verify that DTV boxes have CEC and allow home in control settings</p><p>-take pictures and document any devices that need replaced</p><p>-check connections from RXs to encoders/devices to the monitors</p><p>-check with management for any other issues</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>***** Any Specialty Tools Needed **</p><p>-line tester/toner/probe (audio probe works best for tracing the audio)</p><p>-zip ties, Velcro, electrical tape</p><p>-ladders 16'&nbsp;</p><p>-windows laptop with NIC and patch cable</p><p>-charged smartphone with camera</p><p>-FLASHLIGHT or Headlamp (NOT YOUR PHONE)</p><p>-cat5 and Coax termination tools</p><p>-basic hand tools&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>*** Is there any specific knowledge or skills needed by the technician?***</p><p>AV</p><p>Signal flow</p><p>audio troubleshooting and terminations</p><p>cable runs</p><p>low voltage wiring</p><p><br></p><p>*** How long is needed for this job?***</p><p>2-3 hrs</p><p><br></p><p>*** Who is the point of contact?***</p><p>AVIT support: 888-520-5229&nbsp;</p><p>Rob W&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>AVIT Support: 888-520-5229 ext. 1</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Reference Support ticket (&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;569566&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;)</strong></p><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><p><strong>laptop</strong></p><p><strong>USB jump drive</strong></p><p><strong>punch tool (66 &amp; 110)</strong></p><p><strong>data toner/tester</strong></p><p><strong>USB keyboard/mouse</strong></p><p><strong>Cat5e keystone jacks</strong></p><p><strong>Cat5E cable</strong></p><p><strong>crimp tool with rj45 and rj11 mod ends</strong></p><p><strong>Butt set for telecom related task</strong></p><p><strong>Ladders</strong></p><p>Technician will call the resource coordinator to Check out.</p><p><strong><u>If any issues arise or if the technician requires more detailed information or for general questions while on site, call the Resource Coordinator.</u></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"Notice: No travel expenses will be approved without prior discussion with the work order manager before accepting the work order\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**PLEASE CALL AVIT TO CHECK IN PRIOR TO ENTERING THE BUILDING- AVIT Support: 888-520-5229 ext. 1 Failure to call and speak to a live person at AVIT will activate a 75% reduction on over all pay**\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n \\*\\*\\* Scope of work\\*\\*\\*\n\nIssue; DTV RXs having issues changing or displaying\n\nObjective; check DTV RXs and connections at av rack\n\n\\*Mission;\n\n-check DTV RXs connections (power, component, HDMI)\n\n-check connections to AMX (check for loose, damaged, broken lines)\n\n-confirm all power connections are secure\n\n-verify each DTV RX works and changes without rebooting\n\n-swap DTV 6 and 7 (they currently are wrong with control)\n\n-DTV 5 and 8 will reboot when changing channels or going into the menu\n\n-verify that DTV boxes have CEC and allow home in control settings\n\n-take pictures and document any devices that need replaced\n\n-check connections from RXs to encoders/devices to the monitors\n\n-check with management for any other issues\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Any Specialty Tools Needed \\*\\*\n\n-line tester/toner/probe (audio probe works best for tracing the audio)\n\n-zip ties, Velcro, electrical tape\n\n-ladders 16'\n\n-windows laptop with NIC and patch cable\n\n-charged smartphone with camera\n\n-FLASHLIGHT or Headlamp (NOT YOUR PHONE)\n\n-cat5 and Coax termination tools\n\n-basic hand tools\n\n\\*\\*\\* Is there any specific knowledge or skills needed by the technician?\\*\\*\\*\n\nAV\n\nSignal flow\n\naudio troubleshooting and terminations\n\ncable runs\n\nlow voltage wiring\n\n\\*\\*\\* How long is needed for this job?\\*\\*\\*\n\n2-3 hrs\n\n\\*\\*\\* Who is the point of contact?\\*\\*\\*\n\nAVIT support: 888-520-5229\n\nRob W\n\n**AVIT Support: 888-520-5229 ext. 1**\n\n**Reference Support ticket ( 569566 )**\n\n**Tools:**\n\n**laptop**\n\n**USB jump drive**\n\n**punch tool (66 & 110)**\n\n**data toner/tester**\n\n**USB keyboard/mouse**\n\n**Cat5e keystone jacks**\n\n**Cat5E cable**\n\n**crimp tool with rj45 and rj11 mod ends**\n\n**Butt set for telecom related task**\n\n**Ladders**\n\nTechnician will call the resource coordinator to Check out.\n\n**If any issues arise or if the technician requires more detailed information or for general questions while on site, call the Resource Coordinator.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-26T09:00","end":"2026-09-26T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Granite | MED-530 | 03982724 | PolyRove Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","sum