{"job":{"id":20036896,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"Premium Brands - Battery Back Up installation and Cable Management","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Summary of Work</strong></p>\n<p><strong>MANDATORY CHECK‑IN / CHECK‑OUT</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>DO NOT begin work</strong> without speaking to the Service Desk</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>DOCUMENTATION REQUIRED</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Technician <strong>MUST download and review all attached documentation</strong> <strong>before arriving onsite</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Client Help Desk will ask</strong> if documentation was reviewed and will report back</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cable management around the battery backup unit for the store's Controller is needed.</li>\n<li>Call Willie at <del>*************</del> upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not begin work without talking to Willie.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Parts are scheduled to arrive before 4:30 PM (local time)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Confirm parts delivery before arriving onsite</strong></li>\n<li><strong>No compensation</strong> for second trips if parts are not onsite</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>CHECK‑IN / CHECK‑OUT REQUIREMENT</strong></p>\n<p><strong>You MUST check in and out with BOTH</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>IW Technologies</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Premium Brands Help Desk</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Work must NOT begin without contacting both help desks</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Please be courteous and professional when speaking with support.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Required Tools</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Government‑issued <strong>Photo ID</strong></li>\n<li><strong>USB Keyboard</strong></li>\n<li><strong>USB Mouse</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Standard PC Tool Kit</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Velcro Cable Ties</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Pre‑Visit Instructions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Review, download, and print all attached documentation</li>\n<li><strong>Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of appointment</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Onsite Tasks</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Check‑In</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Check in using the <strong>Field Nation app</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Call IW Technologies:</strong><strong>847‑285‑4198</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Call Premium Brands Help Desk:</strong></li>\n<li><strong>740‑951‑3911 → Option 5 (On‑Site Hardware Technicians)</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Provide <strong>Internal Ticket #</strong>: ___________________</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Work Execution</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as <strong>IW Technologies technician</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Locate shipped parts</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Install equipment per attached documentation</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Validate connectivity/functionality with support</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Clean up work area</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Check‑Out</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Call <strong>Premium Brands Help Desk</strong></li>\n<li><strong>740‑951‑3911 → Option 5</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Confirm resolution or report status</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>Call <strong>IW Technologies BEFORE leaving site:</strong></li>\n<li><strong>847‑285‑4198</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Check out in Field Nation app</strong></li>\n</ol>","markdown":"**Summary of Work**\n\n**MANDATORY CHECK‑IN / CHECK‑OUT**\n\n- **DO NOT begin work** without speaking to the Service Desk\n\n**DOCUMENTATION REQUIRED**\n\n- Technician **MUST download and review all attached documentation** **before arriving onsite**\n- **Client Help Desk will ask** if documentation was reviewed and will report back\n\n**Scope of Work**\n\n- Cable management around the battery backup unit for the store's Controller is needed.\n- Call Willie at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not begin work without talking to Willie.\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTES**\n\n- **Parts are scheduled to arrive before 4:30 PM (local time)**\n- **Confirm parts delivery before arriving onsite**\n- **No compensation** for second trips if parts are not onsite\n\n**CHECK‑IN / CHECK‑OUT REQUIREMENT**\n\n**You MUST check in and out with BOTH**:\n\n- **IW Technologies**\n- **Premium Brands Help Desk**\n\n**Work must NOT begin without contacting both help desks**\n\n**Please be courteous and professional when speaking with support.**\n\n**Required Tools**\n\n- Government‑issued **Photo ID**\n- **USB Keyboard**\n- **USB Mouse**\n- **Standard PC Tool Kit**\n- **Velcro Cable Ties**\n\n**Pre‑Visit Instructions**\n\n- Review, download, and print all attached documentation\n- **Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of appointment**\n\n**Onsite Tasks**\n\n**Check‑In**\n\n1. Check in using the **Field Nation app**\n2. **Call IW Technologies:****847‑285‑4198**\n3. **Call Premium Brands Help Desk:**\n4. **740‑951‑3911 → Option 5 (On‑Site Hardware Technicians)**\n\n- Provide **Internal Ticket #**: \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\n**Work Execution**\n\n- Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as **IW Technologies technician**\n- **Locate shipped parts**\n- **Install equipment per attached documentation**\n- **Validate connectivity/functionality with support**\n- **Clean up work area**\n\n**Check‑Out**\n\n1. Call **Premium Brands Help Desk**\n2. **740‑951‑3911 → Option 5**\n\n- Confirm resolution or report status\n\n1. Call **IW Technologies BEFORE leaving site:**\n2. **847‑285‑4198**\n3. **Check out in Field Nation app**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T12:00","end":"2026-09-28T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $60 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Granite | MED-530 | 03982724 | PolyRove Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise Conversion — Oxford, NC"}],"action":"SKIP","