ludes:&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>DSI Technical Installation Guide</li><li>Direct Source Contact information, Support Desk numbers and escalation plan</li><li>Service Acceptance Form (SAF)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Payment Information:</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Payment Amounts:</u> </strong> $130.00 per successfully Completed Site. Payment amount is inclusive of labor, any applicable sales or use taxes, and expenses (except flight costs) including but not limited to hotel, meals, and local travel. No other expenses will be reimbursed in excess of the payment amounts listed, unless agreed upon in writing. For purposes of this Work Order, the term \"Completed Site\" shall mean each site where: (i) Technician has completed the Work in accordance with the specifications set forth herein; (ii) all required documentation related to the site has been submitted to DSI within the time frames set forth below.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Time &amp; Material Rate:</u></strong> $65.00 per hour for work that exceeds the total scheduled onsite time, due to no fault of the Technician, will be paid at the hourly T&amp;M rate in 15-minute increments. <strong>T&amp;M will ONLY be paid when the issue was reported immediately and the DSI Support Desk or DSI Project Manager has documented the issue, and an incident number or ticket number has been assigned.</strong></p><p>In the event additional resources are required due to reasons outside the Technician's control, the Technician will notify the DSI Project Manager of the situation in writing, propose a solution and obtain <u>pre-approval</u> for any additional costs for materials, labor or expenses. Verbal agreements with anyone other than the Project Manager will be considered invalid.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Store Revisits:</u></strong> Store revisits will be paid at $65.00 per hour with a 2-hour minimum, if the revisit cause is due to no fault of the Technician.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Same Day Cancellation (SDC) 