out of cabling path, mounting location, length of cable run, Installation requirements along with detailed pictures.\n\nProvider is required to work with CTS Remote Support Team and provide the data as required on timely basis.\n\n**Tech must be comfortable in using the ladder (might be onsite lift) in order to get to the roof for survey.**\n\n**Attire:**\n\nPlease have a Blue, Black, White Polo or Collared shirt (If able). Close-toed shoes only. Neat appearance. Must wear hard toe safety shoes.\n\nMUST WEAR PANTS OR LONG LEG CLOTHING\n\n**REQUIRED FOR COMPLETE SITE SURVEY -**\n\n1. Call to check in with CTS Remote Support Team and meet the site contact to introduce yourself as 'CTS Technician'\n2. Required minimum 10 points of Speed Test & Signal Measurement (Larger sites will require more data points). Required pictures of Interior & Exterior of the facility.\n3. Must have image of IT closet/room. Measure the signal strength & run 2-3 speed test in the IT Closet.\n4. Run at least 4 Speed tests and measure signal strength inside the facility.\n5. Provide pictures for roof access along with speed test in 4 corners & center of the roof.\n6. Images of proposed cabling route with marking on pictures. Proposed cable run must not exceed 300ft as per PoE spec.\n7. Must denote any usable existing penetration. Mark the route to where the cabling will go from penetration. Must denote if new penetration is required & propose the spot.\n8. Must denote the mounting location along with type of mount. Look out for best mounting locations (may be any existing pole).\n9. Location and direction of the nearest Verizon tower.\n10. Drawn map of the site or Fire Map with clear indication of where measurement was taken and the speed/ Decibel reading at that spot.\n11. Must denote if building is leased or owned\n12. Must denote if a scissor lift or boom lift will be needed for installation with height.\n13. Check out with CTS Remote Support tech.\n\n**PROVIDER SHALL NOT DISCUSS OR PROPOSE HARDWARE SOLUTIONS TO THE END CLIENT DIRECTLY**\n\n**Assignment will be marked as Incomplete if one or more above information is not provided on the same day. Penalty fee can be applied for incomplete assignment.**\n\nPlease leave detailed notes highlighting site specific requirements for Installation.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T09:30","end":"2026-10-09T10:15"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1790374379001}
