 the old site and dropping it off at the local UPS store.</li>\n<li>Removing old equipment (confirm with site contact). 3 laptops, 3 desktops, and 5 monitors. Boxing these up and having them at the old site.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Assumptions:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customer/network engineer handles network configuration on 9/29.</li>\n<li>Existing rack can be safely removed and remounted without significant modification.</li>\n<li>Standard hand tools and normal installation/removal equipment are included.</li>\n<li>No new cabling, cable installation, network configuration, programming, or equipment repair is included.</li>\n<li>Disposal, e-waste fees, specialty equipment, lifts, parking/tolls, shipping, or other third-party charges would be additional if required.</li>\n<li>Work is performed during normal business hours.</li>\n<li>NTE is based on the stated 2-day/40-hour maximum.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cleanup workstation</li>\n<li>Take photo of all work completed</li>\n<li>Upload Sign Off Sheet</li>\n<li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when leaving the site with photos of work completed.</li>\n<li>Upload all deliverables and mark work order complete within 48 hrs.</li>\n<li>Failure to complete the above tasks will result in non-payment</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Requirements</u></strong><u>:</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when arriving onsite.</li>\n<li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when leaving the site.</li>\n<li>Upload all deliverables and mark work order complete within 48 hrs.</li>\n<li>Failure to complete the above tasks will result in Non-Payment.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Dress Code/PPE:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Present and maintain neat and&nbsp;appropriate professional appearance, including both attire and personal grooming for customer’s business environment. (Business or open collar business, non-denim attire. closed-toe, non-athletic footwea