{"job":{"id":"9773098459","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"DataMax Services, Inc","title":"USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro","description":"<p>Complete MINISO retrofit technology installation for the assigned store.</p><p><br></p><p>General scope includes cabling, rack/device placement, patch panel connections, device/cable labeling, cash wrap POS/Clover connections, AP/TV/media cabling, NVR/BDCOM/camera patching if assigned, Sangoma testing support, and closeout photo documentation. Removing old equipment</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must follow the attached MINISO Retrofit Install Guide and the assigned V11 port map.</p><p><br></p><p>Must Bring a Laptop</p><p>Must Bring no less than 500' of WHITE Cat 6 for 2-3 cable runs.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T09:00","end":"2026-09-24T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":1},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":105.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Granite | MED-530 | 03982724 | Po