{"job":{"id":20042683,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Inverse Technology Solutions","title":"Switch Replacement, 2nd Floor North IDF","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Problem Description</strong></p><p>The 2nd Floor North IDF PoE+ switch (Netgear M4100-50G-POE+) at 10.121.37.233 (MAC 38:94:ed:18:11:08) is down. A replacement switch has been delivered to the community.</p><p><strong>Technician Steps</strong></p><ol><li>Locate the failed Netgear M4100-50G-POE+ in the 2nd Floor North-End Electrical Closet near Room 210, and the delivered replacement (Netgear M4300-52G-PoE+, serial 7LS3565MA05B9).</li><li>Replace the failed switch with the new unit, migrating all cable connections in the same port order where possible.</li><li>Confirm the new switch powers on and uplinks are active.</li><li>Photograph the installed switch and its port connections before leaving.</li><li>Call before checking out per the standard task.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Business casual, clean attire and presentable.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Contact Project Manager if the following are true:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, please contact&nbsp;<strong>Project Manager</strong></li><li><strong>Any issues or questions should be escalated to the Project Manager</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p>Necessary Telecom Tools: Camera/Phone, Buttset, Toner, 66/110 Punch Down Tools, etc.</p><p>Tasks are listed below.</p>","markdown":"**Problem Description**\n\nThe 2nd Floor North IDF PoE+ switch (Netgear M4100-50G-POE+) at 10.121.37.233 (MAC 38:94:ed:18:11:08) is down. A replacement switch has been delivered to the community.\n\n**Technician Steps**\n\n1. Locate the failed Netgear M4100-50G-POE+ in the 2nd Floor North-End Electrical Closet near Room 210, and the delivered replacement (Netgear M4300-52G-PoE+, serial 7LS3565MA05B9).\n2. Replace the failed switch with the new unit, migrating all cable connections in the same port order where possible.\n3. Confirm the new switch powers on and uplinks are active.\n4. Photograph the installed switch and its port connections before leaving.\n5. Call before checking out per the standard task.\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Business casual, clean attire and presentable.\n\n**Contact Project Manager if the following are true:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, please contact **Project Manager**\n- **Any issues or questions should be escalated to the Project Manager**\n\nNecessary Telecom Tools: Camera/Phone, Buttset, Toner, 66/110 Punch Down Tools, etc.\n\nTasks are listed below.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-28T09:00","end":"2026-09-28T12:00","latestStart":"2026-09-28T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":true,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"ELIGIBLE"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:00:00.000Z","summary":