{"job":{"id":20043685,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NEC Corporation of America","title":"Install Hand Scanner for (1) POS Units @ Store","description":{"html":"<p><strong>The estimated duration will be 2 hours</strong></p><p><strong>Overview: Install and configure hand scanners and install a bag holder for all POS Units on site.</strong></p><p>Seeking a technician with experience in POS units. Prefer Retail Point-of-Sale/kiosk experience.</p><p><strong>Tech is required to install hand scanners and bag holders for each POS unit</strong></p><ol><li>You will install a hand scanner for each POS unit as well as a Bag Holder per POS unit mounted on the front of the customer counter</li></ol><p>A detailed deinstallation guide is provided to the assigned provider</p><p>ALL PHOTOS must be <strong>uploaded to the work order</strong>, BEFORE checkout code will be given.</p><p>Estimated duration is 1 hours</p><p>Tools Required:</p><ul><li>Camera or phone for clear pictures on deliverables</li><li>Basic tool kit</li></ul><p><strong>Pre-Site Requirements:</strong></p><p>Check you are at the store number situated on your work request. The store number can be found on the front window of the store. If you don't see it posted, ask store staff.</p><p><strong>On-Site Tasks (Overview- Step-by-step process attached in the document section of the work order)</strong></p><p>Introduction to store personnel and purpose of visit.</p><p>Verify all equipment is on site</p><p>Please note any delays or issues in your close-out notes.</p><p><strong>Required On-Site Deliverables</strong>:</p><p>1) 7) Front counter (before &amp; after)</p><p>&nbsp;Additional Contacts:&nbsp;</p><p>NEC Deployment Support team</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************ *** *</del></span></p><p><strong>Escalation Process:</strong></p><p><strong>Work order questions- contact work order manager Brian Simpson</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************</del></span></p