{"job":{"id":20000532,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Deinstall old and install new pin pads from each POS and/or SCO lane","description":{"html":"<p>Need Ross trained tech(s) for 6 lane pin pad refresh project.</p>\n<p>Tech(s) will download vendor authorization letter, tech checkin-checkout document, and pin pad install guideand review before arrival.</p>\n<p>Text Shyft PM confirming your arrival, contact store MOD, show vendor authorization letter and government issued ID (drivers license), &amp; call command center upon arrival.</p>\n<p>Working with MOD and Command Center representative, deinstall old and install new pin pads from each POS and/or SCO lane.</p>\n<p>Phone #'s and conference ID# can be found in confidential information of your work order.</p>\n<p>At end of day, tech(s) must check out with Ross IT hotline and text Shyft PM before leaving site.</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DO NOT</strong> leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.</li>\n<li><strong>Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule</strong></li>\n</ul>","markdown":"Need Ross trained tech(s) for 6 lane pin pad refresh project.\n\nTech(s) will download vendor authorization letter, tech checkin-checkout document, and pin pad install guideand review before arrival.\n\nText Shyft PM confirming your arrival, contact store MOD, show vendor authorization letter and government issued ID (drivers license), & call command center upon arrival.\n\nWorking with MOD and Command Center representative, deinstall old and install new pin pads from each POS and/or SCO lane.\n\nPhone #'s and conference ID# can be found in confidential information of your work order.\n\nAt end of day, tech(s) must check out with Ross IT hotline and text Shyft PM before leaving site.\n\n**NOTE:**\n\n- **DO NOT** leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.\n- **Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.**\n- **Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.**\n- **Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-18T21:15","end":"2026-10-18T25:27"},"payRange":{"min":210,"max":210},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4.2,"distance":57},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $210 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09