{"job":{"id":20049432,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CPT Network Solutions, Inc.","title":"Petfolk- Media Player Installation","description":{"html":"<p><strong>High Level Overview:</strong></p>\n<p>To Troubleshoot the Media Players and Network Cables</p>\n<p><strong>Tech Required Tools/Materials:</strong></p>\n<p>Technician must bring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Punch-down kit</li>\n<li>Ladder</li>\n<li>Standard installation and testing tools</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work (SOW):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check in with <strong>CPT at 630-735-7018</strong>.</li>\n<li>Check in with <strong>Manager Matthew K.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Turn over and review the received equipment with the manager.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Install and configure one (1) controller</strong> in the MDF.</li>\n<li>Install and configure <strong>seven (7) receivers</strong>, one for each <strong>32\" TV</strong>.</li>\n<li>Ensure all receivers are properly secured and that all cabling is neatly organized and dressed.</li>\n<li>Connect one (1) receiver to each room's television.</li>\n<li>Verify all device connections, network connectivity, and communication between the controller and receivers.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot any non-functioning data drops or network jacks as needed.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot cable runs, if required, to ensure proper connectivity.</li>\n<li>Test the complete system with the manager and confirm functionality of all TVs and receivers.</li>\n<li>Check out with the manager and provide a summary of completed work.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Photos of Fully installed and configured controller and receivers.</li>\n<li>Operational TV connectivity in all seven rooms.</li>\n<li>Successful completion of functional testing and system verification.</li>\n</ol>","markdown":"**High Level Overview:**\n\nTo Troubleshoot the Media Players and Network Cables\n\n**Tech Required Tools/Materials:**\n\nTechnician must bring:\n\n- Punch-down kit\n- Ladder\n- Standard installation and testing tools\n\n**Scope of Work (SOW):**\n\n- Check in with **CPT at 630-735-7018**.\n- Check in with **Manager Matthew K.**\n- **Turn over and review the received equipment with the manager.**\n- **Install and configure one (1) controller** in the MDF.\n- Install and configure **seven (7) receivers**, one for each **32\" TV**.\n- Ensure all receivers are properly secured and that all cabling is neatly organized and dressed.\n- Connect one (1) receiver to each room's television.\n- Verify all device connections, network connectivity, and communication between the controller and receivers.\n- Troubleshoot any non-functioning data drops or network jacks as needed.\n- Troubleshoot cable runs, if required, to ensure proper connectivity.\n- Test the complete system with the manager and confirm functionality of all TVs and receivers.\n- Check out with the manager and provide a summary of completed work.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n1. Photos of Fully installed and configured controller and receivers.\n2. Operational TV connectivity in all seven rooms.\n3. Successful completion of functional testing and system verification.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-30T08:00","end":"2026-09-30T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":260},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":13},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T15:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T22:3