{"job":{"id":20048318,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Axper","title":"Talbots 4021 - Cabling assistant","description":{"html":"<p><strong>The job requirements and the complete scope of work and details are located in the attached document titled \"<em>Installation Guide - Talbots</em>\"</strong>. It is <strong>MANDATORY</strong> to read it before applying for this work order and before the start date scheduled in the work order. If the scope of work reveals itself to be different than the actual situation, while performing the work order, if you encounter any unplanned issue or if you have any question, please make sure to call <strong>Axper Support at 866-658-2360 ext. 470</strong> and an agent will answer your questions and advise you on the steps to follow.</p><p><u>Do you have to run the cable:</u>&nbsp;Yes, Bring at least 300ft of Cat6 bulk.</p><p><strong>A lead technician will handle providing the materials. Please make sure to still bring your tools.</strong></p><p><strong>You will need to assist the lead tech and secure the perimeter, while the scissor lift is in use.</strong></p><p><u>Highest ceiling height:</u>&nbsp;18+ ft</p><p><u>Mounting height:</u> 11 ft</p><p><u>Number of entrances:</u>&nbsp;1</p><p><u>Type of ceiling:</u>&nbsp;Open ceiling</p><p><strong><u>A lift will be available on site.</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Make sure to bring a ladder (at least 10ft in A-frame)</u></strong></p><p><strong>The following summarized service description does not replace the attached scope of work document in any way.</strong></p><p><u>Summary:</u> We will need a technician to swap the old 3D camera for the new Axper 3D camera (traffic counting system). It has to be mounted on the ceiling, 3-4 feet from the door, centered with the door.&nbsp;<strong>The technician will need to call Axper Support to check in and check out.</strong></p>","markdown":"**The job requirements and the complete scope of work and details are located in the attached document titled \"*Installation Guide - Talbots*\"**. It is **MANDATORY** to read it before applying for this work order and before the start date scheduled in the work order. If the scope of work reveals itself to be different than the actual situation, while performing the work order, if you encounter any unplanned issue or if you have any question, please make sure to call **Axper Support at 866-658-2360 ext. 470** and an agent will answer your questions and advise you on the steps to follow.\n\nDo you have to run the cable: Yes, Bring at least 300ft of Cat6 bulk.\n\n**A lead technician will handle providing the materials. Please make sure to still bring your tools.**\n\n**You will need to assist the lead tech and secure the perimeter, while the scissor lift is in use.**\n\nHighest ceiling height: 18+ ft\n\nMounting height: 11 ft\n\nNumber of entrances: 1\n\nType of ceiling: Open ceiling\n\n**A lift will be available on site.**\n\n**Make sure to bring a ladder (at least 10ft in A-frame)**\n\n**The following summarized service description does not replace the attached scope of work document in any way.**\n\nSummary: We will need a technician to swap the old 3D camera for the new Axper 3D camera (traffic counting system). It has to be mounted on the ceiling, 3-4 feet from the door, centered with the door. **The technician will need to call Axper Support to check in and check out.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T06:00","end":"2026-10-01T07:00"},"payRange":{"min":95,"max":185},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":95},"additional":{"units":1.5,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":32},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $185 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},