{"job":{"id":"6668639069","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"MG21 Gateway SIM Swap & Connection Verification","description":"Hilton SIM Swap SOW<br><br>Required Materials:<br>Laptop w/ Admin Rights and Ethernet Port<br>RJ45-RJ45 Ethernet Cable<br><br>Required Deliverables:<br>NEW SIM Number<br>MG21 with visible Purple status light<br>MG21 before and after pictures<br><br>SIM Card UPS Tracking: TBD<br><br>Please review the SIM Installation section of the attached PDF prior to dispatch.<br><br>Technician must be able to access and actively use Microsoft Teams, including Teams chat, for communication, coordination, and support during the installation<br>Upon arrival, the Granite Technician checks in with the Front Desk and asks for the Granite package containing the SIM card<br>For any access issues, please reach out to the Granite PM Jonathon at (401) 955-9477<br><br>When you have the SIM and locate the MG21, please call into the below bridge to work with Granite technical support:<br><br>Dial-In: +1 929-229-2436<br>Passcode: 355013377#<br><br>General Directions:<br>Validate the existing MG21 Gateway is fully operational with the local manager<br>Power down the existing MG21 Gateway<br>Record the serial number for Hilton Worldwide records<br>Disconnect the MG from power<br>Remove the existing SIM by unscrewing the back panel<br>Insert the new SIM and replace the back plate<br>Power on the unit and confirm a solid purple LED indicating proper configuration, active SIM, and cellular connectivity<br>If status light remains Amber (Orange): utilize laptop, console cable, and mobile phone for any required Hilton Worldwide APN configuration (see steps below)<br>Verify the MG21 router is online and all network services are operational<br>Before leaving site, confirm system functionality with the technical coordinator on the Teams meeting<br>Record the store manager’s name as confirmation of successful SIM migration<br><br>How to Manually Change APN<br><br>Step 1 — Physically Connect to the MG<br>Power on the Meraki MG.<br>Connect your laptop directly to the MG LAN port using an Ethernet cable.<br>Wait about 1–2 minutes for your computer to receive an IP address automatically via DHCP.<br><br>Step 2 — Open the Local Status Page (may need to use an incognito browser window)<br>Open a web browser and go to: mg.meraki.com  <br>If that does not work, try:<br>• setup.meraki.com<br>• my.meraki.com<br>If that still does not work, try:<br>Open the Command Prompt and perform an IPCONFIG<br>Get the Gateway IP<br>Copy or Type the Gateway IP in the Web Browser tab<br>Click Enter<br><br>Step 3 — Log Into the MG<br>For newer firmware:<br>Username: admin<br>Password:  (please include the dashes)<br>The serial number is located on the sticker on the bottom or back of the MG.<br><br>Step 4 — Navigate to the Configure Page<br>Select the Configure tab.<br>Locate the Bearer Settings or Cellular Configuration section.<br><br>Step 5 — Override the SIM APN Settings<br>Find the option labeled Cellular Override or Override SIM Settings.<br>Enable Override SIM Settings to manually configure the APN.<br>Step 6 — Enter the APN<br>In the APN field, enter: wbdata<br><br>Step 6: Leave Username and Password blank unless your carrier specifically requires them.<br>Example:<br>APN: wbdata<br>Username: blank<br>Password: blank<br> <br>Step 7 — Confirm/update the next fields<br>Cellular authorization:  None<br>Cellular IP type:  IPv4v6<br> <br>Step 8 — Save the Configuration<br>Scroll to the bottom of the page.<br>Click Save.<br>The MG may briefly reconnect to the cellular network while applying the new APN.<br><br>Step 9 — Verify Connectivity<br>Go to the Connection or Cellular Status page and verify:<br>Carrier is detected<br>APN shows wbdata<br>Signal strength is present<br>Internet connectivity is connected<br>Meraki cloud connectivity is connected<br><br>Troubleshooting<br>Cannot Reach mg.meraki.com:<br>Disconnect and reconnect Ethernet<br>Use another browser<br>Try incognito browser<br>Confirm Wi-Fi is off<br>Browse directly to the MG gateway IP<br>Try setup.meraki.com<br><br>APN Does Not Save:<br>Ensure you clicked Save<br>Reboot the MG<br>Recheck the APN spelling: wbdata<br><br>No Cellular Connectivity:<br>Verify SIM card is active<br>Verify SIM is fully inserted<br>Confirm carrier supports the device<br>Confirm APN is correct<br>Verify signal strength is adequate<br><br>Optional — Factory Reset<br>Press and hold the Reset button for at least 10 seconds.<br>Allow 5–10 minutes for reboot and reconfiguration.<br>Factory reset clears Local Status Page settings including APN configuration.<br><br>Document and provide any returned equipment to the hotel MOD","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T10:45","end":"2026-10-09T12:15"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":75},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":31.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $75 (countered: $98) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise Conversion — Oxford, NC"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1790634078432}
{"job":{"id":20048041,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Primo Water - WMS Project Cable Runs and AP installation Day 2","description":{"html":"For all technical troubleshooting or field support needs, call the Field Tech Support Team at 508.321.4060 for live assistance and guidance.<br/>For non-technical issues including site access, scheduling, store readiness, or scope clarification outside of technical execution, contact your assigned Project Team directly.<br/>Do not mark yourself as “Arrived” until you have physically entered and checked in at the client site.<br/><br/>SOW: <br/>Check in and out with Spencer Sr. PM Abby Stetson 351-218-9097<br/><br/>Tech must be prepared with:<br/>PPE (Hard hat, safety glasses, gloves & vests)<br/>Label maker and labels!<br/>Drill and concrete drill bits<br/>*Techs will need to have 2,000ft of cable plus cabling materials* <br/><br/>DS/Primo IT contacts (if needed): <br/>   - Senthil Kumar Gangadharan 602-245-2238  <br/>   - David Hollis 727-418-4650 <br/>   - Robert Chambers 203-509-6467<br/>   - Rod Waldrop (770)937-7318<br/>   - Serhii Aladov 514-956-2615<br/>Onsite contact:<br/>  - Kristina Smith Region Coordinator<br/>503-803-5823<br/>   - Ray Anonuevo District Ops manager  <br/>661-445-9180<br/>   - Darrell Bowie District Ops manager<br/>910-689-4061<br/><br/><br/>Site Specific Details: Primo will be sending APs and any network equipment, Spencer will be reserving a lift if needed:<br/>Rough-In, Terminate, and Test (5) CAT6 Cables for New APs<br/>Install and Test (5) Interior APs<br/>26' Lift Required<br/><br/>Survey Results-<br/>Any potential issue with installing the APs: follow sprinkler path and stay above, forklifts operate all over floor, APs must be above sprinklers to avoid being hit<br/>Estimate # of interior APs needed: 5<br/>Estimate # of exterior APs needed: 0<br/><br/><br/>Deliverables:<br/>- Before & after pictures of all work done<br/>- Summary of work completed, including site times<br/><br/>Send deliverables to primowater@spencertech.com BEFORE leaving site.<br/><br/>Check out with Sr. PM Abby Stetson 351-218-9097<br/><br/>**Technician may need to provide materials to complete scope of work. Reimbursement will be made after work complete.","markdown":"For all technical troubleshooting or field support needs, call the Field Tech Support Team at 508.321.4060 for live assistance and guidance.  \nFor non-technical issues including site access, scheduling, store readiness, or scope clarification outside of technical execution, contact your assigned Project Team directly.  \nDo not mark yourself as “Arrived” until you have physically entered and checked in at the client site.  \n  \nSOW:   \nCheck in and out with Spencer Sr. PM Abby Stetson 351-218-9097  \n  \nTech must be prepared with:  \nPPE (Hard hat, safety glasses, gloves & vests)  \nLabel maker and labels!  \nDrill and concrete drill bits  \n\\*Techs will need to have 2,000ft of cable plus cabling materials\\*   \n  \nDS/Primo IT contacts (if needed):   \n\\- Senthil Kumar Gangadharan 602-245-2238   \n\\- David Hollis 727-418-4650   \n\\- Robert Chambers 203-509-6467  \n\\- Rod Waldrop (770)937-7318  \n\\- Serhii Aladov 514-956-2615  \nOnsite contact:  \n\\- Kristina Smith Region Coordinator  \n503-803-5823  \n\\- Ray Anonuevo District Ops manager   \n661-445-9180  \n\\- Darrell Bowie District Ops manager  \n910-689-4061  \n  \n  \nSite Specific Details: Primo will be sending APs and any network equipment, Spencer will be reserving a lift if needed:  \nRough-In, Terminate, and Test (5) CAT6 Cables for New APs  \nInstall and Test (5) Interior APs  \n26' Lift Required  \n  \nSurvey Results-  \nAny potential issue with installing the APs: follow sprinkler path and stay above, forklifts operate all over floor, APs must be above sprinklers to avoid being hit  \nEstimate # of interior APs needed: 5  \nEstimate # of exterior APs needed: 0  \n  \n  \nDeliverables:  \n\\- Before & after pictures of all work done  \n\\- Summary of work completed, including site times  \n  \nSend deliverables to primowater@spencertech.com BEFORE leaving site.  \n  \nCheck out with Sr. PM Abby Stetson 351-218-9097  \n  \n\\*\\*Technician may need to provide materials to complete scope of work. Reimbursement will be made after work complete.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-29T08:00","end":"2026-09-29T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":260},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":11},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 1, 9:00 AM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $260\nRejected: pay does not meet the alternative-date minimum."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-30T15:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika tooth"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 | H