{"job":{"id":20054294,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Stratacache","title":"Replace media player 1 power supply","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Overview</u>:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: black;\">Seeking a technician with experience in technical troubleshooting. Knowledge of Indoor Digital Menu Boards and Outdoor Enclosures is a plus.</span></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: black;\">Tech is required to assist the Stratacache technical support desk troubleshoot connectivity / content on Digital Signage Media Player.</span></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: black;\">Estimated duration will be 2 hours</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Scope of Work</u>:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Replace media player 1 power supply</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Pre-Site Requirements</u></strong></p><ul><li>Please review the attached RTS Documents</li><li>Support can provide additional documentation, diagrams, and guidance during the visit</li><li>Review WO in its entirety</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>On-Site Tasks</u><em>:</em></strong></p><p>Before starting any work call and check-in with STRATACACHE support. Please call our Customer Support team at 877-761-1122 OR support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com</p><p>Collect pre-work photos of Enter product to be addressed, and send them to support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com</p><p>Work to be performed:</p><p>Troubleshoot any issues found while completing SOW</p><p>1. Gather Pre-work photos and send to support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com with QDoba and store number in the subject</p><p>2. Locate media player 1</p><p>3. Removed old power supply and dispose of</p><p>4. Install new power supply and verify player powers on and content displays on all screens</p><p>5. If player does not power on or screens do not all have content, troubleshoot further with our customer support</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p>Closeout:</p><p>A. Please ensure screens are properly aligned/level with no spaces in-between and that there are no cables hanging down.</p><p>B. Send final checkout photos</p><p>Before leaving the site tech must confirm content with Stratacache support and store management and submit all requested final pictures.</p><p>Confirm SOW and general directions listed below with Support Team.</p><p>Verify starting point with Support Team</p><p>If needed, locate remote control for specific display brand (LG, Samsung etc., usually it is stored in the manager's office)</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Collect pre-work photos of&nbsp;Enter product to be addressed, and send them to&nbsp;</span><em>support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com</em></p><p><u>If store manager is questioning your presence, please report to Support at the check in so the issue can be resolved ASAP (Manager on duty at the time of the visit may not be aware of the work that needs to be done.</u></p><p><u>If store employee, at the time of the visit, claims that issue does not exist or it was already resolved, do NOT leave the site without Stratacache Support approval or compensation for this WO will be automatically declined.</u></p><p><u>Store employees are not qualified to assess all aspects of Digital Signage.</u></p><p><strong><u>SOW General Directions after check in</u></strong>:&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Once SOW is completed, you will receive the release code.</p><p>Do not leave the site without release code or Support team approval as this will result in Incomplete SOW</p><p>&nbsp;Closeout:</p><p>A. Please ensure screens are properly aligned/level with no spaces in-between&nbsp;and that there are no cables hanging down.&nbsp;</p><p>B. Send final checkout photos&nbsp;</p><p>Before leaving the site tech must confirm content with Stratacache support and store management and submit all requested final pictures.</p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Required On-Site Deliverables</u></strong></p><ol><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Check-In Call</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Pre-Work Photos and any other specific photos requested by Support or SOW during the visit.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Post-Work Photos (Showing area cleaned up, Cables hidden, and content running)</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Check-Out Call to receive release code.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Dress Code</u>:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;Business casual. No third party or company logos please.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Tools Required</u>:</strong></p><p>Cable Tester</p><p>Replacement RJ45 ends</p><p>Cable termination tools</p><p>Screwdrivers</p>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n● Seeking a technician with experience in technical troubleshooting. Knowledge of Indoor Digital Menu Boards and Outdoor Enclosures is a plus.\n\n● Tech is required to assist the Stratacache technical support desk troubleshoot connectivity / content on Digital Signage Media Player.\n\n● Estimated duration will be 2 hours\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n Replace media player 1 power supply\n\n**Pre-Site Requirements**\n\n- Please review the attached RTS Documents\n- Support can provide additional documentation, diagrams, and guidance during the visit\n- Review WO in its entirety\n\n**On-Site Tasks*:***\n\nBefore starting any work call and check-in with STRATACACHE support. Please call our Customer Support team at 877-761-1122 OR support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com\n\nCollect pre-work photos of Enter product to be addressed, and send them to support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com\n\nWork to be performed:\n\nTroubleshoot any issues found while completing SOW\n\n1\\. Gather Pre-work photos and send to support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com with QDoba and store number in the subject\n\n2\\. Locate media player 1\n\n3\\. Removed old power supply and dispose of\n\n4\\. Install new power supply and verify player powers on and content displays on all screens\n\n5\\. If player does not power on or screens do not all have content, troubleshoot further with our customer support\n\n \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nCloseout:\n\nA. Please ensure screens are properly aligned/level with no spaces in-between and that there are no cables hanging down.\n\nB. Send final checkout photos\n\nBefore leaving the site tech must confirm content with Stratacache support and store management and submit all requested final pictures.\n\nConfirm SOW and general directions listed below with Support Team.\n\nVerify starting point with Support Team\n\nIf needed, locate remote control for specific display brand (LG, Samsung etc., usually it is stored in the manager's office)\n\nCollect pre-work photos of Enter product to be addressed, and send them to *support.qdoba@stratacachedmb.com*\n\nIf store manager is questioning your presence, please report to Support at the check in so the issue can be resolved ASAP (Manager on duty at the time of the visit may not be aware of the work that needs to be done.\n\nIf store employee, at the time of the visit, claims that issue does not exist or it was already resolved, do NOT leave the site without Stratacache Support approval or compensation for this WO will be automatically declined.\n\nStore employees are not qualified to assess all aspects of Digital Signage.\n\n**SOW General Directions after check in**:\n\nOnce SOW is completed, you will receive the release code.\n\nDo not leave the site without release code or Support team approval as this will result in Incomplete SOW\n\n Closeout:\n\nA. Please ensure screens are properly aligned/level with no spaces in-between and that there are no cables hanging down.\n\nB. Send final checkout photos\n\nBefore leaving the site tech must confirm content with Stratacache support and store management and submit all requested final pictures.\n\n**Required On-Site Deliverables**\n\n1. Check-In Call\n2. Pre-Work Photos and any other specific photos requested by Support or SOW during the visit.\n3. Post-Work Photos (Showing area cleaned up, Cables hidden, and content running)\n4. Check-Out Call to receive release code.\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n●  Business casual. No third party or company logos please.\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\nCable Tester\n\nReplacement RJ45 ends\n\nCable termination tools\n\nScrewdrivers","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T09:00","end":"2026-10-01T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976620 - 2312 Bridgeport Dr | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 