{"job":{"id":"6088182642","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"0867 | Acct# 04939490 |  Incident 504721-0867","description":"Work Request Details:<br> <br>The center has been experiencing frequent problems with their internet.  The ISP (and our Meraki devices) are saying that the center is back up, but they are still seeing outages as of yesterday (when Meraki showed green).<br><br>I'm including the last week of our MX75 and one of the switches.  Both show a lot of up and down last week, but the switch shows more outages.  We'd like a tech out to see if there is an issue with the equipment or with something else. <br><br>Center address:<br>Bright Horizons Children's Center at The Forum<br>8516 Old Lead Mine Road<br>Raleigh, NC 27615","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T10:00","end":"2026-10-01T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":3.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":260,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-01T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T18:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika tooth"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 | FE offline |  noc: 6998768 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM