{"job":{"id":"4559297040","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"P1 same-day visit for offline broadband circuit","description":"**Issue:**<br>Circuit remains offline after a carrier outage cleared. Customer confirmed the Spectrum modem and router were rebooted with no restoration. TIME WARNER requires modem light status and backup-battery status to be verified before proceeding with its dispatch; the on-site visit should gather those details and address the still-down service. All site visits must be arranged through the Chipotle Help Desk. Site access is available Monday through Sunday, 7:00 AM–11:00 PM.<br><br>CIRCUIT DETAILS<br>Service Type: Broadband<br>Carrier: TIME WARNER<br>CXR Circuit ID: 8349100030034822<br>NSO ID: N/A<br>WAN IP: 24.172.85.38<br>LAN Gateway: 24.172.85.37   <br>MAC Address: N/A<br><br>**Required Equipment at all times:**<br>Laptop with admin access, Console cable, Ethernet tester, 4G aircard or Hotspot, remote access capabilities (Teamviewer, Join.me or Fastsupport), Butt Set, Extra patch cables<br><br>**SOW:**<br>Tech must check in via WorkMarket and be ready to start the Scope of Work.<br>Tech must call in to Broadband Repair at 844-492-2557 option 2 to work with a rep. If tech is unable to reach Broadband Repair, tech must leave a voicemail requesting a call back.<br>Tech must locate the Spectrum modem and customer router.<br>Tech must verify commercial power, modem power, status, online, and connection lights, and document which lights are on or off.<br>Tech must verify whether the modem backup battery is installed and inspect its status.<br>Tech must inspect and reseat the modem power, coax, Ethernet, and router cables as applicable.<br>Tech must confirm the router is powered and connected to the modem.<br>Tech must power-cycle the modem and router if safe and permitted, then verify whether the circuit restores.<br>Tech must provide the observed modem light and backup-battery details for carrier dispatch if service remains down.<br>Tech must run ping and speed tests and send the results to NetOpsAccess@granitenet.com with subject 'DIA/IW ticket #7002574'.<br>Tech must confirm connectivity with the Granite rep before release.<br>Tech must take pictures of the equipment and the work performed.<br>Tech must close out via WorkMarket.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-29T10:30","end":"2026-09-29T14:30"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":300},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/29/2026, 10:30:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"2 ticket"},{"start":"2026-09-30T15:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-10-01T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika tooth"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 | FE offline |  noc: 6998768 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976588 - 3239 South Church St | EPIK Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"