{"job":{"id":20055280,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Mesmerize","title":"Digital Advertisement Verification | 30 Min Max Per Site | $20/site","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>**All travel expenses must be approved prior to being assigned.**</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Lack of communication on provider side will be seen as provider abandoning job and job will be re-posted after 2 days of no communication.</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Overview:</u></strong></p><p>Provider will visit sites listed on the work order to take photos of the advertisements for this project on our Mesmerize television screen(s). Good photos of the correct advertisement(s) playing on the television screen(s) will be needed at all sites.</p><p><strong><u>Pre-Site:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Review attached screenshots of the advertisement(s) in the client documents section you are looking for on the screen(s). This is not the example of good photos.</li><li>Review attached examples of good photos we will accept.</li><li><strong>Confirm site's hours of operations prior to arriving as they may be different than what is on the work order.</strong></li><li>Complete any Prep Tasks in the Field Nation app.</li></ol><p><strong><u>TASK FOR THE JOB WILL INCLUDE:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Speak to the manager or receptionist. Politely introduce yourself in a professional manner. Let them know you are there on behalf of Mesmerize to capture pictures of their Mesmerize TV.</strong></li><li>Enter site on list and find our television screen(s). Our Mesmerize logo will be visible on the side panel.</li><li><strong>Wait for correct ad(s) to play on the screen(s) and take clear photos close up and from a distance of the screen(s). (Review attachments if you are unsure what advertisement(s) you are looking for!)</strong></li><li><strong>If the TV is not powered on, please ask the location to turn on the TV with their remote. If they do not have a remote, there is a button under the TV to turn it on. Please reach out in the work order messages if the TV won't turn on.</strong></li><li><strong>If you have not seen the correct advertisement(s) within 30 minutes of waiting, please send a message to the work order manager within the Field Nation messages. Do not leave the site without uploading photos of the correct advertisement(s). Do not leave the site without communicating through the work order messages. If Provider leaves the site without correct photos and without attempting to communicate with the work order manager, they will be asked to return for no extra compensation.</strong></li><li>Upload photos in the Field Nation app.</li><li>After the photos have been uploaded, add closeout notes in the Field Nation app and move on to the next site.</li></ul><p><strong><u>FAQ:</u></strong></p><ol><li><strong>You must review the attachments in the work order (Client Documents section) and take the correct photos. If you do not upload photos of the correct advertisement(s), you will be asked to return to site(s) and retake the photos with no extra compensation. </strong></li><li><strong>You must take a close up photo of the screen and one from a distance. If either are missing you will be asked to return to the site(s) for more photos.</strong></li><li><strong>We must be able to see the entire screen(s) in the photo(s) or you will be asked to return and retake the photos with no extra compensation. We need to see some of the surrounding area for context.</strong></li><li><strong>If the TV is not powered on please turn on the TV with either the remote or pressing the power button under the screen.</strong></li><li><strong>If you do not take photos of the correct advertisement(s) (screenshots have been attached to the work order), you will be asked to return and retake photos with no extra compensation. If you refuse to return you will not be paid for any incorrect work done.</strong></li><li><strong>If you run into any issues or have any questions, please communicate through Field Nation messages so our entire team can assist you.</strong></li></ol>","markdown":"**\\*\\*All travel expenses must be approved prior to being assigned.\\*\\***\n\n**Lack of communication on provider side will be seen as provider abandoning job and job will be re-posted after 2 days of no communication.**\n\n**Overview:**\n\nProvider will visit sites listed on the work order to take photos of the advertisements for this project on our Mesmerize television screen(s). Good photos of the correct advertisement(s) playing on the television screen(s) will be needed at all sites.\n\n**Pre-Site:**\n\n1. Review attached screenshots of the advertisement(s) in the client documents section you are looking for on the screen(s). This is not the example of good photos.\n2. Review attached examples of good photos we will accept.\n3. **Confirm site's hours of operations prior to arriving as they may be different than what is on the work order.**\n4. Complete any Prep Tasks in the Field Nation app.\n\n**TASK FOR THE JOB WILL INCLUDE:**\n\n- **Speak to the manager or receptionist. Politely introduce yourself in a professional manner. Let them know you are there on behalf of Mesmerize to capture pictures of their Mesmerize TV.**\n- Enter site on list and find our television screen(s). Our Mesmerize logo will be visible on the side panel.\n- **Wait for correct ad(s) to play on the screen(s) and take clear photos close up and from a distance of the screen(s). (Review attachments if you are unsure what advertisement(s) you are looking for!)**\n- **If the TV is not powered on, please ask the location to turn on the TV with their remote. If they do not have a remote, there is a button under the TV to turn it on. Please reach out in the work order messages if the TV won't turn on.**\n- **If you have not seen the correct advertisement(s) within 30 minutes of waiting, please send a message to the work order manager within the Field Nation messages. Do not leave the site without uploading photos of the correct advertisement(s). Do not leave the site without communicating through the work order messages. If Provider leaves the site without correct photos and without attempting to communicate with the work order manager, they will be asked to return for no extra compensation.**\n- Upload photos in the Field Nation app.\n- After the photos have been uploaded, add closeout notes in the Field Nation app and move on to the next site.\n\n**FAQ:**\n\n1. **You must review the attachments in the work order (Client Documents section) and take the correct photos. If you do not upload photos of the correct advertisement(s), you will be asked to return to site(s) and retake the photos with no extra compensation.**\n2. **You must take a close up photo of the screen and one from a distance. If either are missing you will be asked to return to the site(s) for more photos.**\n3. **We must be able to see the entire screen(s) in the photo(s) or you will be asked to return and retake the photos with no extra compensation. We need to see some of the surrounding area for context.**\n4. **If the TV is not powered on please turn on the TV with either the remote or pressing the power button under the screen.**\n5. **If you do not take photos of the correct advertisement(s) (screenshots have been attached to the work order), you will be asked to return and retake photos with no extra compensation. If you refuse to return you will not be paid for any incorrect work done.**\n6. **If you run into any issues or have any questions, please communicate through Field Nation messages so our entire team can assist you.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T09:00","end":"2026-10-01T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-01T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":20,"max":20},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":35},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"T