{"job":{"id":20029397,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Bijora Inc","title":"Network Cable Technician – Lead Tech (AKIRA Crabtree Valley)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Job Overview</strong></p>\n<p>AKIRA is seeking an experienced <strong>Network Cable Technician to serve as the Lead Technician (Tech 1)</strong> for a<strong>20,000sq ft two-floor retail store build</strong> at Crabtree Valley Mall.</p>\n<p>The Lead Technician will be responsible for <strong>running CAT6 cabling and leading additional technicians onsite during the installation</strong>.</p>\n<p>Primary work will include structured cabling installation and mounting network/security equipment throughout the store.</p>\n<p>The <strong>AKIRA IT Project Manager, Hugo, will be onsite managing the project and coordinating all work with the technicians.</strong></p>\n<p>The Lead Technician must be comfortable <strong>working with other technicians, maintaining organization, and ensuring installation standards are followed.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Project Infrastructure</strong></p>\n<p>The store deployment includes:</p>\n<p>• 26 Security Cameras</p>\n<p>• 2 to 4 People Counters</p>\n<p>• 4 Wireless Access Points</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\n<p>Scope of work may change during installation depending on layout adjustments or coverage needs. <strong>Technicians must be flexible and able to adapt to project needs.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p>\n<p>The Lead Technician will primarily be responsible for:</p>\n<p>• Mounting and installing security cameras</p>\n<p>• Mounting wireless access points</p>\n<p>• Installing people counter devices</p>\n<p>• Assisting with IDF network rack installation and uplink cabling</p>\n<p>• Coordinating cable runs with additional technicians onsite</p>\n<p>The Lead Technician will help <strong>guide other technicians to ensure cabling routes and installations are completed correctly and efficiently.</strong></p>\n<p><br 