{"job":{"id":"3211463195","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"ACent Techs","title":"Install CallBox Phones","description":"<p>Tech will install call box phones and configure W/Remote Support.</p><ul><li><strong><u>Tech will check in &amp; out once onsite: 315-355-3234</u></strong></li><li>Please do not start working until you check in with us!</li><li>Tech will take before &amp; after pictures</li><li>Please get a digital signature before leaving the jobsite.</li><li><strong><u>Please do not leave the job; the hours are flexible/as needed.</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Site Reported:</p><p>Scope of work:</p><ul><li>Connect to electrical box that are smooth, no raised head, small cat cable to connect.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li>Tech shouldn't have to run cable because there’s a cellular phone line that they’re connecting to but be prepared.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>The technician must come equipped with:</p><p><strong>Toner</strong></p><p><strong><u>small cat cable</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>electrical box</u></strong></p><p><strong>Laptop</strong></p><p><strong>Drill</strong></p><p><strong>Butsett</strong></p><p><strong>Label Marker</strong></p><p><strong>Ladder 8 ft</strong></p><p><strong>a digital multi-meter,</strong></p><p><strong>standard and precision screwdrivers,</strong></p><p><strong>CAT5 cable tracer (e.x. Fox and Hound),</strong></p><p><strong>CAT5 cable testers,</strong></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00","end":"2026-09-29T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":60},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/29/2026, 1:00:00 PM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.