{"job":{"id":20057798,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NETFOR","title":"Troubleshoot NVR","description":{"html":"<p>BY ACCEPTING THIS ASSIGNMENT, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLETE THE WO, UPLOAD ALL DELIVERABLES WHILE ON SITE AND COMPLETE THE CHECK IN/OUT PROCESS FULLY.</p>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p>\n<p>Tech will need to call or text into customer help desk before beginning:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><del>******** *</del> <del>******************</del></li>\n<li>Technicians can text 'Start' to <del>***** ********</del>. Please have SR number and Location Name ready.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Statement of Work (Security/Interactive)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>System &amp; Model #:</p>\n<p>OpenEye</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Statement of Work - Issue / Problem :&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SOW: Technician must troubleshoot NVR.of the NVR HDD was been replace and it was been an on going issue.</p>\n<p>New NVR and POE Switch already onsite. If found defective repleace it.</p>\n<p>Technician must chat with HD to confirm, verify and test the functionality of the NVR before leaving the site.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Technician may reach out to OPEN EYE technical Support at 888.542.1103 / 8:30am - 5:00pm PDT.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>REI Annual Health Check&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Please complete the annual health check survey while on site.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>https://interfacesystems.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_cMVuZx9bbo505Zc&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Technician will not leave the site until the site is on primary and all services are working as expected.</li>\n<li>Any unused/RMA parts will need to be returned to FedEx via store/kiosk drop off. Must fill in form along with return label if part being returned.</li>\n<li>All old equipment being replaced can be left with MOD of location</li>\n<li>Once released by support; technician approved to leave site. But must call <del>************ ** ***</del> service desk if support does not transfer.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> *** WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT A RELEASE CODE FROM THE REMOTE SUPPORT TECHNICIAN ***</p>\n<p><strong>REQUIRED DELIVERABLES</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Work Order Signed by POC with Accurate date and Check In/Out times (attached document or electronically).</li>\n<li>Picture of any equipment work was completed on, damaged cables/equipment, etc</li>\n<li>Picture of RMA form &amp; return label applied; if applicable</li>\n<li>Release Code</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p>\n<p>Prepare tool bag/box with the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Laptop (Windows 11)</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Operating system must be fully licensed and updated</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">· Administrative rights required for software installation and troubleshooting</li>\n<li>Basic IT Tools</li>\n<li>Buttset</li>\n<li>Network Testing Tools/Cable Testers</li>\n<li>Drill</li>\n<li>12\" bit for wood/medal/or possibly concrete</li>\n<li>8' Ladder</li>\n<li>Phone/Ethernet Wiring</li>\n<li>Digital Camera / Camera Phone with this ability to send pictures before leaving site</li>\n<li>Copy of work order and job information</li>\n<li>Any other tools/materials you may think you need to complete the job on the first visit.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ensure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Long pants</li>\n<li>Collared shirt</li>\n<li>Netfor name badge</li>\n<li>Close toe shoes</li>\n<li>Review SOW and inform Netfor of any question prior to arriving on site.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Contact Name &amp; Number: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monthly Password: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)</strong></p>","markdown":"BY ACCEPTING THIS ASSIGNMENT, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLETE THE WO, UPLOAD ALL DELIVERABLES WHILE ON SITE AND COMPLETE THE CHECK IN/OUT PROCESS FULLY.\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nTech will need to call or text into customer help desk before beginning:\n\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Technicians can text