{"job":{"id":20058245,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NETFOR","title":"Store 8410 -  Tech Revisit to Install Speaker","description":{"html":"<p><strong><em>Technician must work with <del>****</del> support personnel and get <del>**** </del>release code/reference # prior to ending call. Contact info below SOW</em></strong></p><p><strong><u>DETAILED SOW</u></strong></p><p>We need a technician to come back out with speaker wires to install them.</p><p>Ladder Height: 10-15ft </p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Please send pictures to SMS (317) 324-8026 before leaving the site.&nbsp;MUST TEXT WHAT STORE # YOU ARE AT!</strong></li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Support Contact Info:</strong></p><p>Tech should contact Lids support while onsite. Tech should reach out to (please go down the list in order):</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Support Contact Name 1:&nbsp;<del>* </del></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Support Contact Name 2: <del>********* ****** * ************</del></span></p><p><br></p><p>Any questions or issues, please contact your Field Service Coordinator (see Work Order Manager section) as soon as possible.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>CHECK IN/OUT PROCEDURE</u></strong></p><ol><li>Must arrive onsite at the scheduled time (call Netfor for any unforeseen issues)</li><li>Failure to call and notify Netfor could result in being blocked for future work.&nbsp;&nbsp;We take being notified very seriously so we have time to notify the client.</li></ol><p><strong>Check In Steps</strong>&nbsp;(<u>please follow order</u>)</p><ol><li>Check In via FE Portal</li><li>Check in with Lids support (information listed in confidential information)</li><li>Complete installation per SOW.&nbsp;&nbsp;Do not deviate away from the requested SOW unless you are authorized by&nbsp;Netfor.&nbsp;&nbsp;If you are requested to complete additional work, inform Netfor immediately.&nbsp;&nbsp;<u>Document who requested the additional scope.</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;Without this we will not be able to pay and/or bill extra time.</li></ol><p><strong>Check out Steps</strong></p><ol><li>Have POC sign off on work order documenting check in and out times.</li></ol><ul><li><strong>NOTE:&nbsp;<u>*** WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT ALL DELIVERABLES AND SIGN OFF SHEET SIGNED BY MANAGER ***</u></strong></li></ul><ol><li>Check Out on Field Engineer (FN) Portal</li><li>Check out with Netfor at&nbsp;800-908-0226 opt. 1</li><li>Check out with Lids support (information listed in confidential information)</li></ol><ul><li><strong>NOTE:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Failure to call Netfor to check in or out</strong>&nbsp;could result in 25% withdrawn from payment.&nbsp;<strong>Failure to arrive on time</strong>&nbsp;can also result in 20% withdrawn from payment.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>NOTE: Failure to upload documents and pictures</strong>&nbsp;within 24 hours could result in 25% withdrawn from payment. Tech will have approx. 2 days to close out ticket. Ticket MUST be closed out by Friday each week or it will be canceled.</li><li><strong><u>REQUIREMENTS: WORK ORDER MUST BE FULLY COMPLETED WHILE ONSITE BY USING THE FN-MOBILE APP (SMARTPHONE).</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>TOOLS/MATERIALS</u></strong></p><p>Prepare tool bag/box with the following:</p><ul><li>Laptop (Windows 7 or higher)</li><li>Basic IT Tools</li><li>Network Testing Tools/Cable Testers</li><li>Cat5e Cabling</li><li>ladder</li><li>Digital Camera / Camera Phone with this ability to send pictures before leaving site</li><li>Copy of work order and job information</li><li>Any other tools/materials you may think you need to complete the job on the first visit.</li></ul><p>Ensure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:</p><ul><li>Long pants</li><li>Collared shirt</li><li>Netfor name badge</li><li>Close toe shoes</li><li>Review SOW and inform Netfor of any question prior to arriving on site.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>-----------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>REQUIRED DELIVERABLES</strong></p><p>-----------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul><li>Signed Work Order with Date and Times</li><li>Pictures of area before working</li><li>Pictures of all equipment or cabling installed/troubleshot</li><li>Pictures of area once work is completed (showing area cleaned up)</li></ul>","markdown":"***Technician must work with \\*\\*\\*\\* support personnel and get \\*\\*\\*\\* release code/reference # prior to ending call. Contact info below SOW***\n\n**DETAILED SOW**\n\nWe need a technician to come back out with speaker wires to install them.\n\nLadder Height: 10-15ft\n\n- **Please send pictures to SMS (317) 324-8026 before leaving the site. MUST TEXT WHAT STORE # YOU ARE AT!**\n\n**Support Contact Info:**\n\nTech should contact Lids support while onsite. Tech should reach out to (please go down the list in order):\n\nSupport Contact Name 1: \\*\n\nSupport Contact Name 2: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nAny questions or issues, please contact your Field Service Coordinator (see Work Order Manager section) as soon as possible.\n\n**CHECK IN/OUT PROCEDURE**\n\n1. Must arrive onsite at the scheduled time (call Netfor for any unforeseen issues)\n2. Failure to call and notify Netfor could result in being blocked for future work. We take being notified very seriously so we have time to notify the client.\n\n**Check In Steps** (please follow order)\n\n1. Check In via FE Portal\n2. Check in with Lids support (information listed in confidential information)\n3. Complete installation per SOW. Do not deviate away from the requested SOW unless you are authorized by Netfor. If you are requested to complete additional work, inform Netfor immediately. Document who requested the additional scope. Without this we will not be able to pay and/or bill extra time.\n\n**Check out Steps**\n\n1. Have POC sign off on work order documenting check in and out times.\n\n- **NOTE: \\*\\*\\* WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT ALL DELIVERABLES AND SIGN OFF SHEET SIGNED BY MANAGER \\*\\*\\***\n\n1. Check Out on Field Engineer (FN) Portal\n2. Check out with Netfor at 800-908-0226 opt. 1\n3. Check out with Lids support (information listed in confidential information)\n\n- **NOTE:** **Failure to call Netfor to check in or out** could result in 25% withdrawn from payment. **Failure to arrive on time** can also result in 20% withdrawn from payment.\n- **NOTE: Failure to upload documents and pictures** within 24 hours could result in 25% withdrawn from payment. Tech will have approx. 2 days to close out ticket. Ticket MUST be closed out by Friday each week or it will be canceled.\n- **REQUIREMENTS: WORK ORDER MUST BE FULLY COMPLETED WHILE ONSITE BY USING THE FN-MOBILE APP (SMARTPHONE).**\n\n**TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\nPrepare tool bag/box with the following:\n\n- Laptop (Windows 7 or higher)\n- Basic IT Tools\n- Network Testing Tools/Cable Testers\n- Cat5e Cabling\n- ladder\n- Digital Camera / Camera Phone with this ability to send pictures before leaving site\n- Copy of work order and job information\n- Any other tools/materials you may think you need to complete the job on the first visit.\n\nEnsure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:\n\n- Long pants\n- Collared shirt\n- Netfor name badge\n- Close toe shoes\n- Review SOW and inform Netfor of any question prior to arriving on site.\n\n\\-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n**REQUIRED DELIVERABLES**\n\n\\-----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n- Signed Work Order with Date and Times\n- Pictures of area before working\n- Pictures of all equipment or cabling installed/troubleshot\n- Pictures of area once work is completed (showing area cleaned up)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T11:00","end":"2026-10-01T14:00","latestStart