{"job":{"id":20057562,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Wand Corporation","title":"Install (1) 55\" Touch Screen - Tech 1 - 37631 US Army - Ft Bragg","description":{"html":"<p>This is a tech revisit to install an additional 55\" touch screen.  Preferred to have the same tech for this install.</p><p>Here is a link to the project board for reference: https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVGTOpAxU=/?share_link_id=463387684717</p><p>(please copy above URL into a browser tab to zoom in and view details - note* this covers all US Army bases projects, the Ft Bragg layout is in the lower left side of the project board. We will upload the site map image as an attached document to this WO)</p><p>Install Scope:</p><p>(2) 75\" displays - wall mounted - standard tilt wall mount</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Please provide counteroffers for additional pay/travel if needed and will be reviewed during assignment process.</strong></p><p><strong><em><u>DO NOT call or message us requesting&nbsp;work orders&nbsp;or with any questions about work orders.&nbsp;They are available to provide support for onsite techs.&nbsp;Anything additional should be done through the Field Nation portal and&nbsp;may result in you being removed from our provider network or totally blocked.&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></em></strong></p><p><strong>**Rate includes all travel related expenses (fuel, tolls, etc.).&nbsp;Submit a counteroffer if additional is required.</strong></p><p><strong>**Tech assigned on Field Nation must be primary tech onsite for the job or payment may be withheld.&nbsp;Any exceptions must be approved by us first through the portal.</strong></p><p><strong>Failure to complete all work listed in description/SOW may result in reduced payment for work order.</strong></p><p><strong><em>Please use the FN counteroffer system if any issues with dates and/or pricing and we will review among all qualifying bids.&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>REQUIRED TOOLS:</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Metal cutting tools in case you need to shorten a bracket mostly aluminum rail.&nbsp;</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Drill Bit sets - Please note Diamond Drill bits required for Tile wall installs.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;USB Keyboard and Mouse</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ladder (2 ladders. Standard as well as step ladder)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tool bag/carrier&nbsp;with standard installation equipment (drills, tape measure, screw driver, masking tape etc)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Drop cloth to cover onsite surfaces and equipment.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hard Hat, Safety Glasses, Vest, Field Boots (May be used for new construction)</p><p><em>Thank&nbsp;you for your interest and we look forward to working with you!</em></p><p><strong><em><u>*****************************************************************************</u></em></strong></p>","markdown":"This is a tech revisit to install an additional 55\" touch screen. Preferred to have the same tech for this install.\n\nHere is a link to the project board for reference: https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVGTOpAxU=/?share_link_id=463387684717\n\n(please copy above URL into a browser tab to zoom in and view details - note\\* this covers all US Army bases projects, the Ft Bragg layout is in the lower left side of the project board. We will upload the site map image as an attached document to this WO)\n\nInstall Scope:\n\n(2) 75\" displays - wall mounted - standard tilt wall mount\n\n**Please provide counteroffers for additional pay/travel if needed and will be reviewed during assignment process.**\n\n***DO NOT call or message us requesting work orders or with any questions about work orders. They are available to provide support for onsite techs. Anything additional should be done through the Field Nation portal and may result in you being removed from our provider network or totally blocked.***\n\n**\\*\\*Rate includes all travel related expenses (fuel, tolls, etc.). Submit a counteroffer if additional is required.**\n\n**\\*\\*Tech assigned on Field Nation must be primary tech onsite for the job or payment may be withheld. Any exceptions must be approved by us first through the portal.**\n\n**Failure to complete all work listed in description/SOW may result in reduced payment for work order.**\n\n***Please use the FN counteroffer system if any issues with dates and/or pricing and we will review among all qualifying bids.***\n\n**REQUIRED TOOLS:**\n\n· Metal cutting tools in case you need to shorten a bracket mostly aluminum rail.\n\n· Drill Bit sets - Please note Diamond Drill bits required for Tile wall installs.\n\n· USB Keyboard and Mouse\n\n· Ladder (2 ladders. Standard as well as step ladder)\n\n· Tool bag/carrier with standard installation equipment (drills, tape measure, screw driver, masking tape etc)\n\n· Drop cloth to cover onsite surfaces and equipment.\n\n· Hard Hat, Safety Glasses, Vest, Field Boots (May be used for new construction)\n\n*Thank you for your interest and we look forward to working with you!*\n\n***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\****","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T08:00","end":"2026-10-05T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":120},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":53},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T13:00:00.000Z","end