c Addresses with Photos\n- Install Network Rack Equipment\n\n\\----UPS, Peplink Modem, SonicWall, and Network Switch\n\n\\----You will need to work with you \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* IT Specialist to determine the best location for the Peplink Modem\n\n- Network Cable Runs (Run, Test and Label)\n\n\\----Confirm existing runs that can be reused, and run any new cable runs needed\n\n\\----Expect to run form 6 to 10 new cable runs\n\n\\----Devices are port specific so labeling is extremely important\n\n- Install Access Points and Confirm Connectivity\n- Install Multifunction Printer\n- Install i-Gel Cubics PCs\n- Install Tablets (At least 2 per site)\n- Install Cameras\n- Complete TDX Work Order Form\n- Upload All Picture to TDX Work Order\n- Check Out with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* IT Specialist\n- Check Out with TDX Tech Help Desk\n\n**If the technician arrives on site and is not prepared, they will be asked to leave site and will not be paid.**\n\n**Upon completion, the work order and pictures must be uploaded to the Field Nation immediately for TDX Review.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T10:00","end":"2026-10-21T30:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":1100},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":20,"distance":12},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 21, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 21, Thu, Oct 22, Fri, Oct 23 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and I