{"job":{"id":"9406088144","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Concert Technologies","title":"Two Techs Required! Install Security Camera","description":"<p>tech to install one fixed security camera in the panoramic X-ray room and one dedicated monitor in the X-ray alcove</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-<strong>Will need cable molding</strong> and 2 techs onsite with a ladder to install cam. <strong>Ladder to reach up to 15'</strong></p><p>-Install one 18.5-inch security monitor at the green-highlighted location in the X-ray alcove, positioned next to the existing X-ray monitor for technician view</p><p>-Install one security camera at the yellow-highlighted location in the panoramic X-ray room. The camera will face the 3D X-ray machine and capture the patient imaging area</p><p>need to bring wire molding&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>&nbsp;Tools Required to complete Installation. Network/ Computer SAVVY technician required – This is a requirement!</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Laptop w/ Windows 8 or better</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Remote Access Computer Software (Microsoft Teams access)</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Cisco Console Cable (DB9 and Rollover cable)</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- DB9 to USB Adapter</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Emulator Software (Putty or Tera Term)&nbsp;- Pre-installed and knowledge on how to use.</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Hot-Spot or wireless access (Not the customers)</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Cat6 Ethernet patch cord for PC connection to equipment</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;- Must be knowledgeable in changing static IP's and if needed changing PORT Speed on laptop Ethernet Port.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;Please bring cat6, Butt Sett, patch cords, mod ends, testing equipment, tools or hardware etc. that may be needed to complete the job.&nbsp;</strong></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00","end":"2026-10-02T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":65.00504903,"max":195.01514709},"payType":"hourly","