{"job":{"id":20059819,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Lead Technician | Firm Start | Store Remodel - Network/Cabling/POS","description":{"html":"<p><strong>No unauthorized persons allowed on site. Any swaps or helpers must be approved by Essintial.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>REQUIRED SKILLS:&nbsp;</u></strong>Mid-Level Low Voltage Cabling, Mid-Level to Advanced Network Technician, Experience with Network &amp; Security/CCTV and Experience installing POS Equipment. Technician MUST be able to run cables neatly through various ceiling types, terminate cables with RJ45 plugs and or Keystone jacks.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work</u>:&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></strong>Seeking Lead<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Technician to complete a Store Remodel at various Retailers. Technicians will be onsite to complete Low Voltage Cabling Runs, CCTV Installations (varies by site), POS De-Installations &amp; Re-Installations, TV Installations. (Every Remodel / STORE is slightly Different). Scope of work will take place&nbsp;<strong>Over Multiple</strong>&nbsp;<strong>NIGHTs</strong>. Each Night you will be scoped to complete specific items to stay on task to meet the store's cutover date. Technicians will be working with Remote Bridge Line, Onsite MOD, and Site General Contractors nightly / throughout the project.</p><ul><li>Lead Tech is&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">responsible</span>&nbsp;for reviewing and referring to ALL provided&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Remodel Onsite Technician Instructions / Documentation&nbsp;</span>[GENERAL PROJECT SPECIFIC &amp; STORE SPECIFIC Documentation] - Refer to the provided SharePoint Links. Any Issues, Escalate to Essintial.</li><li>Lead Technician will be provided/working with multiple assist technicians to help with the completion of the scope.</li><li>Lead Tech&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;join and work with the&nbsp;<strong>