{"job":{"id":20060102,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"URGENT - VIP SITE!! NEED DONE ASAP!! Kiosk Service - Break/Fix - Troubleshoot Camera - Left Bitting","description":{"html":"<p>**KIOSK #: NS9045**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Overview:</p>\n<p>LB Cam and cc reader needs to be checked</p>\n<p>Troubleshoot degraded camera in the kiosk.</p>\n<p>Cameras needing troubleshooting: Left Bitting</p>\n<p>Verify connections from camera to controller board to motherboard are correct and fully seated.</p>\n<p>Determine if the issue is with the camera, cable, or ports.</p>\n<p>If the camera is faulty, check if another camera in the kiosk can be harvested.</p>\n<p>If ports are the issue, explore remapping.</p>\n<p>After resolving degradation, complete a test transaction to confirm functionality.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check out with SSN.</p>\n<p>SUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables**</p>\n<p>**Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app**</p>\n<p><strong>**Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site**</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*KIOSK #: NS9045\\*\\*\n\nOverview:\n\nLB Cam and cc reader needs to be checked\n\nTroubleshoot degraded camera in the kiosk.\n\nCameras needing troubleshooting: Left Bitting\n\nVerify connections from camera to controller board to motherboard are correct and fully seated.\n\nDetermine if the issue is with the camera, cable, or ports.\n\nIf the camera is faulty, check if another camera in the kiosk can be harvested.\n\nIf ports are the issue, explore remapping.\n\nAfter resolving degradation, complete a test transaction to confirm functionality.\n\nCheck out with SSN.\n\nSUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!\n\n\\*\\*All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Complete the scope of work outlin