{"job":{"id":20060998,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"OHZ Security","title":"NVR Replacement - EST 2 HRS","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with years of experience in troubleshooting CCTV camera system. We will need assistance to replace a defective NVR and connect your laptop to the switch for IT to program it.</li><li>We have shipped a new NVR, we will need to install a new one and install the Hard Drives from the old unit into the new NVR.</li><li>Technician will need to bring a portable monitor if needed in order to connect it to the NVR.</li><li>Communicate with OHZ Support for any assistance.</li><li>Estimated duration will be 2 hours.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements&nbsp;</em></strong></p><ol><li>&nbsp;Call Work Order manager to confirm Scope of Work and scheduling</li><li>Call <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** ******* ************</del></span> 30 min prior to arrival</li><li>Call Onsite contact <del>******** ****** ****************</del>. 30 minute prior to arrival to let her know you are on your way.</li></ol><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks&nbsp;</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order. You represent OHZ Security while onsite</li><li>Check in with Amonique so she can grant you access to the property</li><li>Communicate with <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** ******* </del></span><del>************</del> to get the location of the NVR.</li><li>Replace the NVR to the new one and install the Hard drives from the old NVR into the new one.</li><li>Communicate with <del>*** ******* </del>to confirm we can see their system on our end.</li><li>Review completion of work and take photos.</li><li>Check-out</li></ol><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong>Additional Contacts:&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><del>******** ****** ***************************** ********</del></li><li><del>*** ******* ********************** ** ************** ********</del></li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code:&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;Business casual; no ripped jeans, no graphic t-shirts.</li><li>PPE: hard hats when applicable</li></ul><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>Cable tester, Laptop with Ethernet port or an Ethernet adapter, Crimper, Drill</li></ul><p><strong>Directory Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Work Order manager</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to Work Order manager</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Additional hours or expenses need to be pre-approved by Work Order manager prior to incurring on the work order.</li><li>Any hours or expenses incurred without pre-approval from the Work Order manager will not be accepted.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with years of experience in troubleshooting CCTV camera system. We will need assistance to replace a defective NVR and connect your laptop to the switch for IT to program it.\n- We have shipped a new NVR, we will need to install a new one and install the Hard Drives from the old unit into the new NVR.\n- Technician will need to bring a portable monitor if needed in order to connect it to the NVR.\n- Communicate with OHZ Support for any assistance.\n- Estimated duration will be 2 hours.\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Call Work Order manager to confirm Scope of Work and scheduling\n2. Call \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* 30 min prior to arrival\n3. Call Onsite contact \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*. 30 minute prior to arrival to let her know you are on your way.\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order. You represent OHZ Security while onsite\n2. Check in with Amonique so she can grant you access to the property\n3. Communicate with \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* to get the location of the NVR.\n4. Replace the NVR to the new one and install the Hard drives from the old NVR into the new one.\n5. Communicate with \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* to confirm we can see their system on our end.\n6. Review completion of work and take photos.\n7. Check-out\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n**Additional Contacts:**\n\n- \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Business casual; no ripped jeans, no graphic t-shirts.\n- PPE: hard hats when applicable\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- Basic hand tools\n- Cable tester, Laptop with Ethernet port or an Ethernet adapter, Crimper, Drill\n\n**Directory Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Work Order manager\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to Work Order manager\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Additional hours or expenses need to be pre-approved by Work Order manager prior to incurring on the work order.\n- Any hours or expenses incurred without pre-approval from the Work Order manager will not be accepted.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-02T12:00","end":"2026-10-02T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":140,"max":140},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":10},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05