{"job":{"id":20061617,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Ovation Workplace Services","title":"Network Support Tech Required","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Please adhere to the following mandatory guidelines for all site visits:</strong></p><p><strong>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Do not leave the site</strong>without prior permission from myself and our team or the DCC team.</p><p>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Do not contact the POC</strong>(Point of Contact) before the visit unless explicitly instructed to do so.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Dress Code- Business Casuals.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Do not discuss the</strong> payrate onsite with the customer or other employees.</p><p><strong>Failure to follow these instructions will result in disqualification of work approval, impact billing, and may affect your eligibility for future assignments.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Scope: Request dispatch for Network install, Requesting all network hardware to be mounted and installed in network rack. (Aruba Gateway, 2 Aruba Switches, DIGI, connect patch cables from patch panel to switch, mount Wireless AP's in ceiling and install APC UPS in network rack.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SPOC: Brandon Andrews -2527142258</p><p>Remote poc: Ron Ramseur - 678-331-3550 and Aric Arnsworth - 781-516-7287.</p><p>The NS&amp;I support engineer for this one will be Antonio Medeiros&nbsp;781-697-6933.</p>","markdown":"**Please adhere to the following mandatory guidelines for all site visits:**\n\n**1. Do not leave the site**without prior permission from myself and our team or the DCC team.\n\n2\\. **Do not contact the POC**(Point of Contact) before the visit unless explicitly instructed to do so.\n\n3\\. **Dress Code- Business Casuals.**\n\n**4. Do not discuss the** payrate onsite with the customer or other employees.\n\n**Failure to follow these instructions will result in disqualification of work approval, impact billing, and may affect your eligi