{"job":{"id":20061023,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Teceze","title":"Field Service Engineer - Retail Store Device Health Check","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><p>Technicians will visit assigned retail stores to perform a checklist-based health check of store technology equipment.</p><p>The technician will:</p><ul><li>Perform health checks on retail technology devices, including:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Point-of-Sale (POS) equipment</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Self-checkout devices</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Printers</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Handheld scanners</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Other related store technology equipment</li><li>Follow the provided device health-check checklist and procedures.</li><li>Use the Retail Device Diagnostic Tool when access is provided.</li><li>Identify device health issues and perform basic troubleshooting/remediation where possible.</li><li>Replace or use available support devices/parts when provided and authorized.</li><li>Record all devices checked and document any issues identified.</li><li>Document all remediation activities completed onsite.</li><li>Record any unresolved issues that require follow-up.</li><li>Maintain an accurate daily activity/visit report.</li><li>Take clear photos when required for documentation.</li><li>Clean up the work area after completing the activity.</li></ul><p>Unresolved Issues</p><p>For issues that cannot be resolved onsite:</p><ul><li>Document the device information and issue details.</li><li>Record troubleshooting steps already performed.</li><li>Provide the information to the project team for further action.</li><li>Do not perform any work outside the approved scope without prior authorization.</li></ul><p>Technician Requirements</p><ul><li>Previous experience with retail technology / POS / network / IT hardware is preferred.</li><li>Comfortable working independently at retail store locations.</li><li>Able to follow detailed checklists and pro