{"job":{"id":19094177,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"POS Refresh *TIME/DATE DEFINITE*","description":{"html":"<p>The technician will be upgrading the store's POS terminals/peripherals and deinstalling the old Dell POS Server. All old POS equipment will need to be packed up for return shipment.<br />\n<br />\n***In order to prepare for this site visit, you will be required to view a short Service Orientation Video and provide a Keyword for validation within 48 hours of your site visit.***<br />\n<br />\nREQUIRED TOOLS<br />\n- Cordless drill driver<br />\n- Drill bit set with a ¼” bit<br />\n- Security screw set with a T25 bit<br />\n- Torx screw set with a T8 bit<br />\n- Standard Tools: http://www.rtisurl.com/?c=StandardTools<br />\n- Snips<br />\n- Smartphone with Microsoft Teams mobile app<br />\n- Tone generator with probe<br />\n- Data cabling tester (must say \"Pass\" / \"Fail\")<br />\n- Punch down tool with a 110-blade<br />\n<br />\nDRESS CODE<br />\n- Polo shirt<br />\n- Jeans or khaki pants (no shorts)<br />\n<br />\nDISPATCH GUIDELINES<br />\n- Only confirmed technicians are authorized to be on-site for an activity/dispatch.<br />\n- Any scheduling or tech assignment requests/changes must receive prior approval.<br />\n- Furthermore, additional technicians and/or supervisors are not authorized to accompany assigned tech(s) onsite at any time without prior approval.<br />\n<br />\n**MUST SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION SECTION / SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS FOR WORK INSTRUCTIONS**<br /></p>","markdown":"The technician will be upgrading the store's POS terminals/peripherals and deinstalling the old Dell POS Server. All old POS equipment will need to be packed up for return shipment.  \n  \n\\*\\*\\*In order to prepare for this site visit, you will be required to view a short Service Orientation Video and provide a Keyword for validation within 48 hours of your site visit.\\*\\*\\*  \n  \nREQUIRED TOOLS  \n\\- Cordless drill driver  \n