{"job":{"id":"4310269089","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance***","description":"\"***GRANITE CORE BRIDGE, GRANITE ACCESS ACTIVATIONS BRIDGE, CIRCUIT DETAILS, EQUIPMENT DETAILS POSTED IN SOW BELOW***<br><br>Requesting assistance to:<br><br>1) Call into Granite Core Team Bridge to confirm arrival<br>2) Locate new Granite-provided broadband and or/ DIA service<br>3) Extend new service to Burlington’s network rack/cabinet (if needed)<br>4) Test/validate new service<br>5) With Access Activations assistance, confirm with carrier that modem/router onsite is set to IP Passthrough/Bridge modem<br>6) Connect new Granite-provided Internet service(s) modem and/or FlexEdge router to new EdgebootPro equipment for power in accordance to port mapping guide listed below.<br>7) Connect new Granite-provided Internet service(s) and EdgebootPro to existing Burlington-provided Fortinet firewall ethernet ports in accordance to port mapping guide listed below<br>8) Confirm AC and ethernet connectivity via Edgeboot.io<br>9) Once complete, request Granite Field Service technician to contact Burlington’s Managed Service Provider (Acuative) to perform health check on applicable Fortinet firewall ports new equipment is now connected to<br><br>***NETWORK DIAGRAM ATTACHED AS REFERENCED***<br><br>***ONCE STEPS 1-7 ARE COMPLETE, PLEASE CONTACT BURLINGTON’S MANAGED SERVIE PROVIDE (ACUATIVE) @ 1-888-835-7687, OPTION 1***<br><br>***TECHNICIAN MUST CALL INTO GRANITE ACCESS ACTIVATIONS TEAM. REP WILL THEN MERGE ACCUATIVE INTO CALL FOR A SIGN OFF CODE***<br><br>***JOB NOT COMPLETE UNTIL ALL STEPS ARE PERFORMED***<br><br>***NETWORK CUTOVER TO TAKE PLACE AT LATER DATE***<br><br>***ALL DIA SERVICES FOR BURLINGTON INCLUDES AN EPIKE EDGE/FLEXEDGE DEVICE REGARDLESS WHETHER ON OR OFF-NET. EPIK EDGE/FLEXEDGE DEVICE WILL COME IN SAME PACKAGE AS EDGEBOOT***<br><br>New service details are below:\"<br>Gr