{"job":{"id":20060877,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"(Silversphere) Smoke Detector Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>(Silversphere) </p><p></p><p>Service Description</p><p>PLEASE NOTE WHILE YOU ARE ON SITE YOU REPRESENT SILVERPSHERE</p><p></p><p>THIS IS AN SENIOR ASSISTED LIVING FACILITY. THIS LOCATION REQUIRES TECHS TO ADHERE TO THE BELOW TENETS:</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Cleanliness: </span><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Technicians will arrive clean and wearing clean business casual attire. No flip-flops, t-shirts, or torn clothes. Our business is in senior living and has a very conservative audience. Dress appropriately.</em></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Professionalism:</span><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> Technicians represent Silversphere. At all times, they will conduct themselves professionally while working with a Silversphere technician remotely. If a question about product or scope should arise that is outside the original scope of work, they are to refer the customer back to Silversphere.</em></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Transportation: </span><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Technicians will have their own vehicle used to transport themselves to and from the work site. Should they need to leave the site, they will alert Silversphere and the community immediately. Time off-site is non billable.</em></p><p><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </em></p><p>PLEASE CALL THE CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM BEFORE ENTERING THE SITE:</p><ul><li>Check IN/OUT: <del>************</del></li></ul><p><strong>SILVERSPHERE TECHNICAL CONTACT (CALL BEFORE ENTERING SITE): <del>***************************</del></strong></p><p>LOCAL CONTACT: <del>****************************</del></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Silversphere Case Number - <del>******</del></strong></p><p> </p><p><strong>We need a technician to assist in the following:  </strong></p><ol><li>Check in with CIS</li><li>Check in with TCON</li><li>Check in with the MOD</li><li>Technician to assist with troubleshooting the smoke detectors in Apt. 534 and Apt. 405</li><li>Including the wiring between each smoke detector and its wireless transmitter</li><li>Determine where the issue is occurring</li><li>The technician will serve as hands and eyes onsite while working with Sentrics.</li><li>Call TCON to confirm work is complete and you are released</li><li>Get manager&#39;s signature on Ensure Site Visit Form </li><li>Check out with CIS</li></ol><p> </p><p><strong>Equipment required</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop</li><li>Laptop charger</li><li>Fully charged cell phone</li><li>Console cable</li><li>Cable tester</li><li>Fish tape</li><li>Toner</li><li>Crimper</li><li>Label maker</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong>Materials Needed:</strong></p><ul><li>1000&#39; of Cat5e</li><li>Surface mount box</li><li>Keystone jacks</li><li>Cat5e patch cables</li><li>Zip ties</li><li>Velcro strips</li></ul><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">DELIVERABLES:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO </span><del>************</del></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- WORKMAN&#39;S COMP WAIVER </span><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(ATTACHED)</em></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- ENSURE SITE VISIT FORM (ATTACHED)</span></p><p><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </em></p>","markdown":"(Silversphere)\n\nService Description\n\nPLEASE NOTE WHILE YOU ARE ON SITE YOU REPRESENT SILVERPSHERE\n\nTHIS IS AN SENIOR ASSISTED LIVING FACILITY. THIS LOCATION REQUIRES TECHS TO ADHERE TO THE BELOW TENETS:\n\nCleanliness: *Technicians will arrive clean and wearing clean business casual attire. No flip-flops, t-shirts, or torn clothes. Our business is in senior living and has a very conservative audience. Dress appropriately.*\n\nProfessionalism: *Technicians represent Silversphere. At all times, they will conduct themselves professionally while working with a Silversphere technician remotely. If a question about product or scope should arise that is outside the original scope of work, they are to refer the customer back to Silversphere.*\n\nTransportation: *Technicians will have their own vehicle used to transport themselves to and from the work site. Should they need to leave the site, they will alert Silversphere and the community immediately. Time off-site is non billable.*\n\nPLEASE CALL THE CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM BEFORE ENTERING THE SITE:\n\n- Check IN/OUT: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**SILVERSPHERE TECHNICAL CONTACT (CALL BEFORE ENTERING SITE): \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\nLOCAL CONTACT: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Silversphere Case Number - \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**We need a technician to assist in the following:**\n\n1. Check in with CIS\n2. Check in with TCON\n3. Check in with the MOD\n4. Technician to assist with troubleshooting the smoke detectors in Apt. 534 and Apt. 405\n5. Including the wiring between each smoke detector and its wireless transmitter\n6. Determine where the issue is occurring\n7. The technician will serve as hands and eyes onsite while working with Sentrics.\n8. Call TCON to confirm work is complete and you are released\n9. Get manager's signature on Ensure Site Visit Form\n10. Check out with CIS\n\n**Equipment required**\n\n- Laptop\n- Laptop charger\n- Fully charged cell phone\n- Console cable\n- Cable tester\n- Fish tape\n- Toner\n- Crimper\n- Label maker\n\n**Materials Needed:**\n\n- 1000' of Cat5e\n- Surface mount box\n- Keystone jacks\n- Cat5e patch cables\n- Zip ties\n- Velcro strips\n\nDELIVERABLES:\n\n\\- PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\- WORKMAN'S COMP WAIVER *(ATTACHED)*\n\n\\- ENSURE SITE VISIT FORM (ATTACHED)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T10:00","end":"2026-10-01T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":300},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":150},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":75}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6},"result":{"eligible":true,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"ELIGIBLE"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Move | Priority 3 | 09/29/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 | FE offline |  noc: 6998768 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z