o, please provide confirmation code\n- Provide DETAILED notes of the work that took place including any problems and resolutions steps taken\n- Provide DETAILED notes of any problems onsite that would have caused a delay over 4 hours\n\n**ESCALATION:**\n\n- Support Related Questions and Any Issues onsite / Related to the scope of work should be escalated directly to the **Essintial Project Technical Support @ 717-610-3070**\n\n **Out of Scope Information:**\n\n- If you are asked to do anything onsite that is outside of the work scope on this work order or attached documents, please report to Essintial immediately for approval of additional/different scope.\n- If the instruction you are receiving onsite deviates from what is listed on your work order or attached documents, please report to Essintial immediately for approval of additional/different scope.\n- If the work onsite is about to go over the scoped/estimated time onsite, you MUST call Essintial immediately to provide the reason for going over that timeframe. You will also be required to provide this reason upon close out on your Online Deliverable.\n\n**PHYSICAL REQUIREMENTS:** Must be able to bend, kneel, stand and lift, carry 50lbs repeatedly for extended periods of time.\n\n**DRESS CODE:** **Professional work dress code** is mandatory: Technicians should present a clean, professional appearance. A plain polo / collared / or button-down shirt, slacks / durable work pants (no shorts), and nice shoes / steel- or composite-toe slip-resistant shoes or boots. **Not allowed**: T‑shirts, hoodies, graphics, holes, or stained clothing.\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy:**\n\n- All expenses such as tolls, parking, materials must be pre-approved and accompanied by a receipt. Reimbursements will not be increased to cover markups of any kind.\n- Technicians must contact Essintial for any deviations from the scheduled service date or time. No payment will be granted for work performed prior to the 