{"job":{"id":20064749,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Computer Assistant","title":"Digital signage not working after USB stick update  2081401","description":{"html":"<p>Service is needed today Wednesday 9-30-2026 as quickly as possible.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Site is local office that has smart TV in the lobby that works a digital signage running a video/ ppt from the USB stick in a loop.&nbsp; Site took USB out to update the file but site discovered does not know how to navigate to the file commander to run the file.&nbsp; The person who set this up is not onsite and is not sure if he uploaded the file through the USB or through the FTP feature. Technician needed onsite to work with remote support to diagnose and get the signage running properly.</p>\n<p>Technician MUST obtain site contact signature on the field service report confirming time arrived, time left and what was done onsite.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"Service is needed today Wednesday 9-30-2026 as quickly as possible.\n\nSite is local office that has smart TV in the lobby that works a digital signage running a video/ ppt from the USB stick in a loop. Site took USB out to update the file but site discovered does not know how to navigate to the file commander to run the file. The person who set this up is not onsite and is not sure if he uploaded the file through the USB or through the FTP feature. Technician needed onsite to work with remote support to diagnose and get the signage running properly.\n\nTechnician MUST obtain site contact signature on the field service report confirming time arrived, time left and what was done onsite.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-30T12:00","end":"2026-09-30T14:00","latestStart":"2026-09-30T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":110},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":12},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $110 (countered: $