{"job":{"id":20064856,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Darkhorse Tech, Inc.","title":" PC - Cords and TV Connection Issue","description":{"html":"<p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES:</strong></p><ul><li>Provider MUST call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number1822329<em> </em>to work with a Darkhorse Tech engineer to complete this work order.</li><li>Take pictures of any areas you work on and upload them to the work order with proper labeling</li><li>If you must cancel the WO for any reason, please provide 24-hour notice if possible and call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number above</li></ul><p><strong>Scope of Work: </strong>a flashing/dropping display connection between the PC and TV at Op 8 isn't something to chase remotely</p><p><strong>Equipment Required:</strong> Spare HDMI/display cables and basic hand tools — \"flashing and won't stay connected\" usually points to a failing cable, loose connector, or bad port</p><p>Example: Windows Laptop and Charger, Network tone, Ethernet cables, Termination Tools, Ladder, Keystone jacks, Punch Down tool.</p>","markdown":"**IMPORTANT NOTES:**\n\n- Provider MUST call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number1822329 to work with a Darkhorse Tech engineer to complete this work order.\n- Take pictures of any areas you work on and upload them to the work order with proper labeling\n- If you must cancel the WO for any reason, please provide 24-hour notice if possible and call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number above\n\n**Scope of Work:** a flashing/dropping display connection between the PC and TV at Op 8 isn't something to chase remotely\n\n**Equipment Required:** Spare HDMI/display cables and basic hand tools — \"flashing and won't stay connected\" usually points to a failing cable, loose connector, or bad port\n\nExample: Windows Laptop and Charger, Network tone, Ethernet cables, Termination Tools, Ladder, Keystone jacks, Punch Down tool.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T11:00