{"job":{"id":20057954,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ServiceP (PreferredTechs)","title":"Connect the speakers to the amp","description":{"html":"<p><strong>MANDATORY</strong>:</p><ol><li>Once you arrive on site and are ready to start work, please call or text (507-400-3227) to check in. If you are unable to reach anyone, please contact (720-515-5551).</li><li>Introduce yourself to the site contact and begin work</li><li>Complete installation. Contact Mario with any issues or concerns so work is completed correctly and fully.&nbsp;</li><li>Complete required deliverables (see below) and call support to confirm you have completed the full SOW.</li><li><strong><u>Text signed WO</u></strong> to (507-400-3227 and 720-515-5551)</li><li><strong>REQUIRED</strong>: Call (507-400-3227) to check out providing detailed notes of installation and any delays/issues. If you are unable to reach anyone, please contact (720-515-5551).</li></ol><p><br></p><p>Scope of work;</p><p>Connect speakers to the existing Amp. The media player is already connected to the AMP. </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><ul><li>Philips/flat head screwdrivers</li><li>Cable Management</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>Terminations</li><li>Basic Tools (screwdrivers, pliers, tape measure, etc)</li><li>Copy of WO</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Ensure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:</strong></p><ul><li>Long pants (Khakis or Jeans with no holes)</li><li>Collared shirt/Polo shirt</li><li>Close toe shoes</li><li>Review SOW and inform ServiceP of any question prior to arriving on site.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Required Deliverables</strong></p><ul><li>Signed work order (with check-in/out times and customer signature).</li></ul><p><br></p>","markdown":"**MANDATORY**:\n\n1. Once you arrive on site and are ready to start work, please call or text (507-400-3227) to check in. If you are unable to reach anyone, please contact (720-515-5551).\n2. Introduce yourself to the site contact and begin work\n3. Complete installation. Contact Mario with any issues or concerns so work is completed correctly and fully.\n4. Complete required deliverables (see below) and call support to confirm you have completed the full SOW.\n5. **Text signed WO** to (507-400-3227 and 720-515-5551)\n6. **REQUIRED**: Call (507-400-3227) to check out providing detailed notes of installation and any delays/issues. If you are unable to reach anyone, please contact (720-515-5551).\n\nScope of work;\n\nConnect speakers to the existing Amp. The media player is already connected to the AMP.\n\n**Tools:**\n\n- Philips/flat head screwdrivers\n- Cable Management\n- Label Maker\n- Terminations\n- Basic Tools (screwdrivers, pliers, tape measure, etc)\n- Copy of WO\n\n**Ensure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:**\n\n- Long pants (Khakis or Jeans with no holes)\n- Collared shirt/Polo shirt\n- Close toe shoes\n- Review SOW and inform ServiceP of any question prior to arriving on site.\n\n**Required Deliverables**\n\n- Signed work order (with check-in/out times and customer signature).","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-30T10:00","end":"2026-09-30T11:00","latestStart":"2026-09-30T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":165},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":65},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":11},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/30/2026, 10:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T15:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T15:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T