{"job":{"id":20066387,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pinnacle Communication Corporation","title":"N55049 - 4 Rooms NDT (Mitel MiVB MXe III PBX)","description":{"html":"<p>Technician to call tech support at 240-912-2529 - opt 1 then 1 upon&nbsp;arrival and before departure from site.</p><p>Customer reports no dial tone in 4 guest rooms - 261,266,273,279.</p><p>Remote technician determined we need a tech on site to work with remote support to complete the following scope of work:</p><p>Troubleshoot/repair dial tone in the following rooms:</p><p>GR 261 - 4.1.2.4 - Idle</p><p>GR 266 - 4.1.2.9 - Idle</p><p>GR 273 - 4.1.2.16 -Idle</p><p>GR 279 - 4.1.2.21 -Idle</p><p><strong><em>Technician must take the following tools to the jobsite:</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Windows 10 or less laptop with HSIA capability</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Serial cable with DB9 and DB25 to USB ends and Null Modem connections</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Telephone test set a.k.a. butt set</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Tone generator with tracking wand</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Punch down tool for both 66 and 110 blocks</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Cat 5 inserts and faceplates</em></strong></p><p><strong>TECH TO CALL TECH SUPPORT EVERY 15 MINUTES UNTIL A SUPPORT TECH IS AVAILABLE.</strong></p><p><strong>TECH MUST RECORD NAME OF PCC TECH THEY ARE CHECKING IN AND OUT WITH.</strong></p>","markdown":"Technician to call tech support at 240-912-2529 - opt 1 then 1 upon arrival and before departure from site.\n\nCustomer reports no dial tone in 4 guest rooms - 261,266,273,279.\n\nRemote technician determined we need a tech on site to work with remote support to complete the following scope of work:\n\nTroubleshoot/repair dial tone in the following rooms:\n\nGR 261 - 4.1.2.4 - Idle\n\nGR 266 - 4.1.2.9 - Idle\n\nGR 273 - 4.1.2.16 -Idle\n\nGR 279 - 4.1.2.21 -Idle\n\n***Technician must take the following tools to the jobsite:***\n\n***Windows 10 or less laptop with HSIA capability***\n\n***Serial cable with DB9 and DB25 to USB ends and Null Modem connections***\n\n***Telephone test set a.k.a. butt set***\n\n***Tone generator with tracking wand***\n\n***Punch down tool for both 66 and 110 blocks***\n\n***Cat 5 inserts and faceplates***\n\n**TECH TO CALL TECH SUPPORT EVERY 15 MINUTES UNTIL A SUPPORT TECH IS AVAILABLE.**\n\n**TECH MUST RECORD NAME OF PCC TECH THEY ARE CHECKING IN AND OUT WITH.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T09:00","end":"2026-10-01T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-01T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":17},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 | FE offline |  noc: 6998768 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z"