{"job":{"id":20067318,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"TECH TO INSTALL: GLUE PAD - REGISTER 3","description":{"html":"<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Required On-site time/window: 10/1</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Equipment:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Make/Model: POS</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Serial Number: {SRM_FN.SERIAL}</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Problem Description:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;Tech request: Qty 1 Glue pad -- Install in Register 3. Schedule on Thursday 10/01</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"><br/><br/></span><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Important Scope/Customer Information:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Any changes to ETA&rsquo;s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">via phone.</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">