{"job":{"id":20068139,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IT & Cable Pros","title":"Onsite Service","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>SCOPE OF WORK:</u></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>survey for extending dmarc</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>General Dispatch Requirements:</u></strong></p>\n<p>**After reviewing the scope, if it will take more than</p>\n<p>2 hours then call to discuss</p>\n<p>**Technician is not authorized to perform any structural</p>\n<p>changes without permission from IT &amp; Cable Pros</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Contact IT &amp; Cable Pros for any questions or concerns pertaining to this work order&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>** Do not contact our customer,&nbsp;call work order manger first.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Introducing yourself to the Customer:</u></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Pricing on Site Surveys is always confidential between you (the Provider) and IT &amp; Cable Pros (the Buyer).</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Identify yourself as representing IT &amp; Cable Pros&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Review Scope with customer</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Custom<u>er</u>&nbsp;Leaves/Asks you to lock up for them: Call us immediately if this occurs as there are liability concerns.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Customer Policies &amp; Procedures</u></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Section I:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Check in with Work Order Manager</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>On time Arrivals:</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Please do your best to be on time, if there are reasons that you will not be please contact Work Order Manager so we can communicate with our customer.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Deliverables:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Complete work order deliverables&nbsp;within&nbsp;24 hours&nbsp;of appointment.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Work Order Confirmation:&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Confirm work orders quickly so we can advise our customer of an ETA for you to arrive.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Section II: Penalties Policies</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><u>Assigned Tech Policy -&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The technician performing the work must be the one listed on the Field Nation workorder&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If another tech&nbsp;needs to perform the work, the service company must perform a \"Tech Swap\" within the Field nation portal.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Tardiness:</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Contact Work Order Manager&nbsp;at least&nbsp;half an hour before&nbsp;scheduled appointment time if you are running late to avoid a&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>15%&nbsp;penalty</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>*Being Unprofessional: examples include but are not limited to speaking negatively about the solution the end user has</p>\n<p>​chosen, pay for the dispatch, arriving to an appointment unprepared for the job or missing tools.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>* Checking In and Out:&nbsp;</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Failure&nbsp;to get Open or Close code are&nbsp;Minor penalty.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Failure to get both&nbsp;Open and Close code is a&nbsp;Major penalty</p>\n<p>* Major Violations&nbsp;50%&nbsp;of the total value of the work order</p>\n<p>* Minor Policy&nbsp;Violations are&nbsp;25%&nbsp;of the total value of the work order</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Other Policy Items:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Travel:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Travel/Tolls</p>\n<p>associated charges must be included in a&nbsp;counter offer&nbsp;when bidding on a work order</p>\n<p>Any&nbsp;travel&nbsp;related expenses will&nbsp;not be approved unless included on accepted counter offer</p>","markdown":"**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\nsurvey for extending dmarc\n\n**General Dispatch Requirements:**\n\n\\*\\*After reviewing the scope, if it will take more than\n\n2 hours then call to discuss\n\n\\*\\*Technician is not authorized to perform any structural\n\nchanges without permission from IT & Cable Pros\n\nContact IT & Cable Pros for any questions or concerns pertaining to this work order\n\n\\*\\* Do not contact our customer, call work order manger first.\n\n**Introducing yourself to the Customer:**\n\n\\- Pricing on Site Surveys is always confidential between you (the Provider) and IT & Cable Pros (the Buyer).\n\n\\- Identify yourself as representing IT & Cable Pros\n\n\\- Review Scope with customer\n\n\\- Customer Leaves/Asks you to lock up for them: Call us immediately if this occurs as there are liability concerns.\n\n**Customer Policies & Procedures**\n\nSection I:\n\n\\- Check in with Work Order Manager\n\n**On time Arrivals:**\n\nPlease do your best to be on time, if there are reasons that you will not be please contact Work Order Manager so we can communicate with our customer.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\nComplete work order deliverables within 24 hours of appointment.\n\n**Work Order Confirmation:**\n\nConfirm work orders quickly so we can advise our customer of an ETA for you to arrive.\n\nSection II: Penalties Policies\n\n **Assigned Tech Policy -**\n\nThe technician performing the work must be the one listed on the Field Nation workorder\n\nIf another tech needs to perform the work, the service company must perform a \"Tech Swap\" within the Field nation portal.\n\n**Tardiness:**\n\nContact Work Order Manager at least half an hour before scheduled appointment time if you are running late to avoid a\n\n15% penalty\n\n\\*Being Unprofessional: examples include but are not limited to speaking negatively about the solution the end user has\n\n​chosen, pay for the dispatch, arriving to an appointment unprepared for the job or missing tools.\n\n**\\* Checking In and Out:**\n\nFailure to get Open or Close code are Minor penalty.\n\nFailure to get both Open and Close code is a Major penalty\n\n\\* Major Violations 50% of the total value of the work order\n\n\\* Minor Policy Violations are 25% of the total value of the work order\n\n**Other Policy Items:**\n\nTravel:\n\nTravel/Tolls\n\nassociated charges must be included in a counter offer when bidding on a work order\n\nAny travel related expenses will not be approved unless included on accepted counter offer","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T08:00","end":"2026-10-05T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":130,"max":195},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":130},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":65}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $195 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey a