{"job":{"id":"1203451282","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Computacenter United States Inc.","title":"Deployment Tech - Hot Swap APC2200 UPS Bbatteries and NMC - Winston-Salem, NC - Ticket #INC0975844","description":"<p><strong><em>2&nbsp;Hour Minimum Provided</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>!!!The person assigned to the ticket must be the person going to site. No exceptions!!! DO NOT BRING ANYONE ELSE TO SITE</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em><u>Scope:</u></em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Hot Swap APC2200 UPS batteries and NMC; reset UPS battery timer; re-box expired UPS batteries in original battery box and affix FedEx Return shipping label; move box to branch designated FedEx pickup area.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT: HOTSWAP IS DEFINED AS NOT TURNING OFF UPS UNIT OR UNPLUGGING ANY NETWORK DEVICES FROM THE BACK OF THE UPS FOR BOTH THE BATTERIES AND NMC SWAPOUT</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Please call IT Contact/Remote Support IMMEDIATELY upon arrival so we determine if NMC can be hot swapped prior to branch closure as it will need to be remotely programmed which takes about 15 minutes.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>* Take 3 photos of the work you performed*</p><p>Call the First Horizon IT Support contact before you start any work.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Carry a photo ID/driver license while on-site.</p><p><br></p><p>Expect a 24-hour, and 1-hour pre-call.</p><p><br></p><p>You will present yourself as a representative of Computacenter</p><p><br></p><p>Upon Arrival Contact your Computacenter Coordinator.</p><p>Failure to do so will result in the tech being released and not paid.</p><p><br></p><p>Before leaving ( NOT AFTER ) Contact First Horizon IT Support to be released from site then call the Computacenter Coordinator to check out.</p><p>Failure to do so will result in the tech being released and not paid.</p><p><br></p><p>GENERAL REQUIREMENTS: Working/Charged/Updated Drivers on Laptop, Console Cable, Standard tool box.</p><p><br></p><p>You should not discuss your rate of pay with the customer or show them any documents that contain the pay rate.</p><p><br></p><p>Arrive with tools and supplies needed to complete the work. Do not ask a customer for tools or assistance. No helpers of any kind are allowed without prior consent.</p><p><br></p><p>The deliverables must be uploaded to the WM assignment before checking out from the site and a phone call to check out with Computacenter Contact must be made before leaving the site, so that deliverables can be confirmed.</p><p><br></p><p>Contact your Computacenter contact asap if you cannot gain access to the site or contact the site contact.</p><p><br></p><p>Please contact your Computacenter contact asap if something happens and you cannot be onsite at the agreed upon day/time.</p><p><br></p><p>NO EXPENSES WILL BE REIMBURSED UNLESS AGREED TO BEFOREHAND BY THE ASSIGNMENT OWNER</p><p>Any receipts for materials must also be uploaded.</p><p><br></p><p>Failure to adhere to the above policies may result in effecting your compensation.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T16:30","end":"2026-10-06T19:30"},"payRange":{"min":59.23527263,"max":177.70581789},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":59.23527263,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":91.9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $177.70581789 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15: