{"job":{"id":20068520,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Teceze","title":"Device Inventory & Switch Console Support","description":{"html":"Scope of Work<ul><li>Visit the customer site at the scheduled date and time.</li><li>Check in with the local contact upon arrival.</li><li>Perform an inventory of <strong>80+ devices</strong> at the location.</li><li>Record the required device information, including asset/hostname, serial number, device type, and other details requested by the customer.</li><li>Connect to the network switch and provide the <strong>switch console</strong> as required.</li><li>Verify that the collected inventory information is complete and accurate.</li><li>Provide the completed inventory details after the activity.</li><li>Report any missing devices, discrepancies, or issues encountered during the visit.</li><li>Complete check-in/check-out and provide activity notes before closing the work order.</li></ul>Technician Requirements<ul><li><strong>Laptop is required.</strong></li><li>Technician should have basic networking knowledge.</li><li>Experience with switch console access is required.</li><li>Bring appropriate console cable/adapters needed to connect to the switch.</li><li>No network configuration changes should be made without customer authorization.</li></ul>","markdown":"Scope of Work\n\n- Visit the customer site at the scheduled date and time.\n- Check in with the local contact upon arrival.\n- Perform an inventory of **80+ devices** at the location.\n- Record the required device information, including asset/hostname, serial number, device type, and other details requested by the customer.\n- Connect to the network switch and provide the **switch console** as required.\n- Verify that the collected inventory information is complete and accurate.\n- Provide the completed inventory details after the activity.\n- Report any missing devices, discrepancies, or issues encountered during the visit.\n- Complete check-in/check-out and provide activity notes before closing the work order.\n\nTechnician Requirements- **Laptop is required.**\n- Technician should have basic networking knowledge.\n- Experience with switch console access is required.\n- Bring appropriate console cable/adapters needed to connect to the switch.\n- No network configuration changes should be made without customer authorization.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T09:30","end":"2026-10-06T17:30"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $200 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T1