{"job":{"id":"5971152658","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Shelf Level Retail Solutions LLC","title":"8398 - GREENHOUSE CRISPY LETTUCE - Speed Audi","description":"<p>Job #: 8398 Client: Taylor Farms Retailer: Walmart Audit Type: Item Check-up/ OSA Project: Earthbound Farm Greenhouse Lettuce Audit Launch Date: 09/18/2026 AUDIT INSTRUCTIONS During each assigned store visit, complete the following steps: Customer is looking for a visual freshness check. They want to be certain certain there is no premature decay or wilting lettuce. 1. Go to the specified store location and check in according to store policy. 2. Locate the identified SKU in the assigned department or aisle. 3. Take a clear photos of the front and back of any product experiencing quality issues. 4. If a SKU is not present, take a clear photo of the empty shelf space where the product should be located. 5. Make sure the shelf price tag is visible and readable in the photo whenever possible. 6. Take one wider photo showing the surrounding shelf section and product placement. SPECIAL AUDIT INSTRUCTIONS Take product photos front and back of all product showing premature decay or wilting. SKU DETAILS SKU 1: Earthbound Farm | GREENHOUSE CRISPY LETTUCE | Item # 681911422 COMPENSATION Refer to your WorkMarket fee.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-30T18:00","end":"2026-09-30T22:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":16},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":0},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/30/2026, 6:00:00 PM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T15:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T18:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-30T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T15:00:0