{"job":{"id":20075764,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Brandpoint Services","title":"Service Call for Menu Screens at Fast Food Restaurant","description":{"html":"<p>WORK DESCRIPTION: Please complete the check‑in survey once you arrive at the store. If you don’t have it, please contact your SME or Coates</p><p><br></p><p>Please go to site with crimping tools and cable tester, re-commission and troubleshoot the media player 38</p><p><br></p><p>Bring commissioning tools to re-commission (External Monitor, USB Keyboard, USB Drive on FAT32 format / please refer to the commissioning guide attached to this E-Mail) check the power, source and ethernet connections, verify the cables are not physically damaged and re-crimp them or re-end the cables if it´s necessary, check the IP settings and the Device ID for the screens, make sure to have the devices back online and displaying content properly.</p><p><br></p><p>Once you finish your job, please take a moment to complete the checkout survey. This is mandatory in order to provide the release code.</p><p><br></p><p>Important: Please keep in mind additional troubleshooting maybe required.</p><p><br></p><p>Expected time on site (Additional troubleshooting steps and additional on site may be required): 2-4 hours</p><p><br></p><p>LOCATION: Indoor front counter</p><p><br></p><p><strong>**A 32gb or smaller USB drive is required, must download and unzip the provided installation files needed to set up the new media player.**</strong></p><p><strong>Link to file download: </strong><strong>https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12TnBK3Tqk9yu-F0V_7UcK_xcbCGmzfaD</strong></p><p><br></p><p>When heading to site, TEXT BRANDPOINT SUPPORT AT&nbsp;-&nbsp;(856) 382-2645. They will be your support and troubleshoot with you through the duration of the call.&nbsp;</p><p>Must check in and out with support to confirm total time onsite and obtain checkout code from support to process work order.&nbsp;</p><p>**BEFORE GOING TO SITE Must download file