{"job":{"id":20045682,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Masters Telecom","title":"Installation:  Network Equipment (Router, Switch, Access Point)","description":{"html":"<p>** Some sites may have a Meraki instead of a Pepwave. If that's the case, get the SIM card out of the Meraki. **</p><p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in network equipment installation</li><li>Tech is required to replace end of life router, switch and access point(s) with new Fortinet equipment.</li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;Tech professional - collared shirt with no corporate logos, close toed shoes, long pants.</li></ul><p><strong>Tools Required:&nbsp;</strong><em>must haves</em>&nbsp;</p><ol><li>Valid photo ID&nbsp;</li><li>Fully-charged smartphone and/or Laptop</li><li>Box Cutter</li><li>Ethernet Cords: Can either be pre-made or you can bring the appropriate tools and supplies to make your own.&nbsp;We suggest a hand full of short cables, and at least 1 10-foot cable.&nbsp;</li><li>Velcro / Zip Ties: This is needed for cable management</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ol><li>Confirm start time</li><li>Confirm work order</li><li>Review links and docs</li></ol><p><del>******* *****</del></p><ol><li><del>******** ** **** *****</del></li><li><del>******* *******</del></li><li><del>******* *** ******** ***** ********* ****** ****** ****** ******* **********</del></li><li><del>**** **** *** ****** ********* *********** ******* ******* ********* ** ******** </del></li><li><del>**** *** ******* *** **** **** **** ** ***** *** ********</del></li><li><del>*** ** *** ******** ********* ********* ******* ****** *** **** ** **** **** * ******** ***** **** ** *********</del></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Pictures of all working equipment.</li><li>Check-out of work order.</li></ol><p><strong>Escalation Process:</strong></p><p>Contact WO Manager if the following are true:</p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with<del> **** ******** ************</del></li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to <del>**** ******** ************</del></li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Additional payment requests must be made prior to being assigned the work order.</li><li>The pay is a flat rate. No additional hours are available.</li><li>Parking expenses will be paid only if a receipt is submitted in the Field Nation App.</li></ul>","markdown":"\\*\\* Some sites may have a Meraki instead of a Pepwave. If that's the case, get the SIM card out of the Meraki. \\*\\*\n\n**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in network equipment installation\n- Tech is required to replace end of life router, switch and access point(s) with new Fortinet equipment.\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Tech professional - collared shirt with no corporate logos, close toed shoes, long pants.\n\n**Tools Required:** *must haves*\n\n1. Valid photo ID\n2. Fully-charged smartphone and/or Laptop\n3. Box Cutter\n4. Ethernet Cords: Can either be pre-made or you can bring the appropriate tools and supplies to make your own. We suggest a hand full of short cables, and at least 1 10-foot cable.\n5. Velcro / Zip Ties: This is needed for cable management\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Confirm start time\n2. Confirm work order\n3. Review links and docs\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n1. \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n2. \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n3. \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n4. \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*