- Please enter your close out notes prior to checking out of the work order.**\n\n  \n  \n**Tool Requirement:**  \n  \n• Basic tools including cabling tools  \n• Fiber meter (measuring 1310 and 1550 wavelengths) compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber light source compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber visual fault finder (red laser) compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber scope compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber test jumper cables (lc-sc, sc-sc, lc-lc) to perform port loop backs and interface optical tools to the customers fiber/equipment/patch panels  \n• Dry and wet fiber cleaning supplies  \n• P-touch label printing machine and labels capable of printing 3 row labels  \n• Cisco Console Cable  \n• USB-Serial Adapter  \n• Laptop with charger  \n• Smart phone (photo capable) with charger and international dialing\n\n  \n  \n- Note: Client will provide any cabling that is to remain in the network\n\n  \n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n  \n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts as representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-13T08:00","end":"2026-10-13T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":360},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $360 (countered: $360) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Pr