op with charger</span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: Aptos,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span><span style=\"color: #181818;\">• Smart phone (photo capable) with charger and international dialing</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><br/><br/><br/><br/><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span><span style=\"color: #181818;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: Aptos,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span>Note: Client will provide any cabling that is to remain in the network</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li></ul><br/><br/><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><br/><br/><br/><ul><li>Government-issued photo ID required </li><li>Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance </li><li>Check-in with site contacts as representing <del>********</del></li><li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment </li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li></ul>","markdown":"**INC#:** 00736663 - ATT\n\n  \n**JHA Survey Link:** https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdyhkQ7ZAJoTyHijGQw9bQzXOB10pwInMwDVhxIqW4IPR9r9g/viewform?usp=pp_url&amp;entry.294247664=PIVITAL%2CINC&amp;entry.1982354729=UNITED+STATES&amp;entry.1165025588=Raleigh&amp;entry.1821361314=00736663&amp;entry.860366398=00736663+-+ATT+DC+Decom&amp;entry.865848292=ericsson.jha%40pivital.com\n\n  \n*﻿Review the Confidential Information/Special Note section listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch.*\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n**Important - Please enter your close out notes prior to checking out of the work order.**\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n**Tool Requirement:**  \n  \n• Basic tools including cabling tools  \n• Fiber meter (measuring 1310 and 1550 wavelengths) compatible