n><span style=\"color: #181818;\">• Smart phone (photo capable) with charger and international dialing</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span><span style=\"color: #181818;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: Aptos,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span>Note: Client will provide any cabling that is to remain in the network</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li></ul><br/><br/><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><ul><li>Government-issued photo ID required </li><li>Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance </li><li>Check-in with site contacts as representing <del>********</del></li><li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment </li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li></ul>","markdown":"**INC#:** 00736667 - ATT\n\n  \n**JHA Survey Link:** https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdyhkQ7ZAJoTyHijGQw9bQzXOB10pwInMwDVhxIqW4IPR9r9g/viewform?usp=pp_url&amp;entry.294247664=PIVITAL%2CINC&amp;entry.1982354729=UNITED+STATES&amp;entry.1165025588=Raleigh&amp;entry.1821361314=00736667&amp;entry.860366398=00736667+-+ATT+DC+Decom&amp;entry.865848292=ericsson.jha%40pivital.com\n\n  \n**Important - Please enter your close out notes prior to checking out of the work order.**\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n**Tool Requirement:**  \n  \n• Basic tools including cabling tools  \n• Fiber meter (measuring 1310 and 1550 wavelengths) compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber light source compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber visual fault finder (red laser) compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber scope compatible with lc & sc connectors  \n• Fiber test jumper cables (lc-sc, sc-sc, lc-lc) to perform port loop backs and interface optical tools to the customers fiber/equipment/patch panels  \n• Dry and wet fiber cleaning supplies  \n• P-touch label printing machine and labels capable of printing 3 row labels  \n• Cisco Console Cable  \n• USB-Serial Adapter  \n• Laptop with charger  \n• Smart phone (photo capable) with charger and international dialing\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n- Note: Client will provide any cabling that is to remain in the network\n\n  \n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts as representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T08:00","end":"2026-10-16T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":360},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $360 (countered: $360) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-