{"job":{"id":20077862,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Simple Communications Technologies","title":"Digi IX30 Router Install - Robert Half","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Onsite Contact:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Robyn Blake&nbsp;(919) 489-9109</p>\n<p><strong>Remote Support for Installation:</strong> Nate Shore - 704-774-9127</p>\n<p><strong>Robert Half Engineer for configuration</strong>: Sachiko - 925.913.2965</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Technician will need to do the following while onsite:&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Work with onsite contact to locate the MDF</li>\n<li>Power down and unplug old device (if there is one)</li>\n<li>Plug up new device (Digi IX30)&nbsp;</li>\n<li>One solid white light appears call technical help for testing</li>\n<li>With direction from engineer connect console cable needs to be connected to WTI Console Server</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Engineer will be able to confirm which port on the server the router needs to be connected to</li>\n<li>Confirm unit is online and working with existing equipment</li>\n<li>PLEASE MAKE SURE TO TAKE PLENTY OF PHOTOS AS THEY WILL BE SHARED WITH THE CUSTOMER</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Onsite Contact:** Robyn Blake (919) 489-9109\n\n**Remote Support for Installation:** Nate Shore - 704-774-9127\n\n**Robert Half Engineer for configuration**: Sachiko - 925.913.2965\n\nTechnician will need to do the following while onsite:\n\n- Work with onsite contact to locate the MDF\n- Power down and unplug old device (if there is one)\n- Plug up new device (Digi IX30)\n- One solid white light appears call technical help for testing\n- With direction from engineer connect console cable needs to be connected to WTI Console Server\n- Engineer will be able to confirm which port on the server the router needs to be connected to\n- Confirm unit is online and working with existing equipment\n- PLEASE MAKE SURE TO TAKE PLENTY OF PHOTOS AS THEY WILL BE SHARED WITH THE CUSTOMER","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T10:30","end":"2026-10-14T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":13},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $200 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Network Cable Technician – Low Voltage Tech 1 (AKIRA Crabtree Valley)"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1790890566530}
{"job":{"id":20077822,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Strategic Systems, Inc.","title":"Laptop/desktop deployment |Burlington NC\t27215| 10/05 at 8:45 AM","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Date &amp; Time</strong> <strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp;10/05 at 8:45 AM</strong></p><p><strong>Location : 708 South Church St\tBurlington\tNC 27215</strong></p><p><strong>Scope of Work :</strong> Replacement of a desktop/laptop. New equipment will be available at the bank. Instructions will be sent to your email once confirmed and invite will be sent from the client with the user information. User would explain on what needs to be done either desktop/laptop. Once the deployment is completed need to take signature of the user on the sign off sheet. If a deployment is a replacement technicians should be prepping the device for return (boxed, with a return label adhered) and documenting the return number in the signoff sheet. If a return label is needed and not included, they are to reach out to Erin and note it in the signoff sheet.</p><p><strong>Note :</strong>Technicians should reach out to Erin advise if they are waiting for over a half hour for Service Desk assistance and if the deployment is extending more than 2 hours . In addition, any and all issues during a deployment should be documented on signoff sheet.</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong> Standard technician tool kit Philips (or Flat) head screwdriver / Electric screwdriver with Phillips head (or Flat head).</p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong> Business casual, closed-toe shoes, no jeans, collared shirts</p>","markdown":"**Date & Time** **: 10/05 at 8:45 AM**\n\n**Location : 708 South Church St Burlington NC 27215**\n\n**Scope of Work :** Replacement of a desktop/laptop. New equipment will be available at the bank. Instructions will be sent to your email once confirmed and invite will be sent from the client with the user information. User would explain on what needs to be done either desktop/laptop. Once the deployment is completed need to take signature of the user on the sign off sheet. If a deployment is a replacement technicians should be prepping the device for return (boxed, with a return label adhered) and documenting the return number in the signoff sheet. If a return label is needed and not included, they are to reach out to Erin and note it in the signoff sheet.\n\n**Note :**Technicians should reach out to Erin advise if they are waiting for over a half hour for Service Desk assistance and if the deployment is extending more than 2 hours . In addition, any and all issues during a deployment should be documented on signoff sheet.\n\n**Tools Required:** Standard technician tool kit Philips (or Flat) head screwdriver / Electric screwdriver with Phillips head (or Flat head).\n\n**Dress Code:** Business casual, closed-toe shoes, no jeans, collared shirts","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T08:45","end":"2026-10-05T11:45"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":90},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":30,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":41},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $90 (countered: $180) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-