{"job":{"id":"5378994420","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Retail Tech Inc. - Deployment","title":"HARD START - LIFT OPS - Replace Digital Display - Tech 2 of 2","description":"<p>\"***YOU MUST HAVE A RELEASE CODE FROM THE BBY DOC AND YOU MUST CHECK OUT WITH RTI - VIA PHONE - UPON COMPLETION***</p><p><br></p><p>Two (2) technicians will be dispatched on separate work orders to replace a defective digital display. Connect the media player to the new display and confirm it is operational. Reconfiguration of the media player may also be needed. This work will require a lift.</p><p><br></p><p>REQUIRED TOOLS</p><p>- DIGITAL cable tester (Must say \"PASS / FAIL\" on Screen)</p><p>- Label maker with label tape</p><p>- Cordless drill w/ charged battery</p><p>- Standard tools and materials: https://RTI.surl.ms/StandardTools</p><p><br></p><p>DRESS CODE</p><p>- Polo shirt</p><p>- Jeans or khaki pants (no shorts)</p><p><br></p><p>DISPATCH GUIDELINES</p><p>- Only confirmed technicians are authorized to be onsite for an activity/dispatch.</p><p>- Any scheduling or tech assignment requests/changes must receive prior approval.</p><p>- Furthermore, additional technicians and/or supervisors are not authorized to accompany assigned tech(s) onsite at any time without prior approval.</p><p><br></p><p>**MUST SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION SECTION / SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS FOR WORK INSTRUCTIONS**</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T09:30","end":"2026-10-06T13:30"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":250},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":41.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $250 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T