{"job":{"id":20082207,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Teceze","title":"Device Inventory & Switch Console Support- HEUC","description":{"html":"<strong>Scope of Work</strong><p>The technician is required to perform the following tasks:</p><ul><li>Check in with the local contact upon arrival.</li><li>Perform a physical inventory of <strong>80+ devices</strong> located onsite.</li><li>Record device details, including:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Device type</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Make and model</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Serial number</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Asset tag/hostname (if available)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Location/rack position (if applicable)</li><li>Connect to the network switch using a console cable and provide/share <strong>switch console access</strong> with the remote team.</li><li>Coordinate with the remote support team during console access activities.</li><li>Report any missing devices, discrepancies, or issues identified during the inventory process.</li><li>Take photos of devices/racks if requested by the customer.</li><li>Submit completion notes and inventory details after the activity.</li></ul><strong>Technician Requirements</strong><ul><li>Laptop is mandatory.</li><li>Technician must have basic networking knowledge.</li><li>Experience using switch console connections (USB/Serial/RJ45 console access).</li><li>Must carry appropriate console cables and adapters.</li><li>Ability to accurately capture inventory information.</li></ul><strong>Tools Required</strong><ul><li>Laptop</li><li>Console cable (RJ45-to-USB / Serial adapter as applicable)</li><li>Mobile phone for coordination</li><li>Basic hand tools (if required)</li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work**The technician is required to perform the following tasks:\n\n- Check in with the local contact upon arrival.\n- Perform a physical inventory of **80+ devices** located onsite.\n- Record device details, including:\n- Device type\n- Make and model\n- Serial number\n- Asset tag/hostname (if available)\n- Location/rack position (if applicable)\n- Connect to the network switch using a console cable and provide/share **switch console access** with the remote team.\n- Coordinate with the remote support team during console access activities.\n- Report any missing devices, discrepancies, or issues identified during the inventory process.\n- Take photos of devices/racks if requested by the customer.\n- Submit completion notes and inventory details after the activity.\n\n**Technician Requirements**- Laptop is mandatory.\n- Technician must have basic networking knowledge.\n- Experience using switch console connections (USB/Serial/RJ45 console access).\n- Must carry appropriate console cables and adapters.\n- Ability to accurately capture inventory information.\n\n**Tools Required**- Laptop\n- Console cable (RJ45-to-USB / Serial adapter as applicable)\n- Mobile phone for coordination\n- Basic hand tools (if required)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T21:30","end":"2026-10-06T25:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":120},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":5.242942566125635},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summar