{"job":{"id":20082030,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TailWind Voice & Data, Inc.","title":"New Store Acquisition ","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">**Be prepared for downtime on site- Technician is expected to remain on site until they are released by TCON Arvin or TCON Lance**&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Tech to have Site Acquisition Scope of Work pdf document when arriving onsite.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Tech to have Site Acquisition SOW if Level 10 tech onsite pdf document when arriving onsite.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Working with Public Storage IT, complete the following:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Tag/Label all analog lines at 66 block.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Identify and label the main/direct line at the front office.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Assist Level 10 technician to confirm functionality of existing data runs, confirming existing data ports have all been terminated and are useable.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Assist Level 10 technician to identify and complete cable management as needed.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">&nbsp;</span></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*Be prepared for downtime on site- Technician is expected to remain on site until they are released by TCON Arvin or TCON Lance\\*\\*\n\nTech to have Site Acquisition Scope of Work pdf document when arriving onsite.\n\nTech to have Site Acquisition SOW if Level 10 tech onsite pdf document when arriving onsite.\n\nWorking with Public Storage IT, complete the following:\n\nTag/Label all analog lines at 66 block.\n\nIdentify and label the main/direct line at the front office.\n\nAssist Level 10 technician to confir