{"job":{"id":20083481,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Darkhorse Tech, Inc.","title":"Replace Denon AVR Receiver & Reconnect 7 Ceiling Speakers","description":{"html":"<p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES:</strong></p><ul><li>Provider MUST call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number 1808582<em> </em>to work with a Darkhorse Tech engineer to complete this work order.</li><li>Take pictures of any areas you work on and upload them to the work order with proper labeling</li><li>If you must cancel the WO for any reason, please provide 24-hour notice if possible and call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number above</li></ul><p><strong>Scope of Work: </strong>Replace a failing Denon AVR-E300 receiver behind the front desk with a new Denon AVR-X1800H. Move the existing speaker, network, and HDMI connections to the new unit and confirm all 7 ceiling speakers play internet radio.</p><p><strong>Tasks:</strong></p><ol><li>Check in on arrival and call the Darkhorse engineer at the number above.</li><li>Photograph the existing receiver wiring (all connections) before disconnecting anything. Label the speaker wires.</li><li>Remove the Denon AVR-E300.</li><li>Install the Denon AVR-X1800H in the same location.</li><li>Reconnect the 4-channel bare-wire ceiling speaker connections, the Ethernet cable, and the HDMI cable to the monitor.</li><li>Power on and, with the engineer's remote help, get the receiver on the network and playing internet radio.</li><li>Test audio on <strong>all 7 ceiling speakers</strong> and confirm with the engineer.</li></ol><p><strong>Equipment Required:</strong> Denon AVR-X1800H replacement unit, standard hand tools, wire strippers, Ethernet patch cable, and HDMI cable.</p>","markdown":"**IMPORTANT NOTES:**\n\n- Provider MUST call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number 1808582 to work with a Darkhorse Tech engineer to complete this work order.\n- Take pictures of any areas you work on and upload them to the work order with proper labeling\n- If you must cancel the WO for any reason, please provide 24-hour notice if possible and call (800) 868-4504 and reference ticket number above\n\n**Scope of Work:** Replace a failing Denon AVR-E300 receiver behind the front desk with a new Denon AVR-X1800H. Move the existing speaker, network, and HDMI connections to the new unit and confirm all 7 ceiling speakers play internet radio.\n\n**Tasks:**\n\n1. Check in on arrival and call the Darkhorse engineer at the number above.\n2. Photograph the existing receiver wiring (all connections) before disconnecting anything. Label the speaker wires.\n3. Remove the Denon AVR-E300.\n4. Install the Denon AVR-X1800H in the same location.\n5. Reconnect the 4-channel bare-wire ceiling speaker connections, the Ethernet cable, and the HDMI cable to the monitor.\n6. Power on and, with the engineer's remote help, get the receiver on the network and playing internet radio.\n7. Test audio on **all 7 ceiling speakers** and confirm with the engineer.\n\n**Equipment Required:** Denon AVR-X1800H replacement unit, standard hand tools, wire strippers, Ethernet patch cable, and HDMI cable.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T09:00","end":"2026-10-22T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":12.892032149437588},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"s