{"job":{"id":20083283,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Brandpoint Services","title":"Install 4 displays at fast food restaurant (2 techs required)","description":{"html":"<p>Scope: Install 4 screens and 1 media players to act as menus for the location. Screens must be installed in-line and completely flush together, centered on the wall from left to right. Screens should sit no higher than 2 inches from the bottom of the wall.</p><p><br></p><p>Pay rate covers up to 6 hours of onsite time, but overtime can be approved if needed and communicated. **IF DELAYS ARE NOT REPORTED AND APPROVED, THEY WILL NOT BE COMPENSATED. Examples include: outlets not in right place, missing parts, unsure about mount or device placement, etc</p><p><br></p><p>Procedure (<u>Must be Followed</u>):</p><ul><li>Check in process with BRANDPOINT support</li><li>Complete Site Readiness Checklist</li><li>Install Equipment (Following Installation checklist)</li></ul><ol><li><em>Refer to Install Guide in Dispatch</em></li><li><em>Followed with support in Real Time</em></li></ol><ul><li>Alignment/Troubleshooting</li></ul><ol><li><em>Very detailed process (Could take hours if underestimated)</em></li><li><em>Verify with support when ready for this step</em></li></ol><ul><li>Check out process with BRANDPOINT support</li></ul><p><br></p><p>*MUST follow ALL procedure and read ALL documentation for approved payment*</p><p><br></p><p><u>REQUIRED TOOLS</u></p><ul><li>USB keyboard</li><li>USB mouse</li><li>screwdrivers</li><li>allen wrenches</li><li>power drill</li><li>1\" drywall screws (20 ct.)</li><li>1/4\" toggle bolts (20 ct.)</li><li>measuring tape</li><li>3' Extension Cable</li><li>4ft level</li><li>6ft ladder</li><li>velcro tape for cable management,&nbsp;NOT&nbsp;zip ties</li><li>must have site specific cutsheet</li><li>must must must have access to the Install Design Guide PDF file (IDG)</li><li>Hacksaw or sawzaw</li></ul>","markdown":"Scope: Install 4 screens and 1 media players to act as menus for the location. Screens must be installed in-line and completely flush together, centered on the wall from left to right. Screens should sit no higher than 2 inches from the bottom of the wall.\n\nPay rate covers up to 6 hours of onsite time, but overtime can be approved if needed and communicated. \\*\\*IF DELAYS ARE NOT REPORTED AND APPROVED, THEY WILL NOT BE COMPENSATED. Examples include: outlets not in right place, missing parts, unsure about mount or device placement, etc\n\nProcedure (Must be Followed):\n\n- Check in process with BRANDPOINT support\n- Complete Site Readiness Checklist\n- Install Equipment (Following Installation checklist)\n\n1. *Refer to Install Guide in Dispatch*\n2. *Followed with support in Real Time*\n\n- Alignment/Troubleshooting\n\n1. *Very detailed process (Could take hours if underestimated)*\n2. *Verify with support when ready for this step*\n\n- Check out process with BRANDPOINT support\n\n\\*MUST follow ALL procedure and read ALL documentation for approved payment\\*\n\nREQUIRED TOOLS\n\n- USB keyboard\n- USB mouse\n- screwdrivers\n- allen wrenches\n- power drill\n- 1\" drywall screws (20 ct.)\n- 1/4\" toggle bolts (20 ct.)\n- measuring tape\n- 3' Extension Cable\n- 4ft level\n- 6ft ladder\n- velcro tape for cable management, NOT zip ties\n- must have site specific cutsheet\n- must must must have access to the Install Design Guide PDF file (IDG)\n- Hacksaw or sawzaw","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T08:00","end":"2026-10-06T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":700,"max":700},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":58.7498410846194},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"fixed","counterRate":117,"baseAmount":700,"estHours":6,"travelExpense":90,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-