{"job":{"id":20083639,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Voxiant Technology Partners","title":"Foxwood","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">&nbsp;Please send a tech to evaluate the gear in use and wire up the 6 to 10 devices to the Meraki if the office switch was salvageable.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">This fire happened weeks ago.&nbsp; So, WiFi has been in use.&nbsp; The only problem with WiFi is that it blocks them from printing.&nbsp; I don't think we can afford a survey.&nbsp; This is a double-side trailer building and should be simple to wire up and evaluate.&nbsp; Tech needs to bring supplies or be able to leave the site and return with network supplies same day.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">I need a full report on the health of these broken systems for insurance purposes and replacement cost estimates</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Are these computers that are not connected healthy at all?&nbsp;The front reception PC is not online.&nbsp; Cable runs may be needed.&nbsp; These PCs don't have wireless adapters.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">This is a double-side trailer that our current regional manager team was already using with no issue for three people.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p>A fourth wire connection was needed.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>UPON ARRIVAL PLEASE CONTACT THE HELPDESK / Howard Wilson @ 214-561-1277. </strong></p><p><strong>If they don't answer, please leave a message with your contact information.</strong></p><p><strong>If you are having issues contact the helpdesk, please call me directly @ 972-697-7024</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>","markdown":"Please send a tech to evaluate the gear in use and wire up the 6 to 10 devices to the Meraki if the office switch was salvageable.\n\nThis fire happened weeks ago. So, WiFi has been in use. The only problem with WiFi is that it blocks them from printing. I don't think we can afford a survey. This is a double-side trailer building and should be simple to wire up and evaluate. Tech needs to bring supplies or be able to leave the site and return with network supplies same day.\n\nI need a full report on the health of these broken systems for insurance purposes and replacement cost estimates\n\nAre these computers that are not connected healthy at all? The front reception PC is not online. Cable runs may be needed. These PCs don't have wireless adapters.\n\nThis is a double-side trailer that our current regional manager team was already using with no issue for three people.\n\nA fourth wire connection was needed.\n\n**UPON ARRIVAL PLEASE CONTACT THE HELPDESK / Howard Wilson @ 214-561-1277.**\n\n**If they don't answer, please leave a message with your contact information.**\n\n**If you are having issues contact the helpdesk, please call me directly @ 972-697-7024**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T09:00","end":"2026-10-05T15:00","latestStart":"2026-10-05T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":330},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":10.347819181295838},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":60,"baseAmount":360,"estHours":6,"travelExpense":25,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T20:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":420,"mode":"hours"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","e