{"job":{"id":20085453,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Prime Data Communications","title":"Install  New Data Cables \"Pricing in service Description\"","description":{"html":"<p><strong><em><u>****** YOU MUST CALL TO CHECK IN WITH PROJECT MANAGER WHEN YOU ARRIVE ONSITE AND CALL PROJECT MANAGER BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE ******</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Project Manager:</u></em></strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;Dane Konkel 407-314-8465</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Project Pay:&nbsp;FIXED RATE /SOW</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>$250.00 each for 1 cat6 cable, labor and materials (250 for the 1st cable, $100 for each additional cable to the same faceplate or surface mount box)</strong></li><li><strong>Install </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Need 1 cat6 </strong>&nbsp;<strong>ethernet drop ran to each of the server and kitchen printers from the nearest telecom closets</strong></li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">﻿In addition, need the ethernet drop in the Chef’s office re-terminated</strong></li><li><strong>See example pictures attached</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Includes installation, labeling, connecting to the switch and verify connection</strong></p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><ul><li>Run new cat6 data drops for device locations and label new network jacks.</li><li>Upload pictures of phone or device online.</li><li>Upload pictures of wall jacks installed with labels.</li><li>Upload a picture MDF cabinet.</li></ul><p><strong>**** “Do not use any biscuit jack in MDF or IDF ****</strong></p><p><strong>**** Any changes to the above SOW must be approved by the project manager first, Not the on site contact or store manager.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>On site P.O.C GM</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>IT support Chris Harris 727-287-9997</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Potential Penalties</p><p>Late Penalty (10.00%)</p><p>Failure to Contact PM for Checkout (25.00%)</p><p>Failure to Complete Work Order (75.00%)</p><p><br></p><p><strong><em><u>Project Manager:</u></em></strong><em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</em>Dane Konkel 407-314-8465</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>**Tech should have at a minimum</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Cat6 cables, jacks, faceplates or surface mount boxes</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Toner, Cable tester, Punchdown tool,&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Laptop, Console Cable, Hot spot,&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Buttset, Various Screw drivers, Drill, Pliers,&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Adjustable wrench, Channel Locks, Various size patch cables</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>1000 ft Cat5e cable, Crimper, Rj11 and Rj45 ends and patch panel</u></strong></p>","markdown":"***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* YOU MUST CALL TO CHECK IN WITH PROJECT MANAGER WHEN YOU ARRIVE ONSITE AND CALL PROJECT MANAGER BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\****\n\n***Project Manager:*** *Dane Konkel 407-314-8465*\n\n**Project Pay: FIXED RATE /SOW**\n\n- **$250.00 each for 1 cat6 cable, labor and materials (250 for the 1st cable, $100 for each additional cable to the same faceplate or surface mount box)**\n- **Install** **Need 1 cat6**  **ethernet drop ran to each of the server and kitchen printers from the nearest telecom closets**\n- **﻿In addition, need the ethernet drop in the Chef’s office re-terminated**\n- **See example pictures attached**\n\n**Includes installation, labeling, connecting to the switch and verify connection**\n\n\\--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n- Run new cat6 data drops for device locations and label new network jacks.\n- Upload pictures of phone or device online.\n- Upload pictures of wall jacks installed with labels.\n- Upload a picture MDF cabinet.\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\* “Do not use any biscuit jack in MDF or IDF \\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\* Any changes to the above SOW must be approved by the project manager first, Not the on site contact or store manager.**\n\n**On site P.O.C GM**\n\n**IT support Chris Harris 727-287-9997**\n\nPotential Penalties\n\nLate Penalty (10.00%)\n\nFailure to Contact PM for Checkout (25.00%)\n\nFailure to Complete Work Order (75.00%)\n\n***Project Manager:*** Dane Konkel 407-314-8465\n\n**\\*\\*Tech should have at a minimum**\n\n**Cat6 cables, jacks, faceplates or surface mount boxes**\n\n**Toner, Cable tester, Punchdown tool,**\n\n**Laptop, Console Cable, Hot spot,**\n\n**Buttset, Various Screw drivers, Drill, Pliers,**\n\n**Adjustable wrench, Channel Locks, Various size patch cables**\n\n**1000 ft Cat5e cable, Crimper, Rj11 and Rj45 ends and patch panel**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T13:00","end":"2026-10-06T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":250,"max":250},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.274731734285195},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $250 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Ins