{"job":{"id":"5533578855","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05047148 - Rejuvenation - # 05882 - Cary Town Boul- TU","description":"<p>The goal of this dispatch is to locate, extend (if necessary), TU, and test a newly installed GRID circuit. An additional cutover visit will be scheduled for a later date and won't be handled at the time of this dispatch.</p><p><br></p><p>Circuit Details:</p><p>• Circuit Type: Broadband</p><p>• Carrier Order #: WO-01852677</p><p>• Carrier: Spectrum - Time Warner</p><p>• Bandwidth: 500M/500M</p><p>• CID: 8349100301531910</p><p>• IP: DHCP</p><p>• GW: DHCP</p><p>• SN: DHCP</p><p>• DNS 1: 209.18.47.61</p><p>• DNS 2: 209.18.47.62</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>IW Tech will determine whether an extension is needed to the customer’s router and complete it if necessary. </p><p>Once the extension has been ran, the IW Tech will contact Granite’s GRID Activations Team @ 877.855.1146 option 3 and reference Activations Ticket #: 7016449 . Working with the Granite Activations rep, the IW Tech will complete the TU and Test. The IW Tech MUST complete the below actions as well and include all notes/results/photos in the closeout notes: </p><p><br></p><p> ID router</p><p> Brand new patch cord labeled with useable IP address</p><p> Patch cord threaded</p><p> Take pictures of settings on laptop</p><p> Take pictures of speed test results</p><p> Take pictures of network interface proportionate of the room</p><p><br></p><p>Troubleshoot if required. MUST BE ABLE TO CREATE A WIRELESS HOTSPOT IF NEEDED</p><p>MATERIALS: Laptop PC (Windows 2000 or higher) with administrator login, AC power adapter &amp; internet access (cell/mobile card or hotspot) DB-9 serial cable &amp; serial port on laptop or USB-to-serial adapter, Console Cable, 4G card, AC extension cord (25’ min), putty, cell phone with charger, Butt Set, punch down tool, crimp tool, min 500ft CAT5E cabling (150’ min), RJ45 jacks and plugs (4 min), Min 10 male rj-11 heads, min 10 female to female rj-11 connectors; 4 rj-11 wall jacks and plates, at least 4 biscuit jacks, surface mount box, NID splitter, DSL low-pass filters (5 min).</p><p>** Laptop will need Ethernet and serial ports and HyperTerminal or Putty preinstalled if troubleshooting is necessary. **</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T09:00","end":"2026-10-07T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T18:30:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swaro