{"job":{"id":20086295,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Unisys","title":"Assist with physical installation of hardware | Up to 50 lbs","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>OVERVIEW</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">On this work order you are required to successfully complete the following:</span></p><ul><li>Technicians are required to have a Valid Government Issued ID - (Drivers License OR Passport OR Birth Certificate with raised seal). No photocopies allowed.</li><li>Required to assist in rack and stack server, storage,&nbsp;and networking products.</li><li>No prior training or experience on Storage is required.</li><li>This Service requires site access to be set-up for you which will be handled by us hence any replacement technician is not allowed onsite.</li></ul><p><strong><u>VERY IMPORTANT</u></strong></p><ol><li><strong>\"No Shows\" are not acceptable</strong>—you are expected to attend all assigned onsite appointments on time as scheduled.</li><li>If you foresee any issue that may prevent you from arriving onsite, you <strong>must communicate it immediately and well in advance</strong> to allow time for rescheduling or alternate coverage.</li><li>Failure to provide timely notification of schedule conflicts or absence and last minute cancelltions may impact service delivery commitments which will impact technician ratings on the platform or any further work being assigned to you</li></ol><p><strong><u>EXPECTATIONS/REQUIREMENTS</u></strong></p><ul><li>Contact the <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***********</del></span> Field Engineer listed on the headline of the work order upon arrival.</li><li>Ensure timely arrival (arrive 15 minutes early). Any delays need to be communicated to the assigned<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del> ***********</del></span> Field Engineer.</li><li>Maintains a high degree of professionalism in actions, demeanor, and dress.</li><li>Dress like a professional (collared shirt, no logos, appropriate trousers, closed-toe shoes).</li><li><strong>Must be able to lift 50lbs.</strong></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Ensures customer satisfaction throughout the service delivery transaction.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">No food or drinks (coffee) in DC</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Watch for open floor tiles</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">No smoking or vaping</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Don’t hold the door for people (they must badge in)</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">No full-leg casts (or other Lift-Prohibitive scenarios)</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>TOOLS REQUIRED:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Cell Phone</li><li>Minimum screwdriver set (Philips &amp; Straight)</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>PRE-SITE INSTRUCTIONS:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Do Not enter the site before the lead technician.</li><li>Please contact the <del>*********** </del>Field Engineer upon arrival.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>ONSITE INSTRUCTIONS:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Primary contact is the Field Engineer <strong>– In the Field Nation app navigate to the “Contact” section on the work order and find “Location Contact”.</strong></li><li>Take direction from the lead technician onsite.</li><li>Be careful to avoid any unnecessary outages to customers production environment.</li><li>No Cameras allowed. Photography/Videography is strictly NOT allowed within the customer premises.</li><li>Provide closure details to&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>******</del> on this work order.</span></li></ul><p>Time Arrived Onsite</p><p>Total Time Onsite</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>ESCALATIONS:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Please contact </strong><del>*************************</del> with any general questions regarding the schedule / Rate / Closures / Special Requirement or Payments. <strong>DO NOT CONTACT the </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*********** </del></strong><strong>Field Engineer for these queries.</strong></li><li>Contact&nbsp;<del>*************************</del> <span style=\"color: red;\">prior to the service start time </span>for any personal emergencies and need to cancel lift assistance <strong>(DO NOT CONTACT LEAD TECHNICIAN)</strong></li><li><strong>Site Access Issues:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>If client not allowing access to the data center/hardware.&nbsp;Notify the LEAD technician immediately <strong>(DO NOT DISCUSS WITH END USER)</strong></li><li><strong>Any change in the assigned technician should be reported to </strong><del>*************************</del> <strong>24 hours in advance so that site access can be processed. NO REPLACEMENT technician allowed last minute.</strong></li><li><strong>Arrival Delays - Please notify </strong><del>***********************</del> and the <strong>Lead technician</strong> for updated ETA.</li><li>For all other issues, escalations, off-hours coverage or delay in Unisys response, please contact the following:</li></ul><p>Terry Grenwelge , <del>**************************</del><del> * ************ ******</del>&nbsp;and Jordan Davis,<del> </del><del>***********************</del><del> ******************* ******</del></p>","markdown":"**OVERVIEW**\n\nOn this work order you are required to successfully complete the following:\n\n- Technicians are required to have a Valid Government Issued ID - (Drivers License OR Passport OR Birth Certificate with raised seal). No photocopies allowed.\n- Required to assist in rack and stack server, storage, and networking products.\n- No prior training or experience on Storage is required.\n- This Service requires site access to be set-up for you which will be handled by us hence any replacement technician is not allowed onsite.\n\n**VERY IMPORTANT**\n\n1. **\"No Shows\" are not acceptable**—you are expected to attend all assigned onsite appointments on time as scheduled.\n2. If you foresee any issue that may prevent you from arriving onsite, you **must communicate it immediately and well in advance** to allow time for rescheduling or alternate coverage.\n3. Failure to provide timely notification of schedule conflicts or absence and last minute cancelltions may impact service delivery commitments which will impact technician ratings on the platform or any further work being assigned to you\n\n**EXPECTATIONS/REQUIREMENTS**\n\n- Contact the \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Field Engineer listed on the headline of the work order upon arrival.\n- Ensure timely arrival (arrive 15 minutes early). Any delays need to be communicated to the assigned \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Field Engineer.\n- Maintains a high degree of professionalism in actions, demeanor, and dress.\n- Dress like a professional (collared shirt, no logos, appropriate trousers, closed-toe shoes).\n- **Must be able to lift 50lbs.**\n- Ensures customer satisfaction throughout the service delivery transaction.\n- No food or drinks (coffee) in DC\n- Watch for open floor tiles\n- No smoking or vaping\n- Don’t hold the door for people (they must badge in)\n- No full-leg casts (or other Lift-Prohibitive scenarios)\n\n**TOOLS REQUIRED:**\n\n- Cell Phone\n- Minimum screwdriver set (Philips & Straight)\n\n**PRE-SITE INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\n- Do Not enter the site before the lead technician.\n- Please contact the \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Field Engineer upon arrival.\n\n**ONSITE INSTRUCTIONS:**\n\n- Primary contact is the Field Engineer **– In the Field Nation app navigate to the “Contact” section on the work order and find “Location Contact”.**\n- Take direction from the lead technician onsite.\n- Be careful to avoid any unnecessary outages to customers production environment.\n- No Cameras allowed. Photography/Videography is strictly NOT allowed within the customer premises.\n- Provide closure details to \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* on this work order.\n\nTime Arrived Onsite\n\nTotal Time Onsite\n\n**ESCALATIONS:**\n\n- **Please contact** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* with any general questions regarding the schedule / Rate / Closures / Special Requirement or Payments. **DO NOT CONTACT the** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** **Field Engineer for these queries.**\n- Contact \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* prior to the service start time for any personal emergencies and need to cancel lift assistance **(DO NOT CONTACT LEAD TECHNICIAN)**\n- **Site Access Issues:** If client not allowing access to the data center/hardware. Notify the LEAD technician immediately **(DO NOT DISCUSS WITH END USER)**\n- **Any change in the assigned technician should be reported to** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* **24 hours in advance so that site access can be processed. NO REPLACEMENT technician allowed last minute.**\n- **Arrival Delays - Please notify** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and the **Lead technician** for updated ETA.\n- For all other issues, escalations, off-hours coverage or delay in Unisys response, please contact the following:\n\nTerry Grenwelge , \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and Jordan Davis, \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T08:00","end":"2026-10-09T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":320},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":6.577093133030561},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No in-hours counter slot available\nRequested: Fri, Oct 9, 8:00 AM\nChecked: Fri, Oct 9, Mon, Oct 12, Tue, Oct 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Network Cable Technician – Low Voltage Tech 1 (AKIRA Crabtree Valley)"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1790967082044}
{"job":{"id":"6070242235","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"IT ServicePoint, LLC","title":"Hilton SD-WAN: Meraki Router Install","description":"<p><strong><u>PRIOR TO ARRIVAL ONSITE:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Download &amp; Install the ServiceNow App:</strong></p><ul><li>Follow the attached instructions to install the app on your device.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Account Setup &amp; Login:</strong></p><ul><li>On the login screen, click \"Forgot Password.\"</li><li>Enter your email address twice when prompted.</li><li>You will receive an SMS message on the device you're using to complete the setup.</li><li>Use the link provided in the SMS to set your password and complete your account setup.</li><li>If you encounter any issues during the setup process or have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out for assistance.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Install Meraki Switch</li><li>Install Server&nbsp;</li><li>Install Network Printers</li><li>Work with Support to complete cutover and confirm connectivity</li><li>Collect required collateral and check out with Support</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools/Skillset:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Server/Networking/Workstation experience</li><li>CompTIA A+, Net+, MCSE, MCP equivalent classroom training and 2+ years related industry experience or minimum of 3+</li><li>years minimum related industry experience.</li><li>Ability to comprehend industry standard network connectivity, navigation and software installation</li><li>Standard computer tool kit to include</li><li>Philips screwdriver</li><li>Flat head screwdriver</li><li>Flashlight</li><li>Charged Cell phone preferably an Android or iPhone with charger</li><li>Box Cutter</li><li>Pen</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Console cable</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Flat rate covers up to 2hrs onsite. Any additional time will be paid at $25 an hour</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment. All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum. If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate, subsequent days scheduled will be considered 'Cancelled', not 'Aborted'.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.</em></strong></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T09:00","end":"2026-10-06T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":44.6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026