{"job":{"id":20088682,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Air2Data","title":"WIFI Switch Install at Hotel ","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hotel WIFI Networking Install in Durham NC</strong></li><li>Seeking a technician with experience in WIFI Networking and Low Voltage Cabling.</li><li>Technician to install switch and perform some troubleshooting. </li><li>Estimated duration will be<strong> 2 hours</strong></li><li><strong>INCLUDE ANY TRIP CHARGES UP FRONT OR THEY WILL NOT BE HONORED.</strong></li><li>Dress Code:<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Clean &amp;&nbsp;Business casual, no ripped or cut pants, closed-toe shoes. No vulgar or political referencing.</li><li>Tools Required: Please check WO Qualification section.</li><li>Air2Data's Tier 3 technicians, which work with on-site techs, are done at 4 p.m. MST. On-site techs will need to contact Air2Data's tech support before 4 p.m. to verify remote access to equipment or plan on coming back the next day to finish the installation. <strong>After 4 p.m. Mountain Standard Time, tech support is unavailable for installation questions.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>WORK SCOPE:</strong></p><ul><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Air2Data while onsite.</li><li>Install switch</li><li>Take photos of all installed equipment and any MDF or IDF closets worked in.</li><li>Acquire signature from location manager on duty or property owner upon successful completion of work.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Escalation Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with our office Tier 3 technicians.</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to Project Managers.</li></ul><p><strong>Technician Labor and Travel Compensation</strong></p><p>Air2Data will compensate the technician only for the actual time spent performing work at the job site, plus approved travel time to and from the site.</p><p>For each assignment, Air2Data will provide an estimated number of labor hours and may specify a maximum authorized amount by stating that the work is approved for <strong>\"up to\"</strong> a certain number of hours. Technicians shall not exceed the authorized hours without prior written approval from Air2Data.</p><p>The hotel or customer will be billed only for the actual hours worked on the scheduled project, and Air2Data will compensate the technician for those same actual hours worked, plus any approved travel time. No payment will be made for unworked estimated hours or for time exceeding the authorized limit unless expressly approved in advance by Air2Data.</p><p>By accepting the work order, the technician and/or technician's company acknowledges and agrees to these compensation terms.</p><p><strong>Additional Do's &amp; Don'ts:</strong></p><ol><li>Never leave a property if/when network is down, unless authorized by Air2Data.</li><li>Alert property management if/when service will be interrupted.</li><li>Never turn off an old network prior to testing the new network, to make sure the newly completed work is functioning properly (when applicable).</li><li>Before leaving the property, do a walk through with the manager to ensure the install has been completed according to the contract.</li><li>This w/o is not priced to organize/label pre-existing Ethernet cables, clean, or alter, in any manner the hotel's pre-existing network equipment, configure back-office computers, printers, etc., or sharing the network on the premises. If a customer asks you to do any of the above, please contact Air2Data immediately</li></ol>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- **Hotel WIFI Networking Install in Durham NC**\n- Seeking a technician with experience in WIFI Networking and Low Voltage Cabling.\n- Technician to install switch and perform some troubleshooting.\n- Estimated duration will be **2 hours**\n- **INCLUDE ANY TRIP CHARGES UP FRONT OR THEY WILL NOT BE HONORED.**\n- Dress Code: Clean & Business casual, no ripped or cut pants, closed-toe shoes. No vulgar or political referencing.\n- Tools Required: Please check WO Qualification section.\n- Air2Data's Tier 3 technicians, which work with on-site techs, are done at 4 p.m. MST. On-site techs will need to contact Air2Data's tech support before 4 p.m. to verify remote access to equipment or plan on coming back the next day to finish the installation. **After 4 p.m. Mountain Standard Time, tech support is unavailable for installation questions.**\n\n**WORK SCOPE:**\n\n- Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Air2Data while onsite.\n- Install switch\n- Take photos of all installed equipment and any MDF or IDF closets worked in.\n- Acquire signature from location manager on duty or property owner upon successful completion of work.\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with our office Tier 3 technicians.\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to Project Managers.\n\n**Technician Labor and Travel Compensation**\n\nAir2Data will compensate the technician only for the actual time spent performing work at the job site, plus approved travel time to and from the site.\n\nFor each assignment, Air2Data will provide an estimated number of labor hours and may specify a maximum authorized amount by stating that the work is approved for **\"up to\"** a certain number of hours. Technicians shall not exceed the authorized hours without prior written approval from Air2Data.\n\nThe hotel or customer will be billed only for the actual hours worked on the scheduled project, and Air2Data will compensate the technician for those same actual hours worked, plus any approved travel time. No payment will be made for unworked estimated hours or for time exceeding the authorized limit unless expressly approved in advance by Air2Data.\n\nBy accepting the work order, the technician and/or technician's company acknowledges and agrees to these compensation terms.\n\n**Additional Do's & Don'ts:**\n\n1. Never leave a property if/when network is down, unless authorized by Air2Data.\n2. Alert property management if/when service will be interrupted.\n3. Never turn off an old network prior to testing the new network, to make sure the newly completed work is functioning properly (when applicable).\n4. Before leaving the property, do a walk through with the manager to ensure the install has been completed according to the contract.\n5. This w/o is not priced to organize/label pre-existing Ethernet cables, clean, or alter, in any manner the hotel's pre-existing network equipment, configure back-office computers, printers, etc., or sharing the network on the premises. If a customer asks you to do any of the above, please contact Air2Data immediately","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T10:00","end":"2026-10-05T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":255},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":85,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":5.571419677840586},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $255 (countered: $255) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00