{"job":{"id":20093249,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SOS GEEK LLC","title":"Computer Assemble and window Installation ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seeking a technician with experience in&nbsp;<strong>Computer Assemble and window Installation</strong></li>\n<li>Tech is required to setup &amp; do the computer assembly and format the same as well as install the Windows 11. Customer informed that he got the computer part and the copy of the Window 11 which he ordered online and want the tech to assemble everything from him</li>\n<li>Estimated duration will be&nbsp;2 Hours</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Professional Attire</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>All Basic Hand Tools</li>\n<li>As per the WO</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Contact WO manager to confirm Scope of Work and Scheduling</li>\n</ol>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Call the client 1 hour before check in to confirm availability and ensuring client is reminded about your arrival</li>\n<li>Call SOS GEEK to Confirm whether client answered or call went unanswered.</li>\n<li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent SOS GEEK while onsite</li>\n<li>Call to Check in / Call before Check out - 1855-551-7665</li>\n<li>Take a Print out of the WO and Get it signed buy the client</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tech needs to diagnose the issue properly and check for the parts properly which has malfunctioned. if required open the device to check for proper diagnosis of the device.</li>\n<li>If in case it has a part replacement issue then the tech needs to help the client place the order of the required part which has malfunctioned during the time of diagnosis only so as the client can place the order for the same.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Communication Directory:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with WO manager&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to WO manager</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Any additional hours and expenses must be pre approved by WO manager</li>\n<li>Any additional hours and expenses incurring without pre approval will be denied</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in **Computer Assemble and window Installation**\n- Tech is required to setup & do the computer assembly and format the same as well as install the Windows 11. Customer informed that he got the computer part and the copy of the Window 11 which he ordered online and want the tech to assemble everything from him\n- Estimated duration will be 2 Hours\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Professional Attire\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- All Basic Hand Tools\n- As per the WO\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Contact WO manager to confirm Scope of Work and Scheduling\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Call the client 1 hour before check in to confirm availability and ensuring client is reminded about your arrival\n2. Call SOS GEEK to Confirm whether client answered or call went unanswered.\n3. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent SOS GEEK while onsite\n4. Call to Check in / Call before Check out - 1855-551-7665\n5. Take a Print out of the WO and Get it signed buy the client\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n- Tech needs to diagnose the issue properly and check for the parts properly which has malfunctioned. if required open the device to check for proper diagnosis of the device.\n- If in case it has a part replacement issue then the tech needs to help the client place the order of the required part which has malfunctioned during the time of diagnosis only so as the client can place the order for the same.\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with WO manager\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to WO manager\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Any additional hours and expenses must be pre approved by WO manager\n- Any additional hours and expenses incurring without pre approval will be denied","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-03T13:00","end":"2026-10-03T15:00","latestStart":"2026-10-03T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":100},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":72.3592846322216},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 059749