{"job":{"id":"2533898299","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"04301368 || 8460 Times Dispatch Blvd || EPIK Cutover and Test","description":"DESCRIPTION: SOW - EPIK Cutover &amp; Test <br><br>please call into Activations : (833) 719-8378 <br><br>************************************************************************************* <br><br>Before Arrival <br><br>1.Call the LCON 30 minutes before arrival. <br><br>2.Review the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK: <br><br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo <br><br>3.Arrive with all required tools and materials listed below. <br><br>On Arrival <br><br>1.Check in on WorkMarket. <br><br>2.Locate the customer contact and confirm the install location. <br><br>3.Review the Special Instructions before starting work. <br><br>EPIK Install Requirements <br><br>1.Mount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik. <br><br>2.If EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location.  <br><br>3.Power on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard. <br><br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on. <br><br>4.If applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions. <br><br>5.Log into the EPIK Install Wizard: <br><br>https://wizard.epik.io <br><br>6.Follow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned. <br><br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES <br><br>Checkout Requirement <br><br>1.Confirm Activations has released you. <br><br>2.Submit all WorkMarket deliverables. <br><br>3.Enter the checkout code in WorkMarket. <br><br>4.Check out on WorkMarket. <br><br>The install is not considered valid unless the checkout code is entered in WorkMarket. <br><br>Required Deliverables <br><br>Submit all required deliverables in WorkMarket before checkout: <br><br>1.Photo of completed EPIK install. <br><br>2.Photo of labeled 66 block / harmonica block. <br><br>3.List of existing TNs and the new number that replaced each TN, if applicable. <br><br>4.Customer signed sign-out sheet. <br><br>5.Any additional deliverables listed in Special Instructions. <br><br>Required Tools <br><br>•Laptop <br><br>•Smartphone with hotspot <br><br>•Tone generator and wand <br><br>•66/110 punch tool <br><br>•Butt set <br><br>       Infrared Temperature Gun  <br><br>•Electrician scissors <br><br>•Step ladder <br><br>•Flashlight/headlamp <br><br>•RJ11/RJ45 crimper <br><br>•Ethernet cable tester <br><br>•Impact drill / cordless drill <br><br>•Masonry bits <br><br>•Screwdrivers / driver bits <br><br>•Needle-nose pliers <br><br>•Label maker and label tape <br><br>•Cat3 or better cable <br><br>•Cat6 Ethernet cable <br><br>•Cross-connect wire <br><br>•Gel-crimp connectors <br><br>•Cable ties and mounting hardware <br><br>•RJ11/RJ45 plugs and keystone jacks <br><br>•Console cables: USB to DB9 PL2303 and USB to USB-mini <br><br>************************************************************************************* <br><br>PM SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS GUIDELINES <br><br>Special Instructions <br><br>Install Location <br><br>Enter where the EPIK device should be installed, including MDF/IDF/telco room location, wall/rack/shelf mounting instructions, and access notes. <br><br>________________________________________ <br><br>Cable Runs <br><br>Enter any required cable runs, cable type, distance, start/end points, and whether ladder, lift, ceiling access, or special tools are needed. <br><br>________________________________________ <br><br>Network Information <br><br>Enter switch name, switch port, DHCP/static IP details, VLAN info, and customer network escalation contact. <br><br>________________________________________ <br><br>External Antenna <br><br>Enter whether an external antenna is required, where it should be mounted, and any cable path or photo requirements. <br><br>________________________________________ <br><br>Special Testing <br><br>Enter any customer-specific testing that must be completed, including specific TNs, fax, alarm, elevator, hunt group, auto attendant, or other required testing. <br><br>________________________________________ <br><br>Customer Contacts <br><br>Enter primary LCON, backup contact, customer IT contact, site manager, and escalation contacts. <br><br>________________________________________ <br><br>Vendor / Third-Party Info <br><br>Enter any VTM, customer tech, alarm vendor, elevator vendor, fax vendor, MSP, or other third-party contact information.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-02T11:00","end":"2026-10-02T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":350},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":110.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"DISTANCE_TOO_FAR","rejectDetails":"Reported one-way distance 110.5mi exceeds 100mi limit"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Busy"},{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Network Cable Technician – Low Voltage Tech 1 (AKIRA Crabtree Valley)"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1791000017271}
