{"job":{"id":20091667,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Replace pin pad and bracket on 1 new Xerox self serve printer","description":{"html":"<p>Call command center once onsite.</p>\n<p>Scope of Work:</p>\n<p>Replace pin pad and bracket on 1 new Xerox self serve printer. Use Staples pin pad replacement guide</p>\n<p>IF BRACKETS ARE NOT FOUND BY MOD, THEY SHOULD BE IN TOP DRAWER OF PRINTER.</p>\n<p><strong>Required tools</strong></p>\n<p><strong> Torx T-15 Security bit</strong></p>\n<p><strong> 7mm wrench/spanner</strong></p>\n<p><strong> Number 1 Phillips screwdriver&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Call command center with serial number and tracking information.</p>\n<p>Letter of Authorization Shyft Global doc. Is needed to be able to perform task.</p>\n<p><strong>Additional Contacts &amp; Escalation Process:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For <strong><u>arrival issues</u></strong> or<strong><u>scheduling issues</u></strong> contact <del>*** *** **** ******* **</del> <del>************</del></li>\n<li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to <del>** ***** **** ** ************</del></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pre-approval by the Project Manager is required for reimbursement of purchase of any additional materials that are needed to complete a task, NOT the end user or client.</li>\n<li>Any additional time on site or tasks must be pre-approved by the Project Manager, not the end user or client. This also includes any modification to your schedule.</li>\n<li>To address or escalate any issues while performing a task, you must do so through the Project Manager – NOT the end user or client.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DO NOT</strong>leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.</li>\n<li><strong>Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule</strong></li>\n</ul>","markdown":"Call command center once onsite.\n\nScope of Work:\n\nReplace pin pad and bracket on 1 new Xerox self serve printer. Use Staples pin pad replacement guide\n\nIF BRACKETS ARE NOT FOUND BY MOD, THEY SHOULD BE IN TOP DRAWER OF PRINTER.\n\n**Required tools**\n\n** Torx T-15 Security bit**\n\n** 7mm wrench/spanner**\n\n** Number 1 Phillips screwdriver**\n\nCall command center with serial number and tracking information.\n\nLetter of Authorization Shyft Global doc. Is needed to be able to perform task.\n\n**Additional Contacts & Escalation Process:**\n\n- For **arrival issues** or**scheduling issues** contact \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Pre-approval by the Project Manager is required for reimbursement of purchase of any additional materials that are needed to complete a task, NOT the end user or client.\n- Any additional time on site or tasks must be pre-approved by the Project Manager, not the end user or client. This also includes any modification to your schedule.\n- To address or escalate any issues while performing a task, you must do so through the Project Manager – NOT the end user or client.\n\n**NOTE:**\n\n- **DO NOT**leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Esp