{"job":{"id":20094693,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Quest Professional Services","title":"Onsite Resource","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Support Technician (Project-Based)</strong> <strong>Location:</strong> Timberlake, NC (Local Candidates Only) <strong>Start Date:</strong> October 2 <strong>Training:</strong> Remote meeting/training on October 1 <strong>Requirement:</strong> Recent background check required</p><p>Quest is seeking a local <strong>Support Technician</strong> to provide scheduled onsite support for an end customer in the Timberlake, NC area. The technician will attend a remote training session on October 1 and begin onsite support on October 2.</p>Responsibilities<ul><li>Register workstations in <strong>Microsoft Autopilot</strong> and <strong>Microsoft Intune</strong></li><li>Reimage workstations through Intune</li><li>Onboard end users, including:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">User profile setup</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Microsoft 365 configuration</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Printer setup</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">General user support and Q&amp;A</li><li>Provide general help desk and desktop support as assigned</li><li>Support user onboarding activities, averaging approximately 30 minutes per user</li></ul>Requirements<ul><li>Local to the Timberlake, NC area</li><li>Experience with:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Microsoft Intune</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Microsoft Autopilot</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Windows workstation deployment and imaging</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">End-user onboarding and desktop support</li><li>Strong customer service and communication skills</li><li>Recent background check required</li><li>Reliable phone and transportation for onsite support</li></ul>Important Expectations While Representing Quest<ul><li>Maintain a professional appearance and demeanor at all times</li><li>Present yourself as a Quest representative</li><li>Do not solicit additional business from the customer</li><li>Do not discuss pay rates, pricing, equipment costs, or purchasing recommendations with the customer</li><li>Do not bring additional personnel onsite without prior written approval</li><li>Do not contact the customer outside of scheduled assignments unless authorized by Quest</li></ul><p><br></p>","markdown":"**Support Technician (Project-Based)** **Location:** Timberlake, NC (Local Candidates Only) **Start Date:** October 2 **Training:** Remote meeting/training on October 1 **Requirement:** Recent background check required\n\nQuest is seeking a local **Support Technician** to provide scheduled onsite support for an end customer in the Timberlake, NC area. The technician will attend a remote training session on October 1 and begin onsite support on October 2.\n\nResponsibilities- Register workstations in **Microsoft Autopilot** and **Microsoft Intune**\n- Reimage workstations through Intune\n- Onboard end users, including:\n- User profile setup\n- Microsoft 365 configuration\n- Printer setup\n- General user support and Q&A\n- Provide general help desk and desktop support as assigned\n- Support user onboarding activities, averaging approximately 30 minutes per user\n\nRequirements- Local to the Timberlake, NC area\n- Experience with:\n- Microsoft Intune\n- Microsoft Autopilot\n- Windows workstation deployment and imaging\n- End-user onboarding and desktop support\n- Strong customer service and communication skills\n- Recent background check required\n- Reliable phone and transportation for onsite support\n\nImportant Expectations While Representing Quest- Maintain a professional appearance and demeanor at all times\n- Present yourself as a Quest representative\n- Do not solicit additional business from the customer\n- Do not discuss pay rates, pricing, equipment costs, or purchasing recommendations with the customer\n- Do not bring additional personnel onsite without prior written approval\n- Do not contact the customer outside of scheduled assignments unless authorized by Quest",