{"job":{"id":20090360,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Maintech","title":"Experienced tech needed to assist Maintech FE onsite installing APC 3000VA & PDUs","description":{"html":"<p>This is a partnership account between Maintech and SHI. We are providing service to their customer - Acentra Health</p><p>We are sending a Maintech FE onsite and need a second tech to assist him. Work is scheduled for Thursday, 10/8 @ 3pm EDT.</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The scope is to install one APC 3000VA UPS and two Tripp Lite metered PDUs, then move the network equipment onto the new power setup. Then </span>will need to bunny-hop 3 Meraki MS250-48P switches and 2 Meraki MX100 Firewalls over to the new UPS/PDU combo.&nbsp;Additionally, there is a bad PSU in one of the MS250's; they will coordinate an RMA with the vendor to coincide with 10/8 and make sure it is delivered prior to the 3pm start time.&nbsp;</p><p>Contact info will be provided.</p>","markdown":"This is a partnership account between Maintech and SHI. We are providing service to their customer - Acentra Health\n\nWe are sending a Maintech FE onsite and need a second tech to assist him. Work is scheduled for Thursday, 10/8 @ 3pm EDT.\n\nThe scope is to install one APC 3000VA UPS and two Tripp Lite metered PDUs, then move the network equipment onto the new power setup. Then will need to bunny-hop 3 Meraki MS250-48P switches and 2 Meraki MX100 Firewalls over to the new UPS/PDU combo. Additionally, there is a bad PSU in one of the MS250's; they will coordinate an RMA with the vendor to coincide with 10/8 and make sure it is delivered prior to the 3pm start time.\n\nContact info will be provided.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T15:00","end":"2026-10-08T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":250},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":3,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":4.90990702426