work-related.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Engineer must carry a valid ID for access; access won't be granted without it.</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Do not <strong>represent FIELDNATION</strong> on site unless specified, check with our support team for clarification.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Technician must stay onsite until task completion; </strong>leaving without<strong> Gaichu technical team's authorization </strong>results in<strong> no payment </strong>and task deemed<strong> Incomplete. IMPORTANT</strong></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><strong> </strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Share onsite <strong>Time IN</strong> and <strong>Time Out</strong> with the technical team before leaving.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rude behavior </strong>is not acceptable onsite and will lead to disciplinary action</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Wear professional clothing for the task.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>All tools mentioned in the work order must be taken to the site; if any tools reported to be missing while you are onsite, and work affected because of it will result in no payment.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Take all tools mentioned in the work order to the site; missing tools affecting work will result in no payment. IMPORTANT</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Share all expenses (Travel, Gas, Parking &amp; Toll) before accepting the Work Order. No additional expenses will be approved after the task. <strong>IMPORTANT</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Do not bring unauthorized persons onsite without written confirmation; non-compliance will result in unpaid Work Order and be seen as a security breach.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Share receipts for materials purchased or used onsite for reimbursement; payment won't be authorized without relevant receipts.</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Please take pictures before and after the execution of work.</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Take <strong>Before</strong> and <strong>After</strong> pictures of the work execution.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Connect <strong>Console Cable</strong> <strong>or USB to DB9 Converter</strong> to laptop and share the <strong>Device Manager</strong> picture showing <strong>COM PORT</strong> before starting the task to confirm proper driver installation.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Please see below the WhatsApp requirement for all future Field nation tasks:</p><p><strong>Please install WhatsApp application in your smart phone and send WhatsApp message containing FN WO if you need any technical assistance and when you are onsite then reach out to below contact persons:</strong></p><p><strong>Kiran Arshad:</strong>&nbsp;+92 330 5000523</p><p><strong>Mehreen Arshad:</strong>&nbsp;+92 330 5000522</p><p><strong>Kashan Ul Haq:</strong>&nbsp;+92 347 9859366&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please visit below links to install WhatsApp and to add WhatsApp contacts.</p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaRsRytz1NQ</p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=65IHJAgXIyY&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>If you have any query regarding schedule or payment you need to reach out to below contact details:</strong></p><p><strong>Ammar Ibrahim +92 319 6241457</strong></p><p><strong>Safwan Sajjad: +92 336 5509218</strong></p><p><strong>Jawad Jami: +92 314 0916262</strong></p>","markdown":"**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\nFe to decom and box up equipment for the store closure. Both retail and doctor. Devices to be handed over to the MOD. Devices include but not limited to Meraki MX, AP's + mount, Digi/Cradlepoint, switches, phones etc.\n\nStep by Step Instructions for the Field Engineer:\n\n1\n\nPlease read the work order to have an understanding of what the scope entails before arriving onsite2\n\nField engineer assigned/dispatched to customer site and must arrive onsite 15 minutes before the requested time shown above3\n\nField engineer arrives at customer site and joins provided Microsoft Teams bridge using web browser or Teams App on phone or laptop4\n\nField engineer verifies the job required to be carried out with the technical contact on bridge5\n\nRemote/bridge engineer will confirm once job is complete and provide release to field technician6\n\nField engineer to assist with packing and shipping label for returned equipment (if applicable)7\n\nField engineer to track and provide in/out time onsite8\n\nField engineer completes the Site Visit Report provided by \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and gets this signed by the onsite contact9\n\nField Engineer to send the completed Site Visit Report back to \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* within 48 hours of job completion\n\n**Important:**\n\nTech should have Webex or Blue jeans in his laptop, so he can provide remote access.\n\n**Task Requirement:**\n\n1- Faulty device needs to be carry with you after the task is completed\n\n2- Customer will provide shipping label - the tech needs to drop off the device to the nearby courier place.\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\***\n\n**Tools Requirement:**\n\n\\- Customer ID Badge (if required)\n\n\\- Mobile phone and charger\n\n\\- Laptop and charger\n\n\\- TeamViewer installed on laptop\n\n\\- Console cable (DB9)\n\n\\- 2 x Cat5E Patch cables, 10 and 3 metre\n\n\\- Engineer to take a Cisco console cable CAB-CONSOLE (RH45-DB9 Female)\n\n\\- Installation Tools - Cage Nuts, Screws, Screw Driver.\n\n\\- Digital Camera\n\n- Terminal Server Emulator (Putty, Secure CRT) Standard CISCO Console Cable DB9 to RJ45 or USB to RJ45\n- USB Drivers if using USB connection RS232.\n- Mobile Hotspot for tethering\n- VELCRO Straps for rack cable management/patch cords\n- USB Flash drive (At least 32 or above GB)\n- Screwdriver Set (Phillips Set & Torx Set)\n\n **Terms & Conditions:**\n\n**﻿·** Please remain professional demeanor while on site. Do not engage in any conversation with local site contacts or any staff members unrelated to work. **Keep all conversations strictly work-related.**\n\n**· Engineer must carry a valid ID for access; access won't be granted without it.**\n\n· Do not **represent FIELDNATION** on site unless specified, check with our support team for clarification.\n\n**· Technician must stay onsite until task completion;** leaving without **Gaichu technical team's authorization** results in **no payment** and task deemed **Incomplete. IMPORTANT**\n\n · Share onsite **Time IN** and **Time Out** with the technical team before leaving.\n\n**· Rude behavior** is not acceptable onsite and will lead to disciplinary action\n\n**· Wear professional clothing for the task.**\n\n**·** All tools mentioned in the work order must be taken to the site; if any tools reported to be missing while you are onsite, and work affected because of it will result in no payment.\n\n**· Take all tools mentioned in the work order to the site; missing tools affecting work will result in no payment. IMPORTANT**\n\n**·** Share all expenses (Travel, Gas, Parking & Toll) before accepting the Work Order. No additional expenses will be approved after the task. **IMPORTANT**\n\n**·** Do not bring unauthorized persons onsite without written confirmation; non-compliance will result in unpaid Work Order and be seen as a security breach.\n\n**· Share receipts for materials purchased or used onsite for reimbursement; payment won't be authorized without relevant receipts.**\n\n· **Please take pictures before and after the execution of work.**\n\n· Take **Before** and **After** pictures of the work execution.\n\n· Connect **Console Cable** **or USB to DB9 Converter** to laptop and share the **Device Manager** picture showing **COM PORT** before starting the task to confirm proper driver installation.\n\n· Please see below the WhatsApp requirement for all future Field nation tasks:\n\n**Please install WhatsApp application in your smart phone and send WhatsApp message containing FN WO if you need any technical assistance and when you are onsite then reach out to below contact persons:**\n\n**Kiran Arshad:** +92 330 5000523\n\n**Mehreen Arshad:** +92 330 5000522\n\n**Kashan Ul Haq:** +92 347 9859366\n\nPlease visit below links to install WhatsApp and to add WhatsApp contacts.\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaRsRytz1NQ>\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=65IHJAgXIyY&nbsp;>\n\n**If you have any query regarding schedule or payment you need to reach out to below contact details:**\n\n**Ammar Ibrahim +92 319 6241457**\n\n**Safwan Sajjad: +92 336 5509218**\n\n**Jawad Jami: +92 314 0916262**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T11:15","end":"2026-10-05T13:15"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":90},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":11.24984582774906},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Dana doctor"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026