{"job":{"id":20097894,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Freightsnap","title":"Replace Desktop Network Switch on Measuring Equipment in Trucking Terminal","description":{"html":"<p><strong>**THE SITE DOES NOT HAVE A 12' A-FRAME LADDER FOR THIS SO YOU WILL NEED TO PROVIDE ONE TO REACH THIS EQUIPMENT COMFORTABLY (NORMAL EXTENSION LADDERS DO NOT WORK)</strong></p><p><strong><u>Overview:</u></strong></p><p>We have a piece of equipment in a warehouse setting that automatically captures the dimensions of freight. The unit has 2 POE cameras attached to it, all attached to aluminum \"arms\" on the unit's frame and surrounding bollards. The POE desktop switch powering these cameras is starting to fail so we will need assistance with replacement. The replacement switch will be held for you on site. We can also answer any questions you may have.</p><p><strong><u>Required Tools:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tool for cutting cable ties if necessary</strong></li><li><strong>Cable Ties</strong></li><li><strong>12' A-Frame Ladder (NECESSARY FOR REACHING THE EQUIPMENT)</strong></li></ul>","markdown":"**\\*\\*THE SITE DOES NOT HAVE A 12' A-FRAME LADDER FOR THIS SO YOU WILL NEED TO PROVIDE ONE TO REACH THIS EQUIPMENT COMFORTABLY (NORMAL EXTENSION LADDERS DO NOT WORK)**\n\n**Overview:**\n\nWe have a piece of equipment in a warehouse setting that automatically captures the dimensions of freight. The unit has 2 POE cameras attached to it, all attached to aluminum \"arms\" on the unit's frame and surrounding bollards. The POE desktop switch powering these cameras is starting to fail so we will need assistance with replacement. The replacement switch will be held for you on site. We can also answer any questions you may have.\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n- **Tool for cutting cable ties if necessary**\n- **Cable Ties**\n- **12' A-Frame Ladder (NECESSARY FOR REACHING THE EQUIPMENT)**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T09:00","end":"2026-10-06T11:00","latestS