{"job":{"id":"7298156731","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"DataMax Services, Inc","title":"USS7 CO-NC-Crabtree Valley Mall - Miniso Retro","description":"<p>Complete MINISO retrofit technology installation for the assigned store.</p><p><br></p><p>General scope includes cabling, rack/device placement, patch panel connections, device/cable labeling, cash wrap POS/Clover connections, AP/TV/media cabling, NVR/BDCOM/camera patching if assigned, Sangoma testing support, and closeout photo documentation.</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must follow the attached MINISO Retrofit Install Guide and the assigned V11 port map.</p><p><br></p><p>Must Bring a Laptop</p><p>Must Bring no less than 500' of WHITE Cat 6 for 2-3 cable runs.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-01T08:00","end":"2026-09-01T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":1500},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":1.1},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-02T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-03T18:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-04T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-01T11:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-02T02:30:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso day 2"},{"start":"2026-09-03T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-03T18:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00