egacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Network Cable Technician – Low Voltage Tech 1 (AKIRA Crabtree Valley)"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1791211414738}
{"job":{"id":"9939705748","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey","description":"DESCRIPTION: \"Please check in and out with Property Manager<br>If the survey runs over 2 hours you need to get permission from the Property Manager to continue and please let them know about how much longer would be needed<br>Please survey for all fire alarms, burg alarms, elevators, pool phones(voice), fax<br>If there are different building on the property there are probably fire alarms in each one<br>Please work with Property Manager to make sure we get the correct information<br>If you have any issues please reach out to Hilal 9194246791 or 919-870-5080<br>Survey SOW: SOS must match dates and times that are in WorkMarket and MUST BE SIGNED BY THE CUSTOMER (LCON)<br>1. TECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL.<br>2. Check in and out through Work Market. For any questions during the survey, please call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at: 833-479-4768<br>3. Upon arrival, departure, and for questions about your scope of work or if you are unclear on instructions before starting the installation, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479-4768, otherwise Login to EPIK Wizard at https://wizard.epik.io to begin the Survey process. When you enter the Granite ticket number it will be recognized as a survey, and you will be taken to the Survey Wizard.  (Note: If you have completed a Wizard survey or install before, please be sure to refresh your browser window to ensure the current version is being used.)<br>4. Follow all instructions presented by the Survey Wizard.  If you run into any issues or have questions you may call the TC Team.  All sections of the survey are required and will require final sign off by Granite Technical Coordinator before you will be cleared to leave the site.  The Survey Wizard will guide you through this process.<br>5. Before departure call the EPIK 