{"job":{"id":20046085,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TRCA","title":"Ticket #302835 - (STRSPRT-1745556) 1851 - Network Modernization - Device Installation and Connection - Phase 3","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Technician must review ALL attachments/SOW before going to site and contact TRCA with any questions regarding the Scope of Work.</strong></p><p><strong>CALL TRCA: (940) 293-8232 TO CHECK IN AND CHECK OUT FOR EVERY TRIP.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK – NETWORK MODERNIZATION</strong></p><p><strong>DAY 1 – PREP</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Verify current SOW, equipment, and new circuit/Starlink.</strong></li><li><strong>Install/mount new FortiGate, FortiSwitch, FortiExtender, APs, and cameras.</strong></li><li><strong>Complete required cabling per SOW/cutsheet.</strong></li><li><strong>Stage phones — DO NOT connect POE.</strong></li><li><strong>Confirm FortiGate equipment is online with Backend Support/O’Reilly Help Desk.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>DAY 2 – CUTOVER</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Obtain device pre-count and coordinate with MOD.</strong></li><li><strong>Move server and legacy device cabling to new FortiSwitches per SOW/cutsheet.</strong></li><li><strong>Connect Linux, VoIP phones, APs, cameras, and remaining devices as directed.</strong></li><li><strong>Disconnect/remove legacy network equipment as instructed.</strong></li><li><strong>Complete J16 reboot on Alarm Panel.</strong></li><li><strong>Verify all required devices/services are operational before checkout.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>DAY 3 – REMOVAL/RETURN</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Remove all legacy equipment and cabling included in scope.</strong></li><li><strong>Separate equipment for UPS return and Store/DC return as outlined in SOW.</strong></li><li><strong>Complete required return documentation/photos.</strong></li><li><strong>Obtain final device count and checkout with Backend Support/O’Reilly Help Desk.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>IMPORTANT: Follow the attached SOW and cutsheet for all detailed cabling, port assignments, equipment placement, and required procedures.</strong></p><p><strong>FINAL CHECKOUT:</strong></p><p><strong>Call TRCA (940) 293-8232 before leaving site.</strong></p>","markdown":"**Technician must review ALL attachments/SOW before going to site and contact TRCA with any questions regarding the Scope of Work.**\n\n**CALL TRCA: (940) 293-8232 TO CHECK IN AND CHECK OUT FOR EVERY TRIP.**\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK – NETWORK MODERNIZATION**\n\n**DAY 1 – PREP**\n\n- **Verify current SOW, equipment, and new circuit/Starlink.**\n- **Install/mount new FortiGate, FortiSwitch, FortiExtender, APs, and cameras.**\n- **Complete required cabling per SOW/cutsheet.**\n- **Stage phones — DO NOT connect POE.**\n- **Confirm FortiGate equipment is online with Backend Support/O’Reilly Help Desk.**\n\n**DAY 2 – CUTOVER**\n\n- **Obtain device pre-count and coordinate with MOD.**\n- **Move server and legacy device cabling to new FortiSwitches per SOW/cutsheet.**\n- **Connect Linux, VoIP phones, APs, cameras, and remaining devices as directed.**\n- **Disconnect/remove legacy network equipment as instructed.**\n- **Complete J16 reboot on Alarm Panel.**\n- **Verify all required devices/services are operational before checkout.**\n\n**DAY 3 – REMOVAL/RETURN**\n\n- **Remove all legacy equipment and cabling included in scope.**\n- **Separate equipment for UPS return and Store/DC return as outlined in SOW.**\n- **Complete required return documentation/photos.**\n- **Obtain final device count and checkout with Backend Support/O’Reilly Help Desk.**\n\n**IMPORTANT: Follow the attached SOW and cutsheet for all detailed cabling, port assignments, equipment placement, and required procedures.**\n\n**FINAL CHECKOUT:**\n\n**Call TRCA (940) 293-8232 before leaving site.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T08:00","end":"2026-10-08T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":600},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"ho