{"job":{"id":20100026,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"PROJECT CALL - NCR XR7 POS TERMINAL: NEED A TECH TO REPLACE AND REIMAGE XR7 REGISTER 09 AT STORE 791","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Ticket Description from Customer:</u></strong></p><p>PLEASE CALL THE HELP DESK WITH ETA</p><p><br></p><p>XR7 IS ON SITE, PNY DRIVE ONSITE</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE SCHEDULE A TECH TO REPLACE AND REIMAGE REGISTER 09 AT STORE 791</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE SET FOR EITHER BEFORE OR AFTER STORE HOURS -- AVAILABLE WINDOWS OF -- 7AM - 9AM OR 8:30PM - 10PM.</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE BRING A WIRED USB KEYBOARD, AS WELL AS THE INSTRUCTIONS ON HOW TO REIMAGE A WIRED XR7.</p><p><br></p><p>BEFORE STARTING, PLEASE DISCONNECT SIGCAP FROM XR7; KEEP THE SIG CAP UNPLUGGED THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE REIMAGE PROCESS*</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE REPLACE AND THEN REIMAGE THE REGISTER.</p><p><br></p><p>ONCE PROMPTED, YOU'LL NEED THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION:</p><p><br></p><p>REIMAGE INFORMATION*</p><p><br></p><p>REIMAGE SHOULD TAKE ABOUT 1 HOUR TO COMPLETE (START TO FINISH)</p><p><br></p><p>POS HOST NAME: 0791reg09 (REG MUST BE LOWERCASE)</p><p><br></p><p>IP ADDRESS: 172.22.216.29 /26</p><p><br></p><p>DEFAULT ROUTE: 172.22.216.1</p><p><br></p><p>TEST SYSTEM: C_PRODUCTION</p><p><br></p><p>Primary DNS Server IP Address: 10.242.145.19</p><p><br></p><p>Secondary DNS server IP address: 10.246.145.19</p><p><br></p><p>WHEN PROMPTED REBOOT THE LANE.</p><p><br></p><p>IF LANE REBOOTS AND THERE IS A RED X ON THE BOTTOM RIGHT OF THE SCREEN, CALL HELP DESK TO REISSUE THE DATA CACHE.</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE CALL WITH AN ETA AND AGAIN ONCE COMPLETED AND CONFIRMED WORKING WITH A MANAGER. PLEASE DRIVE CAREFULLY AND HAVE A GOOD DAY!</p><p><br></p><p>On Site Contact Name:&nbsp;</p><p>On Site Contact Phone:&nbsp;</p><p>On Site Contact Email:&nbsp;</p><p>Problem Type: CMOS BATTERY ERROR</p><p>Location Subtype:&nbsp;</p><p>Lane Number (if applicable): Register 9</p><p>Client Ticket Number/External Reference ID: ITSD-291053</p><p><strong><u>Lane Number:</u></strong></p><p>09</p><p><strong><u>Contact Directory</u></strong></p><p><strong>Pomeroy Dispatch Center: 704-414-5131 Operating: 24/7/365</strong></p><ul><li>Check-in/Check-out, Scheduling/Delays getting to site, Additional time on site, Shipping, TRS Password, <strong>After-Hours Support 8PM-8AM EST</strong>, Expenses preauthorization, all expenses must be preauthorized.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Pomeroy TSS – Technical Support: 704-414-5111 Operating: 8AM-8PM EST/365</strong></p><ul><li>Technical support, Documentation walkthrough, will engage TDJ support if required. <strong>***Do not contact TDJ for support.</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Trader Joe’s Service Desk: 855-844-8679 (Option #2) Operating: 4:30AM-11:30PM PST</strong></p><ul><li>Provider must Check-in with TDJ prior to beginning work and Check-out after work is completed.</li><li>If you can't reach the Trader Joe's Helpdesk, please wait 5 min before trying again. Once you dial their number, please press option 2 to speak with a helpdesk coordinator.</li><li><strong><em>Do not contact TDJ for support or work instructions, you must reach out to Pomeroy for support, if you reach out to TDJ for support, a penalty will be applied to the work order. </em></strong></li></ul><p><strong><em>﻿</em></strong></p><p><strong><u>Dress Code</u></strong>: Business casual. Need to maintain a Professional appearance.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Items to bring:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Basic Tool Set</li></ul><p><strong>*Only accept this job if you have all the required tools and are able to make the required time frame.*</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Technical Documentation:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Technical Resource Site:</strong> https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703</p><p>https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-whole-unit-removalreplacement</p><p>https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-bios-settings</p><p><strong>Login ID:</strong> fieldnation@client.pomeroy.com</p><p><strong>Login PW:&nbsp;</strong>If not provided in Messages section, please call Pomeroy Dispatch Center</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Parts Shipment:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Parts (if required) will be couriered to the site; arrival is typically within 4 hours of ticket creation. Please verify with the Pomeroy Dispatch Center that any part(s) has been delivered to resolve issue.</li><li>You may be scheduled to arrive prior to part arrival, due to SLA, please troubleshoot in advance to determine if part is actually required.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Parts Handling Requirements:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned Provider. DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE, unless authorized by Pomeroy.</li><li>&nbsp;If parts are left onsite, work order will not be approved until parts are confirmed shipped.</li><li>&nbsp;Required part must be dropped off asap to UPS: If work order was serviced during business hours, required part must be dropped off the same day until 7PM local time or UPS closing time. If work order was serviced during non-business hours, required part must be dropped off the next day by 12:00PM (noon) local time.</li><li>&nbsp;You must use the return label that comes inside the box shipped by Pomeroy, for additional return labels, please advise Pomeroy Dispatch Center to arrange for label(s) to be sent to you.</li><li>Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.</li><li>Provider may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.</li><li>Ship parts to Pomeroy using return label.&nbsp;Parts must be taken from the store and shipped, unless specified by Pomeroy.&nbsp;Do not leave parts onsite even if asked by TDJ Staff/Service Desk.</li></ol>","markdown":"**Ticket Description from Customer:**\n\nPLEASE CALL THE HELP DESK WITH ETA\n\nXR7 IS ON SITE, PNY DRIVE ONSITE\n\nPLEASE SCHEDULE A TECH TO REPLACE AND REIMAGE REGISTER 09 AT STORE 791\n\nPLEASE SET FOR EITHER BEFORE OR AFTER STORE HOURS -- AVAILABLE WINDOWS OF -- 7AM - 9AM OR 8:30PM - 10PM.\n\nPLEASE BRING A WIRED USB KEYBOARD, AS WELL AS THE INSTRUCTIONS ON HOW TO REIMAGE A WIRED XR7.\n\nBEFORE STARTING, PLEASE DISCONNECT SIGCAP FROM XR7; KEEP THE SIG CAP UNPLUGGED THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE REIMAGE PROCESS\\*\n\nPLEASE REPLACE AND THEN REIMAGE THE REGISTER.\n\nONCE PROMPTED, YOU'LL NEED THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION:\n\nREIMAGE INFORMATION\\*\n\nREIMAGE SHOULD TAKE ABOUT 1 HOUR TO COMPLETE (START TO FINISH)\n\nPOS HOST NAME: 0791reg09 (REG MUST BE LOWERCASE)\n\nIP ADDRESS: 172.22.216.29 /26\n\nDEFAULT ROUTE: 172.22.216.1\n\nTEST SYSTEM: C\\_PRODUCTION\n\nPrimary DNS Server IP Address: 10.242.145.19\n\nSecondary DNS server IP address: 10.246.145.19\n\nWHEN PROMPTED REBOOT THE LANE.\n\nIF LANE REBOOTS AND THERE IS A RED X ON THE BOTTOM RIGHT OF THE SCREEN, CALL HELP DESK TO REISSUE THE DATA CACHE.\n\nPLEASE CALL WITH AN ETA AND AGAIN ONCE COMPLETED AND CONFIRMED WORKING WITH A MANAGER. PLEASE DRIVE CAREFULLY AND HAVE A GOOD DAY!\n\nOn Site Contact Name:\n\nOn Site Contact Phone:\n\nOn Site Contact Email:\n\nProblem Type: CMOS BATTERY ERROR\n\nLocation Subtype:\n\nLane Number (if applicable): Register 9\n\nClient Ticket Number/External Reference ID: ITSD-291053\n\n**Lane Number:**\n\n09\n\n**Contact Directory**\n\n**Pomeroy Dispatch Center: 704-414-5131 Operating: 24/7/365**\n\n- Check-in/Check-out, Scheduling/Delays getting to site, Additional time on site, Shipping, TRS Password, **After-Hours Support 8PM-8AM EST**, Expenses preauthorization, all expenses must be preauthorized.\n\n**Pomeroy TSS – Technical Support: 704-414-5111 Operating: 8AM-8PM EST/365**\n\n- Technical support, Documentation walkthrough, will engage TDJ support if required. **\\*\\*\\*Do not contact TDJ for support.**\n\n**Trader Joe’s Service Desk: 855-844-8679 (Option #2) Operating: 4:30AM-11:30PM PST**\n\n- Provider must Check-in with TDJ prior to beginning work and Check-out after work is completed.\n- If you can't reach the Trader Joe's Helpdesk, please wait 5 min before trying again. Once you dial their number, please press option 2 to speak with a helpdesk coordinator.\n- ***Do not contact TDJ for support or work instructions, you must reach out to Pomeroy for support, if you reach out to TDJ for support, a penalty will be applied to the work order.***\n\n***﻿***\n\n**Dress Code**: Business casual. Need to maintain a Professional appearance.\n\n**Required Items to bring:**\n\n- Basic Tool Set\n\n**\\*Only accept this job if you have all the required tools and are able to make the required time frame.\\***\n\n**Technical Documentation:**\n\n**Technical Resource Site:** <https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703>\n\n<https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-whole-unit-removalreplacement>\n\n<https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703/trader-joes-ncr-7703-bios-settings>\n\n**Login ID:** fieldnation@client.pomeroy.com\n\n**Login PW:** If not provided in Messages section, please call Pomeroy Dispatch Center\n\n**Parts Shipment:**\n\n- Parts (if required) will be couriered to the site; arrival is typically within 4 hours of ticket creation. Please verify with the Pomeroy Dispatch Center that any part(s) has been delivered to resolve issue.\n- You may be scheduled to arrive prior to part arrival, due to SLA, please troubleshoot in advance to determine if part is actually required.\n\n**Parts Handling Requirements:**\n\n1. Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned Provider. DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE, unless authorized by Pomeroy.\n2. If parts are left onsite, work order will not be approved until parts are confirmed shipped.\n3. Required part must be dropped off asap to UPS: If work order was serviced during business hours, required part must be dropped off the same day until 7PM local time or UPS closing time. If work order was serviced during non-business hours, required part must be dropped off the next day by 12:00PM (noon) local time.\n4. You must use the return label that comes inside the box shipped by Pomeroy, for additional return labels, please advise Pomeroy Dispatch Center to arrange for label(s) to be sent to you.\n5. Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.\n6. Provider may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.\n7. Ship parts to Pomeroy using return label. Parts must be taken from the store and shipped, unless specified by Pomeroy. Do not leave parts onsite even if asked by TDJ Staff/Service Desk.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T20:30","end":"2026-10-05T22:30"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":70},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.48592622531743},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $70 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Dana doctor"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z