{"job":{"id":20100197,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"ARK| Sheetz 607| Drop Door E - Lock Troubleshoot/Adjustment","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Must call Work Order Manager to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>No Parts to be Shipped for this Dispatch</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>-Tools Required:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>__Standard Tool Set</strong></p>\n<p><strong>__Nut Drivers or Socket Set</strong></p>\n<p><strong>__Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth</strong></p>\n<p><strong>__Compressed air/Canned Air</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>-Issue: Dropf door issue.</strong> Customer tried slamming a package into hatch and now the hatch is registering open at all times, even though it's clearly closed. Sensor must have been broken or disengaged. Please check and troubleshoot if issue was a disconnected cable, or if the elock came loose and needs tightening. Please identify cause of issue and try to fix.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check in with WO Manager</li>\n<li><strong>Removal:</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Open service door with key</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Loosen mounting hardware for lock box bracket</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Adjust lockbox lower so the latch lines up properly.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>retighten mounting hardware</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Test with Customer</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Check network signal strength</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Call WO Manager to Check out</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>MUST RETURN ALL PARTS TO KIOSK SUPPORT UNDER RMA NUMBER ON TITLE OF WORK ORDER. Do not leave any parts on site. If we do not see return tracking when you close WO we will not process for payment until we do.</p>","markdown":"**Must call Work Order Manager to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty**\n\n**No Parts to be Shipped for this Dispatch**\n\n**-Tools Required:**\n\n**\\_\\_Standard Tool Set**\n\n**\\_\\_Nut Drivers or Socket Set**\n\n**\\_\\_Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth**\n\n**\\_\\_Compressed air/Canned Air**\n\n**-Issue: Dropf door issue.** Customer tried slamming a package into hatch and now the hatch is registering open at all times, even though it's clearly closed. Sensor must have been broken or disengaged. Please check and troubleshoot if issue was a disconnected cable, or if the elock came loose and needs tightening. Please identify cause of issue and try to fix.\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n- Check in with WO Manager\n- **Removal:**\n- **Open service door with key**\n- **Loosen mounting hardware for lock box bracket**\n- **Adjust lockbox lower so the latch lines up properly.**\n- **retighten mounting hardware**\n- **Test with Customer**\n- **Check network signal strength**\n- **Call WO Manager to Check out**\n\nMUST RETURN ALL PARTS TO KIOSK SUPPORT UNDER RMA NUMBER ON TITLE OF WORK ORDER. Do not leave any parts on site. If we do not see return tracking when you close WO we will not process for payment until we do.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T12:00","end":"2026-10-05T13:00","latestStart":"2026-10-05T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":115,"max":115},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":15.431359318525455},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $115 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"b