{"job":{"id":20100600,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pipeline Networks, Inc.","title":"B&L Supply - Network Equipment Install","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>BEFORE WALKING IN:</u></strong></p><ul><li>You are working with <strong>Pipeline Networks</strong></li><li>When you get on site, please check in with Pipeline by calling 949-502-0510, Hold the line without selecting an option.</li></ul><p><strong><u>CHECK IN &amp; CHECK OUT:</u></strong></p><p>Call Pipeline to <u>check in and to check out </u>at 949-502-0510 - Leave a message with your name and location if you get voicemail.</p><p><strong><u>ORDER DETAILS:</u></strong></p><p>1.Check in with your remote support agent.\n2.Locate on site contact.\n3.Install the following:\n3 - Yealink AX86R\n1 - GW7062E\n1 - GW7660EM\n4.Test internal calls.\n5.Get the temporary number from the remote tech and enable call forwarding on the phone. If that fails,\ncall the provider to do it.\n6.Train the customer on basic functions like transfer, conference etc.\n7. Take after pictures of all network equipment.\n8. Get the customer to sign off on this work order.\n9. Check out with your remote support agent.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>REQUIRED</u></strong></p><p>WHEN CHECKING OUT - GET A SIGNATURE FROM THE POC WHEN LEAVING. We need date and time with the signature. Thank you.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>PIPELINE NETWORKS CONTACTS:</u></strong></p><p>Call Kyle for technical questions at 949-407-6384</p><p><strong><u>CHECK IN &amp; CHECK OUT:</u></strong></p><p>Call Pipeline to check in and to check out at 949-502-0510 - Leave a message with your name and location if you get voicemail.</p>","markdown":"**BEFORE WALKING IN:**\n\n- You are working with **Pipeline Networks**\n- When you get on site, please check in with Pipeline by calling 949-502-0510, Hold the line without selecting an option.\n\n**CHECK IN & CHECK OUT:**\n\nCall Pipeline to check in and to check out at 949-502-0510 - Leave a message with your name and location if you get voicemail.\n\n**ORDER DETAILS:**\n\n1.Check in with your remote support agent. 2.Locate on site contact. 3.Install the following: 3 - Yealink AX86R 1 - GW7062E 1 - GW7660EM 4.Test internal calls. 5.Get the temporary number from the remote tech and enable call forwarding on the phone. If that fails, call the provider to do it. 6.Train the customer on basic functions like transfer, conference etc. 7. Take after pictures of all network equipment. 8. Get the customer to sign off on this work order. 9. Check out with your remote support agent.\n\n**REQUIRED**\n\nWHEN CHECKING OUT - GET A SIGNATURE FROM THE POC WHEN LEAVING. We need date and time with the signature. Thank you.\n\n**PIPELINE NETWORKS CONTACTS:**\n\nCall Kyle for technical questions at 949-407-6384\n\n**CHECK IN & CHECK OUT:**\n\nCall Pipeline to check in and to check out at 949-502-0510 - Leave a message with your name and location if you get voicemail.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T07:30","end":"2026-10-07T10:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":24.77514706401879},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $195 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2