{"job":{"id":20103909,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Core Technology Solutions","title":"Hilton SD-WAN: Meraki Router Install","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>PRIOR TO ARRIVAL ONSITE:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Download &amp; Install the ServiceNow App:</strong></p><ul><li>Follow the attached instructions to install the app on your device.</li></ul><p><strong>Account Setup &amp; Login:</strong></p><ul><li>On the login screen, click \"Forgot Password.\"</li><li>Enter your email address twice when prompted.</li><li>You will receive an SMS message on the device you're using to complete the setup.</li><li>Use the link provided in the SMS to set your password and complete your account setup.</li><li>If you encounter any issues during the setup process or have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out for assistance.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Install Meraki Switch</li><li>Install Server&nbsp;</li><li>Install Network Printers</li><li>Work with Support to complete cutover and confirm connectivity</li><li>Collect required collateral and check out with Support</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools/Skillset:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Server/Networking/Workstation experience</li><li>CompTIA A+, Net+, MCSE, MCP equivalent classroom training and 2+ years related industry experience or minimum of 3+</li><li>years minimum related industry experience.</li><li>Ability to comprehend industry standard network connectivity, navigation and software installation</li><li>Standard computer tool kit to include</li><li>Philips screwdriver</li><li>Flat head screwdriver</li><li>Flashlight</li><li>Charged Cell phone preferably an Android or iPhone with charger</li><li>Box Cutter</li><li>Pen</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Console cable</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Flat rate covers up to 2hrs onsite. Any additional time will be paid at $25 an hour</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment.&nbsp;All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum.&nbsp;If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate, subsequent days scheduled will be considered 'Cancelled', not 'Aborted'.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.</em></strong></p>","markdown":"**PRIOR TO ARRIVAL ONSITE:**\n\n**Download & Install the ServiceNow App:**\n\n- Follow the attached instructions to install the app on your device.\n\n**Account Setup & Login:**\n\n- On the login screen, click \"Forgot Password.\"\n- Enter your email address twice when prompted.\n- You will receive an SMS message on the device you're using to complete the setup.\n- Use the link provided in the SMS to set your password and complete your account setup.\n- If you encounter any issues during the setup process or have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out for assistance.\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n- Install Meraki Switch\n- Install Server\n- Install Network Printers\n- Work with Support to complete cutover and confirm connectivity\n- Collect required collateral and check out with Support\n\n**Required Tools/Skillset:**\n\n- Server/Networking/Workstation experience\n- CompTIA A+, Net+, MCSE, MCP equivalent classroom training and 2+ years related industry experience or minimum of 3+\n- years minimum related industry experience.\n- Ability to comprehend industry standard network connectivity, navigation and software installation\n- Standard computer tool kit to include\n- Philips screwdriver\n- Flat head screwdriver\n- Flashlight\n- Charged Cell phone preferably an Android or iPhone with charger\n- Box Cutter\n- Pen\n- Laptop\n- Console cable\n\n***Flat rate covers up to 2hrs onsite. Any additional time will be paid at $25 an hour***\n\n***Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment. All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.***\n\n***Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum. If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate, subsequent days scheduled will be considered 'Cancelled', not 'Aborted'.***\n\n***All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T09:00","end":"2026-10-12T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":70},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":35}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":7.744201242684556},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 