{"job":{"id":20105714,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Telesource, Inc","title":"Troubleshoot Music Player/Speakers","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope</strong></p><p>Dispatching tech due to music stopped playing in store.</p><p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p><ul><li>Professional dress is required.</li><li>All tools to be provided by tech.</li><li>Patch Cables</li><li>Multimeter, cable tester, tone generator, 3.5mm wired headphones/speaker</li><li>10 ft Ladder</li></ul><p><strong>Steps</strong></p><ol><li>Call Telesource at (704) 990-7649 to check in upon arrival.</li><li>Check-in with manager-on-duty.</li><li>Locate audio equipment.</li><li>Troubleshoot amp /speakers and cabling to diagnose and resolve trouble and repair if possible.</li><li>Call Telesource to check-out</li></ol><p><br></p><p>Attach before/after pictures of any changes made.</p>","markdown":"**Scope**\n\nDispatching tech due to music stopped playing in store.\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n- Professional dress is required.\n- All tools to be provided by tech.\n- Patch Cables\n- Multimeter, cable tester, tone generator, 3.5mm wired headphones/speaker\n- 10 ft Ladder\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. Call Telesource at (704) 990-7649 to check in upon arrival.\n2. Check-in with manager-on-duty.\n3. Locate audio equipment.\n4. Troubleshoot amp /speakers and cabling to diagnose and resolve trouble and repair if possible.\n5. Call Telesource to check-out\n\nAttach before/after pictures of any changes made.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-05T10:30","end":"2026-10-05T12:30","latestStart":"2026-10-05T15:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":37.1184099913577},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/5/2026, 10:30:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-0