{"job":{"id":20106559,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Pin pad failure, Replacement, Call Helpdesk once on site","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Scope of Work: The technician is required to address the pin pad failure issue reported for the Ingenico Lane3000 Payment Terminal with serial number <del>**********</del> The work involves replacing the faulty card reader, reimaging the device if necessary, and ensuring the payment terminal is fully operational. Testing and validation of the card reader functionality must be performed to confirm successful resolution. No special access instructions or FE support contact information are required for this task. Parts have been shipped to the site for the repair.</em></p>\n<p><em>Site Security Code #</em></p>\n<p><em>Customer Incident # <del>*******************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Clients present issue: Pin pad failure</em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Helpdesk number of the customer: <del>******* ******** ********************************* **************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>If no answer from the backup number, call again and leave a voice message with your call back number</em></p>\n<p><em>Please review the repair plans in the link below</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***********************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Other Instructions:</em></p>\n<p><em>If assistance is needed, please call:<del>************************ * *</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Required Tool List:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><strong>Completion Requirements:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Closing Notes are required to be provided before leaving the location.</em></strong> <em>These notes should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only.&nbsp;If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be</em> <strong><em>a detailed and concise statement about the work performed</em></strong><em>.</em><strong><em>Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.</em></strong></p>\n<p><em>2.</em> <strong>Part Information</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Unused Parts</strong>: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Used Parts</strong>: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Missing Return Label</strong>: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.</p>\n<p><strong>General Rules</strong>: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.</p>","markdown":"1\\. **Scope of Work** **includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.**\n\n*Scope of Work: The technician is required to address the pin pad failure issue reported for the Ingenico Lane3000 Payment Terminal with serial number \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* The work involves replacing the faulty card reader, reimaging the device if necessary, and ensuring the payment terminal is fully operational. Testing and validation of the card reader functionality must be performed to confirm successful resolution. No special access instructions or FE support contact information are required for this task. Parts have been shipped to the site for the repair.*\n\n*Site Security Code #*\n\n*Customer Incident # \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Clients present issue: Pin pad failure*\n\n*Estimated time: 2 hours*\n\n*Helpdesk number of the customer: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*If no answer from the backup number, call again and leave a voice message with your call back number*\n\n*Please review the repair plans in the link below*\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Other Instructions:*\n\n*If assistance is needed, please call:\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\**\n\n*Required Tool List:*\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n**Completion Requirements:**\n\n***Closing Notes are required to be provided before leaving the location.*** *These notes should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only. If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be* ***a detailed and concise statement about the work performed****.****Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.***\n\n*2.* **Part Information**:\n\n**Unused Parts**: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Used Parts**: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Missing Return Label**: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.\n\n**General Rules**: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T11:00","end":"2026-10-06T12:45","latestStart":"2026-10-06T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":80},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.75,"distance":7.943755978464647},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $80 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Dana doctor"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-