ite POC to locate the kiosk.\n3. Open the kiosk and inspect for any damages.\n4. Follow the attached installation guide (**Compact\\_AMZInstallDocumentation2025.pdf**).\n5. Make sure power is connected and the unit is powered on.\n6. Carefully load the label roll into the printer and center the sensor if not already aligned with the indicator.\n7. Call **KIOSK Support** to confirm the unit is online, checking in, and properly configured.\n8. **Network:**\n9. **WIFI SSID:** AmzKiosk\n10. **WIFI PW:**3XNHdLa!kQlVRYq\n11. Do not leave the site unless released by our **KIOSK Support Team** or unless a new return date has been agreed upon if any issues arise.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T09:00","end":"2026-10-16T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":59.65764912221365},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarov