{"job":{"id":20108408,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"ARK | SHEETZ-659 | Display Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p>This work order is to get our customer back up and running.</p><p>Only accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.</p><p><strong>Must call the Work Order Manager to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Standard Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>Standard Tool Set</li><li>Nut Drivers or Socket Set</li><li>Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth</li><li>A to B USB Cable</li><li>Compressed air/Canned Air</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p><p><strong>Check in with Work Order Manager</strong></p><p>Troubleshoot<strong>:</strong></p><ul><li>Check power at wall and trace to inside kiosk to PC</li><li>Verify power to PC and peripherals from the internal JBOX</li><li>Verify power indicator lights on power supplies inside kiosk</li><li>Reseat power connections</li><li>Perform reset of PC (Hold power button on PC for 30 seconds)</li><li>Troubleshoot issue or determine next step w/KIS</li><li>Call KIS to confirm PC reporting online</li><li>Test with customer</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Call the Work Order Manger for Checkout</p><p>Company: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.</p><p>346 S Arthur Ave.</p><p>Louisville, CO 80027</p><p>(303) 926-3154</p>","markdown":"This work order is to get our customer back up and running.\n\nOnly accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.\n\n**Must call the Work Order Manager to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty**\n\n**The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts a