have personally completed the work described.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All information submitted is true and accurate.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All required photographs accurately depict the completed work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">They have read and agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work**We are seeking a reliable and professional technician to complete a retail display installation at a national retail location. The display will have already been assembled and shipped to the store prior to your arrival.\n\n**MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE\\*\\*\\***\n\n<https://form.fillout.com/t/v5Rd4A88Kfus>\n\n**﻿Estimated Time on Site**Approximately **45–75 minutes**, depending on the store layout and display location.\n\nThe selected technician will be responsible for transporting the display from the store's receiving area to its designated sales floor location, completing the installation, documenting the completed work, and leaving the work area clean and professional.\n\n- Check in with store management upon arrival.\n- Locate the shipped display in the receiving area.\n- Inspect the display for any visible damage prior to installation.\n- Transport the display safely to the approved sales floor location.\n- Remove all protective packaging.\n- Position and level the display according to store management's direction.\n- Install any required display components or signage, if applicable.\n- Remove and properly dispose of all packaging and installation debris.\n- Take required before-and-after photographs.\n- Complete the required digital completion report before leaving the site.\n\n**Professionalism & Appearance**- Maintain a clean, neat, and professional appearance.\n- Wear a plain collared shirt (no offensive 