nce with Customer Requirements**Producer agrees to comply with all customer site rules, store policies, check-in procedures, and instructions provided by authorized customer representatives.\n\n**7. Photographs & Documentation**Producer agrees to accurately complete all required documentation, photographs, signatures, and reporting before submitting this work order. Submission of false, incomplete, misleading, or altered information may result in non-payment and removal from future assignments.\n\n**8. Payment**Payment is contingent upon:\n\n- Successful completion of the assigned scope of work.\n- Submission of all required documentation.\n- Compliance with these Terms & Conditions.\n\n**9. Changes to Scope**Producer shall not perform additional work outside the authorized scope of work outlined by posting without prior approval from Finish Line Services LLC.\n\n**10. Confidentiality**Producer agrees not to disclose customer information, pricing, internal procedures, photographs, or proprietary information obtained during the course of the assignment.\n\n**11. Insurance**Producer represents that they maintain any insurance required by applicable law or by their Producer agreement and accepts responsibility for losses arising from their own acts or omissions to the extent permitted by law.\n\n**12. No Employment Relationship**Acceptance of this work order does not create an employment relationship, partnership, joint venture, or agency relationship between Producer and Finish Line Services LLC.\n\n**13. Limitation of Liability**To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finish Line Services LLC shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising from or related to the performance of this work order. Nothing in these terms limits liability where such limitation is prohibited by law.\n\n**14. Indemnification**To the extent permitted by applicable law, Producer agrees to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Finish Line Services LLC and its officers, employees, and clients from claims, damages, liabilities, costs, and expenses arising out of Producer's negligent acts, omissions, or breach of these Terms & Conditions.\n\n**15. Acknowledgement**By accepting this work order, completing this work order, and submitting the completion report, Producer certifies that:\n\n- They have personally completed the work described.\n- All information submitted is true and accurate.\n- All required photographs accurately depict the completed work.\n- They have read and agree to these Terms & Conditions.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T09:00","end":"2026-10-12T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-12T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":64.15652303803307},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovks