{"job":{"id":"3411795850","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey","description":"DESCRIPTION: Starlink Standard Kit - Survey for Installation<br><br>*** Tech MUST call VEG Network Team at 6465132484 upon arrival to ensure access as this is a secure site. *** <br><br>Summary:<br>You will be surveying the customer’s site to determine where to mount the Standard Starlink Dish, where to mount the Starlink Power Supply, and how the antenna cable will run from the Starlink Router/Power Supply to the antenna.  The cable must be able to route in a professional manner and cannot be run on the ground or between doorways<br><br>Standard Starlink Dish – Custom Starlink cable for the dish max distance is 147ft from where the Starlink router must be set on a rack and plugged into a power outlet.  Survey with this limitation in mind and where the Router will be located<br><br>Per tech: \"To provide the detailed plans, specifications, and mark-ups requested by the customer, I will need to schedule a site revisit with a tall ladder to properly access and inspect the roof.\"<br> <br>Per client:<br>\"I left you a message. Please see the attached plan and specification example from an installation that I was able to get approved. I have discussed the proposed Starlink installation with the landlord. Before they can decide, they are requesting plans and specifications clearly showing what you are proposing to install and how the installation will be completed. Once the plans and specifications are reviewed and approved, we can move forward with putting the necessary agreement in place.\"","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T10:00","end":"2026-10-09T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"starlin