{"job":{"id":"8434384948","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Granite GRID Lite router CMTU0484 is offline","description":"PD Approved by NOC<br>Fiber Tech Required<br><br>Required Equipment:<br>[incase UPS is dead]<br>Multi-port Surge protector<br>15ft of power extension cable<br>Voltage meter<br><br>DO NOT REBOOT OR REPLACE ANY EQUIPMENT UNLESS INSTRUCTED BY NOC<br>Issue: CMTU0484 - NSONID0000000094 - is offline<br> <br>LCON: <br>Mall Security: (919)874-5363<br><br>Router info:<br>CMTU0484<br>NSONID0000000094<br>198.18.136.151<br><br>Router Location:<br>Device is located in the Telco room on the second floor near H&amp;M<br><br>Scope of Work<br>*** IMPORTANT: Tech must call into Granite NOC :844.492.2557 opt. 4 upon arrival and before departing the site. ***<br><br>Check for physical connectivity: Ensure that all cables are securely plugged in and that all connectors are in good condition. If there is a wireless connection, make sure that the signal strength is adequate.<br><br>Check for power: If a device is not receiving power, it will not function. Make sure that all devices are properly plugged in and powered on.<br><br>Check for environmental factors: Check for any environmental factors that may be affecting the network, such as temperature, humidity, or electromagnetic interference.<br><br>Check for hardware failures: If a device is not functioning properly, it may be due to a hardware failure. Check for any damaged components and replace them if necessary.<br><br>Test connectivity: Use diagnostic tools to test connectivity between devices, such as a cable tester or a network analyzer. This will help identify any issues with the physical layer of the network.<br><br>Required Equipment: Tech will need bring fiber testing tools, Buttset, cable tester/certifier, laptop PC (Windows 7 or higher) with serial and Ethernet ports, console cable, administrator login, AC power adapter, PUTTY, extension cord (25’ min), ability to create a wireless hotspot for us to remote to laptop if necessary, 500ft cat5e/cat6 cable, 200ft rj45, min 10 male rj-45 heads, min 10 female to female rj-45 connectors; 4 rj-45 wall jacks and plates; min 4 rj-45 wall jacks and plates, at least 4 Biscuit Jacks, extension ladder.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T11:00","end":"2026-10-06T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":300},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":1.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":75,"baseAmount":300,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-08T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T15:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Dana doctor"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-07T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"DMV"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/