 RJ-45 capable network interface card (NIC) port.</p>\n<p>Cellular Phone with Camera and Charger</p>\n<p>Label Maker with Labels and Tags</p>\n<p>Tape Measure</p>\n<p>Voltage Meter</p>\n<p><br /></p>\nRequired Tools:\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>6 foot Ladder</p>\n<p>Crimping tool: Ability to make RJ11 or RJ45 jacks and terminate ends efficiently</p>\n<p>Toner: for Identify existing in house wiring to extend circuits</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Assorted size drill bits</p>\n<p>Drill with Charger if cordless.</p>\n<p>Wire cutters: Cut wires efficiently</p>\n<p>Punch down tool with 110 &amp; 66 Blades: Accurently punch down twisted pair</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>6 foot Ladder</p>\n<p>Crimping tool: Ability to make RJ11 or RJ45 jacks and terminate ends efficiently</p>\n<p>Toner: for Identify existing in house wiring to extend circuits</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Assorted size drill bits</p>\n<p>Drill with Charger if cordless.</p>\n<p>Wire cutters: Cut wires efficiently</p>\n<p>Punch down tool with 110 &amp; 66 Blades: Accurently punch down twisted pair</p>","markdown":"Call Direct: 888-443-4375 Option 0\n\nWith as many open work orders currently on FN, there is a very long back order of requests. So if you call in they will work with you to get assigned.\n\nJob Description: Job Description:GGE Tech will meet with the TKElevator technician to complete the elevator run and the elevator handoff.\n\nTKE tech needs to grant GGE Tech access to the elevator shaft to complete the quoted run and connect the line to the elevator.\n\nElevator line is located on the PIAB CDS 9090 SN 216295 at FXS 4- 9