{"job":{"id":20115355,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SHI - Corp Services","title":"RAL - 3 Desks with Two Monitors","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Issue</u></strong></p>\n<p>One equipment move from Desk to Conference room Table, Move desk, then 3 desk setups</p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Transfer equipment from desk in conference room to conference room table. Move desk into area with other users. After equipment/desk move... Setup 2 Desks with 2 monitors &amp; Laptops including Web Cam, keyboard, mouse, Headset. Contact onsite contact for instructions. Make sure pictures have camera and headset visible, dispose of all trash.</p>\n<p>- toolsOrEquipment: Basic Tools<em>.</em></p>\n<p><strong><u>Required Tools Needed:</u></strong></p>\n<p><em>Basic Tools</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Escalation Process:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Please call work order manager for any questions or issues while onsite</p>\n<p><strong><u>Dress Code:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Polo, Non-ripped Jeans, Closed toe shoes&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Material Reimbursement:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cat6 Cables .52 cents per foot</li>\n<li>Cat6 Patch cables 1-3ft $4.60 /ea</li>\n<li>Cat6 Patch cables 10ft + $8.00/ea</li>\n<li>Faceplate $3.50 / ea</li>\n<li>Keystones $5.00/ea</li>\n<li>Cable ends $2.50/ea</li>\n<li>Velcro strips .75 cents each</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time onsite above estimate must be approved by work order manager BEFORE the time has lapsed</li>\n<li>Travel expense must be approved PRIOR to accepting job</li>\n<li>Material reimbursement will be approved at the cost above</li>\n<li>NOTE: any cable runs performed - must include validation - labeling, pass/fail tests, and show cable length. Service loops - no longer than 10-12 ft.</li>\n<li><strong><u>Failure to CORRECTLY complete the tasks listed in the work order - and/or leaving site without contacting WO Manager - will result in a minimum 25% deduction of payment.</u></strong></li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Issue**\n\nOne equipment move from Desk to Conference room Table, Move desk, then 3 desk setups\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nTransfer equipment from desk in conference room to conference room table. Move desk into area with other users. After equipment/desk move... Setup 2 Desks with 2 monitors & Laptops including Web Cam, keyboard, mouse, Headset. Contact onsite contact for instructions. Make sure pictures have camera and headset visible, dispose of all trash.\n\n\\- toolsOrEquipment: Basic Tools*.*\n\n**Required Tools Needed:**\n\n*Basic Tools*\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\nPlease call work order manager for any questions or issues while onsite\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\nPolo, Non-ripped Jeans, Closed toe shoes\n\n**Material Reimbursement:**\n\n- Cat6 Cables .52 cents per foot\n- Cat6 Patch cables 1-3ft $4.60 /ea\n- Cat6 Patch cables 10ft + $8.00/ea\n- Faceplate $3.50 / ea\n- Keystones $5.00/ea\n- Cable ends $2.50/ea\n- Velcro strips .75 cents each\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy:**\n\n- Time onsite above estimate must be approved by work order manager BEFORE the time has lapsed\n- Travel expense must be approved PRIOR to accepting job\n- Material reimbursement will be approved at the cost above\n- NOTE: any cable runs performed - must include validation - labeling, pass/fail tests, and show cable length. Service loops - no longer than 10-12 ft.\n- **Failure to CORRECTLY complete the tasks listed in the work order - and/or leaving site without contacting WO Manager - will result in a minimum 25% deduction of payment.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T11:00","end":"2026-10-09T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":400},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":6,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance