{"job":{"id":20115076,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Infinity Retail Services","title":"Replace Interior Digital Window Display Monitor","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in&nbsp;Digital Signage and Monitors</li><li>Tech is required to&nbsp;install the new Interior Digital Window Display monitor using the provided guide. Power on the monitor with default settings, confirm Verizon content is playing on both interior and exterior DWD monitors, and leave the old monitor and bracket for Verizon to dispose of.</li><li>The new interior monitor will be on-site before the technician arrives.</li><li>The estimated duration will be&nbsp;approximately 60 - 90 minutes</li><li>Tech will need to lift the monitor approximately 4 feet off the ground</li><li>Monitor is a 49-inch monitor</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Business Casual</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>Small step ladder, cordless drill, #2 and #3 Phillips tip, socket set, right angle tool, Laptop with micro SD Card Reader</li><li>If bolts get stripped, drill bits may be needed to drill them out.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ol><li>Contact the WO manager to confirm the Scope of Work and Scheduling</li><li>Download the attached Guide - Review the IRS Interior DWD monitor installation instructions provided as a reference.</li><li>Confirm receipt of all necessary hardware: monitor.</li></ol><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check in to the work order and introduce yourself to the on-site contact. You are representing Infinity Retail Services while on-site.</li><li>Upload/take a Before Photo of the Digital Window Display Fixture</li><li>Install the new monitor using the provided guide.</li><li>Power on the monitor and configure it using default settings only &mdash; no internet connection is required.</li><li>Confirm that Verizon content is playing on both the newly installed interior DWD monitor and the existing exterior DWD monitor.</li><li>Upload/take Inward-facing side of the Digital Window Display fixture playing Verizon content.</li><li>Upload/take Outward-facing side of the Digital Window Display fixture playing Verizon content.</li><li>Leave the old monitor and bracket onsite for Verizon Wireless to handle disposal.</li><li>Upload/Take image Outside of Verizon Store (storefront)</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Clear Photo of Digital Window Display Fixture - BEFORE installation</li><li>Clear after photos of the installed monitor</li><li>Confirmation notes verifying content playback on both monitors</li><li>Documentation of any issues encountered during installation</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>Communication Directory:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on the work order, discuss with the WO manager&nbsp;</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to the WO manager</li><li>The WO Manager is Alan Gabe. You can contact him via text or call at 715-641-0369</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Any additional hours and expenses must be pre-approved by the WO manager</li><li>Any additional hours and costs incurred without prior approval will be denied</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Digital Signage and Monitors\n- Tech is required to install the new Interior Digital Window Display monitor using the provided guide. Power on the monitor with default settings, confirm Verizon content is playing on both interior and exterior DWD monitors, and leave the old monitor and bracket for Verizon to dispose of.\n- The new interior monitor will be on-site before the technician arrives.\n- The estimated duration will be approximately 60 - 90 minutes\n- Tech will need to lift the monitor approximately 4 feet off the ground\n- Monitor is a 49-inch monitor\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Business Casual\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- Small step ladder, cordless drill, #2 and #3 Phillips tip, socket set, right angle tool, Laptop with micro SD Card Reader\n- If bolts get stripped, drill bits may be needed to drill them out.\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Contact the WO manager to confirm the Scope of Work and Scheduling\n2. Download the attached Guide - Review the IRS Interior DWD monitor installation instructions provided as a reference.\n3. Confirm receipt of all necessary hardware: monitor.\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check in to the work order and introduce yourself to the on-site contact. You are representing Infinity Retail Services while on-site.\n2. Upload/take a Before Photo of the Digital Window Display Fixture\n3. Install the new monitor using the provided guide.\n4. Power on the monitor and configure it using default settings only — no internet connection is required.\n5. Confirm that Verizon content is playing on both the newly installed interior DWD monitor and the existing exterior DWD monitor.\n6. Upload/take Inward-facing side of the Digital Window Display fixture playing Verizon content.\n7. Upload/take Outward-facing side of the Digital Window Display fixture playing Verizon content.\n8. Leave the old monitor and bracket onsite for Verizon Wireless to handle disposal.\n9. Upload/Take image Outside of Verizon Store (storefront)\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Clear Photo of Digital Window Display Fixture - BEFORE installation\n2. Clear after photos of the installed monitor\n3. Confirmation notes verifying content playback on both monitors\n4. Documentation of any issues encountered during installation\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on the work order, discuss with the WO manager\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to the WO manager\n- The WO Manager is Alan Gabe. You can contact him via text or call at 715-641-0369\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Any additional hours and expenses must be pre-approved by the WO manager\n- Any additional hours and costs incurred without prior approval will be denied","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T10:00","end":"2026-10-07T11:30","latestStart":"2026-10-07T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":210,"max":210},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":45.53088693671964},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"fixed","counterRate":140,"baseAmount":210,"estHours":1.5,"travelExpense":70,"payStructure":null},"reason":"TRAVEL_REQUIRED","rejectDetails":"Travel required (45.53088693671964mi reported + 10mi padding = 55.53088693671964mi > 20mi)"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-07T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"DMV"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | 