{"job":{"id":20086873,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ProAct Services","title":"Rack Room- Store POS Re-Installation (site remodel)","description":{"html":"<p>This store is undergoing a remodel, and as a result needs their technology to be re-installed (equipment was de-installed during a prior visit, before the remodel occurred).</p>\n<p><strong>Estimated time on site is approximately 5-6 hours.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The following items will be re-installed:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Between 2 - 4 POS</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">POS, including: PC, monitor, cash drawer, printer, pinpad, pinad mount, hand scanner, Sensormatic tag deactivator/detacher, keyboard, mouse, power strips/surge protectors)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Site completion requirements are:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photos of back office/POS showing all equipment re-installed</li>\n<li>Completed Sign off sheet</li>\n<li>Serial # sheet of installed items</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The technician will need to provide:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard technician toolkit (screwdrivers, drill with various bits, etc)</li>\n<li>Box cutter</li>\n<li>Other tools as required for this type of work.</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"This store is undergoing a remodel, and as a result needs their technology to be re-installed (equipment was de-installed during a prior visit, before the remodel occurred).\n\n**Estimated time on site is approximately 5-6 hours.**\n\n**The following items will be re-installed:**\n\n- Between 2 - 4 POS\n- POS, including: PC, monitor, cash drawer, printer, pinpad, pinad mount, hand scanner, Sensormatic tag deactivator/detacher, keyboard, mouse, power strips/surge protectors)\n\n**Site completion requirements are:**\n\n- Photos of back office/POS showing all equipment re-installed\n- Completed Sign off sheet\n- Serial # sheet of installed items\n\n**The technician will need to provide:**\n\n- Standard technician toolkit (screwdrivers, drill with various bits, etc)\n- Box cutter\n- Other tool