{"job":{"id":20115619,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Celerity Fiber LLC","title":"RECONNECTION DTV","description":{"html":"<p>Overview:</p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in: DTV installation experience/ Satellite TV</li><li>Tech is required to: Perform Appointment type xxxx TV 1 model xxx reciever</li><li>DirecTV acc:</li><li>Estimated duration will be: N/A</li></ul><p>Dress Code:</p><ul><li>Long Pants/clean/closed shoes</li></ul><p>Tools Required:</p><ul><li>AIM Meter (Directv</li><li>Super Buddy Meter (Dish Network)</li><li>QAM Meter (L&amp;I Properties)</li><li>Inductive Cable Toner (Fox &amp; Hound)</li><li>Pocket Cable Toner</li><li>Diagonal Cutter (Dikes)</li><li>Needle Nose Pliers</li><li>Cordless 1/4&#34; Impact Driver</li><li>Cordless 1/2&#34; Hammer Drill</li><li>Drill Bits &amp; Impact tips/adapters</li><li>RG6 Cable Stripper</li><li>RG11 Cable Stripper</li><li>RG6 Coax Cable Linear Crimper</li><li>RG11 Coax Cable Linear Crimper</li><li>Cat5/6 Cable Crimper</li><li>Coax Security Sleeve tool</li><li>Phillips and Traditional Screwdrivers</li><li>7/16&#34; Open end Wrench</li><li>1/2&#34; Open end Wrench&#65279;</li><li>Cresce</li></ul><p><br/></p><p>Scope of Work:<br/><br/><span>Check the connections inside and outside the unit. Verify the connections in the network closet, SWM, and polarity locker, and measure the signal strength at each connection. Ensure the satellite dish alignment using the AIM meter. After confirming the correct percentage of signal strength, check if the DTV box is functional or needs to be replaced. Restore the DTV signal</span><br/><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>Pre-Site Requirements</p><p>1. Call Tech line <del>************</del> when Technician is on their way to the site.</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>On-Site Tasks</p><ul><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Celerity by Adcomm while onsite</li><li>Arrive on site on time and cleanly dressed.</li><li> Perform diagnosis 