{"job":{"id":20110753,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"XTIUM","title":"REPLACE ADTRAN NETVANTA 1234P SWITCH","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">The estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours, but varies from site to site. XTIUM expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete or tech is released by customer or XTIUM Technical Support Center.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">Timely arrival to site is mandatory. If a problem prevents you from arriving on time you must call prior to the scheduled time &amp; advise of your status.</span></p><p><u>READ AND FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS IN THIS TICKET AS FAILURE TO DO&nbsp;SO MAY RESULT IN NON PAYMENT FOR THE VISIT</u></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>Skills Required and ‘Highlighted’ Tools Required</strong></p><ul><li><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Cisco routers require a USB to DB9 serial adapter and DB9 to RJ45 Cisco console cable</li><li>Adtran routers require a USB to DB9 serial adapter and DB9 male to DB9 female serial cable</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>High Level Work Flow</strong></p><ol><li>Tech will arrive on the work order.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">You <strong><u>DO NOT</u></strong> need to call us if you checked in on the platform.</li><li>Tech will check in with the store manager on duty</li><li>Show manager on duty the work order and a valid photo ID</li><li>Tech to contact TSC by calling into bridge line provided in the work order messages or support number provided in Confidential Information Section if there is no bridge number in the messages.</li><li>TSC and/or Customer and Tech will complete scope of work (including as-built documentation) with customer, as detailed below in work order</li><li>Upon completion of call, Tech will close call with TSC, PRIOR to leaving site and provide closing information.</li><li>While on site if you have any issues, call into bridge line provided in messages or XTIUM Support Desk at 877-677-8271.</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Attachment List</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">Standard Tool List</span></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Parts Requirements</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">If parts are to be returned - Please leave them onsite with the MOD.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>Detailed Instructions&nbsp;</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(72, 73, 23);\">Please see detailed instructions under the ‘Confidential Information’</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"**Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations**\n\nThe estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours, but varies from site to site. XTIUM expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete or tech is released by customer or XTIUM Technical Support Center.\n\nTimely arrival to site is mandatory. If a problem prevents you from arriving on time you must call prior to the scheduled time & advise of your status.\n\nREAD AND FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS IN THIS TICKET AS FAILURE TO DO SO MAY RESULT IN NON PAYMENT FOR THE VISIT\n\n**Skills Required and ‘Highlighted’ Tools Required**\n\n- Cisco routers require a USB to DB9 serial adapter and DB9 to RJ45 Cisco console cable\n- Adtran routers require a USB to DB9 serial adapter and DB9 male to DB9 female serial cable\n\n**High Level Work Flow**\n\n1. Tech will arrive on the work order.\n2. You **DO NOT** need to call us if you checked in on the platform.\n3. Tech will check in with the store manager on duty\n4. Show manager on duty the work order and a valid photo ID\n5. Tech to contact TSC by calling into bridge line provided in the work order messages or support number provided in Confidential Information Section if there is no bridge number in the messages.\n6. TSC and/or Customer and Tech will complete scope of work (including as-built documentation) with customer, as detailed below in work order\n7. Upon completion of call, Tech will close call with TSC, PRIOR to leaving site and provide closing information.\n8. While on site if you have any issues, call into bridge line provided in messages or XTIUM Support Desk at 877-677-8271.\n\n**Attachment List**\n\nStandard Tool List\n\n**Parts Requirements**\n\nIf parts are to be returned - Please leave them onsite with the MOD.\n\n**Detailed Instructions**\n\nPlease see detailed instructions under the ‘Confidential Information’","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T10:45","end":"2026-10-07T12:45"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":80},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":100.59687924937016},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"DISTANCE_TOO_FAR","rejectDetails":"Reported one-way distance 100.59687924937016mi exceeds 100mi limit"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-07T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"DMV"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-Th