resce\n\nScope of Work:  \n  \nCheck the connections inside and outside the unit. Verify the connections in the network closet, SWM, and polarity locker, and measure the signal strength at each connection. Ensure the satellite dish alignment using the AIM meter. After confirming the correct percentage of signal strength, check if the DTV box is functional or needs to be replaced. Restore the DTV signal\n\nPre-Site Requirements\n\n1\\. Call Tech line \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* when Technician is on their way to the site.\n\nOn-Site Tasks\n\n- Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Celerity by Adcomm while onsite\n- Arrive on site on time and cleanly dressed.\n- Perform diagnosis of the issue stated in the work order.\n- Make any appropriate repairs.\n- Verify customer’s system is working.\n- For installations please train the customer how to use the system.\n- Document the repair or installation you made, and all parts used\n- Record Arrival and departure time.\n- Have customer sign the work order.\n- Take pictures of functional TVs and work completed.\n\nRequired On-Site Deliverables\n\n1. Signed work order\n2. Pictures of the work completed and include device information (model/Receiver ID/Access Card/MAC address\\*/Serial number\\*) \\* only for client and mini genies\n3. Description of the work with parts used\n\nEscalation Process:\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, Call Celerity's Tech line at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nAdditional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy\n\n- additional hours or expenses need to be pre-approved by Chip Packard/Rocio Serrano for MDU and for L&I from Rennick Carter.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T08:00","end":"2026-10-06T09:00","latestStart":"2026-10-06T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":9.25538054252292},"result":{"eligible":fal