{"job":{"id":20117665,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Connect America - Home Health","title":"Install Personal Emergency Response Unit - Anelto","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><p>PLEASE REACH OUT TO THE CUSTOMER WITHIN 24 HOURS OF ASSIGNMENT, TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT.</p><p><br></p><p>COMPLETED INSTALLATION CHECKLIST AND SIF FORM ARE REQUIRED FOR PAYMENT, EFFECTIVE 4/15/24. Failure to provide required documents will result in the fixed rate being reduced by $15 per incomplete document.</p><p><br></p><p>Typically a 20-30 minute job</p><p>Technician will install an Anelto Personal Emergency Response system, in our customer's home</p><p>The device will be shipped to the customer's home, unless otherwise specified.</p><p>**INSTALL INSTRUCTIONS HAVE BEEN UPLOADED TO THE WORK ORDER**</p><p><br></p><p>TECHNICIAN MUST BE BACKGROUND AND DRUG TESTED</p><p><br></p><p><strong>FAILED INSTALLS:</strong>&nbsp;If&nbsp;the Service Provider arrives at the customer's home, for a scheduled appointment and the customer or their caregiver refuses to allow the Service Provider to complete the job, or the customer is not home; then the Service Provider must call Connect America at&nbsp;<strong>800-215-4206</strong>&nbsp;and speak with the first available operator. The operator will attempt to call with the customer, to allow you to complete the install.</p><p><strong>**IF INSTALL CANNOT BE ATTEMPTED, FOR ANY REASON, THE FIXED RATE WILL BE REDUCED BY $30.00.**IF CUSTOMER IS A NO-SHOW FOR A SCHEDULED APPOINTMENT, TECHNICIAN MUST PROVIDE EVIDENCE THAT HE/SHE WAS AT THE LOCATION BY SUBMITTING PHOTO OF RESIDENCE, INCLUDING VERIFICATION OF HOUSE NUMBER.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Failure&nbsp;to follow those steps will result in the cancellation of the Work Order&nbsp;as a \"No-Show\" by the Service Provider. </strong></p>","markdown":"PLEASE REACH OUT TO THE CUSTOMER WITHIN 24 HOURS OF ASSIGNMENT, TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT.\n\nCOMPLETED INSTALLATION CHECKLIST AND SIF FORM ARE REQUIRED FOR PAYMENT, EFFECTIVE 4/15/24. Failure to provide required documents will result in the fixed rate being reduced by $15 per incomplete document.\n\nTypically a 20-30 minute job\n\nTechnician will install an Anelto Personal Emergency Response system, in our customer's home\n\nThe device will be shipped to the customer's home, unless otherwise specified.\n\n\\*\\*INSTALL INSTRUCTIONS HAVE BEEN UPLOADED TO THE WORK ORDER\\*\\*\n\nTECHNICIAN MUST BE BACKGROUND AND DRUG TESTED\n\n**FAILED INSTALLS:** If the Service Provider arrives at the customer's home, for a scheduled appointment and the customer or their caregiver refuses to allow the Service Provider to complete the job, or the customer is not home; then the Service Provider must call Connect America at **800-215-4206** and speak with the first available operator. The operator will attempt to call with the customer, to allow you to complete the install.\n\n**\\*\\*IF INSTALL CANNOT BE ATTEMPTED, FOR ANY REASON, THE FIXED RATE WILL BE REDUCED BY $30.00.\\*\\*IF CUSTOMER IS A NO-SHOW FOR A SCHEDULED APPOINTMENT, TECHNICIAN MUST PROVIDE EVIDENCE THAT HE/SHE WAS AT THE LOCATION BY SUBMITTING PHOTO OF RESIDENCE, INCLUDING VERIFICATION OF HOUSE NUMBER.**\n\n**Failure to follow those steps will result in the cancellation of the Work Order as a \"No-Show\" by the Service Provider.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T09:00","end":"2026-10-10T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":12.735311203571683},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/6/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","en