{"job":{"id":20117706,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Gaichu Managed Services","title":"DISPATCH REQUEST - Cheescake Factory - BATTLEBORO, United States","description":{"html":"<p><strong>SOW:</strong></p><p>Tech needs very experienced.</p><ol><li>Install (or confirm they already have been installed) m.2 boot drives on the single NX-1175S-g8 we shipped to each site&nbsp;</li><li>swap the HBA controller with the correct one we've previously shipped on-site</li><li>recable the HBA with the storage drives via the cables MET is shipping out today&nbsp;</li></ol><p><strong><del>**** *************** </del></strong></p><p><strong>Tools Requirement:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Windows Laptop</u></strong> with WIFI Access with <strong><em>admin rights</em></strong></li><li>TeamViewer, Cisco WebEx, Microsoft Teams, Zoom, Blue jeans, Installed on your Laptop</li><li>Terminal Server Emulator (Putty, Secure CRT)</li><li>Standard CISCO Console Cable DB9 to RJ45 or USB to RJ45</li><li>USB Drivers if using USB connection RS232</li><li>Mobile Hotspot for tethering</li><li>Extra Ethernet Patch Cables (3 patch Cables 12 -15 ft. in length - Will be reimburse accordingly when it is used, Receipt must be shared)</li><li>VELCRO Straps for rack cable management/patch cords</li><li>USB Flash drive (Atleast 32 or above GB)</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>Screwdriver Set</li><li>Cable Tester</li></ul><p><strong>Our Primary mode of communication with engineer will be WhatsApp, please install prior to the task and if any issue please reach out to team for alternative mode of communication.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>Terms &amp; Conditions:</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>﻿</u>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Please remain professional demeanor while on site. Do not engage in any conversation with local site contacts or any staff members unrelated to work.&nbsp;<strong>Keep all conversations strictly work-related.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;