{"job":{"id":20118326,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Gaichu Managed Services","title":"DISPATCH REQUEST - Cheescake Factory - BATTLEBORO, United States","description":{"html":"<p><strong>SOW:</strong></p><p>Tech needs very experienced.</p><ol><li>Install (or confirm they already have been installed) m.2 boot drives on the single NX-1175S-g8 we shipped to each site&nbsp;</li><li>swap the HBA controller with the correct one we've previously shipped on-site</li><li>recable the HBA with the storage drives via the cables MET is shipping out today&nbsp;</li></ol><p><strong><del>**** *************** </del></strong></p><p><strong>Tools Requirement:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Windows Laptop</u></strong> with WIFI Access with <strong><em>admin rights</em></strong></li><li>TeamViewer, Cisco WebEx, Microsoft Teams, Zoom, Blue jeans, Installed on your Laptop</li><li>Terminal Server Emulator (Putty, Secure CRT)</li><li>Standard CISCO Console Cable DB9 to RJ45 or USB to RJ45</li><li>USB Drivers if using USB connection RS232</li><li>Mobile Hotspot for tethering</li><li>Extra Ethernet Patch Cables (3 patch Cables 12 -15 ft. in length - Will be reimburse accordingly when it is used, Receipt must be shared)</li><li>VELCRO Straps for rack cable management/patch cords</li><li>USB Flash drive (Atleast 32 or above GB)</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>Screwdriver Set</li><li>Cable Tester</li></ul><p><strong>Our Primary mode of communication with engineer will be WhatsApp, please install prior to the task and if any issue please reach out to team for alternative mode of communication.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\"><u>Terms &amp; Conditions:</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>﻿</u>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Please remain professional demeanor while on site. Do not engage in any conversation with local site contacts or any staff members unrelated to work.&nbsp;<strong>Keep all conversations strictly work-related.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Engineer must carry a valid ID for access; access won't be granted without it.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Do not represent FIELDNATION</strong> on site unless specified, check with our support team for clarification.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Technician must stay onsite until task completion; </strong>leaving without<strong> Gaichu technical team's authorization </strong>results in<strong> no payment </strong>and task deemed<strong> Incomplete. IMPORTANT</strong></p><p><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p><strong><u> </u></strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Share onsite <strong>Time IN</strong> and <strong>Time Out</strong> with the technical team before leaving.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rude behavior </strong>is not acceptable onsite and will lead to disciplinary action</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Wear professional clothing for the task.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>All tools mentioned in the work order must be taken to the site; if any tools reported to be missing while you are onsite, and work affected because of it will result in no payment.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Take all tools mentioned in the work order to the site; missing tools affecting work will result in no payment. IMPORTANT</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Share all expenses (Travel, Gas, Parking &amp; Toll) before accepting the Work Order. No additional expenses will be approved after the task. <strong>IMPORTANT</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Do not bring unauthorized persons onsite without written confirmation; non-compliance will result in unpaid Work Order and be seen as a security breach.</p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Share receipts for materials purchased or used onsite for reimbursement; payment won't be authorized without relevant receipts.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Please take pictures before and after the execution of work.</strong></p><p><strong>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Take Before</strong> and <strong>After</strong> pictures of the work execution.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Connect <strong>Console Cable</strong> <strong>or USB to DB9 Converter</strong> to laptop and share the <strong>Device Manager</strong> picture showing <strong>COM PORT</strong> before starting the task to confirm proper driver installation.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Please see below the WhatsApp requirement for all future Field nation tasks:</p><p><strong>Please install WhatsApp application in your smart phone and send WhatsApp message containing FN WO if you need any technical assistance and when you are onsite then reach out to below contact persons:</strong></p><p><strong>Kiran Arshad:</strong>&nbsp;+92 330 5000523</p><p><strong>Mehreen Arshad:</strong>&nbsp;+92 330 5000522</p><p><strong>Hamza Malik:</strong> ‪+92 325 9182128‬</p><p><strong>Kashan Ul Haq:</strong>&nbsp;+92 347 9859366&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please visit below links to install WhatsApp and to add WhatsApp contacts.</p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaRsRytz1NQ</p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=65IHJAgXIyY&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>If you have any query regarding schedule or payment you need to reach out to below contact details:</strong></p><p><strong>Ammar Ibrahim +92 319 6241457</strong></p><p><strong>Safwan Sajjad: +92 336 5509218</strong></p><p><strong>Jawad Jami: +92 314 0916262</strong></p>","markdown":"**SOW:**\n\nTech needs very experienced.\n\n1. Install (or confirm they already have been installed) m.2 boot drives on the single NX-1175S-g8 we shipped to each site\n2. swap the HBA controller with the correct one we've previously shipped on-site\n3. recable the HBA with the storage drives via the cables MET is shipping out today\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Tools Requirement:**\n\n- **Windows Laptop** with WIFI Access with ***admin rights***\n- TeamViewer, Cisco WebEx, Microsoft Teams, Zoom, Blue jeans, Installed on your Laptop\n- Terminal Server Emulator (Putty, Secure CRT)\n- Standard CISCO Console Cable DB9 to RJ45 or USB to RJ45\n- USB Drivers if using USB connection RS232\n- Mobile Hotspot for tethering\n- Extra Ethernet Patch Cables (3 patch Cables 12 -15 ft. in length - Will be reimburse accordingly when it is used, Receipt must be shared)\n- VELCRO Straps for rack cable management/patch cords\n- USB Flash drive (Atleast 32 or above GB)\n- Label Maker\n- Screwdriver Set\n- Cable Tester\n\n**Our Primary mode of communication with engineer will be WhatsApp, please install prior to the task and if any issue please reach out to team for alternative mode of communication.**\n\n**Terms & Conditions:**\n\n**﻿·** Please remain professional demeanor while on site. Do not engage in any conversation with local site contacts or any staff members unrelated to work. **Keep all conversations strictly work-related.**\n\n**· Engineer must carry a valid ID for access; access won't be granted without it.**\n\n**· Do not represent FIELDNATION** on site unless specified, check with our support team for clarification.\n\n**· Technician must stay onsite until task completion;** leaving without **Gaichu technical team's authorization** results in **no payment** and task deemed **Incomplete. IMPORTANT**\n\n · Share onsite **Time IN** and **Time Out** with the technical team before leaving.\n\n**· Rude behavior** is not acceptable onsite and will lead to disciplinary action\n\n**· Wear professional clothing for the task.**\n\n**·** All tools mentioned in the work order must be taken to the site; if any tools reported to be missing while you are onsite, and work affected because of it will result in no payment.\n\n**· Take all tools mentioned in the work order to the site; missing tools affecting work will result in no payment. IMPORTANT**\n\n**·** Share all expenses (Travel, Gas, Parking & Toll) before accepting the Work Order. No additional expenses will be approved after the task. **IMPORTANT**\n\n**·** Do not bring unauthorized persons onsite without written confirmation; non-compliance will result in unpaid Work Order and be seen as a security breach.\n\n**· Share receipts for materials purchased or used onsite for reimbursement; payment won't be authorized without relevant receipts.**\n\n**· Please take pictures before and after the execution of work.**\n\n**· Take Before** and **After** pictures of the work execution.\n\n· Connect **Console Cable** **or USB to DB9 Converter** to laptop and share the **Device Manager** picture showing **COM PORT** before starting the task to confirm proper driver installation.\n\n· Please see below the WhatsApp requirement for all future Field nation tasks:\n\n**Please install WhatsApp application in your smart phone and send WhatsApp message containing FN WO if you need any technical assistance and when you are onsite then reach out to below contact persons:**\n\n**Kiran Arshad:** +92 330 5000523\n\n**Mehreen Arshad:** +92 330 5000522\n\n**Hamza Malik:** ‪+92 325 9182128‬\n\n**Kashan Ul Haq:** +92 347 9859366\n\nPlease visit below links to install WhatsApp and to add WhatsApp contacts.\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaRsRytz1NQ>\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=65IHJAgXIyY&nbsp;>\n\n**If you have any query regarding schedule or payment you need to reach out to below contact details:**\n\n**Ammar Ibrahim +92 319 6241457**\n\n**Safwan Sajjad: +92 336 5509218**\n\n**Jawad Jami: +92 314 0916262**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T08:45","end":"2026-10-09T12:45"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":90},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":52.89910659835773},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pa