{"job":{"id":20118404,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"TGX, CRP, SIM install ~12ft ladder~","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Summary of Problem</strong>: CrP down.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong>: Install the new Cradle point and activate new Verizon SIM card. Install TGX antenna and verify and restore CP.</p><p><br></p><p><em>﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch. </em></p><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cell Phone – with Charger. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">WIN10 Laptop – with Charger - </span></li><li><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 &amp; USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45</strong></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Standard Tool Kit</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cat 6 cables</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cable Tester</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Hotspot or Internet Dongle</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Black Ink Pens (for documentation)</span></li></ul><p><strong><u>Job Requirements:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></p><p> </p><ul><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Communicate frequently via phone/email communications</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.  </span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">Only use </span><strong>Site Disposal<em> </em></strong><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">when removing any materials/trash</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">If returning equipment, request shipping label via instructions in custom field</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Government-issued photo ID required </li><li>Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance </li><li>Check-in with site contacts representing <del>*******</del></li><li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment </li><li>Professional environment expects professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li></ul><p> </p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n**Summary of Problem**: CrP down.\n\n**Scope of Work**: Install the new Cradle point and activate new Verizon SIM card. Install TGX antenna and verify and restore CP.\n\n*﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch.*\n\n**Tool Requirement**\n\n- Cell Phone – with Charger.\n- WIN10 Laptop – with Charger -\n- **Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 & USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45**\n- Standard Tool Kit\n- Cat 6 cables\n- Cable Tester\n- Hotspot or Internet Dongle\n- Black Ink Pens (for documentation)\n\n**Job Requirements:**\n\n- Communicate frequently via phone/email communications\n- Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order\n- If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.\n- Only use **Site Disposal** when removing any materials/trash\n- If returning equipment, request shipping label via instructions in custom field\n\n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expects professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T14:00","end":"2026-10-07T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":220},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":15.251978128439493},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 7, 2:00 PM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 7, Thu, Oct 8, Fri, Oct 9 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika Ortodont"},{"start":"2026-10-07T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"DMV"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Prio