{"job":{"id":20118539,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NCR Voyix - Retail","title":"ASSIST TECH - MUST bring Required Tools","description":{"html":"<p><strong>REQUIREMENTS</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Dress code</strong>-- Casual business attire, including <strong>COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)</strong>, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><u>UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.</u></strong>&nbsp;Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.</li><li><strong>NCR identification badge</strong> must be worn and visible at all times.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>MUST BE </strong>able to <strong>lift a minimum of 45 pounds</strong></li><li><strong><u>This job requires 8 hours onsite. OT will be added if onsite NCR lead confirms it. Break time needs to be confirmed with Tech Lead with clear start and finish.</u></strong></li><li>Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (<strong>Smartphone</strong>)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p><ul><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cordless Electric Drill &ndash; Very important&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Box cutter with new blades &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function&nbsp;screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;11/32 nut driver &ndash; Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;¾\" socket with extension &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8mm socket - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Needle nose and regular pliers &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Diagonal cutters - Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10\" crescent wrench &ndash; Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;¾\" open-ended combination wrench &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cable ties &ndash; Important</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Complete socket set &ndash; Needed</strong></li><li><strong>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Smart phone &ndash; Smart to have one</strong></li><li><strong>Packing Tape</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>OVERVIEW</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Follow the NCR Hardware Technician On-Site Deployment Strategy.</li><li>Inventory Hardware.</li><li>Unbox, place, install Self Checkout Hardware.</li><li>Clean up and throw away trash.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>ESCALATION PATH</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>D2T.VendorManagement@ncrvoyix.com</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>CANCELLATION POLICY&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech</li><li>Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech</li></ul>","markdown":"**REQUIREMENTS**\n\n- **Dress code**-- Casual business attire, including **COLLARED SHIRT (WITHOUT LOGOS)**, jeans, and comfortable shoes during the entire installation process. **UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHOULD: hats, baggy jeans, open-toed shoes, fatigues, or sweat suits be worn.** Clothes must be worn in a professional manner, neatly pressed and tidy.\n- **NCR identification badge** must be worn and visible at all times.\n- **MUST BE** able to **lift a minimum of 45 pounds**\n- **This job requires 8 hours onsite. OT will be added if onsite NCR lead confirms it. Break time needs to be confirmed with Tech Lead with clear start and finish.**\n- Work Order MUST BE fully completed while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (**Smartphone**)\n\n**YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\n- **• Cordless Electric Drill – Very important**\n- **• Box cutter with new blades – Important**\n- **• Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-fun