{"job":{"id":20118426,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Lingo Telecom","title":"ARC-VoIP IW/Jacks","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Need a VoIP-savvy technician onsite to assist Lingo with installing the 2 new polycom phones 482567FB847E and 482567FB7D26. Also there are few phones which are not working F04EA46A154A, 4825674B256F,4825674B4A75. <br>Tech must have a laptop with a working Ethernet port, TeamViewer 13+, Ethernet cable, and hotspot.<br>Please call Lingo at 888-366-6993, Option 2 to check in/out and troubleshoot. Reference tickets 00516546.<br>Note: If the dispatch cannot be completed due to the extent of work required, please provide a quote with pictures for review and rescheduling.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>Notice: For check in and check out codes, if it is outside Lingo business hours (M-F 8am-5pm Eastern) and you call in for the the open and/or close code, please leave a message with your name and Field Nation work order number and Lingo will fill in the codes by the next business day.</em></p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\nNeed a VoIP-savvy technician onsite to assist Lingo with installing the 2 new polycom phones 482567FB847E and 482567FB7D26. Also there are few phones which are not working F04EA46A154A, 4825674B256F,4825674B4A75.   \nTech must have a laptop with a working Ethernet port, TeamViewer 13+, Ethernet cable, and hotspot.  \nPlease call Lingo at 888-366-6993, Option 2 to check in/out and troubleshoot. Reference tickets 00516546.  \nNote: If the dispatch cannot be completed due to the extent of work required, please provide a quote with pictures for review and rescheduling.\n\n*Notice: For check in and check out codes, if it is outside Lingo business hours (M-F 8am-5pm Eastern) and you call in for the the open and/or close code, please leave a message with your name and Field Nation work order number and Lingo will fill in the codes by the next business day.*","actions":[]},"isRequested