{"job":{"id":20119228,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nova Remote IT LLC","title":"Network Installation","description":{"html":"<p>Retest internet speed after carrier troubleshooting on existing Sercomm SAX1V1R gateway.</p><p>Join remote bridge with engineer to verify installation and confirm results.</p><p>Laptop must support 1G speeds.</p><p><br></p><p><ul><li><strong>You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge</strong></li><li><strong>Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens</strong></li><li><strong>Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.</strong></li></ul></p><p><strong>Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.</strong></p><p><strong>Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.</strong></p><p>Please review confidential section for site specific details</p><p><ol><li>Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - <strong>join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.</strong></li><li>Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.</li><li>Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.</li><li>Clean up work area and close out.</li></ol></p>","markdown":"Retest internet speed after carrier troubleshooting on existing Sercomm SAX1V1R gateway.\n\nJoin remote bridge with engineer to verify installation and confirm results.\n\nLaptop must support 1G speeds.\n\n- **You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge**\n- **Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens**\n- **Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.**\n\n**Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.**\n\n**Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.**\n\nPlease review confidential section for site specific details\n\n1. Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - **join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.**\n2. Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.\n3. Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.\n4. Clean up work area and close out.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-13T11:30","end":"2026-10-13T13:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8.38848859942174},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-07T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at 