{"job":{"id":20095939,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Sales floor PVM issue||*Troubleshooting*","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Scope of Work:Tech needs to troubleshoot __ sales floor PVM________ camera located ___ sales floor________</em></p>\n<p><em>• Archived view from camera - sales floor PVM</em></p>\n<p><em>• Tech will need to tone/test network run between camera and Switch H5</em></p>\n<p><em>• Check for a biscuit jack/network junction, which may be located in the ceiling along the cable path.</em></p>\n<p><em>• If a biscuit jack is located:</em></p>\n<p><em>o Inspect and re-punch the connections as needed, or</em></p>\n<p><em>o Terminate the network cable with an RJ45 connector and connect it directly to the camera,</em></p>\n<p><em>bypassing the biscuit jack.</em></p>\n<p><em>• Once troubleshooting and cabling work are complete, contact the TJX Help Desk at <del>*************</del> Option 1 →</em></p>\n<p><em>Option 8 → Option 1 for testing and verification.</em></p>\n<p><em>• If you are unable to reach the TJX Help Desk or do not receive a callback within 15 minutes, or require</em></p>\n<p><em>additional technical assistance, contact: Shyft/AVT National Technical Support at <del>*************</del> Option 3</em></p>\n<p><em>Device/Host Name:</em></p>\n<p><em>Model Name:</em></p>\n<p><em>IP Address:</em></p>\n<p><em>Switch Port:</em></p>\n<p><em>MAC address:</em></p>\n<p><em>Camera Location:</em></p>\n<p><em>Camera Height:</em></p>\n<p><em>Ceiling Height:</em></p>\n<p><em>Site Security Code: <del>******</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Customer Incident: <del>**********</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Part shipped to the site?: (y/n)</em></p>\n<p><em>!!! Please provide the ceiling height in your closing notes !!!</em></p>\n<p><em>For technical assistance, please call Shyft Services National Tech Support at <del>************</del>, opt 3.</em></p>\n<p><em>Troubleshooting steps:</em></p>\n<p><em>Problem: Offline camera High Level Steps:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***********************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>1. Locate camera</em></p>\n<p><em>2. Locate switch port via label, TJX helpdesk, NTS L2 Support. Camera will be connected to either switch H5 or H6(except Sierra Trading Post stores)</em></p>\n<p><em>If unable to locate the tone-out cable, or work with support</em></p>\n<p><em>3. Reseat cable</em></p>\n<p><em>4. Try a different open port between 1-39</em></p>\n<p><em>5. Remove camera and plug directly into switch</em></p>\n<p><em>Problem: PVM Black Monitor High Level Steps:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***********************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>1. Locate PVM</em></p>\n<p><em>2. Unplug all cables on PVM for two minutes</em></p>\n<p><em>3. If the issue is not resolved, work with manager or LP personnel to locate PVM PSU(usually in LP office)</em></p>\n<p><em>4. Flip the PVM PSU power off for two minutes</em></p>\n<p><em>Required Technician Skills:</em></p>\n<p><em>Network Troubleshooting</em></p>\n<p><em>POS Support</em></p>\n<p><em>CCTV/PTZ Support</em></p>\n<p><em>Audio/Video Support</em></p>\n<p><em>Low voltage cabling</em></p>\n<p><em>Required Tools Link:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><strong>Technician Support Process (Important)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Before contacting Shyft/NTS Support, you MUST contact the</strong> <strong><del>*** **** **** ******</del></strong></p>\n<p><strong>If you encounter an issue while onsite:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Contact the <strong><del>*** **** ****</del></strong> and work through the issue with them.</li>\n<li>If the issue is resolved, continue and complete the work order.</li>\n<li>If the issue is <strong>