{"job":{"id":"3691945397","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"P2 SIP IW","description":"Issue: SIP trunk is offline.  Please work with NOC to get the SIP trunk back online.<br><br>PBX 9196938855<br><br>Granite NOC Service Ticket: 7030017                                                        <br><br>Dispatch's date and time: 10/07 between 10 AM and 2 PM EST.<br><br>Scope Of Work:<br><br>*** IMPORTANT: Tech must call into Granite NOC 844.492.2557 opt. 4 then opt. 1 for Voice, upon arrival and before departing the site. ***<br><br>1) Tech will call into Granite NOC to start the scope of work <br><br>2) Locate the Granite Adtran.  Trace the wires from Adtran to make sure it is connected to the site's modem or switch.<br><br>3) Work with NOC to get your Adtran back online.<br><br>4) If Adtran is not coming online, you may need to work with the site's PBX vendor.<br><br>5) MOD or Granite must give approval to release.<br><br>Tech will need a patch cord, a splitter and a minimum of 3 filters, Laptop with ability to create hotspot, Smart Phone and charger, Multimeter, Lineman’s Telephony Handset/Butt-Set, Tone Generator and Wand, Punch Tool (66 &amp; 110) Electrician Scissors, Step Ladder,  Flashlight and/or Headlamp, RJ11&amp;RJ45 Crimper, Ethernet Cable Tester, Pencil and/or Marker, Needle-Nose Pliers, Label-Maker, Cross-Connect Wire, Gel-Crimp Connecters, Label-Tape, RJ11 &amp; Cat6 Ethernet Keystone Jacks, RJ11 &amp; RJ45 Modular PlugsTelephony Handset/Butt-Set, Tone Generator and Wand, Punch Tool (66 &amp; 110) Electrician Scissors, Step Ladder,  Flashlight and/or Headlamp, RJ11&amp;RJ45 Crimper, Ethernet Cable Tester, Pencil and/or Marker, Needle-Nose Pliers, Label-Maker, Cross-Connect Wire, Gel-Crimp Connecters, Label-Tape, RJ11 &amp; Cat6 Ethernet Keystone Jacks, RJ11 &amp; RJ45 Modular Plugs, Console Cable.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T10:00","end":"2026-10-07T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":75.0017277,"max":