{"job":{"id":20101678,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Quality Sign and Marquee","title":"Paper Airplane: Wild Horse Nine Flatcard","description":{"html":"<p>BE SURE TO CHECK SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL, QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT OPEN FOR THE DAY.</p><p>PROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.</p><p>If the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or cannot locate the standee.</p><p>If the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for <strong>HALF (50%)</strong> of the installation rate.</p><p>Scope of Work:</p><p>Provider is asked to confirm the Flatcard Standee has arrived (tracking attached to this workorder) before visiting the location. Once confirmed, plan to visit the location, locate the Flatcard Standee for Wild Horse Nine, build the display according to the included instruction sheet (display is a simple flat card standee with easel back), and place in a prominent location within the theatre lobby. We are requesting (2) installation photos, 1 showing the standee properly installed and 1 showing the placement in the theatre. Keep in mind we want to see the display from a distance so we can see what is around the display. The average installer is completing the standee in less than 30 minutes.</p>","markdown":"BE SURE TO CHECK SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL, QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT OPEN FOR THE DAY.\n\nPROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.\n\nIf the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or cannot locate the standee.\n\nIf the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for **HALF (50%)** of the installation rate.\n\nScope of Work:\n\nProvider is asked to confirm the Flatcard Standee has arrived (tracking attached to this workorder) before visiting the location. Once confirmed, plan to visit the location, locate the Flatcard Standee for Wild Horse Nine, build the display according to the included instruction sheet (display is a simple flat card standee with easel back), and place in a prominent location within the theatre lobby. We are requesting (2) installation photos, 1 showing the standee properly installed and 1 showing the placement in the theatre. Keep in mind we want to see the display from a distance so we can see what is around the display. The average installer is completing the standee in less than 30 minutes.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-06T12:00","end":"2026-10-11T22:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":40},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":1.6139184224995629},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Workmarket Roma ticket"},{"start":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Dana doctor"},{"start":"2026-10-07T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika O