{"job":{"id":20120312,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NEC Corporation of America","title":"Store IT/POS Equipment -test and validate the operational ability of all RIS equipment (Precheck/T-5 testing)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview: Ensure the stores readiness before handing the store over to 7-11 personel. We will need to test and validate the operations of all RIS equipment.</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in basic electronic installation. Prefer Retail Point-of-Sale experience.</li><li>A detailed guide is provided to the assigned provider</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1 hour</li></ul><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Pre-Site Requirements&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Check you are at the store number situated on your work request.</li><li>The store number can be situated on the front window of the Store, on the off chance that you don't discover the store number posted, ask store staff,General Contractor, or Field Consultant on location.</li><li>If no one onsite or unable to confirm, please contact the Deployment Support Team at <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************ ***** ****************</del></span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;<strong>On-Site Tasks (Overview- Step by step process attached in the document section of the work order)</strong></p><p><strong>Objectives</strong></p><p>Back Office Validations</p><ul><li>Multi-Function Printer is operational</li><li>Chromebox online, keyboard and mouse are functional</li></ul><p>Wireless Validations</p><ul><li>7MD connected to wireless and apps downloaded.</li><li>7MD scanning functionality</li><li>Point of Sale Validations on each (POS)</li></ul><p>Login to POS</p><ul><li>Valid 7Rewards scan</li><li>Valid POS scan item</li><li>Valid age restriction prompts on POS (photo of each POS)</li><li>Valid debit test with incorrect pin</li><li>Valid POS receipt print</li><li>Validate cash drawer opens</li><li>Validate MOM is online</li></ul><p><strong>Testing time frames</s