{"job":{"id":20121143,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Lululemon - Audio System Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"SOW: Tech to troubleshoot store speakers on salesfloor. Please work with support, take photos, and complete signoff sheet before leaving site. <br/><br/>Original description from store staff: \"Description: At least one of the Bose speakers on the sales floor is not working properly. Store was called to confirm that some of the speakers are working while others are not. Given this ticket link for assistance with the amplifier to the speakers.\"<br/><br/>IMPORTANT: Please ensure all audio working properly, with MOD, before leaving<br/>If any parts are needed, tech must provide brand/part/model/color and/or comprehensive pics<br/><br/>Check-in Requirements:<br/>-Check in to the IVR 516.500.7776  PIN 1805580, enter code 366047633<br/>-Check in with Spencer Service 508.635.2037<br/><br/>While Onsite:<br/>-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed<br/>-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW<br/>-Tech support:  AV Support 774-827-2224<br/><br/>    <br/>Checkout Requirements:<br/><br/>-Tech must obtain sign off from store manager<br/>-Photos and sign off must be sent to lululemonservice@spencertech.com BEFORE check out<br/>-Checkout with IVR and provide code to Spencer at checkout<br/>-Checkout with Spencer: 508.635.2037<br/><br/>Required Tools:<br/>-Basic Cabling Tools<br/>-Butt set<br/>-Cable toner<br/>-Cable Tester<br/>-Label Maker<br/>-Ladder<br/>-CAT 6 cabling<br/>-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends<br/>-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights","markdown":"SOW: Tech to troubleshoot store speakers on salesfloor. Please work with support, take photos, and complete signoff sheet before leaving site.   \n  \nOriginal description from store staff: \"Description: At least one of the Bose speakers on the sales floor is not working properly. Store was called to confirm that some of the speakers are working while others are not. Given this ticket link for assistance with the amplifier to the speakers.\"  \n  \nIMPORTANT: Please ensure all audio working properly, with MOD, before leaving  \nIf any parts are needed, tech must provide brand/part/model/color and/or comprehensive pics  \n  \nCheck-in Requirements:  \n-Check in to the IVR 516.500.7776 PIN 1805580, enter code 366047633  \n-Check in with Spencer Service 508.635.2037  \n  \nWhile Onsite:  \n-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed  \n-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW  \n-Tech support: AV Support 774-827-2224  \n  \n   \nCheckout Requirements:  \n  \n-Tech must obtain sign off from store manager  \n-Photos and sign off must be sent to lululemonservice@spencertech.com BEFORE check out  \n-Checkout with IVR and provide code to Spencer at checkout  \n-Checkout with Spencer: 508.635.2037  \n  \nRequired Tools:  \n-Basic Cabling Tools  \n-Butt set  \n-Cable toner  \n-Cable Tester  \n-Label Maker  \n-Ladder  \n-CAT 6 cabling  \n-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends  \n-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T08:00","end":"2026-10-08T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":4.558136427491954},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:0