{"job":{"id":"5387278772","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 10/07/2026 | Hard Start","description":"Service technician needed on site to install the following equipment: Properly mount network equipment and make double cable runs to offices / printer. The equipment should be installed at Network Closet.<br><br>Once the equipment has been successfully installed, the technician should test with customer IT: <br>• Testing contact #1: Ryan Waldroop who can be reached via phone at (803) 393-4646 or email at ryan.waldroop@movement.com.<br>• Testing contact #2: Roderick Muhammad who can be reached via phone at (803) 334-0748 or email at roderick.muhammad@movement.com.<br><br>Tech will need to purchase and install backer board, patch panel, and a small network rack, then mount patch panel and 48-port switch to the rack. Make double runs to existing blank wall plates in each office and any other locations the on-site contact wants them. Longest runs may be 80 feet, total number of runs will be 20ish. Also mount 1 or 2 additional wireless access points with PoE cable runs using best judgement to provide better wireless coverage.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T10:30","end":"2026-10-07T14:30"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":14},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 7, 10:30 AM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 7, Thu, Oct 8, Fri, Oct 9 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T20:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000