{"job":{"id":20121496,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Scarsdale Security Systems Inc","title":"Scarsdale Ticket #843424 - Burglary alarm network trouble. Verify patch cable to switch, document switch ID and port number. Work with Scarsdale or customer IT support as needed to reset alarm panel, verify signals to central via network.","description":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Burglary alarm network trouble. Verify patch cable to switch, document switch ID and port number. Work with Scarsdale or customer IT support as needed to reset alarm panel, verify signals to central via network. Send user code changes to panel.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>**IMPORTANT** In order for technician to get paid, a SIGNED SERVICE TICKET must also be returned with ticket notes. THIS IS THE CUSTOMER'S EXPECTATION</strong></li>\n<li><strong>﻿YOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS IN THE CONFIDENTIAL INFO SECTION OF THIS WORK ORDER !! Thank You.</strong></li>\n<li>IF A PART NEEDS TO BE REPLACED, DOCUMENT THE MAKE, MODEL AND SERIAL NUMBER OF DEVICE. PROVIDE NOTES AS TO WHY PART MUST BE REPLACED. UPLOAD PICTURE TO WORK ORDER.</li>\n<li>DELETE user-SUZANNE CASTILLO, USER ID: 14, OLD PIN: 5823 .</li>\n<li>TECHNICIAN MUST HAVE CABLE TESTER, CAT5 CABLE AND TERMINATION MATERIALS ON HAND.</li>\n<li>FOR SYSTEM ON-TEST OR TECHNICAL SUPPORT WHEN ON SITE CALL 914-722-2933 BETWEEN 8 AM AND 7:30 PM EST MON - FRI.</li>\n<li>***IMPORTANT** If a part needs to be replaced DOCUMENT the make, model, serial #. MUST PROVIDE NOTES as to WHY the part needs replaced (I.E. Damaged? Physically missing? Remodeling? Provide these DETAILS and upload picture to work order and/or email to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com Use provided return label to return ship any unused parts.</li>\n<li>TECH TO HAVE SERVICE CHANNEL *PROVIDER* APP INSTALLED ON PHONE OR TABLET. SEE GOOGLE PLAY STORE OR APPLE STORE FOR THE FREE APP. USE APP TO CHECK IN AND OUT. *OR* TECHNICIAN MUST USE AUTOMATED RESPONSE SYSTEM (IVR) TO CHECK IN WITH THE S