o nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com Use provided return label to return ship any unused parts.\n- TECH TO HAVE SERVICE CHANNEL \\*PROVIDER\\* APP INSTALLED ON PHONE OR TABLET. SEE GOOGLE PLAY STORE OR APPLE STORE FOR THE FREE APP. USE APP TO CHECK IN AND OUT. \\*OR\\* TECHNICIAN MUST USE AUTOMATED RESPONSE SYSTEM (IVR) TO CHECK IN WITH THE STORE PHONE UPON ARRIVAL TO THE LOCATION & TO CHECK OUT WITH THE STORE PHONE UPON COMPLETION OF THE VISIT. CALL- USA- 516.500.7776 \\*\\*Canada - 647-496-1288 (CA-ON), 506-300-3307 (CA-NB) – PIN NUMBER 75182 AND TRACKING NUMBER - 365883683 \\*\\*WHEN CALLING FROM PREMISE PHONE, IF IVR DOES NOT LET YOU SIGN IN and OUT, CALL 855-269-6471. This will allow you to speak directly with a Service Channel Representative. If all else fails, call a Scarsdale Customer Service Representative at 914-722-2933. Thank you. \\*\\*CHECKING IN WITH THE IVR DOES NOT PUT YOUR SYSTEM ON TEST!!!\n- \\*\\*BEFORE LEAVING SITE\\*\\*\\* Technician MUST email notes/resolution to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com OR call 914-722-2933 and speak to one of our National Account Team Members.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T10:00","end":"2026-10-09T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":32.27269650719214},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $85 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end"