{"job":{"id":20124250,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"Hot Topic - Install POS System -- Revisit","description":{"html":"<p>PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS - <del>************</del></p><p>TECHNICAL CONTACT: Hot Topic IT - <del>************</del></p><p></p><p>Check in with CIS upon arrival 949-916-7545</p><p>Check in with TCON </p><p>Check in with the MOD </p><p>Tech requested to install the POS System </p><p>Check out with TCON </p><p>Check out with MOD </p><p>Check out with CIS</p><p></p><p>Deliverables:</p><p>- Photos of work done Texted to: 208-960-0175</p><p>- Signed Manager’s Sign-Off Sheet</p><p>Check out with TCON -</p><p>Check out with the MOD -</p><p>Check out with CIS before leaving site.</p><p></p><p>Requirements</p><ul><li>Please direct any questions to CIS while onsite.</li><li>Be sure to check in and out with your CIS contact before arriving and departing the site.</li><li>Dress appropriately for the job (i.e. no flip flops, inappropriate content on clothes, shorts etc..)</li><li>Always confirm and sign off with the onsite Manager/Personnel when you complete the work.</li><li>You are NOT allowed to leave site without properly checking out with your CIS contact</li><li>Carefully review each required tool and material BEFORE heading out to site to ensure you are prepared to complete the work.</li><li>You must review ALL documents attached to your WO before heading to site, if you have a &#39;Installation/Turnup Guide&#39; attached, you must print and bring a paper copy to site.</li></ul><p></p><p>Required Materials</p><ul><li>1000&#39; of Cat6</li><li>Surface Mount Box</li><li>Cat 6 Keystone Jacks</li><li>Cat6 Patch Cables</li><li>Zip Ties</li><li>Velcro Strips</li></ul><p></p><p>Required Tools</p><ul><li>Laptop</li><li>Laptop Charger</li><li>Console Cable</li><li>Cable Tester/ Toner</li><li>Fish Tape</li><li>Crimper</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>10&#39; Ladder</li></ul><p></p><p>YOU MUST CALL CIS TO CHECK OUT UPON DEPARTURE - 949-916-7545</p><br><br><p>12' A-frame Ladder may be required</p>","markdown":"PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS - \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nTECHNICAL CONTACT: Hot Topic IT - \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nCheck in with CIS upon arrival 949-916-7545\n\nCheck in with TCON\n\nCheck in with the MOD\n\nTech requested to install the POS System\n\nCheck out with TCON\n\nCheck out with MOD\n\nCheck out with CIS\n\nDeliverables:\n\n\\- Photos of work done Texted to: 208-960-0175\n\n\\- Signed Manager’s Sign-Off Sheet\n\nCheck out with TCON -\n\nCheck out with the MOD -\n\nCheck out with CIS before leaving site.\n\nRequirements\n\n- Please direct any questions to CIS while onsite.\n- Be sure to check in and out with your CIS contact before arriving and departing the site.\n- Dress appropriately for the job (i.e. no flip flops, inappropriate content on clothes, shorts etc..)\n- Always confirm and sign off with the onsite Manager/Personnel when you complete the work.\n- You are NOT allowed to leave site without properly checking out with your CIS contact\n- Carefully review each required tool and material BEFORE heading out to site to ensure you are prepared to complete the work.\n- You must review ALL documents attached to your WO before heading to site, if you have a 'Installation/Turnup Guide' attached, you must print and bring a paper copy to site.\n\nRequired Materials\n\n- 1000' of Cat6\n- Surface Mount Box\n- Cat 6 Keystone Jacks\n- Cat6 Patch Cables\n- Zip Ties\n- Velcro Strips\n\nRequired Tools\n\n- Laptop\n- Laptop Charger\n- Console Cable\n- Cable Tester/ Toner\n- Fish Tape\n- Crimper\n- Label Maker\n- 10' Ladder\n\nYOU MUST CALL CIS TO CHECK OUT UPON DEPARTURE - 949-916-7545\n\n  \n  \n12' A-frame Ladder may be required","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T13:00","end":"2026-10-07T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":140,"max":280},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":140},"additional":{"units":