{"job":{"id":20124534,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"3b2 Solutions, LLC","title":"Chuy's 6125 Fayetteville, NC  POS 8 ADD/MOVE","description":{"html":"<p>Please go to the back door, ring the bell to get in. MOD will have equipment&nbsp;</p><p>WO2003779&nbsp;&nbsp;POS 8 ADD/MOVE&nbsp;</p><p>ATTACHED PICTURES&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Scope of work:</p><p><br></p><p>Call to check in with 3b2: Bonnie 864-252-5966 OR Janet 864-764-9365</p><p>Call to check in with Darden Analyst Nilo 407-245-5766</p><p>Take before pictures and send them to ITRefresh@darden.com AND bstone@3b2solutions.com OR jbailey@3b2solutions.com</p><p>Location of POS below in picture has power and network run already connected to Port 1-18 based on site Switch 1 or 2</p><p>Please ship FedEx 2DAY and provide tracking number.</p><p>Install the POS and peripherals making sure not to turn on the POS until it has a working connection to the correct port on the switch.</p><p>Manage all cables to Darden standards</p><p>Test with MOD and Darden Analyst</p><p>Take after pictures and send them to ITRefresh@darden.com AND bstone@3b2solutions.com OR jbailey@3b2solutions.com</p><p>Call to check out with Darden Analyst Nilo 407-245-5766</p><p>Call to check out with 3b2: Bonnie 864-252-5966 OR Janet 864-764-9365</p><p><br></p><p>3B2 Shipping</p><p>. POS 8 Takeout Model 7773&nbsp;</p><p>. POS Printer 7199 with Y-cable</p><p>. EMV 8 Lane 3000 (000.000.000.000) with HDMI to USB.</p><p>. Cash Drawer and cable per MOD</p><p>. EMV Bracket for Lane 3000</p><p><br></p><p>Please take with you&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Standard toolkit</p><p>. Cabling toolkit</p><p>. Spool Cat 5/6</p><p>. Stud finder</p><p>. 1/4\" toggle bolts</p><p>. Tape measure</p><p>. Cordless drill with bit set</p><p>. Level</p><p>. Faceplates and blanks</p><p>. Cable toner and tester</p><p>. Patch cables of various lengths</p><p>. Label maker</p><p>. 2-port biscuit boxes</p><p><br></p><p>We will re-imburse for materials used</p><p><br></p>","markdo