{"job":{"id":20125066,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Acuative Corporation","title":"INSTALLATION __ STRUCTURED CABLING - INTERMEDIATE","description":{"html":"<p><strong>**&nbsp;<u>Bringing or sending a non-registered Field Nation person to site is strictly prohibited.</u>&nbsp;**</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>***This assignment has a specific arrival time, and timeliness is critical. Please <del>******* ******* ************ ** ************</del> if you are unable to make your assignment at the specified time***</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***There are several custom fields you will be responsible for entering on this work order. Accuracy when entering these fields is very important.**</strong>*</p>\n<p><u>OVERVIEW</u></p>\n<p>Lead:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Scope: Network migration initiative to replace existing Meraki MX firewalls, switches, and wireless access points.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Run Book will be sent in the box with the equipment.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Y:\\Site-and-Client-Information\\L\\Lumen\\DSW</p>\n<p><del>**** ** ***** ** **** **************</del></p>\n<p><del>************</del></p>\n<p>Once completed - log into the TEAMS bridge no later than 6:45PM&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>This will be a hardware refresh Project for DSW replacing existing firewalls, switches and access points.</p>\n<p>There will be added cable runs along with re-terminating cables into the patch panel. AP s will be replaced and may have new locations</p>\n<p>&nbsp;Tools Requirement -Install Documents -Basic Cabling Tools (RJ45 modular plugs w/crimp tool, punch tool, and snips.) -Tools to rework/mount AP s (Linemen Pliers able to cut #10-8 wire) -Spool of safety or bailing wire to hang AP s -25 foot tape measure -Hand Tools -Cable Tester -Label Maker -Packing tape -Velcro -Cable for potential AP-rewire (should be delivered to site) -Patch panel Keystone inserts (should be delivered to site) -Patch cables (color coded for panel) (should be delivered to site) -Laptop with working MS Teams&nbsp;&nbsp;ether-Cell phone (Hotspot capable We will be doing cable labeling as well as cleanup/remediation.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Bridge for techs to get on and work with DSW will be provided prior to the dispatch.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Lift will be delivered day of dispatch if required&nbsp;&nbsp;tech needs to be able to work a lift&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>****techs to code off the number and length of any AP cable runs****</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech to code off any unused amount of 4PR-CAT5E(PLENUM)-WH and ship back to Acuative(ticket created)&nbsp;using the customers Fed ex information&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Use customer FedEx account number # 203219935</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reference Field&nbsp;&nbsp;SNHR</li>\n</ul>\n<p><u>PRESITE</u></p>\n<p><strong>***Carefully review attached documentation before requesting this work to ensure you understand the scope, requirements and expectations.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please review work order for required forms and documentation. Any attachments must be reviewed and printed prior to dispatch.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><u>ONSITE</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Scope of work requested:</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete work order custom fields</li>\n</ul>\n<p><u>POSTSITE</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Completion of work order with all custom fields and deliverables complete and uploaded within <strong><u>24 hours</u></strong> of service event.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><u>DELIVERABLES REQUIRED FOR PAYMENT</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete code off form (note you will likely be duplicating several responses in the custom field section of this work order)</li>\n<li>Custom fields filled out accurately within 24 hours of service event</li>\n</ul>\n<p><u>ESCALATIONS</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>For dispatch issues (late, reschedule, etc.) - <del>******* ************ ************</del></li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**\\*\\* Bringing or sending a non-registered Field Nation person to site is strictly prohibited. \\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*This 