ff the number and length of any AP cable runs\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nTech to code off any unused amount of 4PR-CAT5E(PLENUM)-WH and ship back to Acuative(ticket created) using the customers Fed ex information\n\nUse customer FedEx account number # 203219935\n\n- Reference Field SNHR\n\nPRESITE\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Carefully review attached documentation before requesting this work to ensure you understand the scope, requirements and expectations.**\n\n- Please review work order for required forms and documentation. Any attachments must be reviewed and printed prior to dispatch.\n\nONSITE\n\n- Scope of work requested:\n\n- Complete work order custom fields\n\nPOSTSITE\n\n- Completion of work order with all custom fields and deliverables complete and uploaded within **24 hours** of service event.\n\nDELIVERABLES REQUIRED FOR PAYMENT\n\n- Complete code off form (note you will likely be duplicating several responses in the custom field section of this work order)\n- Custom fields filled out accurately within 24 hours of service event\n\nESCALATIONS\n\n- For dispatch issues (late, reschedule, etc.) - \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-07T18:30","end":"2026-10-07T26:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":420},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":6,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":9.367865748238277},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 7, 6:30 PM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 7, Thu, Oct 8, Fri, Oct 9 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-07T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T15:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-07T20:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-07T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T00:00:00.000Z"},{"sta