{"job":{"id":20125124,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TruMed Systems","title":"Vaccine Management Machine - Leaky Unit - 01862","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work OVERVIEW</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Reported Issues: **must bring heat gun and duct tape**<br/>Replace drip tray for larger one<br/>Melt ice and add insulation tape as needed<br/>Verify area is dry before adding insulation tubing<br/>APPLY DUCT TAPE TO INSULATION<br/>Perform PM<br/>Perform leak check. Tracking: No Parts Required</span></p><p><strong>PM/Leak Check </strong></p><p><strong>﻿Video Tutorials Below</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** ** **** *** **** ** *** **********</del></span><del>****************************</del></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** ** ******* ******** **** *************</del></span><del>*******************************************</del></p><p><br></p><p><strong>You MUST have the tools listed in the file: TOOLS REQUIRED TO GET PAID.</strong></p><p><strong>Scope Specific Tools</strong></p><ul><li>Heat Gun </li><li>T20 Torx Driver</li><li>T10 Torx Driver</li><li>2.5mm Allen key</li><li>4 mm Allen key or Flat Head Screwdriver</li><li><strong>DO NOT USE POWER TOOLS </strong></li></ul><p><strong>&nbsp;Essential Hardware</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Torx tools</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">T20 Torx Driver</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">T10 Torx Driver</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">T5 Torx Driver</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">1.3 mm driver&nbsp;</li><li>Sharpie</li><li> 4mm 2.5mm Allen wrench set</li><li>T20, T10, T8 Driver or T-Tool</li><li>Torx key set (T20, T15, T10, T8, T5)</li><li>Mini ratchet with T30, T20, T15, T10, T8, T5 bits</li><li>Large flathead screwdriver or pry tool</li><li>Digital multimeter / voltmeter</li><li>Handheld vacuum</li><li>Needle-nose pliers</li><li>Standard pliers</li><li>Channel-lock pliers</li><li>4\" (small) zip ties</li><li>Electrical tape</li><l