{"job":{"id":"3668622878","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance***","description":"\"Requesting assistance to:<br><br>1) Locate new Granite-provided broadband and or/ DIA service<br>2) Extend new service to Burlington’s network rack/cabinet (if needed)<br>3) Test/validate new service<br>4) Confirm with carrier that modem/router onsite is set to IP Passthrough/Bridge modem<br>5) Connect new Granite-provided Internet service(s) modem and/or FlexEdge router to new EdgebootPro equipment for power in accordance to port mapping guide listed below.<br>6) Connect new Granite-provided Internet service(s) and EdgebootPro to existing Burlington-provided Fortinet firewall ethernet ports in accordance to port mapping guide listed below.<br>7) Confirm AC and ethernet connectivity via Edgeboot.io<br>8) Once complete, request Granite Field Service technician to contact Burlington’s Managed Service Provider (Acuative) to perform health check on applicable Fortinet firewall ports new equipment is now connected to<br><br>***NETWORK DIAGRAM ATTACHED AS REFERENCED***<br><br>***DO NOT ADJUST BURLINGTON EDGEBOOT PROFILE UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES***<br><br>***NETWORK CUTOVER TO TAKE PLACE AT LATER DATE***<br><br>***TECHNICIAN MUST CALL INTO ACTIVATIONS AND THEN MERGE ACCUATIVE INTO CALL FOR A SIGN OFF CODE***<br><br>***ALL DIA SERVICES FOR BURLINGTON INCLUDES A FLEXEDGE DEVICE REGARDLESS WHETHER ON OR OFF-NET.***<br><br>***EDGEBOOT ETH 0 TO BE USED FOR MONITORING NEW INTERNET SERVICE, ETH 1 TO PROVIDE NEW LTE SERVICE. IMPORTANT- ETH1 on Edgeboot Pro is configured as LAN by default.***<br><br>New service details are below:\"<br>Customer:Burlington<br><br>Site Type:C-1<br><br>Acuative NOC Phone Number:1-888-835-7687, Option 1<br><br>WAN Details:<br>Type:Cable<br>ISP:Spectrum<br>Bandwidth:1G/50<br>Circuit ID:<br>Demarc:<br>IP:Dynamic<br>GW:Dynamic<br>Subnet:Dynamic<br>DNS1:Dynamic<br>DNS2:Dynamic<br>EdgebootPro Serial #:<br>Edgeboot FedEx/UPS (DIA ORDER ONLY, PLEASE DISREGARD FOR BROADBAND PRODUCTS):877636990507<br>Equipment FedEx/UPS (DIA ORDER ONLY, PLEASE DISREGARD FOR BROADBAND PRODUCTS):-<br><br>\"AC/Ethernet Port Mapping Guide:<br><br>Edgeboot AC Ports:<br><br>Port 1: DIA FlexEdge (WHERE APPLICABLE)<br>Port 2: Broadband Modem<br>Port 3: None<br>Port4: None<br><br>Edgeboot/New Circuit Ethernet Cross Connect:<br>New DIA Circuit: FortiGate Port 2 (WHERE APPLICABLE)<br>New Broadband Circuit: FortiGate Port 3<br>Edgeboot Port 0: FortiGate Port 5<br>Edgeboot Port 1: FortiGate Port 4<br>Edgeboot Console Port: FortiGate Console Port (via provided console cable included with EdgebootPro)\"","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T09:00","end":"2026-10-14T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6.7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 14, 9:00 AM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 14, Thu, Oct 15, Fri, Oct 16 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"}