{"job":{"id":20118404,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"TGX, CRP, SIM install ~12ft ladder~","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Summary of Problem</strong>: CrP down.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong>: Install the new Cradle point and activate new Verizon SIM card. Install TGX antenna and verify and restore CP.</p><p><br></p><p><em>﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch. </em></p><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cell Phone – with Charger. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">WIN10 Laptop – with Charger - </span></li><li><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 &amp; USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45</strong></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Standard Tool Kit</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cat 6 cables</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cable Tester</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Hotspot or Internet Dongle</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Black Ink Pens (for documentation)</span></li></ul><p><strong><u>Job Requirements:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></p><p> </p><ul><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Communicate frequently via phone/email communications</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.  </span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">Only use </span><strong>Site Disposal<em> </em></strong><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">when removing any materials/trash</span>