{"job":{"id":20126588,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Rittenhouse Communications","title":"Connect Wireless Door Release Receiver and Provide 2 HDMI Cables","description":{"html":"<p>Provide (2) 1ft or 3ft HDMI Cables</p><p>Connect HDMI Over Ethernet extender/splitter from SPD-152 Decoder to Orei Splitter</p><p>Connect Orei receivers behind office monitors to the Office CCTV monitors</p><p>Connect Alarm Controls RT3R receiver to the Access Control power supply to control the inner vestibule door.</p><p>Pair the existing remotes to the receivers. Top button pairs to front door receiver. Bottom button pairs to inner door receiver (new receiver).</p><p><br></p>","markdown":"Provide (2) 1ft or 3ft HDMI Cables\n\nConnect HDMI Over Ethernet extender/splitter from SPD-152 Decoder to Orei Splitter\n\nConnect Orei receivers behind office monitors to the Office CCTV monitors\n\nConnect Alarm Controls RT3R receiver to the Access Control power supply to control the inner vestibule door.\n\nPair the existing remotes to the receivers. Top button pairs to front door receiver. Bottom button pairs to inner door receiver (new receiver).","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T08:00","end":"2026-10-08T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-08T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":225},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6.979676595199879},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitors\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-08T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2