{"job":{"id":20127002,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"360 Tech Services","title":"Structured cabling Site Survey: Complete Site Survey in order to provide a Structured Cabling Quote (Est.Time< 2 hours) WO54523","description":{"html":"<p>Volkert IT is requesting a cabling quote for the site.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Please provide quote in number of hours, number of techs, and any supplies needed to complete. (cabling, lift,etc) Quote is to be provided back to 360 prior to discussing with client.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please work with LCON Kevin Bowen for locations in question.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>9 drops total running back to server room&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>4 to cubicles total&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1 ap drop&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2 drops in small office&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2 drops in large office&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wall conduit and cabling exists, if able to reuse cabling that's great but if new cabling is needed that's fine for cubicle runs.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please reach out to to Daniel Grooms once on site for any technical needs.&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"Volkert IT is requesting a cabling quote for the site.\n\nPlease provide quote in number of hours, number of techs, and any supplies needed to complete. (cabling, lift,etc) Quote is to be provided back to 360 prior to discussing with client.\n\nPlease work with LCON Kevin Bowen for locations in question.\n\n9 drops total running back to server room\n\n4 to cubicles total\n\n1 ap drop\n\n2 drops in small office\n\n2 drops in large office\n\nWall conduit and cabling exists, if able to reuse cabling that's great but if new cabling is needed that's fine for cubicle runs.\n\nPlease reach out to to Daniel Grooms once on site for any technical needs.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T09:00","end":"2026-10-08T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-08T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":5.125989178416