{"job":{"id":20127216,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nova Remote IT LLC","title":"Network Installation","description":{"html":"<p>Install and test new circuit equipment.</p><p>Join remote bridge with engineer to configure and verify.</p><p>Bring label maker and mounting screws.</p><p><br></p><p><ul><li><strong>You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge</strong></li><li><strong>Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens</strong></li><li><strong>Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.</strong></li></ul></p><p><strong>Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.</strong></p><p><strong>Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.</strong></p><p>Please review confidential section for site specific details</p><p><ol><li>Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - <strong>join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.</strong></li><li>Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.</li><li>Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.</li><li>Clean up work area and close out.</li></ol></p>","markdown":"Install and test new circuit equipment.\n\nJoin remote bridge with engineer to configure and verify.\n\nBring label maker and mounting screws.\n\n- **You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge**\n- **Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens**\n- **Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.**\n\n**Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.**\n\n**Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.**\n\