ment when available.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have a smartphone capable of submitting photos and electronic documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have basic hand tools, including a utility knife.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What You'll Need</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Smartphone with camera</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Utility knife</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Closed-toe shoes</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ability to safely operate a pallet jack</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tape for FedEx Return Label</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Completion Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To receive payment, technicians must:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete all assigned work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submit all required photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the digital work order on platform **Installation reporting application will be sent upon acceptance**</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Important Information</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Work must be completed during the scheduled service window.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Displays must be installed only in the location approved by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The work area must be left clean and free of all installation materials.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professional appearance and communication are expected at all times.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>*** Installation Guide will be sent upon acceptance showing step-by-step instructions ***</u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>MUST SU