{"job":{"id":20127223,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"URGENT - VIP SITE!! NEED DONE ASAP!! Kiosk Service - Break/Fix - Troubleshoot X/Y Table & Motors - GEN 4.2","description":{"html":"<p>**KIOSK #: NS6625**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Overview:</p>\n<p>Troubleshoot X/Y table and motors.</p>\n<p>Restore motion.</p>\n<p>Make two keys in a Test Transactions.</p>\n<p>This assignment is to troubleshoot an X/Y axis issue on a GEN 4.2 kiosk</p>\n<p>Scope includes clearing loose keys from the table, checking the homing sensor and cabling, verifying if the slide nut is loose, checking motor cabling and connectors, checking control board fuses, and testing for faulty X/Y motor using a multimeter.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check out with SSN.</p>\n<p>SUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>﻿**All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables**</p>\n<p>**Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app**</p>\n<p>**Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*KIOSK #: NS6625\\*\\*\n\nOverview:\n\nTroubleshoot X/Y table and motors.\n\nRestore motion.\n\nMake two keys in a Test Transactions.\n\nThis assignment is to troubleshoot an X/Y axis issue on a GEN 4.2 kiosk\n\nScope includes clearing loose keys from the table, checking the homing sensor and cabling, verifying if the slide nut is loose, checking motor cabling and connectors, checking control board fuses, and testing for faulty X/Y motor using a multimeter.\n\nCheck out with SSN.\n\nSUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!\n\n﻿\\*\\*All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T09:00",