{"job":{"id":"6275995348","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05688639-08923637 Dalton-Managed Starlink Survey","description":"DESCRIPTION: Starlink Survey  | ABB Inc | Cary, NC<br>Customer - ABB Inc<br>Child Acct - 05688639<br>Location - Cary, NC<br>Address - 1305 Gregson Dr, Cary, NC 27511<br>Salesforce Order - 02312029<br>IP - Default<br>Data Plan - 500GB - Pooled<br>Additional Data Plan - None<br>Kit - Performance Gen 3 (STARLINK-G3HPERF-BUNDLE)<br><br>Before dispatching, please download the Starlink App to your phone.  The app will be needed to verify the best location to install the antenna.  You will not need an account to use it:<br><br>-    Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.starlink.mobile&amp;hl=en_US<br>-    iPhone: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/starlink/id1537177988<br>-    2 min instruction video on App usage https://www.starlink.com/videos/2<br><br>This dispatch is a survey for the planned installation of a Starlink antenna.  You will be surveying the site to determine the following:<br>-    Where to mount a Starlink antenna<br>-    Where to mount the Starlink Power Supply<br>-    How the antenna cable will run from the Starlink Router/Power Supply to the antenna<br><br>Customer - AmeriGas Propane, L.P.<br>Child Acct - 06059246<br>Location - 4444 - Mayfield, KY<br>Address - 2578 Highway 121, Mayfield, KY 42066<br><br>Kit - Standard Kit (STARLINK-STANDARD-BUNDLE)<br>Mount Preference - Tech Recommendation -<br><br>PPE Required - <br>Standard<br><br>This survey comes with the expectation that the surveying tech can also complete the installation on a separate dispatch after this survey is reviewed and approved.<br>-    If you cannot perform cable work, antenna installation, or are not comfortable with heights, please do not request this dispatch.<br><br>Review the attached Starlink Survey Guide before dispatching.<br>-    Survey Guide will need to be filled out and returned w/ requested pictures.<br>-    Payment will be withheld until all deliverables are received.<br><br>Deliverables<br>-    Signoff Sheet<br>-    Completed Starlink Survey Guide (Blank attached)<br>-   All Requested Pictures<br><br>Zero Roof Penetrations:  The contractor is strictly prohibited from drilling, lagging, or otherwise penetrating any roofing membrane, substrate, or flashing.<br><br>Cable Pathing:  Cables shall enter the building through existing conduits, wall penetrations (if authorized). No new holes may be drilled through the roof to route cabling.<br><br>Authorized Mounting Only:  Any deviation from non-penetrating mounting methods requires approval.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T09:00","end":"2026-10-12T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":10.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"starlink\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-12T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05999131-Durham - Site #9927-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000