{"job":{"id":20129191,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"POSRG Remarketing Group","title":"Imbox Upgrade","description":{"html":"<p><strong>*******PLEASE READ ENTIRE WORK ORDER BEFORE ACCEPTING*********</strong></p><p><strong><u>-----------------THIS IS FOR A SHOE PROTECTION SPRAY KIOSK------------------------</u></strong></p><p><em>-------------------------ALL GUIDES ARE PROVIDED BELOW-----------------------------</em></p><p>***TECH WILL NEED ALL EQUIPMENT FROM REQUIRED LIST BELOW***</p><p><strong><em>Please read the entire work order before requesting this job.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>TECH: Please call Work Order Manager (see ticket) when you first arrive. If additional technical assistance is needed, please reach out to WO manager to connect to support.</em></strong></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work Overview</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>!!!!!!!!!!!PLEASE READ ALL UPGRADE GUIDE PROVIDED!!!!!!!</u></strong></p><p>YOU WILL BE UPGRADING MULTIPLE HARDWARE PARTS</p><p>Follow guide provided( make sure you have all required tools to complete)</p><p>Spray test video must be submitted and approved by WOM</p><p><br></p><p>SN - 522010316</p><p><br></p><p><em>If any pieces are missing from the shipped unit please inform the work order manager immediately.</em></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***</del></strong><strong>Failure to check in may result in a loss of compensation and any travel expenses.</strong></p><p><strong><u>Required Deliverables to be Paid</u></strong></p><p><strong>MUST&nbsp;</strong>check in/out with POSRG work order manager.</p><p>The Imbox has been tested and is functioning before departure.</p><p>Complete the check list and attach photos to the work order.</p><p>Leave detailed closing notes.</p><p><strong><u>Required Tools</u></strong></p><p>Tools:</p><ul><li>Torx bit bet (T6 – T30)</li><li>&nbsp;1.5mm long allen wrench or whole T6 screwdriver</li><li>Precision screwdriver set</li><li>Screwdriver set</li><li>Double faced soft mallet</li><li>Curved needle nose</li><li>Socket set (5.5mm, 10mm, etc.)</li><li>Adjustable wrench</li><li>Light</li><li>Knee pads or foam cushion</li></ul>","markdown":"**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*PLEASE READ ENTIRE WORK ORDER BEFORE ACCEPTING\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**-----------------THIS IS FOR A SHOE PROTECTION SPRAY KIOSK------------------------**\n\n*-------------------------ALL GUIDES ARE PROVIDED BELOW-----------------------------*\n\n\\*\\*\\*TECH WILL NEED ALL EQUIPMENT FROM REQUIRED LIST BELOW\\*\\*\\*\n\n***Please read the entire work order before requesting this job.***\n\n***TECH: Please call Work Order Manager (see ticket) when you first arrive. If additional technical assistance is needed, please reach out to WO manager to connect to support.***\n\n**Scope of Work Overview**\n\n**!!!!!!!!!!!PLEASE READ ALL UPGRADE GUIDE PROVIDED!!!!!!!**\n\nYOU WILL BE UPGRADING MULTIPLE HARDWARE PARTS\n\nFollow guide provided( make sure you have all required tools to complete)\n\nSpray test video must be submitted and approved by WOM\n\nSN - 522010316\n\n*If any pieces are missing from the shipped unit please inform the work order manager immediately.*\n\n**\\*\\*\\*****Failure to check in may result in a loss of compensation and any travel expenses.**\n\n**Required Deliverables to be Paid**\n\n**MUST** check in/out with POSRG work order manager.\n\nThe Imbox has been tested and is functioning before departure.\n\nComplete the check list and attach photos to the work order.\n\nLeave detailed closing notes.\n\n**Required Tools**\n\nTools:\n\n- Torx bit bet (T6 – T30)\n- 1.5mm long allen wrench or whole T6 screwdriver\n- Precision screwdriver set\n- Screwdriver set\n- Double faced soft mallet\n- Curved needle nose\n- Socket set (5.5mm, 10mm, etc.)\n- Adjustable wrench\n- Light\n- Knee pads or foam cushion","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T10:00","end":"2026-10-08T14:30","latestStart":"2026-10-08T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":450,"m