{"job":{"id":20129600,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Lingo Telecom","title":"ARC-Broadband IW/Jacks","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Requesting a Data/ Equipment savvy technician to dispatch to the site to assist Lingo with troubleshooting the client's data equipment. The site is reporting peplink device down need troubleshoot the issue to bring back device back online. The technician will need to call Lingo Repair 8883666993 opt 2 for an open/close code and to work directly with a Lingo Data technician. Please provide ticket number 00523977. We will provide any additional information such as static IP or Equipment login if needed for troubleshooting, once the technician is onsite and actively engaged with Lingo Repair. We will also need pictures of equipment before and after and<br> a description of topology. Note: If you are unable to complete the dispatch due to the extent of work required, please submit a quote with pictures so that we can review and reschedule.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>Notice: For check in and check out codes, if it is outside Lingo business hours (M-F 8am-5pm Eastern) and you call in for the the open and/or close code, please leave a message with your name and Field Nation work order number and Lingo will fill in the codes by the next business day.</em></p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\nRequesting a Data/ Equipment savvy technician to dispatch to the site to assist Lingo with troubleshooting the client's data equipment. The site is reporting peplink device down need troubleshoot the issue to bring back device back online. The technician will need to call Lingo Repair 8883666993 opt 2 for an open/close code and to work directly with a Lingo Data technician. Please provide ticket number 00523977. We will provide any additional information such as static IP or Equipment login if needed for troubleshooting, once the technician is onsite and actively engaged with Lingo Repair. We will also need pictu