{"job":{"id":20130143,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TruMed Systems","title":"Vaccine Management Machine - Heater Pan Swap - 01464","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work OVERVIEW</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">Reported Issues: Perform Resistance Checks.<br/>De-ice unit.<br/>Swap parts if Resistance Checks failed.<br/>Ensure EPS is regreased properly.<br/>Assist with post repair tests. FedEx Tracking: 878275348359</span></p><p>Evaporator fan failure occurred. Clear the ice/grease buildup, troubleshoot the Evaporator fan. Replace the Heater pan assembly (if Applicable), Install Flow Balancer (if applicable). Install the Battery safety kit (insulator shield, inline fuse cable, rubber insulating edges/cable ties) (if Applicable)<strong> Must have Heat Gun, Voltage Meter and review and have tool's listed in the Work Instructions (AV0024_ Work Instruction_Repairs Behind EPS_Rev K.pdf) or you could be penalized or not paid for the Service Cal</strong>l</p><p><strong><em>High-quality photos of completed work are crucial for our engineering team. Please ensure that the photos are detailed, clear, and encompass all areas where ice buildup has occurred over time.</em></strong></p><p><strong>﻿Video Tutorials Below</strong></p><p>PAN JOB VIDEO:</p><p>https://youtu.be/aU2_NebvhpQART Part 1</p><p><br></p><p>https://youtu.be/06UWLcsTeA8 Part 2</p><p><br></p><p>https://youtu.be/nNNaMOXogcw Part 3</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** ** **** *** **** ** *** **** </del></span><del>****************************</del></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** ** ******* ******** **** *************</del></span><del>*******************************************</del></p><p><br></p><p><strong>You MUST have the tools listed in the file: TOOLS REQUIRED TO GET PAID.</strong></p><p><strong>Scope Specific Tools</strong></p><ul><li>PPE</li><li>Voltage Meter</li><li>T20 Torx Driver (10-inch)</li><li>T10 Torx Driver</li><li>T