{"job":{"id":20130415,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"DiverseNet","title":"Troubleshoot AA system - Avaya IP Office 500 Certification Required","description":{"html":"<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Technician must upload all deliverables before calling DiverseNet to check out or leaving site</li>\n<li>Technician must call to check in and out with DiverseNet to receive full payment</li>\n<li>Technician must arrive during the given time frame to receive full payment</li>\n<li>Any out of scope work, or time logged past the not to exceed amount, must be approved by DiverseNet to receive payment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>SKILLS, TOOLS, MATERIALS AND DRESS CODE</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>Pre-work</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Print PDF work order attached to work order before heading to site</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Skills</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Low Voltage Cabling&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Networking</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Tools/Materials</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Laptop with a physical network port OR a USB network adapter (RJ45) and must have HDMI, VGA</li>\n<li>Smartphone with camera</li>\n<li>Cat5 Tester</li>\n<li>Cable Toner and Wand</li>\n<li>Multimeter</li>\n<li>Crimper (Cat-5)</li>\n<li>FlashLight</li>\n<li>Network Termination Tools</li>\n<li>Video Termination Tools</li>\n<li>Basic Handtools</li>\n<li>Spare VGA, DVI and Cat5 Patch Cables (for testing)</li>\n<li>Extension Cord</li>\n<li>Tape Measure</li>\n<li>Velcro</li>\n<li>8ft Ladder</li>\n<li>Coax Cable</li>\n<li>Cat5e Data Cable</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Dress Code</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Close toed shoes</li>\n<li>Long pants</li>\n<li>Collared shirt</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>CHECK IN INSTRUCTIONS AND ESCALATION</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We will be representing&nbsp;<del>****************</del>while on site.</li>\n<li>Check in with DiverseNet at&nbsp;317-536-6000 opt 2 and reference case number&nbsp;00051711\n<ul>\n<li>Ask for&nbsp;<strong><u>DiverseNet&nbsp;Check in code</u></strong> (<u>Required for Payment</u>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Check in with <del>**********</del> at <del>************</del>and reference <del>***</del></li>\n<li>Check in with&nbsp;<del>***</del>&nbsp;to verify location of equipment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Use the following escalation path for all issues onsite:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>If first&nbsp;contact is non-responsive call&nbsp;DiverseNet at&nbsp;317-536-6000 opt 2</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION OF WORK</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please call Continuant for approval every 2hrs if more hrs needed <del>************</del>. If no approval there can be delay in payment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We are in need of a technician to visit the following site:</p>\n<p>Mebane Factory Store 4000 Arrowhead Blvd</p>\n<p>Suite 310 Mebane, NC 27302</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>The technician will need to complete the following scope of work:</p>\n<p>Technician will need to go onsite and troubleshoot. Calls ring to the store, but the AA system does not pick up on any lines.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Note: If access to the mall telco DMARC is needed, please confirm tech being sent has credentials/authorization before sending.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>System Type: Avaya IP Office 500</p>\n<p>**Note: Technician needs to be Avaya IP Office 500 certified.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Technician will need to bring the following items:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Laptop</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Network cables ( straight through cable )</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>IP Office admin suite 11.0 or greater installed</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Teamviewer ( screen share application )</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Wireless Hotspot capability</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tone and tracer ( to trace out cables )</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Butt set to (test for dial tone )</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Krone tool ( punch down tool )</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Printed and Signed Work Order with Date and Times</li>\n<li>Pictures of Work Done</li>\n<li>Picture of Equipment&nbsp;Connected (if applicable, include Serial Number)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>CHECK OUT INSTRUCTIONS</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out&nbsp;with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 x2 and reference case number&nbsp;00051711\n<ul>\n<li>Ask for <strong><u>DiverseNet Check Out code</u></strong>(Required for Payment)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Check out with <del>**********</del> at <del>************</del>and reference <del>***</del>\n<ul>\n<li><del>*** ********** **** **** ********** *** *** ** ** *** ******** *****</del></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTES**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Technician must upload all deliverables before calling DiverseNet to check out or leaving site\n- Technician must call to check in and out with DiverseNet to receive full payment\n- Technician must arrive during the given time frame to receive full payment\n- Any out of scope work, or time logged past the not to exceed amount, must be approved by DiverseNet to receive payment\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**SKILLS, TOOLS, MATERIALS AND DRESS CODE**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**Pre-work**\n\n- Print PDF work order attached to work order before heading to site\n\n**Skills**\n\n- Low Voltage Cabling\n- Networking\n\n**Tools/Materials**\n\n- Laptop with a physical network port OR a USB network adapter (RJ45) and must have HDMI, VGA\n- Smartphone with camera\n- Cat5 Tester\n- Cable Toner and Wand\n- Multimeter\n- Crimper (Cat-5)\n- FlashLight\n- Network Termination Tools\n- Video Termination Tools\n- Basic Handtools\n- Spare VGA, DVI and Cat5 Patch Cables (for testing)\n- Extension Cord\n- Tape Measure\n- Velcro\n- 8ft Ladder\n- Coax Cable\n- Cat5e Data Cable\n\n**Dress Code**\n\n- Close toed shoes\n- Long pants\n- Collared shirt\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**CHECK IN INSTRUCTIONS AND ESCALATION**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- We will be representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*while on site.\n- Check in with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 opt 2 and reference case number 00051711 \n  - Ask for **DiverseNet Check in code** (Required for Payment)\n- Check in with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*and reference \\*\\*\\*\n- Check in with \\*\\*\\* to verify location of equipment\n\nUse the following escalation path for all issues onsite:\n\n1. If first contact is non-responsive call DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 opt 2\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**DESCRIPTION OF WORK**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Please call Continuant for approval every 2hrs if more hrs needed \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*. If no approval there can be delay in payment\n\nWe are in need of a technician to visit the following site:\n\nMebane Factory Store 4000 Arrowhead Blvd\n\nSuite 310 Mebane, NC 27302\n\nThe technician will need to complete the following scope of work:\n\nTechnician will need to go onsite and troubleshoot. Calls ring to the store, but the AA system does not pick up on any lines.\n\n\\*\\*Note: If access to the mall telco DMARC is needed, please confirm tech being sent has credentials/authorization before sending.\n\nSystem Type: Avaya IP Office 500\n\n\\*\\*Note: Technician needs to be Avaya IP Office 500 certified.\n\nTechnician will need to bring the following items:\n\nLaptop\n\nNetwork cables ( straight through cable )\n\nIP Office admin suite 11.0 or greater installed\n\nTeamviewer ( screen share application )\n\nWireless Hotspot capability\n\nTone and tracer ( to trace out cables )\n\nButt set to (test for dial tone )\n\nKrone tool ( punch down tool )\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Printed and Signed Work Order with Date and Times\n- Pictures of Work Done\n- Picture of Equipment Connected (if applicable, include Serial Number)\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**CHECK OUT INSTRUCTIONS**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Check out with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 x2 and reference case number 00051711 \n  - Ask for **DiverseNet Check Out code**(Required for Payment)\n- Check out with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*and reference \\*\\*\\*\n  - \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T10:00","end":"2026-10-08T14:00","latestStart":"2026-10-08T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":360},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":90,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":32.20320046785529},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Thu, Oct 8, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Thu, Oct 8, Fri, Oct 9, Mon, Oct 12 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04: