{"job":{"id":"8970247790","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"AMSYS","title":"Router Install  Zebulon  NC","description":"<p><strong><em>**** Please Do NOT reach to the client or end user regarding any issue pertaining to work market. ANY such issue should be directed to work market or to the assigned Project Manager from AMSYS Innovative Solutions.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Router install request for </p><p>Equipment will need to be picked up from FedEx pickup location. and installed at . Please have ID ready for equipment release. Routers should be picked up and on site by the start time. Routers will need to be racked and cabled prior to the bridge line being opened. Cabling instructions attached. The bridge line information for testing and connectivity verification: +</p><p>This will be a standard phase 1 refresh install. We will be installing 2 new routers, connecting them to the old routers via the management port on the 4331 and the GE0/0/0 on the new 8300 routers using the supplied coper cable.. The new routers will be connected together with the provided fiber cables. G0/0/4 from \"A\" to G0/0/4 on \"B\". G0/0/5 from \"A\" to G0/0/5 on \"B\".</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em>﻿Tools Require:</em></p><p>Please bring the following tools to the site.</p><p>Basic Hand tool, Laptop, USB drive and Console cable /ethernet cable</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T11:00","end":"2026-10-29T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":5,"distance":20.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $200 (countered: $325) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04: