{"job":{"id":20130926,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ALL STAR REPAIR WORKS LLC","title":"TV Diagnose-Dish Antenna & Channel Setup","description":{"html":"<p>Issue / Request:</p><p>Customer needs the dish antenna connected and configured with the Samsung 43\" TV. Channels need to be scanned and set up for proper viewing.</p><p>Samsung 43\" TV On Stand</p><p>Scope of Work:</p><p><br></p><p>Connect dish antenna to the Samsung 43\" TV.</p><p><br></p><p>Check signal/input connection.</p><p><br></p><p>Configure satellite/dish settings as applicable.</p><p><br></p><p>Perform channel scan/tuning.</p><p><br></p><p>Verify available channels and proper picture/sound.</p><p><br></p><p>Test the TV after setup.</p><p><br></p><p>Completion:</p><p>Technician to confirm dish signal and channels are working properly before completing the service call.</p>","markdown":"Issue / Request:\n\nCustomer needs the dish antenna connected and configured with the Samsung 43\" TV. Channels need to be scanned and set up for proper viewing.\n\nSamsung 43\" TV On Stand\n\nScope of Work:\n\nConnect dish antenna to the Samsung 43\" TV.\n\nCheck signal/input connection.\n\nConfigure satellite/dish settings as applicable.\n\nPerform channel scan/tuning.\n\nVerify available channels and proper picture/sound.\n\nTest the TV after setup.\n\nCompletion:\n\nTechnician to confirm dish signal and channels are working properly before completing the service call.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T10:00","end":"2026-10-08T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-08T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":70},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":8.281376876963776},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"s