{"job":{"id":20131228,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Digacore Technology Consulting","title":"Port Repair - ","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience&nbsp;in <strong>cable terminations/running cable.</strong></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Estimated duration will be</span><strong style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.5 hours</strong></li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Scope of Work:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span>Tech is required to&nbsp;<strong>work with backend support on the following: Tone out two voip lines for telephones possible repunch or repair.</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>If re-terminating and ensuring cable is plugged into a switch, extra funds will be added to re-run the cable.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Dress Code:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Business casual</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Tools Required:</strong><em style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</em><span style=\"color: black;\">Cat 5/5e/6 cable, Drill (with bits), Termination Kit, Network toner, 6ft ladder</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Onsite contact –&nbsp;</span>Michele Alberti</p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Digacore while onsite</li><li>Call 732-646-5725 and ask to speak with your backend support technician&nbsp;<strong>John&nbsp;</strong>before starting work</li></ol><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Must upload pictures of work done prior to leaving</li><li>Check-out of work order</li></ol><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Escalation Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order or you have any questions what so ever, discuss with&nbsp;<strong>John</st