{"job":{"id":20131393,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"IP Camera Installation","description":{"html":"<p>Tech will be on site to install IP Camera(s) that will be on site. They will install the camera 3' into the store on the already provided drop pole and use existing cabling. Will have to install the PoE Injector as well once the camera is plugged in. The Tech will need to complete an online form after the installation to submit the deliverables. Tech is to use existing cabling and install the cameras based on the site plan.</p><p>Once the installation is complete the tech will do the following:</p><ol><li>Take photos of the installed devices</li><li>Complete an online Installation checklist (submit the photos taken and any additional photos required)</li><li>Work with Veteranson on any adjustments needed</li></ol><p>Techs should be on site for no longer than 90 minutes. If any delays tech must notify Veteranson immediately.</p><p>Please only send one tech to the site unless told in writing otherwise by Veteranson.</p>","markdown":"Tech will be on site to install IP Camera(s) that will be on site. They will install the camera 3' into the store on the already provided drop pole and use existing cabling. Will have to install the PoE Injector as well once the camera is plugged in. The Tech will need to complete an online form after the installation to submit the deliverables. Tech is to use existing cabling and install the cameras based on the site plan.\n\nOnce the installation is complete the tech will do the following:\n\n1. Take photos of the installed devices\n2. Complete an online Installation checklist (submit the photos taken and any additional photos required)\n3. Work with Veteranson on any adjustments needed\n\nTechs should be on site for no longer than 90 minutes. If any delays tech must notify Veteranson immediately.\n\nPlease only send one tech to the site unless told in writing otherwise by Veteranson.","actions":[]},"isR