{"job":{"id":20131402,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Mattress Firm - Access Point Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>Check-in Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Check in with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755</p>\n<p>Device information</p>\n<p>Network Type: Wireless Access Point</p>\n<p>Network Device Make/Model: Meraki MR36</p>\n<p>Device IP: 10.179.12.67</p>\n<p>Subnet: 255.255.255.224</p>\n<p>GW: 10.179.12.65</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Description of trouble: AP2 has failed</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>SOW:</p>\n<p>Please dispatch a technician to replace a wireless access point.</p>\n<p>Technician needs to ensure that the replacement device maintains a stable 1 Gbps connection.</p>\n<p>Ceiling height is estimated to be around 12 ft and the store's ladder is sufficient to access it.</p>\n<p>Technician must have a laptop and confirm that all lines and devices are working prior to release.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please bring a laptop with you. If you have a hotspot, bring it with you.</p>\n<p>Please bring a tone generator and tracer in case you must trace wiring.</p>\n<p>If going out to RUN or TEST wiring bring a CABLE TESTER</p>\n<p>Please bring patch cable (RJ45 and RJ11) and butt sett</p>\n<p>Make sure all the devices are working prior to leaving site.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>MFI Escalations/Contacts:</p>\n<p>8552343755</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>While Onsite:</p>\n<p>-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed</p>\n<p>-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW</p>\n<p>-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Checkout Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Check out with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755</p>\n<p>-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Tech must document store manager's name and Mattress Firm IT support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout</p>\n<p>-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Required Tools:</p>\n<p>-Basic Cabling Tools</p>\n<p>-Butt set</p>\n<p>-Cable toner</p>\n<p>-Cable Tester</p>\n<p>-Label Maker</p>\n<p>-CAT 6 cabling</p>\n<p>-fiber tester</p>\n<p>-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends</p>\n<p>-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights</p>","markdown":"Check-in Requirements:\n\n-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1\n\n-Check in with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755\n\nDevice information\n\nNetwork Type: Wireless Access Point\n\nNetwork Device Make/Model: Meraki MR36\n\nDevice IP: 10.179.12.67\n\nSubnet: 255.255.255.224\n\nGW: 10.179.12.65\n\nDescription of trouble: AP2 has failed\n\nSOW:\n\nPlease dispatch a technician to replace a wireless access point.\n\nTechnician needs to ensure that the replacement device maintains a stable 1 Gbps connection.\n\nCeiling height is estimated to be around 12 ft and the store's ladder is sufficient to access it.\n\nTechnician must have a laptop and confirm that all lines and devices are working prior to release.\n\nPlease bring a laptop with you. If you have a hotspot, bring it with you.\n\nPlease bring a tone generator and tracer in case you must trace wiring.\n\nIf going out to RUN or TEST wiring bring a CABLE TESTER\n\nPlease bring patch cable (RJ45 and RJ11) and butt sett\n\nMake sure all the devices are working prior to leaving site.\n\nMFI Escalations/Contacts:\n\n8552343755\n\nWhile Onsite:\n\n-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed\n\n-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW\n\n-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite\n\nCheckout Requirements:\n\n-Check out with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755\n\n-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1\n\n-Tech must document store manager's name and Mattress Firm IT support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout\n\n-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n-Basic Cabling Tools\n\n-Butt set\n\n-Cable toner\n\n-Cable Tester\n\n-Label Maker\n\n-CAT 6 cabling\n\n-fiber tester\n\n-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends\n\n-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T11:00","end":"2026-10-09T13:00","latestStart":"2026-10-09T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14.810628126766671},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vinson Service_ISS Call"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)