{"job":{"id":20131613,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"Installation","description":{"html":"<p>*** All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables. *** Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app. More details available through the SSN app including PDF guides and Tech Support contact info. Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site.</p>\n<p>Cabinet Type: L-100</p>\n<p>Help Traka technician install cabinet</p>\n<p>You are a helper on this job. Assist their technician.</p>\n<p>You must use the SSN app while on site to submit photos. Set up your profile immediately after accepting the work order. We will need your email to get you started.</p>\n<p>After downloading the app the organization key is SIT563.</p>\n<p>Technician: <del>******** ************</del></p>\n<p>-------------------</p>\n<p>Requirements: Driving License; Hard hat; Hi-vis tabard; Safety boots; Safety glasses; Safety gloves</p>\n<p>Time: 9:00am EST</p>\n<p>Estimated time on site: 1 hour</p>\n<p>-------------------</p>\n<p><del>***********</del></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*\\* All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables. \\*\\*\\* Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app. More details available through the SSN app including PDF guides and Tech Support contact info. Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site.\n\nCabinet Type: L-100\n\nHelp Traka technician install cabinet\n\nYou are a helper on this job. Assist their technician.\n\nYou must use the SSN app while on site to submit photos. Set up your profile immediately after accepting the work order. We will need your email to get you started.\n\nAfter downloading the app the organization key is SIT563.\n\nTechnician: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\-------------------\n\nRequirements: Driving License; Hard hat; Hi-vis tabard; Safety boots; Safety glasses; Safety gloves\n\nTime: 9:00am EST\n\nEstimated time on site: 1 hour\n\n\\-------------------\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T09:00","end":"2026-10-22T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":100},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":59.904441531992354},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1791474785609}
{"job":{"id":20131745,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"OWL Automotive Consulting, LLC","title":"PC Install","description":{"html":"<p>Replace aging or at-risk PCs identified for hardware refresh. PCs will be provided pre-imaged by the manufacturer and ready for deployment.</p><p> Technician responsibilities:</p><ul><li> Remove the existing PC and install the replacement.</li><li> Connect required peripherals and cables.</li><li> Verify the new PC powers on and is properly connected.</li><li> Ensure the workstation is left clean and operational.</li><li> Securely store all removed PCs and hardware onsite for recycling/pickup.</li></ul><p> This is a straightforward hardware swap. No imaging, software installation, configuration, or troubleshooting is required beyond basic verification.</p>","markdown":"Replace aging or at-risk PCs identified for hardware refresh. PCs will be provided pre-imaged by the manufacturer and ready for deployment.\n\n Technician responsibilities:\n\n- Remove the existing PC and install the replacement.\n- Connect required peripherals and cables.\n- Verify the new PC powers on and is properly connected.\n- Ensure the workstation is left clean and operational.\n- Securely store all removed PCs and hardware onsite for recycling/pickup.\n\n This is a straightforward hardware swap. No imaging, software installation, configuration, or troubleshooting is required beyond basic verification.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T09:00","end":"2026-10-19T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":525},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":7,"distance":11.836832320554707},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":75,"baseAmount":525,"estHours":7,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null},"reason":"TRAVEL_REQUIRED","rejectDetails":"Travel required (11.836832320554707mi reported + 10mi padding = 21.836832320554706mi > 20mi)"},"availableBlock