{"job":{"id":20131747,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"OWL Automotive Consulting, LLC","title":"PC Install","description":{"html":"<p>Replace aging or at-risk PCs identified for hardware refresh. PCs will be provided pre-imaged by the manufacturer and ready for deployment.</p><p> Technician responsibilities:</p><ul><li> Remove the existing PC and install the replacement.</li><li> Connect required peripherals and cables.</li><li> Verify the new PC powers on and is properly connected.</li><li> Ensure the workstation is left clean and operational.</li><li> Securely store all removed PCs and hardware onsite for recycling/pickup.</li></ul><p> This is a straightforward hardware swap. No imaging, software installation, configuration, or troubleshooting is required beyond basic verification.</p>","markdown":"Replace aging or at-risk PCs identified for hardware refresh. PCs will be provided pre-imaged by the manufacturer and ready for deployment.\n\n Technician responsibilities:\n\n- Remove the existing PC and install the replacement.\n- Connect required peripherals and cables.\n- Verify the new PC powers on and is properly connected.\n- Ensure the workstation is left clean and operational.\n- Securely store all removed PCs and hardware onsite for recycling/pickup.\n\n This is a straightforward hardware swap. No imaging, software installation, configuration, or troubleshooting is required beyond basic verification.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T09:00","end":"2026-10-19T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":525},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":7,"distance":11.836832320554707},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":75,"baseAmount":525,"estHours":7,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null},"reason":"TRAVEL_REQUIRED","rejectDetails":"Travel required (11.836832320554707mi reported + 10mi padding = 21.836832320554706mi > 20mi)"},"availableBlock