{"job":{"id":20132302,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"Kiosk Scanner Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>Dispenser's scanner isn't functioning and needs to be replaced.&nbsp;EPC has shipped a replacement scanner to the store via FedEx. <strong>Check FedEx tracking before arriving to the store</strong>. You will need to remove the amplifier in order to access the scanner. The amplifier and scanner are located on the inside of the door in the bottom left corner. You will need a phillips head screw driver and a 3/8\" socket with a short extension. If this is a brand new scanner you will have to scan the initialization bar codes attached to the work order. Scan the top code first and then the bottom one, we might need to restart the application.</p><p>Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff.&nbsp;After replacing the scanner, confirm that it is able to scan cards (we may need to restart the application after the swap).&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span></p><p>Call EPC to confirm it is functioning properly.&nbsp;Finally, ship the faulty parts back to EPC by dropping the package off at a FedEx location using the enclosed return shipping label.</p>","markdown":"Dispenser's scanner isn't functioning and needs to be replaced. EPC has shipped a replacement scanner to the store via FedEx. **Check FedEx tracking before arriving to the store**. You will need to remove the amplifier in order to access the scanner. The amplifier and scanner are located on the inside of the door in the bottom left corner. You will need a phillips head screw driver and a 3/8\" socket with a short extension. If this is a brand new scanner you will have to scan the initialization bar codes attached to the work order. Scan the top code first and then the bottom one, we might need to restart the application.\n\nCall EPC when onsite and check in with store staff. After replacing the scanner, confirm that it is able to scan cards (we may need to restart the application after the swap).\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.\n\nCall EPC to confirm it is functioning properly. Finally, ship the faulty parts back to EPC by dropping the package off at a FedEx location using the enclosed return shipping label.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T09:00","end":"2026-10-09T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-09T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":10.901950696558725},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $85 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vinson Service_ISS Call"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"st