{"job":{"id":20122819,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Scarsdale Security Systems Inc","title":"Scarsdale Ticket #842085 - ZN 44 REAR DOOR (sn 01989649) - Technician to replace CR123A and also install external contact at rear door transmitter, call Scarsdale for programming and test operation. Ensure zone 44 remains Normal when door is locked.","description":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>ZN 44 REAR DOOR (sn 01989649) - Technician to replace CR123A and also install external contact at rear door transmitter, call Scarsdale for programming and test operation. Ensure zone 44 remains Normal when door is locked.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Parts onsite-</strong> 544823195855 delivered 10/07 10:18 Received by DDUPREE.</li>\n<li><strong>**IMPORTANT** In order for technician to get paid, a SIGNED SERVICE TICKET must also be returned with ticket notes. THIS IS THE CUSTOMER'S EXPECTATION</strong></li>\n<li><strong>﻿YOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS IN THE CONFIDENTIAL INFO SECTION OF THIS WORK ORDER !! Thank You.</strong></li>\n<li>IF A PART NEEDS TO BE REPLACED, DOCUMENT THE MAKE, MODEL AND SERIAL NUMBER OF DEVICE. PROVIDE NOTES AS TO WHY PART MUST BE REPLACED. UPLOAD PICTURE TO WORK ORDER.</li>\n<li>\"STOCKROOM / BURGLAR ALARM / Burglar Alarm / Connectivity Issue / Our rear door alarm isn't setting properly and we have been getting calls from Scarsdale Security saying the burglar alarm is being set off after we set it. They have dispatched police multiple times and there isn't a break in so we need our alarm checked and fixed\"</li>\n<li>FOR SYSTEM ON-TEST OR TECHNICAL SUPPORT WHEN ON SITE CALL 914-722-2933 BETWEEN 8 AM AND 7:30 PM EST MON - FRI.</li>\n<li>**BEFORE LEAVING SITE*** Technician MUST email notes/resolution to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com OR call 914-722-2933 and speak to one of our National Account Team Members</li>\n<li>***IMPORTANT** If a part needs to be replaced DOCUMENT the make, model, serial #. MUST PROVIDE NOTES as to WHY the part needs replaced (I.E. Damaged? Physically missing? Remodeling? Provide these DETAILS and upload picture to work order and/or email to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com Use provided return label to return ship any unused parts.</li>\n<li>TECH TO HAVE SERVICE CHANNEL *PROVIDER* APP INSTALLED ON PHONE OR TABLET. SEE GOOGLE PLAY STORE OR APPLE STORE FOR THE FREE APP. USE APP TO CHECK IN AND OUT. *OR* TECHNICIAN MUST USE AUTOMATED RESPONSE SYSTEM (IVR) TO CHECK IN WITH THE STORE PHONE UPON ARRIVAL TO THE LOCATION &amp; TO CHECK OUT WITH THE STORE PHONE UPON COMPLETION OF THE VISIT. CALL- USA- 516.500.7776 **Canada - 647-496-1288 (CA-ON), 506-300-3307 (CA-NB) – PIN NUMBER 75182 AND TRACKING NUMBER - 364980643 **WHEN CALLING FROM PREMISE PHONE, IF IVR DOES NOT LET YOU SIGN IN and OUT, CALL 855-269-6471. This will allow you to speak directly with a Service Channel Representative. If all else fails, call a Scarsdale Customer Service Representative at 914-722-2933. Thank you. **CHECKING IN WITH THE IVR DOES NOT PUT YOUR SYSTEM ON TEST!!!</li>\n<li>RF BATTERY REPLACEMENT -- a) Verify transmitter serial number to ensure it is correct detector/transmitter, b) Replace CR123A, press transmitter reset button. c) Ensure transmitter housing is properly closed/seated and test operation. d) Ensure detector resumes normal operation and that Restore signals are received at central station. (Must perform Sensor Reset) ** *DMP wireless systems REQUIRE Sensor Reset at keypad before restore signal is sent. Extreme cases may also require J16 panel reset. ** * Ademco/Honeywell system may require reset to restore wireless (CODE + OFF two times in a row at keypad) ** * INOVONICS - Requires receiver reset - Press/Release RESET button on Inovonics receiver, replace cover. **--Call Scarsdale 914-722-2933 to verify signals and for programming assistance &amp; support --**</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"- **ZN 44 REAR DOOR (sn 01989649) - Technician to replace CR123A and also install external contact at rear door transmitter, call Scarsdale for programming and test operation. Ensure zone 44 remains Normal when door is locked.**\n- **Parts onsite-** 544823195855 delivered 10/07 10:18 Received by DDUPREE.\n- **\\*\\*IMPORTANT\\*\\* In order for technician to get paid, a SIGNED SERVICE TICKET must also be returned with ticket notes. THIS IS THE CUSTOMER'S EXPECTATION**\n- **﻿YOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS IN THE CONFIDENTIAL INFO SECTION OF THIS WORK ORDER !! Thank You.**\n- IF A PART NEEDS TO BE REPLACED, DOCUMENT THE MAKE, MODEL AND SERIAL NUMBER OF DEVICE. PROVIDE NOTES AS TO WHY PART MUST BE REPLACED. UPLOAD PICTURE TO WORK ORDER.\n- \"STOCKROOM / BURGLAR ALARM / Burglar Alarm / Connectivity Issue / Our rear door alarm isn't setting properly and we have been getting calls from Scarsdale Security saying the burglar alarm is being set off after we set it. They have dispatched police multiple times and there isn't a break in so we need our alarm checked and fixed\"\n- FOR SYSTEM ON-TEST OR TECHNICAL SUPPORT WHEN ON SITE CALL 914-722-2933 BETWEEN 8 AM AND 7:30 PM EST MON - FRI.\n- \\*\\*BEFORE LEAVING SITE\\*\\*\\* Technician MUST email notes/resolution to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com OR call 914-722-2933 and speak to one of our National Account Team Members\n- \\*\\*\\*IMPORTANT\\*\\* If a part needs to be replaced DOCUMENT the make, model, serial #. MUST PROVIDE NOTES as to WHY the part needs replaced (I.E. Damaged? Physically missing? Remodeling? Provide these DETAILS and upload picture to work order and/or email to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com Use provided return label to return ship any unused parts.\n- TECH TO HAVE SERVICE CHANNEL \\*PROVIDER\\* APP INSTALLED ON PHONE OR TABLET. SEE GOOGLE PLAY STORE OR APPLE STORE FOR THE FREE APP. USE APP TO CHECK IN AND OUT. \\*OR\\* TECHNICIAN MUST USE AUTOMATED RESPONSE SYSTEM (IVR) TO CHECK IN WITH THE STORE PHONE UPON ARRIVAL TO THE LOCATION & TO CHECK OUT WITH THE STORE PHONE UPON COMPLETION OF THE VISIT. CALL- USA- 516.500.7776 \\*\\*Canada - 647-496-1288 (CA-ON), 506-300-3307 (CA-NB) – PIN NUMBER 75182 AND TRACKING NUMBER - 364980643 \\*\\*WHEN CALLING FROM PREMISE PHONE, IF IVR DOES NOT LET YOU SIGN IN and OUT, CALL 855-269-6471. This will allow you to speak directly with a Service Channel Representative. If all else fails, call a Scarsdale Customer Service Representative at 914-722-2933. Thank you. \\*\\*CHECKING IN WITH THE IVR DOES NOT PUT YOUR SYSTEM ON TEST!!!\n- RF BATTERY REPLACEMENT -- a) Verify transmitter serial number to ensure it is correct detector/transmitter, b) Replace CR123A, press transmitter reset button. c) Ensure transmitter housing is properly closed/seated and test operation. d) Ensure detector resumes normal operation and that Restore signals are received at central station. (Must perform Sensor Reset) \\*\\* \\*DMP wireless systems REQUIRE Sensor Reset at keypad before restore signal is sent. Extreme cases may also require J16 panel reset. \\*\\* \\* Ademco/Honeywell system may require reset to restore wireless (CODE + OFF two times in a row at keypad) \\*\\* \\* INOVONICS - Requires receiver reset - Press/Release RESET button on Inovonics receiver, replace cover. \\*\\*--Call Scarsdale 914-722-2933 to verify signals and for programming assistance & support --\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T10:00","end":"2026-10-14T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":32.16019359171262},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $85 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900