{"job":{"id":"3496232042","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard","description":"\"Install antenna<br>pool phone 9192667763<br>if install goes over 3 hours need detailed notes of why it ran over<br>*****************************************************************************<br>Michelle Nolan<br>*****************************************************************************<br><br>SOW - EPIK Cutover &amp; Test<br>*************************************************************************************<br>Before Arrival<br>1.    Call the LCON 30 minutes before arrival.<br>2.    Review the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK:<br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo<br>3.    Arrive with all required tools and materials listed below.<br>On Arrival<br>1.    Check in on WorkMarket.<br>2.    Locate the customer contact and confirm the install location.<br>3.    Review the Special Instructions before starting work.<br>EPIK Install Requirements<br>1.    Mount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik.<br>2.    If EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location. <br>3.    Power on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard.<br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on.<br>4.    If applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions.<br>5.    Log into the EPIK Install Wizard:<br>https://wizard.epik.io<br>6.    Follow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned.<br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES<br>Checkout Requirement<br>1.    Confirm Activations has released you.<br>2.    Submit all WorkMarket deliverables.<br>3.    Enter the checkout code in WorkMarket.<br>4.    Check out on WorkMarket.<br> <br>The install is not considered valid unless the checkout code is entered in WorkMarket.<br> <br>Required Deliverables<br>Submit all required deliverables in WorkMarket before checkout:<br>1.    Photo of completed EPIK install.<br>2.    Photo of labeled 66 block / harmonica block.<br>3.    List of existing TNs and the new number that replaced each TN, if applicable.<br>4.    Customer signed sign-out sheet.<br>5.    Any additional deliverables listed in Special Instructions.<br> <br> <br>Required Tools<br>•    Laptop<br>•    Smartphone with hotspot<br>•    Tone generator and wand<br>•    66/110 punch tool<br>•    Butt set<br>       Infrared Temperature Gun <br>•    Electrician scissors<br>•    Step ladder<br>•    Flashlight/headlamp<br>•    RJ11/RJ45 crimper<br>•    Ethernet cable tester<br>•    Impact drill / cordless drill<br>•    Masonry bits<br>•    Screwdrivers / driver bits<br>•    Needle-nose pliers<br>•    Label maker and label tape<br>•    Cat3 or better cable<br>•    Cat6 Ethernet cable<br>•    Cross-connect wire<br>•    Gel-crimp connectors<br>•    Cable ties and mounting hardware<br>•    RJ11/RJ45 plugs and keystone jacks<br>•    Console cables: USB to DB9 PL2303 and USB to USB-mini<br>*************************************************************************************","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T10:00","end":"2026-10-09T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":225},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":10.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Fri, Oct 9, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Fri, Oct 9, Mon, Oct 12, Tue, Oct 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.00