{"job":{"id":20132680,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"Automated Returns Kiosk|SHEETZ-507 | Display| Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>This work order is to get our customer back up and running.</p>\n<p>Only accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.</p>\n<p><strong>The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back</strong></p>\n<p><strong>NOTE: Call Kiosk and do not go to site if part has not delivered by your scheduled time.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>ISSUE:</strong> <strong>black screen with red light on. We need to troubleshoot the display, check the cables, and reseat them.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>-Tools Required:</strong></p>\n<p>__Standard Tool Set</p>\n<p>__Nut Drivers or Socket Set</p>\n<p>__Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth</p>\n<p>__A to B USB Cable</p>\n<p>__Compressed air/Canned Air</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>There are two screen sizes in total across the ARK fleet, each document is attached to the work order for the display/kiosk you find on site. Below are generic steps to remove the display, with supplemental information within each document pertaining to the specific model.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p>\n<p>__Check in with KIOSK (303) 926-3154</p>\n<p>__Disconnect display power, USB, and video cables</p>\n<p>__Remove P clip for cables.</p>\n<p>__Unscrew mounting screws from screen bracket</p>\n<p>__Mount new display using same hardware. Reattached P clip for cables.</p>\n<p>__Reconnect power, USB and video cables.</p>\n<p>__Test with Customer</p>\n<p>__Take note of OLD serial and NEW serial.</p>\n<p>__<strong>Call WO Manager to Check out</strong></p>","markdown":"This work order is to get our customer back up and running.\n\nOnly accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.\n\n**The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back**\n\n**NOTE: Call Kiosk and do not go to site if part has not delivered by your scheduled time.**\n\n**ISSUE:** **black screen with red light on. We need to troubleshoot the display, check the cables, and reseat them.**\n\n**-Tools Required:**\n\n\\_\\_Standard Tool Set\n\n\\_\\_Nut Drivers or Socket Set\n\n\\_\\_Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth\n\n\\_\\_A to B USB Cable\n\n\\_\\_Compressed air/Canned Air\n\n**There are two screen sizes in total across the ARK fleet, each document is attached to the work order for the display/kiosk you find on site. Below are generic steps to remove the display, with supplemental information within each document pertaining to the specific model.**\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n\\_\\_Check in with KIOSK (303) 926-3154\n\n\\_\\_Disconnect display power, USB, and video cables\n\n\\_\\_Remove P clip for cables.\n\n\\_\\_Unscrew mounting screws from screen bracket\n\n\\_\\_Mount new display using same hardware. Reattached P clip for cables.\n\n\\_\\_Reconnect power, USB and video cables.\n\n\\_\\_Test with Customer\n\n\\_\\_Take note of OLD serial and NEW serial.\n\n\\_\\_**Call WO Manager to Check out**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00","end":"2026-10-08T15:30","latestStart":"2026-10-08T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":15.02856770604206},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-08T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite ticket2"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vinson Service_ISS Call"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736663 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T