{"job":{"id":20133518,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Fortitude Nicsa Global Limited","title":"Critical Link Down Alert | Research Triangle Park, USA","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Service Description:</strong></p><ul><li>Basic Technical activities\t\t\t\t</li><li>Rack &amp; Stack\t\t\t\t</li><li>Running cables\t\t\t\t</li><li>Patching &amp; Labeling\t\t\t\t</li><li>Moving devices\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Understands fundamentals of internetworking\t\t\t\t</li><li>Connect to devices through comand interface\t\t\t\t</li><li>Perform common administrative tasks\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Perform standard troubleshooting\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Perform a Site survey\t</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Customer Name</strong></p><p><strong><del>****</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p>Requirements:</p><p><strong>Interview will be required</strong></p><p><strong>You will receive training from our team and the customer</strong></p><p><strong>This is NOT full time, you will be onboarded and receive access to customer site. The work model is under dispatch case/</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Business casual</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>Required Software:</li><li>Putty, MS Teams, AnyDesk, WebEx, Team Viewer, WhatsApp</li><li>Required Tools:</li><li>Screwdrivers, Anti-static wristband, A set of patch cords (at least 2m), Console Cable, 32GB USB Drive</li><li>Network Tester, Electronic spray clear, vacuum cleaner</li><li>Personal Protection Gear</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Internet</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Onsite Work:</strong></p><p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ol><li>Contact WO manager to confirm Scope of Work and Scheduling</li><li>Download and read the SOW</li><li>Ask questions if any</li><li>Download and print the onsite report</li><li>Quick conference call to review scope and solve questions</li></ol><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p>