\n- Screwdrivers, Anti-static wristband, A set of patch cords (at least 2m), Console Cable, 32GB USB Drive\n- Network Tester, Electronic spray clear, vacuum cleaner\n- Personal Protection Gear\n- Laptop\n- Internet\n\n**Onsite Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Contact WO manager to confirm Scope of Work and Scheduling\n2. Download and read the SOW\n3. Ask questions if any\n4. Download and print the onsite report\n5. Quick conference call to review scope and solve questions\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact and inform our Service Desk team. You represent\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* while onsite\n2. Join conference call with Remote Team who will guide and assist during the activity\n3. Take pictures\n4. Take note of serial numbers\n5. Take notes of actions\n6. Any issues or questions should be addressed to our team\n7. Send the report to our Service Desk team before leaving the site\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Send pictures via email, messaging or cloud storage folder\n2. Send signed report via email, messaging or cloud storage folder\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with WO manager\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to WO manager\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Any additional hours and expenses must be pre approved by WO manager\n- Any additional hours and expenses incurring without pre approval will be denied","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T09:45","end":"2026-10-09T13:45"},"payRange":{"min":170,"max":230},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":170},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":7.037388443886853},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Fri, Oct 9, 9:45 A