nk<br><br>New Granite DIA Circuit Info:<br><br>Circuit ID: BSPD/450365261<br> Circuit Speed: 10M <br>Type : DIA<br><br>Hand off : Copper \\(RJ45\\) <br>Modem or Router Serial/Model Number/ :<br><br>Carrier Device Port: Port 3<br>Carrier Port Config: auto-1000-full <br> Demarc: 1st floor, OUTSIDE THE OFFICE IN THE WAREHOUSE/LOADING DOCK AREA, Wall mounted Port 3: Labeled with NC/KXFN/179911/LUMN no ext. GNVMNCAW4P001 network port 1 <br> Local exchange carrier \\(LEC\\): Brightspeed <br> Gateway IP - 4.21.46.201<br>Usable IP - 4.21.46.202<br>Subnet - 255.255.255.248<br><br>Required MATERIALS:<br>Laptop PC \\(Windows 2000 or higher\\) with administrator login, AC power adapter internet access, cell/mobile card or hotspot\\), DB-9 serial cable &amp; serial port on laptop or USB-to-serial adapter, USB to USB Console Cable, 4G card, AC extension cord, cell phone with charger, min 500ft CAT5E cabling, RJ45 jacks and plugs, biscuit jacks, surface mount box, NID splitter, DSL filters","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T10:00","end":"2026-10-09T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":72.1},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Fri, Oct 9, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Fri, Oct 9, Mon, Oct 12, Tue, Oct 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vinso