{"job":{"id":20133618,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Rack and stack of a single server","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Install 1 new server [ThinkSystem SR250 V3]</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Basic Scope:</strong> Technician needed onsite to install new server [ThinkSystem SR250 V3], per <del>***** </del>supplied documentation with connectivity of a single external USB hard drive. Once racked and cabled, the server will need to be validated by the remote team and will require a series of photos. New Equipment and Installation Material will be shipped to site prior to the scheduled date. Device Details and Device S/N(s) will be provided. Site will have 1 New Server Needing Installed.</li><li><strong>Quantity of engineers required:</strong> 1 engineers</li><li><strong>Tools required:</strong> Basic hand tools, Windows based laptop with Wi-Fi and Ethernet capabilities. One strait through RJ45 patch cable (3ft to 6ft in length).</li><li><strong>Supplies required:</strong> Velcro or cable straps</li><li><strong>Number of devices within scope:</strong> QTY 1 ThinkSystem SR250 V3</li><li><strong>Hardware assembly requirements:</strong> Following Lenovo Provided Install guide, install rails and server, install USB Drive and Set Drive on top of the server</li><li><strong>Cabling requirements:</strong> Per provided documentation</li><li><strong>Connectivity to customer network:</strong> Customer assisted</li><li><strong>Estimated duration per engineer:</strong> Approx. 4 hours per engineer, per day</li><li><strong>Service date(s) and times:</strong> Service scheduled 9AM</li><li><strong>Primary point of contact:</strong><del> ***** ****** *** ************ ** ******* ***** *** ************</del></li><li><strong>Remote validation point of contact:</strong> <del>***** ***** ************** ** ****** ****** **************</del></li><li><strong>Technical contact(s):</strong><del> ***** ***** ********