{"job":{"id":20134329,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"WUS Single Kiosk Installation","description":{"html":"<p>PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM: (PLEASE NOTE YOU ONLY NEED TO CHECK IN WITH ONE OF US): 936-320-0028</p><p></p><p><strong>*** Please TEXT Technical Contact upon arrival ***</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p>TECHNICAL CONTACT: Please send text message (do not call) to: <del>***********************************</del></p><p><strong><u>Please Note: You do not need to wait for confirmation from the TCON to begin work; please start work upon arrival</u></strong></p><p></p><p>LOCAL CONTACT: <del>********************************</del></p><p></p><p>FAQ Document for any additional questions not listed in Assembly Guide: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T8kylLuhnu4FgRcl0x3cv5wSpoYTH361zWskgjf9vJ0/edit?tab=t.0</p><p><strong><u>*Please refer to this document FIRST before reaching out to CIS or TCON </u></strong></p><p></p><p>1 x Kiosk (27” - Floor Mount) installation with floor stand and base (not anchored into ground)</p><p>Connect with WiFi - ask local contact MOD for WiFi info</p><p></p><p>ASSEMBLY GUIDE</p><p>https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O7NEj7jRcOfsCCMJjBnDN2Xalvj2lmEDPpyhh-3Kkso/edit?tab=t.td8xaqx2avoh </p><p></p><p>CIS needs an FST to assist with the following:</p><p>Check in with CIS</p><p>Check in with LCON</p><p>Check in with TCON </p><p>Inventory the equipment onsite. There is an attached pdf, &quot;Inventory - Check List&quot; Print that, and take it with you to the install</p><p>NOTE: When inventorying the equipment, the kiosk will be floor mounted, NOT table mounted.</p><p>Install Qty. 1 – Assemble POS Kiosk.</p><p>-- Follow assembly guide and reach out to client provided support for any questions during installation.</p><p>-- Assembly guide to be provided by the client.</p><p>Unbox kiosk printer, base, stand, payment terminal and payment holder.</p><p>Assemble kiosk base and stand.</p><p>-- Client to provide in advance of dispatch which REV of base plate will need to be assembled.</p><p>-- Follow client provided assembly guide per REV of base plate that will be installed. 1.3.4. Mount POS Kiosk to base and stand.</p><p>-- Follow client provided mounting instructions, POS terminal should be front facing.</p><p>-- Connect power and data to kiosk.</p><p>-- Route cabling per client provided assembly guide.</p><p>-- Install payment terminal to kiosk.</p><p>-- Connect power and data to payment terminal.</p><p>-- Follow client provided guide to route cabling.</p><p>-- Install kiosk POS printer</p><p>-- Connect power and data to kiosk POS printer.</p><p>-- Follow client provided guide to route cabling.</p><p>Follow client provided set up / configuration guide for terminal.</p><p>-- Client to provide remote technical support for the field service technician.</p><p>All devices will be tested for functionality and to have technical support for certifying all devices online.</p><p>The technician will have all proper installation/assembly guides and documents supplied by OTTER. 1.7.</p><p>Check out with TCON</p><p>Check out with LCON</p><p>Check out with CIS</p><p></p><p>Required Equipment</p><p>Wrench Set</p><p>Flat Head &amp; Phillips Screwdriver</p><p>Hex Set</p><p>Laptop</p><p>Laptop Charge</p><p>Cell Phone</p><p>Cell Phone Charger</p><p>Cisco Console Cable</p><p>Cable Tester/Toner</p><p>Crimper</p><p>Power Drill with assortment of bits</p><p></p><p>Required Materials:</p><p>1000&#39; Cat5e/Cat6 Cable</p><p>Cat5e Patch Cables</p><p>RJ45 Modular Ends</p><p>Zip Ties</p><p>Velcro</p><p></p><p>DELIVERABLES:</p><p>PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO 949-703-2220</p><p>-- Picture of Test transaction receipt  </p><p>--Picture of functioning screen after kiosk is installed </p><p>--Picture of inside of screen showing cable management </p><p>--Picture from afar of the kiosk to show placement </p><p>--Picture of the back of kiosk showing cables running to the wall </p><p></p><p>WORKMAN&#39;S COMP WAIVER (ATTACHED)</p><p>MANAGERS SIGN OFF (ATTACHED)</p><p></p><p>Before the tech leaves the site, they MUST call to check out with CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM prior to leaving site in order to close the work order out.</p><p></p><p>***Please note if you do not call for check out we may need to deny payment***</p><br><br><p>None</p>","markdown":"PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM: (PLEASE NOTE YOU ONLY NEED TO CHECK IN WITH ONE OF US): 936-320-0028\n\n**\\*\\*\\* Please TEXT Technical Contact upon arrival \\*\\*\\***\n\nTECHNICAL CONTACT: Please send text message (do not call) to: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Please Note: You do not need to wait for confirmation from the TCON to begin work; please start work upon arrival**\n\nLOCAL CONTACT: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nFAQ Document for any additional questions not listed in Assembly Guide: <https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T8kylLuhnu4FgRcl0x3cv5wSpoYTH361zWskgjf9vJ0/edit?tab=t.0>\n\n**\\*Please refer to this document FIRST before reaching out to CIS or TCON**\n\n1 x Kiosk (27” - Floor Mount) installation with floor stand and base (not anchored into ground)\n\nConnect with WiFi - ask local contact MOD for WiFi info\n\nASSEMBLY GUIDE\n\n<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O7NEj7jRcOfsCCMJjBnDN2Xalvj2lmEDPpyhh-3Kkso/edit?tab=t.td8xaqx2avoh>\n\nCIS needs an FST to assist with the following:\n\nCheck in with CIS\n\nCheck in with LCON\n\nCheck in with TCON\n\nInventory the equipment onsite. There is an attached pdf, \"Inventory - Check List\" Print that, and take it with you to the install\n\nNOTE: When inventorying the equipment, the kiosk will be floor mounted, NOT table mounted.\n\nInstall Qty. 1 – Assemble POS Kiosk.\n\n\\-- Follow assembly guide and reach out to client provided support for any questions during installation.\n\n\\-- Assembly guide to be provided by the client.\n\nUnbox kiosk printer, base, stand, payment terminal and payment holder.\n\nAssemble kiosk base and stand.\n\n\\-- Client to provide in advance of dispatch which REV of base plate will need to be assembled.\n\n\\-- Follow client provided assembly guide per REV of base plate that will be installed. 1.3.4. Mount POS Kiosk to base and stand.\n\n\\-- Follow client provided mounting instructions, POS terminal should be front facing.\n\n\\-- Connect power and data to kiosk.\n\n\\-- Route cabling per client provided assembly guide.\n\n\\-- Install payment terminal to kiosk.\n\n\\-- Connect power and data to payment terminal.\n\n\\-- Follow client provided guide to route cabling.\n\n\\-- Install kiosk POS printer\n\n\\-- Connect power and data to kiosk POS printer.\n\n\\-- Follow client provided guide to route cabling.\n\nFollow client provided set up / configuration guide for terminal.\n\n\\-- Client to provide remote technical support for the field service technician.\n\nAll devices will be tested for functionality and to have technical support for certifying all devices online.\n\nThe technician will have all proper installation/assembly guides and documents supplied by OTTER. 1.7.\n\nCheck out with TCON\n\nCheck out with LCON\n\nCheck out with CIS\n\nRequired Equipment\n\nWrench Set\n\nFlat Head & Phillips Screwdriver\n\nHex Set\n\nLaptop\n\nLaptop Charge\n\nCell Phone\n\nCell Phone Charger\n\nCisco Console Cable\n\nCable Tester/Toner\n\nCrimper\n\nPower Drill with assortment of bits\n\nRequired Materials:\n\n1000' Cat5e/Cat6 Cable\n\nCat5e Patch Cables\n\nRJ45 Modular Ends\n\nZip Ties\n\nVelcro\n\nDELIVERABLES:\n\nPHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO 949-703-2220\n\n\\-- Picture of Test transaction receipt\n\n\\--Picture of functioning screen after kiosk is installed\n\n\\--Picture of inside of screen showing cable management\n\n\\--Picture from afar of the kiosk to show placement\n\n\\--Picture of the back of kiosk showing cables running to the wall\n\nWORKMAN'S COMP WAIVER (ATTACHED)\n\nMANAGERS SIGN OFF (ATTACHED)\n\nBefore the tech leaves the site, they MUST call to check out with CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM prior to leaving site in order to close the work order out.\n\n\\*\\*\\*Please note if you do not call for check out we may need to deny payment\\*\\*\\*\n\n  \n  \nNone","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T14:30","end":"2026-10-19T17:30"},"payRange":{"min":165,"max":165},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":3.6461423161477917},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $165 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-08T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-08T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Manag