leted while onsite by using the FN-Mobile App (**Smartphone**)\n\n**YOUR REQUIRED TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\n- **• Cordless Electric Drill – Very important**\n- **• Box cutter with new blades – Important**\n- **• Phillips screwdriver w/#2 bit but a multi-function screwdriver with multiple tips is preferred. - Important**\n- **• 11/32 nut driver – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" socket with extension – Important**\n- **• 8mm socket - Important**\n- **• Needle nose and regular pliers – Important**\n- **• Diagonal cutters - Important**\n- **• 10\" crescent wrench – Needed**\n- **• ¾\" open-ended combination wrench – Important**\n- **• Cable ties – Important**\n- **• Complete socket set – Needed**\n- **Packing Tape**\n\n**ESCALATION PATH**\n\n- **D2T.VendorManagement@ncrvoyix.com**\n\n**CANCELLATION POLICY**\n\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site in the first hour: 50% to the tech\n- Cancellation when tech arrives on site after the first hour: 100% to the tech","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00","end":"2026-10-16T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":225},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":5,"distance":57.54261305786768},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $225 (countered: $300) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2