{"job":{"id":20135319,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CPT Network Solutions, Inc.","title":"O'Reilly Network Modernization Survey","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>High Level Overview</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">We have an upcoming project and we are scheduling the </span><u style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">site survey</u><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">, currently. We are looking for a tech to survey the site, complete the survey form, take deliverable photos, and review with CPT support.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">The future phases of the project include a network rack installation, consolidated cabling, network hardware swap, and cabling / installation of VoIP phones and security cameras. There is the possibility that we can schedule you for the future phases of the work but that will be discussed after the completion of the survey.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools to Bring to Site:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>Cell phone or tablet</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work</u></strong></p><ol><li>Review the survey form and list of deliverables</li><li>Retrieve a copy of the floor plan from the manager on duty</li><li>Complete the survey form and take photos of the deliverables</li><li>Review the survey with the CPT project team </li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Deliverables</u></strong></p><ol><li>Photos of the marked-up floor plan (including existing locations of APs</li><li>Security Cameras, and Phones, the location of the MDF, the location of the Cashwrap, and the location of the Telco board)</li><li>Photos of the ceilings on the sales floor</li><li>Photos of the ceilings in the back of house. Photos of the cashwrap</li><li>Photos of the IDF cashwrap switch</li><li>Photos of the MDF. Photos of the Telco board</li><li>Photos of network equipment (including switches, routers, firewalls, modems/circuits)</li><li>Photos of telephone equipment (including phone system if present and phones)</li><li>Photos of existing APs Photos of existing security cameras</li><li>Photos of cable pathways to the MDF Photos of any unmanaged switches</li><li>Photos of any damaged/messy cabling</li><li>Photos of the store's active SSIDs</li><li>Photos of any obstacles/deviations/issue</li></ol>","markdown":"**High Level Overview**\n\nWe have an upcoming project and we are scheduling the site survey, currently. We are looking for a tech to survey the site, complete the survey form, take deliverable photos, and review with CPT support.\n\nThe future phases of the project include a network rack installation, consolidated cabling, network hardware swap, and cabling / installation of VoIP phones and security cameras. There is the possibility that we can schedule you for the future phases of the work but that will be discussed after the completion of the survey.\n\n**Required Tools to Bring to Site:**\n\n1. Basic hand tools\n2. Cell phone or tablet\n\n**Scope of Work**\n\n1. Review the survey form and list of deliverables\n2. Retrieve a copy of the floor plan from the manager on duty\n3. Complete the survey form and take photos of the deliverables\n4. Review the survey with the CPT project team\n\n**Deliverables**\n\n1. Photos of the marked-up floor plan (including existing locations of APs\n2. Security Cameras, and Phones, the location of the MDF, the location of the Cashwrap, and the location of the Telco board)\n3. Photos of the ceilings on the sales floor\n4. Photos of the ceilings in the back of house. Photos of the cashwrap\n5. Photos of the IDF cashwrap switch\n6. Photos of the MDF. Photos of the Telco board\n7. Photos of network equipment (including switches, routers, firewalls, modems/circuits)\n8. Photos of telephone equipment (including phone system if present and phones)\n9. Photos of existing APs Photos of existing security cameras\n10. Photos of cable pathways to the MDF Photos of any unmanaged switches\n11. Photos of any damaged/messy cabling\n12. Photos of the store's active SSIDs\n13. Photos of any obstacles/deviations/issue","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T14:00","end":"2026-10-16T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":62.31411741609602},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"