{"job":{"id":20132882,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nerd In Motion","title":"Switching patch cable to different port EASY WORK!!! - 10 mins","description":{"html":"<p>Need technician to go to site and patch in the shoppertrak (yellow poe injector) patch cable to Juniper Switch 0 Port 15.</p>\n<p>After patching in cable to the Juniper switch call the wo manager to get with the NOC to confirm that it is online and pinging.</p>\n<p>Please take before and after pictures of shoppertrak and its patch in.</p>","markdown":"Need technician to go to site and patch in the shoppertrak (yellow poe injector) patch cable to Juniper Switch 0 Port 15.\n\nAfter patching in cable to the Juniper switch call the wo manager to get with the NOC to confirm that it is online and pinging.\n\nPlease take before and after pictures of shoppertrak and its patch in.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T11:00","end":"2026-10-14T12:00","latestStart":"2026-10-14T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":125,"max":125},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":65.44944096946553},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $125 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 059