{"job":{"id":20134199,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"XTIUM","title":"Entouch device missing - Report device location or confirm if it is missing.","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations</strong></p><p>The estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours but varies from site to site.&nbsp;XTIUM expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete or tech is released by customer or T-Mobile support.</p><p><strong>Skills Required and ‘Highlighted’ Tools Required</strong></p><ol><li>Laptop with Win 11</li><li>Aruba Console Cable</li><li>Cisco Console Cable</li><li>Ladder</li><li>RJ45 connectors</li><li>Cable Tester</li></ol><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>High Level Workflow</strong></p><ol><li>Tech will check in on the platform</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">If the app is not working, please call the XTIUM Support Desk at 877-677-8271 to be marked as arrived</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">You <strong><u>DO NOT</u></strong> need to call us if you checked in on the platform</li><li>Tech will check in with the store manager on duty</li><li>Show manager on duty the work order as well as a valid photo ID</li><li>Tech to contact T-Mobile NOC by calling (866)783-9557 Option 9, then 2&nbsp;when ready to begin work</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">If unable to reach the T-Mobile NOC, please call the XTIUM Field Support team at 877-677-8271.</li><li>Upon completion of call, Tech will close call by completing the custom fields on the platform, PRIOR to leaving site and provide closing information.</li><li>&nbsp;Tech will return any equipment within 24 hours.</li><li>While on site if you have any technical issues, please contact the Support Desk and ask for the TSC</li><li>If tracking is requested, please reach out to T-Mobile (866)783-9557 Option 9, then 2 for tracking#</li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Attachment List</strong></p><p>Standard Tool List</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Parts Requirements</strong></p><p>&nbsp;If any parts were shipped to site the Field Technician will be responsible for returning ALL shipments within 24 hours of completed service. The technician will keep the shipping receipt for 30 days for verification on the returned part.</p><p>The Field Technician will also be required to provide the tracking number of the returning equipment in the Custom Fields.</p><p>Failure to provide proof of returned equipment will delay and/or result in non payment of work order.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Detailed Instructions&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Please review confidential section when assigned to this work order.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"**Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations**\n\nThe estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours but varies from site to site. XTIUM expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete or tech is released by customer or T-Mobile support.\n\n**Skills Required and ‘Highlighted’ Tools Required**\n\n1. Laptop with Win 11\n2. Aruba Console Cable\n3. Cisco Console Cable\n4. Ladder\n5. RJ45 connectors\n6. Cable Tester\n\n**High Level Workflow**\n\n1. Tech will check in on the platform\n2. If the app is not working, please call the XTIUM Support Desk at 877-677-8271 to be marked as arrived\n3. You **DO NOT** need to call us if you checked in on the platform\n4. Tech will check in with the store manager on duty\n5. Show manager on duty the work order as well as a valid photo ID\n6. Tech to contact T-Mobile NOC by calling (866)783-9557 Option 9, then 2 when ready to begin work\n7. If unable to reach the T-Mobile NOC, please call the XTIUM Field Support team at 877-677-8271.\n8. Upon completion of call, Tech will close call by completing the custom fields on the platform, PRIOR to leaving site and provide closing information.\n9. Tech will return any equipment within 24 hours.\n10. While on site if you have any technical issues, please contact the Support Desk and ask for the TSC\n11. If tracking is requested, please reach out to T-Mobile (866)783-9557 Option 9, then 2 for tracking#\n\n**Attachment List**\n\nStandard Tool List\n\n**Parts Requirements**\n\n If any parts were shipped to site the Field Technician will be responsible for returning ALL shipments within 24 hours of completed service. The technician will keep the shipping receipt for 30 days for verification on the returned part.\n\nThe Field Technician will also be required to provide the tracking number of the returning equipment in the Custom Fields.\n\nFailure to provide proof of returned equipment will delay and/or result in non payment of work order.\n\n**Detailed Instructions**\n\nPlease review confidential section when assigned to this work order.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-09T08:45","end":"2026-10-09T10:45"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":80},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":75.14142511249646},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $80 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Vika USCIS biometry"},{"start":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Vinson Service_ISS Call"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-09T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P2 SIP IW (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-