{"job":{"id":20135953,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Maverick Technical Resources","title":"Install VoIP Phones  / Remote Tech To Assist","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>All Equipment is on site.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Install Yealink T85W Phones</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Number Porting is scheduled for Wednesday</li><li>Work with Remote Technician to install VoIP Phones (Remote Technician phone number is in the Confidential Information Section of this WO)</li><li>Make Inbound and Outbound test calls for call completion and clarity.</li><li>Assist with Basic User Training if needed. WO Manager will conduct the training via phone with you on site guiding the customer through the phone buttons, etc.</li></ul><p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p><ul><li>Tech <strong><u>MUST NEVER</u></strong> mention Field Nation or that you are a contractor</li><li><strong><em><u>Tech must have a generic email address to use (i.e. gmail, yahoo, etc.)</u></em></strong> in the event of email communication while on the job. No company email address can be used.</li><li>Tech cannot wear any business logos or names</li><li>Tech must be professional with Customer and remote technician</li><li>Tech must be able to perform basic network troubleshooting functions</li><li>Tech must be able to install and test the equipment</li><li>Tech must be able to stay until job is completed, or released by remote technician. All time will be compensated for.</li></ul><p><strong>Required Tools:</strong></p><ul><li>All typical network and telecom tools</li><li>Laptop with ethernet connection and AnyDesk (similar to TeamViewer) downloaded prior to arrival</li><li>Additional ethernet cables in case needed</li><li>Hot Spot</li><li>Camera to take photos of work area and installed equipment</li></ul><p><strong>On Site Tasks:</strong></p><ul><li>Check in with WO Manager by calling&nbsp;<del>************* ** ** ******* ************</del>. WO Manager will get you in contact with the remote technician.</li><li>Work with remote technician to install and test provided equipment</li><li>When completed, clean up work area</li><li>Take and upload photos of work area and installed equipment</li><li>Provide COMPLETE NOTES to Work Order</li><li>Check out with WO Manager by calling&nbsp;<del>************</del>&nbsp;or, if no answer, text message to&nbsp;<del>************</del></li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- All Equipment is on site.\n- Install Yealink T85W Phones\n- Number Porting is scheduled for Wednesday\n- Work with Remote Technician to install VoIP Phones (Remote Technician phone number is in the Confidential Information Section of this WO)\n- Make Inbound and Outbound test calls for call completion and clarity.\n- Assist with Basic User Training if needed. WO Manager will conduct the training via phone with you on site guiding the customer through the phone buttons, etc.\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n- Tech **MUST NEVER** mention Field Nation or that you are a contractor\n- ***Tech must have a generic email address to use (i.e. gmail, yahoo, etc.)*** in the event of email communication while on the job. No company email address can be used.\n- Tech cannot wear any business logos or names\n- Tech must be professional with Customer and remote technician\n- Tech must be able to perform basic network troubleshooting functions\n- Tech must be able to install and test the equipment\n- Tech must be able to stay until job is completed, or released by remote technician. All time will be compensated for.\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n- All typical network and telecom tools\n- Laptop with ethernet connection and AnyDesk (similar to TeamViewer) downloaded prior to arrival\n- Additional ethernet cables in case needed\n- Hot Spot\n- Camera to take photos of work area and installed equipment\n\n**On Site Tasks:**\n\n- Check in with WO Manager by calling \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\