{"job":{"id":20138506,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"Troubleshoot a Digital Screen/Window - scope 3 hrs","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: black;\">Scope of work -&nbsp;assist with troubleshooting a device that is currently offline.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Tech will need to check in with the coordinator</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Tech will need to bring cable tester</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Have the technician bring extra patch cables in case it needs to be swapped out and a cable testing to confirm not an issue with the cable run.</span></p><p>Bring supplies to run a cat 5 cable and or troubleshoot the cable run</p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Tech will need to provide pictures of all digital screens and the area.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Once all of this has been completed, tech will need to check out with coordinator to make sure everything is correct before leaving the store</span></p>","markdown":"Scope of work - assist with troubleshooting a device that is currently offline.\n\nTech will need to check in with the coordinator\n\nTech will need to bring cable tester\n\nHave the technician bring extra patch cables in case it needs to be swapped out and a cable testing to confirm not an issue with the cable run.\n\nBring supplies to run a cat 5 cable and or troubleshoot the cable run\n\nTech will need to provide pictures of all digital screens and the area.\n\nOnce all of this has been completed, tech will need to check out with coordinator to make sure everything is correct before leaving the store","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-13T17:00","end":"2026-10-13T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":45},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":15.562859309718624},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $45 (