{"job":{"id":20139759,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Armor Security","title":"IP Camera System Installation - Cables Ran Prior (Dutch Bros)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Work Order must be completed during 9 am - 5 pm Central Time.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Install 12 Cameras, NVR, and a wall mounted Monitor.</strong></p>\n<p>See Buyer Custom Fields for the Armor Photo WebLink <strong>(All photos must be uploaded before leaving to receive payment)</strong></p>\n<p>See Client Documents for CCTV Install Instructions PDF</p>\n<p>See Tasks for Completion Requirements</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>NOTE: If permanent power/internet are not active on site, you may still be asked to complete this work order.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Required Equipment:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>12 Inch Wood, Brick, Metal Drill Bits</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Cordless Hammer Drill/Impact Driver</strong></li>\n<li>Cordless Drill</li>\n<li>Wire Fishing Tools</li>\n<li>100' Cat5</li>\n<li>5' Prefab Cat5</li>\n<li>Cable Fishing Tape</li>\n<li>Wire Cutter</li>\n<li>Crimper/Termination Tool</li>\n<li>Cable Tester</li>\n<li>1 1/2\" Stainless Steel Self Tapping Screws (For Inside Cameras)</li>\n<li>3\" Stainless Steel Self Tapping Screws (For Outside Cameras)</li>\n<li>RJ45 Ends</li>\n<li>Silicone Sealant</li>\n<li>6' ladder</li>\n<li>Little Giant Ladder</li>\n<li>Headlamp</li>\n<li>Laptop, Keyboard, and Mouse</li>\n<li>Normal Hand Tools</li>\n<li>Screw Assortment</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Equipment provided:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>NVR</li>\n<li>Pre-labeled IP Cameras</li>\n<li>32\" Monitor with mount</li>\n<li>50' HDMI cable (one way directional)</li>\n<li>Cat5 Cables Ran Prior</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>See Standard Instructions section for standardized equipment reimbursement rates.​</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Before leaving - you must complete the install along with the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fulfill each Completion Requirement in the Task section of Work Order</li>\n<li>Make sure ALL required photos are uploaded to Armor Weblink</li>\n<li>Verify that the Work Order Manager can login to the system</li>\n<li>Must take any unused equipment with you to ship back to Work Order Manager (request return shipping label)</li>\n<li>Receive a close out code for completion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>If, for whatever reason, we have to reschedule based on our error, i.e. equipment not being on site, we will pay $30 travel fee.</em></p>\n<p><strong>By accepting the work order you are agreeing to Armor Security’s Standard Instructions, Policies &amp; Procedures terms, and Completion Requirements.</strong></p>","markdown":"**Work Order must be completed during 9 am - 5 pm Central Time.**\n\n**Install 12 Cameras, NVR, and a wall mounted Monitor.**\n\nSee Buyer Custom Fields for the Armor Photo WebLink **(All photos must be uploaded before leaving to receive payment)**\n\nSee Client Documents for CCTV Install Instructions PDF\n\nSee Tasks for Completion Requirements\n\n**NOTE: If permanent power/internet are not active on site, you may still be asked to complete this work order.**\n\n**Required Equipment:**\n\n- **12 Inch Wood, Brick, Metal Drill Bits**\n- **Cordless Hammer Drill/Impact Driver**\n- Cordless Drill\n- Wire Fishing Tools\n- 100' Cat5\n- 5' Prefab Cat5\n- Cable Fishing Tape\n- Wire Cutter\n- Crimper/Termination Tool\n- Cable Tester\n- 1 1/2\" Stainless Steel Self Tapping Screws (For Inside Cameras)\n- 3\" Stainless Steel Self Tapping Screws (For Outside Cameras)\n- RJ45 Ends\n- Silicone Sealant\n- 6' ladder\n- Little Giant Ladder\n- Headlamp\n- Laptop, Keyboard, and Mouse\n- Normal Hand Tools\n- Screw Assortment\n\n**Equipment provided:**\n\n- NVR\n- Pre-labeled IP Cameras\n- 32\" Monitor with mount\n- 50' HDMI cable (one way directional)\n- Cat5 Cables Ran Prior\n\n**See Standard Instructions section for standardized equipment reimbursement rates.​**\n\n**Before leaving - you must complete the install along with the following:**\n\n- Fulfill each Completion Requirement in the Task section of Work Order\n- Make sure ALL required photos are uploaded to Armor Weblink\n- Verify that the Work Order Manager can login to the system\n- Must take any unused equipment with you to ship back to Work Order Manager (request return shipping label)\n- Receive a close out code for completion\n\n*If, for whatever reason, we have to reschedule based on our error, i.e. equipment not being on site, we will pay $30 travel fee.*\n\n**By accepting the work order you are agreeing to Armor Security’s Standard Instructions, Policies & Procedures terms, and Completion Requirements.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T10:00","end":"2026-11-03T109:00"},"payRange":{"min":500,"max":500},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":99,"distance":43.98411689841089},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T2