{"job":{"id":20139762,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Armor Security","title":"Installation of Preprogrammed DMP Alarm System (Dutch Bros)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Work Order must be completed during 9 am - 5 pm Central Time.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Install preprogrammed DMP CHeKT alarm system.</strong></p>\n<p>See Buyer Custom Fields for the Armor Photo Weblink <strong>(All photos must be uploaded before leaving to receive payment)</strong></p>\n<p>See Client Documents for Alarm Install Instructions PDF and Layout</p>\n<p>See Tasks for Completion Requirements</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>NOTE: If permanent power/internet are not active on site, you may still be asked to complete this work order.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Required Equipment:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cable Fishing Tools</strong></li>\n<li>Cordless Drill</li>\n<li>100' Cat5</li>\n<li>5' Prefab Cat5</li>\n<li>Cable Fishing Tools</li>\n<li>Wire Cutter</li>\n<li>Crimper/Termination Tool</li>\n<li>Cable Tester</li>\n<li>Metal and stucco drill bit</li>\n<li>1 1/2\" Stainless Steel Self Tapping Screws</li>\n<li>RJ45 Ends</li>\n<li>6' ladder</li>\n<li>Headlamp</li>\n<li>Normal Hand Tools</li>\n<li>Screw Assortment</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Equipment Provided (may vary):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>(1) DMP Keypad</li>\n<li>(1) Control Panel</li>\n<li>(1) CHeKT bridge</li>\n<li>(3) Wireless panic buttons</li>\n<li>(1) 12V Battery/Transformer</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Before leaving - you must complete the install along with the following:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fulfill each Completion Requirement in the Task section of Work Order</li>\n<li>Make sure ALL required photos are uploaded to Armor Weblink</li>\n<li>Verify that the Work Order Manager can login to the system</li>\n<li>Clean up</li>\n<li>Must take any unused equipment with you to ship back to Work Order Manager (request return shipping label)</li>\n<li>Receive a close out code for completion</