hedule based on our error, i.e. equipment not being on site, we will pay $30 travel fee.*\n\n**By accepting the work order you are agreeing to Armor Security’s Standard Instructions and Policies & Procedures terms.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T10:00","end":"2026-11-04T109:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":99,"distance":43.98411689841089},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00