{"job":{"id":20139809,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Zones LLC","title":"Food Lion 1344 Lillington - Relabel 2 APs","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope Notes</u></strong></p><ul><li>Relabel AP11 to AP1 </li><li>Relabel AP1 to AP 11</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Tech Must Be Lift Certified.</strong></p><p><strong>All Deliverables must be uploaded to FN prior to leaving site, unless returning materials.</strong></p><p><strong>Close out notes and marking the WO complete must be done after the equipment is shipped out. Please notify POC with receipt and tracking information.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>READ ME!!!!</strong></p><p>Check-in on the Field Nation App</p><p>Introduce yourself to the MOD</p><p>Walk through site and locate all delivered hardware (2 or 3 boxes with green label that says \"HOLD FOR TECHNICIAN\").</p><p>Provide photo of shipped materials, marking anything that is missing.</p><p>Provide photo of return label (if applicable).</p><p>Utilizing the attached AP Survey, find the location where the AP will go on the roof.</p><p><br></p><p>Provide a photo of EACH installed AP as you go.</p><p><br></p><p>Move Lift back to where we found it and attach a picture to your FN WO. Include the lift ID number in the photo.</p><p>Receive Signoff from MOD&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skill Set &amp; Tools Required:</strong></p><p><strong><em>WhatsApp </em></strong>for efficient group communication&nbsp;</p><p>PPE - Hi-Vis shirt or vest and face mask if required by site</p><p>Steel Toe Boots, Safety Glasses, Lift Harness (This is required, if you don't own one, they are sold for about $20 at HD.)</p><p>Smartphone for communication while onsite</p><p>Laptop with hotspot</p><p>Network Equipment Experience Required</p><p>Working Camera</p><p>100 ft extension cord \"In case lift needs to be charged\"</p><p>Microsoft Teams Installed**(This must be done before we arrive.)</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Total installation must be complete BEFORE the store opens for business.</u></strong></p>","markdown":"**Scope Notes**\n\n- Relabel AP11 to AP1\n- Relabel AP1 to AP 11\n\n**Tech Must Be Lift Certified.**\n\n**All Deliverables must be uploaded to FN prior to leaving site, unless returning materials.**\n\n**Close out notes and marking the WO complete must be done after the equipment is shipped out. Please notify POC with receipt and tracking information.**\n\n**READ ME!!!!**\n\nCheck-in on the Field Nation App\n\nIntroduce yourself to the MOD\n\nWalk through site and locate all delivered hardware (2 or 3 boxes with green label that says \"HOLD FOR TECHNICIAN\").\n\nProvide photo of shipped materials, marking anything that is missing.\n\nProvide photo of return label (if applicable).\n\nUtilizing the attached AP Survey, find the location where the AP will go on the roof.\n\nProvide a photo of EACH installed AP as you go.\n\nMove Lift back to where we found it and attach a picture to your FN WO. Include the lift ID number in the photo.\n\nReceive Signoff from MOD\n\n**Skill Set & Tools Required:**\n\n***WhatsApp*** for efficient group communication\n\nPPE - Hi-Vis shirt or vest and face mask if required by site\n\nSteel Toe Boots, Safety Glasses, Lift Harness (This is required, if you don't own one, they are sold for about $20 at HD.)\n\nSmartphone for communication while onsite\n\nLaptop with hotspot\n\nNetwork Equipment Experience Required\n\nWorking Camera\n\n100 ft extension cord \"In case lift needs to be charged\"\n\nMicrosoft Teams Installed\\*\\*(This must be done before we arrive.)\n\n**Total installation must be complete BEFORE the store opens for business.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T22:00","end":"2026-10-12T24:00"},"payRange":{"min":130,"max":130},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":32.07375640261072},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 is below mini