{"job":{"id":20140122,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Zenxeon, Inc","title":"Remove old PC / Install new PC |Est: 1 Hrs| Drill, Velcro, Basic hand tools","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience&nbsp;installing desktop POS setups</li><li>Tech is required to swap out 1 old computers and install 1 new computer, confirm everything is functional.</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1 Hours</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tools Required:</strong><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</em></p><ul><li><em>Drill or basic hand tools (for mounting hardware)</em></li><li><em>Velcro</em></li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">***(SEE TASKS section For Job Checklist)</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Pre-Site Requirements:</em></strong></p><ul><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent <strong>Zenxeon</strong> while onsite</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>On-Site Tasks:</em></strong></p><ul><li>Take a before picture for us to reference to</li><li>Remove the old desktop in the office Along with keyboard and mouse. (New peripherals in the box)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Please confirm which desktop goes where before taking offline.</li><li>Leave any computer mounts attached</li><li>It is important to manage cables accordingly while installing new computer.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Please use <strong>Velcro ties </strong>for ease of use</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Manage cables underneath and on top of the counter</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Please leave some slack in the cables running to the monitor (for ease of movement)</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ul><li>Upload pictures:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Before decommissioning</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">After installation</li><li>Call Zenxeon for assistance on testing these devices and to confirm deliverables</li><li>Check-out of work order</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Communication Directory:</strong></p><ul><li>Call 916 312 3220 press 7 to reach any team member</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Any travel expenses must be applied as a counter-offer when requesting the work in order to get approved</li><li>Any additional hours must be requested and approved by WO Manager</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience installing desktop POS setups\n- Tech is required to swap out 1 old computers and install 1 new computer, confirm everything is functional.\n- Estimated duration will be 1 Hours\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- *Drill or basic hand tools (for mounting hardware)*\n- *Velcro*\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*(SEE TASKS section For Job Checklist)**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements:***\n\n- Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent **Zenxeon** while onsite\n\n***On-Site Tasks:***\n\n- Take a before picture for us to reference to\n- Remove the old desktop in the office Along with keyboard and mouse. (New peripherals in the box)\n- Please confirm which desktop goes where before taking offline.\n- Leave any computer mounts attached\n- It is important to manage cables accordingly while installing new computer.\n- Please use **Velcro ties** for ease of use\n- Manage cables underneath and on top of the counter\n- Please leave some slack in the cables running to the monitor (for ease of movement)\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n- Upload pictures:\n- Before decommissioning\n- After installation\n- Call Zenxeon for assistance on testing these devices and to confirm deliverables\n- Check-out of work order\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- Call 916 312 3220 press 7 to reach any team member\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Any travel expenses must be applied as a counter-offer when requesting the work in order to get approved\n- Any additional hours must be requested and approved by WO Manager","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T11:30","end":"2026-10-14T12:30","latestStart":"2026-10-14T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":12.29143711849722},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-09T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05809722 - VEG - Cary NC - Managed Starlink Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[