{"job":{"id":"2722694418","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Tech-Americas USA","title":"Incident #269308-  Install PIAB / Cross Connection","description":"<p>Upon Arrival:</p><p>Check in with Tech Americas by calling (281) 668-3211.</p><p>If there’s no answer, email support@tech-americas.com with the TA Incident # in the subject line.</p><p>Upon Completion:</p><p>Check out immediately after finishing the job by calling (281) 668-3211.</p><p>If there’s no answer, email support@tech-americas.com with the TA Incident # in the subject line.</p><p>Communication Requirements:</p><p>All communication must be via phone or email directly with Tech Americas.</p><p>Failure to check in upon arrival will result in the visit being deemed invalid, potentially affecting payment.</p><p>Failure to check out on the same day as the dispatch may result in cancellation of the ticket without payment.</p><p>Important Note: Failure to follow the on-site steps outlined below may result in non-payment for incomplete or improperly completed work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>****** SCOPE OF WORK ******</p><p>Single Dispatch - New TNs (Rack and Stack &amp; Cross Connect/Port/Go Live)</p><p>EQUIPMENT RACK AND STACK + GO LIVE</p><p>TECH TO BE PROVIDED BOXED METTEL EQUIPMENT</p><p>RACK AND STACK AT THE DMARC</p><p>ANTENNAS TO BE MOUNTED AND INSTALLED</p><p>TEST OVER LTE AND VERIFY DIAL TONE ON THE METTEL EQUIPMENT</p><p>WAN CONNECTION MAY BE REQUIRED</p><p>PIAB CONFIGURATION DETAILS: Specialty Line(s):</p><p>Line 1 Type - Fax - NEW TN</p><p>Line 2 Type - Elevator - NEW TN</p><p>Line 3 Type - Voice - NEW TN</p><p>CROSS CONNECTS TO BE COMPLETED FOR NEW TNs</p><p>TESTING TO BE COMPLETED (VERIFY DIAL TONE, INBOUND AND OUTBOUND TEST CALLS/FAX)</p><p>TECH WILL NEED: BUTT-SET, BRIDGE CLIPS, TONER, MULTI-METER AND LABEL MAKER</p><p>Local Contact: ********************</p><p>Local Contact Phone: ********************</p><p>Project Contact Person: ***********************</p><p>Project Contact Email: ********************************</p><p>Project Contact Phone: **************************************</p><p>Project Contact Cell: ************************************************</p><p>PLEASE ASSIGN A TECH FAMILIAR WITH PIAB AND POTS CROSS CONNECTS</p><p><br></p><p>****** CALL-IN INSTRUCTIONS ******</p><p>MetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit ******************* to manually lookup and start the dispatch.</p><p>Please call ************************ upon arrival to the site. If not reachable, please call remote support toll free # 844-905-9779 for assistance. Provide Bruin ticket number ************** to MetTel Rep.</p><p><br></p><p>****** SPECIAL MATERIALS NEEDED FOR DISPATCH ******</p><p>Fully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port ,Multimeter wire tester ,Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches ,Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer) ,Biscuit jacks ,Crimpers &amp; Wirecutters ,4-6 ft’ ladder ,Butt Set ,RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors ,100’ extension cord ,Digital Camera ,100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device ,Cell phone w/Hotspot device ,Punch down tool</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tool Requirements</p><p>Required Tools:</p><p>Phillips and flathead screwdrivers</p><p>Impact tool with 66 and 110 blades (for termination and cutting)</p><p>Tone generator and receiver</p><p>Telephone test set (butt set)</p><p>RJ11 6-position, 4-conductor module (for testing/toning)</p><p>RJ11 and RJ45 crimp tools</p><p>Electrician scissors and/or Cat5e wire strippers</p><p>Needle-nose pliers</p><p>Medium hammer drill/driver with assorted masonry bits (including 5/16” and 3/8” diameters)</p><p>Extended-length masonry bits (up to 3/8”) for thick walls or cinder blocks</p><p>3/8” U-style staple gun with staples</p><p>Label maker with black text on white label tape</p><p>Sharpie permanent marker pens</p><p>Small bubble level</p><p>Laptop with wired Ethernet port, serial-to-USB console, and terminal software (e.g., PuTTY or CRT)</p><p>Mobile phone with a high-quality camera and charger</p><p>Extra battery pack for phone</p><p>Consumable Items (carry as needed):</p><p>Cable ties (assorted lengths and sizes) for cable management</p><p>300+ feet of Cat5e or Cat6 cable</p><p>RJ11/12 plug modules (one 6-position, 2-conductor plug per PIAB line interface)</p><p>RJ45 Cat5e plug modules (for wireline internet options)</p><p>Scotch locks (for splicing/extending 22-24 AWG twisted pair telco wire)</p><p>1” to 1-1/4” drywall screws</p><p>Black electrical tape</p><p>Fish tape (50’, optional but recommended)</p><p>Extra 9V batteries for test tools</p><p>Clear silicone sealer (for exterior wall penetrations)</p><p>Standard wall-mount telephone jacks (interior/exterior) for analog phones or callboxes</p><p>Additional Requirement:</p><p>Bring a laptop with TeamViewer, console cable, and internet access for on-site configuration and troubleshooting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Work Order and Documentation Submission</p><p>Work Order Requirements:</p><p>Complete and sign the Tech Americas Work Order emailed to you after assignment. Include:</p><p>On-site and off-site times</p><p>MOD name and signature</p><p>Submit the signed work order and required photos to documents@tech-americas.com.</p><p>Required Photos:</p><p>Before and after installation images</p><p>Before and after unboxing photos (if equipment was received and unpacked)</p><p>Photos of old equipment’s location and condition</p><p>For speed tests or cable toning, provide photos or screenshots with clear documentation</p><p>Photos of all new cabling labels (label all cables appropriately)</p><p>Submission Process:</p><p>Email all deliverables to documents@tech-americas.com.</p><p>Contact Tech Americas via phone (281) 668-3211 or email (support@tech-americas.com) to confirm receipt and acceptance of submissions.</p><p>Failure to submit complete documentation may require a warranty visit at no additional cost to Tech Americas. If the technician does not return for a required warranty visit, the cost of a replacement visit may be deducted from their payment.</p><p>If No Work Is Performed:</p><p>Take site photos before leaving and email them to documents@tech-americas.com.</p><p>Contact Tech Americas via phone (281) 668-3211 or email (support@tech-americas.com) before departure to document the situation and avoid non-payment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Payment Processing</p><p>Payment processing begins once all required deliverables (work order, photos, etc.) are received at documents@tech-americas.com.</p><p>Incomplete or missing deliverables may result in payment delays or deductions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Critical Communication Rule</p><p>Discuss agreements or payment issues only with Tech Americas, not with the end customer or client.</p><p>Why: This ensures professionalism and protects client relationships.</p><p>How: Contact Tech Americas at (281) 668-3211 or support@tech-americas.com for all agreement or payment-related questions.</p><p>Consequences: Unauthorized discussions with clients may result in termination of contract.</p><p>Acknowledgment: You must confirm adherence to this rule on the work order form.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T10:00","end":"2026-10-29T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":148.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"DISTANCE_TOO_FAR","rejectDetails":"Reported one-way distance 148.8mi exceeds 100mi limit"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z"