{"job":{"id":20141370,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"URGENT - VIP SITE!! NEED DONE ASAP!! Kiosk Service - Break/Fix - Troubleshoot Ejection Issues","description":{"html":"<p>**KIOSK #: NS1468**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Door key required for this task?: Yes**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Overview:</p>\n<p>Check and eject all magazines, looking out for broken mags.</p>\n<p>Make sure the carousel can turn fully two times around without catching or dragging.</p>\n<p>Please send images of ejector arm to Support</p>\n<p>Check for loose keys and brass debris on and around the X/Y tables and sensors.</p>\n<p>Support will need to clear the cutter stuck and run EC on All disabled mags, then make two keys in a Test Transactions.</p>\n<p>The kiosk is failing to eject keys from one or more magazines.</p>\n<p>Engage the estop, remove magazines above the ejector arm, and verify the arm is not broken, chipped, or bent.</p>\n<p>Confirm the carousel rotates without drag and check all magazines for damage.</p>\n<p>Remove any partially ejected keys and confirm all push plates are locked.</p>\n<p>If the carousel does not rotate, check for a stuck magazine on the opposite side or ejector arm obstruction.</p>\n<p>Communicate where the jam appears but do not force rotation.</p>\n<p>Once the ejector, carousel, and magazines are verified, ensure magazines are properly enabled or disabled, release the estop, and complete 2–3 test cuts to confirm kiosk functionality before closing the service call.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check out with SSN.</p>\n<p>SUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>﻿**All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables**</p>\n<p>**Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app**</p>\n<p>**Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site**</p>","markdown":"\\*\\*KIOSK #: NS1468\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Door key required for this task?: Yes\\*\\*\n\nOverview:\n\nCheck and eject all magazines, looking out for broken mags.\n\nMake sure the carousel can turn fully two times around without catching or dragging.\n\nPlease send images of ejector arm to Support\n\nCheck for loose keys and brass debris on and around the X/Y tables and sensors.\n\nSupport will need to clear the cutter stuck and run EC on All disabled mags, then make two keys in a Test Transactions.\n\nThe kiosk is failing to eject keys from one or more magazines.\n\nEngage the estop, remove magazines above the ejector arm, and verify the arm is not broken, chipped, or bent.\n\nConfirm the carousel rotates without drag and check all magazines for damage.\n\nRemove any partially ejected keys and confirm all push plates are locked.\n\nIf the carousel does not rotate, check for a stuck magazine on the opposite side or ejector arm obstruction.\n\nCommunicate where the jam appears but do not force rotation.\n\nOnce the ejector, carousel, and magazines are verified, ensure magazines are properly enabled or disabled, release the estop, and complete 2–3 test cuts to confirm kiosk functionality before closing the service call.\n\nCheck out with SSN.\n\nSUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!\n\n﻿\\*\\*All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-13T09:00","end":"2026-10-13T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-13T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":105},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":65},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":25.233102240658955},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $105 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start"