play according to store management's direction.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Install any required display components or signage, if applicable.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Remove and properly dispose of all packaging and installation debris.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take required before-and-after photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the required digital completion report before leaving the site.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professionalism &amp; Appearance</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintain a clean, neat, and professional appearance.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Wear a plain collared shirt (no offensive language, graphics, or competitor branding), long pants or clean work shorts, and closed-toe shoes.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Follow all retailer policies and directions provided by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintain a clean and organized work area throughout the installation and remove all installation debris before leaving.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use professional language and conduct yourself in a professional manner</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Technician Requirements</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be professional and customer-focused.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Must be able to lift up to 50lbs and </span>maneuver in tight spaces.</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be comfortable working inside retail environments during business hours.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be able to safely move retail display fixtures using store-provided equipment when available.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have a smartphone capable of submitting photos and electronic documentat