{"job":{"id":20143675,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PurTeraIT","title":"Rally Bar Install ","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope Of Work:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>Install and connect the replacement scheduling tablet to the Ethernet connection.</li><li>Configure and register the tablet as required, coordinating with the customer’s internal IT team or Logitech support.</li><li>Install surface-mounted cable raceway from the desk to the wall, then up the wall behind the TVs.</li><li>Route and conceal two cables within the raceway: the Cat5e cable supplied with the Sight camera and the micro-USB extension cable for the pod microphone.</li><li>Secure the raceway and cables for a clean, organized installation.</li><li>Test the tablet, Sight camera, and pod microphone with remote support to confirm proper connectivity and functionality.</li><li>Provide completion photos and obtain customer confirmation that the remaining work is complete.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>","markdown":"**Scope Of Work:**\n\n- Install and connect the replacement scheduling tablet to the Ethernet connection.\n- Configure and register the tablet as required, coordinating with the customer’s internal IT team or Logitech support.\n- Install surface-mounted cable raceway from the desk to the wall, then up the wall behind the TVs.\n- Route and conceal two cables within the raceway: the Cat5e cable supplied with the Sight camera and the micro-USB extension cable for the pod microphone.\n- Secure the raceway and cables for a clean, organized installation.\n- Test the tablet, Sight camera, and pod microphone with remote support to confirm proper connectivity and functionality.\n- Provide completion photos and obtain customer confirmation that the remaining work is complete.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T09:00","end":"2026-10-12T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"dis