{"job":{"id":"6195053408","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Ovation Workspace Services","title":"Network Support Tech Required","description":"<p>Please follow the instructions :-</p><p><strong>1. Do not leave the site</strong> without prior permission from myself, our team, or the DCC team.</p><p><strong>2. Do not contact the POC (Point of Contact)</strong>before the visit unless explicitly instructed to do so.</p><p><strong>3. Dress Code:</strong> Business casual attire is required.</p><p><strong>4. Do not discuss the pay rate</strong> onsite with the customer or any other employees.</p><p><strong>5. Site Visit Report:</strong> After completing the visit, you <strong>must fill out the Site Visit Report and upload it to the work order</strong>. This is <strong>mandatory for work order approval</strong>.</p><p><strong>Failure to follow these instructions will result in disqualification of work approval, impact billing, and may affect your eligibility for future assignments.</strong></p><p><br></p><p>8.Short description of the reported issue:&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;SETUP A DISPTACH FOR CLINIC-105479 TO ASSIST ON INSTALLING ADDITIONAL SWITCH</p><p>9.If L1/L2 is required: L2</p><p><br></p><p>10.Mandate Action required:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bomgar software to be installed in every dispatch engineer laptop.</p><p>Upload an image of Kronos clock during the Entry time and Exit time.</p><p>Engineers are required to contact the Dispatch Team before leaving the clinic.</p><p>Ovation engineer should introduce himself in the clinic saying he/she is from Fresenius IT support</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>11.Engineers are required to carry the following equipment:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Personal Cell phone and Laptop with Microsoft Teams access and PuTTY (For being able to contact each other and possibly hotspot).</p><p>-A Screwdriver and Allen wrench.</p><p>-10 ft data cable.ac</p><p>-Console Cable for Cisco / HP Router, Switch</p><p>-Cable tester&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>-Tone generator&nbsp;</p><p>-Toner</p><p>- USB of 2GB empty space</p><p>-Network sockets and Network cables needs to be inspected and if required to replace</p><p>and tech should have at least 20 cables and Sockets with Tech, if required have to use.</p><p>-If clinic is having the required equipment to use or else tech have to use their own.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>12.After the completion of Visit:</p><p>Update the SVR with Resolution Steps</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T10:00","end":"2026-10-12T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":48.4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $180 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00