{"job":{"id":20144762,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Academy Sports & Outdoors - Cash Drawer Replacement","description":{"html":"SOW: Tech to replace cash drawer at register#  203                   (Tech Needs to provide work order, ID and INC to MOD) <br/>- INC Number:  INC2579097<br/>- Tech must write RMA provided from Service on return package and drop part off at FedEx<br/><br/>Required Tools:<br/>- Basic hand tools <br/>- Screw drivers (#0, #1, & #3 phillips and flat head) <br/>- Needle nose pliers <br/><br/>Check In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)<br/>-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN<br/>-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app<br/>-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1<br/><br/>While Onsite:<br/>- Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW<br/>- Tech will call Academy Sports Helpdesk (888-396-6330 option 5) OR Spencer Support (877-541-0547 option 2) for All Support needs <br/>- If necessary the tech can remove a component or cable from the customer support register for spare parts. - Must obtain MOD’s permission first<br/><br/>Checkout Requirements:<br/>- Tech and MOD must check-out with Academy Sports Helpdesk (888-396-6330 option 5),  Tech will need the REQ# to give Academy as the “release number” (can be obtained from Spencer Service Agent <br/>-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)<br/>-Tech to take after photo<br/><br/>Deliverables:<br/>-This work order requires tech to take a before and after photo of all surrounding cables pertaining to this scope of work. Tech MUST NOT leave the site until their Spencer Service agent approves their photos during check out. Tech MUST send photos to Service@Spencertech.com The Request ID MUST be added to the subject line.<br/>- Tech is responsible for recording serial numbers of new equipment and defective equipment <br/>- Tech is responsible for packing up defective equipment and dropping off at FedEx for return. DO NOT LEAVE ONSITE.","markdown":"SOW: Tech to replace cash drawer at register# 203 (Tech Needs to provide work order, ID and INC to MOD)   \n\\- INC Number: INC2579097  \n\\- Tech must write RMA provided from Service on return package and drop part off at FedEx  \n  \nRequired Tools:  \n\\- Basic hand tools   \n\\- Screw drivers (#0, #1, & #3 phillips and flat head)   \n\\- Needle nose pliers   \n  \nCheck In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)  \n-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN  \n-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app  \n-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1  \n  \nWhile Onsite:  \n\\- Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW  \n\\- Tech will call Academy Sports Helpdesk (888-396-6330 option 5) OR Spencer Support (877-541-0547 option 2) for All Support needs   \n\\- If necessary the tech can remove a component or cable from the customer support register for spare parts. - Must obtain MOD’s permission first  \n  \nCheckout Requirements:  \n\\- Tech and MOD must check-out with Academy Sports Helpdesk (888-396-6330 option 5), Tech will need the REQ# to give Academy as the “release number” (can be obtained from Spencer Service Agent   \n-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)  \n-Tech to take after photo  \n  \nDeliverables:  \n-This work order requires tech to take a before and after photo of all surrounding cables pertaining to this scope of work. Tech MUST NOT leave the site until their Spencer Service agent approves their photos during check out. Tech MUST send photos to Service@Spencertech.com The Request ID MUST be added to the subject line.  \n\\- Tech is responsible for recording serial numbers of new equipment and defective equipment   \n\\- Tech is responsible for packing up defective equipment and dropping off at FedEx for return. DO NOT LEAVE ONSITE.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T17:00","end":"2026-10-12T19:00","latestStart":"2026-10-12T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":10.454989457655966},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-12T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974903-Method Townhomes-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05980771-The Edition on Oberlin-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1