{"job":{"id":20145361,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"FW2 Down","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Summary Of Problem: FW2 Down</strong></p><p><strong>Scope Of Work: replace fw1 that is not powering on. confirm fw1 is up and synchronized. </strong></p><p><br></p><p>When you arrive onsite, please contact the Comcast Enterprise Service Assurance NOC immediately and communicate that you are onsite for a Trouble Call. Please send a text message via <del>************ *** ********* *** ****** * ***************</del></p><p> </p><p><em>﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch. </em></p><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cell Phone – with Charger. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">WIN10 Laptop – with Charger - </span></li><li><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 &amp; USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45</strong></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Standard Tool Kit</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cat 6 cables</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cable Tester</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Hotspot or Internet Dongle</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Black Ink Pens (for documentation)</span></li></ul><p><strong><u>Job Requirements:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></p><p> </p><ul><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Communicate frequently via phone/email communications</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.  </span></li><li><span style=\