{"job":{"id":20061178,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"Tory Burch POS and Server Preventative Maintenance","description":{"html":"<p>Tory Burch Preventative Maintenance- POS and Server. Perform preventative maintenance and visual inspection of registers and server.</p><p>Please ensure you are on time, arriving at 9 am. Penalties for late arrivals will be imposed.</p><p>Upon arrival, check in with Pomeroy coordinator.</p><p>Call <del>*****</del> support line promptly at 9:00 am and check in with the analyst.</p><p>Work with analyst on tasks in the checklist, including cleaning dust, confirming fan is operational and testing peripherals attached to the register. The analyst will walk you through removing the head cover from the register, using the small push button on the back.</p><p>Perform a visual inspection of the server and report failures. Clean any airflow blockages.</p><p>Take a picture of the server and surrounding area.<strong> The model number and serial number of the server must be clearly visible.</strong></p><p>Complete the checklist and submit to work order creator prior to leaving the site.</p><p>Checkout with analyst on <del>*****</del> support line.</p><p>Preventative maintenance work will take between 1 to 2 hours.</p><p><strong>Required Technician Tools/Materials:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Paper towels</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Lint free cloths</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Canned air</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Windex </span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Paper clip&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Screwdriver</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Pliers</span></li></ul>","markdown":"Tory Burch Preventative Maintenance- POS and Server. Perform preventative maintenance and visual inspection of registers and server.\n\nPlease ensure you are on time, arriving at 9 am. Penalties for late arrivals will be imposed.\n\nUpon arrival, check in with Pomeroy coordinator.\n\nCall \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* support line promptly at 9:00 am and check in with the analyst.\n\nWork with analyst on tasks in the checklist, including cleaning dust, confirming fan is operational and testing peripherals attached to the register. The analyst will walk you through removing the head cover from the register, using the small push button on the back.\n\nPerform a visual inspection of the server and report failures. Clean any airflow blockages.\n\nTake a picture of the server and surrounding area. **The model number and serial number of the server must be clearly visible.**\n\nComplete the checklist and submit to work order creator prior to leaving the site.\n\nCheckout with analyst on \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* support line.\n\nPreventative maintenance work will take between 1 to 2 hours.\n\n**Required Technician Tools/Materials:**\n\n- Paper towels\n- Lint free cloths\n- Canned air\n- Windex\n- Paper clip\n- Screwdriver\n- Pliers","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T09:00","end":"2026-10-20T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":32.20320046785529},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","