{"job":{"id":20133465,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"WiringPOS","title":"Install Media Player","description":{"html":"<p>Check in and out from the parking lot before walking into the location with&nbsp;<del>***** ** ******************</del></p>\n<p>New Store Construction,&nbsp;about 3 hrs on site.</p>\n<p>Mount 20\" LCD monitor &amp; Media Player in Drive Thru Area next to the Cash Wrap.</p>\n<p>Mount the media player behind monitor.</p>\n<p>Cable manage of wiring.</p>\n<p>Run about 30' of cat5 loop extension from the J-box under drive thru window area conduit is provided to the Media player.</p>\n<p>Connect Media player to the data wall jack.</p>\n<p>Review the PDF installation Diagram</p>\n<p>inventory parts go over scope of work, ask any questions,</p>\n<p>Upload or Text photos of installation before being released from site.</p>\n<p>Installation Video</p>\n<p>https://you<del>*****************</del></p>\n<p>Test with Support</p>\n<p>The accepting pro must meet ALL requirements below:</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pro should be detail oriented</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pro should not wear any articles of clothing that have another companies name or logo on it.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>TOOL REQUIREMENT:</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Smart Phone with ability to access e-mail and open a mobile web page (for checking in and out)</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Basic technician tools (philips and flat head screw driver, wire cutters, etc)</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Drill &amp; Screws</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fish tape/Cable Pulling and Crimping tools</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Spare RJ-45</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Spare Cat5 cable (reimburse if used)</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6 ft ladder</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Must Bring for testing if static IP is wrong</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;USB Keyboard &amp; Mouse</p>\n<p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Volt / OHM meter</p>","markdown":"Check in and out from the parking lot before walking into the location with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nNew Store Construction, about 3 hrs on site.\n\nMount 20\" LCD monitor & Media Player in Drive Thru Area next to the Cash Wrap.\n\nMount the media player behind monitor.\n\nCable manage of wiring.\n\nRun about 30' of cat5 loop extension from the J-box under drive thru window area conduit is provided to the Media player.\n\nConnect Media player to the data wall jack.\n\nReview the PDF installation Diagram\n\ninventory parts go over scope of work, ask any questions,\n\nUpload or Text photos of installation before being released from site.\n\nInstallation Video\n\nhttps://you\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nTest with Support\n\nThe accepting pro must meet ALL requirements below:\n\n• Pro should be detail oriented\n\n• Pro should not wear any articles of clothing that have another companies name or logo on it.\n\nTOOL REQUIREMENT:\n\n• Smart Phone with ability to access e-mail and open a mobile web page (for checking in and out)\n\n• Basic technician tools (philips and flat head screw driver, wire cutters, etc)\n\n• Drill & Screws\n\n• Fish tape/Cable Pulling and Crimping tools\n\n• Spare RJ-45\n\n• Spare Cat5 cable (reimburse if used)\n\n• 6 ft ladder\n\nMust Bring for testing if static IP is wrong\n\n• USB Keyboard & Mouse\n\n• Volt / OHM meter","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-12T09:00","end":"2026-10-12T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":250,"max":250},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":12.365134524002087},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Columbus Day"},{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"st