{"job":{"id":20141101,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Applied Network Services","title":"Tech will need laptop with 1G ethernet port for testing Activation/Install -11480272","description":{"html":"<p>This is for Banana Republic</p>\n<p><strong>Firm start time, please do not be late. Job should take roughly 2-3hrs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>-------PLEASE READ SCOPE OF WORK BEFORE REQUESTING OR ACCEPTING---</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Firm start time, please do not be late.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***Upon arrival - tech to call remote support</strong><strong><del>****** ********* * ************</del></strong></p>\n<p><strong>If you have trouble reaching assigned remote support, please call&nbsp;844-905-9779 for assistance</strong></p>\n<p>Provide ANS # or TKT #...Do not mention&nbsp;<strong>FIELD NATION</strong>&nbsp;or provide Field Nation ID.</p>\n<p><strong>Do not Mention Field Nation!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***Tech must have valid Identification</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***Tech must have Laptop with Ethernet adapter-Should have Team viewer loaded</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***Tech must have Butt Sett with Toner and wand FOR ANY POTS RELATED SERVICES</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;***Tech SHOULD have at least 100 Cat5e Cable in case a cable run is needed - all Materials used must be documented and will be reimbursed at industry rate or at cost with receipt.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>***IMPORTANT - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED BUT YOU ARE UNABLE TO COMPLETE DUE TO DIFFICULTY OR TOTAL TIME IT WOULD TAKE, PLEASE PERFORM SURVEY, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>*****IMPORTANT - UPON COMPLETION - MUST SEND PHOTO OF&nbsp;<u>SIGNED&nbsp;</u>WORK ORDER TO REMOTE SUPPORT AS WELL AS UPLOAD TO FIELD NATION*****</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The business you are visiting is</strong>&nbsp;<strong><del>*** ****</del></strong><strong>.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>You have been hired by Applied Network Services who has been contracted for this job by&nbsp;</strong><del>******</del></p>\n<p><strong>If you have&nbsp;<u>ANY</u>&nbsp;questions on this work order, need to make changes, extend time, etc&nbsp;<u>DO NOT ASK THE ONSITE CUSTOMER and DO NOT ASK&nbsp;</u></strong><del>******</del><strong>&nbsp;Please send us a note ON THE PLATFORM or TEXT Charles 914-355-9520 IF RESPONSE TIME IS SLOW</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>On Site Instructions:</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Upon entry, introduce yourself to the on-site manager as&nbsp;</strong><u>Applied Network Services</u>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<del>************</del>and he/she&nbsp;will escort you to the work area.Please call upon arrival and work with contact on all connections.&nbsp;Local contact is&nbsp;<strong><del>**** ***********</del></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>***PLEASE NOTE - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED FOR ANY WORK ON SITE, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. SURVEY THE WORK, PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>***Tech is to be onsite at 7:30am local time***</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Store ID: BANANA REPUBLIC-ST08146</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>***Tech will need laptop with 1G ethernet port for testing. Ensure USB connections/ports are USB3.0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>GAP is requesting to retest and cutover circuit to the Stores Router on for 10/19/2026 @ 8:00am ET local time.</p>\n<p>This must start at 8am local time in order to complete prior to store opening at 10am.</p>\n<p>A COI might be required by property management. Will notify you if so.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Niles Zoom link</p>\n<p>https://gapinc.zoom.us/j/3325606894?pwd=5mxPi21zZjVNTGAzPqoVZeDeJ268n0.1</p>\n<p>Mobile call one-tap (US Toll): +12532050468, 3325606894# or +12532158782,3325606894#</p>\n<p><br 