{"job":{"id":"5809942336","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"06062281-1025 Trollinger Road-EPIK Survey and Install","description":"DESCRIPTION: \"SOW - EPIK Single Visit Install <br><br>************************************************************************************* <br><br>Before Arrival <br><br>1.Call the LCON 30 minutes before arrival. <br><br>2.Review the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK: <br><br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo <br><br>3.Arrive with all required tools and materials listed below. <br><br>On Arrival <br><br>1.Check in on WorkMarket. <br><br>2.Locate the customer contact and confirm the install location. <br><br>3.Review the Special Instructions before starting work. <br><br>EPIK Install Requirements <br><br>1.Mount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik. <br><br>2.If EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location.  <br><br>3.Power on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard. <br><br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on. <br><br>4.If applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions. <br><br>5.Log into the EPIK Install Wizard: <br><br>https://wizard.epik.io <br><br>6.Follow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned. <br><br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES <br><br>7.If not already stated in the TNs to be wired section of your ticket, confirm with site contact if there are fire alarm, security alarm, elevator or e911 lines on site. If so, notify activations of any port configuration changes that need to be made and complete testing with the fire, security or elevator monitoring companies. <br><br>8.For any lines that ca