{"job":{"id":20153740,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Package Solutions - Locker Issues","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Pre-Site Requirements</u>:</strong></p><ul><li>Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)</li><li>Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)</li><li>Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.</li><li>Sign Technician NDA<strong> (</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><u>REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT</u></strong><strong>): </strong><del>**************************************</del></li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Check-In</u>:&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-in with on-site staff.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check-in with our support at&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************</del></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 134, 232);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">to get codes and review scope.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If you are on hold for more than 10 minutes, please review your ticket scope and start working on it. Work closely with the property staff on codes and part tracking information.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Job Details</u>:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">CALL TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING ANY TROUBLESHOOTING ASSISTANCE!!!</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Scope</u>:</strong></p><p><strong>Type of Request:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tech and Parts Only</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Reason for Visit:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Troubleshoot locker 45</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Adjust latch/Replace lock</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check all lockers 3/3 times</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Property Details:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Forayna Davis Park - (10838)</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Address:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1025 Luxury Lane Durham, North Carolina - NC 27703</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Special Tools Needed:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Standard Tool Kit</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Screwdrivers (Philips #2, #3, Flathead)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 90 Degree Angle Drill Attachment</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- 18V+ Cordless Drill w/ Assorted Cobalt Drill Bit Set</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Ratchet and 90-degree socket adapter</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Rivet Gun</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Needle Nose and diagonal pliers</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">- Pick &amp; Hook set</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;Locker Lock Replacement: 45</span></p><ul><li>Test the lock for Lockers:</li><li>If the lock clicks, adjust the latch until the door opens and closes smoothly.</li><li>If the lock does not click, proceed to remove it; if the harness is secured and it will not click, replace it.</li><li>Replace the lock by following the How to Replace a lock guide.</li><li>Once the lock is replaced, test it.</li><li>Contact tech support for further assistance if the door still doesn’t open.</li><li>If the door opens, test all the doors 2x to ensure all are swinging open.</li><li>If you notice any other doors not swinging open, align the latches of Lockers doors.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>Check-Out</u>:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check out with technical support&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>**************</del></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 134, 232);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional. Again if on hold for 10+ minutes, continue to the next step.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.</span></li></ul><p><strong><u>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support</u>:&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Resources:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Lock Replacement:</strong></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eklOvGnzzVo&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=10</p><p><strong>XL Lock Replacement:</strong></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wMkPQR3k6UA&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=5</p><p><strong>Locker Will Not Open:</strong></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LH1DMZ-u-EY&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=38</p><p><strong>Bumper Installation:</strong></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=agkb3vhwtQg&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=15</p><p><strong>Accessing Control Board:</strong></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxQo9IvMuuI&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=12</p>","markdown":"**Pre-Site Requirements:**\n\n- Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)\n- Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)\n- Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.\n- Sign Technician NDA **(****REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT****):** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Check-In:**\n\n- Check-in with on-site staff.\n- Check-in with our support at **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to get codes and review scope.\n- If you are on hold for more than 10 minutes, please review your ticket scope and start working on it. Work closely with the property staff on codes and part tracking information.\n\n**Job Details:**\n\n**CALL TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING ANY TROUBLESHOOTING ASSISTANCE!!!**\n\n**Scope:**\n\n**Type of Request:**\n\nTech and Parts Only\n\n**Reason for Visit:**\n\nTroubleshoot locker 45\n\nAdjust latch/Replace lock\n\nCheck all lockers 3/3 times\n\n**Property Details:**\n\nForayna Davis Park - (10838)\n\n**Address:**\n\n1025 Luxury Lane Durham, North Carolina - NC 27703\n\n**Special Tools Needed:**\n\n\\- Standard Tool Kit\n\n\\- Screwdrivers (Philips #2, #3, Flathead)\n\n\\- 90 Degree Angle Drill Attachment\n\n\\- 18V+ Cordless Drill w/ Assorted Cobalt Drill Bit Set\n\n\\- Ratchet and 90-degree socket adapter\n\n\\- Rivet Gun\n\n\\- Needle Nose and diagonal pliers\n\n\\- Pick & Hook set\n\n**Scope:**\n\n Locker Lock Replacement: 45\n\n- Test the lock for Lockers:\n- If the lock clicks, adjust the latch until the door opens and closes smoothly.\n- If the lock does not click, proceed to remove it; if the harness is secured and it will not click, replace it.\n- Replace the lock by following the How to Replace a lock guide.\n- Once the lock is replaced, test it.\n- Contact tech support for further assistance if the door still doesn’t open.\n- If the door opens, test all the doors 2x to ensure all are swinging open.\n- If you notice any other doors not swinging open, align the latches of Lockers doors.\n\n**Check-Out:**\n\n- Check out with technical support **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional. Again if on hold for 10+ minutes, continue to the next step.\n- Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.\n\n**If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support:** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Resources:**\n\n**Lock Replacement:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eklOvGnzzVo&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=10>\n\n**XL Lock Replacement:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wMkPQR3k6UA&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=5>\n\n**Locker Will Not Open:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LH1DMZ-u-EY&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=38>\n\n**Bumper Installation:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=agkb3vhwtQg&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=15>\n\n**Accessing Control Board:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxQo9IvMuuI&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=12>","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-13T10:30","end":"2026-10-13T12:30","latestStart":"2026-10-13T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":95},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":55},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":17.808762081440698},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $95 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062262-301 Prison Camp Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062271-3224 Old Hillsborough Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062284-600 S 3rd Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-