{"job":{"id":20150554,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Package Solutions - Troubleshooting (82709)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Pre-Site Requirements</u>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)</li>\n<li>Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)</li>\n<li>Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.</li>\n<li>Sign Technician NDA <strong>(</strong><strong><u>REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT</u></strong><strong>):</strong><del>**************************************</del></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Check-In</u>:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check-in with on-site staff.</li>\n<li>Check-in with our support at&nbsp;<strong><del>************</del></strong>&nbsp;to get codes and review scope.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Job Details</u>:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Calling into support for check-in/out is mandatory, additional calls can be made for any troubleshooting assistance.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope</u>:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Reason for Visit:</strong></p>\n<p>Bring Both Package Room Door relays online</p>\n<p>There are two routers, one in each interior room iPad mount</p>\n<p>Reboot ALL Equipment requested by Luxer One&nbsp;</p>\n<p>There's two iPads inside of the room</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Property Details:</strong></p>\n<p>Plat 4 at Research Triangle</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Address:</strong></p>\n<p>5510 Primary Drive Durham, North Carolina - NC 27703</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Gate Code:</p>\n<p>919-539-9190</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Special Tools Needed:</p>\n<p>-</p>\n<p>**For Internet:</p>\n<p>- Ethernet Tester</p>\n<p>- Laptop w/ Ethernet Port with Firefox Installed</p>\n<p>- Line Toner</p>\n<p>- Device w/ HotSpot Functionality</p>\n<p>- Ethernet cable terminals (RJ45)</p>\n<p>- Ethernet cable terminating tool (RJ45)</p>\n<p>- Precision Screwdriver Set, iFixit or equivalent</p>\n<p>-</p>\n<p>**For Power:</p>\n<p>- Wire Crimper</p>\n<p>- Outlet Tester</p>\n<p>- Volt-Meter</p>\n<p>- Precision Screwdriver Set</p>\n<p>- iFixit or equivalent</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Parts Needed:</p>\n<p>None</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Scope</strong>:</p>\n<p>Full System Down Inspection:</p>\n<p>Network &amp; Router:</p>\n<p>Confirm router is connected and receiving live internet.</p>\n<p>Test/inspect ethernet connections and document speed (Minimum 1.5MB/s upload speed).</p>\n<p>Contact LuxerOne support at 916 252 5590 to gain access to the router and view attached devices on the network.</p>\n<p>Verify all devices are accounted for.</p>\n<p>If devices are missing, restore their connectivity.</p>\n<p>If property internet is not live, request the property reboot their Luxer modem (OOS for technician).</p>\n<p>If successful, reboot Luxer Netgear router as well.</p>\n<p>if you are able toconfirm that the Luxer router is receiving active internet from the property.</p>\n<p>Lockers iPad(s):</p>\n<p>Contact LuxerOne support at 916 252 5590 to disable single-app-mode and to verify the iPad is reporting as ‘Alive.’.</p>\n<p>Access the iPad by opening the Main control bay and removing the iPad from the mounting plate.</p>\n<p>If wired, confirm adapters are connected properly.</p>\n<p>If connected via Wi-Fi, ensure the iPad is connected to SSID ‘LuxerOne’ and forget all other networks.</p>\n<p>**Note: If the Lockers has a ThermoElectric Cooler (TEC) attached to the docking plate, the iPad can still be removed via the thumb screws.</p>\n<p>Power cycle the system's iPad by holding the POWER and HOME buttons until the screen goes blank. If the iPad screen is stuck in data sync afterwards, then call the support number below.</p>\n<p>Otherwise, proceed to next step.</p>\n<p>If the Control Board, wiring, and iPad are operational, contact the technician support team at 916-252-5590 to conduct several test deliveries and pick-ups.</p>\n<p>On the Luxer One App:</p>\n<p>Log into the Manager Interface using the 8-digit manager code (if the iPad did not automatically sync, you may select “Re-sync” on this page to ensure it does).</p>\n<p>Test opening the door(s) by opening them individually. **DO NOT USE ‘OPEN ALL LOCKERS’ command as it floods Control Boards with voltage**</p>\n<p>If testing was successful, secure the iPad back into the enclosure and reconnect all cables.</p>\n<p>Confirm the iPad is charging and still opening locks after repositioning.</p>\n<p>If the Control Board, wiring, and iPad are operational, contact the technician support team at 916-252-5590 to conduct several test deliveries and pick-ups.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Check-Out</u>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out with technical support&nbsp;<strong><del>**************</del></strong>&nbsp;to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional.</li>\n<li>Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support</u>:&nbsp;</strong><strong><del>************</del></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Resources:</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Lock Replacement:</strong></p>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eklOvGnzzVo&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=11</p>\n<p><strong>Accessing the Control Board:</strong></p>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxQo9IvMuuI&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=12</p>","markdown":"**Pre-Site Requirements:**\n\n- Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)\n- Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)\n- Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.\n- Sign Technician NDA **(****REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT****):**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Check-In:**\n\n- Check-in with on-site staff.\n- Check-in with our support at **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to get codes and review scope.\n\n**Job Details:**\n\n**Calling into support for check-in/out is mandatory, additional calls can be made for any troubleshooting assistance.**\n\n**Scope:**\n\n**Reason for Visit:**\n\nBring Both Package Room Door relays online\n\nThere are two routers, one in each interior room iPad mount\n\nReboot ALL Equipment requested by Luxer One\n\nThere's two iPads inside of the room\n\n**Property Details:**\n\nPlat 4 at Research Triangle\n\n**Address:**\n\n5510 Primary Drive Durham, North Carolina - NC 27703\n\nGate Code:\n\n919-539-9190\n\nSpecial Tools Needed:\n\n-\n\n\\*\\*For Internet:\n\n\\- Ethernet Tester\n\n\\- Laptop w/ Ethernet Port with Firefox Installed\n\n\\- Line Toner\n\n\\- Device w/ HotSpot Functionality\n\n\\- Ethernet cable terminals (RJ45)\n\n\\- Ethernet cable terminating tool (RJ45)\n\n\\- Precision Screwdriver Set, iFixit or equivalent\n\n-\n\n\\*\\*For Power:\n\n\\- Wire Crimper\n\n\\- Outlet Tester\n\n\\- Volt-Meter\n\n\\- Precision Screwdriver Set\n\n\\- iFixit or equivalent\n\nParts Needed:\n\nNone\n\n**Scope**:\n\nFull System Down Inspection:\n\nNetwork & Router:\n\nConfirm router is connected and receiving live internet.\n\nTest/inspect ethernet connections and document speed (Minimum 1.5MB/s upload speed).\n\nContact LuxerOne support at 916 252 5590 to gain access to the router and view attached devices on the network.\n\nVerify all devices are accounted for.\n\nIf devices are missing, restore their connectivity.\n\nIf property internet is not live, request the property reboot their Luxer modem (OOS for technician).\n\nIf successful, reboot Luxer Netgear router as well.\n\nif you are able toconfirm that the Luxer router is receiving active internet from the property.\n\nLockers iPad(s):\n\nContact LuxerOne support at 916 252 5590 to disable single-app-mode and to verify the iPad is reporting as ‘Alive.’.\n\nAccess the iPad by opening the Main control bay and removing the iPad from the mounting plate.\n\nIf wired, confirm adapters are connected properly.\n\nIf connected via Wi-Fi, ensure the iPad is connected to SSID ‘LuxerOne’ and forget all other networks.\n\n\\*\\*Note: If the Lockers has a ThermoElectric Cooler (TEC) attached to the docking plate, the iPad can still be removed via the thumb screws.\n\nPower cycle the system's iPad by holding the POWER and HOME buttons until the screen goes blank. If the iPad screen is stuck in data sync afterwards, then call the support number below.\n\nOtherwise, proceed to next step.\n\nIf the Control Board, wiring, and iPad are operational, contact the technician support team at 916-252-5590 to conduct several test deliveries and pick-ups.\n\nOn the Luxer One App:\n\nLog into the Manager Interface using the 8-digit manager code (if the iPad did not automatically sync, you may select “Re-sync” on this page to ensure it does).\n\nTest opening the door(s) by opening them individually. \\*\\*DO NOT USE ‘OPEN ALL LOCKERS’ command as it floods Control Boards with voltage\\*\\*\n\nIf testing was successful, secure the iPad back into the enclosure and reconnect all cables.\n\nConfirm the iPad is charging and still opening locks after repositioning.\n\nIf the Control Board, wiring, and iPad are operational, contact the technician support team at 916-252-5590 to conduct several test deliveries and pick-ups.\n\n**Check-Out:**\n\n- Check out with technical support **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional.\n- Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.\n\n**If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support:** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Resources:**\n\n**Lock Replacement:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eklOvGnzzVo&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=11>\n\n**Accessing the Control Board:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oxQo9IvMuuI&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=12>","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-13T10:00","end":"2026-10-13T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":95},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":55},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":17.76637105033117},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $95 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062264-612 Apple Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062283-320 Ivey Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062272-5827 Church Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062286-7718 Sylvan Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062255-720 Walker Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062266-609 Ray Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062281-1025 Trollinger Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-03T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T17:00:00.000Z"