{"job":{"id":"5131860840","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409","description":"DESCRIPTION: DESCRIPTION: TECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL.<br>Check in and out through Work Market. For any questions during the survey, please call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at: 833-479-4768<br>Upon arrival, departure, and for questions about your scope of work or if you are unclear on instructions before starting the installation, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479-4768, otherwise Login to EPIK Wizard at https://wizard.epik.io to begin the Survey process. When you enter the Granite ticket number it will be recognized as a survey, and you will be taken to the Survey Wizard. (Note: If you have completed a Wizard survey or install before, please be sure to refresh your browser window to ensure the current version is being used.)<br>Follow all instructions presented by the Survey Wizard. If you run into any issues or have questions you may call the TC Team. All sections of the survey are required and will require final sign off by Granite Technical Coordinator before you will be cleared to leave the site. The Survey Wizard will guide you through this process.<br>Before departure call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479- 4768 to review deliverables and receive approval on survey results.<br>Once your survey results have been approved by the TC Team, a TC Team representative will give you a checkout code to enter into WorkMarket which you will use to check out upon completion of the survey. Failure to checkout will result in delay or nonpayment for services.<br><br>Materials/Tools Required: Laptop with ability to create hotspot, Smart Phone, Tone Generator and Wand, Punch Tool (66 &amp; 110) Electrician Scissors, Step Ladder, Flashlight and/or Headlamp, RJ11&amp;RJ45 Crimper, Ethernet Cable Tester, Masonry Bits, Impact Drill, Pencil and/or Marker, Level, Philips Driver Bits and Screwdriver Cordless Drill, Needle-Nose Pliers, Label-Maker, All-Purpose Screws (drywall, masonry, wood), Cable-Ties and Mountings, Cat3 or Better Cable (for analog devices), Cat6 Ethernet Cable (for data connections), CrossConnect Wire, Gel-Crimp Connecters, Label-Tape, RJ11 &amp; Cat6 Ethernet Keystone Jacks, RJ11 &amp; RJ45 Modular Plugs, Lineman’s Telephony Handset/Butt-Set<br><br>EPIK Scope of Work:<br><br>Watch Epik install Video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo 2. Watch EPIK Install Wizard video: EPIK Install Wizard Video TECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL. Upon arrival, departure, and for questions about your scope of work or are unclear on instruction before starting the installation, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479-4768, otherwise Login to EPIK install Wizard at https://wizard.epik.io to begin the install process. (Note: If you have completed a Wizard install before please be sure to refresh your browser window to ensure the current version is being used. Also, use Chrome, Firefox, Rave or Microsoft Edge. We do not recommend Safari) Review the SOW and install guide before starting the install. 6. Locate the following Granite-provided Equipment: EPIK Router(s) (4 or 8 Port) and any additional accessories - Update to site specific models and quantities a) Install EPIK router and accessories per site survey results and Installation Guide b) Connect to customers switch on site (if approved) per site survey results Connect to Customer Wired network a) Power on Epik Edge b) Prewire lines to cross connect points as described on work order (TNs to be wired) d) If pre-existing wiring is in use, DO NOT disconnect existing equipment without first being instructed to by the Greenix flow, or an Epik Activations rep (do not perform cross connections before instructed) After installation is complete, Submit required deliverables to WorkMarket and Check out on WorkMarket 9. Before departure check out with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team to review deliverables at 833-479-4768. Materials/Tools Required: Laptop with ability to create hotspot, Smart Phone, Tone Generator and Wand, Punch Tool (66 &amp; 110) Electrician Scissors, Step Ladder, Flashlight and/or Headlamp, RJ11&amp;RJ45 Crimper, Ethernet Cable Tester, Masonry Bits, Impact Drill, Pencil and/or Marker, Level, Philips Driver Bits and Screwdriver Cordless Drill, Needle-Nose Pliers, Label- Maker, All-Purpose Screws (drywall, masonry, wood), Cable-Ties and Mountings, Cat3 or Better Cable (for analog devices), Cat6 Ethernet Cable (for data connections), Cross-Connect Wire, Gel-Crimp Connecters, Label-Tape, RJ11 &amp; Cat6 Ethernet Keystone Jacks, RJ11 &amp; RJ45 Modular Plugs, Lineman’s Telephony Handset/Butt-Set","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T11:00","end":"2026-10-19T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":77.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":110,"payStructure":null},"reason":"TRAVEL_REQUIRED","rejectDetails":"Travel required (77.5mi reported + 10mi padding = 87.5mi > 20mi)"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062255-720 Walker Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"