{"job":{"id":20155262,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Troubleshoot POTS line","description":{"html":"<p>Need to troubleshoot 2 phone lines. One line is the elevator and the other is the fire panel. Both lines connect to an Ooma AirDial. I believe the lines may be connected backwards and need to verify which cable is going to each port.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Business casual, clean attire and presentable.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Contact Project Manager if the following are true:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, please contact&nbsp;<strong>Project Manager</strong></li><li><strong>Any issues or questions should be escalated to the Project Manager</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p>Necessary Telecom Tools: Camera/Phone, Buttset, Toner, 66/110 Punch Down Tools, etc.</p><p>Tasks are listed below.</p>","markdown":"Need to troubleshoot 2 phone lines. One line is the elevator and the other is the fire panel. Both lines connect to an Ooma AirDial. I believe the lines may be connected backwards and need to verify which cable is going to each port.\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Business casual, clean attire and presentable.\n\n**Contact Project Manager if the following are true:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, please contact **Project Manager**\n- **Any issues or questions should be escalated to the Project Manager**\n\nNecessary Telecom Tools: Camera/Phone, Buttset, Toner, 66/110 Punch Down Tools, etc.\n\nTasks are listed below.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T09:30","end":"2026-10-16T09:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":520},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":10.001365412457952},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 14, 9:30 AM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 14, Thu, Oct 15, Fri, Oct 16 · 9:00 A