{"job":{"id":20155184,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"SBUX - Ipad Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>***PHOTO DELIVERABLES MUST BE REVIEWED PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE***</p><p><br></p><p>SCOPE OF WORK: Remove Existing ELO, Install iPad w/Mount</p><p>--Be prepared with a Phillips #2 screwdriver, a snipping/cutting tool, and cabling materials to replace/repair cabling as needed.</p><p>--Install guide attached and the new mounting equipment is sent to the site for technician.</p><p>--Remove existing ELO, install the iPad VESA mount onto the tri-arm, an iPad into the mounting case, and then add them all together with the charger to have an iPad DPM.</p><p>--Ensure ELO is boxed and labeled for return. Technician to take to FedEx to return ship.</p><p>--Ensure replacement iPad DPM installed and mounted.</p><p>--Ensure iPad DPM is connected to WAN, troubleshoot connection if needed.</p><p><br></p><p>CABLING DISPATCH EXPECTATIONS:</p><p>--If a new cable run is needed but can't be completed, call New Era.</p><p>--Technicians are expected to leave each area so that it looks like a new installation.&nbsp;</p><p>--If there are any questions about what is approved, please call New Era immediately to discuss.</p><p><br></p><p>NEW ERA CONTACT INFORMATION:</p><p>Dial in by phone</p><p><a href=\"tel:+16178650253,,158951459#\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(91, 95, 199);\"><u>+1 617-865-0253,,158951459#</u></a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(97, 97, 97);\"> United States, Boston</span></p><p><a href=\"https://dialin.teams.cloud.microsoft/e57ae107-6c61-474c-8ef2-f226dad63a43?id=158951459\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(91, 95, 199);\"><u>Find a local number</u></a></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(97, 97, 97);\">Phone conference ID: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">158 951 459#</span></p><p><br></p><p>DELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 24 HOURS OF SITE COMPLETION</p><p>--Technician is REQUIRED to check in/out and complete the checklist via the Tech-Works portal while onsite.</p><p>--Technician must provide CLEAR and QUALITY photos in the Smartsheet Form.</p><p>---If tech experiences issues with Tech-Works, email all photos to New Era at StarbucksDPMCoordinators@neweratech.com@neweratech.com. Subject line needs to include the Store #</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Smartsheet From for Pictures --</p><p>TECH-WORKS LINK -- <a href=\"https://tw.neweratech.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=%2f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://tw.neweratech.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=%2f</a></p><p><br></p><p>PROFESSIONAL REQUIREMENTS:</p><p>--Technician must attain a professional demeanor while onsite. Failure to do so will result in No Payment and further repercussions.</p><p>--Technician must be dressed business casual - no shorts or open toed shoes.</p><p>--You are representing New Era Technology/Comm-Works while onsite.</p><p>--Instructions MUST be followed, if support isn't contacted for release, payment may be denied.</p><p>--Deliverables MUST be uploaded within 24 hours of site completion, if not payment may be denied.</p><p>--By accepting this work order, you are agreeing to these terms.</p>","markdown":"\\*\\*\\*PHOTO DELIVERABLES MUST BE REVIEWED PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE\\*\\*\\*\n\nSCOPE OF WORK: Remove Existing ELO, Install iPad w/Mount\n\n\\--Be prepared with a Phillips #2 screwdriver, a snipping/cutting tool, and cabling materials to replace/repair cabling as needed.\n\n\\--Install guide attached and the new mounting equipment is sent to the site for technician.\n\n\\--Remove existing ELO, install the iPad VESA mount onto the tri-arm, an iPad into the mounting case, and then add them all together with the charger to have an iPad DPM.\n\n\\--Ensure ELO is boxed and labeled for return. Technician to take to FedEx to return ship.\n\n\\--Ensure replacement iPad DPM installed and mounted.\n\n\\--Ensure iPad DPM is connected to WAN, troubleshoot connection if needed.\n\nCABLING DISPATCH EXPECTATIONS:\n\n\\--If a new cable run is needed but can't be completed, call New Era.\n\n\\--Technicians are expected to leave each area so that it looks like a new installation.\n\n\\--If there are any questions about what is approved, please call New Era immediately to discuss.\n\nNEW ERA CONTACT INFORMATION:\n\nDial in by phone\n\ntel:+16178650253,,158951459#  United States, Boston\n\nhttps://dialin.teams.cloud.microsoft/e57ae107-6c61-474c-8ef2-f226dad63a43?id=158951459\n\nPhone conference ID: 158 951 459#\n\nDELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 24 HOURS OF SITE COMPLETION\n\n\\--Technician is REQUIRED to check in/out and complete the checklist via the Tech-Works portal while onsite.\n\n\\--Technician must provide CLEAR and QUALITY photos in the Smartsheet Form.\n\n\\---If tech experiences issues with Tech-Works, email all photos to New Era at StarbucksDPMCoordinators@neweratech.com@neweratech.com. Subject line needs to include the Store #\n\nSmartsheet From for Pictures --\n\nTECH-WORKS LINK -- [](https://tw.neweratech.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=%2f)<https://tw.neweratech.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=%2f>\n\nPROFESSIONAL REQUIREMENTS:\n\n\\--Technician must attain a professional demeanor while onsite. Failure to do so will result in No Payment and further repercussions.\n\n\\--Technician must be dressed business casual - no shorts or open toed shoes.\n\n\\--You are representing New Era Technology/Comm-Works while onsite.\n\n\\--Instructions MUST be followed, if support isn't contacted for release, payment may be denied.\n\n\\--Deliverables MUST be uploaded within 24 hours of site completion, if not payment may be denied.\n\n\\--By accepting this work order, you are agreeing to these terms.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T09:00","end":"2026-10-19T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-19T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":n