{"job":{"id":20155351,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"2 Techs Needed - Menu Board Swap, configuration and drop off","description":{"html":"<p>Please text Brandpoint Services at 856-382-2645 when you are on your way, when you arrive onsite, and when you are ready to leave to review work. You will receive your checkout code after you submit your photos, sign off and receipt from dropping off the screen at FedEx.</p><p>We are swapping out a defective display for new a one. (usually a black spot on defective unit)</p><p>We are taking the defective unit and packing it in the new box, and will be dropping it off at a local FedEx the same/next business day.</p><p>After Replacement call support to ensure correct content is up on the new screen.</p><p>Photos and Sign Off Sheet/Checklist needed before leaving site.</p><p>Photo of drop off receipt needed (Boxes are large so need a large SUV, van or pickup)</p><p>MUST HAVE TORX SECURITY BITS/SCREWDRIVERS</p><p>You are responsible for checking the weather before going to site. An ODMB should not be performed in the rain.</p><p>We want to avoid the lunch rush of noon to 1PM arrival.</p><p><br></p><p>CONFIRM FEDEX TRACKING BEFORE GOING TO SITE!&nbsp;A TRIP CHARGE WILL NOT BE ISSUED FOR SITE VISITS AND THE MONITOR HAS NOT ARRIVED YET.</p><p><br></p><p>Trip Charges are $150 if we are unable to complete the swap in its entirety. (IE no key or refused to work)</p>","markdown":"Please text Brandpoint Services at 856-382-2645 when you are on your way, when you arrive onsite, and when you are ready to leave to review work. You will receive your checkout code after you submit your photos, sign off and receipt from dropping off the screen at FedEx.\n\nWe are swapping out a defective display for new a one. (usually a black spot on defective unit)\n\nWe are taking the defective unit and packing it in the new box, and will be dropping it off at a local FedEx the same/next business day.\n\nAfter Replacement call support to ensure correct content is up on the new screen.\n\nPhotos and Sign Off Sheet/Checklist needed before leaving site.\n\nPhoto of drop off receipt needed (Boxes are large so need a large SUV, van or pickup)\n\nMUST HAVE TORX SECURITY BITS/SCREWDRIVERS\n\nYou are responsible for checking the weather before going to site. An ODMB should not be performed in the rain.\n\nWe want to avoid the lunch rush of noon to 1PM arrival.\n\nCONFIRM FEDEX TRACKING BEFORE GOING TO SITE! A TRIP CHARGE WILL NOT BE ISSUED FOR SITE VISITS AND THE MONITOR HAS NOT ARRIVED YET.\n\nTrip Charges are $150 if we are unable to complete the swap in its entirety. (IE no key or refused to work)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T13:00","end":"2026-10-15T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":43.58880321676609},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"menu board\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062255-720 Walker Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062266-609 Ray Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062262-301 Prison Camp Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062264-612 Apple Stre