{"job":{"id":"8497935241","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit","description":"SOW - EPIK Cutover &amp; Test<br>*************************************************************************************<br>Before Arrival<br>1.Call the LCON 30 minutes before arrival.<br>2.Review the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK:<br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo<br>3.Arrive with all required tools and materials listed below.<br>On Arrival<br>1.Check in on WorkMarket.<br>2.Locate the customer contact and confirm the install location.<br>3.Review the Special Instructions before starting work.<br>EPIK Install Requirements<br>1.Mount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik.<br>2.If EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location. <br>3.Power on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard.<br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on.<br>4.If applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions.<br>5.Log into the EPIK Install Wizard:<br>https://wizard.epik.io<br>6.Follow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned.<br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES<br>Checkout Requirement<br>1.Confirm Activations has released you.<br>2.Submit all WorkMarket deliverables.<br>3.Enter the checkout code in WorkMarket.<br>4.Check out on WorkMarket.<br><br>The install is not considered valid unless the checkout code is entered in WorkMarket.<br><br>Required Deliverables<br>Submit all required deliverables in WorkMarket before checkout:<br>1.Photo of completed EPIK install.<br>2.Photo of labeled 66 block / harmonica block.<br>3.List of existing TNs and the new number that replaced each TN, if applicable.<br>4.Customer signed sign-out sheet.<br>5.Any additional deliverables listed in Special Instructions.<br><br><br>Required Tools<br>•Laptop<br>•Smartphone with hotspot<br>•Tone generator and wand<br>•66/110 punch tool<br>•Butt set<br>•       Infrared Temperature Gun <br>•Electrician scissors<br>•Step ladder<br>•Flashlight/headlamp<br>•RJ11/RJ45 crimper<br>•Ethernet cable tester<br>•Impact drill / cordless drill<br>•Masonry bits<br>•Screwdrivers / driver bits<br>•Needle-nose pliers<br>•Label maker and label tape<br>•Cat3 or better cable<br>•Cat6 Ethernet cable<br>•Cross-connect wire<br>•Gel-crimp connectors<br>•Cable ties and mounting hardware<br>•RJ11/RJ45 plugs and keystone jacks<br>•Console cables: USB to DB9 PL2303 and USB to USB-mini<br>*************************************************************************************<br><br>PM SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS GUIDELINES<br>Special Instructions<br>Install Location<br>Enter where the EPIK device should be installed, including MDF/IDF/telco room location, wall/rack/shelf mounting instructions, and access notes.<br>________________________________________<br>Cable Runs<br>Enter any required cable runs, cable type, distance, start/end points, and whether ladder, lift, ceiling access, or special tools are needed.<br>________________________________________<br>Network Information<br>Enter switch name, switch port, DHCP/static IP details, VLAN info, and customer network escalation contact.<br>________________________________________<br>External Antenna<br>Enter whether an external antenna is required, where it should be mounted, and any cable path or photo requirements.<br>________________________________________<br>Special Testing<br>Enter any customer-specific testing that must be completed, including specific TNs, fax, alarm, elevator, hunt group, auto attendant, or other required testing.<br>________________________________________<br>Customer Contacts<br>Enter primary LCON, backup contact, customer IT contact, site manager, and escalation contacts.<br>________________________________________<br>Vendor / Third-Party Info<br>Enter any VTM, customer tech, alarm vendor, elevator vendor, fax vendor, MSP, or other third-party contact information.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T10:00","end":"2026-10-15T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":11.9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062255-720 Walker Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062266-609 Ray Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062262-301 Prison Camp Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062264-612 Apple Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062271-3224 Old Hillsborough Road-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T1