{"job":{"id":20014183,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"RMO PC & Printer Modernization","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Expected Time On-site: 30-45 minutes visit can not exceed an hour without approval from <del>****** *******</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>If any delays are reported, they must be reported to the TDX helpdesk immediately to justify on-site time exceeding 45 minutes.</strong></p><p><strong>If issues arise, reach out to WU support <del>* ***** ********* </del>If the issues are not resolved after 15-20 minutes of working with support, please escalate the issues to <del>****** *******</del> at <del>***************</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>THE TECHNICIAN ASSIGNED TO THIS WORK ORDER MUST BE THE TECHNICIAN DISPATCHED TO SITE. NO EXCEPTIONS!</strong></p><p><strong>The technician must present a non-expired government issued photo ID upon arrival. If the technician is turned away for not having a valid ID, or the technician sent to site is not the technician assigned to this work order, they will be asked to leave site and will not be paid.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope:</u></strong></p><p>TDX Technician will follow the steps in the provided install guide to complete the modernization of the customers RMO PC &amp; Printer by removing legacy equipment and connecting a provided USB cable directly from the PC to the printer. Tech will pack old legacy equipment and leave it on site with the MOD.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;TDX Work Order Document (attached in documents section)</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;Install Guide (attached in documents section)</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;Non-expired government issued photo ID</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;Basic PC Tool Kit</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;Spare USB Cables</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Work Description:&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>• Check in with TDX help desk at 952-912-9222.</strong></p><p><strong>• Check in with the manager on duty</strong><