SB cable.**\n\n**• Follow the instructions in the install guide to complete the modernization process.**\n\n1. Completed end of day close, print the report, and take a photo of it and upload it\n2. Remove the legacy equipment\n3. Connect the new USB cable (USB A connector) to the PC and the other end of the new USB cable (USB B connector) to the printer.\n4. Set up the printer on PC per the instructions in the install guide\n5. Have the manager on duty complete a test transaction and take a photo of the test transaction\n6. Pack legacy equipment and leave it on site with the manager on duty\n\n**• If any technical assistance is needed, please contact Money Order support**\n\n**at** \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**• Take photos of installed equipment and legacy equipment packed.**\n\n**• Take an overview photo showing PC and Printer**\n\n**• Completed the TDX work order document with the manager's signature**\n\n**• Call TDX helpdesk to check out 952-912-9222.**\n\n**Technician is required to supply all tools and materials needed to complete the installation. If the technician does not have the skill set, tools, or materials needed, DO NOT accept the work order. If the technician arrives on site and is not prepared, they will be asked to leave site and will not be paid.**\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n**• Photo of the outside of the store upon arrival**\n\n• **Photo of the end-of-day close**\n\n**• Photos of installed equipment**\n\n**• Photo of test transaction with correct date**\n\n**• Box with legacy equipment**\n\n**• These are all required to be submitted before checking out of the work order**\n\n**Signed TDX work order and deliverables are required to be uploaded before leaving the site! Any delay in uploading the deliverables will result in a penalty of 10%.**\n\n  \n  \nSupport 1-888-810-8121","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T16:00","end":"2026-10-28T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":60},"payType":"fixed","pay