{"job":{"id":20159396,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Tech to address the issue of the Down AP at RM 405 (HLT-RDUCY-36-405-AP050).  Tech to Check/Test the Cables of below APs as its getting error.. (Ethernet uplink speed degraded) might related to a cable issue (working on bouncing the port already... )","description":{"html":"<p>AN EXPERIENCED TECHNICIAN SHOULD BE ABLE TO COMPLETE THIS WORK IN THE MAX HOURS SET ON THE WORK ORDER</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Additional time <strong><u>must be approved</u></strong> before the initial time expires by calling <strong>Allbridge Dispatch at 1-516-394-4648</strong>. Failure to obtain approval will result in denial of additional time.</li>\n<li>All travel needs to be pre-approved <strong><u>before assignment.</u></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Additional Site Instructions</u></strong></p>\n<p>Tech to address the issue of the Down AP at RM 405 (HLT-RDUCY-36-405-AP050).</p>\n<p>Tech to Check/Test the Cables of below APs as its getting error.. (Ethernet uplink speed degraded) might related to a cable issue (working on bouncing the port already... )</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Alerting APs:</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-315-AP041</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-318-AP042</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-403-AP048</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-416-AP055</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-500-AP060</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-609-AP080</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-613-AP082</p>\n<p>HLT-RDUCY-36-617-AP084</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>POC: Noah Latta</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Required skillsets:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Router/switch/firewall configuration &amp; troubleshooting</li>\n<li>Wireless AP installs and testing (heat mapping experience is a plus)</li>\n<li>Knowledge of TCP/IP, VLANs, DHCP, DNS</li>\n<li>Ability to work with ticketing systems &amp; follow case documentation processes</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope:</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pre-site</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Print out the attached Allbridge work order and bring to sit