formed****.****Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.***\n\n*2.* **Part Information**:\n\n**Unused Parts**: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Used Parts**: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Missing Return Label**: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.\n\n**General Rules**: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T07:00","end":"2026-10-14T08:45","latestStart":"2026-10-14T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":80},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.75,"distance":7.123661930662892},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Incident #269224 - ALARM CUTOVER CUTOVER - ANALOG SKILLS REQUIRED (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z