{"job":{"id":20159916,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"8x8 Survey Request for KinderCare Center 300957 - Goldsboro","description":{"html":"<p>***NOTE: THIS WORK ORDER REQUIRES BACKGROUND CHECK AND DRUG TEST IN PAST 12 MONTHS***</p><p><br></p><p>We are providing customer with a telecom / network and facility survey to replace existing set up and install new 8x8 telecom system.</p><p><strong><u>PRE-VISIT WORK:</u></strong></p><ol><li>DOWNLOAD SURVEY AND 8X8 UTILITY INSTRUCTIONS</li></ol><p>\t\t<span style=\"color: black;\">8x8 Survey Key: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***************</del></span></p><p>\t\t<span style=\"color: black;\">Company Code: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>**********</del></span></p><p><strong><u>SCOPE OF WORK:</u></strong></p><ul><li>8x8 Survey</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tech should perform 8x8 survey steps outlined in our standard 8x8 survey scope of work.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tech must run the 8x8 Network Utility Test using ethernet connected to port 10 on the Meraki Switch</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Once the test is complete, the tech should email the results to <del>*************************</del><del>*</del></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tech must reach out to me, or a member of my team, with the network test details.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Network Utility Test Information</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Voice VLAN port: 10</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">8x8 Survey Key: <del>***************</del></span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Company Code: <del>**********</del></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Equipment by the Tech:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Laptop w/ ethernet adapter and ethernet cable (MUST HAVE)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">with access to Chrome &amp; LogMeIn application</li><li>Ladder (6-10ft)</li><li>Basic telephony tools (punch down, cable toner, butt-set line tester etc.)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>When you arrive:</u></strong></p><ol><li>CALL/TEXT WO MANAGER UPON ARRIVAL</li><li>INTRODUCE YOURSELF TO ONSITE MANAGER EXPLAINING WHY YOU ARE THERE</li><li>LOCATE NETWORK EQUIPMENT</li><li>CALL<del> </del><span style=\"color: black;\"><del>***** ***** ************</del></span><del> </del>BEFORE STARTING *If Larry is not available, try the Telecom Team</li><li>FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS TO DOWNLOAD UTILITY TOOL</li><li><strong>SURVEY - PHONES</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">CURRENT MAKE/MODEL OF EXISTING PHONE SYSTEM</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">TELEPHONE LINES</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">FAX LINES</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">NOTE EACH PHONE MODEL AND TYPE</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">DESK</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">CORDLESS</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">NOTE ANY NON WORKING PHONES</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">ANY DEDICATED PHONE NUMBERS</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">CHECK SCANNER DEVICE MAKE / MODEL</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">CREDIT CARD MACHINE MAKE / MODEL</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">UPLOAD PICTURES</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">TELEPHONE SYSTEM</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">ONE - DESK PHONE</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">ONE - CORDLESS PHONE</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">CHECK SCANNER</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">CREDIT CARD MACHINE</li><li><strong>SURVEY - NETWORK</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">WIRING CLOSET</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">MARK UP SITE MAP WITH CABLE DROP LOCATIONS (use fire escape plan as site map - if not one available)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">PHONE LOCATIONS AND TYPE OF CONNECTION/PORT</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">AVAILABLE SWITCH PORTS AND PORT NUMBERS</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">UPLOAD PICTURES -</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">NETWORK AREA</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">UPCLOSE OF SWITCH</li><li><strong>SURVEY - FACILITY</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">CEILING TYPE</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">DISTANCE FROM NETWORK EQUIPMENT TO DIRECTOR'S OFFICE</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">NUMBER OF CLASSROOMS</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">TYPE OF DOOR PHONE/BUZZER/PAGING EQUIPMENT</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">IS THERE AN ADDITIONAL OFFICE</li><li>COMPLETE SURVEY - UPLOAD TO WORK ORDER</li><li>CHECK OUT WITH TELECOM TEAM</li><li>CALL / TEXT WO MANAGER BEFORE LEAVING SITE</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Escalation Process:</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Please call work order manager for any questions or issues while onsite</span></p><p><strong><u>Dress Code:</u></strong></p><p>Polo, Non-ripped Jeans, Closed toe shoes&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><u>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy:</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Time onsite above estimate must be approved by work order manager BEFORE the time has lapsed</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Travel expense must be approved PRIOR to accepting job</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Material reimbursement will be approved at the cost below</span></li><li>Failure to CORRECTLY complete the tasks listed in the work order - and/or leaving site without contacting WO Manager - will result in a minimum 25% deduction of payment.&nbsp;</li></ul>","markdown":"\\*\\*\\*NOTE: THIS WORK ORDER REQUIRES BACKGROUND CHECK AND DRUG TEST IN PAST 12 MONTHS\\*\\*\\*\n\nWe are providing customer with a telecom / network and facility survey to replace existing set up and install new 8x8 telecom system.\n\n**PRE-VISIT WORK:**\n\n1. DOWNLOAD SURVEY AND 8X8 UTILITY INSTRUCTIONS\n\n 8x8 Survey Key: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n Company Code: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\n- 8x8 Survey\n- Tech should perform 8x8 survey steps outlined in our standard 8x8 survey scope of work.\n- Tech must run the 8x8 Network Utility Test using ethernet connected to port 10 on the Meraki Switch\n- Once the test is complete, the tech should email the results to \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Tech must reach out to me, or a member of my team, with the network test details.\n\nNetwork Utility Test Information\n\nVoice VLAN port: 10\n\n8x8 Survey Key: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nCompany Code: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Required Equipment by the Tech:**\n\n- Laptop w/ ethernet adapter and ethernet cable (MUST HAVE)\n- with access to Chrome & LogMeIn application\n- Ladder (6-10ft)\n- Basic telephony tools (punch down, cable toner, butt-set line tester etc.)\n\n**When you arrive:**\n\n1. CALL/TEXT WO MANAGER UPON ARRIVAL\n2. INTRODUCE YOURSELF TO ONSITE MANAGER EXPLAINING WHY YOU ARE THERE\n3. LOCATE NETWORK EQUIPMENT\n4. CALL \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* BEFORE STARTING \\*If Larry is not available, try the Telecom Team\n5. FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS TO DOWNLOAD UTILITY TOOL\n6. **SURVEY - PHONES**\n7. CURRENT MAKE/MODEL OF EXISTING PHONE SYSTEM\n8. TELEPHONE LINES\n9. FAX LINES\n10. NOTE EACH PHONE MODEL AND TYPE\n11. DESK\n12. CORDLESS\n13. NOTE ANY NON WORKING PHONES\n14. ANY DEDICATED PHONE NUMBERS\n15. CHECK SCANNER DEVICE MAKE / MODEL\n16. CREDIT CARD MACHINE MAKE / MODEL\n17. UPLOAD PICTURES\n18. TELEPHONE SYSTEM\n19. ONE - DESK PHONE\n20. ONE - CORDLESS PHONE\n21. CHECK SCANNER\n22. CREDIT CARD MACHINE\n23. **SURVEY - NETWORK**\n24. WIRING CLOSET\n25. MARK UP SITE MAP WITH CABLE DROP LOCATIONS (use fire escape plan as site map - if not one available)\n26. PHONE LOCATIONS AND TYPE OF CONNECTION/PORT\n27. AVAILABLE SWITCH PORTS AND PORT NUMBERS\n28. UPLOAD PICTURES -\n29. NETWORK AREA\n30. UPCLOSE OF SWITCH\n31. **SURVEY - FACILITY**\n32. CEILING TYPE\n33. DISTANCE FROM NETWORK EQUIPMENT TO DIRECTOR'S OFFICE\n34. NUMBER OF CLASSROOMS\n35. TYPE OF DOOR PHONE/BUZZER/PAGING EQUIPMENT\n36. IS THERE AN ADDITIONAL OFFICE\n37. COMPLETE SURVEY - UPLOAD TO WORK ORDER\n38. CHECK OUT WITH TELECOM TEAM\n39. CALL / TEXT WO MANAGER BEFORE LEAVING SITE\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\nPlease call work order manager for any questions or issues while onsite\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\nPolo, Non-ripped Jeans, Closed toe shoes\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy:**\n\n- Time onsite above estimate must be approved by work order manager BEFORE the time has lapsed\n- Travel expense must be approved PRIOR to accepting job\n- Material reimbursement will be approved at the cost below\n- Failure to CORRECTLY complete the tasks listed in the work order - and/or leaving site without contacting WO Manager - will result in a minimum 25% deduction of payment.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T11:00","end":"2026-10-14T19:00","latestStart":"2026-10-14T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":400},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":6,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":45.89681210521666},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Oct 14, 11:00 AM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 14, Thu, Oct 15, Fri, Oct 16 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-12T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-18T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Durham RTP"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Incident #269224 - ALARM CUTOVER CUTOVER - ANALOG SKILLS REQUIRED (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 06062266-609 Ray Street-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-06T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Camera Install + Cable Run - Durham, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.