{"job":{"id":20160150,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"chargeFUZE Station Installation","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in Kiosk Installations</li><li>Tech is required to install 2x F10 and 1x F25chargeFUZE stations</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1-2 Hours</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tools Required:&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><em>﻿</em><strong>USB Mouse</strong> [ Cordless or Corded ], Basic PC Toolkit</li><li><strong>MUST BE&nbsp;</strong>able to&nbsp;<strong>lift a minimum of 70 pounds</strong></li><li><strong>Keyboard</strong></li><li><strong>Dolly</strong></li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ol><li>Be familiar with the product &amp; company, visit chargefuze.com</li></ol><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order</li><li>Contact POC for location of delivery and where the stations will be installed</li><li>Assemble unit per guide. ( You will be <strong>assembling unit only</strong>, Unit is pre configured)</li><li>Make sure the station/s are not exposed to direct sunlight, rain, storms, or any adverse weather conditions.</li><li>Message Remote Support 442) 276-5980, provide IMEI of Station</li><li>Support will request confirmation for screen status and connectivity.</li><li>Once given OK, take required photos and submit the Installation Completion Form after installing each station.</li><li>Clean up work area</li><li>Return Keys to POC</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Submit photos once connection is confirmed</li><li>Once task is complete, check out is mandatory before you leave the site.&nbsp;</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Escalation Process:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Contact WO Manager at&nbsp;</span>442) 276-5980</p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order</li><li>Any issues or questions</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Parking expenses will be paid only if a receipt is submitted in the Field Nation App.</li><li>All Additional Hours need to be approved by WO manager before submission</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Terms and Conditions</strong></p><ul><li>The person who accepts the work order needs to be the one on-site, if this is not the case, s/he will be turned away WITHOUT PAY, your work order will then be closed and you will be reported to the FieldNation. Again, person on-site needs to be the person accepting the work order, unless approved by ChargeFuze. You will be turned away and the work order will NOT BE PAID.</li><li>If you arrive late, you'll get docked $15 as penalty fee. We're not gonna be paying you for the time that you missed. The time that you worked minus $15 for being late on-site.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Kiosk Installations\n- Tech is required to install 2x F10 and 1x F25chargeFUZE stations\n- Estimated duration will be 1-2 Hours\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- *﻿***USB Mouse** \\[ Cordless or Corded \\], Basic PC Toolkit\n- **MUST BE** able to **lift a minimum of 70 pounds**\n- **Keyboard**\n- **Dolly**\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Be familiar with the product & company, visit chargefuze.com\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order\n2. Contact POC for location of delivery and where the stations will be installed\n3. Assemble unit per guide. ( You will be **assembling unit only**, Unit is pre configured)\n4. Make sure the station/s are not exposed to direct sunlight, rain, storms, or any adverse weather conditions.\n5. Message Remote Support 442) 276-5980, provide IMEI of Station\n6. Support will request confirmation for screen status and connectivity.\n7. Once given OK, take required photos and submit the Installation Completion Form after installing each station.\n8. Clean up work area\n9. Return Keys to POC\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Submit photos once connection is confirmed\n2. Once task is complete, check out is mandatory before you leave the site.\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\nContact WO Manager at 442) 276-5980\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order\n- Any issues or questions\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Parking expenses will be paid only if a receipt is submitted in the Field Nation App.\n- All Additional Hours need to be approved by WO manager before submission\n\n**Terms and Conditions**\n\n- The person who accepts the work order needs to be the one on-site, if this is not the case, s/he will be turned away WITHOUT PAY, your work order will then be closed and you will be reported to the FieldNation. Again, person on-site needs to be the person accepting the work order, unless approved by ChargeFuze. You will be turned away and the work order will NOT BE PAID.\n- If you arrive late, you'll get docked $15 as penalty fee. We're not gonna be paying you for the time that you missed. The time that you worked minus $15 for being late on-site.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T10:00","end":"2026-10-28T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":80},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":80,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":9.741271410011773},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $80 (countered: $80) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:0