{"job":{"id":20172776,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Owens & Minor Swap UPS Battery Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p>MUST call Stephen Collins Office: 919.910.7528 | Mobile: 704.964.4460</p><p>4200 Global Street</p><p>Raleigh, NC 27610</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">The error we are seeing on the unit is that the battery isn’t installed properly. We wanted to try and reseat the battery to see if that might clear that error possibly. Steven couldn’t get the battery to come out at all when he tried working with it, so we wanted a tech out to try and reseat it. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Remove Battery and put back in and see if this clears the error. </span></p><ul><li><strong>After accepting the work order there is no further negotiation regarding travel.&nbsp;All travel expenses must be negotiated and approved before accepting work order.&nbsp;This does not include tolls or parking.&nbsp;Those will be reimbursed with an uploaded receipt.</strong></li></ul>","markdown":"MUST call Stephen Collins Office: 919.910.7528 | Mobile: 704.964.4460\n\n4200 Global Street\n\nRaleigh, NC 27610\n\nThe error we are seeing on the unit is that the battery isn’t installed properly. We wanted to try and reseat the battery to see if that might clear that error possibly. Steven couldn’t get the battery to come out at all when he tried working with it, so we wanted a tech out to try and reseat it.\n\nRemove Battery and put back in and see if this clears the error.\n\n- **After accepting the work order there is no further negotiation regarding travel. All travel expenses must be negotiated and approved before accepting work order. This does not include tolls or parking. Those will be reimbursed with an uploaded receipt.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T09:00","end":"2026-10-16T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"