{"job":{"id":20172407,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"76787-BFS-Apex-SIM Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>DO NOT SHOW INTEREST IN THIS JOB UNTIL YOU HAVE READ THE SCOPE OF WORK AND UNDERSTAND THE SKILLS AND TOOL REQUIRED. THANK YOU!</p><p>This is a cat6 cable-based installation.</p><p>The following tools may be required on this project. If you do not have, or normally carry these tools, please do not request this job. We highly recommend two technicians for projects (a senior tech and entry level tech for wire runs) this is not mandatory but recommended. The price is fixed and based on thousands of similar installations.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Truck or Van</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cordless drill</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hammer Drill</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Assorted wood and concrete drill bits.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hand tools.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Crimpers BNC</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fish tape &amp; wall fish rods</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Small 10ft ladder &amp; 15ft extension ladder</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Windows Based Laptop</p><p>- IP Camera Professional Tester</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Installation Description</strong></p><p>Installation of cat6 CCTV camera system. Only installation skills needed. Backstreet Surveillance to provide all programming and setup. Install Backstreet provided camera(s), cable and NVR, including network connection to router or internet modem. Wire and cable included with equipment. Installer accepts the firm price to complete scope of work. Equipment is shipped on-site. If additional materials are required installer will give Backstreet the opportunity to provide or the installer will provide and charge Backstreet with Backstreet pre-approval.</p><p>Scope:</p><p>Replace the existing SIM with an active SIM in SIM1 and an inactive SIM in SIM2 and verify connectivity with our tech department. </p><p>By accepting the work, the installer agrees to work with Backstreet on any issues that may arise and agrees not to try and sell customer alternative equipment. All equipment changes should be communicated to a Backstreet representative and agreed upon ahead of any alteration of equipment.</p><p>Installer to provide images of each camera's installation and a signed \"Work completion\" sheet signed by the customer prior to payment. Payment will be made within 24 hours of submitting the completion document. The installation images ARE required for payment.</p>","markdown":"DO NOT SHOW INTEREST IN THIS JOB UNTIL YOU HAVE READ THE SCOPE OF WORK AND UNDERSTAND THE SKILLS AND TOOL REQUIRED. THANK YOU!\n\nThis is a cat6 cable-based installation.\n\nThe following tools may be required on this project. If you do not have, or normally carry these tools, please do not request this job. We highly recommend two technicians for projects (a senior tech and entry level tech for wire runs) this is not mandatory but recommended. The price is fixed and based on thousands of similar installations.\n\n· Truck or Van\n\n· Cordless drill\n\n· Hammer Drill\n\n· Assorted wood and concrete drill bits.\n\n· Hand tools.\n\n· Crimpers BNC\n\n· Fish tape & wall fish rods\n\n· Small 10ft ladder & 15ft extension ladder\n\n· Windows Based Laptop\n\n\\- IP Camera Professional Tester\n\n**Installation Description**\n\nInstallation of cat6 CCTV camera system. Only installation skills needed. Backstreet Surveillance to provide all programming and setup. Install Backstreet provided camera(s), cable and NVR, including network connection to router or internet modem. Wire and cable included with equipment. Installer accepts the firm price to complete scope of work. Equipment is shipped on-site. If additional materials are required installer will give Backstreet the opportunity to provide or the installer will provide and charge Backstreet with Backstreet pre-approval.\n\nScope:\n\nReplace the existing SIM with an active SIM in SIM1 and an inactive SIM in SIM2 and verify connectivity with our tech department.\n\nBy accepting the work, the installer agrees to work with Backstreet on any issues that may arise and agrees not to try and sell customer alternative equipment. All equipment changes should be communicated to a Backstreet representative and agreed upon ahead of any alteration of equipment.\n\nInstaller to provide images of each camera's installation and a signed \"Work completion\" sheet signed by the customer prior to payment. Payment will be made within 24 hours of submitting the completion document. The installation images ARE required for payment.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T10:00","end":"2026-10-23T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":130,"max":260},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":130},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":65}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":10.637965151636013},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2