{"job":{"id":20166977,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Data Center Cabling Tech, NOV/DEC - 21 Day Commitment","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Title:</strong> Data Center Deployment Technicians (2) – Durham, NC – Multi-Week Project - <strong>DO NOT APPLY if you cannot commit to the ENTIRE schedule as presented.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Project Overview:</strong></p>\n<p>We are seeking <strong>an experienced Data Center Deployment Technician</strong> to support a multi-phase infrastructure deployment project at a data center in Durham, NC. Technicians will work closely with the project team to assist with equipment installation, deployment activities, and related data center tasks.</p>\n<p><strong>Pre-Engagement Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Brief Zoom meeting with the project lead prior to project start</li>\n<li>No in-person interview required</li>\n<li>Strong data center experience preferred</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently and follow deployment instructions</li>\n<li>Professional communication and documentation skills</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Schedule</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Block 1 – November</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Week 1</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>November 3 – November 6</li>\n<li>Tuesday through Friday</li>\n<li>4 Working Days</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Week 2</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>November 9 – November 13</li>\n<li>Monday through Friday</li>\n<li>5 Working Days</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Week 3</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>November 16 – November 19</li>\n<li>Monday through Thursday</li>\n<li>4 Working Days</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Total Block 1 Duration:</strong> 13 Working Days</p>\n<p><strong>Block 2 – December</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tentative Schedule (Subject to Adjustment Based on November Progress)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>December 8 – December 11</li>\n<li>December 14 – December 17</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Expected schedule is Tuesday through Friday during the first week and Monday through Thursday during the second week. Exact dates may shift slightly depending on project progress.</p>\n<p><strong>Work Hours</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Target Schedule: <strong>9:00 AM – 6:00 PM</strong></li>\n<li>Minor schedule adjustments may be accommodated (example: 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM)</li>\n<li>Weekend work is not anticipated but may be requested if needed and mutually agreed upon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Required Skills</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Copper Jumper assembly</li>\n<li>Cabling and Cable Management</li>\n<li>Reading and Following Deployment Documentation</li>\n<li>Professional Communication</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Information</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Technicians must be reliable, punctual, and comfortable working in a live data center environment.</li>\n<li>December scheduling is expected to follow the outlined plan but may be adjusted based on progress achieved during the November deployment phase.</li>\n<li>Preference will be given to technicians with prior data center deployment experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Resources Needed:</strong> 2</p>\n<p><strong>Estimated Duration:</strong> Approximately 21 working days across two project phases.</p>\n<p><strong>Pay Hours:</strong> Includes all possible hours for project. December dates are subject to change based on November progress.</p>","markdown":"**Title:** Data Center Deployment Technicians (2) – Durham, NC – Multi-Week Project - **DO NOT APPLY if you cannot commit to the ENTIRE schedule as presented.**\n\n**Project Overview:**\n\nWe are seeking **an experienced Data Center Deployment Technician** to support a multi-phase infrastructure deployment project at a data center in Durham, NC. Technicians will work closely with the project team to assist with equipment installation, deployment activities, and related data center tasks.\n\n**Pre-Engagement Requirements:**\n\n- Brief Zoom meeting with the project lead prior to project start\n- No in-person interview required\n- Strong data center experience preferred\n- Ability to work independently and follow deployment instructions\n- Professional communication and documentation skills\n\n**Schedule**\n\n**Block 1 – November**\n\n**Week 1**\n\n- November 3 – November 6\n- Tuesday through Friday\n- 4 Working Days\n\n**Week 2**\n\n- November 9 – November 13\n- Monday through Friday\n- 5 Working Days\n\n**Week 3**\n\n- November 16 – November 19\n- Monday through Thursday\n- 4 Working Days\n\n**Total Block 1 Duration:** 13 Working Days\n\n**Block 2 – December**\n\n**Tentative Schedule (Subject to Adjustment Based on November Progress)**\n\n- December 8 – December 11\n- December 14 – December 17\n\nExpected schedule is Tuesday through Friday during the first week and Monday through Thursday during the second week. Exact dates may shift slightly depending on project progress.\n\n**Work Hours**\n\n- Target Schedule: **9:00 AM – 6:00 PM**\n- Minor schedule adjustments may be accommodated (example: 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM)\n- Weekend work is not anticipated but may be requested if needed and mutually agreed upon\n\n**Required Skills**\n\n- Copper Jumper assembly\n- Cabling and Cable Management\n- Reading and Following Deployment Documentation\n- Professional Communication\n\n**Additional Information**\n\n- Technicians must be reliable, punctual, and comfortable working in a live data center environment.\n- December scheduling is expected to follow the outlined plan but may be adjusted based on progress achieved during the November deployment phase.\n- Preference will be given to technicians with prior data center deployment experience.\n\n**Resources Needed:** 2\n\n**Estimated Duration:** Approximately 21 working days across two project phases.\n\n**Pay Hours:** Includes all possible hours for project. December dates are subject to change based on November progress.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T09:00","end":"2026-12-17T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":10395},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":189,"distance":21.59829070909903},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Tue, Nov 3, 9:00 AM\nChecked: Tue, Nov 3, Wed, Nov 4, Thu, Nov 5, Fri, Nov 6 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736663 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736658 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-13T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736649 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-12T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"00736638 - ATT DC Decom"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792064897135}
