{"job":{"id":20168903,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Package Solutions - Troubleshooting (78343)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Pre-Site Requirements</u>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)</li>\n<li>Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)</li>\n<li>Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.</li>\n<li>Sign Technician NDA <strong>(</strong><strong><u>REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT</u></strong><strong>):</strong><del>**************************************</del></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Check-In</u>:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check-in with on-site staff.</li>\n<li>Check-in with our support at&nbsp;<strong><del>************</del></strong>&nbsp;to get codes and review scope.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Job Details</u>:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>CALL TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING ANY TROUBLESHOOTING ASSISTANCE!!!</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope</u>:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Type of Request:</strong></p>\n<p>Tech Only</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Reason for Visit:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Troubleshoot iPad</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Address:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;5501 Atlantic Springs Road Raleigh, NC 27616</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Special Tools Needed:</strong></p>\n<p>- Outlet Tester</p>\n<p>- Volt-Meter</p>\n<p>- Ethernet Tester</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Parts Needed:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Scope:</strong></p>\n<p>Troubleshooting the iPad:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Call Technical Support to unlock Single App Mode from the iPad.</li>\n<li>This will allow you to exit the Luxer One App.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Power:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Confirm if it is powered on</li>\n<li>Check battery levels.</li>\n<li>Ensure battery is sitting at 100%.</li>\n<li>Inspect charging cable and components.</li>\n<li>Reboot iPad if needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Internet:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check iPad wiring kit, reseat the every adapter if needed.</li>\n<li>Check if the iPad is on WiFi.</li>\n<li>Reboot iPad if needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Misc:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check for iOS update.</li>\n<li>Check camera adapter firmware version.</li>\n<li>Inspect screen and backing of the iPad for sign of wear.</li>\n<li>Perform a test delivery and pick up.</li>\n<li>Have Technical Support Re-enable Single App Mode.</li>\n<li>Ensure that the iPad is locked into the LuxerOne App.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Check-Out</u>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out with technical support&nbsp;<strong><del>**************</del></strong>&nbsp;to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional.</li>\n<li>Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support</u>:&nbsp;</strong><strong><del>************</del></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Resources:</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Troubleshooting iPad:</strong></p>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d2su7xnBho0&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=38</p>","markdown":"**Pre-Site Requirements:**\n\n- Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)\n- Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)\n- Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.\n- Sign Technician NDA **(****REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT****):**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Check-In:**\n\n- Check-in with on-site staff.\n- Check-in with our support at **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to get codes and review scope.\n\n**Job Details:**\n\n**CALL TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING ANY TROUBLESHOOTING ASSISTANCE!!!**\n\n**Scope:**\n\n**Type of Request:**\n\nTech Only\n\n**Reason for Visit:**\n\n- Troubleshoot iPad\n\n**Address:**\n\n 5501 Atlantic Springs Road Raleigh, NC 27616\n\n**Special Tools Needed:**\n\n\\- Outlet Tester\n\n\\- Volt-Meter\n\n\\- Ethernet Tester\n\n**Parts Needed:**\n\n**Scope:**\n\nTroubleshooting the iPad:\n\n- Call Technical Support to unlock Single App Mode from the iPad.\n- This will allow you to exit the Luxer One App.\n\n\\*Power:\n\n- Confirm if it is powered on\n- Check battery levels.\n- Ensure battery is sitting at 100%.\n- Inspect charging cable and components.\n- Reboot iPad if needed.\n\n\\*Internet:\n\n- Check iPad wiring kit, reseat the every adapter if needed.\n- Check if the iPad is on WiFi.\n- Reboot iPad if needed.\n\n\\*Misc:\n\n- Check for iOS update.\n- Check camera adapter firmware version.\n- Inspect screen and backing of the iPad for sign of wear.\n- Perform a test delivery and pick up.\n- Have Technical Support Re-enable Single App Mode.\n- Ensure that the iPad is locked into the LuxerOne App.\n\n**Check-Out:**\n\n- Check out with technical support **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional.\n- Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.\n\n**If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support:** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Resources:**\n\n**Troubleshooting iPad:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d2su7xnBho0&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=38>","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-14T10:00","end":"2026-10-14T12:00","latestStart":"2026-10-14T16:30"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":95},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":55},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborH