y List ] -</strong> Any site specific documentation will be attached to your work order prior to your visit.</li><li><strong>Confirm the start date and time. You will receive pre-calls at 24 hours and 2 hours prior to your ETA. If you do not answer or reply, you may lose the work as confirmation is a contractual obligation and a cancellation fee will not be granted.</strong></li><li><strong>Download Microsoft Teams and ensure that it works on your phone.&nbsp;</strong></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>On-Site Tasks:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Check In Requirements- Follow in order</strong></li><li><strong>CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER– </strong>Arrive onsite no earlier than 30 min. prior to start time. If you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ 855-612-2183 to check in.</li><li><strong>Site Access: </strong>Start at the back service door and knock, if you get no answer, then proceed to the front door and knock. If you still have no response, then reach out the Microsoft Teams Support Chat for instruction.</li><li><strong>CHECK IN with the Manager on duty (MOD) and introduce yourself as the Essintial Technician there to complete an install</strong></li><li><strong>Have the manager direct you to the recently received shipment.</strong></li><li><strong>Take Inventory</strong> - Once you have located the equipment, please utilize the provided sheet and begin the inventory process. Once you have completed the inventory, please use the Microsoft teams link to join the Essintial KFC support chat.</li><li><strong>CHECK IN via Microsoft Teams with the Essintial/KFC Support team - https://tinyurl.com/35kwddm9</strong></li><li><strong>Start the Installation - Refer to Provided Installation Guide &amp; any other technical documents for step by step instructions:</strong></li><li>Work with the manager on duty (MOD) to verify they have completed <strong>\"Start of Day</strong>\" on the back-office PC</li><li>Work with the Essintial support team to determine the <strong>predesignated mounting location - THIS could be on the Front Counter, on a kiosk TABLE or on a WALL.</strong></li><li>Once the mounting location has been decided, check to make sure that we have at least <strong>2 power outlets installed</strong>. We will also need<strong> 2 network drops per kiosk run</strong> the desired location [<strong> Ensure Power and LAN wall-outlets are available at proposed kiosk location.</strong></li><li><br></li><li><strong>Power should already be installed prior to your visit, if power is not available - </strong>we will need to reschedule to get power installed.</li><li><strong>In most cases data will NOT be installed - </strong>we will need to run the required network drops.</li><li>Once you have the data cables installed, we will need to get with the KFC Support Desk and complete the <strong>\"Network Switch Configurations\".</strong></li><li><strong>Complete</strong> the <strong>\"Kiosk Hardware Assembly\"</strong></li><li>Once assembled, place Kiosks in designated location and upload a picture to the Essintial/KFC support chat for final approval before permanently mounting.</li><li>Mount the kiosk, and complete all power and data connections.</li><li>Verify Kiosk Functionality</li><li>Work with Essintial and KFC to ensure the devices come online and connect to the network.</li><li>Mount or hang the included<strong>ORDER</strong> sign as described in the kiosk playbook.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required On-Site Deliverables / Closeout Requirements [ PRIOR to leaving the site ]</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Complete Essintial Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE):</strong></li><li>You will be asked to confirm site details</li><li>You will be asked to provide requested information and photos</li><li>You will be asked to obtain Manager's signature</li><li>Record the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverables. You will be required to provide this code at final close out</li><li><strong>CHECK OUT with the Essintial/KFC Support team via Microsoft Teams - https://tinyurl.com/35kwddm9</strong></li><li><strong>CHECK OUT OF YOUR WORK ORDER-If you are unable to do so, make sure that you call into Essintial Projects Team</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Escalation Process: Any issues or questions related to the scope of work should be escalated to the Essintial/KFC Support team via this link - https://tinyurl.com/35kwddm9</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Essintial KFC Support - Microsoft Teams Info:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Link: https://tinyurl.com/35kwddm9</strong></p><p><strong>Meeting ID: 277 936 211 298</strong></p><p><strong>Passcode: pqnBC5</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>KFC Support Desk -</strong> (800)435-7532 silent option 9</p><p>KFC SD Hours: 8 am - 3 pm Eastern Time.</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Dress Code: </strong>Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no jeans or holes, collared or button-down shirts (no t-shirts), slacks, and nice shoes.</p><p><strong>Physical Requirements: </strong>Must be able to bend, kneel, stand and lift, carry 50lbs repeatedly for extended periods of time. Activities such as climbing ladders, navigating through tight spaces and crawling on unfinished floor should all be expected as part of this work.</p><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy: </strong>All expenses such as tolls, parking, materials must be pre-approved and accompanied by a receipt. Reimbursements will not be increased to cover markups of any kind. Technicians must contact Essintial for any deviations from the scheduled service date or time. No payment will be granted for work performed prior to the scheduled start time</p><p><strong>Out of Scope: </strong>Time over the allotted hours onsite must be detailed as to why the tech went over. (Note: Any delay due to the technician's skill-set, errors, not following directions, etc. will not be honored or approved)</p><p>Acceptable Reasons:</p><ul><li><strong>Site/lane access delays</strong></li><li><strong>Missing equipment</strong></li><li><strong>Delays in accessing equipment</strong></li><li><strong>Troubleshooting</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>-^-^- <strong>Attachment &amp; Work Guide Links</strong></p><p>- Refreshed on 10/9/2026 4:10 PM by Adam -</p><p><br></p><p><strong>(1 of 3) KFC_Kiosk_Install_Guide_v3.1</strong></p><p>Link: https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003GyPt/3iF0l1fQesIjsJuSaGjfjcHn_dA5Yfb_c0jocDXNp7o</p><p><br></p><p><strong>(2 of 3) KFCC-Kiosk-Playbook_2026_updated 1</strong></p><p>Link: https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000005BvWL/_44jtAwSRvCBMvnXBka8ybD2TKzR6jq0uSY5z5LAyc8</p><p><br></p><p><strong>(3 of 3) KFC Kiosk Hardware Installation Guide V1.0</strong></p><p>Link: https</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Essintial Payment Clause</u>:</strong></p><p><strong>If payment negotiation occurs, please note who you spoke to. Name is required.</strong></p><p><strong>Required onsite and repair times are non-negotiable and must be met. By accepting this work order, you are accepting the parameters outlined within; if you’re not able to meet this criteria for&nbsp;any</strong>&nbsp;reason, you must CALL Essintial ASAP.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T06:45","end":"2026-10-15T14:45"},"payRange":{"min":51.40186916,"max":411.21495328},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":51.40186916,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":51.4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/15/2026, 6:45:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end"