{"job":{"id":"3959039987","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1132569.1 HP Need to confirm the model – Error 98.00.0","description":"Customer Reference:    --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- ABM FEDERAL<br><br>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---<br>Please provide ETA for service<br><br>Serial Number: mxbccl821kw Make: HP **NEED TO CONFIRM MODEL AND SN* SN isnt coming up in Hp warranty<br><br>* MUST SPEAK WITH THE USER TO SET AN APT. <br>Tech needs an appointment with the end user, no Voicemail.<br>Need to provide the name of the tech so the site can put him on the security list.<br><br>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.<br><br>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.<br>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)<br><br>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.<br><br>Initial notes: HP Need to confirm the model – Error 98.00.0<br><br>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.<br>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login <br>techlink user name and password are the call number 1132569<br><br>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**<br><br>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.<br><br>General Instructions for All Calls-<br>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.<br>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot be