{"job":{"id":"8926747406","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Flowater, Inc","title":"2x FloWater Refill Station Filter Change - 4655428","description":"<ul><li>Case Details: 2x12mo FC (Past due 05/26)</li><li>Refill Station(s) to service: R1710E-023109,R1710E-023111</li><li>Task Details:&nbsp;**2x12mo FC (Past due 05/26)**</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Up to 2 hour on site</p><p><br></p><p><strong>You must download and print FloWater Services Sign Off Sheet before arriving on site. POC name and signature required.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Filter Change checklist:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1)</strong> unplug unit and plug back in (this cycles the ozonator)</p><p><strong>2) </strong>change all filters (6 total)</p><p><strong>3) </strong>verify water is flowing into reserve tank (photo required)</p><p><strong>4)</strong> clean drain tank (photo required)</p><p><strong>5) </strong>clean catchment tray (photo required)</p><p><strong>6)</strong> clean inline filter located on back of unit (take before &amp; after photo)</p><p><strong>7) </strong>unplug unit and plug back in (listen again for ozonator to cycle)</p><p><strong>8)</strong> wipe down unit - we want to leave unit and work area cleaner than it was when you arrived (photo required)</p><p><strong>9) </strong>obtain name and signature of POC on site (photo required of Sign Off Sheet)</p><p><strong>10)</strong> dispose of used filters offsite</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required tools: </strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>1) </strong>Gloves (disposable)</p><p><strong>2)</strong> Bucket or container (1 gallon minimum, 5 gallon is ideal)</p><p><strong>3)</strong> Clean towels</p><p><strong>4)</strong> Screwdrivers (Phillips and flathead)</p><p><strong>5)</strong> Spray bottle (for cleaning outside surfaces of Refill Station)</p><p><br></p><p>This isn't a plumbing job. You'll be dealing with 1/4\" polyethylene tubing and quick connect fittings.</p><p><br></p><p>5 Business Day Warranty on labor - anything missed or done improperly that requires a return trip for rework</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T08:00","end":"2026-10-21T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":50.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736663 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736658 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-13T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736649 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-12T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-12T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"00736638 - ATT DC Decom"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792089444637}
