{"job":{"id":"3962227932","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"McKesson","title":"Swapping out/ Installing New Lynx PC Only (Device info in Description)","description":"<p>CIA: 1597320</p><p><br></p><p>===Replacement PCs:<strong> MXL6344X3L </strong>&amp;<strong> MXL6352WXS</strong>===</p><p>===Replacing:<strong> MXL31329CR </strong>&amp;<strong> MXL31329CJ</strong>===</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>By accepting this Work Order, you represent and warrant that you will follow all CDC Guidelines (</u></strong>https://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus/2019-ncov/symptoms-testing/symptoms.html<strong><u>) as well as any customer or practice site specific guidelines and requirements in performing the work under this Work Order.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em><u>Upon acceptance, it is required you contact the site contact to obtain verbal confirmation of appointment date/time</u></em></strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><em><u>﻿</u>If you do not call to check in and do not call to check out, we will not pay for the work done. </em></li></ul><p><br></p><p><em><u>﻿</u></em></p><p><em>Travel/Parking fees Not paid for Lynx consists of a Windows based PC running a web-based application and controlling USB-attached security devices such as a Security Cabinet and/or Remote Locking device. The current system onsite may either be an Asus slim profile PC or an HP Elite Desk. </em></p><ul><li><em>0) </em><strong><em>Please track arrival of parts prior to coming onsite. You can track via Fedex Tracking: </em></strong>878718716524&nbsp;<strong><em>. We do not pay for waiting.</em></strong><em>(If tracking indicates packages have not arrived, please contact Lynx Tech support for further instruction </em>at 888-338-8445 Opt 2<em>.) </em></li><li><em>1) Once arrived at site, call Lynx helpdesk to check in </em>at 888-338-8445 Opt 2<em>. </em><strong><em>When calling in, r</em>eference the work order's Interaction Number (page 2 of work order) </strong><em>along with city and state that it's in so that we can pull up the details from our system.</em></li><li><strong><em><u>Please show photo ID if asked by customer</u></em><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></li><li><strong><u>Business Attire Required</u></strong></li><li><strong><u>Professionalism Required</u></strong></li><li>2) Confirm location of the system to be swapped (it is possible the site has several other Lynx PC's installed, so double check with end user before proceeding).</li><li>3) Perform the PC swap. PC may be mounted behind the monitor.</li><li>4) Once the new PC is installed, turn it on to make sure it boots up properly and loads all the way to a blue Lynx Mobile sign on page. You can ask medical staff onsite to sign into the Lynx Mobile program to test full functionality of system.</li><li>5) Call our helpdesk so that we can verify and test with end-user. Once we confirm that everything is working fine and the end user is satisfied with installation, then this will be considered the final check out call.</li><li>6)<strong> DO NOT leave any old or unused parts/computer equipment at the practice. You are responsible to make sure that they are returned using the provided FedEx return label.</strong></li><li>7) Once old/unused parts are checked into FedEx, you can then submit your work order for review and approval.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Upload a few Pictures of work preformed</u></strong></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00","end":"2026-10-15T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":109.09090909},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":0},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start"