{"job":{"id":20181045,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Package Solutions - Troubleshooting (78343)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Pre-Site Requirements</u>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)</li>\n<li>Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)</li>\n<li>Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.</li>\n<li>Sign Technician NDA <strong>(</strong><strong><u>REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT</u></strong><strong>):</strong><del>**************************************</del></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Check-In</u>:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check-in with on-site staff.</li>\n<li>Check-in with our support at&nbsp;<strong><del>************</del></strong>&nbsp;to get codes and review scope.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>Job Details</u>:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>CALL TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING ANY TROUBLESHOOTING ASSISTANCE!!!</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope</u>:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Type of Request:</strong></p>\n<p>Tech Only</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Reason for Visit:</strong></p>\n<p>Troubleshoot inside ipad</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Property Details:</strong></p>\n<p>Album Summit Pines- 12644</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Address:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1000 Sweetbay Haven Lane Apex, North Carolina - NC 27523</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Business Hours:</strong></p>\n<p>9am - 6pm M-F</p>\n<p>10am on Weekends</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Point of Contact:</strong></p>\n<p>Britney or Eren</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Special Tools Needed:</strong></p>\n<p>- Outlet Tester</p>\n<p>- Volt-Meter</p>\n<p>- Ethernet Tester</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Parts Needed:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Scope:</strong></p>\n<p>Troubleshooting the iPad:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Call Technical Support to unlock Single App Mode from the iPad.</li>\n<li>This will allow you to exit the Luxer One App.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Power:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Confirm if it is powered on</li>\n<li>Check battery levels.</li>\n<li>Ensure battery is sitting at 100%.</li>\n<li>Inspect charging cable and components.</li>\n<li>Reboot iPad if needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Internet:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check iPad wiring kit, reseat the every adapter if needed.</li>\n<li>Check if the iPad is on WiFi.</li>\n<li>Reboot iPad if needed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>*Misc:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check for iOS update.</li>\n<li>Check camera adapter firmware version.</li>\n<li>Inspect screen and backing of the iPad for sign of wear.</li>\n<li>Perform a test delivery and pick up.</li>\n<li>Have Technical Support Re-enable Single App Mode.</li>\n<li>Ensure that the iPad is locked into the LuxerOne App.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Check-Out</u>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out with technical support&nbsp;<strong><del>**************</del></strong>&nbsp;to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional.</li>\n<li>Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support</u>:&nbsp;</strong><strong><del>************</del></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Resources:</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Troubleshooting iPad:</strong></p>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d2su7xnBho0&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=38</p>","markdown":"**Pre-Site Requirements:**\n\n- Please review Resource videos below and attached Client Documents for better understanding of system. (Note: Not all videos/documents may be necessary.)\n- Check tracking for parts ensuring that they've arrived before going on-site. (If no tracking provided below, call Luxer Support.)\n- Check shipping address for parts, if site does not have an office parts may be held by UPS Store.\n- Sign Technician NDA **(****REQUIRED TO RECIEVE PAYMENT****):**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Check-In:**\n\n- Check-in with on-site staff.\n- Check-in with our support at **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to get codes and review scope.\n\n**Job Details:**\n\n**CALL TECHNICAL SUPPORT REGARDING ANY TROUBLESHOOTING ASSISTANCE!!!**\n\n**Scope:**\n\n**Type of Request:**\n\nTech Only\n\n**Reason for Visit:**\n\nTroubleshoot inside ipad\n\n**Property Details:**\n\nAlbum Summit Pines- 12644\n\n**Address:**\n\n**1000 Sweetbay Haven Lane Apex, North Carolina - NC 27523**\n\n**Business Hours:**\n\n9am - 6pm M-F\n\n10am on Weekends\n\n**Point of Contact:**\n\nBritney or Eren\n\n**Special Tools Needed:**\n\n\\- Outlet Tester\n\n\\- Volt-Meter\n\n\\- Ethernet Tester\n\n**Parts Needed:**\n\n**Scope:**\n\nTroubleshooting the iPad:\n\n- Call Technical Support to unlock Single App Mode from the iPad.\n- This will allow you to exit the Luxer One App.\n\n\\*Power:\n\n- Confirm if it is powered on\n- Check battery levels.\n- Ensure battery is sitting at 100%.\n- Inspect charging cable and components.\n- Reboot iPad if needed.\n\n\\*Internet:\n\n- Check iPad wiring kit, reseat the every adapter if needed.\n- Check if the iPad is on WiFi.\n- Reboot iPad if needed.\n\n\\*Misc:\n\n- Check for iOS update.\n- Check camera adapter firmware version.\n- Inspect screen and backing of the iPad for sign of wear.\n- Perform a test delivery and pick up.\n- Have Technical Support Re-enable Single App Mode.\n- Ensure that the iPad is locked into the LuxerOne App.\n\n**Check-Out:**\n\n- Check out with technical support **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** to ensure the issue has been resolved and that system is functional.\n- Check out with the on-site staff demonstrating that the issue has been resolved.\n\n**If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with support:** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Resources:**\n\n**Troubleshooting iPad:**\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d2su7xnBho0&amp;list=PLd70puW1-kb2R6ZALYd5iYDnJ87idOudx&amp;index=38>","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T09:00","end":"2026-10-16T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-16T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":95},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":55},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":13.825818010055679},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $95 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736663 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736658 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-13T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736649 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792109186449}
{"job":{"id":20178330,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TDX Tech LLC","title":"Network Cutover of all IT Equipment - Assistant Tech (prepare for 8 hours and potential cabling)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>*Attention Technicians*</strong></p><p><strong>When requesting this ticket, all potential travel expenses need to be countered when requesting this work order﻿. This includes:</strong></p><p><strong>Travel Time | Parking Fees | Hotel | Gas | ETC.</strong></p><p><strong><u>Any additions for travel after the work is completed will not be accepted.</u></strong></p><p><strong>*ANY PARTS PURCHASED BY TECH ON-SITE WILL BE REIMBURSED AT THE PRICE SHOWN ON THE RECEIPT.*</strong></p><p><strong>*IF YOU USE YOUR PARTS, YOU ARE REQUIRED TO DISCLOSE THE PARTS ' PRICE BEFORE YOU DO THE WORK. FAILURE TO DISCLOSE PRICES WILL RESULT IN PARTS NOT BEING COVERED*</strong></p><p><strong>*TDX DOES NOT PAY FIELD NATION FEES ON PARTS*</strong></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">A 5-6 hour site visit to cut the network and all IT equipment from the legacy Pep Boys to the new Mavis Tire network and IT equipment.&nbsp;All Pep Boys equipment will be de-installed and packed for pick up.&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>Tool Requirements (Consumables Will Be Reimbursed):</strong></p><ul><li>Smart Phone with Charger or External Battery</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Basic PC Tool Kit</li><li>Basic Cabling Tool Kit</li><li>10 to 12 Foot Ladder (No Lift Available)</li><li>2000 Feet of Plenum Rated Cat 6 Cable</li><li>Cabling Materials</li></ul><p>----Keystone Jacks, SMBs, Biscuits, Etc...</p><ul><li>Cabling Support Materials</li></ul><p>----J Hooks, Arlington Loops, Etc...</p><ul><li>Cable Tester (Continuity or Analyzer - Certification Not Required)</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>Tape Measure</li><li>Tapcons for Mounting to Concrete</li><li>Drywall Anchors and Screws</li><li>Toggle Bolts</li><li>Velcro&nbsp;</li><li>Cable Ties</li><li>Spare Patch Cables</li><li>Phillips, Torque and Slotted Screwdrivers (Phillips #0, #1, #2 and straight blade 1/8 inch and 1/4 inch)</li><li>SDS Impact Drill and Standard Drill (Wood and Masonry Bits).&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>High Level Cutover Instructions:</strong></p><p><strong><em>For Detailed Step-by-Step Instructions Please Refer to the Current Deployment Runbook in the Client Documents Section</em></strong></p><ul><li>Check in with the TDX Tech help desk at (952) 777-3964</li></ul><p>----<strong><em>Throughout the installation, please report any major delays, issues, or concerns to TDX immediately as they arise</em></strong></p><ul><li>Check in with your assigned Mavis IT Deployment Specialist&nbsp;</li></ul><p>----This can be found under the Contacts section of the Field Nation Template</p><p>----You will work directly with your assigned Mavis IT Specialist to complete the installation</p><p>----Prior to leaving site, the following must be completed:</p><ul><li>Complete TDX Work Order Form</li><li>Upload All Pictures to TDX Work Order</li><li>Check Out with Mavis IT Specialist&nbsp;</li><li>Check Out with TDX Tech Help Desk</li></ul><p><strong>If the technician arrives on site and is not prepared, they will be asked to leave site and will not be paid.</strong></p><p><strong>Upon completion, the work order and pictures must be uploaded to the Field Nation immediately for TDX Review. </strong></p>","markdown":"**\\*Attention Technicians\\***\n\n**When requesting this ticket, all potential travel expenses need to be countered when requesting this work order﻿. This includes:**\n\n**Travel Time | Parking Fees | Hotel | Gas | ETC.**\n\n**Any additions for travel after the work is completed will not be accepted.**\n\n**\\*ANY PARTS PURCHASED BY TECH ON-SITE WILL BE REIMBURSED AT THE PRICE SHOWN ON THE RECEIPT.\\***\n\n**\\*IF YOU USE YOUR PARTS, YOU ARE REQUIRED TO DISCLOSE THE PARTS ' PRICE BEFORE YOU DO THE WORK. FAILURE TO DISCLOSE PRICES WILL RESULT IN PARTS NOT BEING COVERED\\***\n\n**\\*TDX DOES NOT PAY FIELD NATION FEES ON PARTS\\***\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nA 5-6 hour site visit to cut the network and all IT equipment from the legacy Pep Boys to the new Mavis Tire network and IT equipment. All Pep Boys equipment will be de-installed and packed for pick up.\n\n**Tool Requirements (Consumables Will Be Reimbursed):**\n\n- Smart Phone with Charger or External Battery\n- Laptop\n- Basic PC Tool Kit\n- Basic Cabling Tool Kit\n- 10 to 12 Foot Ladder (No Lift Available)\n- 2000 Feet of Plenum Rated Cat 6 Cable\n- Cabling Materials\n\n\\----Keystone Jacks, SMBs, Biscuits, Etc...\n\n- Cabling Support Materials\n\n\\----J Hooks, Arlington Loops, Etc...\n\n- Cable Tester (Continuity or Analyzer - Certification Not Required)\n- Label Maker\n- Tape Measure\n- Tapcons for Mounting to Concrete\n- Drywall Anchors and Screws\n- Toggle Bolts\n- Velcro\n- Cable Ties\n- Spare Patch Cables\n- Phillips, Torque and Slotted Screwdrivers (Phillips #0, #1, #2 and straight blade 1/8 inch and 1/4 inch)\n- SDS Impact Drill and Standard Drill (Wood and Masonry Bits).\n\n**High Level Cutover Instructions:**\n\n***For Detailed Step-by-Step Instructions Please Refer to the Current Deployment Runbook in the Client Documents Section***\n\n- Check in with the TDX Tech help desk at (952) 777-3964\n\n\\----***Throughout the installation, please report any major delays, issues, or concerns to TDX immediately as they arise***\n\n- Check in with your assigned Mavis IT Deployment Specialist\n\n\\----This can be found under the Contacts section of the Field Nation Template\n\n\\----You will work directly with your assigned Mavis IT Specialist to complete the installation\n\n\\----Prior to leaving site, the following must be completed:\n\n- Complete TDX Work Order Form\n- Upload All Pictures to TDX Work Order\n- Check Out with Mavis IT Specialist\n- Check Out with TDX Tech Help Desk\n\n**If the technician arrives on site and is not prepared, they will be asked to leave site and will not be paid.**\n\n**Upon completion, the work order and pictures must be uploaded to the Field Nation immediately for TDX Review.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00","end":"2026-10-26T21:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":330},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":11.82424602891827},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $330 (countered: $360) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736663 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-14T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736658 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-13T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-13T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00