{"job":{"id":20182253,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Switch 93280swFitnessOffice2 is down need to check and bring the switch up.","description":{"html":"<p>Tech needs to be on Friday Oct 16th 2026 by 12:00 PM without miss followed by LT.</p><p><br></p><p>Switch 93280swFitnessOffice2 is down need to check and bring the switch up.</p><p><br></p><p>|| INC0347852&nbsp;|| Switch 93280swFitnessOffice2 is down&nbsp;|| 93280 Brier Creek Country Club | ||</p><p><br></p><p>Club Contact :</p><p>&nbsp;Liz Miller,-&nbsp;&nbsp;o: 919-206-4600&nbsp;m: 919-649-5721&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;e - Liz.Miller@invitedclubs.com&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Address : 9400 Club Hill Drive Raleigh, NC - North Carolina, 27617, USA</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>======================================================================================================================</p><p><br></p><p>Tech needs to do : Tech need to check the switch if power cable is faulty replace the power cable if cable is faulty replace the cable and&nbsp;</p><p>bring the switch up.</p><p><br></p><p>2) Reboot manually.</p><p>3) Change the cables both end.</p><p>4) 100 meters cable is mandatory.</p><p>So preplan to come with cables.***</p><p><br></p><p>Important Notes :</p><p>&lt;&lt;&lt; If required to change cable , please pre-plan to come &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p>&lt;&lt;&lt; Must needed laptop, console cable and internet &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p>&nbsp;&lt;&lt;&lt; Must carry power injector or AC power Adaptor to check Access Points &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;Important Notes :</p><p><br></p><p>&lt;&lt;&lt; If required to change cable , please pre-plan to come &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p><br></p><p>&lt;&lt;&lt; Must needed laptop, console cable and internet &gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p><br></p><p>======================================================================================================================</p><p><br></p><p>Important Notes :</p><p><br></p><p>Tech must bring LAPTOP, working console cable, hotspot (internet).</p><p><br></p><p>The following software must be installed on tech PC : Microsoft team is must with application installed and should</p><p>be able to provide control access to us, Putty (for SSH), webex, team viewer.</p><p><br></p><p>Tech must aware how to change IP on his machine, for troubleshooting purposes we need to change IPs on tech laptop.</p><p><br></p><p>if tech is using any third party cable to console into Network equipment, make sure he has uptodate software in it</p><p><br></p><p>======================================================================================================================</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Required Equipment: Laptop and Console Cable and and internet.</p><p><br></p><p>Technician should have Microsoft Teams, Webex, Team Viewer - installed on laptop prior to arrival</p><p><br></p><p>Upon arrival and prior to departure technician MUST contact ClubCorp Network Contact provided.</p><p><br></p><p>Departure without contact will result in non-payment.</p><p><br></p><p>If unable to reach Network Contact or one has not been provided please reach out to IT Service Desk: 972-888-7777</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>*Out of scope work must be approved by Comm-Works</p><p><br></p><p>*Reschedules must be scheduled via Comm-Works - Refer client to Comm-Works.</p><p><br></p><p>======================================================================================================================</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Tech need to perform &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;</p><p><br></p><p>Testing the cable , replace the cable and Wall jack if required, Console in to switch,</p><p><br></p><p>Technician need to cable run from switch to user Location in Long distance and check port.</p><p><br></p><p>if require need to replace the wiring.</p><p><br></p><p>Tech should bring Laptop with Ethernet Port supported.</p><p><br></p><p>Internet with Hotspot</p><p><b