orking console cable, hotspot (internet).\n\nThe following software must be installed on tech PC : Microsoft team is must with application installed and should\n\nbe able to provide control access to us, Putty (for SSH), webex, team viewer.\n\nTech must aware how to change IP on his machine, for troubleshooting purposes we need to change IPs on tech laptop.\n\nif tech is using any third party cable to console into Network equipment, make sure he has uptodate software in it\n\n======================================================================================================================\n\nRequired Equipment: Laptop and Console Cable and and internet.\n\nTechnician should have Microsoft Teams, Webex, Team Viewer - installed on laptop prior to arrival\n\nUpon arrival and prior to departure technician MUST contact ClubCorp Network Contact provided.\n\nDeparture without contact will result in non-payment.\n\nIf unable to reach Network Contact or one has not been provided please reach out to IT Service Desk: 972-888-7777\n\n\\*Out of scope work must be approved by Comm-Works\n\n\\*Reschedules must be scheduled via Comm-Works - Refer client to Comm-Works.\n\n======================================================================================================================\n\nTech need to perform >>>>>>>>\n\nTesting the cable , replace the cable and Wall jack if required, Console in to switch,\n\nTechnician need to cable run from switch to user Location in Long distance and check port.\n\nif require need to replace the wiring.\n\nTech should bring Laptop with Ethernet Port supported.\n\nInternet with Hotspot\n\nCisco Console cable\n\nWall/Data Points\n\nEthernet cables\n\nCable tester\n\n=======================================================================================================================\n\nNetwork Contact Phone:- 972325-9768\n\nRaghavendra.Katti@invitedclubs.com\n\ndl-it-networkdata@invitedclubs.com\n\n==========================================