{"job":{"id":"1956631614","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"DaVita # 03034-1C Broadband Cutover - acct #03264414","description":"Davita Broadband Upgrade &amp; Turnup<br><br>BrightSpeed Circuit ID: 0004290378<br>\"IP 208.160.12.209 - 208.160.12.213<br>GW 208.160.12.214<br>DNS1 68.94.156.1<br>DNS2: 68.94.157.1 <br>Subnet :255.255.255.248MAC :88:DA:36:6E:32:1E\"<br><br>Granite Activations 877-855-1146 option 2 if any issues with running speed test on circuit<br><br>Locate network equipment in Davita network room where the new Granite broadband circuit is located.<br>Locate the new Granite broadband circuit. Verify the physical connection and ensure it is powered on and appears to be in a ready state (e.g., status lights indicate connectivity).<br>Connect laptop directly to the new circuit (e.g., to the LAN port on the modem/ONT) using an Ethernet cable.<br>Configure your laptop's network adapter with the provided static IP address, subnet mask, gateway, and DNS servers, or verify DHCP is enabled and obtaining an IP address if configured that way.<br>Perform Connectivity Tests and run speed test -verify actual bandwidth (upload and download speeds)<br>If the new circuit is found to be working and stable: Call the client's IT, DaVita/Netfield line  at 888-331-3931, Option 1) to initiate the official turn-up process and obtain confirmation of activation.<br>Document the activation confirmation and the name/ID of the DaVita/Netfield representative.<br>If the new circuit is not found or not working/stable after basic troubleshooting (no power, Ethernet port inactive, IP configuration issues, unable to pass tests, missing/incorrect equipment). Do NOT proceed with calling Davita/Netfield but please contact Granite Project Manager Kaitlyn Horgan at 781-718-5837 for further instruction.<br>Document Existing Equipment (Decommissioning):<br>Identify any old client circuit equipment (modem, router, etc.) that is to be decommissioned [Davita/Netfield line will advise instructions on disposal and/or return shipment)<br>Take photos of completed work &amp; obtain sign out sheet signature from customer prior to leaving site","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T10:00","end":"2026-10-19T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":54.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":85,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T14:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-15T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736663 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-14T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1