{"job":{"id":20178324,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Network Cutover of all IT Equipment - Assistant Tech (prepare for 8 hours and potential cabling)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>*Attention Technicians*</strong></p><p><strong>When requesting this ticket, all potential travel expenses need to be countered when requesting this work order﻿. This includes:</strong></p><p><strong>Travel Time | Parking Fees | Hotel | Gas | ETC.</strong></p><p><strong><u>Any additions for travel after the work is completed will not be accepted.</u></strong></p><p><strong>*ANY PARTS PURCHASED BY TECH ON-SITE WILL BE REIMBURSED AT THE PRICE SHOWN ON THE RECEIPT.*</strong></p><p><strong>*IF YOU USE YOUR PARTS, YOU ARE REQUIRED TO DISCLOSE THE PARTS ' PRICE BEFORE YOU DO THE WORK. FAILURE TO DISCLOSE PRICES WILL RESULT IN PARTS NOT BEING COVERED*</strong></p><p><strong>*TDX DOES NOT PAY FIELD NATION FEES ON PARTS*</strong></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">A 5-6 hour site visit to cut the network and all IT equipment from the legacy Pep Boys to the new Mavis Tire network and IT equipment.&nbsp;All Pep Boys equipment will be de-installed and packed for pick up.&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>Tool Requirements (Consumables Will Be Reimbursed):</strong></p><ul><li>Smart Phone with Charger or External Battery</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Basic PC Tool Kit</li><li>Basic Cabling Tool Kit</li><li>10 to 12 Foot Ladder (No Lift Available)</li><li>2000 Feet of Plenum Rated Cat 6 Cable</li><li>Cabling Materials</li></ul><p>----Keystone Jacks, SMBs, Biscuits, Etc...</p><ul><li>Cabling Support Materials</li></ul><p>----J Hooks, Arlington Loops, Etc...</p><ul><li>Cable Tester (Continuity or Analyzer - Certification Not Required)</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>Tape Measure</li><li>Tapcons for Mounting to Concrete</li><li>Drywall Anchors and Screws</li><li>Toggle Bolts</li><li>Velcro&nbsp;</li><li>Cable Ties</li><li>Spare Patch Cables