and is not prepared, they will be asked to leave site and will not be paid.**\n\n**Upon completion, the work order and pictures must be uploaded to the Field Nation immediately for TDX Review.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T09:30","end":"2026-10-27T15:30"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":330},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":4.897879930990613},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $330 (countered: $360) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Signature Aviation - Install - GSO 1060 PTI Drive, Greensboro, NC 27409 (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Angier Police Department Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"s