{"job":{"id":20193265,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Support on Medical Device","description":{"html":"<p>Table install, diagnostic and computer equipment transfer / assembly and testing</p><p><br></p><p>________________________________________________________________________</p><p><em>Provider will perform the installation in accordance to the installation manual provided. Any requested or non-requested deviation from the installation manual, regardless of the requestor or situation, must be escalated to the Buyer for approval prior to performing any action. Any deviation that is not approved by the Buyer and is still performed by the Provider will be considered “out of scope” and the time spent performing said deviation will not be compensated.</em></p><p><em>Provider represents that he or she has his or her own business, which performs similar work to that requested by Buyer for other companies.</em></p><p><em>Provider shall have his own or her own entity, e.g. LLC, which employs the Provider and contracts the Provider out to other businesses.</em></p><p><em>To be considered for the assignment, the Provider should have the following qualifications:</em></p><ul><li><em>Product knowledge is required. If needed, on-line product training will be provided.</em></li><li><em>Provider must be experienced with the basic functions of a desktop computer and network. CompTIA A+ and/or Network+ (or similar) would be preferred.</em></li><li><em>Common computer and network maintenance tools will likely be needed, including but not limited to common hand tools (i.e. screwdrivers, pliers), Torx drivers, Hex keys and ESD protection (mat, wrist strap).</em></li><li><em>A valid driver’s license, auto insurance and access to reliable transportation.</em></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em> </em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>The work may involve:</em></strong></p><ul><li><em>Bending, stooping and crawling, 