{"job":{"id":20192933,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"America Bitcoin","title":"Breakfix-Kiosk","description":{"html":"<p>Upon arrival, assess whether the machine’s connectivity problem is due to network, software, or hardware failure. Check power supply, network connections, and run any provided diagnostic tools. Verify that the ATM's software is up-to-date, including any wallet or transaction handling services. If the issue appears network-related, ensure the machine’s network settings align with the provider’s requirements. If hardware issues are detected, troubleshoot or replace faulty components like routers or internal controllers. Log all findings and actions taken, and report any unresolved issues to the support team for further guidance.</p>","markdown":"Upon arrival, assess whether the machine’s connectivity problem is due to network, software, or hardware failure. Check power supply, network connections, and run any provided diagnostic tools. Verify that the ATM's software is up-to-date, including any wallet or transaction handling services. If the issue appears network-related, ensure the machine’s network settings align with the provider’s requirements. If hardware issues are detected, troubleshoot or replace faulty components like routers or internal controllers. Log all findings and actions taken, and report any unresolved issues to the support team for further guidance.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T10:30","end":"2026-10-20T11:30","latestStart":"2026-10-20T17:30"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":20.088417970520155},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"202