{"job":{"id":20201010,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Package Solutions Inc","title":"Package Room - Replace Rack 3 USB Hub and LED Power Supply - Remote Support - EST 1 Hr","description":{"html":"<strong>Overview</strong><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>This work takes place inside the HelloPackage package room at Candour House. Zendesk Ticket #591360.</p><p><br></p><p>Background: During onsite troubleshooting under previous ticket 589581, the room was restored online with all four racks operational. Two components on Rack 3 were identified for replacement.</p><p><br></p><p>Scope of work (preventative replacement):</p><p>1. Replace the existing USB hub on Rack 3 with the current-model USB hub. The existing hub is currently functioning but is an older model. This hub is what the zones connect to.</p><p>2. Replace the LED power supply on Rack 3.</p><p><br></p><p>After installation, verify the Raspberry Pi remains online and communicating properly, confirm all LED modules/zones are functioning, and perform a final operational test of Rack 3.</p><p><br></p><p>A technician is needed on-site to work with HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to locate the correct components, perform the replacements, and verify operation. Both replacement parts are already on-site (no parts to order or pick up).</p><p><br></p><p>Tasks for Technician</p><p><br></p><p>1. Check in with the leasing staff upon arrival and get access to the package room.</p><p>2. Contact HelloPackage Support - Lu Gibbs at (470) 825-3255 before locating any equipment.</p><p>3. Work with Support at (470) 825-3255 to identify Rack 3 and the electronics bin containing the USB hub and LED power supply.</p><p>4. Power down Rack 3 only if Support instructs you to do so.</p><p>5. Open the electronics bin and locate the USB hub as guided by Support.</p><p>6. Disconnect all USB and power cables from the old USB hub.</p><p>7. Remove the old USB hub.</p><p>8. Install the replacement (current-model) USB hub.</p><p>9. Reconnect all USB cables exactly as Support at (470) 825-3255 directs so each zone is reconnected to the correct port order.</p><p>10. Reconnect the hub's power cable.</p><p>11. Locate the LED power supply on Rack 3 as guided by Support.</p><p>12. Disconnect power to the existing LED power supply and remove it.</p><p>13. Install the replacement LED power supply and reconnect power as directed by Support at (470) 825-3255.</p><p>14. Power Rack 3 back on if needed.</p><p>15. Work with Support at (470) 825-3255 to verify the Raspberry Pi remains online and communicating properly.</p><p>16. Work with Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm all LED modules/zones are functioning and Rack 3 comes back online properly.</p><p>17. Perform a final operational test of Rack 3 with Support at (470) 825-3255.</p><p>18. Clean up the work area and check out with leasing staff.</p><p><br></p><p>Parts / Tools Required</p><p><br></p><p>Parts (on-site, already shipped - none required):</p><p>- Replacement USB hub, current model - Qty 1</p><p>- Replacement LED power supply - Qty 1</p><p><br></p><p>Tools Needed:</p><p>- Basic hand tools</p>","markdown":"**Overview**This work takes place inside the HelloPackage package room at Candour House. Zendesk Ticket #591360.\n\nBackground: During onsite troubleshooting under previous ticket 589581, the room was restored online with all four racks operational. Two components on Rack 3 were identified for replacement.\n\nScope of work (preventative replacement):\n\n1\\. Replace the existing USB hub on Rack 3 with the current-model USB hub. The existing hub is currently functioning but is an older model. This hub is what the zones connect to.\n\n2\\. Replace the LED power supply on Rack 3.\n\nAfter installation, verify the Raspberry Pi remains online and communicating properly, confirm all LED modules/zones are functioning, and perform a final operational test of Rack 3.\n\nA technician is needed on-site to work with HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to locate the correct components, perform the replacements, and verify operation. Both replacement parts are already on-site (no parts to order or pick up).\n\nTasks for Technician\n\n1\\. Check in with the leasing staff upon arrival and get access to the package room.\n\n2\\. Contact HelloPackage Support - Lu Gibbs at (470) 825-3255 before locating any equipment.\n\n3\\. Work with Support at (470) 825-3255 to identify Rack 3 and the electronics bin containing the USB hub and LED power supply.\n\n4\\. Power down Rack 3 only if Support instructs you to do so.\n\n5\\. Open the electronics bin and locate the USB hub as guided by Support.\n\n6\\. Disconnect all USB and power cables from the old USB hub.\n\n7\\. Remove the old USB hub.\n\n8\\. Install the replacement (current-model) USB hub.\n\n9\\. Reconnect all USB cables exactly as Support at (470) 825-3255 directs so each zone is reconnected to the correct port order.\n\n10\\. Reconnect the hub's power cable.\n\n11\\. Locate the LED power supply on Rack 3 as guided by Support.\n\n12\\. Disconnect power to the existing LED power supply and remove it.\n\n13\\. Install the replacement LED power supply and reconnect power as directed by Support at (470) 825-3255.\n\n14\\. Power Rack 3 back on if needed.\n\n15\\. Work with Support at (470) 825-3255 to verify the Raspberry Pi remains online and communicating properly.\n\n16\\. Work with Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm all LED modules/zones are functioning and Rack 3 comes back online properly.\n\n17\\. Perform a final operational test of Rack 3 with Support at (470) 825-3255.\n\n18\\. Clean up the work area and check out with leasing staff.\n\nParts / Tools Required\n\nParts (on-site, already shipped - none required):\n\n\\- Replacement USB hub, current model - Qty 1\n\n\\- Replacement LED power supply - Qty 1\n\nTools Needed:\n\n\\- Basic hand tools","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T10:00","end":"2026-10-20T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":75},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":17.20377431852982},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/19/2026, 10:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"Listen Audio Book"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Angier Police Department Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"202