{"job":{"id":20199393,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ICS Advanced Technologies","title":"Skyhouse Raleigh Low Voltage Site Survey","description":{"html":"<p>Perform an on site survey at an apartment complex to determine existing cabling infrastructure to provide Internet service.  Technician must have knowledge of Cat5e/Cat6 cabling &amp; fiber types and terminations.  Basic hand tools will be required to remove wall plates and open enclosures.  </p><ul><li>Appointment will be scheduled and coordinated for you</li><li>Tech must contact our quoting team member while on site </li><li>Upload photos of wiring and equipment</li><li>Complete site survey form</li></ul>","markdown":"Perform an on site survey at an apartment complex to determine existing cabling infrastructure to provide Internet service. Technician must have knowledge of Cat5e/Cat6 cabling & fiber types and terminations. Basic hand tools will be required to remove wall plates and open enclosures.\n\n- Appointment will be scheduled and coordinated for you\n- Tech must contact our quoting team member while on site\n- Upload photos of wiring and equipment\n- Complete site survey form","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T10:00","end":"2026-10-20T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8.397346763367327},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 21, 2:00 PM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $200\nRejected: pay does not meet the alternative-date minimum."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T