{"job":{"id":20178474,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"BP Innovations, Inc.","title":"Monday Ops/IT Conversion Migration Support (minimum required time onsite)","description":{"html":"This is a 3-day WO, Tuesday (Prep), Saturday (Testing) & Monday (Go Live Support)<br/><br/>SUMMARY:<br/>This is the Software and Business Conversion, migrating these users to their new Point of Sale and Inventory Management system, the support is to ensure that all necessary IT equipment and connections are ready, and verify that infrastructure is documented and supportable going forward.<br/>Release each day will require sign off from onsite Ops PM, Remote IT PM and your BP Innovations project coordinator.<br/><br/>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>TECH REQUIRED EQUIPMENT:<br/>- Laptop, Console Cable, & HotSpot<br/>- All standard tools as listed in the WO<br/><br/>TECH REQUIRED MATERIALS (in addition to standard tools & materials):<br/>- At least 300' of Cat6 Cable and at least 4 Cat6 Jacks to be used only if needed.<br/><br/>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/><br/>TUESDAY ADVANCED PREP VISIT:<br/>Tech will work with BPI PM, Remote Customer IT staff and onsite Integration Manager to complete tasks as per the final checklist. Work will include:<br/>- Swapping out a few devices such as:<br/>    - Network Printer for Shipping (aka \"Varsity Printer\")<br/>    - TEMP CONNECT the credit card machines and verify<br/>    - Check scanner (USB connection)<br/>- Tone & test any data drops that may get equipment connected and update the as built diagram for the site<br/>- Install any new PCs or Printers (estimated 0 - 3 devices, final count is site and situation specific)<br/>- Running data drop(s) only if needed for new equipment (i.e. Shipping Printer)<br/>-----------------------------<br/>SATURDAY TESTING DAY:<br/>Tech will work with BPI PM and Customer IT staff to complete tasks as per the final checklist which will be onsite. Work will include:<br/>- Ensure credit card machine is in it's final place<br/>- Ensure all PCs and Printers are online<br/>- Assist in any troubleshooting as the onsite operations teams completes their testing checklist.<br/>- Verify data drops are documented on the as built diagram.<br/>- Assist in any final adjustments requested by Corporate IT (remote) and the BPI PM<br/>-----------------------------<br/>MONDAY GO LIVE DAY:<br/>- Be onsite for any support that may be required during initial go live. Tech will remain onsite until released which will be no earlier than 11am.<br/>    - Release must come from the BPI PM prior to leaving site and will be verified with the onsite Ops Integration Manager, remote IT lead and BPI PM assigned.<br/>-----------------------------<br/><br/>DELIVERABLES:<br/>1. Photos as requested<br/>2. As Built Updated<br/>","markdown":"This is a 3-day WO, Tuesday (Prep), Saturday (Testing) & Monday (Go Live Support)  \n  \nSUMMARY:  \nThis is the Software and Business Conversion, migrating these users to their new Point of Sale and Inventory Management system, the support is to ensure that all necessary IT equipment and connections are ready, and verify that infrastructure is documented and supportable going forward.  \nRelease each day will require sign off from onsite Ops PM, Remote IT PM and your BP Innovations project coordinator.  \n  \n\\--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  \nTECH REQUIRED EQUIPMENT:  \n\\- Laptop, Console Cable, & HotSpot  \n\\- All standard tools as listed in the WO  \n  \nTECH REQUIRED MATERIALS (in addition to standard tools & materials):  \n\\- At least 300' of Cat6 Cable and at least 4 Cat6 Jacks to be used only if needed.  \n  \n\\--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  \n  \nTUESDAY ADVANCED PREP VISIT:  \nTech will work with BPI PM, Remote Customer IT staff and onsite Integration Manager to complete tasks as per the final checklist. Work will include:  \n\\- Swapping out a few devices such as:  \n\\- Network Printer for Shipping (aka \"Varsity Printer\")  \n\\- TEMP CONNECT the credit card machines and verify  \n\\- Check scanner (USB connection)  \n\\- Tone & test any data drops that may get equipment connected and update the as built diagram for the site  \n\\- Install any new PCs or Printers (estimated 0 - 3 devices, final count is site and situation specific)  \n\\- Running data drop(s) only if needed for new equipment (i.e. Shipping Printer)  \n\\-----------------------------  \nSATURDAY TESTING DAY:  \nTech will work with BPI PM and Customer IT staff to complete tasks as per the final checklist which will be onsite. Work will include:  \n\\- Ensure credit card machine is in it's final place  \n\\- Ensure all PCs and Printers are online  \n\\- Assist in any troubleshooting as the onsite operations teams completes their testing checklist.  \n\\- Verify data drops are documented on the as built diagram.  \n\\- Assist in any final adjustments requested by Corporate IT (remote) and the BPI PM  \n\\-----------------------------  \nMONDAY GO LIVE DAY:  \n\\- Be onsite for any support that may be required during initial go live. Tech will remain onsite until released which will be no earlier than 11am.  \n\\- Release must come from the BPI PM prior to leaving site and will be verified with the onsite Ops Integration Manager, remote IT lead and BPI PM assigned.  \n\\-----------------------------  \n  \nDELIVERABLES:  \n1\\. Photos as requested  \n2\\. As Built Updated","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T09:00","end":"2026-11-09T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":280},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":43.2553736831442},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $280 (countered: $280) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Angier Police Department Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792430175124}
