{"job":{"id":20173530,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"Variety Wholesalers Pin Pad Refresh","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Summary of Work:</strong></p>\n<p>IW Technologies is looking for a technician to complete a pin pad replacement at a local retailer. The scope includes replacing the existing pin pads, installing the switch, configuring and testing the devices. Please record each pin pad serial number with its corresponding lane number. Pack the existing pin pads and Verifone cables in the original tamper-safe white packaging, and drop the box off at FedEx.</p>\n<p><strong>QTY of Lanes: 3</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Required Tools:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;Physical Drivers License or State Issued ID</li>\n<li>Velcro</li>\n<li>1.25\" hole saw w/drill</li>\n<li>Variety of Phillips screwdrivers</li>\n<li>Loctite to use on the pin pad screws for the mount</li>\n<li>Fish Tape/Pull String</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Pre-Visit Instructions:</strong></p>\n<p>Be sure to read and understand all of the instructions and download/print all documentation attached to work order</p>\n<p>Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.</p>\n<p><strong>Onsite Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check in on the Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198</p>\n<p>Mount the new pinpad in the <strong>same location as the old pinpad</strong>.</p>\n<p>Use the <strong>provided patch cables</strong> to connect the pinpad to the switch.</p>\n<p>The switch must have <strong>3 cables connected</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Port 1:</strong> Existing CAT 5 from the biscuit jack under the register.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Port 2:</strong> Connect a new CAT 5 patch cable to the biscuit jack, with the other end connected to<strong>Port 2</strong>.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Port 3:</strong> CAT 5 cable from the pinpad.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Mount the switch on the <strong>left side</strong>, with the<strong>link lights visible</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Verify the access codes and IP address before entering them</strong> to avoid issues with the pinpad.</p>\n<p>Pack the <strong>old pinpads only</strong> for return.<strong>Do not include the stands or old cables.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Please review the Pinpad Refresh Field Services Guide for the full scope of work and installation instructions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Clean up Area</strong></p>\n<p>Call IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site - 847-285-4198. Be prepared to hand your phone to the store manager so we can verify with the manager that the pin pad is fully functional.</p>\n<p>Check In Time: (local)</p>\n<p>Check Out Time: (local)</p>\n<p>Store Contact Name:</p>\n<p>Record the serial numbers of all installed pin pads</p>\n<p>Return Tracking #:</p>\n<p>Store Check Out Contact:</p>\n<p>Picture of Completed Work:</p>\n<p><strong>Close-Out Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check out on the Field Nation App</p>\n<p>Ensure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables</p>\n<p>Leave defective parts onsite</p>\n<p>Submit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.</p>","markdown":"**Summary of Work:**\n\nIW Technologies is looking for a technician to complete a pin pad replacement at a local retailer. The scope includes replacing the existing pin pads, installing the switch, configuring and testing the devices. Please record each pin pad serial number with its corresponding lane number. Pack the existing pin pads and Verifone cables in the original tamper-safe white packaging, and drop the box off at FedEx.\n\n**QTY of Lanes: 3**\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n- Physical Drivers License or State Issued ID\n- Velcro\n- 1.25\" hole saw w/drill\n- Variety of Phillips screwdrivers\n- Loctite to use on the pin pad screws for the mount\n- Fish Tape/Pull String\n\n**Pre-Visit Instructions:**\n\nBe sure to read and understand all of the instructions and download/print all documentation attached to work order\n\nConfirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.\n\n**Onsite Tasks:**\n\nCheck in on the Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198\n\nMount the new pinpad in the **same location as the old pinpad**.\n\nUse the **provided patch cables** to connect the pinpad to the switch.\n\nThe switch must have **3 cables connected**:\n\n- **Port 1:** Existing CAT 5 from the biscuit jack under the register.\n- **Port 2:** Connect a new CAT 5 patch cable to the biscuit jack, with the other end connected to**Port 2**.\n- **Port 3:** CAT 5 cable from the pinpad.\n\nMount the switch on the **left side**, with the**link lights visible**.\n\n**Verify the access codes and IP address before entering them** to avoid issues with the pinpad.\n\nPack the **old pinpads only** for return.**Do not include the stands or old cables.**\n\n- Please review the Pinpad Refresh Field Services Guide for the full scope of work and installation instructions.\n\n**Clean up Area**\n\nCall IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site - 847-285-4198. Be prepared to hand your phone to the store manager so we can verify with the manager that the pin pad is fully functional.\n\nCheck In Time: (local)\n\nCheck Out Time: (local)\n\nStore Contact Name:\n\nRecord the serial numbers of all installed pin pads\n\nReturn Tracking #:\n\nStore Check Out Contact:\n\nPicture of Completed Work:\n\n**Close-Out Tasks:**\n\nCheck out on the Field Nation App\n\nEnsure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables\n\nLeave defective parts onsite\n\nSubmit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-30T07:45","end":"2026-10-30T10:45"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":90},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":43.89226743662282},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Angier Police Department Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792430373720}
{"job":{"id":20189075,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"FTG testing and config.","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Summary of Problem: </strong>E4 and NDE are unable to access the FortiGate to be able to add it to the FortiManager.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work: </strong>Restore CADA access to the FortiGate HA cluster as well as add the cluster to the FortiManager.</p><p><br></p><p><em>﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch. </em></p><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement</u></strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cell Phone – with Charger. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">WIN10 Laptop – with Charger - </span></li><li><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 &amp; USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45</strong></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Standard Tool Kit</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cat 6 cables</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Cable Tester</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Hotspot or Internet Dongle</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Black Ink Pens (for documentation)</span></li></ul><p><strong><u>Job Requirements:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); font-size: 10.5pt;\"> </span></p><p> </p><ul><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Communicate frequently via phone/email communications</span></li><li><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: 12px;\">Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.  </span></li><li><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">Only use </span><strong>Site Disposal<em> </em></strong><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12px;\">when removing any materials/trash</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">If returning equipment, request shipping label via instructions in custom field</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Government-issued photo ID required </li><li>Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance </li><li>Check-in with site contacts representing <del>*******</del></li><li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment </li><li>Professional environment expects professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li></ul><p> </p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n**Summary of Problem:** E4 and NDE are unable to access the FortiGate to be able to add it to the FortiManager.\n\n**Scope of Work:** Restore CADA access to the FortiGate HA cluster as well as add the cluster to the FortiManager.\n\n*﻿See the Confidential Information section at the bottom of the work order for detailed information regarding this dispatch.*\n\n**Tool Requirement**\n\n- Cell Phone – with Charger.\n- WIN10 Laptop – with Charger -\n- **Console Cable -DB9 male to RJ45 & USB-C to RJ45/USB-A to RJ45**\n- Standard Tool Kit\n- Cat 6 cables\n- Cable Tester\n- Hotspot or Internet Dongle\n- Black Ink Pens (for documentation)\n\n**Job Requirements:**\n\n- Communicate frequently via phone/email communications\n- Assist with all dispatch needs for the specific scope provided in the work order\n- If out-of-scope work is required, the work order manager will need to be looped in to receive a confirmation to proceed.\n- Only use **Site Disposal** when removing any materials/trash\n- If returning equipment, request shipping label via instructions in custom field\n\n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expects professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T21:00","end":"2026-10-19T25:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":220},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":25.050158561062933},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 21, 2:00 PM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $220\nRejected: pay does not meet the alternative-date minimum."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"Listen Audio Book"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","en