{"job":{"id":20184389,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Mesmerize","title":"Poster Installation | 10 Minutes Per Site | $20/site","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>**All travel expenses must be approved prior to being assigned.**</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>﻿**All work performed and materials submitted must be authentic and unaltered; AI-generated content or images are not accepted. Violations will be reported to Field Nation per platform guidelines.**</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Mailing address required upon acceptance of job. Lack of communication on provider side will be seen as provider abandoning job and job will be re-posted after 2 days of no communication.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>**<u>IMPORTANT</u>: We will be mailing the materials directly to you for this work order. The dates, as such, are tentative until materials have been delivered to you.**</strong></p><p><strong><u>Overview:</u></strong></p><p>Providers will visit sites listed on the work order to install posters. Good quality photos of the poster will be needed at all sites.</p><p><strong><u>PRE-SITE</u></strong></p><p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Provide mailing address in work order messages</p><p>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Review attached example photos in work order for quality standards</p><p>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Confirm site's hours of operation prior to arriving as they may be different than what is on the work order</strong></p><p>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Complete any Prep Tasks in the Field Nation app</p><p><strong><u>TASKS FOR THE JOB WILL INCLUDE:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Receive package(s) of&nbsp;posters</li><li>Enter location on list (<strong><u>Routing is up to you, please ensure the location is open before visiting by either looking it up online or calling them)</u></strong>.</li><li><strong>Speak to the manager/staff on duty, politely introduce yourself in a professional manner. Ask if you can install the poster(s)</strong></li><li><strong>Please place the poster(s) flat on an interior wall (not outside). Avoid installing on a window, counter, or drink cooler, if possible</strong></li><li><strong>Please avoid using tape to hang the poster(s). There is self-adhesive on the back of the poster(s)</strong></li><li>Once all materials are posted: Upload required photos in the Field Nation app</li><li>After photos have been uploaded, add closeout notes in the Field Nation app, thank them and move on to the next site</li></ul><p><strong>FAQ:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Provider must have permission to post materials on site. If you do not have permission to post the materials, please take a photo of the outside of the building and upload to Field Nation. Provider will be paid even if the location refuses the materials as long as Provider has taken a photo of the building as proof of visit.</strong></li><li><strong>Poster must be fully adhered and flat on the inside wall (no loose corners and/or edges) or Provider will be asked to return to site(s) in order to correct the work for no additional compensation. If Provider refuses to correct any issues, they will not be paid for any incorrect work done at site(s).</strong></li><li><strong>Take straight on photos, not from the side. We must be able to see the whole poster in the photo. Any photo(s) taken from an angle or where the entire poster is not visible, Provider will be asked to retake photo(s), or we will not pay for that site.</strong></li><li><strong>When you have finished the work order, please ask work order manager for return label to return any unused materials.</strong></li><li><strong>If you run into any issues or have any questions, please communicate through Field Nation messages so our entire team can assist you.</strong></li></ol>","markdown":"**\\*\\*All travel expenses must be approved prior to being assigned.\\*\\***\n\n**﻿\\*\\*All work performed and materials submitted must be authentic and unaltered; AI-generated content or images are not accepted. Violations will be reported to Field Nation per platform guidelines.\\*\\***\n\n**Mailing address required upon acceptance of job. Lack of communication on provider side will be seen as provider abandoning job and job will be re-posted after 2 days of no communication.**\n\n**\\*\\*IMPORTANT: We will be mailing the materials directly to you for this work order. The dates, as such, are tentative until materials have been delivered to you.\\*\\***\n\n**Overview:**\n\nProviders will visit sites listed on the work order to install posters. Good quality photos of the poster will be needed at all sites.\n\n**PRE-SITE**\n\n1\\. Provide mailing address in work order messages\n\n2\\. Review attached example photos in work order for quality standards\n\n3\\. **Confirm site's hours of operation prior to arriving as they may be different than what is on the work order**\n\n4\\. Complete any Prep Tasks in the Field Nation app\n\n**TASKS FOR THE JOB WILL INCLUDE:**\n\n- Receive package(s) of posters\n- Enter location on list (**Routing is up to you, please ensure the location is open before visiting by either looking it up online or calling them)**.\n- **Speak to the manager/staff on duty, politely introduce yourself in a professional manner. Ask if you can install the poster(s)**\n- **Please place the poster(s) flat on an interior wall (not outside). Avoid installing on a window, counter, or drink cooler, if possible**\n- **Please avoid using tape to hang the poster(s). There is self-adhesive on the back of the poster(s)**\n- Once all materials are posted: Upload required photos in the Field Nation app\n- After photos have been uploaded, add closeout notes in the Field Nation app, thank them and move on to the next site\n\n**FAQ:**\n\n1. **Provider must have permission to post materials on site. If you do not have permission to post the materials, please take a photo of the outside of the building and upload to Field Nation. Provider will be paid even if the location refuses the materials as long as Provider has taken a photo of the building as proof of visit.**\n2. **Poster must be fully adhered and flat on the inside wall (no loose corners and/or edges) or Provider will be asked to return to site(s) in order to correct the work for no additional compensation. If Provider refuses to correct any issues, they will not be paid for any incorrect work done at site(s).**\n3. **Take straight on photos, not from the side. We must be able to see the whole poster in the photo. Any photo(s) taken from an angle or where the entire poster is not visible, Provider will be asked to retake photo(s), or we will not pay for that site.**\n4. **When you have finished the work order, please ask work order manager for return label to return any unused materials.**\n5. **If you run into any issues or have any questions, please communicate through Field Nation messages so our entire team can assist you.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T09:00","end":"2026-10-19T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-19T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":20,"max":20},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":48.04195071803652},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/19/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"Listen Audio Book"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summ