{"job":{"id":20201277,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Kohl's - Replace Cash Drawer, Iron Gray, Key 9952","description":{"html":"SOW: -Tech to replace Cash Drawer on register # 81 <br/>Cash drawer is stuck tight in the cash wrap.  Sensomatic needs to be removed.  Work with the help desk to determine how to remove the cash drawer <br/><br/>*****Tech MUST box up cash drawer, till and cable*****<br/>!!! REQUIREMENTS FOR JOB CHECK-IN AND TIME APROVAL HAVE BEEN UPDATED PlEASE READ !!!<br/><br/>-Tech must take pictures of POS devices in box prior to unpacking and attach pictures to work order.  (Pictures can be emailed to dellservice@spencertech.com)<br/>-Tech must follow attached SOW guide<br/>-This work order requires tech to take a before and after photo of all surrounding cables pertaining to this scope of work. Tech MUST NOT leave the site until their Spencer Service agent approves their photos during check out. Tech MUST send photos to DellService@Spencertech.com The Request ID MUST be added to the subject line.<br/><br/>It is required that you follow these guidelines while visiting a Kohl’s location:<br/>-Maintain a positive and respectful attitude towards the customer, fellow employees, contractors, and all others that you Interact with at all times.<br/>-Ensure that your appearance is neat, clean, and that you are properly dressed per the Spencer dress code.<br/>-All complaints are to be taken to the Spencer Field Manager away from the hearing of others.<br/><br/>Required Tools:<br/>-Camera or Smart Phone to take before and after photos.<br/>-Cable testers<br/>-Spare patch cables/Ethernet cables<br/>-Basic tools (Screwdriver, Wire Cutters, Allen Wrenches)<br/>-Extra Keyboard and Mouse.<br/>-Consumables to Cable Manage (Zip-ties, Cable Ties, Twist ties, Label Maker)<br/>#4 Allen Wrench<br/><br/>Checkin Requirements:<br/>-Head inside the store and check in at the Customer Service Desk (for New Stores, check in at the Welcome Desk at the main entrance).<br/>- Tech must retrieve replacement equipment from associate and provide the following during check in call.<br/>       - Return Tracking provided in box with new device <br/>       - Confirm Register # you will be working on<br/>-Provide INC# to store associate and fill out visitor log.<br/>-Tech must take photos of the Device and all the cables for the device before any work is done.<br/><br/>-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN<br/>-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app<br/>-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1<br/>   <br/>While Onsite:<br/>--Tech must follow attached SOW guide<br/>-Tech is required to work with Kohls Team: 262-703-1515<br/>      When dialing 262-703-1515, the following message is played:<br/>      Thank you for reaching the Kohls team.<br/>      Press 1 for store hardware issues.<br/>      Press 2 for network-related issues.<br/>-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW.<br/>-Take photos of the new installation to provide to Spencer upon checkout. Include all cable connections and cable management.<br/>- It is mandatory that ALL time exceeding the expected duration is approved by the Service team PRIOR to that time being<br/>Please call 844-464-1910 opt 2 as soon as you realize you may not be able to complete the scope of work in the allotted time and provide an update as to why and how much additional time would be needed.<br/><br/>Checkout Requirements:<br/>-Tech must check-out with the Kohl’s Service Delivery Team (844-464-1910, Opt 2) <br/>-Technician is required to send photos from the Job to Kohl’s Service Delivery Team (DellService@SpencerTech.com) The photos should Include all before and after photos for all cables and devices.<br/>-Technician must box up old equipment and provide it to the Manager on Duty.<br/>-Sign out at Kohl’s Customer Service Desk.<br/>    <br/>Deliverables:<br/>-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com; DellService@SpencerTech.com<br/>-Names of the Manager(s) and Support agents you talked with.<br/>-Photos of all cables and devices before work was done and after work was done.<br/>-Return tracking number of the returning part(s).","markdown":"SOW: -Tech to replace Cash Drawer on register # 81   \nCash drawer is stuck tight in the cash wrap. Sensomatic needs to be removed. Work with the help desk to determine how to remove the cash drawer   \n  \n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*Tech MUST box up cash drawer, till and cable\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*  \n!!! REQUIREMENTS FOR JOB CHECK-IN AND TIME APROVAL HAVE BEEN UPDATED PlEASE READ !!!  \n  \n-Tech must take pictures of POS devices in box prior to unpacking and attach pictures to work order. (Pictures can be emailed to dellservice@spencertech.com)  \n-Tech must follow attached SOW guide  \n-This work order requires tech to take a before and after photo of all surrounding cables pertaining to this scope of work. Tech MUST NOT leave the site until their Spencer Service agent approves their photos during check out. Tech MUST send photos to DellService@Spencertech.com The Request ID MUST be added to the subject line.  \n  \nIt is required that you follow these guidelines while visiting a Kohl’s location:  \n-Maintain a positive and respectful attitude towards the customer, fellow employees, contractors, and all others that you Interact with at all times.  \n-Ensure that your appearance is neat, clean, and that you are properly dressed per the Spencer dress code.  \n-All complaints are to be taken to the Spencer Field Manager away from the hearing of others.  \n  \nRequired Tools:  \n-Camera or Smart Phone to take before and after photos.  \n-Cable testers  \n-Spare patch cables/Ethernet cables  \n-Basic tools (Screwdriver, Wire Cutters, Allen Wrenches)  \n-Extra Keyboard and Mouse.  \n-Consumables to Cable Manage (Zip-ties, Cable Ties, Twist ties, Label Maker)  \n\\#4 Allen Wrench  \n  \nCheckin Requirements:  \n-Head inside the store and check in at the Customer Service Desk (for New Stores, check in at the Welcome Desk at the main entrance).  \n\\- Tech must retrieve replacement equipment from associate and provide the following during check in call.  \n\\- Return Tracking provided in box with new device   \n\\- Confirm Register # you will be working on  \n-Provide INC# to store associate and fill out visitor log.  \n-Tech must take photos of the Device and all the cables for the device before any work is done.  \n  \n-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN  \n-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app  \n-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1  \n   \nWhile Onsite:  \n\\--Tech must follow attached SOW guide  \n-Tech is required to work with Kohls Team: 262-703-1515  \n When dialing 262-703-1515, the following message is played:  \n Thank you for reaching the Kohls team.  \n Press 1 for store hardware issues.  \n Press 2 for network-related issues.  \n-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW.  \n-Take photos of the new installation to provide to Spencer upon checkout. Include all cable connections and cable management.  \n\\- It is mandatory that ALL time exceeding the expected duration is approved by the Service team PRIOR to that time being  \nPlease call 844-464-1910 opt 2 as soon as you realize you may not be able to complete the scope of work in the allotted time and provide an update as to why and how much additional time would be needed.  \n  \nCheckout Requirements:  \n-Tech must check-out with the Kohl’s Service Delivery Team (844-464-1910, Opt 2)   \n-Technician is required to send photos from the Job to Kohl’s Service Delivery Team (DellService@SpencerTech.com) The photos should Include all before and after photos for all cables and devices.  \n-Technician must box up old equipment and provide it to the Manager on Duty.  \n-Sign out at Kohl’s Customer Service Desk.  \n   \nDeliverables:  \n-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com; DellService@SpencerTech.com  \n-Names of the Manager(s) and Support agents you talked with.  \n-Photos of all cables and devices before work was done and after work was done.  \n-Return tracking number of the returning part(s).","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T11:00","end":"2026-10-20T13:00","latestStart":"2026-10-20T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":12.173746012667834},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00