{"job":{"id":20177755,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Zutek LLC","title":"Presto AI: Dual NIC install/cable run","description":{"html":"<p>Zutek is a nationwide service and deployment company looking to add quality field staff to our Field Nation Network.&nbsp;&nbsp;We do a wide variety of POS, CCTV, Digital Signage, Out Door Menu Boards, and many other related technologies in the Hospitality and Retail Industries.&nbsp;</p><p>During the performance of&nbsp;Work&nbsp;you shall refrain from performing any services beyond the scope of services outlined in the Statement of Work. If additional work is requested/required, you must obtain prior approval from the Zutek Project Manager while onsite. Time onsite exceeding the original work order must also be approved by the Zutek Project Manager while onsite. Otherwise, Zutek has the right to refuse payment for the additional services.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>LATE ARRIVAL NOTICE</u></strong></p><p>Technicians are required to arrive on-site at the scheduled start time, with a maximum grace period of <strong>10 minutes</strong>.</p><p>Arrivals exceeding this 10-minute grace period without prior approval from Zutek will result in a <strong>$20 penalty</strong>, which will be deducted from the job payment.</p><p>This policy ensures we maintain our commitments to clients, uphold our service standards, and avoid delays that impact project schedules.</p><p>If you anticipate being late, you must call Zutek immediately with the reason for the delay and your updated ETA.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope Of Work: Original installation guides attached for reference if needed.</u></strong></p><p>TECH MUST CHECK IN WITH ZUTEK AND SUPPORT UPON ARRIVAL&nbsp;</p><p><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>PRE-SITE SURVEY ATTACHED MUST BE COMPLETED BEFORE STARTING WORK.</p><p>Technician will join support link and work directly with Presto technician.&nbsp;</p><p>Link:&nbsp;To be provided once schedule is confirmed</p><p><br></p><p>SOW</p><p>Technician to work with Presto support to install a dual NIC on their system and run a cable to the network switch.</p><p>*****Upon completion need to confirm that DT timer is working properly*******</p><p><br></p><p>If tech is swapping equipment they are responsible for packaging old equipment with label and shipping back to Presto</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Deliverables:</u></strong></p><p>CSR Signed by MOD - EACH TECH WILL NEED THEIR OWN CSR</p><p>Before and after photos of affected equipment</p><p>Cable Management</p><p>Old equipment packaged with return label (if applicable)</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>DO NOT leave site until you have uploaded ALL deliverables and called Zutek at </u><em><u>941-662-2522 </u></em><u>to check offsite. We will check your deliverables and then give you an exit code. Once you receive an exit code you may leave site.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools:</u></strong></p><p>- Line tester and verifier</p><p>-Testing monitor (MUST HAVE)</p><p>-CAT 6 Cable</p><p>- Minimum 6’ Step Ladder</p><p>- Drill. assorted bits</p><p>- Screws, Size 6x1”, molly bolts, flat washers</p><p>- Laptop, fully charged with charger and adaptors to connect to ethernet small assortment of ethernet patch cables</p><p>- Phone, fully charged with charger</p><p>- Networking Equipment, punch down tool, Crimps, Cable Crimper, flush cutter, keystone puck, toner</p><p>- Cable management (zip ties, hook-and-loop cable ties, J hooks)</p><p>- Electrical tape</p><p>- Small phillips head and flat head screwdriver</p><p>- Wire connector (multiple sizes)</p><p>- Wire cutter</p><p>- Scissors</p><p><strong><em>***You MUST mark yourself complete upon receiving an exit code at checkout to ensure efficient closeout of your ticket.***</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>The Fine Print of Requirements:</u></strong></p><p>All deliverables &ndash; Zutek exit code, paperwork (Zutek CSR and vendor WO.), pictures and/or cable certifications &ndash; must be received, via email or uploaded to Field Nation, before leaving the job site.&nbsp;If these guidelines are not met without prior authorization a $50 penalty will be assessed upon leaving site. An additional 10% penalty of your per job rate will be assessed for each day paperwork/photos remain incomplete. If applicable, you must provide the Zutek exit code in the resolution of the assignment before you will be paid.&nbsp;</p><p>RMA's must be&nbsp;shipped&nbsp;and a tracking number provided by the end of the business day. For every day that your RMA is not shipped you will be assessed a $10 penalty per day. Your assignment will NOT be invoiced until the part is returned and checked in.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Work Order Acceptance:</u></strong></p><p>By requesting / accepting this work order you agree to the terms set above</p>","markdown":"Zutek is a nationwide service and deployment company looking to add quality field staff to our Field Nation Network. We do a wide variety of POS, CCTV, Digital Signage, Out Door Menu Boards, and many other related technologies in the Hospitality and Retail Industries.\n\nDuring the performance of Work you shall refrain from performing any services beyond the scope of services outlined in the Statement of Work. If additional work is requested/required, you must obtain prior approval from the Zutek Project Manager while onsite. Time onsite exceeding the original work order must also be approved by the Zutek Project Manager while onsite. Otherwise, Zutek has the right to refuse payment for the additional services.\n\n**LATE ARRIVAL NOTICE**\n\nTechnicians are required to arrive on-site at the scheduled start time, with a maximum grace period of **10 minutes**.\n\nArrivals exceeding this 10-minute grace period without prior approval from Zutek will result in a **$20 penalty**, which will be deducted from the job payment.\n\nThis policy ensures we maintain our commitments to clients, uphold our service standards, and avoid delays that impact project schedules.\n\nIf you anticipate being late, you must call Zutek immediately with the reason for the delay and your updated ETA.\n\n**Scope Of Work: Original installation guides attached for reference if needed.**\n\nTECH MUST CHECK IN WITH ZUTEK AND SUPPORT UPON ARRIVAL\n\n﻿PRE-SITE SURVEY ATTACHED MUST BE COMPLETED BEFORE STARTING WORK.\n\nTechnician will join support link and work directly with Presto technician.\n\nLink: To be provided once schedule is confirmed\n\nSOW\n\nTechnician to work with Presto support to install a dual NIC on their system and run a cable to the network switch.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*Upon completion need to confirm that DT timer is working properly\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nIf tech is swapping equipment they are responsible for packaging old equipment with label and shipping back to Presto\n\n**Required Deliverables:**\n\nCSR Signed by MOD - EACH TECH WILL NEED THEIR OWN CSR\n\nBefore and after photos of affected equipment\n\nCable Management\n\nOld equipment packaged with return label (if applicable)\n\n**DO NOT leave site until you have uploaded ALL deliverables and called Zutek at *941-662-2522* to check offsite. We will check your deliverables and then give you an exit code. Once you receive an exit code you may leave site.**\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n\\- Line tester and verifier\n\n-Testing monitor (MUST HAVE)\n\n-CAT 6 Cable\n\n\\- Minimum 6’ Step Ladder\n\n\\- Drill. assorted bits\n\n\\- Screws, Size 6x1”, molly bolts, flat washers\n\n\\- Laptop, fully charged with charger and adaptors to connect to ethernet small assortment of ethernet patch cables\n\n\\- Phone, fully charged with charger\n\n\\- Networking Equipment, punch down tool, Crimps, Cable Crimper, flush cutter, keystone puck, toner\n\n\\- Cable management (zip ties, hook-and-loop cable ties, J hooks)\n\n\\- Electrical tape\n\n\\- Small phillips head and flat head screwdriver\n\n\\- Wire connector (multiple sizes)\n\n\\- Wire cutter\n\n\\- Scissors\n\n***\\*\\*\\*You MUST mark yourself complete upon receiving an exit code at checkout to ensure efficient closeout of your ticket.\\*\\*\\****\n\n**The Fine Print of Requirements:**\n\nAll deliverables – Zutek exit code, paperwork (Zutek CSR and vendor WO.), pictures and/or cable certifications – must be received, via email or uploaded to Field Nation, before leaving the job site. If these guidelines are not met without prior authorization a $50 penalty will be assessed upon leaving site. An additional 10% penalty of your per job rate will be assessed for each day paperwork/photos remain incomplete. If applicable, you must provide the Zutek exit code in the resolution of the assignment before you will be paid.\n\nRMA's must be shipped and a tracking number provided by the end of the business day. For every day that your RMA is not shipped you will be assessed a $10 penalty per day. Your assignment will NOT be invoiced until the part is returned and checked in.\n\n**Work Order Acceptance:**\n\nBy requesting / accepting this work order you agree to the terms set above","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T09:00","end":"2026-10-21T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-21T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":145},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":45}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":8.920808954210042},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Angier Police Department Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792431004545}
{"job":{"id":"3959039987","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1132569.1 HP Need to confirm the model – Error 98.00.0","description":"Customer Reference:    --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- ABM FEDERAL<br><br>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---<br>Please provide ETA for service<br><br>Serial Number: mxbccl821kw Make: HP **NEED TO CONFIRM MODEL AND SN* SN isnt coming up in Hp warranty<br><br>* MUST SPEAK WITH THE USER TO SET AN APT. <br>Tech needs an appointment with the end user, no Voicemail.<br>Need to provide the name of the tech so the site can put him on the security list.<br><br>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.<br><br>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.<br>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)<br><br>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.<br><br>Initial notes: HP Need to confirm the model – Error 98.00.0<br><br>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.<br>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login <br>techlink user name and password are the call number 1132569<br><br>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**<br><br>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.<br><br>General Instructions for All Calls-<br>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.<br>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.<br>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.<br>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.<br>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.<br>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.<br>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T08:02","end":"2026-10-15T12:02"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":45},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/15/2026, 8:02:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-17T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Call Mom"},{"start":"2026-10-19T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"Listen Audio Book"},{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Angier Police Department Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Burlington | WAN Testing/Validation, EB Install, Cross Connect Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T