{"job":{"id":20176233,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Terraboost Media","title":"Static Kiosk - Art change/New art installation","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Seeking a technician with experience changing out physical advertisement/signage</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tech is required to&nbsp;remove existing advertisement, discard, and install new advertisement</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Estimated duration will be 5-10 minutes per site</p><p><strong>Dress Code: (</strong>Casual Dress)</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Casual pants such as jeans</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Knee-length skirts in casual fabrics such as cotton</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Shorts of appropriate length</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Wrinkle-free and tidy T-shirts</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Collared polo shirts or crew-neck sweaters</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Clean athletic shoes</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Smartphone</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Clean towel/paper towel</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Replacement wipes (as needed)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><p>●&nbsp;Ensure proper artwork is received and that you know what location in the venue the artwork is to be installed in (ex. entrance 1, entrance 2, meat, pharmacy)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Terraboost Media while onsite</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Identify the static kiosks while onsite</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Remove existing advertisement top ad and bottom magnets panel and discard</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Wipe down kiosk with towel</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If generic ad exists behind initial ad, leave in place behind new ad install</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Install new top ad and bottom, panel magnet(s)</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Replace wipes if needed</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Provide any notes for context</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Old advertisement removed and discarded</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;New ad installed properly, kiosk wiped down, wipes replaced (if </p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Capturing current pictures of the kiosk after repair/adjustment made (kiosk needs to be in full view)</p><p><strong>Escalation Process:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with&nbsp;Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk via ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any issues or questions should be escalated to&nbsp;Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any issues or questions should be escalated to&nbsp;Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz</p>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n● Seeking a technician with experience changing out physical advertisement/signage\n\n● Tech is required to remove existing advertisement, discard, and install new advertisement\n\n● Estimated duration will be 5-10 minutes per site\n\n**Dress Code: (**Casual Dress)\n\n● Casual pants such as jeans\n\n● Knee-length skirts in casual fabrics such as cotton\n\n● Shorts of appropriate length\n\n● Wrinkle-free and tidy T-shirts\n\n● Collared polo shirts or crew-neck sweaters\n\n● Clean athletic shoes\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n● Smartphone\n\n● Clean towel/paper towel\n\n● Replacement wipes (as needed)\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n● Ensure proper artwork is received and that you know what location in the venue the artwork is to be installed in (ex. entrance 1, entrance 2, meat, pharmacy)\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n● Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent Terraboost Media while onsite\n\n● Identify the static kiosks while onsite\n\n● Remove existing advertisement top ad and bottom magnets panel and discard\n\n● Wipe down kiosk with towel\n\n● If generic ad exists behind initial ad, leave in place behind new ad install\n\n● Install new top ad and bottom, panel magnet(s)\n\n● Replace wipes if needed\n\n● Provide any notes for context\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n● Old advertisement removed and discarded\n\n● New ad installed properly, kiosk wiped down, wipes replaced (if\n\n● Capturing current pictures of the kiosk after repair/adjustment made (kiosk needs to be in full view)\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\n● If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk via ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz\n\n● Any issues or questions should be escalated to Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n● Any issues or questions should be escalated to Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-17T08:00","end":"2026-10-29T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":20,"max":20},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":45.05646755541484},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/17/2026, 8:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"