p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">REFERENCE KB KB0010214</span></p><p>https://umicore.service-now.com/kb_view.do?sysparm_article=KB0010214</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">******************************************************************************************************************************</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">ServiceNow Available KBs</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">KB0010196 - New Installation Autopilot Procedure</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">KB0117303 - PC Prepare</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">KB0358277 - PC Model 2024 (Autopilot Example Demo)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">*************************************************************************************************************</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">Please advise Dispatch FE Name and Contact Details (including Date and ETA)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">Before Tagging the Field Engineer, please make sure his x and w account are activated and working.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">PPE should be carried with Engineer</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">To be able to access the ServiceNow Links in the KBs,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">FE needs to log in Umicore Machine or Personal/Hemmers Bach computer and need to connect to the Umicore4U Wi-Fi or LAN while Onsite.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">Please upload the attached Dispatch Intervention report to this work order and email it to Jeffrey.Senecal@hemmersbach.com, viren.patel@am.umicore.com with dispatch-miami@hemmersbach.com in copy.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">Dispatch Check List:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">1). Please make sure FE carries his own Autopilot staging USB Key and LTSC Master image latest version USB Key should be carried with FE.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">2). One blank Empty USB Stick,</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">3). Personal or Hemmers Bach Laptop and good working cell phone.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">4). Working X and W account (v. imp)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">5). Dispatch FE should have his PPE carried with him.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">6). Dispatch FE Should complete the HSE short video training (in case required) </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">7). FE needs to contact Greg Engledove Mobile Number: +19194578675 or Work Phone Number: +19198742129 OR call Viren Patel over the phone +1-205-566-7565 as soon as he reaches Umicore site</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(58, 40, 49);\">Thank You.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><em style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">Before going to the site, please make sure that your Umicore accounts (both x- and w-account) work fine. To do that, log to your both Umicore accounts through </em><em>Microsoft 365</em><em style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"> in private/incognito window.</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>TCS contact person’s details will be visible in the tickets, they should be the following:</p><p>Contact –<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del> ***** ****** </del></span><del>**************************</del><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del> ****************</del></span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><em>In case you can’t log, please contact us immediately!</em></strong></p><p><em style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">&nbsp;Please download the image using the file \"</em>\"TCS-Umicore Preparation- Build the USB Thumb Drive_08042026_EXTERNAL.docx\"\"</p><p><em style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">To access process documentation (Knowledge Base Articles) mentioned in below task description, log in to your x-account, go to </em><em>Knowledge Homepage | ServiceNow</em><em style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"> and search for the relevant KB.</em></p><p><br></p><p>Please review the attached documents, as they provide guidance on how to perform the tasks required to successfully complete this work order.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>MUST SUBMIT THE TCS-Umicore Dispatch Intervention Report BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE.</strong></p>","markdown":"Scope of work\n\nroblem Description:\n\nSCTASK00118480 SCTASK00118481 SCTASK00118482\n\nHello Field Dispatch Lead,\n\nWill you please schedule Field Engineer visit for below Umicore site?\n\nAPPOINTMENT DATE: Oct 20 2026 around at 10:15 AM EDT Local Time\n\nTime: 10:15 AM EDT preferably\n\nAddress: 3600 Glenwood Avenue\n\nRaleigh, NC 27612\n\nLocal IT Point of contact person:\n\nGreg Engledove\n\nWork Number +1-919-874-2129\n\nCell phone +19194578675\n\nGreg.Engledove@am.umicore.com\n\nUSERNAME: Daphne Cunningham\n\nEmail Id: Daphne.Cunninghams@am.umicore.com\n\nDevice Serial Number: 1H86397KJY\n\nPhone: N/A\n\nDevice New Name: RAL-NB-A149\n\nUSERNAME: Janette Tomes\n\nEmail Id: Janette Tomes@am.umicore.com\n\nDevice Serial Number: 1H86397KJX\n\nPhone: N/A\n\nDevice New Name: RAL-NB-A150\n\nUSERNAME: Cassandra Goodyear\n\nEmail Id: Cassandra.Goodyearghams@am.umicore.com\n\nDevice Serial Number: 1H86397KK3\n\nPhone: N/A\n\nDevice New Name: RAL-NB-A151\n\nPPE : REQUIRED\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nJob Task\n\n3 SC Tasks SCTASK00118480 SCTASK00118481 SCTASK00118482\n\nProblem Short Description: LifeCycleV2.0 WO1 - Confirm Delivery\n\nRe-install computer\n\nComputer will be re-installed with Windows 11. You have to indicate the device type (personal or shared) 