necal@hemmersbach.com, viren.patel@am.umicore.com with dispatch-miami@hemmersbach.com in copy.\n\nDispatch Check List:\n\n1). Please make sure FE carries his own Autopilot staging USB Key and LTSC Master image latest version USB Key should be carried with FE.\n\n2). One blank Empty USB Stick,\n\n3). Personal or Hemmers Bach Laptop and good working cell phone.\n\n4). Working X and W account (v. imp)\n\n5). Dispatch FE should have his PPE carried with him.\n\n6). Dispatch FE Should complete the HSE short video training (in case required)\n\n7). FE needs to contact Greg Engledove Mobile Number: +19194578675 or Work Phone Number: +19198742129 OR call Viren Patel over the phone +1-205-566-7565 as soon as he reaches Umicore site\n\nThank You.\n\n*Before going to the site, please make sure that your Umicore accounts (both x- and w-account) work fine. To do that, log to your both Umicore accounts through* *Microsoft 365* *in private/incognito window.*\n\nTCS contact person’s details will be visible in the tickets, they should be the following:\n\nContact – \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n***In case you can’t log, please contact us immediately!***\n\n *Please download the image using the file \"*\"TCS-Umicore Preparation- Build the USB Thumb Drive\\_08042026\\_EXTERNAL.docx\"\"\n\n*To access process documentation (Knowledge Base Articles) mentioned in below task description, log in to your x-account, go to* *Knowledge Homepage | ServiceNow* *and search for the relevant KB.*\n\nPlease review the attached documents, as they provide guidance on how to perform the tasks required to successfully complete this work order.\n\n**MUST SUBMIT THE TCS-Umicore Dispatch Intervention Report BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T10:00","end":"2026-10-20T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":120},"payType