{"job":{"id":"3959039987","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1132569.1 HP Need to confirm the model – Error 98.00.0","description":"<p>Customer Reference: --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- ABM FEDERAL</p><p><br></p><p>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---</p><p>Please provide ETA for service</p><p><br></p><p>Serial Number: mxbccl821kw Make: HP **NEED TO CONFIRM MODEL AND SN* SN isnt coming up in Hp warranty</p><p><br></p><p>* MUST SPEAK WITH THE USER TO SET AN APT. </p><p>Tech needs an appointment with the end user, no Voicemail.</p><p>Need to provide the name of the tech so the site can put him on the security list.</p><p><br></p><p>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.</p><p>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)</p><p><br></p><p>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.</p><p><br></p><p>Initial notes: HP Need to confirm the model – Error 98.00.0</p><p><br></p><p>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.</p><p>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login </p><p>techlink user name and password are the call number 1132569</p><p><br></p><p>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**</p><p><br></p><p>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.</p><p><br></p><p>General Instructions for All Calls-</p><p>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.</p><p>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.</p><p>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.</p><p>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.</p><p>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.</p><p>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.</p><p>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T08:00","end":"2026-10-20T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":45},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $72.4910836 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05976601 - 707 Green Valley Road, Pinnacle Bank, epik survey  (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":