{"job":{"id":20186806,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Quality Sign and Marquee","title":"Disney: Ice Age: Boiling Point Standee","description":{"html":"<p>BE SURE TO CHECK THE THEATRE SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL (Via Google), QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT YET OPEN FOR THE DAY. ANY WORK ORDER SUBMITTED FOR PAYMENT BECAUSE THE THEATRE WAS CLOSED AT THE TIME OF ARRIVAL WILL BE DENIED. PROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.</p><p>BE ACCEPTING THE WORK ORDER, YOU AGREE TO THE FOLLOWING:</p><p>If the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or cannot locate the standee.</p><p>If the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for <strong>HALF (50%)</strong> of the installation rate.</p><p>SCOPE OF WORK:</p><p>The provider is asked to confirm the standee has arrived (tracking attached to this workorder) before visiting the location. Once confirmed, plan to visit the location, locate the pre-shipped theatrical standee for<strong> Ice Age: Boiling Point</strong>, build the display according to the attached instruction sheet, and place in a prominent location within the theatre lobby. We are requesting (2) installation photos, 1 showing the standee properly installed and 1 showing the placement in the theatre. Keep in mind we want to see the display from a distance so we can see what is around the display.</p><p>The average installer has completed the standee in <strong>1-2 hours</strong>, please plan accordingly. The Instruction Sheet can be downloaded from the link below, please familiarize yourself with it before heading to your locations.</p><p>THIS IS A CHALLENGING INSTALLATION, THE INSTRUCTIONS MUST BE REVIEWED AND UNDERSTOOD PRIOR TO VISITING THE LOCATION.</p>","markdown":"BE SURE TO CHECK THE THEATRE SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL (Via Google), QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT YET OPEN FOR THE DAY. ANY WORK ORDER SUBMITTED FOR PAYMENT BECAUSE THE THEATRE WAS CLOSED AT THE TIME OF ARRIVAL WILL BE DENIED. PROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.\n\nBE ACCEPTING THE WORK ORDER, YOU AGREE TO THE FOLLOWING:\n\nIf the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or cannot locate the standee.\n\nIf the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for **HALF (50%)** of the installation rate.\n\nSCOPE OF WORK:\n\nThe provider is asked to confirm the standee has arrived (tracking attached to this workorder) before visiting the location. Once confirmed, plan to visit the location, locate the pre-shipped theatrical standee for **Ice Age: Boiling Point**, build the display according to the attached instruction sheet, and place in a prominent location within the theatre lobby. We are requesting (2) installation photos, 1 showing the standee properly installed and 1 showing the placement in the theatre. Keep in mind we want to see the display from a distance so we can see what is around the display.\n\nThe average installer has completed the standee in **1-2 hours**, please plan accordingly. The Instruction Sheet can be downloaded from the link below, please familiarize yourself with it before heading to your locations.\n\nTHIS IS A CHALLENGING INSTALLATION, THE INSTRUCTIONS MUST BE REVIEWED AND UNDERSTOOD PRIOR TO VISITING THE LOCATION.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-19T12:00","end":"2026-10-30T22:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":6.98031