{"job":{"id":"3719020434","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"The Streets at Southpoint UPS Replacment Project","description":"2 techs Required After Hours<br><br>Techs to have 12 foot ladder<br><br>SCOPE:<br>- Techs to check in onsite with Mall Security (9195728808)<br>- Techs to call Renee Rhodes 401-955-6513 (if Teams Meeting invite was provided, log into meeting instead) and review full scope and proceed to first IDF<br>- At each IDF, techs to:<br>     - Locate the new UPS and battery in its shipping carton prestaged at each IDF by Mall Mnagement, unbox and insert battery into UPS (instructions attached)<br>     - Take before pictures of opened and closed IDF cabinet, a close up of the current UPS, and a picture of the Serial Number of the new UPS<br>     - Rejoin meeting or call Renee to verify current status of IDF before proceeding<br>     - Once approved, unplug IDF Power from current UPS and UPS cat6 from UPS management port to IDF switch port, leaving cabling in the IDF port<br>     - Remove Old UPS from cabinet<br>     - Install new UPS in cabinet and power up<br>     - Plug IDF power into new UPS<br>     - Connect UPS management port to IDF switch port using exisitng cat6 (if no exisitng cat6, coinnect new to IDF switch port 23)<br>     - Rejoin meeting or call Renee to verify status of IDF matches with previous check<br>     - Once verified, proceed to next IDF and repeat.<br><br>If any IDF requires a Lift, Mall will supply<br><br>List of IDFs in Scope:<br>Note: all MDF cabinets are recieving a 2200 sized UPS unit.  All IDFs are recieving a 1500 unit, unless proceeded by (2200) in the below list.<br>IDF06, IDF09, IDF11","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T08:00","end":"2026-11-12T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":22.6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","count