otective equipment (PPE), and transportation unless specifically stated otherwise within the work order.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. Property Damage</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Producer is responsible for exercising reasonable care while performing services. Any accidental damage to customer property, merchandise, fixtures, equipment, or facilities falls under Producers \"Assumption Of Risk\" (3) and must be reported to Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. Compliance with Customer Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to comply with all customer site rules, store policies, check-in procedures, and instructions provided by authorized customer representatives.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. Photographs &amp; Documentation</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to accurately complete all required documentation, photographs, signatures, and reporting before submitting this work order. Submission of false, incomplete, misleading, or altered information may result in non-payment and removal from future assignments.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Payment</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Payment is contingent upon:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Successful completion of the assigned scope of work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submission of all required documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Compliance with these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Changes to Scope</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer shall not perform additional work outside the authorized scope of work outlined by posting without prior approval from Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10. Confidentiality</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees not to disclose customer information, pricing, internal procedures, photographs, or proprietary information obtained during the course of the assignment.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">11. Insurance</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer represents that they maintain any insurance required by applicable law or by their Producer agreement and accepts responsibility for losses arising from their own acts or omissions to the extent permitted by law.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">12. No Employment Relationship</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Acceptance of this work order does not create an employment relationship, partnership, joint venture, or agency relationship between Producer and Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">13. Limitation of Liability</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finish Line Services LLC shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising from or related to the performance of this work order. Nothing in these terms limits liability where such limitation is prohibited by law.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">14. Indemnification</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To the extent permitted by applicable law, Producer agrees to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Finish Line Services LLC and its officers, employees, and clients from claims, damages, liabilities, costs, and expenses arising out of Producer's negligent acts, omissions, or breach of these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">15. Acknowledgement</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By accepting this work order, completing this work order, and submitting the completion report, Producer certifies that:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">They have personally completed the work described.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All information submitted is true and accurate.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All required photographs accurately depict the completed work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">They have read and agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work**We are seeking a reliable and professional technician to complete a retail display installation at a national retail location. The displays will have already been assembled and shipped to the store prior to your arrival.\n\n**MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE\\*\\*\\***\n\n<https://form.fillout.com/t/v5Rd4A88Kfus>\n\n**﻿Estimated Time on Site**Approximately **45–75 minutes**, depending on the store layout and display location.\n\nThe selected technician will be responsible for transporting the display from the store's receiving area to its designated sales floor location, completing the installation, documenting the completed work, and leaving the work area clean and professional.\n\n- Check in with store management upon arrival.\n- Locate the shipped display in the receiving area.\n- Inspect the display for any visible damage prior to installation.\n- Transport the display safely to the approved sales floor location.\n- Remove all protective packaging.\n- Position and level the display according to store management's direction.\n- Install any required display components or signage, if applicable.\n- Remove and properly dispose of all packaging and installation debris.\n- Take required before-and-after photographs.\n- Complete the required digital completion report before leaving the site.\n\n**Professionalism & Appearance**- Maintain a clean, neat, and professional appearance.\n- Wear a plain collared shirt (no offensive language, graphics, or competitor branding), long pants or clean work shorts, and closed-toe shoes.\n- Follow all retailer policies and directions provided by store management.\n- Maintain a clean and organized work area throughout the installation and remove all installation debris before leaving.\n- Use professional language and conduct yourself in a professional manner\n\n**Technician Requirements**- Be professional and customer-focused.\n- Must be able to lift up to 50lbs and maneuver in tight spaces.\n- Be comfortable working inside retail environments during business hours.\n- Be able to safely move retail display fixtures using store-provided equipment when available.\n- Have a smartphone capable of submitting photos and electronic documentation.\n- Have basic hand tools, including a utility knife.\n\n**What You'll Need**- Smartphone with camera\n- Utility knife\n- Closed-toe shoes\n- Ability to safely operate a pallet jack\n\n**Completion Requirements**To receive payment, technicians must:\n\n- Complete all assigned work.\n- Submit all required photographs.\n- Complete the digital work order on platform \\*\\*Installation reporting application will be sent upon acceptance\\*\\*\n\n**Important Information**- Work must be completed during the scheduled service window.\n- Displays must be installed only in the location approved by store management.\n- The work area must be left clean and free of all installation materials.\n- Professional appearance and communication are expected at all times.\n\n**\\*\\*\\* Installation Guide will be sent upon acceptance showing step-by-step instructions \\*\\*\\***\n\n**MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE\\*\\*\\***\n\n<https://form.fillout.com/t/v5Rd4A88Kfus>\n\n**\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\