{"job":{"id":"3378066195","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"LEGACY Retail Services","title":"2 Techs Required - Service Call for Menu Screens at Fast Food Restaurant","description":"<p>WORK DESCRIPTION: Please complete the check in and check out survey, if you don't have it, please call your CMS.</p><p>Please go to site with crimping tools, cable tester, universal tv remote control, extra HDMI cables, extra cat6 cables and replace the screens D \"231\" \"232\" \"233\" \"234\" (left to right, customer's view) in the Indoor menu board. Check the power, source and ethernet connections, verify the cables are not physically damaged and re-crimp them or re-end the cables if it's necessary. Follow the next network settings for the screen:</p><p><br></p><p>~~~231~~~</p><p>Screen IP: 192.168.30.231</p><p>Gateway: 192.168.30.1</p><p>Subnet: 255.255.255.0</p><p>DNS primary/secondary: 1.1.1.1/1.0.0.1</p><p><br></p><p>~~~232~~~</p><p>Screen IP: 192.168.30.232</p><p>Gateway: 192.168.30.1</p><p>Subnet: 255.255.255.0</p><p>DNS primary/secondary: 1.1.1.1/1.0.0.1</p><p><br></p><p>~~~233~~~</p><p>Screen IP: 192.168.30.233</p><p>Gateway: 192.168.30.1</p><p>Subnet: 255.255.255.0</p><p>DNS primary/secondary: 1.1.1.1/1.0.0.1</p><p><br></p><p>~~~234~~~</p><p>Screen IP: 192.168.30.234</p><p>Gateway: 192.168.30.1</p><p>Subnet: 255.255.255.0</p><p>DNS primary/secondary: 1.1.1.1/1.0.0.1</p><p><br></p><p>Device ID set number 1 for the screens Please make sure to have all the screens properly aligned. Install them together (left side or right side) Do not leave any visible cable. ***Important: Keep in mind additional troubleshooting may be required*** Call Coates for further assistance in regards the configuration</p><p><br></p><p>Expected time on site (Additional troubleshooting steps and additional on site may be required): 4-6 hours</p><p><br></p><p>LOCATION: Front Counter</p><p><br></p><p>When heading to site, TEXT BRANDPOING SUPPORT AT&nbsp;-&nbsp;(856) 382-2645. They will be your support 