{"job":{"id":20207241,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Site Activation/Turn -UP/ Test - VERIFY CONNECTIVITY WITH REMOTE TEAM /  MB1706632 MB1706630","description":{"html":"<p><em>THIS IS A HARD START - IT IS A HOT CUT OVER AND A BRIDGE CALL HAS BEEN SCHEDULED WITH MULTIPLE PARTIES --- DO NOT BE LATE </em></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><u><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></u><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\"><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></b></span></p><p><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b>Description of Problem: </b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system;\">***SITE ACTIVATION ONLY***</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"> </span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\">-If Necessary</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system;\">Equipment MUST be mounted in the customer rack - Escalate with Remote Engineer if there is not adequate space in the rack</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system;\">Communicate via Bridge or Hotline with Remote Engineer to cable equipment into correct ports.</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system;\">SOW: Complete installation and remote testing of the Circuit and the FortiGate device</span></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: -apple-system;\"> </span></span><br> <br/>Bridge Call Start Time:  10/27/2026 10:00 AM</b></p><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></b><p><br></p><ol><li>Activate circuit with remote support</li></ol><p><em>Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch including bridge line details, lcon info, and equipment information</em></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">Please bring a </span><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 5, 5);\">NEWER working Windows laptop (Win10 or higher) with a 1gb Ethernet port (or 1gb Ethernet dongle), a hotspot and team viewer already installed with the ability to log into a network device using a Console connection AND Ethernet connection. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31);\">This is required for all techs at the minimum. Preferably have ALL of the tools listed below in the Tool Requirements</span></p><p><strong><u>Tool Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>WIN10 or higher Laptop (No Mac laptops) – with1gb Ethernet connection, charger &amp; TeamViewer Installed</li><li>Hot Spot or Internet Dongle</li><li>Standard Tool Kit</li><li>Cell Phone - with Charger</li><li>Console Cable <span style=\"color: rgb(234, 5, 5);\">(Please see attached images for reference)</span></li><li>Spare Patch Cables &amp; Cabling Equipment (Rj45, Biscuits, Etc..)</li></ul><p><em>*Additional Tools Requested*</em></p><p> </p><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Photo ID required</li><li>Names of all technicians going to the site must be provided in advance</li><li>Check-in with site contacts representing <del>******* ******** ****** ************** *******</del></li><li>Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment</li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li><li>If PPE required: professional environment expecting professional conduct, clean work attire with appropriate PPE</li></ul>","markdown":"*THIS IS A HARD START - IT IS A HOT CUT OVER AND A BRIDGE CALL HAS BEEN SCHEDULED WITH MULTIPLE PARTIES --- DO NOT BE LATE*\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n﻿\n\n****Description of Problem:** \\*\\*\\*SITE ACTIVATION ONLY\\*\\*\\*  \n   \n-If Necessary  \nEquipment MUST be mounted in the customer rack - Escalate with Remote 