{"job":{"id":"2533969313","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Buchanan Technologies","title":"Replace old switch, Ladder required. reset AP, cameras and speakers to new switch","description":"<p>Please read this description carefully.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Full Description:</u></strong> </p><p>Need  a technician to assist with replacing an old Unifi switch. The technician will need the following: The appropriate tools to remove the old switch from the network rack and install the new one. A laptop to connect via Ethernet locally to the firewall in case we need to connect and troubleshoot on site. A ladder to reset existing equipment mounted on the ceiling or walls in order for the new switch to detect them. The property has four cameras and five speakers that will need to be reset and rejoined to the new network setup. The technician will be assisted by a remote tech who will provide admin access and guide the process. Must be done before salon opens. </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>NOTE*** If you are not the tech arriving at the site please acknowledge that and give the name and the # of who will be on site</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Deliverables:</u></strong></p><p>The following deliverables are required:</p><ul><li>Signed sign-off sheet</li><li>Pictures of all work performed</li></ul><p>Please be sure to read all information under \"Important\" in the Special Instructions section of this work order.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T07:30","end":"2026-10-21T09:30"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":4.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2