{"job":{"id":20207540,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Gap - Yealink Base Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"SOW:  Title: Please dispatch a tech to check the yealink phone<br/><br/>Description: Scope of work(SOW):<br/>Kindly try rebooting the Yealink phone by unplugging the network and power cables, then plugging them back in to see if they function properly. If not, would you please attempt a factory reset by following the steps below and report back to us on the outcome?<br/>\"- Press Menu Softkey.<br/>Go to Settings → Advanced, enter the phone password (admin or 475869)<br/>Select Reset to Factory option.<br/>The LCD screen will show the following prompt: \"Warning, Reset to Factory Setting\".<br/>Press OK to continue.\"<br/><br/>Tech need to check any last minute issues reported by Stores Voice or store managers Tech to confirm with Store manager of work completed/issue resolved, and check out by calling Stores Voice @ 800-333-7899, ext 66645<br/>    <br/>Required Tools:<br/>Basic Tools<br/>Telephony tools, including a buttset<br/>    <br/>Check in Requirements:<br/><br/>-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN<br/>-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app<br/>-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1<br/>-Tech to take before photo<br/>   <br/>While Onsite:<br/>    <br/>Checkout Requirements:<br/>-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)<br/>-Tech to take after photo<br/>    <br/>Deliverables:<br/>-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com<br/>-MOD email for Survey","markdown":"SOW: Title: Please dispatch a tech to check the yealink phone  \n  \nDescription: Scope of work(SOW):  \nKindly try rebooting the Yealink phone by unplugging the network and power cables, then plugging them back in to see if they function properly. If not, would you please attempt a factory reset by following the steps below and report back to us on the outcome?  \n\"- Press Menu Softkey.  \nGo to Settings → Advanced, enter the phone password (admin or 475869)  \nSelect Reset to Factory option.  \nThe LCD screen will show the following prompt: \"Warning, Reset to Factory Setting\".  \nPress OK to continue.\"  \n  \nTech need to check any last minute issues reported by Stores Voice or store managers Tech to confirm with Store manager of work completed/issue resolved, and check out by calling Stores Voice @ 800-333-7899, ext 66645  \n   \nRequired Tools:  \nBasic Tools  \nTelephony tools, including a buttset  \n   \nCheck in Requirements:  \n  \n-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN  \n-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app  \n-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1  \n-Tech to take before photo  \n   \nWhile Onsite:  \n   \nCheckout Requirements:  \n-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)  \n-Tech to take after photo  \n   \nDeliverables:  \n-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com  \n-MOD email for Survey","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T11:00","end":"2026-10-20T14:00","latestStart":"2026-10-20T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":57.195812022387074},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 22, 1:30 PM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $180\nRejected: pay