{"job":{"id":20208126,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PurTeraIT","title":"Back-Office 40\" TV + Flat mount install (Tech 1 of 2)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></strong>Seeking a technician experienced in mounting 40\"+ TVs/displays, including ceiling and pole mounts.</p><p>Task: Mount one 40\" TV on a ceiling/pole mount, connect it to Wi-Fi, and complete the activation script.</p><p>Time: Estimated onsite time: 2 hours.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Install one (1) 40\" TV with a ceiling/pole mount at the location the store owner selects. Secure the mount to ceiling joists or structural framing, route power to the nearest outlet, connect to Wi-Fi, and verify content is displaying properly.</p><p><br></p><p>Communicate with the work order manager in real time if anything comes up.</p><p><br></p><p>Confirm the mounting location with the store owner before drilling. If the ceiling cannot support the mount at the chosen location, call the work order manager to get approval on an alternate location.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Business casual; presentable for an active kitchen/commercial environment.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required</strong></p><p><br></p><p>6-8 ft ladder</p><p>6-8 ft extension cord</p><p>Drop cloths (mandatory to protect food prep areas)</p><p>Small vacuum/shop vac (mandatory for immediate dust cleanup)</p><p>Stud finder (joist-capable) and level (minimum 2 ft)</p><p>Cordless drill/driver with bits for ceiling joists and structural framing</p><p>Tape measure and basic hand tool kit</p><p>Second person to help lift the TV overhead (recommended)</p><p>Smartphone/tablet for photos and PurPulse check-ins</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Pre-Site Requirements</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Review all provided documentation and installation/activation scripts.</p><p>Call or text PurTera Dispatch upon arrival.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>On-Site Tasks</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Check in with the store owner or manager and confirm the mounting location before drilling.</p><p>Lay drop cloths before any cutting, drilling, or mounting, including directly below the work area.</p><p>Locate joists or structural framing and securely mount the ceiling plate or pole to them.</p><p>Route power to the nearest outlet; document any extension cord use as temporary.</p><p>Connect to store Wi-Fi and complete the activation script.</p><p>Take clear before-and-after photos of the equipment and work area.</p><p>Record the monitor serial number.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Work Order Title</strong></p><p><br></p><p>TV Mounting &amp; Wi-Fi Setup: Ceiling/Pole Mount (40\" Display)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required On-Site Deliverables</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Photo: TV powered on and displaying assigned content (required for payment)</p><p>Photo: Wide shot showing mounting location context</p><p>Photo: Legible serial number tag</p><p>Photo: Site left clean, with no debris or packaging</p><p>Data: Serial number, mounting location confirmed by owner, and SSID connected to</p><p>Confirmation: Installation script completed and activation verified</p><p>Signature: Store Manager signature, or documented reason if unavailable</p><p><br></p><p>Payment / Hours / Expenses Policy</p><p><br></p><p>Fixed fee: $150.00 flat rate.</p><p>Travel expenses must be submitted as a counter-offer when requesting the work.</p><p>Any additional hours must be requested and approved by the WO Manager before continuing work.</p><p>Parts: No out-of-pocket purchases; all hardware is shipped to site.</p><p>Revisits require a new work order unless caused by technician workmanship.</p><p>Clean up the work area and confirm completion with the onsite contact.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>TV Installation</strong></p><p><br></p><p>NOTE: The items are general guidelines; ensure you follow the manufacturer’s installation instructions.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools &amp; Materials</strong></p><p><br></p><p>· Stud finder (joist-capable)</p><p>· Drill + drill bits</p><p>· Screwdriver</p><p>· Level</p><p>· Tape measure</p><p>· Pencil</p><p>· Socket wrench (sometimes needed for lag bolts)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Inventory</strong></p><p><br></p><p>· Inventory items included in the TV box, should include the following:</p><p>· TV with stand (remove stand for mounting)</p><p>· Remote with two double AA batteries</p><p>· Power cord</p><p>· Ceiling/pole mount kit (shipped to site)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Locate Joists</strong></p><p><br></p><p>· Use a stud finder to locate ceiling joists or structural framing. Mark at least two joists. Your mount must anchor into joists or structural framing for safety.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Mark Mounting Holes</strong></p><p><br></p><p>· Hold the ceiling plate against the ceiling:</p><p>· Align it with the joists you marked</p><p>· Use a level to ensure it’s straight</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Mount the Ceiling Plate and Pole</strong></p><p><br></p><p>· Drive lag bolts through the ceiling plate and into the joists</p><p>· Tighten securely</p><p>· Double-check that the plate is level</p><p>· Attach the pole to the ceiling plate, then attach the mounting plate to the TV (with a second person holding the TV if possible)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Final Check</strong></p><p><br></p><p>· Ensure the TV is level</p><p>· Confirm it’s firmly attached to the pole</p><p>· Gently test stability</p>","markdown":"**Overview**\n\n**﻿**Seeking a technician experienced in mounting 40\"+ TVs/displays, including ceiling and pole mounts.\n\nTask: Mount one 40\" TV on a ceiling/pole mount, connect it to Wi-Fi, and complete the activation script.\n\nTime: Estimated onsite time: 2 hours.\n\n**Scope of Work**\n\nInstall one (1) 40\" TV with a ceiling/pole mount at the location the store owner selects. Secure the mount to ceiling joists or structural framing, route power to the nearest outlet, connect to Wi-Fi, and verify content is displaying properly.\n\nCommunicate with the work order manager in real time if anything comes up.\n\nConfirm the mounting location with the store owner before drilling. If the ceiling cannot support the mount at the chosen location, call the work order manager to get approval on an alternate location.\n\n**Dress Code**\n\nBusiness casual; presentable for an active kitchen/commercial environment.\n\n**Tools Required**\n\n6-8 ft ladder\n\n6-8 ft extension cord\n\nDrop cloths (mandatory to protect food prep areas)\n\nSmall vacuum/shop vac (mandatory for immediate dust cleanup)\n\nStud finder (joist-capable) and level (minimum 2 ft)\n\nCordless drill/driver with bits for ceiling joists and structural framing\n\nTape measure and basic hand tool kit\n\nSecond person to help lift the TV overhead (recommended)\n\nSmartphone/tablet for photos and PurPulse check-ins\n\n**Pre-Site Requirements**\n\nReview all provided documentation and installation/activation scripts.\n\nCall or text PurTera Dispatch upon arrival.\n\n**On-Site Tasks**\n\nCheck in with the store owner or manager and confirm the mounting location before drilling.\n\nLay drop cloths before any cutting, drilling, or mounting, including directly below the work area.\n\nLocate joists or structural framing and securely mount the ceiling plate or pole to them.\n\nRoute power to the nearest outlet; document any extension cord use as temporary.\n\nConnect to store Wi-Fi and complete the activation script.\n\nTake clear before-and-after photos of the equipment and work area.\n\nRecord the monitor serial number.\n\n**Work Order Title**\n\nTV Mounting & Wi-Fi Setup: Ceiling/Pole Mount (40\" Display)\n\n**Required On-Site Deliverables**\n\nPhoto: TV powered on and displaying assigned content (required for payment)\n\nPhoto: Wide shot showing mounting location context\n\nPhoto: Legible serial number tag\n\nPhoto: Site left clean, with no debris or packaging\n\nData: Serial number, mounting location confirmed by owner, and SSID connected to\n\nConfirmation: Installation script completed and activation verified\n\nSignature: Store Manager signature, or documented reason if unavailable\n\nPayment / Hours / Expenses Policy\n\nFixed fee: $150.00 flat rate.\n\nTravel expenses must be submitted as a counter-offer when requesting the work.\n\nAny additional hours must be requested and approved by the WO Manager before continuing work.\n\nParts: No out-of-pocket purchases; all hardware is shipped to site.\n\nRevisits require a new work order unless caused by technician workmanship.\n\nClean up the work area and confirm completion with the onsite contact.\n\n**TV Installation**\n\nNOTE: The items are general guidelines; ensure you follow the manufacturer’s installation instructions.\n\n**Tools & Materials**\n\n· Stud finder (joist-capable)\n\n· Drill + drill bits\n\n· Screwdriver\n\n· Level\n\n· Tape measure\n\n· Pencil\n\n· Socket wrench (sometimes needed for lag bolts)\n\n**Inventory**\n\n· Inventory items included in the TV box, should include the following:\n\n· TV with stand (remove stand for mounting)\n\n· Remote with two double AA batteries\n\n· Power cord\n\n· Ceiling/pole mount kit (shipped to site)\n\n**Locate Joists**\n\n· Use a stud finder to locate ceiling joists or structural framing. Mark at least two joists. Your mount must anchor into joists or structural framing for safety.\n\n**Mark Mounting Holes**\n\n· Hold the ceiling plate against the ceiling:\n\n· Align it with the joists you marked\n\n· Use a level to ensure it’s straight\n\n**Mount the Ceiling Plate and Pole**\n\n· Drive lag bolts through the ceiling plate and into the joists\n\n· Tighten securely\n\n· Double-check that the plate is level\n\n· Attach the pole to the ceiling plate, then attach the mounting plate to the TV (with a second person holding the TV if possible)\n\n**Final Check**\n\n· Ensure the TV is level\n\n· Confirm it’s firmly attached to the pole\n\n· Gently test stability","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T09:00","end":"2026-10-22T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":45.513639437885566},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792506000337}
{"job":{"id":20208136,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PurTeraIT","title":"Back-Office 40\" TV + Flat mount install (Tech 2 of 2)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></strong>Seeking a technician experienced in mounting 40\"+ TVs/displays, including ceiling and pole mounts.</p><p>Task: Mount one 40\" TV on a ceiling/pole mount, connect it to Wi-Fi, and complete the activation script.</p><p>Time: Estimated onsite time: 2 hours.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Install one (1) 40\" TV with a ceiling/pole mount at the location the store owner selects. Secure the mount to ceiling joists or structural framing, route power to the nearest outlet, connect to Wi-Fi, and verify content is displaying properly.</p><p><br></p><p>Communicate with the work order manager in real time if anything comes up.</p><p><br></p><p>Confirm the mounting location with the store owner before drilling. If the ceiling cannot support the mount at the chosen location, call the work order manager to get approval on an alternate location.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Business casual; presentable for an active kitchen/commercial environment.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required</strong></p><p><br></p><p>6-8 ft ladder</p><p>6-8 ft extension cord</p><p>Drop cloths (mandatory to protect food prep areas)</p><p>Small vacuum/shop vac (mandatory for immediate dust cleanup)</p><p>Stud finder (joist-capable) and level (minimum 2 ft)</p><p>Cordless drill/driver with bits for ceiling joists and structural framing</p><p>Tape measure and basic hand tool kit</p><p>Second person to help lift the TV overhead (recommended)</p><p>Smartphone/tablet for photos and PurPulse check-ins</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Pre-Site Requirements</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Review all provided documentation and installation/activation scripts.</p><p>Call or text PurTera Dispatch upon arrival.</p>