{"job":{"id":20209092,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity, Inc","title":"Poster Printer Troubleshooting - 408945","description":{"html":"<p>Call Direct: 888-443-4375 Option 0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>With as many open work orders currently on FN, there is a very long back order of requests. So if you call in they will work with you to get assigned.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\nJob Description:\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Job Description: Please dispatch a technician to replace the Carriage Unit and Carriage Motor on the Canon TM200 printer, test the printer with a poster print and poster board to confirm operation and troubleshoot any issues that persist.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Requirements(Skills/Tools): 12 Magnetic tip JIS #2 and small thin flathead screwdrivers required.</p>\n<p>Advanced Canon TM200 knowledge/Wide Format Printer(Poster) knowledge.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\nRequired Tools:\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>","markdown":"Call Direct: 888-443-4375 Option 0\n\nWith as many open work orders currently on FN, there is a very long back order of requests. So if you call in they will work with you to get assigned.\n\nJob Description: Job Description: Please dispatch a technician to replace the Carriage Unit and Carriage Motor on the Canon TM200 printer, test the pr