{"job":{"id":20192425,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Deploy and Test SIB","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Testing:</u></strong></p><p>Very IMPORTANT _ Call the POC and get site access. Confirm the equipment is located before calling <del>****</del> - if you are not able to gain access to the building OR the equipment within 10 minutes ESCALATE per the Prep guide </p><p><br></p><p>Check in with <del>****</del> Bridge Line/Remote Technical Services (Number in confidential section and tasks). </p><p><br></p><p>They will then send you an email to start an email chain where all technical support will be provided. If you have ANY non-technical issues, please call the same number, but all technical issues will be handled through email. If you don’t receive an email within 10 minutes, please contact <del>*******</del> at <del>************</del> and give them your work order #, so they can let the PM know. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>The techs must have laptops and work through email.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Event Name: Beauty Extra Colleagues Discount  </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Number of registers: 3 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 1 number: 12 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 1 MAC:  </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 2 number: 48 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 2 MAC: </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 3 number: 454 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 3 MAC: </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store Event Owner: Amgad Habib </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store Event Owner Mobile Number: 4122658688 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store / OPS Manager: Jenness Willey </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store / OPS Manager Mobile Number: 919-7412410</span></p><p><br></p><p>Technician to validate hardware for connectivity and performance.</p><p>Upon successful testing, equipment is handed off to Operations Manager/event designee.</p><p>Connection &amp; Verification:</p><ul><li>Allow 2–3 minutes for SIB to initialize.</li><li>LED indicators: Older SIB: Solid white - Newer SIB (60–83): Purple = connected, Amber = error.</li><li>Connect POS registers using CAT5 cables from the SIB LAN ports (1–4).</li><li>Do not use the Internet/WAN port.</li><li>Verify each register is online.</li><li>Repeat connection steps for all deployed registers.</li><li>Store is accountable for any lost or unreturned equipment.</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong><u>Required tools:</u></strong></p><p>Installation guide</p><p>Standard tool kit (screwdrivers, pliers, etc.)</p><p>USB PC Keyboard 104 key 008-0077710 or equivalent</p><p>Cellphone: With camera, phone charger, data plan, handsfree headset to communicate with <del>****</del>.</p><p>Checklist Pape: Printed out manager checklist to have the manager complete prior to leaving.</p><p>Computer to Email photos and checkout form to remote support.</p>","markdown":"**Testing:**\n\nVery IMPORTANT \\_ Call the POC and get site access. Confirm the equipment is located before calling \\*\\*\\*\\* - if you are not able to gain access to the building OR the equipment within 10 minutes ESCALATE per the Prep guide\n\nCheck in with \\*\\*\\*\\* Bridge Line/Remote Technical Services (Number in confidential section and tasks).\n\nThey will then send you an email to start an email chain where all technical support will be provided. If you have ANY non-technical issues, please call the same number, but all technical issues will be handled through email. If you don’t receive an email within 10 minutes, please contact \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and give them your work order #, so they can let the PM know.\n\n**The techs must have laptops and work through email.**\n\n﻿Event Name: Beauty Extra Colleagues Discount\n\nNumber of registers: 3\n\nRegister 1 number: 12\n\nRegister 1 MAC:\n\nRegister 2 number: 48\n\nRegister 2 MAC:\n\nRegister 3 number: 454\n\nRegister 3 MAC:\n\nStore Event Owner: Amgad Habib\n\nStore Event Owner Mobile Number: 4122658688\n\nStore / OPS Manager: Jenness Willey\n\nStore / OPS Manager Mobile Number: 919-7412410\n\nTechnician to validate hardware for connectivity and performance.\n\nUpon successful testing, equipment is handed off to Operations Manager/event designee.\n\nConnection & Verification:\n\n- Allow 2–3 minutes for SIB to initialize.\n- LED indicators: Older SIB: Solid white - Newer SIB (60–83): Purple = connected, Amber = error.\n- Connect POS registers using CAT5 cables from the SIB LAN ports (1–4).\n- Do not use the Internet/WAN port.\n- Verify each register is online.\n- Repeat connection steps for all deployed registers.\n- Store is accountable for any lost or unreturned equipment.\n\n**Required tools:**\n\nInstallation guide\n\nStandard tool kit (screwdrivers, pliers, etc.)\n\nUSB PC Keyboard 104 key 008-0077710 or equivalent\n\nCellphone: With camera, phone charger, data plan, handsfree headset to communicate with \\*\\*\\*\\*.\n\nChecklist Pape: Printed out manager checklist to have the manager complete prior to leaving.\n\nComputer to Email photos and checkout form to remote support.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T10:00","end":"2026-10-21T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":135},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":11.166385492457554},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 22, 1:30 PM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $135\nRejected: pay does not meet the alternative-date minimum."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Web Conference Interview Round - 1 | Desktop Engineer L1 | Raleigh NC - USA"},{"start":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Oil VW tepair"},{"start":"2026-10-23