{"job":{"id":20209227,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Comm-Works","title":"SBUX - Ipad Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>***PHOTO DELIVERABLES MUST BE REVIEWED PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE***</p><p><br></p><p>SCOPE OF WORK: Remove Existing ELO, Install iPad w/Mount</p><p>--Be prepared with a Phillips #2 screwdriver, a snipping/cutting tool, and cabling materials to replace/repair cabling as needed.</p><p>--Install guide attached and the new mounting equipment is sent to the site for technician.</p><p>--Remove existing ELO, install the iPad VESA mount onto the tri-arm, an iPad into the mounting case, and then add them all together with the charger to have an iPad DPM.</p><p>--Ensure ELO is boxed and labeled for return. Technician to take to FedEx to return ship.</p><p>--Ensure replacement iPad DPM installed and mounted.</p><p>--Ensure iPad DPM is connected to WAN, troubleshoot connection if needed.</p><p><br></p><p>CABLING DISPATCH EXPECTATIONS:</p><p>--If a new cable run is needed but can't be completed, call New Era.</p><p>--Technicians are expected to leave each area so that it looks like a new installation.&nbsp;</p><p>--If there are any questions about what is approved, please call New Era immediately to discuss.</p><p><br></p><p>NEW ERA CONTACT INFORMATION:</p><p>Dial in by phone</p><p><a href=\"tel:+16178650253,,158951459#\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(91, 95, 199);\"><u>+1 617-865-0253,,158951459#</u></a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(97, 97, 97);\"> United States, Boston</span></p><p><a href=\"https://dialin.teams.cloud.microsoft/e57ae107-6c61-474c-8ef2-f226dad63a43?id=158951459\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(91, 95, 199);\"><u>Find a local number</u></a></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(97, 97, 97);\">Phone conference ID: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\">158 951 459#</span></p><p><br></p><p>DELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 24 HOURS OF 