{"job":{"id":20209499,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Cable run from Switch to DLink","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p>\n<br />\n<p><br /></p>\n<br />\n<p>-<strong>Make sure to bring at least 78 ft (24 meters) of LAN cable</strong> to replace the cable connected from Port2 MS225 going to D link switch</p>\n<br />\n<p><br /></p>\n<br />\n<p>-Make sure that the cable will go through the conduit making the cable not exposed</p>\n<br />\n<p><br /></p>\n<br />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<br />\n<p>Please provide images of all work completed onsite.</p>\n<br />\n<p>Provide detailed close out notes including all work done onsite, any issues or delays, MOD's name, Support's name, and if a revisit is needed.</p>\n<br />\n<p>Must provided receipt or invoice for all expenses or materials</p>\n<br />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<br />\n<p><em>Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch.</em></p>\n<br />\n<p>Do not log multiple site visits on this work order.</p>\n<br />\n<p>Each site visit will require its own work order.</p>\n<br />\n<p>If a revisit is needed, close out this work order and contact Pivital ASAP to notify that a revisit will be required.</p>\n<br />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<br />\n<p><strong><u>Tool Requirement:</u></strong></p>\n<br />\n<ul>\n<li>300 Feet Cat 6 (Will be reimbursed up to $0.35 per/foot)</li>\n<li>RJ45 connectors (Will be reimbursed up to $0.50 per/connector)</li>\n<li>RJ45 crimping tool</li>\n<li>Wire stripper / Cable scissors</li>\n<li>Faceplates and Cat 6 jacks</li>\n<li>Cable/Continuity Tester</li>\n<li>8-10 foot Ladder</li>\n<li>Spare patch cables</li>\n<li>Zip ties / Velcro for cable management</li>\n<li>Standard Tool Kit - including flat and Phillips screwdrivers in various sizes and needle nose pliers</li>\n<li>Permanent marker</li>\n<li>Digital Camera/Phone</li>\n<li>Label maker</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<br />\n<p><strong><u>Site Requirements:</u></strong></p>\n<br />\n<ul>\n<li>Do Not Post Any Customer Photos On Social Media</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<br />\n<p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p>\n<br />\n<ul>\n<li>Government-issued photo ID required</li>\n<li>Names of all techs going to the site must be provided in advance</li>\n<li>Background check is required</li>\n<li>Check-in with site contacts representing&nbsp;<del>**************</del></li>\n<li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment</li>\n<li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li>\n<li>PPE – As Required by location</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n  \n  \n-**Make sure to bring at least 78 ft (24 meters) of LAN cable** to replace the cable connected from Port2 MS225 going to D link switch\n\n  \n  \n-Make sure that the cable will go through the conduit making the cable not exposed\n\n  \n  \n  \nPlease provide images of all work completed onsite.\n\n  \nProvide detailed close out notes including all work done onsite, any issues or delays, MOD's name, Support's name, and if a revisit is needed.\n\n  \nMust provided receipt or invoice for all expenses or materials\n\n  \n  \n*Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch.*\n\n  \nDo not log multiple site visits on this work order.\n\n  \nEach site visit will require its own work order.\n\n  \nIf a revisit is needed, close out this work order and contact Pivital ASAP to notify that a revisit will be required.\n\n  \n  \n**Tool Requirement:**\n\n  \n- 300 Feet Cat 6 (Will be reimbursed up to $0.35 per/foot)\n- RJ45 connectors (Will be reimbursed up to $0.50 per/connector)\n- RJ45 crimping tool\n- Wire stripper / Cable scissors\n- Faceplates and Cat 6 jacks\n- Cable/Continuity Tester\n- 8-10 foot Ladder\n- Spare patch cables\n- Zip ties / Velcro for cable management\n- Standard Tool Kit - including flat and Phillips screwdrivers in various sizes and needle nose pliers\n- Permanent marker\n- Digital Camera/Phone\n- Label maker\n\n  \n**Site Requirements:**\n\n  \n- Do Not Post Any Customer Photos On Social Media\n\n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all techs going to the site must be provided in advance\n- Background check is required\n- Check-in with site contacts representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire\n- PPE – As Required by location","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T14:00","end":"2026-10-20T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":35},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":57.8433210097577},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $35 (countered: $60) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summa