{"job":{"id":20159276,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"Printer Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>Dispenser's printer has a problem and needs to be replaced. EPC has shipped a replacement printer to the store via FedEx. Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff. A full, step-by-step guide (with pictures) is included in this WO after it is accepted.&nbsp;After replacing the printer, call EPC to confirm it is printing properly from card scans.</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span></p><p> Finally, ship the faulty printer back to EPC by dropping the package off at a FedEx location using the enclosed return shipping label.</p><p> </p><p> This ticket's schedule is based on the FedEx delivery time and EPC helpdesk hours.&nbsp;Tracking number for this printer is located in the ticket.</p>","markdown":"Dispenser's printer has a problem and needs to be replaced. EPC has shipped a replacement printer to the store via FedEx. Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff. A full, step-by-step guide (with pictures) is included in this WO after it is accepted. After replacing the printer, call EPC to confirm it is printing properly from card scans.\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.\n\n Finally, ship the faulty printer back to EPC by dropping the package off at a FedEx location using the enclosed return shipping label.\n\n This ticket's schedule is based on the FedEx delivery time and EPC helpdesk hours. Tracking number for this printer is located in the ticket.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-20T09:00","end":"2026-10-20T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-20T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":56.354227058923435},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/20/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Web Conference Interview Round - 1 | Desktop Engineer L1 | Raleigh NC - USA"},{"start":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Oil VW tepair"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 P