{"job":{"id":20211077,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Intelisite, LLC","title":"Camera Signal Troubleshooting - Greensboro","description":{"html":"<p>Scope of Work</p><p>Perform a survey and troubleshoot 1 camera that are currently not receiving a signal.</p><p>Inspect the camera, cabling, connectors, and associated network equipment.</p><p>Verify power and network connectivity to the camera.</p><p>Test the cable run to identify any possible cable, connection, or equipment issues.</p><p>Check the associated switches, ports, and network connections as needed.</p><p>Identify the cause of the signal loss and document the findings.</p><p>Provide recommendations for any necessary repairs or replacement parts.</p>","markdown":"Scope of Work\n\nPerform a survey and troubleshoot 1 camera that are currently not receiving a signal.\n\nInspect the camera, cabling, connectors, and associated network equipment.\n\nVerify power and network connectivity to the camera.\n\nTest the cable run to identify any possible cable, connection, or equipment issues.\n\nCheck the associated switches, ports, and network connections as needed.\n\nIdentify the cause of the signal loss and document the findings.\n\nProvide recommendations for any necessary repairs or replacement parts.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T09:00","end":"2026-10-28T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":59.811526962490724},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $140) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T