{"job":{"id":20211289,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"3V Infrastructure","title":"SWTCH Zerova Charger Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Must have experience repairing or installing EV charging stations</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Please follow the steps below for the affected chargers:</p><ol><li>Check in at leasing office and share that you're there on behalf of 3V Infrastructure to assist with the offline charger</li><li>Verify chargers are energized and powered on. <strong>Currently, all chargers are showing as offline.</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Inspect respective EV panel, verify position of breakers and capture photo of panel</li><li>Check the screen of each unit for any error codes, capture a photo to upload</li><li>Confirm if networking equipment is powered on, note any flashing LED lights</li><li>Return to the electrical panel to complete power cycle of all offline units and network connectivity equipment.</li><li>Call Work Order Manager to confirm chargers have reconnected before checking out</li></ol>","markdown":"**Must have experience repairing or installing EV charging stations**\n\nPlease follow the steps below for the affected chargers:\n\n1. Check in at leasing office and share that you're there on behalf of 3V Infrastructure to assist with the offline charger\n2. Verify chargers are energized and powered on. **Currently, all chargers are showing as offline.**\n3. Inspect respective EV panel, verify position of breakers and capture photo of panel\n4. Check the screen of each unit for any error codes, capture a photo to upload\n5. Confirm if networking equipment is powered on, note any flashing LED lights\n6. Return to the electrical panel to complete power cycle of all offline units and network connectivity equipment.\n7. Call Work Order Manager to confirm chargers have reconnected before checking out","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T09:00","end":"2026-10-21T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-21T15:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":9.664009202857434},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $65 (countered: $65) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Web Conference Interview Round - 1 | Desktop Engineer L1 | Raleigh NC - USA"},{"start":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Oil VW tepair"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":