neric ad exists behind initial ad, leave in place behind new ad install</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Install new top ad and bottom, panel magnet(s)</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Replace wipes if needed</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Provide any notes for context</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Old advertisement removed and discarded</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;New ad installed properly, kiosk wiped down, wipes replaced (if </p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Capturing current pictures of the kiosk after repair/adjustment made (kiosk needs to be in full view)</p><p><strong>Escalation Process:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with&nbsp;Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk via ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz</p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any issues or questions should be escalated to&nbsp;Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any issues or questions should be escalated to&nbsp;Terraboost Media Operations Coordinators support desk ; Email: installteam@terraboost.biz</p>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n● Seeking a technician with experience changing out physical advertisement/signage\n\n● Tech is required to remove existing advertisement, discard, and install new advertisement\n\n● Estimated duration will be 5-10 minutes per site\n\n**Dress Code: (**Casual Dress)\n\n● Casual pants such as jeans\n\n● Knee-length skirts in casual fabrics such as cotton\n\n● Shorts of appropriate length\n\n● Wrinkle-free and tidy T-shirts\n\n● Collared polo shirts or crew-neck sweaters\n\n● Clean athletic shoes\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n● Smartphone\n\n● Clean towel/paper towel\n\n● Replacement wipes (as needed)\n\n