{"job":{"id":20199768,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CallRevu","title":"VoIP Phone Installation - Southpoint Honda Hudson","description":{"html":"<p>We have a customer who is migrating to a new phone system. The project is on-going and we have set a date for the phone's to be cut over. You will be expected to check in with the Project Manager via phone call when you arrive on-site and when you leave the site.</p><p>You will assist in installing/racking a <strong>GWN 7003 Voice Router.</strong></p><p>You will work on unboxing and laying out phones<strong> 114 Yealink T34W phones on specified desks</strong>. You will also be ensuring the phones are plugged in and are functional. </p><p>This project also has analog aspects including faxing and paging hook ups.</p><p>There may also be a need for assistance in troubleshooting cabling, network connections, analog connections, or testing equipment.</p><p>The number port is scheduled for early morning following your installation date. We expect all phones are plugged in and working prior to the port. <strong><u>You are expected to be on-site on the next day for about 1 hour.</u></strong></p>","markdown":"We have a customer who is migrating to a new phone system. The project is on-going and we have set a date for the phone's to be cut over. You will be expected to check in with the Project Manager via phone call when you arrive on-site and when you leave the site.\n\nYou will assist in installing/racking a **GWN 7003 Voice Router.**\n\nYou will work on unboxing and laying out phones **114 Yealink T34W phones on specified desks**. You will also be ensuring the phones are plugged in and are functional.\n\nThis project also has analog aspects including faxing and paging hook ups.\n\nThere may also be a need for assistance in troubleshooting cabling, network connections, analog connections, or testing equipment.\n\nThe number port is scheduled for early morning following your installation date. We expect all phones are plugged in and working prior to the port. **You are expected to be on-site on the next day for about 1 hour.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T17:30","end":"2026-10-26T23:30"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":480},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":80,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":11.84401619860755},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":80,"baseAmount":480,"estHours":6,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T18:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974912-Red Wolf Crossing-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   T