{"job":{"id":"1768899843","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Pilot Services, Inc.","title":"T/S Jack for phone","description":"<p>CALL INTO DISPATCH UPON ARRIVAL/DEPARTURE AT 888-745-6898 OPT 2. </p><p><br></p><p>Reference number: T20261020.0101</p><p><br></p><p>Please arrive 5-10 mins early. If checking in before 7am or checking out after 6pm CT please dial \"0\" to be transferred to the on-call person.</p><p><br></p><p>DATE: 10/27/2026 11:00 AM *(I am flexible with date and time - what ever works with your scheduled)</p><p><br></p><p>1. SCOPE:</p><p><br></p><p>Troubleshoot non-working jack/cabling for VoIP phone. Site contact advised that jacks were recently replaced in building, so it's possible that this jack/run was not terminated to the Meraki switch (jack does not currently provide PoE or connectivity). </p><p><br></p><p>Phone registers to ext and works when plugged into other jack.</p><p><br></p><p>POC Kristin Hoell</p><p>IT Suppory Steve Dorsey 215-826-2927</p><p><br></p><p>2. DELIVERABLES: Photos are needed before/after completed work upload photos on the platform</p><p><br></p><p>- Photos of before/after completed work</p><p>- Description of the work that was completed including name of ENG and LCON</p><p>- Materials used</p><p>- Signed work order</p><p><br></p><p>3. REQUIRED STANDARD TOOLS: Butt set, toner, basic hand tools, crimpers, laptop, 300ft CAT6, 8ft ladder, jacks, loopback cable and Cisco console cable</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Tech must get pre-approval PRIOR TO DOING ANY WORK OUTSIDE OF ABOVE LISTED SCOPE.</p><p><br></p><p>By accepting this ticket, it is the expectation of Pilot GT, the work will be completed by the resources accepting the ticket, not a party working on their behalf.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>PILOT Global Technologies </p><p>1891 Bay Scott Cir, STE 109</p><p>Naperville, IL 60540</p><p>PHONE: 888-745-6898</p><p><br></p><p>EMAIL: </p><p>SERVICE@pilotgt.com</p><p>BILLING@PILOTGT.COM - All invoices must include the service address, service date(s), and our work order (PO) number. For toll reimbursement, please provide a receipt or screenshot that clearly shows the toll charge along with the date and time of the transaction.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T11:00","end":"2026-10-27T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":90},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":54.4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $90 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792531300932}
{"job":{"id":20213189,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Old Navy - Network Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>Check In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)</p>\n<p>-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN</p>\n<p>-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app</p>\n<p>-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Tech must call GTI at 800-869-8490, to confirm scope listed below to be completed:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Title: Circuit Outage for L1 checks</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please dispatch a tech to do L1 checks for ISP2 circuit down issue at the store.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>We are seeing Interface connecting to modem from port 2 on Palo Alto towards modem is down.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech will need to troubleshoot with GTI team at 800-869-8490</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Please ensure the tech has all of the required equipment. E.G Laptop + internet +cable +cable tester + console cable.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech has to call GTI when at site and tech able to contact on mail GTI-Store-Network-Support-DG@gap.com</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech has to bring a working laptop with the updated driver, console cable, Cat5 cables, cable tester, and internet dongle.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech need to perform the L1 troubleshooting APC, Router, modems, and check cables</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Required Tools:</p>\n<p>Basic Tools</p>\n<p>working laptop with the updated driver</p>\n<p>Console Cables</p>\n<p>Cat5 Cable</p>\n<p>Cable tester</p>\n<p>Internet dongle</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)</p>\n<p>-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN</p>\n<p>-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app</p>\n<p>-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Tech must call GTI at 800-869-8490, to confirm scope to be complete.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>While Onsite:</p>\n<p>- Tech to perform Health Check with GTI at 800-869-8490. If GTI is not available, you may perform the Health check with Spencer Support at (877-541-0547, opt 2</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Checkout Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)</p>\n<p>-Tech to take after photo, and submit with before to Service.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Deliverables:</p>\n<p>-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com</p>\n<p>-MOD email for Survey</p>","markdown":"Check In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)\n\n-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN\n\n-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app\n\n-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1\n\n-Tech must call GTI at 800-869-8490, to confirm scope listed below to be completed:\n\nTitle: Circuit Outage for L1 checks\n\nPlease dispatch a tech to do L1 checks for ISP2 circuit down issue at the store.\n\nWe are seeing Interface connecting to modem from port 2 on Palo Alto towards modem is down.\n\nTech will need to troubleshoot with GTI team at 800-869-8490\n\nPlease ensure the tech has all of the required equipment. E.G Laptop + internet +cable +cable tester + console cable.\n\nTech has to call GTI when at site and tech able to contact on mail GTI-Store-Network-Support-DG@gap.com\n\nTech has to bring a working laptop with the updated driver, console cable, Cat5 cables, cable tester, and internet dongle.\n\nTech need to perform the L1 troubleshooting APC, Router, modems, and check cables\n\nRequired Tools:\n\nBasic Tools\n\nworking laptop with the updated driver\n\nConsole Cables\n\nCat5 Cable\n\nCable tester\n\nInternet dongle\n\nCheck In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)\n\n-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN\n\n-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app\n\n-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1\n\n-Tech must call GTI at 800-869-8490, to confirm scope to be complete.\n\nWhile Onsite:\n\n\\- Tech to perform Health Check with GTI at 800-869-8490. If GTI is not available, you may perform the Health check with Spencer Support at (877-541-0547, opt 2\n\nCheckout Requirements:\n\n-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)\n\n-Tech to take after photo, and submit with before to Service.\n\nDeliverables:\n\n-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com\n\n-MOD email for Survey","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T11:00","end":"2026-10-21T15:00","latestStart":"2026-10-21T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":12.428145955906416},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 22, 1:30 PM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $240\nRejected: pay does not meet the alternative-date minimum."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T21:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-22T1