{"job":{"id":20213977,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Lounge TV Offline – Connectivity Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p>Lounge TV Offline – Connectivity Troubleshoot</p>\n<p><em>Need tech on site to troubleshoot Associate Lounge TV - Moodmedia player for connectivity issue between Associate Lounge TV - Moodmedia player and VEN1 port 20 or 21 in the electrical/server room or IDF room in the Manager office.</em></p>\n<p><em>Tech will need a network line tester/toner and termination kit</em></p>\n<p><em>Mood Media player should be plugged into VEN1 switch / Port 20 or 21 per TJX SD</em></p>\n<p><em>Tech will need to call TJX HD at <del>************* **** ** **** ** **** * ** ******* ** ** *******</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>** ********* ******* ** ******* ****** **** ********* ******** **** ******* ** ************* **** ** **** *</del></em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em><del>**** ******** **** *******</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>******** *******************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Clients present issue: Lounge TV - Moodmedia player - Offline</em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 Hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Part shipped to the site? No</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Required Tool List:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><strong>Completion Requirements:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Closing Notes are required to be provided before leaving the location.</em></strong> <em>These notes should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only.&nbsp;If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be</em> <strong><em>a detailed and concise statement about the work performed</em></strong><em>.</em><strong><em>Please do not inc