{"job":{"id":20214636,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Highsource","title":"Lonovo/IBM X86 Server Replace CMOS Battery","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><ol><li>We will ship the some parts to your house, and you need bring the them to customer site.</li><li>Find out the room#, rack# and machine located rack unit# &nbsp;( details in the action plan)</li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">Pre-check</strong>: don’t take any action but take pictures for mode &amp; SN &amp; faulted parts (details and location in the action plan), &nbsp;and send to remote team.</li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">MUST NOT Replace the parts without remote approval</strong> in WhatsApp.</li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">Physical Replacement: </strong>Replace the faulted parts. parts (details in the action plan).</li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">Onsite Verification</strong>: take the pictures for the installed parts and the front whole picture( verify the parts amber light off, the server amber light off) </li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">Remote Verification</strong>: pls standby at site, our customer will do the remote check from their side.</li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">Service Report: </strong>Sign off the service report and get back to us.</li><li><strong style=\"color: red;\">Leave site</strong>: FE are not allowed to leave site unless get approval from remote team.&nbsp;</li></ol>","markdown":"1. We will ship the some parts to your house, and you need bring the them to customer site.\n2. Find out the room#, rack# and machine located rack unit# ( details in the action plan)\n3. **Pre-check**: don’t take any action but take pictures for mode & SN & faulted parts (details and location in the action plan), and send to remote team.\n4. **MUST NOT Replace the parts without remote approval** in WhatsApp.\n5. **Physical Replacement:** Replace the faulted parts. parts (details in the action plan).\n6. **Onsite Verification**: take the pictures for the installed parts and the front whole picture( verify the parts amber light off, the server amber light off)\n7. **Remote Verification**: pls standby at site, our customer will do the remote check from their side.\n8. **Service Report:** Sign off the service report and get back to us.\n9. **Leave site**: FE are not allowed to leave site unless get approval from remote team.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-25T22:00","end":"2026-10-25T23:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":8.382749125110067},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $50 (countered: $60) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"On-site Technician Required - Barrier