{"job":{"id":20215064,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Protel Services, Inc","title":"Seymour Johnson AFB","description":{"html":"<p>We are looking for a tech to dispatch to Seymour Johnson AFB to assist us to troubleshoot a switch that's down. The switch that is down is at the Mustang Tap Room in building 3705. The switch is a cisco 3850 24-port switch. We will need the tech to bring his laptop and cisco console cables and any usb to console adapter needed to console into this switch. Then we can Anydesk to your laptop to check the switch config. Davion Smith will be the local contact once they tech arrives.</p><p>IMPORTANT: Since this work is on a military base, please have a real ID and valid drivers license and proof of vehicle insurance so you will be able to get on base. Must be able to pass a background check to get on the military base. Once you arrive at the visitors center, please call us at 866-632-6113 and we will get you on base.</p>","markdown":"We are looking for a tech to dispatch to Seymour Johnson AFB to assist us to troubleshoot a switch that's down. The switch that is down is at the Mustang Tap Room in building 3705. The switch is a cisco 3850 24-port switch. We will need the tech to bring his laptop and cisco console cables and any usb to console adapter needed to console into this switch. Then we can Anydesk to your laptop to check the switch config. Davion Smith will be the local contact once they tech arrives.\n\nIMPORTANT: Since this work is on a military base, please have a real ID and valid drivers license and proof of vehicle insurance so you will be able to get on base. Must be able to pass a background check to get on the military base. Once you arrive at the visitors center, please call us at 866-632-6113 and we will get you on base.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T10:00","end":"2026-10-22T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":280},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHour