{"job":{"id":20213651,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Scarsdale Security Systems Inc","title":"Scarsdale Ticket #841913 - Zone 509 false alarms, Rear Door serial # 01489690,  Replace transmitter program and get zone restored to normal.. Please relocate transmitter and add external contact to the door. Work with SSS to verify normal operation","description":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Zone 509 false alarms, Rear Door serial # 01489690, Replace transmitter program and get zone restored to normal.. Please relocate transmitter and add external contact to the door. Work with SSS to verify normal operation.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>**IMPORTANT** In order for technician to get paid, a SIGNED SERVICE TICKET must also be returned with ticket notes. THIS IS THE CUSTOMER'S EXPECTATION</strong></li>\n<li><strong>﻿YOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS IN THE CONFIDENTIAL INFO SECTION OF THIS WORK ORDER !! Thank You.</strong></li>\n<li>IF A PART NEEDS TO BE REPLACED, DOCUMENT THE MAKE, MODEL AND SERIAL NUMBER OF DEVICE. PROVIDE NOTES AS TO WHY PART MUST BE REPLACED. UPLOAD PICTURE TO WORK ORDER.</li>\n<li>RECEIVING / Security Systems / Burglar - Door Contact / Door Contact Problem / The location of the doors and receiving it is a one pin contact. We have had false alarms by the police dispatched twice when the wind hits the door we need a better contact. W</li>\n<li>FOR SYSTEM ON-TEST OR TECHNICAL SUPPORT WHEN ON SITE CALL 914-722-2933 BETWEEN 8 AM AND 7:30 PM EST MON - FRI.</li>\n<li>**BEFORE LEAVING SITE*** Technician MUST email notes/resolution to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com OR call 914-722-2933 and speak to one of our National Account Team Members</li>\n<li>***IMPORTANT** If a part needs to be replaced DOCUMENT the make, model, serial #. MUST PROVIDE NOTES as to WHY the part needs replaced (I.E. Damaged? Physically missing? Remodeling? Provide these DETAILS and upload picture to work order and/or email to nationalservice@sc