{"job":{"id":20215174,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ASAP IT Resource Group","title":"Starlink Survey","description":{"html":"<p><strong>We are a Professional Dish Installation Company for DISH Network, DIRECTV, HughesNet, Viasat and StarLink and only work with experienced Dish Antenna / Starlink Installers. These are commercial rooftop installations so if heights is an issue please don't request this ticket.</strong></p><p>I need to get a rooftop survey done. Need to know if a lift is needed, if there is a view without obstructions, where we can mount and how we need to mount being a sled or J-Mount and is there an existing penetration we can use with a cable path that get us to the endpoint. Need photos of the MDF and potential areas to mount the equipment.</p><p><strong>Provider must have WhatsApp on their phone and be willing to use it to communicate with the NOC.</strong></p><p><strong>Provider must also have the Starlink App to run the Obstruction Test.</strong></p>","markdown":"**We are a Professional Dish Installation Company for DISH Network, DIRECTV, HughesNet, Viasat and StarLink and only work with experienced Dish Antenna / Starlink Installers. These are commercial rooftop installations so if heights is an issue please don't request this ticket.**\n\nI need to get a rooftop survey done. Need to know if a lift is needed, if there is a view without obstructions, where we can mount and how we need to mount being a sled or J-Mount and is there an existing penetration we can use with a cable path that get us to the endpoint. Need photos of the MDF and potential areas to mount the equipment.\n\n**Provider must have WhatsApp on their phone and be willing to use it to communicate with the NOC.**\n\n**Provider must also have the Starlink App to run the Obstruction Test.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T09:00","end":"2026-11-03T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"