{"job":{"id":20208506,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity Tech Solutions","title":"New Location Setup- Revisit","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Overview:</u></strong> </p><p>This is a revisit.  The areas that need completed are:</p><p>Finish setting up the tv in the customer waiting area. Previous issues were reported with the mini PC located behind the tv.  Review runbook</p><ul><li>Start by turning the tv and pc off and then turning them back on.  Try doing this 5-10 times.  This might end up resetting it.  If so, you will see the Dreamfinders homepage. If this does not work, reset the cradlepoint. Give it a few minutes then turn everything off and on again.</li><li>Check HDMI settings</li><li>Check static IP</li><li>Please disregard the section that asks you to download a file. You do not need to run a batch file. This step is only required if your player has display issues. It comes preconfigured and should automatically display required content. Please reach out to your WO manager if this is an issue</li><li>Once the tv is fully set up, you will see the Dreamfinders homepage and will be able to navigate by touchscreen. If this does not happen, then the set up is not complete.</li><li>if none of this works, please contact the work order manager and she will put you in contact with the IT Support. </li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>***<strong>Read Runbook</strong>. If you cannot find the answer there, then contact the work order manager</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Local contact: </strong><del>******* *********************</del></p><p><strong>Before arriving to site:</strong></p><ul><li>Review Runbook</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>On site Tasks:</strong></p><ul><li>Check in with work order manager</li><li>Check in with local contact</li><li>Mount TV- be sure the overlay is firmly attached and apply extra 3M tape if needed</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">This will get set up in the garage – customer waiting area – 55 inch tv with tv – hdmi connected to micro dongle to layover and wireless keyboard/mouse</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">batch file – already provided – change to the existing community site – change the url to the correct community name</li><li>Install 2 wireless cameras</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">1 at the front door and one at the door into the garage/office.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">These are solar powered, so make sure that they are in an appropriate spot.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">The other two can be installed if the site requires. If they are installed inside and need power, please make sure the installation is tidy and there are no stretched or dangling cables.</li><li>Signoff sheet filled out prior to leaving. Must have manager sign.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(31, 73, 125);\"><u>Final Validation </u></strong></p><ul><li>Verify all devices are online and reachable</li><li>Confirm Micro PC, touchscreen, and input devices function properly</li><li>Validate printer operation</li><li>&nbsp;Confirm camera live feed and recording</li><li>Run final Cradle point speed test</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Materials:</strong></p><p>Industrial Velcro</p><p>L-brackets</p><p>anchors</p><p>lag bolts</p><p>black 3m tape</p><p>Alcohol prep pads</p><p>Basic Hand Tools</p><p>power strips</p><p>Laptop w/hotspot</p><p>Console cable</p><p>CAT6 Cabling</p><p>Ladder</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul><li>Pictures of the devices before install</li><li>Pictures before work</li><li>Pictures of all completed work</li><li>Signoff sheet with site contact initialing all areas</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\nThis is a revisit. The areas that need completed are:\n\nFinish setting up the tv in the customer waiting area. Previous issues were reported with the mini PC located behind the tv. Review runbook\n\n- Start by turning the tv and pc off and then turning them back on. Try doing this 5-10 times. This might end up resetting it. If so, you will see the Dreamfinders homepage. If this does not work, reset the cradlepoint. Give it a few minutes then turn everything off and on again.\n- Check HDMI settings\n- Check static IP\n- Please disregard the section that asks you to download a file. You do not need to run a batch file. This step is only required if your player has display issues. It comes preconfigured and should automatically display required content. Please reach out to your WO manager if this is an issue\n- Once the tv is fully set up, you will see the Dreamfinders homepage and will be able to navigate by touchscreen. If this does not happen, then the set up is not complete.\n- if none of this works, please contact the work order manager and she will put you in contact with the IT Support.\n\n\\*\\*\\***Read Runbook**. If you cannot find the answer there, then contact the work order manager\n\n**Local contact:** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Before arriving to site:**\n\n- Review Runbook\n\n**On site Tasks:**\n\n- Check in with work order manager\n- Check in with local contact\n- Mount TV- be sure the overlay is firmly attached and apply extra 3M tape if needed\n- This will get set up in the garage – customer waiting area – 55 inch tv with tv – hdmi connected to micro dongle to layover and wireless keyboard/mouse\n- batch file – already provided – change to the existing community site – change the url to the correct community name\n- Install 2 wireless cameras\n- 1 at the front door and one at the door into the garage/office.\n- These are solar powered, so make sure that they are in an appropriate spot.\n- The other two can be installed if the site requires. If they are installed inside and need power, please make sure the installation is tidy and there are no stretched or dangling cables.\n- Signoff sheet filled out prior to leaving. Must have manager sign.\n\n**Final Validation**\n\n- Verify all devices are online and reachable\n- Confirm Micro PC, touchscreen, and input devices function properly\n- Validate printer operation\n- Confirm camera live feed and recording\n- Run final Cradle point speed test\n\n**Materials:**\n\nIndustrial Velcro\n\nL-brackets\n\nanchors\n\nlag bolts\n\nblack 3m tape\n\nAlcohol prep pads\n\nBasic Hand Tools\n\npower strips\n\nLaptop w/hotspot\n\nConsole cable\n\nCAT6 Cabling\n\nLadder\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n- Pictures of the devices before install\n- Pictures before work\n- Pictures of all completed work\n- Signoff sheet with site contact initialing all areas","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T10:00","end":"2026-10-26T13:00","latestStart":"2026-10-26T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":150},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":25.37780049397302},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00740402 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"On-site Technician Required - Barrier Gate Part Replacement"},{"start":"2026-10-16T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: 00736667 - ATT SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792591218682}
