{"job":{"id":20216157,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SISL Infotech (US) Inc","title":"L1/L2 Dispatch natwork resource required | Wake Forest\tNC\t27587","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>SLA Support required: </u></strong></p><p><strong>Same Business Day (SBD)</strong></p><p><strong>Next Business Day (NBD)</strong></p><p><strong>P1 / 24×7 Requests: Support will be provided within 4 hours</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;<u>Resourcing requirement: </u></strong>Unnamed Dispatch Model- L1 &amp; L2 Network resources</p><p><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work: </u></strong>Please find below the generic scope of work.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>we need network FSO dispatch support for Club,</li><li>Provide hands &amp; feet support for in-scope network device including Cisco LAN switches, SD-WAN devices, Wireless Access Points, Ubiquiti wireless mesh devices, and firewalls.</li><li>Provide hands &amp; feet support, Break-Fix Support IMACD support, Wi-Fi surveys, Network Site Survey reports, structured cabling support, network device upgrades, and network installation/deployment support as applicable to approved tickets.</li></ul><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong></p><p>All defined prerequisites items required for site access must be available and carried to customer site. In absence of any below listed item, access to site will not be granted and the work order will be cancelled simultaneously without further notice.&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>REQUIREMENTS/EXPECTATIONS</u></strong></p><ul><li>Timely Arrival.</li><li>Please provide required pictures in the whatsapp group with remote team .</li><li>Please provide check in check out time in the whatsapp group .</li><li>Constant communication with backend team via bridge.</li></ul><p><strong><u>POST-SITE</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>REQUIRED DELIVERABLES</u></strong></p><ul><li>Completed excel data sheet.</li><li>Pictures of the IT equipment at site.</li></ul><p><str