ant communication with backend team via bridge.\n\n**POST-SITE**\n\n**REQUIRED DELIVERABLES**\n\n- Completed excel data sheet.\n- Pictures of the IT equipment at site.\n\n**ESCALATIONS**\n\n- All escalations to be directed to remote bridge line\n\n**ADDITIONAL HOURS & EXPENSES APPROVAL PAYMENT POLICY::**\n\n- Unexpected expenses, such as parking fees, may be paid, ONLY if a receipt is submitted in the Field Nation App, and communicated to the Work Order Manager upon arrival to the work site.\n- Travel expenses such as mileage will not be paid when submitted upon completion of a work order. Any travel expenses must be included with a counteroffer to be eligible for consideration.\n- Additional hours will only be paid with prior approval from the Work Order Manager.\n- View Less","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T08:00","end":"2026-10-26T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":30,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":11.305258204253406},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":60,"baseAmount":480,"estHours":8,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00: