{"job":{"id":20216358,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"VCI","title":"Phone tech","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><p>We need tech to troubleshoot phones in rooms. Tech must have Butt set and rj11 connectors also windows laptop with ethernet adaptor, serial connectors and all necessary equipment to troubleshoot the phones. Also, tech must have knowledge of 66/110 blocks. Tech should have ultraviewer installed on his computer for remote access.</p><p>Any job more than 6 hours, 30 mins of lunch time will be deducted.</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Tech must have 1 year of cabling experience and have basic tools for the job.</li><li>Follow all instructions in the work order, write all work done, take pictures, and upload to the Field Nation, have the client sign the work order.</li><li>Tech has to call the number in the work order to check in and check-out.</li><li>Work Order has to include the check-in and check-out times and be signed by the client at the location to get paid. Upload signed work order to Field Nation Platform.</li><li>Wear appropriate attire and follow all safety regulations.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"We need tech to troubleshoot phones in rooms. Tech must have Butt set and rj11 connectors also windows laptop with ethernet adaptor, serial connectors and all necessary equipment to troubleshoot the phones. Also, tech must have knowledge of 66/110 blocks. Tech should have ultraviewer installed on his computer for remote access.\n\nAny job more than 6 hours, 30 mins of lunch time will be deducted.\n\n- Tech must have 1 year of cabling experience and have basic tools for the job.\n- Follow all instructions in the work order, write all work done, take pictures, and upload to the Field Nation, have the client sign the work order.\n- Tech has to call the number in the work order to check in and check-out.\n- Work Order has to include the check-in and check-out times and be signed by the client at the location to get paid. Upload signed work or