{"job":{"id":20217358,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Intelligent Communication Solutions","title":"Tech to install UPS for 10mb circuit (part onsite) ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in Low Voltage Cabling/Troubleshooting.</li><li>Tech is required to have Networking/Cabling/POS/KDS/Printer Experience</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1-2 Hours.</li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code: </strong></p><ul><li>Pants</li><li>shirts</li><li>work shoes (non-slip preferred)</li><li>nothing offensive</li></ul><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong><em> </em></p><ul><li><em> </em>Screw divers</li><li>Crimpers</li><li>punch down</li><li>scissors</li><li>toners</li><li>cable certifier preferred</li><li>RJ 45 mod plugs</li><li>Cat5/Cat6 Data Jack</li><li>Surface Mount and or Single/Double Port Keystone Plates.</li><li>Cay5/6 Patch cords 3- 7 foot</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Tech to install new UPS for 10mb circuit (part onsite)&nbsp;</p><p>Remote tech will go over scope of work in depth. (Techs are prohibited from posting on social media about the sites they are working on for ICS, as this could inadvertently reveal sensitive information)</p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks </em></strong></p><ol><li>Must call <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***</del></span> to check in onsite <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*************</del></span></li><li>Connect with remote tech when onsite walk though scope of work in depth&nbsp;</li><li>Work with remote tech to troubleshoot and fix/repair problem&nbsp;</li><li>Check out with Manager on duty (MOD), to ensure device is working properly</li><li>Must get MOD name for remote tech</li><li>Must provide details of work completed to remote techs during the checkout of site call&nbsp;</li><li>Must call <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***</del></span> to check out of onsite <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*************</del></span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables </em></strong></p><ol><li>&nbsp;Must obtain signature of MOD once work completed&nbsp;</li><li>Photos of completed scope of work - based on remote tech request</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong>Escalation Process: </strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, please call<del> *** </del>at <del>************</del></li><li>Any issues or questions while onsite should be escalated to Remote Tech</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy </strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Low Voltage Cabling/Troubleshooting.\n- Tech is required to have Networking/Cabling/POS/KDS/Printer Experience\n- Estimated duration will be 1-2 Hours.\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Pants\n- shirts\n- work shoes (non-slip preferred)\n- nothing offensive\n\n·\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- Screw divers\n- Crimpers\n- punch down\n- scissors\n- toners\n- cable certifier preferred\n- RJ 45 mod plugs\n- Cat5/Cat6 Data Jack\n- Surface Mount and or Single/Double Port Keystone Plates.\n- Cay5/6 Patch cords 3- 7 foot\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nTech to install new UPS for 10mb circuit (part onsite)\n\nRemote tech will go over scope of work in depth. (Techs are prohibited from posting on social media about the sites they are working on for ICS, as this could inadvertently reveal sensitive information)\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Must call \\*\\*\\* to check in onsite \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n2. Connect with remote tech when onsite walk though scope of work in depth\n3. Work with remote tech to troubleshoot and fix/repair problem\n4. Check out with Manager on duty (MOD), to ensure device is working properly\n5. Must get MOD name for remote tech\n6. Must provide details of work completed to remote techs during the checkout of site call\n7. Must call \\*\\*\\* to check out of onsite \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Must obtain signature of MOD once work completed\n2. Photos of completed scope of work - based on remote tech request\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, please call \\*\\*\\* at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Any issues or questions while onsite should be escalated to Remote Tech\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n-","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T08:45","end":"2026-10-22T10:45","latestStart":"2026-10-22T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":90,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":3.0177242243050015},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"📅 Requested schedule unavailable; a later date was considered.\nAlternative: Oct 23, 3:00 PM (Eastern)\n💸 Alternative-date minimum: $300 · listed maximum: $180\nRejected: pay does not meet the alternative-date minimum."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fair festival"},{"start":"2026-10-23T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z",