{"job":{"id":20211582,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Processing 3 camera, Troubleshoot.","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Scope of Work:</em></p>\n<p><em>Tech to follow \"Troubleshooting steps\" outlined below and link attachment. Tech need to check/verify and test cable at Processing 3 camera, switch and reset</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Tech will need to tone/test network run between camera and Switch H5 or H6</em></p>\n<p><em>Check for a biscuit jack/network junction, which may be located in the ceiling along the cable path.</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>If a biscuit jack is located:</em></p>\n<p><em>Inspect and re-punch the connections as needed, or Terminate the network cable with an RJ45 connector and connect it directly to the camera, bypassing the biscuit jack.</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Device/Camera Information:</em></p>\n<p><em>Processing <del>* *** **************** **** ***************** **** ***** ****** ****** ******* ********</del></em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Camera location and Link: Processing 3</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Please call Shyft Services National Tech Support at<del>************* *** **</del> opt 4 for additional support and to check and verify</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Camera Height:</em></p>\n<p><em>Ceiling Height:</em></p>\n<p><em>Site Security Code: <del>******</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>******** ********* **********</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Part shipped to the site?: (y/n)</em></p>\n<p><em>Troubleshooting steps:</em></p>\n<p><em>Problem: Offline camera High Level Steps:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************