g Return Label</strong>: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.</p>\n<p><strong>General Rules</strong>: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.</p>","markdown":"1\\. **Scope of Work** **includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.**\n\n*Scope of Work:*\n\n*Tech to follow \"Troubleshooting steps\" outlined below and link attachment. Tech need to check/verify and test cable at Processing 3 camera, switch and reset*\n\n*Tech will need to tone/test network run between camera and Switch H5 or H6*\n\n*Check for a biscuit jack/network junction, which may be located in the ceiling along the cable path.*\n\n*If a biscuit jack is located:*\n\n*Inspect and re-punch the connections as needed, or Terminate the network cable with an RJ45 connector and connect it directly to the camera, bypassing the biscuit jack.*\n\n*Device/Camera Information:*\n\n*Processing \\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Camera location and Link: Processing 3*\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Please call Shyft Services National Tech Support at\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*