{"job":{"id":20205475,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Applied Network Services","title":"MUST KNOW POTS KNOW HOW TO CROSS CONNECT AND HAVE BUTT SETT -  Activation/Install -11974525","description":{"html":"<p><br></p><p><strong>Firm start time, please do not be late. Job should take roughly 2-3hrs</strong></p><p><strong>-------PLEASE READ SCOPE OF WORK BEFORE REQUESTING OR ACCEPTING---</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Firm start time, please do not be late.</strong></p><p><strong>***Upon arrival - tech to call remote support </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\"><del>****** ******* * ************</del></strong></p><p><strong>If you have trouble reaching assigned remote support, please call&nbsp;844-905-9779 for assistance</strong></p><p>Provide ANS # or TKT #...Do not mention&nbsp;<strong>FIELD NATION</strong>&nbsp;or provide Field Nation ID.</p><p><strong>Do not Mention Field Nation!</strong></p><p><strong>***Tech must have valid Identification</strong></p><p><strong>***Tech must have Laptop with Ethernet adapter-Should have Team viewer loaded</strong></p><p><strong>***Tech must have Butt Sett with Toner and wand FOR ANY POTS RELATED SERVICES</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;***Tech SHOULD have at least 100 Cat5e Cable in case a cable run is needed - all Materials used must be documented and will be reimbursed at industry rate or at cost with receipt.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>***IMPORTANT - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED BUT YOU ARE UNABLE TO COMPLETE DUE TO DIFFICULTY OR TOTAL TIME IT WOULD TAKE, PLEASE PERFORM SURVEY, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>*****IMPORTANT - UPON COMPLETION - MUST SEND PHOTO OF&nbsp;<u>SIGNED&nbsp;</u>WORK ORDER TO REMOTE SUPPORT AS WELL AS UPLOAD TO FIELD NATION*****</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>The business you are visiting is</strong>&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\"><del>********* ********* ******** ******* *********** ***</del></strong><strong>.</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>You have been hired by Applied Network Services who has been contracted for this job by&nbsp;</strong><del>******</del></p><p><strong>If you have&nbsp;<u>ANY</u>&nbsp;questions on this work order, need to make changes, extend time, etc&nbsp;<u>DO NOT ASK THE ONSITE CUSTOMER and DO NOT ASK&nbsp;</u></strong><del>******</del><strong>&nbsp;Please send us a note ON THE PLATFORM or TEXT Charles 914-355-9520 IF RESPONSE TIME IS SLOW</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>On Site Instructions:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Upon entry, introduce yourself to the on-site manager as&nbsp;</strong><u>Applied Network Services</u>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<del>************</del>and he/she&nbsp;will escort you to the work area.Please call upon arrival and work with contact on all connections.&nbsp;Local contact is&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\"><del>***** *****</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK:</strong></p><p><strong>***PLEASE NOTE - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED FOR ANY WORK ON SITE, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. SURVEY THE WORK, PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">**PIAB install + Cross Connect** Call Travis Newkirk at 3852623457 when on site. Data Remote CDS-9090 -MiMo Antenna &amp; Bracket Kit</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Tech to locate equipment.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Locate customer network switch in room switch/router.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Install MetTel Board and CDS-9090.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Attach antennas and power on.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-MetTel will validate configurations.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Connect laptop and run speed tests over LTE. Do not use </span>speedtest.net</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Verify dial tone and in/outbound calling on all provisioned CDS9090 RJ11 ports.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Validate e911 address on one each line.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Use multimeter to verify each existing pair has a voltage of 0 on customer side of the demark.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">If voltage is found, locate the short/bridge and repair.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Work with customer to contact the alarms monitoring vendor and have the Fire Panel placed into test mode.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Locate/tag Elevator, Fire and Burglar lines.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Cross-connect to Fire Panel, Burglar Panel, and test.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Contact the fire monitoring vendor to confirm that they are receiving the faults, restoral, low battery and battery restore signals.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">-Confirm monitoring vendor sees the correct service address.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">MetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit </span>https://dispatch.bruin.com/<span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\"> to manually lookup and start the dispatch.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Rack + Stack + Go Live</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">NO PORT - NEW NUMBERS</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">LCON:Joshua Blake / Mark Card (336) 503-5635</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Tickets - 11974415 11974525</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Fully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port ,Multimeter wire tester ,Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches ,Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer) ,Biscuit jacks ,Crimpers &amp; Wirecutters ,4-6 ft’ ladder ,Butt Set ,RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors ,100’ extension cord ,Digital Camera ,100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device ,Cell phone w/Hotspot device ,Punch down tool</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Attach pics in Field Nation and send to contact if requested.</strong></p><p>*Copy of work order ---&gt;Must get signature from customer - If customer is NOT on site or able to sign, must clearly write that on work order</p><p>*Photos of work performed in field:</p><p>*If equipment installed - take photo of that with close ups and full room picture.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>*Any photos asked of by remote support</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Additional Technician Equipment/Materials:</u></strong></p><p>Cat 5E cable and cable ends (75ft-100ft)</p><p>cable crimper</p><p>Corded/cordless Drill</p><p>Misc mounting hardware</p><p>4-6ft ladder</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>ATTENTION:</u></strong></p><p><em>Please check in and out onsite using GPS on the Field Nation app. This is how time onsite is confirmed and it non-negotiable.&nbsp;Failure to do so will result in a penalty.</em></p><p><em>Please also complete your work order for payment same day by midnight. Delays may result in a denial of add-on costs (i.e materials, extra travel, extra time, etc.) and/or a penalty.</em></p><p><em>Please PRINT ANS SIGNOFF SHEET and have the onsite contact sign.</em></p><p><em>Please be prepared with technician equipment listed.</em></p>","markdown":"**Firm start time, please do not be late. Job should take roughly 2-3hrs**\n\n**-------PLEASE READ SCOPE OF WORK BEFORE REQUESTING OR ACCEPTING---**\n\n**Firm start time, please do not be late.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Upon arrival - tech to call remote support** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**If you have trouble reaching assigned remote support, please call 844-905-9779 for assistance**\n\nProvide ANS # or TKT #...Do not mention **FIELD NATION** or provide Field Nation ID.\n\n**Do not Mention Field Nation!**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Tech must have valid Identification**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Tech must have Laptop with Ethernet adapter-Should have Team viewer loaded**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Tech must have Butt Sett with Toner and wand FOR ANY POTS RELATED SERVICES**\n\n **\\*\\*\\*Tech SHOULD have at least 100 Cat5e Cable in case a cable run is needed - all Materials used must be documented and will be reimbursed at industry rate or at cost with receipt.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*IMPORTANT - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED BUT YOU ARE UNABLE TO COMPLETE DUE TO DIFFICULTY OR TOTAL TIME IT WOULD TAKE, PLEASE PERFORM SURVEY, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*IMPORTANT - UPON COMPLETION - MUST SEND PHOTO OF SIGNED WORK ORDER TO REMOTE SUPPORT AS WELL AS UPLOAD TO FIELD NATION\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**The business you are visiting is** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*****.** **You have been hired by Applied Network Services who has been contracted for this job by** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**If you have ANY questions on this work order, need to make changes, extend time, etc DO NOT ASK THE ONSITE CUSTOMER and DO NOT ASK** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* **Please send us a note ON THE PLATFORM or TEXT Charles 914-355-9520 IF RESPONSE TIME IS SLOW**\n\n**On Site Instructions:**\n\n**Upon entry, introduce yourself to the on-site manager as** Applied Network Services for \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*and he/she will escort you to the work area.Please call upon arrival and work with contact on all connections. Local contact is **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*PLEASE NOTE - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED FOR ANY WORK ON SITE, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. SURVEY THE WORK, PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.**\n\n\\*\\*PIAB install + Cross Connect\\*\\* Call Travis Newkirk at 3852623457 when on site. Data Remote CDS-9090 -MiMo Antenna & Bracket Kit\n\n-Tech to locate equipment.\n\n-Locate customer network switch in room switch/router.\n\n-Install MetTel Board and CDS-9090.\n\n-Attach antennas and power on.\n\n-MetTel will validate configurations.\n\n-Connect laptop and run speed tests over LTE. Do not use speedtest.net\n\n-Verify dial tone and in/outbound calling on all provisioned CDS9090 RJ11 ports.\n\n-Validate e911 address on one each line.\n\n-Use multimeter to verify each existing pair has a voltage of 0 on customer side of the demark.\n\nIf voltage is found, locate the short/bridge and repair.\n\n-Work with customer to contact the alarms monitoring vendor and have the Fire Panel placed into test mode.\n\n-Locate/tag Elevator, Fire and Burglar lines.\n\n-Cross-connect to Fire Panel, Burglar Panel, and test.\n\n-Contact the fire monitoring vendor to confirm that they are receiving the faults, restoral, low battery and battery restore signals.\n\n-Confirm monitoring vendor sees the correct service address.\n\nMetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit <https://dispatch.bruin.com/> to manually lookup and start the dispatch.\n\nRack + Stack + Go Live\n\nNO PORT - NEW NUMBERS\n\nLCON:Joshua Blake / Mark Card (336) 503-5635\n\nTickets - 11974415 11974525\n\nFully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port ,Multimeter wire tester ,Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches ,Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer) ,Biscuit jacks ,Crimpers & Wirecutters ,4-6 ft’ ladder ,Butt Set ,RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors ,100’ extension cord ,Digital Camera ,100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device ,Cell phone w/Hotspot device ,Punch down tool\n\n**Attach pics in Field Nation and send to contact if requested.**\n\n\\*Copy of work order --->Must get signature from customer - If customer is NOT on site or able to sign, must clearly write that on work order\n\n\\*Photos of work performed in field:\n\n\\*If equipment installed - take photo of that with close ups and full room picture.\n\n\\*Any photos asked of by remote support\n\n**Additional Technician Equipment/Materials:**\n\nCat 5E cable and cable ends (75ft-100ft)\n\ncable crimper\n\nCorded/cordless Drill\n\nMisc mounting hardware\n\n4-6ft ladder\n\n**ATTENTION:**\n\n*Please check in and out onsite using GPS on the Field Nation app. This is how time onsite is confirmed and it non-negotiable. Failure to do so will result in a penalty.*\n\n*Please also complete your work order for payment same day by midnight. Delays may result in a denial of add-on costs (i.e materials, extra travel, extra time, etc.) and/or a penalty.*\n\n*Please PRINT ANS SIGNOFF SHEET and have the onsite contact sign.*\n\n*Please be prepared with technician equipment listed.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T10:00","end":"2026-10-28T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":110},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":38.90931092948008},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $110 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13: