{"job":{"id":"2233062174","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Endeavor Managed Services","title":"Experienced Networking/Cabling Tech Needed - LTE/5G Mobile Survey","description":"<p>********* <strong><u>Pre-Dispatch</u></strong> *********</p><p><strong>Download and print the SR and other supporting documents. The SR will need to be signed by the MOD prior to leaving site. </strong>&nbsp;Please download all documents from the <strong>Documents </strong>section of this assignment.&nbsp;&nbsp;Please also download the MyESP app and make sure you are able to login. If not, please reach out to fe_engagement@endeavor-ms.com.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>********* <strong><u>Scope of Work</u></strong> *********</p><p>Tech will be completing a full FWA survey along with a physical assessment of the install of the cradlepoint by the previous vendor.</p><p><br></p><p>Please follow the scope.</p><p>Existing device is a Verizon Gateway BUSINESS GATEWAY3 ASK-NCM1100E.,</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Complete a cellular survey using your Verizon 5G capable Android OS cell phone, the Speed Test by Ookla app, and the G-Mon Pro app. You will test two indoor locations (near permanent electric power) and one outdoor location, providing photos, installation, and cabling details.</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>Log on-site by calling the Endeavor TAC at the phone number displayed in the Special Instructions section.</strong></li><li><strong>Call the Endeavor TAC to check-out at the phone number displayed in the Special Instructions section.</strong></li><li><strong>IMPORTANT: It is mandatory that you answer all phone calls from Endeavor TAC.</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p>********* <strong><u>Required Tools and Materials</u></strong> *********</p><ul><li><strong>5G Capable Android phone on the Verizon Network (Must be Verizon, not a reseller)</strong></li><li><strong>PPE's</strong></li><li><strong>Windows based laptop</strong></li><li><strong>Speedtest by Ookla App</strong></li><li><strong>GMoN Pro app</strong></li><li><strong>8-ft A-Frame ladder</strong></li><li><strong>120V</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Electrical Outlet Tester - capable of detecting whether the outlet is wired correctly or not</strong> <strong>(multimeter tool will not suffice)</strong></li><li><strong>Laser measuring device (measuring tape will not suffice)</strong></li><li><strong>MyESP App</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>********* <u>Dress Code Policy</u> *********</p><p>Technicians must always present a clean, professional appearance. Technicians are expected to be well-groomed and wear clean clothing, free of holes, tears, or other signs of wear.</p><p><br></p><p><u>Shirts:</u></p><ul><li>Must be a polo shirt, or other collared shirt. T-shirts of any kind are not permitted.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><u>Pants:</u></p><ul><li>Must be Docker style pants or colored denim.</li><li>Jeans must be clean and professional looking. Jeans with holes, rips or fraying are not permitted.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>********* <u>Post-Dispatch</u> *********</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Upon completion of the assignment, do not under any circumstances reach out to, interact with, or contact the end client.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>*********&nbsp;<u>Commitments &amp; Penalties</u>&nbsp;*********</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Assignment Approval:</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Mark your assignment as pending approval within 24 hours of the dispatch.</li><li>If you are unable to mark the assignment complete, please add a message with your concern within 24 hours of the dispatch.</li><li>If the assignment is not marked pending approval and no note is posted within the time frames shown, we will mark it as pending approval on your behalf. This will serve as acceptance of the assignment value listed at the time of closure.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Bonus Structure</strong></p><ul><li>A 5% bonus will be awarded if all deliverables are submitted, reviewed, and approved via myESP on the dispatch date.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Penalty Structure</strong></p><ul><li>Arrivals over 15 minutes late without notice will incur a 10% penalty.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Deliverables received after you have left the site or the dispatch is closed:</strong></p><ul><li>Within 48 hours of your dispatch a penalty of 10% will be assessed.</li><li>Within 72 hours of your dispatch a penalty of 15% will be assessed.</li><li>Deliverables received after 72 hours are subject to customer acceptance. If they are not accepted by the customer, it can result in non-payment of the assignment.</li><li><br></li></ul>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-15T10:30","end":"2026-10-15T14:30"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":199.99802549},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":6.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/15/2026, 10:30:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-15T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-17T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Call Mom"},{"start":"2026-10-19T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"Listen Audio Book"},{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1