{"job":{"id":20219899,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TechNet Partners","title":"Technician Needed with Tools to Install Aruba Switch in MDF – Fayetteville, NC | 00262603 / SA-294253 / 05293188  ","description":{"html":"<p>Upon Arrival - Call 1-858-352-7230 to immediately check in. You can then immediately begin to validate locations and access to the Location/Rooms/Units. Make sure you familiarize yourself with the site contact (POC) and get acclimated with the location of all the areas we will need to go into.</p><p>After your check-in (or possibly before), the coordinator will put you into a Microsoft Teams chat with an engineer who can assist you into deeper troubleshooting as needed (You’ll need to have Microsoft Teams installed on your phone and be able to use it effectively for this job; otherwise, you may risk losing payment). It is expected that you begin to locate and troubleshoot the devices called out in the scope below before initiating a conversation with the engineer. They are not there to hold your hand - they are there to further assist when needed. If you have questions about the scope before going to site send an email to NationalSC@technetpartners.com.</p><ul><li>Note: <strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Do not exceed 15 minutes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\"> </span>to complete all remaining tasks after the service is completed or remote assistance has ended</li><li>Note: <strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Each Visit corresponds to a single detailed summary</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\"> </span>explaining the activities conducted on site to validate the time spent before checking out.</li><li>Note: Ensure that a note is added to this ticket to <strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">specify whether a follow-up visit is needed</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\"> </span>and its reason.</li><li>Note: After installation or repair, <strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">the job must be tested and delivered to the customer</strong>.</li><li>Any trip charges need to be approved with our scheduling and coordination teams prior to accepting work.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Title:</strong> Technician Needed with Tools to Install Aruba Switch in MDF – Fayetteville, NC | 00262603 / SA-294253 / 05293188</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Type of Work:</strong> Networking</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Schedule:</strong> October 22, 2026 – 09:00 EDT (09:00 EDT)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Site Name &amp; Address:</strong> Fairfield Inn Fayetteville North, 4249 Ramsey Street, Fayetteville, NC 28311, United States</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>WO / SA / Case:</strong> 00262603 / SA-294253 / 05293188</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Contact Details:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Site POC: Rosa Baleta, 910-223-7867</p><p><br></p><p>Engineer: Adel El-Sayed | TECHNET</p><p><br></p><p>Technician: TBD, TBD, TBD (Please Acknowledge)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><ul><li>Install Aruba switch at the MDF location.</li><li>Replace faulty switch installation.</li><li>Device Name: FAYFNSW02-01-MDF.</li><li>Model: HPE Aruba Networking 2930F 24G PoE+ 4SFP Switch JL261A.</li><li>Serial Number: CN20HL25PW.</li><li>Vendor Ticket Number: 5405643033.</li><li>Verify all network connections are properly connected and secured.</li><li>Confirm switch powers on and operates normally.</li><li>Verify network connectivity after installation.</li><li>Coordinate with remote engineer Adel El-Sayed during the installation.</li><li>Label equipment and connections if required.</li><li>Document all work performed and any issues identified.</li><li>Provide photos and completion notes after the job is done.</li></ul><p><strong>Asset &amp; Location:</strong> FAYFNSW02-01-MDF – MDF</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>Microsoft Teams installed and available to chat</li><li>Laptop (Windows) and power adapter</li><li>Ethernet adapter</li><li>Ethernet cable</li><li>Mobile hotspot (cellp