{"job":{"id":"5527560509","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Crescent IT","title":"Kiosk decommission install","description":"<p>Need a tech to decommission 1-5 and put them in a recycle box that will be onsite. <strong><u>These kiosks are bolted to the floor and in rare cases they may need to be cut instead of just unscrewed. Please make sure you bring equipment to do this.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>You will also be installing new kiosks in their place. The install document will be provided once you are assigned.</p><p><br></p><p>Before and after photos will be needed before you start work and before you leave the site. This will need to be validated before you leave. This is essential to you getting paid.</p><p><br></p><p>Tools needed:</p><p>4mm Hex wrench</p><p>11mm socket and wrench</p><p>Standard tool kit</p><p>a way to cut bolts if needed</p><p>2.5mm allen wrench</p><p>glow rod, fishtape (optional, but will be extreamly helpful)</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T09:00","end":"2026-10-27T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $195 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summar