{"job":{"id":20220549,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Assist Tech 2 of 2 to help the lead install and uninstall large monitor","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><br/><br/><br/><p>Assist a lead tech in a mounting large monitor.</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Upon arrival to site please check in with the lead tech. The name will be provided in your messages.</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Very important to arrive on time.</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Must have a valid state ID.</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Back ground check is required.</p><br/><br/><br/><p><strong>Upon Arrival:</strong></p><br/><br/><br/><p>Check in with the lead technician.</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Assist with unboxing and installing the monitor</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Clean up any trash left behind.</p><br/><br/><br/><p>Complete sign off form. Capture name of lead tech.</p><br/><br/><br/><p><strong><u>Tool Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><br/><br/><ul><li>Laptop computer with a Browser</li><li>Standard tool kit. Including screw drivers, pliers, wire snips. </li><li>Cell phone</li></ul><br/><br/><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><br/><br/><ul><li>Photo ID required</li><li>Names of all techs going to the site must be provided in advance</li><li>Check-in with site contacts as representing <del>***</del></li><li>Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment</li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li><li><strong>Scheduled date and time are firm, tardiness will NOT be tolerated ***Penalties maybe applied at the discretion of Pivital***</strong></li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n  \n  \n  \nAssist a lead tech in a mounting large monitor.\n\n  \n  \n  \nUpon arrival to site please check in with the lead tech. The name will be provided in your messages.\n\n  \n  \n  \nVery important to arrive on time.\n\n  \n  \n  \nMust have a valid state ID.\n\n  \n  \n  \nBack ground check is required.\n\n  \n  \n  \n**Upon Arrival:**\n\n  \n  \n  \nCheck in with the lead technician.\n\n  \n  \n  \nAssist with unboxing and installing the monitor\n\n  \n  \n  \nClean up any trash left behind.\n\n  \n  \n  \nComplete sign off form. Capture name of lead tech.\n\n  \n  \n  \n**Tool Requirements:**\n\n  \n  \n  \n- Laptop computer with a Browser\n- Standard tool kit. Including screw drivers, pliers, wire snips.\n- Cell phone\n\n  \n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n  \n  \n- Photo ID required\n- Names of all techs going to the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts as representing \\*\\*\\*\n- Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire\n- **Scheduled date and time are firm, tardiness will NOT be tolerated \\*\\*\\*Penalties maybe applied at the discretion of Pivital\\*\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T07:30","end":"2026-10-23T09:30"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":70},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":7.605954391823917},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota T