{"job":{"id":20220645,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TPX Communications","title":"Installing 2-VELOs, CRADLEPOINT, 3-Meraki switches, 3-Polycom phones, & Wattbox managed power.","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>OVERVIEW:</u></strong></p><p>Installing 2-VELOs, CRADLEPOINT, 3-Meraki switches, 3-Polycom phones, &amp; Wattbox managed power.</p><p> Inventory shipped equipment to be installed &amp; join bridge at 10am.</p><p> Document any removed equipment &amp; hand over to customer onsite.</p><p> Any delays or request outside the SOW call 833-294-6642 for approval.</p><p> Need laptop with ANYDESK loaded, hotspot, console cables, &amp; spare patch cables &amp; tester.</p><p> </p><p>****************************************************************************************************</p><p><em>\"For any work outside of the scope please contact TPx Support.\"</em></p><p><em>\"After 2.5 hours, we kindly ask that the provider informs us if they anticipate the work on site will go over the 3-hour mark. This helps us plan accordingly and ensures that we may provide necessary support and resources if needed.\" </em></p><p><em>Please make sure to mark </em><strong><em>'On My Way</em></strong><em>' in Field Nation at least one hour before your scheduled on-site time. This is a key step we rely on to confirm readiness.”</em></p><p><em>Provider is required to contact the customer at least 1hour prior to arrival to confirm the estimated ETA. Failure to make contact in advance may result in delays.</em></p><p><em>Our business hours are Monday through Friday, 5:00 AM to 5:00 PM Pacific Time.</em></p><p><em>**If you are calling to </em><strong><em><u>check in</u></em></strong><em><u> </u>for a scheduled work order, please </em><strong><em>press 3</em></strong><em> to leave a message.</em></p><p><em>**If </em><strong><em>after 5pm PST </em></strong><em>for urgent issues requiring immediate assistance, please </em><strong><em>press 1</em></strong><em> to reach the On-Call team.</em></p><p><em>****************************************************************************************************</em></p><p><strong>DRESS CODE</strong></p><ul><li>Business casual or professional attire required</li><li>No other company logos or branding permitted (TPX branding only, if applicable)</li><li>Closed-toe shoes required (no sandals)</li><li>Safety gear must be worn if site requires (PPE)</li><li>Present yourself professionally as a TPX representative</li></ul><p><strong>PRE-SITE WORK</strong></p><ul><li>Review the Scope of Work and its requirements.</li><li>Call TPx Support with any questions or clarification about the Scope of Work</li></ul><p><strong>ON-SITE WORK</strong></p><ul><li>Check In on the Field Nation Portal</li><li>Call TPx Support&nbsp;to check in 833-294-6642&nbsp;before entering premises. <em>If after </em><strong><em>5pm</em></strong><em> PST, press </em><strong><em>option 3</em></strong><em> leave a message.</em></li><li>Introduce yourself as representative of TPX and enter their name into the Required Task in the Field Nation Portal</li><li>Call into Bridge Number on Time <del>*************  *****  **** *** *** **** ** **** ***</del></li></ul><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;POST-SITE WORK</strong></p><ul><li>Confirm deliverables are complete</li><li>Enter Close out notes and any client feedback into Order</li><li>Clean-up work materials from installation (wire clipping, boxes, trash, and any other debris)</li><li>Call TPX Communications from customer’s site to check out <strong>833-294-6642 (</strong>If after 5pm PST, press <strong>option 3</strong> leave a message &amp; we will follow up next Business day)</li><li>Enter Release Code (Given by the Support at the time of close out)</li><li>Check out in Field Nation Portal</li></ul><p><strong>ESCALATIONS</strong></p><ul><li>Call Technical Support number if you encounter any issues on-site <strong>833-294-6642</strong></li><li>DO NOT perform any work outside of scope. If asked to perform outside of the scope work, call TPx Support <strong>833-294-6642</strong></li></ul><p><strong>﻿</strong></p><p><strong><u>Requirements:</u></strong></p><p><strong>REQUIRED LAPTOP</strong></p><ul><li>Internet Connectivity (WIFI Hotspot)</li><li>Windows&nbsp;7 or 10&nbsp;Laptop with 1Gb Ethernet port</li><li>Active Email Address</li></ul><p><strong>REQUIRED SOFTWARE FOR LAPTOP</strong></p><ul><li>Teamviewer 12 (MUST be version 12)</li><li>AnyDesk</li><li>Aeroadmin</li><li>HyperTerminal, Putty or TeraTerm</li><li>FTP Client</li><li>TFTP Server software</li><li>MircoSIP (SIP call testing- https://www.microsip.org/)</li><li>Wireshark</li></ul><p><strong>REQUIRED CABLES FOR LAPTOP TESTING</strong></p><ul><li>Ethernet Patch Cable</li><li>Cisco Console Cable​</li><li>USB to DB9 male serial Cable</li></ul><p><strong>REQUIRED TELECOM TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p><ul><li>Buttset</li><li>Line man’s test set or analog test set</li><li>RJ-11 and RJ-45 crimp tool</li><li>Snips</li><li>Punch down tool with blades for 66 and 110 blocks</li><li>Tone Generator and Wand</li><li>Drill/ Dry wall screws</li><li>4’ ladder</li><li>CAT5e or CAT6 cable (minimum of 250’ for usage of extending circuits or making a patch cable for a data drop)</li><li>Pre-made crossover cables</li><li>RJ-11 and RJ-45 connectors</li><li>Pre-made Ethernet patch cables (5pack of each-length of 3’/5’/7’)</li><li>Power inverter</li></ul>","markdown":"**OVERVIEW:**\n\nInstalling 2-VELOs, CRADLEPOINT, 3-Meraki switches, 3-Polycom phones, & Wattbox managed power.\n\n Inventory shipped equipment to be installed & join bridge at 10am.\n\n Document any removed equipment & hand over to customer onsite.\n\n Any delays or request outside the SOW call 833-294-6642 for approval.\n\n Need laptop with ANYDESK loaded, hotspot, console cables, & spare patch cables & tester.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n*\"For any work outside of the scope please contact TPx Support.\"*\n\n*\"After 2.5 hours, we kindly ask that the provider informs us if they anticipate the work on site will go over the 3-hour mark. This helps us plan accordingly and ensures that we may provide necessary support and resources if needed.\"*\n\n*Please make sure to mark* ***'On My Way****' in Field Nation at least one hour before your scheduled on-site time. This is a key step we rely on to confirm readiness.”*\n\n*Provider is required to contact the customer at least 1hour prior to arrival to confirm the estimated ETA. Failure to make contact in advance may result in delays.*\n\n*Our business hours are Monday through Friday, 5:00 AM to 5:00 PM Pacific Time.*\n\n*\\*\\*If you are calling to* ***check in*** *for a scheduled work order, please* ***press 3*** *to leave a message.*\n\n*\\*\\*If* ***after 5pm PST*** *for urgent issues requiring immediate assistance, please* ***press 1*** *to reach the On-Call team.*\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n**DRESS CODE**\n\n- Business casual or professional attire required\n- No other company logos or branding permitted (TPX branding only, if applicable)\n- Closed-toe shoes required (no sandals)\n- Safety gear must be worn if site requires (PPE)\n- Present yourself professionally as a TPX representative\n\n**PRE-SITE WORK**\n\n- Review the Scope of Work and its requirements.\n- Call TPx Support with any questions or clarification about the Scope of Work\n\n**ON-SITE WORK**\n\n- Check In on the Field Nation Portal\n- Call TPx Support to check in 833-294-6642 