{"job":{"id":20220736,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"tech needed to perform site survey for camera install","description":{"html":"<p>site survey for a camera install</p><p>determine what is needed to run cat 6 and install cameras</p><p>we will need to know the camera type for each location whether it be a bullet or dome camera required. provide a final count of each type.</p><p>You will meet with the customer, review locations they will need coverage, determine a bullet cam or dome cam and mark the locations on the map. If there are existing cams please note which locations will be a cam swap vs a new camera with cabling. We will provide the map of the property</p><p>provide all results, photos and marked up map in our whatsapp group</p>","markdown":"site survey for a camera install\n\ndetermine what is needed to run cat 6 and install cameras\n\nwe will need to know the camera type for each location whether it be a bullet or dome camera required. provide a final count of each type.\n\nYou will meet with the customer, review locations they will need coverage, determine a bullet cam or dome cam and mark the locations on the map. If there are existing cams please note which locations will be a cam swap vs a new camera with cabling. We will provide the map of the property\n\nprovide all results, photos and marked up map in our whatsapp group","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T09:00","end":"2026-10-23T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":130,"max":260},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":130},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":65}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":57.652170435010866},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1