{"job":{"id":20221099,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Deploy and Test SIB","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Testing:</u></strong></p><p>Very IMPORTANT _ Call the POC and get site access. Confirm the equipment is located before calling <del>****</del> - if you are not able to gain access to the building OR the equipment within 10 minutes ESCALATE per the Prep guide </p><p><br></p><p>Check in with <del>****</del> Bridge Line/Remote Technical Services (Number in confidential section and tasks). </p><p><br></p><p>They will then send you an email to start an email chain where all technical support will be provided. If you have ANY non-technical issues, please call the same number, but all technical issues will be handled through email. If you don’t receive an email within 10 minutes, please contact <del>*******</del> at <del>************</del> and give them your work order #, so they can let the PM know. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>The techs must have laptops and work through email.</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Event Name: Beauty Extra Colleagues Discount  </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Number of registers: 3 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 1 number: 12 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 1 MAC:  </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 2 number: 48 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 2 MAC: </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 3 number: 454 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Register 3 MAC: </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store Event Owner: Amgad Habib </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store Event Owner Mobile Number: 4122658688 </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store / OPS Manager: Jenness Willey </span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store / OPS Manager Mobile Number: 919-7412410</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Technician to validate hardware for connectivity and performance.</p><p>Upon successful testing, equipment is handed off to Operations Manager/event designee.</p><p>Connection &amp; Verification:</p><ul><li>Allow 2–3 minutes for SIB to initialize.</li><li>LED indicators: Older SIB: Solid white - Newer SIB (60–83): Purple = connected, Amber = error.</li><li>Connect POS registers using CAT5 cables from the SIB LAN ports (1–4).</li><li>Do not use the Internet/WAN port.</li><li>Verify each register is online.</li><li>Repeat connection steps for all deployed registers.</li><li>Store is accountable for any lost or unreturned equipment.</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong><u>Required tools:</u></strong></p><p>Installation guide</p><p>Standard tool kit (screwdrivers, pliers, etc.)</p><p>USB PC Keyboard 104 key 008-0077710 or equivalent</p><p>Cell