ant Site Information / Requirements:</em></strong></p><ul><li>You must represent yourself as an Essintial technician on behalf of NCR while on site.</li><li>These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business.&nbsp;<strong>Be Respectful</strong>&nbsp;and limit any disruptions while on site.</li><li><strong><u>DRESS CODE:</u></strong>&nbsp;Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no T-Shirts, Jeans or holes - A plain collared or button-down shirts, slacks, and nice shoes. (No Jeans, T-Shirts/Hoodies and NO Graphics or HOLES in clothing)</li><li>You are required to be onsite no later than your scheduled time (penalties will be applied if you are late). Please escalate to Essintial Projects @ 855-612-2183</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong><u>Pre-Site Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Download and then Print</u>&nbsp;all relevant attachments (guides, checklists, other important tech related documentation) in color to bring to the site.</strong>&nbsp;Please&nbsp;<strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">READ &amp; REVIEW</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span>all attachments prior to arriving onsite.&nbsp;<strong><em>Important Note:&nbsp;</em></strong>These Links will take you to / show you a&nbsp;<strong><u>PREVIEW</u></strong>&nbsp;of the document,&nbsp;<strong><em>IT IS VERY IMPORTANT</em></strong>&nbsp;that you&nbsp;<strong><em>DOWNLOAD</em></strong>&nbsp;the files from this view and then&nbsp;<strong>PRINT</strong>&nbsp;(<em>DO NOT PRINT FROM PREVIEW MODE</em>)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">General Project Specific &amp; STORE Specific Onsite Technician Documentation – via SharePoint Folder Link [VERY IMPORTANT]</strong><strong>:</strong>&nbsp;<del>****************************************************************************************************************************************