{"job":{"id":20221351,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Assist Tech | Overnight Store Remodeling - Network/Cabling/POS (Full 8+ Hours Onsite)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Visit Specific Notes/Instructions:</u></strong> <em style=\"font-size: 10px;\">(consider these notes along with the full scope of work below)</em></p><p>REMAINING SCOPE:<br/>- Install Learning Center computers.<br/>- Install and validate Learning Center TV.<br/>- Install and validate Learning Center phone.<br/>- Install and validate phones at Registers 6 and 9.<br/>- Validate functionality with MOD<br/>- Complete project closeout and customer signoff.<br/><br/>Security Code: 845643</p></BR><p><b>No unauthorized persons allowed on site. Any swaps or helpers must be approved by Essintial.</b></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>REQUIRED SKILLS:&nbsp;</u></strong>Mid-Level Low Voltage Cabling, Mid-Level to Advanced Network Technician, Experience with Network &amp; Security/CCTV and Experience installing POS Equipment. Technician MUST be able to run cables neatly through various ceiling types, terminate cables with RJ45 plugs and or Keystone jacks.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work</u>:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Seeking an Assist</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Technician to complete a Store Remodel at various Retailers. Technicians will be onsite working with LEAD TECHNICIAN to complete Low Voltage Cabling Runs, CCTV Installations (varies by site), POS De-Installations &amp; Re-Installations, TV Installations. (Every Remodel / STORE is slightly Different). Scope of work will take place&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Over Multiple</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">NIGHTs</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">. Each Night you will be scoped to complete specific items to stay on task to meet the store’s cutover date. Technicians will be taking direction from Lead Technician and working with other assist technicians to complete the scope of work.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>IMPORTANT CALL OUTS:</u></strong></p><ul><li>You&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;represent yourself as an Essintial Technician on behalf of <del>***</del></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: black;\">MUST</strong><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;read the&nbsp;</span><u style=\"color: black;\">entire work order and all provided documentation</u><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">before</strong><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;arriving on-site. All guides and plans&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color: black;\">MUST</strong><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;be printed and/or available on a laptop or tablet (not a phone) for review onsite.</span></li><li><strong><u>Important:</u></strong>&nbsp;<del>***</del> consists of multiple retailer companies/stores where we are supporting this scope of work, you could be scoped to complete work at a <del>** ***** ********** *********</del>, or other company within the <del>*** </del>umbrella!!!!! Your Workorder will call out what store you are scheduled to be at.</li><li><strong><u>Important:</u></strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Work TAKES place overnight – YOU WILL GET LOCKED IN ONCE MANAGER LEAVES FOR THE NIGHT!!!</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Techs&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;<u>ARRIVE ONTIME</u> - you will be scheduled to arrive 30 minutes before the store closes. You MUST arrive on time as you will NOT be able to gain access!!!! (<strong>PENALTIES APPLY</strong>)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong><u>Techs MUST come prepared:</u></strong>&nbsp;bring all tools, food/drinks, medications, device chargers, etc. (anything you might need while working overnight!!!!!)</li><li><strong>Estimated