{"job":{"id":"7809388289","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Airitpros.","title":"Hisense 50 Inch TV Break fix - Roxboro, NC","description":"<p>Note: Because of COVID 19- You may be required to wear a mask, gloves, observe social distancing rules etc at customer site.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Complaint:</strong>Google TV Master Set Field Service 7/13/2026 -&gt; Troubleshooting -&gt; Power(TV Wont turn on, Constantly Resets, randomly resets etc) -&gt; TV Won't Turn On/No Image Seen Audio is heard -&gt; Unit does not power correctly SOS with Main Board and Power Board</p><p><br></p><p>Parts Being Sent:</p><p><strong>1:</strong>Part#: T448205 -- Desc: Main BoardLarge component\\50A60QUA(01)\\t -- QTY: 1</p><p><br></p><p>If issue still persists after replacing the parts then tech to follow panel destroy process.</p><p><br></p><p>Dress Code Requirement</p><p>An engineer must have business casual dress and comply with local site requirements which AirIt Pro will provide in advance.</p><p>Allowed : Jeans, Collared T-Shirts, Formal Pant, Formal Shirt</p><p>Not allowed : Round neck/ V-neck /sweatshirt/beach dress, 3/4th pant, Hat, Cap, Shorts, unclean shoes and any unclean dress.</p><p>Dispatch Technician must carry Laptop &amp; Charger, fully charged Mobile and other required equipment</p><p>Dispatch Technician must be fluent in English (Read, Write and Speak)</p><p><br></p><p>NO sunglasses, listening to music with or without headphones (this is fine during lunch break)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Contact, Support Engineers details and Equipment details will be shared with Assigned FE Via Email.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T09:00","end":"2026-10-28T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":41.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks"