{"job":{"id":20222285,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TailWind Voice & Data, Inc.","title":"Technician needed for router replacement at Outback Steakhouse. ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Objective Statement: </strong></p><p>Technician needed for router replacement at Outback Steakhouse.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Technician will need to come prepared with extra replacement keystone jack, CAT5E Cable, terminating tools, cable toner, cable tester/ certifier, ladders, and other hand tools necessary to complete the work required.&nbsp;</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Equipment required: </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Standard technician tools &amp; materials </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Technician will need to come prepared with: </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Label Maker </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CAT6 Cable and extra replacement Keystone Jacks (CAT5e &amp; CAT6) </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Terminating tools, Cable Toner/Tester/Certifier </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;10ft-12ft Ladder </p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Other hand tools necessary to complete the work required.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Required Deliverable Format: Technician will be asked to complete a specific JotForm to collect the appropriate deliverables. This is a required task.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>TailWind Requirements: </strong></p><ul><li>Tailwind will only approve the work authorized in the SOW uploaded by Tailwind in the attachments of the Field Nation order.</li><li>Technician must verify that all materials/lifts in the SOW are on-site upon arrival and report any issues to Tailwind immediately via Field Nation messages.</li><li>Any delays on-site need to be reported to Tailwind via Field Nation messages OR by calling in and speaking with someone at TailWind within 1 hour of the delay. (Document who you spoke to and gave you approval)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tailwind will not approve additional time beyond 1 hour for delays that are not reported and responded to by a Tailwind via Field Nation Messages OR phone call.</li><li>Any additional Out of Scope work needs to be requested in the Field Nation messages OR the technician calls into TailWind and gets approval to proceed.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Any verbal agreements will be be followed up with a written confirmation of next steps and approval via Field Nation messages.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Only Tailwind can approve Out of Scope work.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Objective Statement:**\n\nTechnician needed for router replacement at Outback Steakhouse.\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\no Technician will need to come prepared with extra replacement keystone jack, CAT5E Cable, terminating tools, cable toner, cable tester/ certifier, ladders, and other hand tools necessary to complete the work required.\n\no Equipment required:\n\n• Standard technician tools & materials\n\n• Technician will need to come prepared with:\n\n• Label Maker\n\n• CAT6 Cable and extra replacement Keystone Jacks (CAT5e & CAT6)\n\n• Terminating tools, Cable Toner/Tester/Certifier\n\n• 10ft-12ft Ladder\n\n• Other hand tools necessary to complete the work required.\n\n**Required Deliverable Format: Technician will be asked to complete a specific JotForm to collect the appropriate deliverables. This is a required task.**\n\n**TailWind Requirements:**\n\n- Tailwind will only approve the work authorized in the SOW uploaded by Tailwind in the attachments of the Field Nation order.\n- Technician must verify that all materials/lifts in the SOW are on-site upon arrival and report any issues to Tailwind immediately via Field Nation messages.\n- Any delays on-site need to be reported to Tailwind via Field Nation messages OR by calling in and speaking with someone at TailWind within 1 hour of the delay. (Document who you spoke to and gave you approval)\n- Tailwind will not approve additional time beyond 1 hour for delays that are not reported and responded to by a Tailwind via Field Nation Messages OR phone call.\n- Any additional Out of Scope work needs to be requested in the Field Nation messages OR the technician calls into TailWind and gets approval to proceed.\n- Any verbal agreements will be be followed up with a written confirmation of next steps and approval via Field Nation messages.\n- Only Tailwind can approve Out of Scope work.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T10:00","end":"2026-10-22T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":13.280687459972155},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792631077467}
