{"job":{"id":20222566,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Dynamic Advantage, Inc.","title":"Removal of IT equipment and ship","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>FIRST AND FOREMOST</u></strong></p><p>DO NOT MENTION THAT YOU ARE USING FIELDNATION TO ANYONE YOU SPEAK TO EXCEPT FOR OLIVER.</p><p><br></p><p>YOU ARE REPRESENTING \"BP NETWORK\" FOR THIS PROJECT</p><p><br></p><p><strong>*** TECH MUST SUPPLY THE SHIPPING BOX AND PACKING MATERIAL ***</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>What to bring:</strong></p><ul><li>6ft ladder - to remove the AP from the ceiling grid</li><li>Basic tools</li><li>small screw drivers</li><li>TECH MUST SUPPLY THE BOXES AND PACKING MATERIALS (bubble wrap, peanuts, etc) TO SHIP BACK THE EQUIPMENT. WE WILL PROVIDE THE UPS SHIPPING LABEL.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p><p><strong>Meet site contact at agreed time - MUST Agree to a meeting time prior to arrival</strong></p><p><strong>*****IT IS VERY IMPORTANT TO TAKE BEFORE PICTURES BEFORE YOU REMOVE ANYTHING AND AFTER PICTURES OF THE IT RACK ONCE YOU ARE DONE*****</strong></p><p><strong><u>De-install the following network gear from the IT cabinet and ship using provided shipping label:</u></strong></p><ul><li>(2) Brightsign XD235 &amp; SD Card</li><li>(1) Meraki MX64 Security Appliance</li><li>(1) MS225 24-port switch</li><li>(1) MR42</li><li>(4) Tablets &amp; Stands</li><li>(1) Kiosk &amp; Stand</li></ul><p><strong>Disconnect the following items:</strong></p><p>(1) Access control panel and 1 Fob</p><p>(1) Cabinet Fan Kit</p><p>(1) Surge Protector</p><p><strong>Disconnect and Return ISP Modem to nearest provider location </strong></p><ul><li><em>ISP/Modem DETAILS TBD</em></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>(Shipping label will be emailed to the UPS store or technician's email within 5 minutes once the box dimensions and weight are sent to Oliver)</strong></p><p>Make sure that all the equipment getting returned is packaged VERY SECURELY using bubble wrap / card board, etc... (Walmart sells rolls of bubble wrap and boxes)</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Pictures/Documentation:</strong></p><ul><li>Provide a picture of the equipment getting shipped back</li><li>Provide a picture of the empty IT cabinet</li><li>Provide a picture of the drop off receipt/confirmation of modem</li><li>Provide any other relevant pictures</li></ul><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><p>Unless otherwise specified in the specific work order clean non-tattered or non-torn jeans and a plain polo shirt are acceptable attire. No hats, sunglasses, or excessive jewelry is permitted. Technicians are encouraged to be well groomed and represent Buyer professionally during all service events.</p>","markdown":"**FIRST AND FOREMOST**\n\nDO NOT MENTION THAT YOU ARE USING FIELDNATION TO ANYONE YOU SPEAK TO EXCEPT FOR OLIVER.\n\nYOU ARE REPRESENTING \"BP NETWORK\" FOR THIS PROJECT\n\n**\\*\\*\\* TECH MUST SUPPLY THE SHIPPING BOX AND PACKING MATERIAL \\*\\*\\***\n\n**What to bring:**\n\n- 6ft ladder - to remove the AP from the ceiling grid\n- Basic tools\n- small screw drivers\n- TECH MUST SUPPLY THE BOXES AND PACKING MATERIALS (bubble wrap, peanuts, etc) TO SHIP BACK THE EQUIPMENT. WE WILL PROVIDE THE UPS SHIPPING LABEL.\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n**Meet site contact at agreed time - MUST Agree to a meeting time prior to arrival**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*IT IS VERY IMPORTANT TO TAKE BEFORE PICTURES BEFORE YOU REMOVE ANYTHING AND AFTER PICTURES OF THE IT RACK ONCE YOU ARE DONE\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**De-install the following network gear from the IT cabinet and ship using provided shipping label:**\n\n- (2) Brightsign XD235 & SD Card\n- (1) Meraki MX64 Security Appliance\n- (1) MS225 24-port switch\n- (1) MR42\n- (4) Tablets & Stands\n- (1) Kiosk & Stand\n\n**Disconnect the following items:**\n\n(1) Access control panel and 1 Fob\n\n(1) Cabinet Fan Kit\n\n(1) Surge Protector\n\n**Disconnect and Return ISP Modem to nearest provider location**\n\n- *ISP/Modem DETAILS TBD*\n\n**(Shipping label will be emailed to the UPS store or technician's email within 5 minutes once the box dimensions and weight are sent to Oliver)**\n\nMake sure that all the equipment getting returned is packaged VERY SECURELY using bubble wrap / card board, etc... (Walmart sells rolls of bubble wrap and boxes)\n\n**Pictures/Documentation:**\n\n- Provide a picture of the equipment getting shipped back\n- Provide a picture of the empty IT cabinet\n- Provide a picture of the drop off receipt/confirmation of modem\n- Provide any other relevant pictures\n\n\\-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\nUnless otherwise specified in the specific work order clean non-tattered or non-torn jeans and a plain polo shirt are acceptable attire. No hats, sunglasses, or excessive jewelry is permitted. Technicians are encouraged to be well groomed and represent Buyer professionally during all service events.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T09:00","end":"2026-10-28T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-28T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":8.175855425397167},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":