{"job":{"id":20223015,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Ovation Workplace Services","title":"Network Support Required (Filling the Service Visit Report is Mandatory)","description":{"html":"<p>You need to join the Teams call once you have checked in on Field Nation. Please note that your check-in and check-out times will be calculated based on your time you spent on the teams meeting.</p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong> <strong style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\">Two pcs at the site unable to reach Hertz network, need technician to trace line back to Fortinet switch and help locate where said connection is coming from as IP isn't on network or domain.</strong></p><p><strong>Tools the technician must bring onsite:</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop with Windows operating system must have an Ethernet port(s}</li><li>Console cables (RJ45 to USB, USB to Serial Converter)</li><li>Basic tool kit</li><li>USB drive (32GB)</li><li>Internet data – Hotspot</li><li>Putty (application)</li><li>MS Teams (installed on both your phone and laptop)</li><li>Phone with a reliable hotspot</li><li>Patch cables(Copper or fiber)</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Instructions:</strong></p><p>Make sure to read the Tech Overview before going onsite. You must also share the SVR before leaving the site.</p><p>POC Details will be shared on email.</p>","markdown":"You need to join the Teams call once you have checked in on Field Nation. Please note that your check-in and check-out times will be calculated based on your time you spent on the teams meeting.\n\n**Scope of Work:** **Two pcs at the site unable to reach Hertz network, need technician to trace line back to Fortinet switch and help locate where said connection is coming from as IP isn't on network or domain.**\n\n**Tools the technician must bring onsite:**\n\n- Laptop with Windows operating system must have an Ethernet port(s}\n- Console cables (RJ45 to USB, USB to Serial Converter)\n- Basic tool kit\n- USB drive (32GB)\n- Internet data – Hot