{"job":{"id":20224232,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Visual Image Display","title":"Pro/AV Digital Signage - Hardware Replacement- Helper Needed (Must have basic tools) - Estimated Duration: 2 Hours","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>*Please note, you will have to go to the assigned FedEx/UPS location prior to your visit (Same day) to pick up hardware.</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>*To Note: Many times, you will be on the phone with the Location Contact During the visit contact during this visit.</u></strong></p><p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in Pro/AV Digital Signage &amp; Networking. But basic knowledge of hardware is preferred (ie: computer player, routers, wattbox PDUs, etc)</li><li>Tech is required to replace digital signage media player to restore content to screen, and take plenty of photos to document findings to send&nbsp;back.</li><li>Estimated duration will be 2 Hours</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Smart casual attire,</li><li>Appropriate dress attire for being in front of retail clients and functionable dress ware to troubleshoot hardware (possibly behind TVs or in low cabinets)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>No Holes/Ripped Jeans</li><li>Polo/slacks Ok</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li><em>&nbsp;</em>Basic hand tools</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Keyboard</li><li>Mouse</li><li>Cat 6/Wire HDMI (Bring on-site in case)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><ul><li>Connect with Internal Technicians upon arrival</li><li>Located Equipment/Hardware</li><li>Find all the hardware and speak with on-site manager to assist in location of equipment, if needed</li><li>Locate Digital Signage player and replace faulty player and other hardware</li><li>Confirm (with VID POC) that all equipment (ie: Digital Signage players, Watt Boxes, and Routers) are all online</li><li>Confirm Content is playing on the monitor and in the correct orientation</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ol><li>Confirm scheduled start time/date with Work Order manager</li><li>Go to assigned FedEx Location prior to visit and pick up replacement hardware</li><li>Confirm when hardware has been picked up</li><li>Call POC when you arrive on site</li></ol><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself and the type of work you will be completing on-site to the onsite manager.</li><li>Locate digital signage player and hardware, and replace</li><li>Call VID POC to confirm new player is showing online remotely, and content is displaying correctly on site</li></ol><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Photos of site location (ie: note where equipment is located, take zoomed in photo but also zoomed out photo to reference equipment location)</li></ol><p><br></p><p>*<strong>Type of photos</strong>: Photos of the components behind the screens, photos of the screens Serial number tags, photos of the screens showing content playing correctly.</p><ol><li>Call VID POC to check out once deliverables are uploaded, so we can review and ensure everything has been completed</li><li>Signatures from Both you and the On-stie manager sign off upon completion of the work order.</li><li>Check-out of work order</li></ol><p><strong>Escalation Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Project Manager/Technician</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>-To note: Many times, you will be on the phone with the On-Site Point of contact during this visit</strong></p><ul><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to Work Order Manager</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;Pre-approved by Project manager prior to incurring / during the service visit</li><li><br></li></ul>","markdown":"**\\*Please note, you will have to go to the assigned FedEx/UPS location prior to your visit (Same day) to pick up hardware.**\n\n**\\*To Note: Many times, you will be on the phone with the Location Contact During the visit contact during this visit.**\n\n**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Pro/AV Digital Signage & Networking. But basic knowledge of hardware is preferred (ie: computer player, routers, wattbox PDUs, etc)\n- Tech is required to replace digital signage media player to restore content to screen, and take plenty of photos to document findings to send back.\n- Estimated duration will be 2 Hours\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Smart casual attire,\n- Appropriate dress attire for being in front of retail clients and functionable dress ware to troubleshoot hardware (possibly behind TVs or in low cabinets)\n- No Holes/Ripped Jeans\n- Polo/slacks Ok\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- Basic hand tools\n- Laptop\n- Keyboard\n- Mouse\n- Cat 6/Wire HDMI (Bring on-site in case)\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n- Connect with Internal Technicians upon arrival\n- Located Equipment/Hardware\n- Find all the hardware and speak with on-site manager to assist in location of equipment, if needed\n- Locate Digital Signage player and replace faulty player and other hardware\n- Confirm (with VID POC) that all equipment (ie: Digital Signage players, Watt Boxes, and Routers) are all online\n- Confirm Content is playing on the monitor and in the correct orientation\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Confirm scheduled start time/date with Work Order manager\n2. Go to assigned FedEx Location prior to visit and pick up replacement hardware\n3. Confirm when hardware has been picked up\n4. Call POC when you arrive on site\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself and the type of work you will be completing on-site to the onsite manager.\n2. Locate digital signage player and hardware, and replace\n3. Call VID POC to confirm new player is showing online remotely, and content is displaying correctly on site\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Photos of site location (ie: note where equipment is located, take zoomed in photo but also zoomed out photo to reference equipment location)\n\n\\***Type of photos**: Photos of the components behind the screens, photos of the screens Serial number tags, photos of the screens showing content playing correctly.\n\n1. Call VID POC to check out once deliverables are uploaded, so we can review and ensure everything has been completed\n2. Signatures from Both you and the On-stie manager sign off upon completion of the work order.\n3. Check-out of work order\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Project Manager/Technician\n\n**-To note: Many times, you will be on the phone with the On-Site Point of contact during this visit**\n\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to Work Order Manager\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Pre-approved by Project manager prior to incurring / during the service visit\n-","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T10:00","end":"2026-10-23T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":180,"max":360},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":180,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":4.558136427491954},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TVs\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","su