{"job":{"id":"5382319791","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1132701.1 HP CLJ MANAGED FLOW MFP E87640-E87660Z UNCONFIGURED - The printer doesn't have an error, but 75 of the paper comes out magenta.","description":"<p>Customer Reference:10202026-1 --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- ABM FEDERAL</p><p><br></p><p>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---</p><p>ETA. </p><p><br></p><p>*MUST SPEAK WITH THE USER TO SET AN APT.</p><p>Tech needs an appointment with the end user, no Voicemail.</p><p>Need to provide the name of the tech so the site can put him on the security list.</p><p><br></p><p>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.</p><p>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)</p><p><br></p><p>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.</p><p><br></p><p>Initial notes: HP CLJ MANAGED FLOW MFP E87640-E87660Z UNCONFIGURED - The printer doesn't have an error, but 75 of the paper comes out magenta.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Per Support - Called EU and confirmed the printer issue and the site address.</p><p>Need tech to triage. The tech should run a sample to confirm the issue with the printer and then do clean and check printer, all rollers, fuser and paper path sensors for wear or damage. Tech should also test all features while on site. Please be very thorough and inspect a machine completely while onsite and NOT just look at the one issue reported. Need to give the entire machine a quick inspection for worn or damaged parts.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.</p><p>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login</p><p>techlink user name and password are the call number 1132701</p><p><br></p><p>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**</p><p><br></p><p>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.</p><p><br></p><p>General Instructions for All Calls-</p><p>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.</p><p>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.</p><p>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.</p><p>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.</p><p>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.</p><p>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.</p><p>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-22T08:00","end":"2026-10-22T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":53.6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/22/2026, 8:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1