{"job":{"id":20218036,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Quality Sign and Marquee","title":"Neon: Paper Tiger Box Standee","description":{"html":"<p>BE SURE TO CHECK SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL, QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT YET OPEN FOR THE DAY.</p><p><br></p><p>PROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.</p><p><br></p><p>If the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or cannot locate the standee.</p><p>If the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for <strong>HALF (50%)</strong> of the installation rate.</p><p><br></p><p>Scope of Work:</p><p>The provider is asked to confirm the standee has arrived (tracking attached to this workorder) before visiting the location. Once confirmed, plan to visit the location, locate the pre-shipped theatrical standee for Paper Tiger, build the display according to the attached instruction sheet, and place in a prominent location within the theatre lobby. <strong>Attached instructions are SAMPLE instructions.</strong></p><p>We are requesting (2) installation photos, 1 showing the standee properly installed and 1 showing the placement in the theatre. Keep in mind we want to see the display from a distance so we can see what is around the display.</p><p>The average installer has completed the standee in less than 1 hour, please plan accordingly.</p><p>The Instruction Sheet can be downloaded from the link below, please familiarize yourself with it before heading to your locations.</p>","markdown":"BE SURE TO CHECK SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL, QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT YET OPEN FOR THE DAY.\n\nPROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.\n\nIf the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or cannot locate the standee.\n\nIf the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for **HALF (50%)** of the installation rate.\n\nScope of Work:\n\nThe provider is asked to confirm the standee has arrived (tracking attached to this workorder) before visiting the location. Once confirmed, plan to visit the location, locate the pre-shipped theatrical standee for Paper Tiger, build the display according to the attached instruction sheet, and place in a prominent location within the theatre lobby. **Attached instructions are SAMPLE instructions.**\n\nWe are requesting (2) installation photos, 1 showing the standee properly installed and 1 showing the placement in the theatre. Keep in mind we want to see the display from a distance so we can see what is around the display.\n\nThe average installer has completed the standee in less than 1 hour, please plan accordingly.\n\nThe Instruction Sheet can be downloaded from the link below, please familiarize yourself with it before heading to your locations.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-21T12:00","end":"2026-10-30T22:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":40},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":10.483092916078247},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-21T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-22T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-22T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"