{"job":{"id":20224691,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVIT, LLC","title":"Collect cradle point info and IT rack photos 576021 ","description":{"html":"<p>Notice: No travel expenses will be approved without prior discussion with the work order manager before accepting the work order</p><p>**********************************************************************************************</p><p><strong>PLEASE CALL AVIT TO CHECK IN PRIOR TO ENTERING THE BUILDING- AVIT Support: 888-520-5229 ext. 1 Failure to call and speak to a live person at AVIT will activate a 75% reduction on over all pay</strong></p><p>**********************************************************************************************</p><p>Scope</p><p><strong>1.) Documentation</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Take pictures</strong> of the current rack mounting condition and surrounding area. Photos of the front, side and back with the rack swung open to see how it is secured to the wall.</li><li>Check the rack mounting condition and locate the wall backing (wood studs vs. drywall).</li><li><em>Critical Safety Rule: </em><strong>Do not attempt to remove current mounting bolts to install a washer.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>2.) Cable Management &amp; Testing</strong></p><ul><li>Perform any necessary cable clean-up and dressing.</li><li>Test the rack door/enclosure to <strong>ensure the rack closes smoothly</strong> without obstruction.</li></ul><p><strong>3.) Device Documentation </strong></p><ul><li><strong>Take a clear photo</strong> of the <strong>Cradlepoint </strong>sticker, ensuring the <strong>Serial Number, IMEI, and Model Number</strong> are fully legible.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">AVIT Support Technician: Kimberly Jamison</strong></p><p><strong>Reference Support ticket (</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">576021</strong><strong>)</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Technician will call the resource coordinator to Check out.</p><p><strong><u>If any issues arise or if the technician requires more detailed information or for general questions while on site, call the Resource Coordinator.​</u></strong></p>","markdown":"Notice: No travel expenses will be approved without prior discussion with the work order manager before accepting the work order\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**PLEASE CALL AVIT TO CHECK IN PRIOR TO ENTERING THE BUILDING- AVIT Support: 888-520-5229 ext. 1 Failure to call and speak to a live person at AVIT will activate a 75% reduction on over all pay**\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nScope\n\n**1.) Documentation**\n\n- **Take pictures** of the current rack mounting condition and surrounding area. Photos of the front, side and back with the rack swung open to see how it is secured to the wall.\n- Check the rack mounting condition and locate the wall backing (wood studs vs. drywall).\n- *Critical Safety Rule:* **Do not attempt to remove current mounting bolts to install a washer.**\n\n**2.) Cable Management & Testing**\n\n- Perform any necessary cable clean-up and dressing.\n- Test the rack door/enclosure to **ensure the rack closes smoothly** without obstruction.\n\n**3.) Device Documentation**\n\n- **Take a clear photo** of the **Cradlepoint** sticker, ensuring the **Serial Number, IMEI, and Model Number** are fully legible.\n\n**AVIT Support Technician: Kimberly Jamison**\n\n**Reference Support ticket (****576021****)**\n\nTechnician will call the resource coordinator to Check out.\n\n**If any issues arise or if the technician requires more detailed information or for general questions while on site, call the Resource Coordinator.​**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T09:00","end":"2026-10-23T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":58.88207413006089},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-23T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineering (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-26T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 