{"job":{"id":"1723884861","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"TecsPlus","title":"Network Tech- Garner NC","description":"<p><strong>We require our techs to arrive at least 15 minutes of requested ETA.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1. Timesheet MUST be printed and signed off by someone local. If you have to wait for more than 5 minutes after&nbsp;your release time, you MUST call 302 368 5656 Ext 2 to inform them so that you can be released from site without a signature. Failure to adhere will mean that you will have to WAIT for WO to be approved in a timely manner while we attempt to validate time onsite.</strong></p><p><strong>2.&nbsp;It is the responsibility of techs to report any expenses incurred on materials used and how it was used in their closing notes along with any other expenses within 0-24 hours of completion of assignment.</strong></p><p>**NOTE: Contact, Support Engineers details and Equipment details will be shared with Assigned FE Via Email. <strong><em><u>Details will NOT be added to Work Order.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong>Service Location</strong>: Garner NC <strong>27529</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tech  for the installation and testing including but not limited to Usip Switch, connect to, and test Spectrum&nbsp;circuit .&nbsp;Knowledge of static IP routing required.&nbsp;</p><p>Tech <em>may</em> be required to test directly from the carrier handoff with a laptop to verify speeds.</p><p>Tech to have a Windows 10 (or newer) laptop capable of testing to 1Gig and familiar with how to manipulate static assignments.&nbsp;Apple/MAC laptops are not approved for this effort.</p><p>Built in ethernet port preferred. USB Dongle is OK but must be proven capable of testing to 1 Gig previously.</p><p>Please make sure Windows is updated.&nbsp;Windows updates interfere with and slows down the completion of the install and testing.</p><p>This is a fiber circuit so Tech must have knowledge of connecting fiber optic cables.</p><p>Circuit details: 1000 M</p><p><br></p><p>Contact, Support Engineers details and Equipment details will be shared with Assigned FE Via Email.</p><p><br></p><p>Standard Tool Kit:</p><ul><li>Console Cable/Cisco Console Cable</li><li>Laptop</li><li>Buttset</li><li>Cat5 Cable (min 300 ft)</li><li>Cross-Connect Wire</li><li>Bridge Clips</li><li>Tie Wraps</li><li>Biscuits (Single/Double) Beige &amp; White</li><li>RJ48x Self Looping Jack for T1 extensions</li><li>RJ45 Jack Cat5 Rated and RJ45 Male Connectors</li></ul>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T11:45","end":"2026-10-28T13:45"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":100},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14.9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"star