{"job":{"id":20226632,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Keyboard – Replacement – Till 3","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Scope of Work: The store is experiencing issues with the keyboard at Till 3. Inspect the faulty keyboard and replace it with a new one to restore normal functionality. Test the replacement to ensure it is working correctly.</em></p>\n<p><em>Clients present issue: Store is experiencing issues with the keyboard at Till 3</em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Part shipped to the site?:(y)</em></p>\n<p><em>Please review the repair plans in the link below</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***********************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Other Instructions:</em></p>\n<p><em>If assistance is needed, please call: <del>************ ****** * *</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Required Tool List:</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>User called in and was verified with full name, employee ID, and BBR <del>*** * ** ************* * ***********</del></em></p>\n<p><em>ELO 2.0</em></p>\n<p><em>Cherry Keyboard <del>*****************</del></em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>For Shyft Services:</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>Keyboard is not working at Till 3 but there seems to be power as there is a green light for \"1\" near the number pad. We tried to guide the user to reseat the cable at the elo expansion dock but they were not able to locate the dock. Could you help them to check the cabling convention and see why the keyboard stopped working suddenly? If possible, bring an additional keyboard to test and replace if necessary. Thank you.</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><em>[code]KB0013286 : POS – Keyboard Troubleshooting[/code]</em