ut. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.</p>","markdown":"1\\. **Scope of Work** **includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.**\n\n*Scope of Work: The store is experiencing issues with the keyboard at Till 3. Inspect the faulty keyboard and replace it with a new one to restore normal functionality. Test the replacement to ensure it is working correctly.*\n\n*Clients present issue: Store is experiencing issues with the keyboard at Till 3*\n\n*Estimated time: 2 hours*\n\n*Part shipped to the site?:(y)*\n\n*Please review the repair plans in the link below*\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Other Instructions:*\n\n*If assistance is needed, please call: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\**\n\n*Required Tool List:*\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*User called in and was verified with full name, employee ID, and BBR \\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*ELO 2.0*\n\n*Cherry Keyboard \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*For Shyft Services:*\n\n*Keyboard is not working at Till 3 but there seems to be power as there is a green light for \"1\" near the number pad. We tried to guide the user to reseat the cable at the elo expansion dock but they were not able to locate the dock. Could you help them to check the cabling convention and see why the keyboard stopped working suddenly? If possible, bring an additional keyboard to test and replace if necessary. Thank you.*\n\n*\\[code\\]KB0013286 : POS – Keyboard Troubleshooting\\[/code\\]*\n\n*Email 2 :\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Store Hours :*\n\n*mon: 10:00-20:00*\n\n*tue: 10:00-20:00*\n\n*wed: 12:00-18:00*\n\n*thu: 10:00-19:00*\n\n*fri: 10:00-19:00*\n\n*sat: 10:00-19:00*\n\n*sun: 10:00-19:00*\n\n*timeZone: America/New\\_York*\n\n**Completion Requirements:**\n\n***Closing Notes are required to be provided before leaving the location.*** *These notes should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only. If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be* ***a detailed and concise statement about the work performed****.****Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.***\n\n*2.* **Part Information**:\n\n**Unused Parts**: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Used Parts**: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Missing Return Label**: - If the box is missing the return label, within the Part module select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.\n\n**General Rules**: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T10:0