{"job":{"id":20227093,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Survey","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: inherit; color: rgb(228, 120, 25);\">Survey needed</strong></p><p><br></p><ol><li><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Install Cabling – See attached floor plan.<ol><li>Four (4) Wireless Access Points<ol><li>Training Lab</li><li>Production Lab</li><li>Open Office - 2</li></ol></li><li>Two (2) Printers<ol><li>Outside Room 265</li><li>End of middle bench in Production Lab</li></ol></li><li>Two (2) connections (1 faceplate) – Room 258</li><li>Three (3) additional “extra’’ cables</li></ol></li><li>Rack and Stack FCX provided Equipment in Room 264 (Storage) – see attached pictures for current conditions<ol><li>24 port switch</li><li>PDU</li><li>Four (4) WAPs</li><li>Velo</li></ol></li><li>Install Patch Cables to Switch</li><li>Test Equipment</li></ol><p><strong style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: inherit; color: rgb(228, 120, 25);\"> </strong></p><p><br></p><p>The Pivital Post survey will need to be used for this. The link will be provided in the techs email.</p><p>Please provide images of all work completed onsite.</p><p>The post tool password for the survey will be “password_email address....the word passwordUNDERSCOREemailaddress”</p><p>Provide detailed close out notes including all work done onsite, any issues or delays, MOD&#39;s name, Support&#39;s name, and if a revisit is needed.</p><p>If work cannot be completed onsite, please call work order manager ASAP. Complete a site survey of Complete the attached Data Drop Survey_compucom.docx</p><p>1.    Upload both items as deliverables</p><p> </p><p><em>Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch.</em></p><p>Do not log multiple site visits on this work order.</p><p>Each site visit will require its own work order.</p><p>If a revisit is needed, close out this work order and contact P