{"job":{"id":"4533434948","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"INT13880424  ––T1872 –Durham, NC   Music/sound Player off line Ladder","description":"<p>T1872 - Image sound Player showing offline .</p><p><br></p><p>**Initial Description/Overview** INT13880424&nbsp;––T1872 –Durham, NC&nbsp;&nbsp;Music/sound Player off line Ladder&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>**\\*See Target Store Tech Tips for TOA attachment for tool recommendations\\***</p><p><br></p><p>\\*\\*\\***UPON ARRIVAL:** TECH MUST CALL GRANITE **TARGET SUPPORT BRIDGE +1 929-229-2436,,6261761#**</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>* Proceed to the Guest Service Desk, provide Identification and ask for a Designated Leader Jeorah Gilliam</p><p>* When meeting designated leader, provide the above incident number and reason for the service call, determine location of service call. Designated Store Lead will direct you to the package with replacement part that was delivered \\(see below for tracking details\\)&nbsp;</p><p>* If the store refuses the technician and work, the technician should ask the store leader/designated leader to call the CSC with the above incident number and service call number SR0087021</p><p><br></p><p>* **If Control Room Access is required, please reach out to CSC 612-304-4357 to obtain code – Tech Must read the attached Control Room Access and Regulations documents before requesting access.**</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**ISSUE** T1872 - Image sound Player showing offline .</p><p>**Tech must call Granite rep before leaving site to verify testing and final check out.&nbsp;DO NOT leave site without approval from your Granite Rep.**</p><p><br></p><p>**T2230 - In store music not working in specific location of store**</p><p>**Replacement Device /Equipment Info/Tracking**</p><p>**Return Visit to Tone and Trace and replace Cable for Zone 6 – Beauty Section.**</p><p>T1872 - Image sound Player showing offline .</p><p>The store has confirmed that music is playing through all the speakers. However, the Imagesound player is still showing as offline.</p><p><br></p><p>Kindly arrange a technician visit to the store to check the Imagesound player's network connectivity and investigate the offline status.</p><p>Outbound Tracking: Tech check Player</p><p>Return Tracking Provided: Tech check Player</p><p>Outbound UPN\\(s\\): Tech check Player</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**Closeout Checklist:**</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Confirm ALL devices online with designated leader.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Call **TARGET SUPPORT BRIDGE +1 929-229-2436,,6261761#** to check out BEFORE leaving.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Provide before and after pictures of devices worked on</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Picture of SN#\\(s\\) one of existing/old and one of new/replaced equipment</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pictures of certified cable tests</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pictures of termination points</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Record first and last name of site contact and support contact you worked with</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;**If equipment was shipped,** Box up unused equipment \\(old or new\\) with return label provided and TECH is responsible for dropping off at a UPS location, a picture of the return label and the receipt from UPS at drop off is a required deliverable</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**REQUIRED MATERIALS /TOOLS: Tech MUST have the following:**</p><p>**\\*Impedance Tester\\***</p><p>Laptop with power supply and USB to RS-232C converter cable</p><p>Cat5/Cat6 cable tester</p><p>Min 500ft CAT6 cable \\(White preferred\\)</p><p>CAT6 Jacks</p><p>CAT6 Patch cords various lengths</p><p>Basic hand tools</p><p>Pliers</p><p>Assorted screwdrivers</p><p>Precision screwdriver set</p><p>Drill</p><p>Velcro for cable management</p><p>Label maker \\(P touch or equivalent\\)</p><p>Patch cables</p><p>Cable tester Toner and Probe</p><p>Camera/Smart phone</p><p>8-10' Ladder&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**REQUIRED DELIVERABLES/Closing Info:**</p><p>Failure to provide the following may result in delayed payment.</p><p>Before and after photos showing device\\(s\\) worked on</p><p>Capture Clear Pictures SN#'s of existing equipment and replacement equipment</p><p>Manage cables neatly and cleanup work area\\(s\\).</p><p>Confirm all devices are online and working properly before leaving site</p><p>Picture of the return label AND the receipt from UPS at drop off</p><p>Record name of site contact that has verified work completed at closing</p><p>SIGNED work order.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**If Issue/SOW is unable to be resolved**, take necessary photos showing device\\(s\\), cable test results and any other problems preventing resolution, please describe findings and what was done on site.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T06:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":100},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":16.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.