{"job":{"id":20228098,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Zones LLC","title":"Food Lion 434 FUQUAY VARINA, NC - Install Antenna L-Bracket Mount in Meat Cooler","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope Notes</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">L-bracket needs to be installed to mount the antenna located in the </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">meat cooler</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. Photos attached.</span></p><p>Technician needed install existing antenna<strong> in the Meat cooler </strong>to newly provided L-Bracket.</p><p>L-Brackets are already on site.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Skill Set &amp; Tools Required:</strong></p><p>Label Maker</p><p>Silicone Sealer</p><p>Self-Tapping Screws for Metal Cooler</p><p>Hand tools (Ratchets, pliers, etc.)</p><p><strong><em>WhatsApp </em></strong>for efficient group communication&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>More Required Tools</strong></p><p>PPE - Hi-Vis shirt or vest and face mask if required by site</p><p>Steel Toe Boots, Safety Glasses, Lift Harness (This is required, if you don't own one, they are sold for about $20 at HD.)</p><p>Adjustable Ladder or 10' A-Frame</p><p>Standard RJ45 hand tools - Stripper, crimps, cat6a Mod Ends</p><p>Smartphone for communication while onsite</p><p>Network Equipment Experience Required</p>","markdown":"**Scope Notes**\n\nL-bracket needs to be installed to mount the antenna located in the **meat cooler**. Photos attached.\n\nTechnician needed install existing antenna **in the Meat cooler** to newly provided L-Bracket.\n\nL-Brackets are already on site.\n\n**Skill Set & Tools Required:**\n\nLabel Maker\n\nSilicone Sealer\n\nSelf-Tapping Screws for Metal Cooler\n\nHand tools (Ratchets, pliers, etc.)\n\n***WhatsApp*** for efficient group communication\n\n**More Required Tools**\n\nPPE - Hi-Vis shirt or vest and face mask if required by site\n\nSteel Toe Boots, Safety Glasses, Lift Harness (This is required, if you don't own o