{"job":{"id":"3719020434","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"The Streets at Southpoint UPS Replacment Project","description":"<p>2 techs Required After Hours</p><p><br></p><p>Techs to have 12 foot ladder</p><p><br></p><p>SCOPE:</p><p>- Techs to check in onsite with Mall Security (9195728808)</p><p>- Techs to call Renee Rhodes 401-955-6513 (if Teams Meeting invite was provided, log into meeting instead) and review full scope and proceed to first IDF</p><p>- At each IDF, techs to:</p><p> - Locate the new UPS and battery in its shipping carton prestaged at each IDF by Mall Mnagement, unbox and insert battery into UPS (instructions attached)</p><p> - Take before pictures of opened and closed IDF cabinet, a close up of the current UPS, and a picture of the Serial Number of the new UPS</p><p> - Rejoin meeting or call Renee to verify current status of IDF before proceeding</p><p> - Once approved, unplug IDF Power from current UPS and UPS cat6 from UPS management port to IDF switch port, leaving cabling in the IDF port</p><p> - Remove Old UPS from cabinet</p><p> - Install new UPS in cabinet and power up</p><p> - Plug IDF power into new UPS</p><p> - Connect UPS management port to IDF switch port using exisitng cat6 (if no exisitng cat6, coinnect new to IDF switch port 23)</p><p> - Rejoin meeting or call Renee to verify status of IDF matches with previous check</p><p> - Once verified, proceed to next IDF and repeat.</p><p><br></p><p>If any IDF requires a Lift, Mall will supply</p><p><br></p><p>List of IDFs in Scope:</p><p>Note: all MDF cabinets are recieving a 2200 sized UPS unit. All IDFs are recieving a 1500 unit, unless proceeded by (2200) in the below list.</p><p>IDF06, IDF09, IDF11</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T23:00","end":"2026-11-04T27:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":14.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{