{"job":{"id":20229065,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ATC Tech Solutions","title":"Camera Line of Sight and Turn Up - Raleigh, NC - Wednesday, 10/28 at 9AM","description":{"html":"<p>I have a retail customer who has a new store opening in a mall environment.   They have (8) cameras that have been pre-installed on site.   We need a technician to come to the store location the morning of the 28th and work with support to work with remote support on the camera configuration and to complete any line-of-sight adjustments that need to happen for these cameras.  There is no cabling that is needed and the cameras are already installed.  They just need boots on the ground to physically adjust the cameras as needed.</p><p><strong>I am putting this up for 2 hours as a placeholder - however, all time on site will be covered through a spend limit increase.</strong></p>","markdown":"I have a retail customer who has a new store opening in a mall environment. They have (8) cameras that have been pre-installed on site. We need a technician to come to the store location the morning of the 28th and work with support to work with remote support on the camera configuration and to complete any line-of-sight adjustments that need to happen for these cameras. There is no cabling that is needed and the cameras are already installed. They just need boots on the ground to physically adjust the cameras as needed.\n\n**I am putting this up for 2 hours as a placeholder - however, all time on site will be covered through a spend limit increase.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T09:00","end":"2026-10-28T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":110},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":4.558136427491954},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $110 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z