{"job":{"id":"9170695066","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Computacenter United States Inc.","title":"Network Tech - Hot Swap APC2200 UPS Batteries and NMC - Mebane, NC - Ticket #INC1005706","description":"<p>2&nbsp;Hour Minimum Provided</p><p><br></p><p>!!!The person assigned to the ticket must be the person going to site. No exceptions!!!  DO NOT BRING ANYONE ELSE TO SITE</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT: HOTSWAP IS DEFINED AS NOT POWERING DOWN UPS UNIT AND NOT UNPLUGGING ANY NETWORK DEVICE FROM THE BACK OF THE UNIT (NETWORK AND UPS REMAIN UP DURING BOTH HARDWARE SWAPS)</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Call IT Contact IMMEDIATELY upon arrival before any work is performed</strong></p><p><strong>Unbox UPS batteries and network management card 3 and inspect for physical damage and/or battery drainage.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Assess whether network management card can be hot swapped prior to branch close without interrupting network operations as remote programming will need to be performed which takes about 15 minutes</strong></p><p><strong>Hot swap UPS batteries and reset battery timer using LCD menu screen once given the green light by the LCON AFTER teller balancing process has been completed.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Rebox expired UPS batteries and NMCv2 using same original box and affix FedEx Ground shipping label provided by the LCON upon arrival; place box in branch designated FedEx pickup area for pick up the following day.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>* Take 3 photos of the work you performed*</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Technicians must call the First Horizon IT Support contact before you start any work and before leaving site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Carry a photo ID/driver license while on-site.</p><p><br></p><p>Expect a 24-hour, and 1-hour pre-call..</p><p><br></p><p>You will present yourself as a representative of Computacenter</p><p><br></p><p>Upon Arrival Contact your Computacenter Coordinator.</p><p>Failure to do so will result in the tech being released and not paid.</p><p><br></p><p>Before leaving ( NOT AFTER ) Contact First Horizon IT Support to be released from site then call the Computacenter Coordinator to check out.</p><p>Failure to do so will result in the tech being released and not paid.</p><p><br></p><p>GENERAL REQUIREMENTS: Working/Charged/Updated Drivers on Laptop, Console Cable, Standard tool box.</p><p><br></p><p>You should not discuss your rate of pay with the customer or show them any documents that contain the pay rate.</p><p><br></p><p>Arrive with tools and supplies needed to complete the work. Do not ask a customer for tools or assistance. No helpers of any kind are allowed without prior consent.</p><p><br></p><p>The deliverables must be uploaded to the WM assignment before checking out from the site and a phone call to check out with Computacenter Contact must be made before leaving the site, so that deliverables can be confirmed.</p><p><br></p><p>Contact your Computacenter contact asap if you cannot gain access to the site or contact the site contact.</p><p><br></p><p>Please contact your Computacenter contact asap if something happens and you cannot be onsite at the agreed upon day/time.</p><p><br></p><p>NO EXPENSES WILL BE REIMBURSED UNLESS AGREED TO BEFOREHAND BY THE ASSIGNMENT OWNER</p><p>Any receipts for materials must also be uploaded.</p><p><br></p><p>Failure to adhere to the above policies may result in effecting your compensation.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T16:30","end":"2026-10-29T19:30"},"payRange":{"min":59.23527263,"max":177.70581789},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":59.23527263,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":36.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $177.70581789 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10