{"job":{"id":20224239,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NEC Corporation of America","title":"Store IT/POS Equipment -test and validate the operational ability of all RIS equipment (Go Live testing)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview: Ensure the stores readiness before opening to the public. We will need to test and validate the operations of all RIS equipment.</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in basic electronic installation. Prefer Retail Point-of-Sale experience.</li><li>A detailed go live guide is provided to the assigned provider</li><li>Estimated duration will be 2 hours.</li></ul><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Pre-Site Requirements&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Check you are at the store number situated on your work request.</li><li>The store number can be situated on the front window of the Store, on the off chance that you don't discover the store number posted, ask store staff,General Contractor, or Field Consultant on location.</li><li>If no one onsite or unable to confirm, please contact the Deployment Support Team at <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************ ***** ****************</del></span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;<strong>On-Site Tasks (Overview- Step by step process attached in the document section of the work order)</strong></p><p><strong>Back Office Validations</strong></p><ul><li>Switch and Router are mounted to wall in back office</li><li>7MD charging cradle and 7MD x1 installed on top of back office desk</li><li>Chromebox properly mounted to back of monitor stand</li><li>Chromebox keyboard and mouse functioning properly</li><li>Back office Multi-Function Printer is operational</li></ul><p><strong>Point of Sale Validations on each (POS) &ndash; Testing to be completed on every POS</strong></p><ul><li>Login to POS</li><li>Valid POS scan item</li><li>Valid 7Rewards scan</li><li>Valid POS debit transaction</li><li>Valid POS receipt print</li><li>Validate cash drawer opens</li></ul><p><strong>Wireless Vali