{"job":{"id":20229779,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"Spectrum | Payment Kiosk | Printer Troubleshooting/Replacement/Testing","description":{"html":"<p><strong>This work order is to get our customer back up and running.</strong></p><p><strong>Only accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.</strong></p><p><strong>Must call Kiosk support to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty</strong></p><p><strong>Support Number:</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(303) 926-3154</span>&nbsp;- Hours are Mon - Friday 7am - 5pm MST</p><p><br></p><p><strong>The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back</strong></p><p><strong>NOTE: Call Kiosk and do not go to site if part has not delivered by your scheduled time.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>-Tools Required:</strong></p><p>__Standard Tool Set</p><p>__Nut Drivers or Socket Set</p><p>__Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth</p><p>__A to B USB Cable</p><p>__VGA Cable</p><p>__Compressed air/Canned Air</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p><p><strong>__Check in with the Work Order manager</strong></p><p>__PLEASE troubleshooting the existing printer <strong>PRIOR</strong> replacing to confirm there is a problem with the printer itself | <strong>Support Number:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(303) 926-3154</span></p><p>__Reference cleaning/PM guide. Check for jams, broken plastic, dislodged blades, etc.</p><p>__Check status light on printer</p><p>__Make sure paper is loaded properly</p><p>__Check power cable is properly connected to printer, ac adapter and to power strip</p><p>__Check USB cable to Printer and to PC</p><p>__Call KIOSK Support to report your findings and we'll confirm to you if we need to replace it (Pictures uploaded before calling is appreciated)</p><p>__if all checks out but we're still unable to get the printer working we can then replace the printer</p><p>__Disconnect printer power and USB cable</p><p>__Unscrew mounting screws from bottom of printer. Remove P clip for cables.</p><p>__Mount new printer using same hardware. Reattached P clip for cables.</p><p><strong>__Install bezel kit - Bezel is used to stick slightly out of the door to guide receipts to customer.<u> if there is no bezel on the printer tell KIS Agent. </u></strong></p><p><strong>__&nbsp;<u>REFERENCE PAGE 4- Step 4 &amp; Step 5 FOR ALIGNMENT/ADJUSTMENT</u></strong></p><p>__Paper holder to printer arm using the waster and hardware provided in the accessory kit</p><p>__Install the new assembled printer to Kiosk</p><p>__Reconnect new printer power and USB</p><p>__Load paper</p><p>__Test with Customer</p><p>__Take note of OLD serial and NEW serial.</p><p>__Call your Work Order manager to check out</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Company: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.</strong></p><p><strong>Support Number:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(303) 926-3154</span>&nbsp;- Hours are Mon - Friday 7am - 5pm MST</p><p><strong>346 S Arthur Ave.</strong></p><p><strong>Louisville, CO 80027</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">(303) 926-3154</strong></p>","markdown":"**This work order is to get our customer back up and running.**\n\n**Only accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.**\n\n**Must call Kiosk support to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty**\n\n**Support Number:** (303) 926-3154 - Hours are Mon - Friday 7am - 5pm MST\n\n**The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back**\n\n**NOTE: Call Kiosk and do not go to site if part has not delivered by your scheduled time.**\n\n**-Tools Required:**\n\n\\_\\_Standard Tool Set\n\n\\_\\_Nut Drivers or Socket Set\n\n\\_\\_Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth\n\n\\_\\_A to B USB Cable\n\n\\_\\_VGA Cable\n\n\\_\\_Compressed air/Canned Air\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n**\\_\\_Check in with the Work Order manager**\n\n\\_\\_PLEASE troubleshooting the existing printer **PRIOR** replacing to confirm there is a problem with the printer itself | **Support Number:** (303) 926-3154\n\n\\_\\_Reference cleaning/PM guide. Check for jams, broken plastic, dislodged blades, etc.\n\n\\_\\_Check status light on printer\n\n\\_\\_Make sure paper is loaded properly\n\n\\_\\_Check power cable is properly connected to printer, ac adapter and to power strip\n\n\\_\\_Check USB cable to Printer and to PC\n\n\\_\\_Call KIOSK Support to report your findings and we'll confirm to you if we need to replace it (Pictures uploaded before calling is appreciated)\n\n\\_\\_if all checks out but we're still unable to get the printer working we can then replace the printer\n\n\\_\\_Disconnect printer power and USB cable\n\n\\_\\_Unscrew mounting screws from bottom of printer. Remove P clip for cables.\n\n\\_\\_Mount new printer using same hardware. Reattached P clip for cables.\n\n**\\_\\_Install bezel kit - Bezel is used to stick slightly out of the door to guide receipts to customer. if there is no bezel on the printer tell KIS Agent.**\n\n**\\_\\_ REFERENCE PAGE 4- Step 4 & Step 5 FOR ALIGNMENT/ADJUSTMENT**\n\n\\_\\_Paper holder to printer arm using the waster and hardware provided in the accessory kit\n\n\\_\\_Install the new assembled printer to Kiosk\n\n\\_\\_Reconnect new printer power and USB\n\n\\_\\_Load paper\n\n\\_\\_Test with Customer\n\n\\_\\_Take note of OLD serial and NEW serial.\n\n\\_\\_Call your Work Order manager to check out\n\n**Company: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.**\n\n**Support Number:** (303) 926-3154 - Hours are Mon - Friday 7am - 5pm MST\n\n**346 S Arthur Ave.**\n\n**Louisville, CO 80027**\n\n**(303) 926-3154**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T11:00","end":"2026-10-23T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":75},"payTyp