{"job":{"id":"6459059236","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"KnitWell - Connectivity Refresh - Cutover and Edgeboot Install | LOFT 0661","description":"<p>***PLEASE ARRIVE WITHIN REQUESTED TIME WINDOW AS CUSTOMER NOC HAS A HARD STOP OF 5PM EST TO COMPLETE CUTOVER***</p><p><br></p><p>***If edgeboot is not onsite, we will still be proceeding with cutover portion with bridge team. Do not release the tech after working with activation team, please have them called into the bridge to work with KW team - Bridge: +1 929-229-2436 Passcode: 650 176 514 # ***</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>*** Tech must reference attachment for complete SOW procedures *** </p><p><br></p><p>General SOW:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Check in and meet manager on duty upon arrival</p><p><br></p><p>Locate Granite provided equipment bring to the back of the store/network space</p><p><br></p><p>All locations will receive at least 1 x edgebootPro Smart PDU</p><p><br></p><p>Some locations will receive a SIM card for swap in current LTE device</p><p><br></p><p>Bring equipment to back of store network space and take a wide angle picture before starting</p><p><br></p><p>Locate circuit and complete testing with laptop</p><p><br></p><p>Circuits will be broadband, Granite GRID/GRIDe, or DIA</p><p><br></p><p>If issue with connection, locating circuit – follow procedures in attachment</p><p><br></p><p>If a dmarc extension is required, the tech must survey the extension to return estimate to Granite</p><p><br></p><p>Record speed tests to circuit</p><p><br></p><p>If dynamic, confirm it can surf</p><p><br></p><p>If static, used the assigned IP’s to laptop and confirm if can surf</p><p><br></p><p>Install edgebootPro smart power distribution unit</p><p><br></p><p>Locate an outlet near new circuit and customer’s network equipment</p><p><br></p><p>Only carrier equipment will be connected via power to the PDU (no customer equipment)</p><p><br></p><p>Verify the PDU lights are on</p><p><br></p><p>Call into Granite provided TEAMS bridge to work with Granite support and customer IT support to complete cutover to new circuit and ethernet connection to edgeboot port 0 – Bridge: +1 929-229-2436 Passcode: 650 176 514 #</p><p><br></p><p>Each site will have a unique customer equipment port to connect the ethernet cable to for cutover, please reference the complete SOW in attachment</p><p><br></p><p>Complete cutover</p><p><br></p><p>Customer IT support will verify connection to CPE and new circuit and confirm ok to release</p><p><br></p><p>Move old equipment out of way for customer to return</p><p><br></p><p>Close up</p><p><br></p><p>Clean up space, take pictures of all devices and wide angle after install, sign out with manager</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Circuit Information</p><p><br></p><p>Access Type BB</p><p>Carrier BlueLine</p><p>Product / Bandwidth GRANITE RURAL BROADBAND Cable 100 Mbps</p><p>Circuit ID 13008</p><p>IP Type Dynamic</p><p>IP Address</p><p><br></p><p>Gateway</p><p><br></p><p>Subnet Mask</p><p><br></p><p>MAC Address A4:08:53:6E:5A:01</p><p>Modem Type Nokia</p><p>DMARC (DIA Only)</p><p><br></p><p>NID NSOID (ON NET DIA Only)</p><p><br></p><p>NID UPS Tracking # (ON NET DIA Only) </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Edgeboot Information</p><p><br></p><p>Serial # 2037260315</p><p>Edgeboot UPS Tracking 1Z7X569X0334487585</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-30T10:00","end":"2026-10-30T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6.7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null},"reason":"PAYMENT_INSUFFICIENT","rejectDetails":"Rate $50/hr is below base rate $65/hr"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.00