{"job":{"id":20231376,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Device Courier -  Pick Up and Drop Off","description":{"html":"<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs97C2AA46\">Important: Onsite Time is measured from arrival time at FedEx, transit time from FedEx to Site, restock, and then drop-off at Fedex for Return.]</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Technicians Labor Times&nbsp;Start Time</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;- is when they&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">ARRIVE</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;at&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">local FEDEX HOLD&nbsp;[ not when they arrive onsite ]</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Check-In upon arrival at FEDEX&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Technicians Labor&nbsp;End Time</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;is</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">HAS defective equipment to return</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;- their labor ends when they drop equipment off at FedEx</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Check-Out upon leaving FedEx&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">DOES NOT have defective equipment to return</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;- their labor ends when they are finished at site.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Check-Out upon leaving the site&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Required On-site time/window:</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> ASAP</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Equipment:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Make/Model: OTH</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Serial Number: {SRM_FN.SERIAL}</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Problem Description:</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> For Essinsial: This is a refill request for 6 devices. Please collect the Package from Fed-Ex and assist with placing the laptops in the lockers and taking out the defective laptops. Please prepare additional time if we need to rearrange the lockers. The Refill ticket will be logged after we have agreed on a date for the visit, as Fed-Ex will only hold a package for up to 5 days. Once you reach BASF, please call us from Talkative by clicking on &quot;Click to support&quot;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csAC525ECB\">Tracking number Replenishment:</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csAC525ECB\">Return label tracking:</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">3842 1165 4055</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">7981 9691 1411</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">3842 1184 6199</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">7981 9686 1972</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">3842 1168 2055</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">7981 9685 8884</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">3842 1172 8830</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">7981 9685 9733</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">3842 1161 5654</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">7981 9691 3002</span></p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">3842 1178 1831</span></p><p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"csF9555EFC\">7981 9691 0231</span></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9AD462FD\">***Scope of Work Instructions***</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">General </span><span class=\"csEFAFD4EB\">Scope of Work</span><span class=\"cs97C2AA46\">:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"csC2DDC91E\">Technician to go and pick up equipment up at local fedex hold, drive to customers site location,&nbsp;work with the HCL VITP - Virtual IT Point via onsite&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;Talkative Video Calling System&quot; to drop equipment off in customers onsite VITP storage lockers, and if applicable take defective equipment out of lockers and drop off a local FedEx Hold for return to customer.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Scope of Work Step by Step Instructions:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Pick up the laptops from FedEx.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Arrive at the BASF office</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> and use the Talkative machine by selecting </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">&ldquo;Click to Support.&rdquo;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">One of our agents [ </span><span class=\"csC2DDC91E\">HCL VITP - Virtual IT Point Agents ]</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> will answer the call and guide the technician step‑by‑step.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"csC2DDC91E\">&quot;Talkative Video Calling System&quot; Process -</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\"> </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Refer to the&nbsp;HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process:&nbsp;<span class=\"csC1D8CEBD\">https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U</span></span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Open the package:</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Every package contains a </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">return label</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> &mdash; keep this aside for return shipping.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">There will be an inner box containing the </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">new laptop</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Our agent [ </span><span class=\"csC2DDC91E\">HCL VITP - Virtual IT Point Agents ]</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> will provide the </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">admin PIN</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> and guide the technician to open the locker.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Remove the defective laptop</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> from the locker.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Place the new laptop inside the locker</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">, share the </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">serial number</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">, and close the locker.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Ship the defective laptop back to FedEx:</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Pack the old laptop back into the box.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Stick the </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">return label</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> onto the box.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Return it at the FedEx location.</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs97C2AA46\">Onsite Virtual IT Point via Onsite &quot;Talkative Video Calling System&quot; Process</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs97C2AA46\">Refer to the&nbsp;HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process</span><span class=\"csC2DDC91E\">:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"><span class=\"csC1D8CEBD\">https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U</span></span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"csB54904E9\">Important Tech Information &amp; Requirements</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">ARE NOT</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;to go to site unless equipment is ready for pickup at local FedEx&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;Represent themselves as an Essintial Technician on behalf of HCL/BASF</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;carry/present BASF Badge while onsite</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Information on Site:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">You must represent themselves as an Essintial technician on behalf of HCL/BASF while on site.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;carry/present BASF Badge while onsite</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Onsite -&nbsp;DO NOT GO ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE BUILDING except to the storage locker and back</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business. </span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">Dress code is business casual; no jeans or holes. Collared or button down shirt, slacks, and nice shoes required.</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Scope/Customer Information:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Any changes to ETA&rsquo;s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED.&nbsp;You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Required Tools:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Cell Phone or other device that has a phone, camera, and internet ability&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Standard hand tools</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Upon Arrival at FedEx:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs5AB00083\">CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">&ndash;&nbsp;if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">855-612-2183</span><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">&nbsp;to check in.&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs5AB00083\">Upon Arrival at the Site:&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Enter the site with Badge and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Introduce yourself as an Essintial Technician on behalf of HCL/BASF&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Go to Virtual ID Area -</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;DO NOT GO ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE BUILDING except to the storage locker and back.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Ref to the</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&quot;</span><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Scope of Work Step by Step Instructions&quot;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\"> - posted above in your Work Order</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Once at the VITP Point, there is a device that the techs will use to call the VITP Team - Refer to the&nbsp;HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">:&nbsp;<span class=\"csC1D8CEBD\">https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U</span></span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Work with the HCL VITP Team&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">HCL VITP Agent will Advise what locker the devices will go into and advise which lock to pull the defective from.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">The team will guide and open lockers for tech and provide support, techs will provide new and old device serials to the team.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">HCL VITP Agent will provide </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">admin PIN</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">VITP Agent will release the tech, once call has ended tech will leave and exit</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technician to take any defective equipment with them and drop off at FedEx Immediately after leaving the site</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Techs DO NOT GO ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE BUILDING except to the storage locker and back.&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">&nbsp;Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Get Released from the site by the VITP Agent - obtain agents Name</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Take Defective Equipment and drop off at local FedEx</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">Call the Essintial Project Team @&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs8B49C83F\">855-612-2183</span><span class=\"cs7D58027A\">&nbsp;opt 2 to perform your final check out</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Note about Check-Out:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Technicians Labor&nbsp;End Time</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;is</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">HAS defective equipment to return</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;- their labor ends when they drop equipment off at FedEx</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Check-Out upon leaving FedEx&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">DOES NOT have defective equipment to return</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;- their labor ends when they are finished at site.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Check-Out upon leaving the site&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Closing / Completion Notes:</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Detailed Description of the Work that took Place, including any issues and delays</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Name of the HCL VITP Agent who released you from the site?</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Return Tracking Numbers (if applicable)</span></li></ul>","markdown":"IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time & only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.\n\nYOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU \\*\\*MUST\\*\\* HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.\n\nImportant: Onsite Time is measured from arrival time at FedEx, transit time from FedEx to Site, restock, and then drop-off at Fedex for Return.\\]\n\n- Technicians Labor Times Start Time - is when they ARRIVE at local FEDEX HOLD \\[ not when they arrive onsite \\]\n- Check-In upon arrival at FEDEX\n- Technicians Labor End Time - is\n- If technicians HAS defective equipment to return - their labor ends when they drop equipment off at FedEx\n- Check-Out upon leaving FedEx\n- If Technicians DOES NOT have defective equipment to return - their labor ends when they are finished at site.\n- Check-Out upon leaving the site\n\nRequired On-site time/window: ASAP\n\nEquipment:\n\nMake/Model: OTH\n\nSerial Number: {SRM\\_FN.SERIAL}\n\nProblem Description: For Essinsial: This is a refill request for 6 devices. Please collect the Package from Fed-Ex and assist with placing the laptops in the lockers and taking out the defective laptops. Please prepare additional time if we need to rearrange the lockers. The Refill ticket will be logged after we have agreed on a date for the visit, as Fed-Ex will only hold a package for up to 5 days. Once you reach BASF, please call us from Talkative by clicking on \"Click to support\"\n\nTracking number Replenishment:\n\nReturn label tracking:\n\n3842 1165 4055\n\n7981 9691 1411\n\n3842 1184 6199\n\n7981 9686 1972\n\n3842 1168 2055\n\n7981 9685 8884\n\n3842 1172 8830\n\n7981 9685 9733\n\n3842 1161 5654\n\n7981 9691 3002\n\n3842 1178 1831\n\n7981 9691 0231\n\n\\*\\*\\*Scope of Work Instructions\\*\\*\\*\n\nGeneral Scope of Work: Technician to go and pick up equipment up at local fedex hold, drive to customers site location, work with the HCL VITP - Virtual IT Point via onsite \"Talkative Video Calling System\" to drop equipment off in customers onsite VITP storage lockers, and if applicable take defective equipment out of lockers and drop off a local FedEx Hold for return to customer.\n\nScope of Work Step by Step Instructions:\n\n- Pick up the laptops from FedEx.\n- Arrive at the BASF office and use the Talkative machine by selecting “Click to Support.”\n- One of our agents \\[ HCL VITP - Virtual IT Point Agents \\] will answer the call and guide the technician step‑by‑step.\n- \"Talkative Video Calling System\" Process - Refer to the HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process: <https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U>\n- Open the package:\n- Every package contains a return label — keep this aside for return shipping.\n- There will be an inner box containing the new laptop.\n- Our agent \\[ HCL VITP - Virtual IT Point Agents \\] will provide the admin PIN and guide the technician to open the locker.\n- Remove the defective laptop from the locker.\n- Place the new laptop inside the locker, share the serial number, and close the locker.\n- Ship the defective laptop back to FedEx:\n- Pack the old laptop back into the box.\n- Stick the return label onto the box.\n- Return it at the FedEx location.\n\nOnsite Virtual IT Point via Onsite \"Talkative Video Calling System\" Process\n\n- Refer to the HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process: <https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U>\n\nImportant Tech Information & Requirements\n\n- Technicians ARE NOT to go to site unless equipment is ready for pickup at local FedEx\n- Technicians MUST Represent themselves as an Essintial Technician on behalf of HCL/BASF\n- Technicians MUST carry/present BASF Badge while onsite\n\nImportant Information on Site:\n\n- You must represent themselves as an Essintial technician on behalf of HCL/BASF while on site.\n- Technicians MUST carry/present BASF Badge while onsite\n- Onsite - DO NOT GO ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE BUILDING except to the storage locker and back\n- These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business.\n- Dress code is business casual; no jeans or holes. Collared or button down shirt, slacks, and nice shoes required.\n\nImportant Scope/Customer Information:\n\n- Any changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone.\n- If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.\n- If additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED. You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.\n- All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n- Cell Phone or other device that has a phone, camera, and internet ability\n- Standard hand tools\n\nUpon Arrival at FedEx:\n\n- CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER – if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ 855-612-2183 to check in.\n\nUpon Arrival at the Site:\n\n- Enter the site with Badge and Introduce yourself as an Essintial Technician on behalf of HCL/BASF\n- Go to Virtual ID Area - DO NOT GO ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE BUILDING except to the storage locker and back.\n- Ref to the\n- \"Scope of Work Step by Step Instructions\" - posted above in your Work Order\n- Once at the VITP Point, there is a device that the techs will use to call the VITP Team - Refer to the HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process: <https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U>\n- Work with the HCL VITP Team\n- HCL VITP Agent will Advise what locker the devices will go into and advise which lock to pull the defective from.\n- The team will guide and open lockers for tech and provide support, techs will provide new and old device serials to the team.\n- HCL VITP Agent will provide admin PIN\n- VITP Agent will release the tech, once call has ended tech will leave and exit\n- Technician to take any defective equipment with them and drop off at FedEx Immediately after leaving the site\n- Techs DO NOT GO ANYWHERE ELSE IN THE BUILDING except to the storage locker and back.\n\n Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements\n\n- Get Released from the site by the VITP Agent - obtain agents Name\n- Take Defective Equipment and drop off at local FedEx\n- Call the Essintial Project Team @ 855-612-2183 opt 2 to perform your final check out\n\nImportant Note about Check-Out:\n\n- Technicians Labor End Time - is\n- If technicians HAS defective equipment to return - their labor ends when they drop equipment off at FedEx\n- Check-Out upon leaving FedEx\n- If Technicians DOES NOT have defective equipment to return - their labor ends when they are finished at site.\n- Check-Out upon leaving the site\n\nClosing / Completion Notes:\n\n- Detailed Description of the Work that took Place, including any issues and delays\n- Name of the HCL VITP Agent who released you from the site?\n- Return Tracking Numbers (if applicable)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T09:00","end":"2026-10-23T12:00","latestStart":"2026-10-23T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":90},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":30,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":7.037388443886853},"result":{"eligib