lose the locker.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Ship the defective laptop back to FedEx:</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Pack the old laptop back into the box.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Stick the </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">return label</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> onto the box.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Return it at the FedEx location.</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs97C2AA46\">Onsite Virtual IT Point via Onsite &quot;Talkative Video Calling System&quot; Process</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs97C2AA46\">Refer to the&nbsp;HCL BASF Onsite VITP Process - Return and Replenishment Process</span><span class=\"csC2DDC91E\">:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"><span class=\"csC1D8CEBD\">https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000003uH9J/cEucV0buMb0kEy.aD.huNaNut7UUrDFEb5FO7Un976U</span></span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"csB54904E9\">Important Tech Information &amp; Requirements</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">ARE NOT</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;to go to site unless equipment is ready for pickup at local FedEx&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;Represent themselves as an Essintial Technician on behalf of HCL/BASF</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;carry/prese