{"job":{"id":20231370,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Sparkplug-IP","title":"Motel/Studio 6 Fayetteville, NC PBX items","description":{"html":"<p>Tech Scope of Work: Tech needed onsite to assist Sparkplug engineers with reconnecting PBX and Telcom equipment. Site is currently undergoing a network refresh, and it looks like the PBX and Telcom equipment may have been disconnected from the network.&nbsp;Tech will need to locate equipment and reconnect the network connections to restore service.</p><p>Required Tools:</p><ul><li>Basic Hand tools</li><li>Patch cables</li><li>Windows Laptop with Ethernet port/dongle</li><li>Cable toner/tester</li><li>Phone Buttset</li><li>DB9 serial cable male with USB to serial adaptor</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Call Support: <span style=\"color: rgb(31, 118, 194);\">616-227-4400</span> to BOTH check in/out and confirm if any equipment requires shipping and labels are received.</p>","markdown":"Tech Scope of Work: Tech needed onsite to assist Sparkplug engineers with reconnecting PBX and Telcom equipment. Site is currently undergoing a network refresh, and it looks like the PBX and Telcom equipment may have been disconnected from the network. Tech will need to locate equipment and reconnect the network connections to restore service.\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n- Basic Hand tools\n- Patch cables\n- Windows Laptop with Ethernet port/dongle\n- Cable toner/tester\n- Phone Buttset\n- DB9 serial cable male with USB to serial adaptor\n\nCall Support: 616-227-4400 to BOTH check in/out and confirm if any equipment requires shipping and labels are received.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-23T09:00","end":"2026-10-23T12:00","latestStart":"2026-10-23T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":210},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":56.5527505852686},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":70,"baseAmount":210,"estHours":3,