{"job":{"id":20176053,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Global Net Commerce Inc GNCI","title":"Cellular Site Survey","description":{"html":"<p>Site survey to determine best cellular carrier.&nbsp;&nbsp;Test takes about about one hour to complete.</p><p><strong>***Survey kit will be shipped to FedEx***</strong></p><p><strong><u>Provider Must Bring The Following Required Equipment:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Smartphone</li><li>FWA02 Survey Kit (shipped to FedEx prior to survey date)</li><li>50’ Extension cord</li><li>6-Outlet Power Strip</li></ul><p><strong>Instructions:</strong></p><p>Upon arrival at location introduce yourself to site contact.&nbsp;Proceed to testing location and set up survey equipment per the attached <em>FWA02 Kit Guide</em>, then call GNCI (949-515-1960) to launch survey.&nbsp;After survey is complete, return survey kit in same box, in same condition as received, using provided FedEx return shipping label.</p><p><strong>Accepted Expenses:</strong></p><p>Parking fees and FedEx fees with a receipt of the total amount, unforeseen issues with the site contact or equipment resulting in extended time (each amount accepted will differ based on the situation), and extra tests that are added at the site ($50 added for extra tests).</p><p><strong>Unaccepted Expenses:</strong></p><p>Toll road expense, extended travel expense.</p><p><strong>Work order paid when return delivery is complete.</strong></p>","markdown":"Site survey to determine best cellular carrier. Test takes about about one hour to complete.\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Survey kit will be shipped to FedEx\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Provider Must Bring The Following Required Equipment:**\n\n- Smartphone\n- FWA02 Survey Kit (shipped to FedEx prior to survey date)\n- 50’ Extension cord\n- 6-Outlet Power Strip\n\n**Instructions:**\n\nUpon arrival at location introduce yourself to site contact. Proceed to testing location and set up survey equipment per the attached *FWA02 Kit Guide*, then call GNCI (949-515-1960) to launch survey. After survey is complete, return survey kit in same box, in same condition as received, using provided FedEx return shipping label.\n\n**Accepted Expenses:**\n\nParking fees and FedEx fees with a receipt of the total amount, unforeseen issues with the site contact or equipment resulting in extended time (each amount accepted will differ based on the situation), and extra tests that are added at the site ($50 added for extra tests).\n\n**Unaccepted Expenses:**\n\nToll road expense, extended travel expense.\n\n**Work order paid when return delivery is complete.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T11:00","end":"2026-10-28T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":125,"max":125},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":36.27710346272338},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $125 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:0