{"job":{"id":20231865,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Netview Inc.","title":"Dispatch Ticket - Smart hands- CABLE ISSUE","description":{"html":"<p>The SOW is: Need cable tech to replace fiber cable running from SW4 (IDF) to ACCM212 Port 50. Tech should have a rollover cable.</p>\n<p>INC000012086461 RET-0099 - case #C261013-18862873</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>ONSITE: 10<strong>/26/2026 10:00AM</strong>. DO NOT SHOW UP OUTSIDE OF THE REQD TIMEFRAME</p>\n<p>Bring cabling trunk stock and MUST have working cable tester. Will need passing test results of cabling once ran.</p>\n<p>Must have rollover cable</p>\n<p>REQUIRES TECH TO BRING THE FOLLOWING BEFORE ARRIVING AT STORE:</p>\n<p>---Laptop</p>\n<p>---Cisco Console Cable (with serial to USB converter)</p>\n<p>---USB Console Cable</p>\n<p>---Rollover Cable (with RJ45 connector on both ends)</p>\n<p>---Straight-through Cable</p>\n<p>---Crossover Cable</p>\n<p>---15 ft. Ethernet Cable</p>\n<p>---USB/Flash drive (at least 2 GB of capacity)</p>\n<p>---Serial to USB convertor (To connect console cable from switch/router to Laptop)</p>\n<p>---Have Putty software installed on technician laptop PRIOR to arrival- (http://www.putty.org)</p>\n<p>---Have TFTP server software installed on technician laptop PRIOR to arrival- (Google it)</p>\n<p>---The helpdesk may also ask you to download additional files from the internet (such as Solarwinds and the image file), so make sure you have the ability to connect via WiFi (REQ TECH TO HAVE DEDICATED HOTSPOT IN SERVER RM).</p>\n<p>.</p>","markdown":"The SOW is: Need cable tech to replace fiber cable running from SW4 (IDF) to ACCM212 Port 50. Tech should have a rollover cable.\n\nINC000012086461 RET-0099 - case #C261013-18862873\n\nONSITE: 10**/26/2026 10:00AM**. DO NOT SHOW UP OUTSIDE OF THE REQD TIMEFRAME\n\nBring cabling trunk stock and MUST have working cable tester. Will need passing test results of cabling once ran.\n\nMust have rollover cable\n\nREQUIRES TECH TO BRING THE FOLLOWING BEFORE ARRIVING AT STORE:\n\n\\---Laptop\n\n\\---Cisco Console Cable (with serial to USB converter)\n\n\\---USB Console Cable\n\n\\---Rollover Cable (with RJ45 connector on both ends)\n\n\\---Straight-through Cable\n\n\\---Crossover Cable\n\n\\---15 ft. Ethernet Cable\n\n\\---USB/Flash drive (at least 2 GB of capacity)\n\n\\---Serial to USB convertor (To connect console cable from switch/router to Laptop)\n\n\\---Have Putty software installed on technician laptop PRIOR to arrival- (<http://www.putty.org)>\n\n\\---Have TFTP server software installed on technician laptop PRIOR to arrival- (Google it)\n\n\\---The helpdesk may also ask you to download additional files from the internet (such as Solarwinds and the image file), so make sure you have the ability to connect via WiFi (REQ TECH TO HAVE DEDICATED HOTSPOT IN SERVER RM).\n\n.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T10:00","end":"2026-10-26T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":220},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":57.191737840915096},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $220 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.0