{"job":{"id":"1682341178","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Walmart Tenant Connectivity Service - EPIK NID Activation for Earl Of Sandwich - WMT 4250","description":"BEGIN SCOPE OF WORK<br>Access letter is attached to ticket if needed<br>Review Scope  below and then call Dario 401-955-6516  or chris Nunes 401-288-1842<br>Locate tenant Earl Of Sandwich at front of store<br>Call LCON for access  OR locate Walmart Store Manager for assistance ( needed for Walmart closets)<br>Please locate Granite shipment (tracking included with circuit information at end of Scope as well as activation contact info)<br>Locate data jack labeled Granite in Tenants suite call Dario for pictures.<br>- If you unable to locate the router, please find a store associate and ask them to take you to receiving to find the package. If unable to locate contact dispatcher or go to customer space incase it was sent to suite.<br>\"ROUTER INSTALL<br>Locate data jack labeled Granite in Tenants suite (if unable to locate, call  Dario or Chris Nunes for assistance / photos but photos will be attached in documents of ticket of cable location and Walmart IDF switch)<br>Please note cable might be In the ceiling and a photo will be attached if it is in the ceiling to be pulled to customers network area or a specific location by dispatcher if provided. Should be 50ft of service left <br>Unbox and plug in Granite edge router<br>- Patch the Granite Jack in WAN port ETH 0/1<br>- Test out of Customer Lan port ETH 0/2<br>Call Granite Activations to verify port assignment, connectivity, run a speed test, and troubleshoot as required<br>- Inform them that you are installing a Granite router for a Walmart Tenant (DO NOT mention 'EPIK' )<br>- You may need to go to the local IDF closet to verify if the extension is connected to the correct switch and port.<br>- make sure router is mounted on customers telco board unless lcon onsite has a different prefer location for router to be placed or if cable is on a faceplate just place router where faceplate is located<br>DELIVERABLES<br>Take photos of:<br>- Location of biscuit jack in tenant space<br>- Speed tests<br>- Final location of Granite edge router\"<br><br>CHECK OUT<br>Call  Dario or Chris Nunes to check out<br>END SCOPE OF WORK<br><br>Provisioning Info:<br>Demarc:s-gm: General Merchandise Switch<br>Circuit ID:TCS000720<br>Router config on port 1<br>IP:DHCP<br>Gateway:DHCP<br>Subnet:DHCP<br>Switch/Port Infos-gm-1 / ge-/0/0/1<br>NID / CPE ID:<br>NID Tracking:1Z7X569X0304822367<br>Granite Activations: 888-860-1159 Option 2. Reference ticket","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T10:00","end":"2026-10-26T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":8.6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":260,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T20:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"sta