{"job":{"id":20229517,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Hemmersbach US","title":"5 DAYS HP Raliegh, NC /Weekly Onsite Break and Fix Field Service Support","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>3-DAY, 8 HOURS A DAY WORK ORDER*</u></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>SCOPE OF WORK:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Provide Field Break &amp; Fix Services to customers within a 60-mile radius.</p>\n<p>The provider must pick up required parts before and return old parts after each intervention to the specified pick-up/drop-off location. <u>The receipt of the returned parts must be uploaded via a clear picture.</u></p>\n<p>Break-Fix services will include PC, laptops, RPOS, and similar devices.</p>\n<p>All tickets assigned for the day must be completed, as they form the basis for work order fulfillment. <strong>Provider must give the customer a courtesy call before attending onsite, if not able to reach the provider MUST still attend onsite.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>All work/repairs MUST be conducted on-site; no equipment should be removed from the customer's site for any reason.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>The assigned provider is expected to provide timely updates on the status of their assigned cases. Failure to comply may result in delayed approval of the work order or off-boarding.</strong></p>\n<p>The Field Service Team will contact you via email to convey the Welcome email. All other engagements will be done via email/phone. See the Contact section for their details.</p>\n<p><strong>Equipment Requirements:</strong></p>\n<p>• Laptop</p>\n<p>• Reliable Transportation</p>\n<p>• Basic Laptop, Desktop, RPOS tools</p>\n<p>• USB Stick (for branding)</p>\n<p>*The work order is based on ticket volume, should the volume not warrant a full 8 hour work day we reserve the right to offboard early with a minimum of one day's notice.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>SERVICE PROVIDER SAFETY &amp; SECURITY GUIDELINES</u></strong></p>\n<p>Service Provider will ensure that Service Provider personnel assigned to work on Hemmersbach’s or Hemmersbach’s customer premises:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not bring weapons of any kind onto Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer premises.</li>\n<li>Do not manufacture, sell, distribute, possess, use or be under the influence of controlled substances (for nonmedical reasons) or alcoholic beverages while on Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer premises.</li>\n<li>Do not have in their possession hazardous materials of any kind on Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer premises without Hemmersbach's authorization.</li>\n<li>Service Provider will promptly notify Hemmersbach of any accident or security incidents (such as those involving loss or misuse of, or damage to, Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer assets, physical altercations, assaults or harassment) and provide Hemmersbach with a copy of any accident or incident report involving the above.</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**3-DAY, 8 HOURS A DAY WORK ORDER\\***\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\nProvide Field Break & Fix Services to customers within a 60-mile radius.\n\nThe provider must pick up required parts before and return old parts after each intervention to the specified pick-up/drop-off location. The receipt of the returned parts must be uploaded via a clear picture.\n\nBreak-Fix services will include PC, laptops, RPOS, and similar devices.\n\nAll tickets assigned for the day must be completed, as they form the basis for work order fulfillment. **Provider must give the customer a courtesy call before attending onsite, if not able to reach the provider MUST still attend onsite.**\n\n**All work/repairs MUST be conducted on-site; no equipment should be removed from the customer's site for any reason.**\n\n**The assigned provider is expected to provide timely updates on the status of their assigned cases. Failure to comply may result in delayed approval of the work order or off-boarding.**\n\nThe Field Service Team will contact you via email to convey the Welcome email. All other engagements will be done via email/phone. See the Contact section for their details.\n\n**Equipment Requirements:**\n\n• Laptop\n\n• Reliable Transportation\n\n• Basic Laptop, Desktop, RPOS tools\n\n• USB Stick (for branding)\n\n\\*The work order is based on ticket volume, should the volume not warrant a full 8 hour work day we reserve the right to offboard early with a minimum of one day's notice.\n\n**SERVICE PROVIDER SAFETY & SECURITY GUIDELINES**\n\nService Provider will ensure that Service Provider personnel assigned to work on Hemmersbach’s or Hemmersbach’s customer premises:\n\n- Do not bring weapons of any kind onto Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer premises.\n- Do not manufacture, sell, distribute, possess, use or be under the influence of controlled substances (for nonmedical reasons) or alcoholic beverages while on Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer premises.\n- Do not have in their possession hazardous materials of any kind on Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer premises without Hemmersbach's authorization.\n- Service Provider will promptly notify Hemmersbach of any accident or security incidents (such as those involving loss or misuse of, or damage to, Hemmersbach's or Hemmersbach’s customer assets, physical altercations, assaults or harassment) and provide Hemmersbach with a copy of any accident or incident report involving the above.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T08:00","end":"2026-10-26T48:00"},"payRange":{"min":38,"max":1500},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":37.5,"estLaborHours":40,"distance":5.546402466054024},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No in-hours counter slot available\nRequested: Mon, Oct 26, 8:00 AM\nChecked: Mon, Oct 26, Tue, Oct 27, Wed, Oct 28, Thu, Oct 29, Fri, Oct 30 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.