ment/patch panels  \n• Dry and wet fiber cleaning supplies  \n• P-touch label printing machine and labels capable of printing 3 row labels  \n• Cisco Console Cable  \n• USB-Serial Adapter  \n• Laptop with charger  \n• Smart phone (photo capable) with charger and international dialing\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n- Note: Client will provide any cabling that is to remain in the network\n\n  \n  \n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts as representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-16T08:00","end":"2026-10-16T15:23"},"payRange":{"min":443,"max":3277},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":443.4,"estLaborHours":7.39,"distance":7.633937711815665},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/16/2026, 8:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-16T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-17T02:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-17T03:00:00.000Z","summary":"Call Mom"},{"start":"2026-10-19T12:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T13:30:00.000Z","summary":"Listen Audio Book"},{"start":"2026-10-20T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-20T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"DataMax"},{"start":"2026-10-19T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-19T19:30:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T1