{"job":{"id":20233810,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Protos Security","title":"IP Camera Switch re-install, must have a 24ft extension ladder","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Tech must have a 24ft extension ladder</strong></p><p>Tech needed to re-install a new switch at the \"<span style=\"color: rgb(41, 50, 57);\">2100 breezeway\" location. The switch is on-site with the Leasing Office</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Knowledge of IP/analog cameras, general cable troubleshooting and general network troubleshooting required.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Must check in with Help Desk and Project Manager.</strong></p><p><strong>Must be released by Help Desk and Project Manager. Help Desk number and Project Manager is in Confidential Information Section.</strong></p>","markdown":"**Tech must have a 24ft extension ladder**\n\nTech needed to re-install a new switch at the \"2100 breezeway\" location. The switch is on-site with the Leasing Office\n\nKnowledge of IP/analog cameras, general cable troubleshooting and general network troubleshooting required.\n\n**Must check in with Help Desk and Project Manager.**\n\n**Must be released by Help Desk and Project Manager. Help Desk number and Project Manager is in Confidential Information Section.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T10:00","end":"2026-10-27T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":75},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":55.9268799182181},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $75 (countered: $75) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00: