{"job":{"id":"1147140370","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Highspring | 06054980 Parklake | On-Net DIA and BB Cutover &amp; Testing","description":"<p>TU ticket. </p><p>Turn Up Date/Time:</p><p> Oct 19 at 9:00 AM (local time)</p><p>Location: </p><p>4130 Parklake Ave Ste 300, Raleigh, NC 27612</p><p><br></p><p>Customer Contacts:</p><p>Stephanie Bagwell (919) 624-3109</p><p>Jacob Franklin (615) 838-3467</p><p>Granite Contacts:</p><p>Kaitlyn Horgan (617) 804-4555</p><p><br></p><p>From Previous ticket (7060944)</p><p>SOW: Unable to complete SOW - upon arrival, unable to locate the primary Lumen circuit onsite and called into activations for more information. Completed walkthrough with the MOD on both the 3rd floor where the network equipment is located and the 1st floor communication room where the demarc is located but unable to find the circuit. Activations rep Daniel called into the carrier and opened tag and locate ticket with Lumen. Located the secondary ATT BB circuit, connected laptop and ran speed tests with Daniel. Unable to get proper speeds required; speeds were below 100/100 and needed 500/500 minimum. Went through troubleshooting steps with Daniel and attempted to reboot the modem + change configuration settings on laptop but unable to resolve. Daniel determined issue is with the carrier and called into ATT. Daniel advised ticket opened with ATT to dispatch tech to troubleshoot/resolve circuit issues. Unable to proceed with cutover. Left the new Granite EPIK router and edgeboot staged in the network cabinet, powered off because there were no available outlets at the cabinet; will need surge protector or devices disconnected to free up power on future visit. Revisit required. Took pictures.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Scope of Work: Cutover to newly installed circuits – On-net DIA and BB</p><p><br></p><p>•Once on site locate the new circuits (x2) </p><p>oDIA GE - 1000MBPS Circuit ID: VA/KXFN/162213/LUMN</p><p>EPIK FlexEdge information on ticket 6395152</p><p>oBB- ATT500M/500M Circuit ID: 345932287</p><p>•Dial into conference bridge at 9:30 AM. </p><p>oBridge Info: +1 929-229-2436</p><p>•Test and turn up the new circuits listed above.</p><p>•Coordinate with the customer’s team to validate connectivity.</p><p>•Confirm end‑to‑end functionality and report any issues identified during testing.</p><p><br></p><p>________________________________________</p><p>Support / Escalation</p><p>If there are any issues related to circuit location, connectivity, or speeds, the technician must contact:</p><p>Granite Activations Team</p><p> 877 855 1146</p><p>➡️ Option 1 (BB)</p><p>➡️ Option 2 (DIA)</p><p>Reference Ticket Number: </p><p><br></p><p>________________________________________</p><p> Circuit Information</p><p>#1. Primary Circuit: On-Net DIA</p><p>Carrier: Level3</p><p>Circuit ID: NC/KXFN/179426/LUMN</p><p>DEMARC: 1st floor communication room, wall mounted switch RLGKNCBSZG001, RJ45 customer port ge0/0/0 labeled with NC/KXFN/179426/LUMN</p><p>Bandwidth: 1000m</p><p>NNI: VA/KFFN/710678/LVLCVA/KFFN/710678/LVLC</p><p>VLAN: 2591</p><p><br></p><p>#2. Secondary Circuit: Broadband</p><p>Carrier: ATT</p><p>CID: 345932287</p><p>IP: 68.78.36.185-68.78.36.189</p><p>Gateway: 68.78.36.190</p><p>Subnet: 255.255.255.248</p><p>DNS1: 68.94.156.1</p><p>DNS2: 68.94.157.1</p><p>Speed: 500M/500M</p><p>________________________________________</p><p> Extension Requirements</p><p>If an extension is required:</p><p>•Perform a site survey</p><p>•Provide materials list and cost when closing the ticket</p><p>________________________________________</p><p>✅ Close Out Documentation (Required)</p><p>Please include the following photos with ticket closure:</p><p>•Photo of newly installed Edgeboot</p><p>•Photo of circuit labeling</p><p>•Photo showing circuit connection</p><p>________________________________________</p><p> Required Materials &amp; Tools</p><p>•Laptop (Windows 2000 or higher) with administrator access</p><p>•AC power adapter</p><p>•Internet access (cell/mobile card or hotspot)</p><p>•DB 9 serial cable and serial port or USB to serial adapter</p><p>•Console cable</p><p>•4G card</p><p>•AC extension cord</p><p>•Cell phone with charger</p><p>•Butt set</p><p>•Punch down tool</p><p>•Crimp tool</p><p>•Minimum 500 ft CAT5e cabling</p><p>•RJ 45 jacks and plugs</p><p>•Biscuit jacks</p><p>•Surface mount box</p><p>•NID splitter</p><p>•DSL filters</p><p>•USB to USB console cable</p><p>•USB A to RJ 45 console cable</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T09:00","end":"2026-10-29T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":1.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":