{"job":{"id":20236097,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"POSRG Remarketing Group","title":"Imbox Breakdown Device","description":{"html":"<p><strong>*******PLEASE READ ENTIRE WORK ORDER BEFORE ACCEPTING*********</strong></p><p><strong><u>-----------------THIS IS FOR A SHOE PROTECTION SPRAY KIOSK------------------------</u></strong></p><p><em>-------------------------ALL GUIDES ARE PROVIDED BELOW-----------------------------</em></p><p>***TECH WILL NEED ALL EQUIPMENT FROM REQUIRED LIST BELOW***</p><p><strong><em>Please read the entire work order before requesting this job.</em></strong></p><p><strong>Please read the attached documentation and print out the installation check list as needed before service.</strong></p><p><strong><em>TECH: Please call Work Order Manager (see ticket) when you first arrive. If additional technical assistance is needed, please reach out to WO manager to connect to support.</em></strong></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work Overview</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>!!!!Run Diagnostics report and take picture, send to WOM before starting troubleshooting!!!!!!!</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>sn- </u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 37, 46);\">522010320  ///</span><span style=\"color: rgb(99, 115, 129);\">&nbsp;request that the technician install the newly configured SSD (1.5 software already installed on hard drive)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(99, 115, 129);\">Tracking#879138977512</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(99, 115, 129);\">﻿</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***</del></strong><strong>Failure to check in may result in a loss of compensation and any travel expenses.</strong></p><p><strong><u>Required Deliverables to be Paid</u></strong></p><p><strong>MUST&nbsp;</strong>check in/out with POSRG work order manager.</p><p>The Imbox has been tested and is functioning before departure.</p><p>Complete the check list and attach photos to the work order.</p><p>Leave detailed closing notes.</p><p><strong><u>Duration on Site</u></strong></p><p>An experienced technician can be done in about 2 hours.If more time is needed the technician is required to call the work order manager to get approval. Failure to get approval will result in nonpayment.</p><p><strong><u>Required Tools</u></strong></p><p>Tools:</p><ul><li>Torx bit bet (T6 – T30)</li><li>Precision screwdriver set</li><li>Screwdriver set</li><li>Digital multimeter</li><li>Curved needle nose</li><li>Socket set (5.5mm, 10mm, etc.)</li><li>2 Adjustable wrenches</li><li>Wrench set</li><li>Flashlight</li></ul>","markdown":"**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*PLEASE READ ENTIRE WORK ORDER BEFORE ACCEPTING\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**-----------------THIS IS FOR A SHOE PROTECTION SPRAY KIOSK------------------------**\n\n*-------------------------ALL GUIDES ARE PROVIDED BELOW-----------------------------*\n\n\\*\\*\\*TECH WILL NEED ALL EQUIPMENT FROM REQUIRED LIST BELOW\\*\\*\\*\n\n***Please read the entire work order before requesting this job.***\n\n**Please read the attached documentation and print out the installation check list as needed before service.**\n\n***TECH: Please call Work Order Manager (see ticket) when you first arrive. If additional technical assistance is needed, please reach out to WO manager to connect to support.***\n\n**Scope of Work Overview**\n\n**!!!!Run Diagnostics report and take picture, send to WOM before starting troubleshooting!!!!!!!**\n\n**sn-** 522010320 /// request that the technician install the newly configured SSD (1.5 software already installed on hard drive)\n\nTracking#879138977512\n\n﻿\n\n**\\*\\*\\*****Failure to check in may result in a loss of compensation and any travel expenses.**\n\n**Required Deliverables to be Paid**\n\n**MUST** check in/out with POSRG work order manager.\n\nThe Imbox has been tested and is functioning before departure.\n\nComplete the check list and attach photos to the work order.\n\nLeave detailed closing notes.\n\n**Duration on Site**\n\nAn experienced technician can be done in about 2 hours.If more time is needed the technician is required to call the work order manager to get approval. Failure to get approval will result in nonpayment.\n\n**Required Tools**\n\nTools:\n\n- Torx bit bet (T6 – T30)\n- Precision screwdriver set\n- Screwdriver set\n- Digital multimeter\n- Curved needle nose\n- Socket set (5.5mm, 10mm, etc.)\n- 2 Adjustable wrenches\n- Wrench set\n- Flashlight","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T11:00","end":"2026-10-27T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":210},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":16.00665037439804},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $210 (countered: $210) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-26T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10