{"job":{"id":20236388,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"ASAP- Deploy and Test SIB","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Testing:</u></strong></p><p>Very IMPORTANT _ Call the POC and get site access. Confirm the equipment is located before calling <del>****</del> - if you are not able to gain access to the building OR the equipment within 10 minutes ESCALATE per the Prep guide </p><p><br></p><p>Check in with <del>****</del> Bridge Line/Remote Technical Services (Number in confidential section and tasks). </p><p><br></p><p>They will then send you an email to start an email chain where all technical support will be provided. If you have ANY non-technical issues, please call the same number, but all technical issues will be handled through email. If you don’t receive an email within 10 minutes, please contact <del>*******</del> at <del>************</del> and give them your work order #, so they can let the PM know. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>The techs must have laptops and work through email.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Event Name: Beauty Extra Colleagues Discount  </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Number of registers: 3 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Register 1 number: 12 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Register 1 MAC:  </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Register 2 number: 48 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; backg