int a copy of this scope of work and bring it to site\n- Call \\*\\*\\* Support with any question or clarification about the Scope of Work\n\nON SITE WORK- Check In on the Field Nation Portal\n- Introduce yourself as representative of \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Call \\*\\*\\* Support to check in @ \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* entering premises\n- Check in with the on-site contact and enter their name into the Required Task in the Field Nation Portal\n- Must call into \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*Repair Support to the number provided in the on-site process.\n- Call into \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*Repair a\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Troubleshoot and resolve the repair issues on site.\n- Upload pictures of equipment powered up\n- Upload pictures of cable connections on devices\n- Upload a picture of speed test results from Laptop\n- Clean-up work materials from install (wire clipping, boxes, trash, and any other debris)\n- Call \\*\\*\\*  Support to check out @ \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* If after 5pm PST, press **option 3** leave a message.\n\n**POST-SITE WORK**\n\n- Confirm deliverables are complete\n- Enter Close out notes into Order\n- Enter \\*\\*\\* Release Code (Given by the \\*\\*\\* Support at the time of close out)\n- Check out in Field Nation Portal provide full detailed notes on what was done on site.\n\n **ESCALATIONS**\n\n- Call Technical Support number if you encounter any issues on-site @ \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- DO NOT perform any work outside of scope. If asked to perform out of the scope work, call \\*\\*\\* Support.\n\n**ADDITIONAL HOURS & EXPENSES APPROVAL PAYMENT POLICY**\n\n- Parking expenses will be paid only if a receipt is submitted in the Field Nation App.\n\n- Buyer \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* does not pay travel expenses unless pre-approved. Any approved travel expenses must be entered in the Field Nation App as “Travel Expenses” and not additional hours. Travel expenses can be pre-approved by calling \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*. If approved the Buyer \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* will document the additional expenses in the messages of the Field Nation portal.\n\n- Buyer \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* does not pay parts and material expenses unless pre-approved. Any additional expenses associated with parts and materials must be pre-approved by calling \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*. If approved the Buyer \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* will document the additional expenses in the messages of the Field Nation portal. Any material use, please take pictures of them and load them to the Field Nation portal for approval.\n\n- Any hours worked beyond the pre-approved Max hours on the published job description must be pre-approved by calling \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*. If approved, the Buyer \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* will document the additional approved time in the messages of the Field Nation portal.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T20:30","end":"2026-10-28T22:30"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":160},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":80,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":59.92650623488999},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $160 (countered: $160) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start"