ype in the meeting ID and password.\n- Stay connected for the entire visit\n- Please tell them when you get there and when you leave, as well as what the next action is needed.\n- In the meeting chat, enter:\n- **INC#**\n- **Arrival time**\n- **Departure time**\n- **Do not leave the site unless released by the NOC team**\n- **The NOC team on the bridge will you send you to a second bridge. If you have been on that second bridge for a while with no one from the NOC team joining, rejoin the primary bridge and let them know.**\n\n**They will create a secondary room for your specific ticket/issue. You will work with the team for your specific issue. Please join back the main bridge once you are finished to check out.**\n\n**﻿**\n\n**3. Post-Service Actions**- Document all work performed in the **FieldNation closing notes**\n- Notify **Argus** of the resolution prior to departure\n- Return any unused parts using the provided **return label** (if applicable)\n\n**4. Required Tools & Equipment**- Smartphone with hotspot\n- Laptop with admin access, Teams, Putty, and email\n- Console cables (USB to RJ45)\n- Cable Tester / Toner\n- Wi-Fi analyzer app\n- IT hardware repair kit\n- Patch cables, crimpers, cable testers\n- Spare RJ-45 connectors (**MUST BE CAT6)**\n- Spare Ethernet cables (various lengths)\n- General hand tools and accessories\n\n**5. Ticket notes from client:**\n\n\"Store manager Patrick Eldridge for visit on as soon as possible.\n\nIssue - SCO 55 Catalina printer\n\n\\[Service Request:\\]\n\nNEED TECH ONSITE TO TONE AND TEST/REPLACE CABLE FROM CATALINA SWITCH TO CATALINA PRINTER\"\"\"\n\n**If you need a schedule change/want to request the work order - REQUEST A SCHEDULE CHANGE. We can troubleshoot as long as the store is open. Whatever time you get there, we will adjust on the WO so it doesn't impact your rating.**\n\n**The phone number on the Work Order is for on-site escalations and emergencies. Calling the number repeatedly everyday for future work consideration, will result in not using you as a technician for future engagements.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T07:00","end":"2026-10-27T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":220},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":26.787546445815774},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $220 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1792805227243}
{"job":{"id":20238188,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ProAct Services","title":"RRM-WO202610240001 Monitor Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>THIS WORK ORDER MUST HAVE A TECHNICIAN ON SITE ON THE DATE SCHEDULED IN THE WORK ORDER DUE TO CUSTOMER CONTRACT.</p><p>This work order requires a technician to replace a monitor in a Rack Room / Off Broadway / Rookie shoe store, which has been shipped to deliver to the store by 4:30 pm</p><p>The monitor requiring replacement is located at Register 2.</p><p>Estimated time on site is approximately 1 hour.<strong> </strong></p><p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Check in with ProAct Support/Project Coordinator at the number listed below.</p></li><li><p>To replace the defective monitor, contact the Rack Room help desk for testing, as required. Help Desk number is listed below.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Pack the defective monitor in the box that the new monitor arrived in, placing the shipping label that was included.</p></li><li><p>Instruct the Manager on Duty to arrange for a pickup of the defective monitor ASAP.</p></li><li><p>Take site completion photos and complete the sign off sheet (attached to this work order) with the manager on duty.</p></li><li><p>Provide photos to the ProAct Project Coordinator for review and approval prior to checking out or leaving the site.</p></li><li><p>Check out with the ProAct Project Coordinator.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Photo of old monitor before removal.</p></li><li><p>Photo of new monitor with working screen.</p></li><li><p>Photo of the entire POS.</p></li><li><p>Photo of return shipment, sealed and with return label (ENDORSE to MOD).</p></li><li><p>Close up photo of return label.</p></li><li><p>Complete and detailed photo of the sign off sheet from top to bottom, please make sure MOD initial is filled out in the right side columns, at the bottom part should have MOD signature with printed name</p></li></ul><p></p>","markdown":"THIS WORK ORDER MUST HAVE A TECHNICIAN ON SITE ON THE DATE SCHEDULED IN THE WORK ORDER DUE TO CUSTOMER CONTRACT.\n\nThis work order requires a technician to replace a monitor in a Rack Room / Off Broadway / Rookie shoe store, which has been shipped to deliver to the store by 4:30 pm\n\nThe monitor requiring replacement is located at Register 2.\n\nEstimated time on site is approximately 1 hour.\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n- Check in with ProAct Support/Project Coordinator at the number listed below.\n- To replace the defective monitor, contact the Rack Room help desk for testing, as required. Help Desk number is listed below.\n\n- Pack the defective monitor in the box that the new monitor arrived in, placing the shipping label that was included.\n- Instruct the Manager on Duty to arrange for a pickup of the defective monitor ASAP.\n- Take site completion photos and complete the sign off sheet (attached to this work order) with the manager on duty.\n- Provide photos to the ProAct Project Coordinator for review and approval prior to checking out or leaving the site.\n- Check out with the ProAct Project Coordinator.\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n- Photo of old monitor before removal.\n- Photo of new monitor with working screen.\n- Photo of the entire POS.\n- Photo of return shipment, sealed and with return label (ENDORSE to MOD).\n- Close up photo of return label.\n- Complete and detailed photo of the sign off sheet from top to bottom, please make sure MOD initial is filled out in the right side columns, at the bottom part should have MOD signature with printed name","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T16:30","end":"2026-10-27T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":98},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":37.175627184565606},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end