{"job":{"id":20238237,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Mattress Firm - Network Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"Check-in Requirements:<br/>-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1 <br/>-Check in with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755<br/><br/>While Onsite:<br/>-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed<br/>-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW<br/>-Tech support:  Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite<br/><br/>Description of trouble: CS4 is down and may be termination or cabling issues. <br/><br/>SOW: <br/>-Tone out the entire run and eliminate the cable, replace cables if bad<br/>-Bring a 10 foot ladder, and 50 feet of cables incase the run is bad<br/>-Device was moved to port 6 of CS1 to run a cable test. Repair connection issue and move back to port 6 of Firewall or MX68<br/>-Make Sure Port 6 of MX68 is up before COC<br/>-re-terminate if need be<br/>-Work with MFI to confirm CS4 is up and can be pinged<br/>-Fully test devices connected to CS4 and get MFI and store manager signoff before ending the job. <br/><br/> <br/>Please bring a laptop with you.  If you have a hotspot bring it with you. <br/>Please bring a tone generator and tracer in case you must trace wiring. <br/>If going out to RUN or TEST wiring bring a CABLE TESTER Please bring patch cable (RJ45 and RJ11) and butt sett Make sure all the devices are working prior to leaving site. <br/><br/>    <br/>Checkout Requirements:<br/>-Check out with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755<br/>-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1<br/>-Tech must document store manager's name and Mattress Firm IT support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout <br/>-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out<br/><br/>Required Tools:<br/>-Basic Cabling Tools<br/>-Butt set<br/>-Cable toner<br/>-Cable Tester<br/>-Label Maker<br/>-CAT 6 cabling<br/>-fiber tester <br/>-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends<br/>-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights","markdown":"Check-in Requirements:  \n-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1   \n-Check in with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755  \n  \nWhile Onsite:  \n-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed  \n-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW  \n-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite  \n  \nDescription of trouble: CS4 is down and may be termination or cabling issues.   \n  \nSOW:   \n-Tone out the entire run and eliminate the cable, replace cables if bad  \n-Bring a 10 foot ladder, and 50 feet of cables incase the run is bad  \n-Device was moved to port 6 of CS1 to run a cable test. Repair connection issue and move back to port 6 of Firewall or MX68  \n-Make Sure Port 6 of MX68 is up before COC  \n-re-terminate if need be  \n-Work with MFI to confirm CS4 is up and can be pinged  \n-Fully test devices connected to CS4 and get MFI and store manager signoff before ending the job.   \n  \n   \nPlease bring a laptop with you. If you have a hotspot bring it with you.   \nPlease bring a tone generator and tracer in case you must trace wiring.   \nIf going out to RUN or TEST wiring bring a CABLE TESTER Please bring patch cable (RJ45 and RJ11) and butt sett Make sure all the devices are working prior to leaving site.   \n  \n   \nCheckout Requirements:  \n-Check out with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755  \n-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1  \n-Tech must document store manager's name and Mattress Firm IT support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout   \n-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out  \n  \nRequired Tools:  \n-Basic Cabling Tools  \n-Butt set  \n-Cable toner  \n-Cable Tester  \n-Label Maker  \n-CAT 6 cabling  \n-fiber tester   \n-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends  \n-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin right