{"job":{"id":20236419,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Replace SFPs on both ends of the fiber run / 19 FT Lift will be used","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Weblink Survey:</strong><strong>https://pivitalapps.com/verizonTarget/?case=00741634</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Replace SFPs on both ends of the fiber run.</p>\n<p>Replace fiber patch cable to patch panel if replacing SFPs does not resolve issue.</p>\n<p>Do not leave the store without checking out</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>t2930swtb0002 is IDF2</p>\n<p>t2930swtcoreb - inside the control room.</p>\n<p><strong>Note from Client:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tech to perform troubleshooting and/or replacement of Network device (s) listed.</li>\n<li>Complete online Installation webform:&nbsp;<del>***********************************************</del></li>\n<li>Need to arrive onsite 15 minutes prior but no later than the pre-arranged start time as stated in the schedule.</li>\n<li>Tech to state when they are enroute to site and check in on the platform when they arrive inside the store</li>\n<li>Call the NOC&nbsp;<del>**************</del> to notify of your arrival and locate POC “ETL Lead”</li>\n<li>If Parts or Lift were requested, work with POC “ETL Leader” to locate the equipment and mention ETL office. Parts will have an Orange Sticker, check in AREA TCS.</li>\n<li>Tech to work with NOC during entirety of visit.</li>\n<li>Attach pictures as required and update your closeout notes. This must be completed before you check out.</li>\n<li>Return lift to pick-up location</li>\n<li>Package devices for return and take them with you.</li>\n<li>Check out with NOC, then the work order and notify work order manager from Pivital.</li>\n<li>Drop off return shipments at UPS within 24 hours of the site visit using the label provided and include a receipt on your work order.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Tool Requirements</u></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n