{"job":{"id":20240983,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Intelligent Communication Solutions","title":"Fry KDS (jack & patch cable) ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in Low Voltage Cabling/Troubleshooting.</li><li>Tech is required to have Networking/Cabling/POS/KDS/Printer Experience</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1-2 Hours.</li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code: </strong></p><ul><li>Pants</li><li>shirts</li><li>work shoes (non-slip preferred)</li><li>nothing offensive</li></ul><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong><em> </em></p><ul><li><em> </em>Screw divers</li><li>Crimpers</li><li>punch down</li><li>scissors</li><li>toners</li><li>cable certifier preferred</li><li>RJ 45 mod plugs</li><li>Cat5/Cat6 Keystone Data Jacks</li><li>Surface Mount and or Single/Double Port Keystone Plates.</li><li>Cay5/6 Patch cords 3- 7 foot</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Tech needed to troubleshoot and repair an offline KDS. (Kitchen Display System)  Tone/Test cable from the wall plate at the KDS to the 48 port network switch at the rack. Replace Keystone Inserts and Patch Cords at the KDS, Test and confirm operational with the site manager. Call ICS to check in and out.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks </em></strong></p><ol><li>Must call <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>***</del></span> to check in onsite <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*************</del></span></li><li>Connect with ICS remote tech when onsite walk though scope of work in depth&nbsp;</li><li>Work with ICS remote tech to troubleshoot and fix/repair problem&nbsp;</li><li>Check out with Manager on duty (MOD), to ensure device is working properly</li><li>Must get MOD name for remote tech</li><li>Must provide details of work completed to remote techs during the checkout of site call&nbsp;</li><li>Must call <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 