emote tech\n6. Must provide details of work completed to remote techs during the checkout of site call\n7. Must call \\*\\*\\* to check out once completed \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Must obtain signature of MOD once work completed\n2. Photos of completed scope of work - based on remote tech request\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, please call \\*\\*\\* at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Any issues or questions while onsite should be escalated to Remote Tech\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n-","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T09:45","end":"2026-10-26T11:45","latestStart":"2026-10-26T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":90,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":43.728306290171176},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"Family"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","sum