e, repair, or replace while onsite. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs55FA0F8F\">Technicians are required to use the provided box(es) and all packing materials for shipping equipment. All equipment must be securely packaged and technicians should take photos of the package before sealing it to ensure proper packing. Failure to package the equipment securely and provide requested photos will result in penalties if the equipment is inbounded and determined to be damaged.</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Important Scope/Customer Information:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Any changes to ETA&rsquo;s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">via phone. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Parts and Support are provided by Travel Centers - TA Support Desk contact number = </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">1-800-243-5782&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this - Contact Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED, You MUST contact Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required online deliverable.</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Tech Requirements:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech MUST represent themselves as Essintial on behalf of Travel Centers of America (TA)</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech MUST check-in with site MOD upon Arrival</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech MUST package returned equipment security for shipment and upload photos.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech MUST complete online deliverable prior to leaving site</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Required Tools:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">150 FT Cat 5/6 Cable</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Standard/Basic hand tools</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Screwdrivers</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Cell Phone or other device that has a phone, camera, and internet ability (for online deliverable) </span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Laptop, with access to a cellular hotspot</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Cable Straps or Velcro</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Appropriate Console cables (for Cisco, Fortinet, Aruba)</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Installation tools (for racking and unracking equipment</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Cabling termination tools (RJ45 ends, jacks)</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Testing equipment (cable tester, cable toner, multimeter)</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Online Deliverable Requirements | Deliverable Link:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"><span class=\"csF7506C85\">https://essintial.jotform.com/250866044689166</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to Obtain Customer Sign-Off or&nbsp;If Site POC is unavailable then the tech MUST contact TA Service Desk @ 1-800-243-5782 to be released from site and report the agents name in the online deliverable instead of obtaining sign-off</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to take a photo of the completed device</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverables</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Upon Arrival at site:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Introduce yourself as Essintial technician on behalf of Travel Centers (TA) to the onsite MOD</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If applicable, locate parts or whole units shipped to site by Customer.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Troubleshoot/repair or replace failed component to return failed system to working order</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Remote technical support, if needed, is provided by TA Help Desk.</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Confirm functionality with Travel Centers Help Desk &amp; provide their name upon closure</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Complete online Deliverable</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technician to use the box that component arrived in to return failed component utilizing provided return label. </span><span class=\"cs55FA0F8F\">All equipment must be securely packaged and technicians should take photos of the package before sealing it to ensure proper packing.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technician will leave the box at site with the Store Manager or POC for Customer to arrange pickup.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out</span></li></ul>","markdown":"IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time & only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.\n\nYOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU \\*\\*MUST\\*\\* HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.\n\nPasscode: Goose\n\nRequired On-site time/window: ASAP\n\nEquipment:\n\nMake/Model: LEVEL1TECH\n\nSerial Number: {SRM\\_FN.SERIAL}\n\nProblem Description: Site Number : 0329\n\nContact Name/Number : Rachael - 919-304-7476\n\nDepartment: Dunkin Donuts\n\nDevice Offline: Monitor for KDS fell off the wall. Please reattach bracket securely. May require drill and bits.\n\n Technician needs to be prepared to tone, trace, repair, or replace while onsite.\n\nTechnicians are required to use the provided box(es) and all packing materials for shipping equipment. All equipment must be securely packaged and technicians should take photos of the package before sealing it to ensure proper packing. Failure to package the equipment securely and provide requested photos will result in penalties if the equipment is inbounded and determined to be damaged.\n\nImportant Scope/Customer Information:\n\nAny changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone.\n\nParts and Support are provided by Travel Centers - TA Support Desk contact number = 1-800-243-5782\n\nIf you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this - Contact Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise\n\nIf additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED, You MUST contact Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.\n\nAll times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required online deliverable.\n\nIf additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies & Procedures #6.\n\nImportant Tech Requirements:\n\n- Tech MUST represent themselves as Essintial on behalf of Travel Centers of America (TA)\n- Tech MUST check-in with site MOD upon Arrival\n- Tech MUST package returned equipment security for shipment and upload photos.\n- Tech MUST complete online deliverable prior to leaving site\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n- 150 FT Cat 5/6 Cable\n- Standard/Basic hand tools\n- Screwdrivers\n- Cell Phone or other device that has a phone, camera, and internet ability (for online deliverable)\n- Laptop, with access to a cellular hotspot\n- Cable Straps or Velcro\n- Appropriate Console cables (for Cisco, Fortinet, Aruba)\n- Installation tools (for racking and unracking equipment\n- Cabling termination tools (RJ45 ends, jacks)\n- Testing equipment (cable tester, cable toner, multimeter)\n\nOnline Deliverable Requirements | Deliverable Link: <https://essintial.jotform.com/250866044689166>\n\n- Tech will be asked to Obtain Customer Sign-Off or If Site POC is unavailable then the tech MUST contact TA Service Desk @ 1-800-243-5782 to be released from site and report the agents name in the online deliverable instead of obtaining sign-off\n- Tech will be asked to take a photo of the completed device\n- Tech will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverables\n\nUpon Arrival at site:\n\n- Introduce yourself as Essintial technician on behalf of Travel Centers (TA) to the onsite MOD\n- If applicable, locate parts or whole units shipped to site by Customer.\n- Troubleshoot/repair or replace failed component to return failed system to working order\n- Remote technical support, if needed, is provided by TA Help Desk.\n\nUpon Completion/Closeout Requirements:\n\n- Confirm functionality with Travel Centers Help Desk & provide their name upon closure\n- Complete online Deliverable\n- Technician to use the box that component arrived in to return failed component utilizing provided return label. All equipment must be securely packaged and technicians should take photos of the package before sealing it to ensure proper packing. Technician will leave the box at site with the Store Manager or POC for Customer to arrange pickup.\n- Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T11:00","end":"2026-10-26T14:00","latestStart":"2026-10-26T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":30.205368275595273},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z