{"job":{"id":20242450,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TechNet Partners","title":"Site Survey","description":{"html":"<p>PROJECT OVERVIEW</p><p>The technician is responsible for completing an on-site IT survey. The goal is to document the property’s current</p><p>network, workstations, and peripherals. This is a discovery visit only. No equipment is being installed or replaced</p>","markdown":"PROJECT OVERVIEW\n\nThe technician is responsible for completing an on-site IT survey. The goal is to document the property’s current\n\nnetwork, workstations, and peripherals. This is a discovery visit only. No equipment is being installed or replaced","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T09:00","end":"2026-10-27T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":8.06839820176667},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Tue, Oct 27, 9:00 AM\nChecked: Tue, Oct 27, Wed, Oct 28, Thu, Oct 29, Fri, Oct 30 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.0