{"job":{"id":20245328,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Voxiant Technology Partners","title":"Foxwood","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">We had it completed, or so I thought.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Tech stated on the last visit that a PC was \"fried\".&nbsp; I didn't get that report.&nbsp; I need this confirmed so we can order a new one.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">That desk phone also does not work, but the site did get new VOIP phones.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">I sent a new switch that we had available.&nbsp; &nbsp;I need it daisy chained to the office LAN.&nbsp; &nbsp; Plug in for them.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Finally, Adobe does not load up PDFs very well.&nbsp; I suspect the bowser is set to download all PDFs, so it creates a network delay. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>UPON ARRIVAL PLEASE CONTACT THE HELPDESK / Howard Wilson @ 214-561-1277. </strong></p><p><strong>If they don't answer, please leave a message with your contact information.</strong></p><p><strong>If you are having issues contact the helpdesk, please call me directly @ 972-833-4002</strong></p>","markdown":"We had it completed, or so I thought.\n\nTech stated on the last visit that a PC was \"fried\". I didn't get that report. I need this confirmed so we can order a new one.\n\nThat desk phone also does not work, but the site did get new VOIP phones.\n\nI sent a new switch that we had available. I need it daisy chained to the office LAN. Plug in for them.\n\nFinally, Adobe does not load up PDFs very well. I suspect the bowser is set to download all PDFs, so it creates a network delay.\n\n**UPON ARRIVAL PLEASE CONTACT THE HELPDESK / Howard Wilson @ 214-561-1277.**\n\n**If they don't answer, please leave a message with your contact information.**\n\n**If you are having issues contact the helpdesk, please call me directly @ 972-833-4002**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T09:00","end":"2026-10-27T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-27T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":110},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":10.365368364075039},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $110 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"