shipments at UPS within 24 hours of the site visit using the label provided and include a receipt on your work order.\n\n**Tool Requirements**\n\n- Review and have available the associated Knowledge Article attached for the equipment you will be supporting.\n- Cisco Console Cable (DB9 or USB)\n- 15 ft. UTP Cat6 RJ-45 Network Cable\n- 15 ft. Cat6 RJ-45 Ethernet Crossover Cable\n- Spare Patch Cables &amp; Cabling Equipment (Rj45, Biscuits, Etc.)\n- 10 Foot **RED** Ethernet patch cable\n\n· 25 Foot **BLUE** Ethernet patch cable\n\n· 50 Foot **BLUE** Ethernet patch cable\n\n- Standard Networking Tool Kit\n- Ethernet Cable Tester\n- Toner and Probe set\n- Loopback Connectors\n- RJ-48C T1\n- RJ-48S 4W 56K\n- RJ-45 Ethernet\n- Waterproof silicone caulking (White) for cooler/freezers and outside AP’s\n- Cell Phone - with Charger and wireless headset\n- Laptop – With Charger\n- 4G LTE Hotspot or Equivalent\n- Laptop with TeamViewer, with the ability to connect to the equipment and internet.\n- 5/32 Allen Wrench\n- Crimper\n- Power Cord – 3 conductor PC power connector (not required)\n- Punch Down tools (110 blades)\n- 1GB to 4GB USB Thumb Drive\n- Label Maker - cable wrap labels (No Flags)\n- Always label both ends of cable\n- Label ports\n- AP’s 3 lines ability to read from the floor\n- Velcro\n- Ladder 6-8 ft.\n\nNote the customer will not have the tools onsite. You must carry them with you and be prepared and knowledgeable to perform the service. Providers’ failure to have the necessary resources, tools, and other items needed to provide the Service and perform its obligations will not be paid.\n\n- **Site Security Requirements:** Photo ID required.\n- No reassignments as the name of the technician is provided to the client upon assignment\n- Only the assigned tech is allowed onsite.\n- Printable ID attached to the work order\n- Be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire\n- Represent yourself as \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* (Do NOT mention Field Nation)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T06:00","end":"2026-10-28T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":40,"max":160},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":40,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":36.03089195939707},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $160 (countered: $240) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-