{"job":{"id":20245940,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"360 Tech Services","title":"Networking - Smart Hands Onsite (Est. Time < 3 hours) - WO54618","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>***The technician must FIRST contact the FM Network team upon arrival. Mark Travers - <del>************</del> /<del>************</del>***</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>***Time is being counted based on first and last contacts with the TFM team***</u></strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>SOW</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Link speed between the Spectrum modem/router and MX67 is 100Mbps instead of 1Gbps and needs to be corrected.</li>\n<li>The modem and router from Spectrum are in the motor room, they are patched to the MX67 in the front office, port 1 on that device.</li>\n<li>Also, please make sure the MG21E is mounted high on the wall closer to the exterior of the building in the front office.</li>\n<li>They have been having connectivity issues, and I need them cleared up.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tools and parts to reterminate ends may be needed.</li>\n<li>A good cable certifier to check the run is required.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>LCON</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>MOD - <del>************</del></p>","markdown":"**\\*\\*\\*The technician must FIRST contact the FM Network team upon arrival. Mark Travers - \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* /\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Time is being counted based on first and last contacts with the TFM team\\*\\*\\***\n\n**SOW**\n\n- Link speed between the Spectrum modem/router and MX67 is 100Mbps instead of 1Gbps and needs to be corrected.\n- The modem and router from Spectrum are in the motor room, they are patched to the MX67 in the front office, port 1 on that device.\n- Also, please make sure the MG21E is mounted high on the wall closer to the exterior of the building in the front office.\n- They have been having connectivity issues, and I need them cleared up.\n\n- Tools and parts to reterminate ends may be needed.\n- A good cable certifier to check the run is required.\n\n**LCON**\n\nMOD - \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T08:00","end":"2026-10-27T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-27T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":210},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":57.73867810123804},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Tue, Oct 27, 8:00 AM\nChecked: Tue, Oct 27, Wed, Oct 28, Thu, Oct 29, Fri, Oct 30 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"