{"job":{"id":20247054,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity, Inc","title":"Poster Printer Troubleshooting - 410593","description":{"html":"<p>Call Direct: 888-443-4375 Option 0</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>With as many open work orders currently on FN, there is a very long back order of requests. So if you call in they will work with you to get assigned.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\nJob Description:\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Job Description: Tech needed to service a Canon TM200 poster printer.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>1. Replace the pinch roller gear. GATHER PICS BEFORE PUTTING BACK TOGETHER PLEASE.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>2. Once approved, assemble the printer.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>3. Load poster paper. You might have to choose plain paper type at this step.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>4. Once loaded, attempt to load the AM1 files. DELETE/HIDE ANY INCORRECT TYPES.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>5. Once AM1 files are loaded, remove paper. Reboot and load poster paper again.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>6. Make sure the custom menu is there now, and the DNP paper types (AM1 files) are present for the site to select. Then test.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Further troubleshoot any issues.</p>\n<p>﻿Requirements(Skills/Tools):</p>\n<p>Advanced TM200 knowledge/Wide Format Printer(Poster) knowledge</p>\n<p>12 Magnetic tip JIS #2 and small thin flathead screwdrivers required.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\nRequired Tools:\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</p>\n<p>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port</p>\n<p>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</p>\n<p>TORX T-10 and T-15</p>\n<p>Adjustable crescent wrench</p>\n<p>Socket set</p>\n<p>Torx driver set (T6 T8 T10 T15 T20 T25)</p>\n<p>Needle Nose Pliers</p>\n<p>12 Inch long shafted magnetic JIS no.2 screwdriver</p>\n<p>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</p>\n<p>Camera with USB cor