{"job":{"id":20248054,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Replace Camera parts | ENTRANCE PVM monitor is on blank screen | Lift on site.","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Scope of Work:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Tech to replace Entrance PVM, once replaced please call Shyft Services National Tech Support at 800-282-7928, opt 3, opt 4 to configure, test and verify new PVM</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Device/Camera Information:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Entrance PVM IP: 192.168.130.5</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Camera location and Link: Entrance PVM</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Part Number: TJX-SMT-3231PV-CS</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Description: SMT-3231PV-CS PUBLIC VIEW MONITOR AI version</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Replacement Default IP: 192.168.130.200</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Camera Height: 12&#39;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">Ceiling Height:</span></p><p><br></p><p><em>Site Security Code included in confidential section</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Re-package the Old Device - Use FedEx Return Label ONLY:</u></strong> </p><ul><li>If there is no return shipping label, or the return shipping label provided is not shipping call Pivital WO Manager ONLY for a new shipping label.</li><li>The New Return label will be Pre Printed in the box (do not lose)</li><li>Write the RO number on anywhere in address field on the preprinted label. </li><li>Take a photo of the label and upload it to the work order</li><li>Drop the package off at any FedEx location, FOR US Sites</li><li>For CANADA locations- there will a Return shipping label from Purolator</li></ul><p> </p><p><em>Review attached client work order for equipment details and client work order #. Remember to print the client work order for the POC sign-off.</em></p><p><strong>Do not log multiple site visits on this work order.</strong></p><p><strong>Each site visit will require its own work order.</strong></p><p><strong>If a revisit is needed or requested by support, close out this work order and contact Pivital ASAP to notify that a revisit will be required.</strong></p><p><em>Device installs may also include troubleshooting, configuration, or working with support to confirm device is on the customer’s network.</em></p><p> All NTS support phone calls will be routed directly to a support technician i.e., L1 or L2.  <strong><u>ALL engineers will call 800-282-7928 #3 for NTS support</u></strong>.</p><ul><li> A second menu will be presented so the FE tech can select what support they require.<ul><li> #1 - POS, Registers, Terminal Support – calls route to NTS L1 and transfer to L2 if needed.</li><li>#2 - Network and cabling Support – calls route to NTS L1 and transfer to L2 if needed.</li><li>#3 - Server Support – calls will route directly to NTS L2.</li><li>#4 - Cameras Support – calls will route to a dedicated camara team.</li><li>#5 - Audio Support – calls will route to a dedicated audio team.</li></ul></li></ul><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement:</u></strong></p><p>• Anti Static Wrist Strap or Static Mat</p><p>• Laptop</p><p>• USB to serial connector</p><p>• NetTerm 5.6 or higher - http://www.securenetterm.com/html/downloads.html</p><p>• Putty</p><p>• NULL Modem cable</p><p>• Ethernet cable</p><p>• Laptop Power pack</p><p>• Cell Phone capable of setting up a personal Hotspot for your laptop to connect to the internet</p><p>• Set of Torx Screw Drivers from 2.5 to 30</p><p>• Flash light</p><p>• Digital Volt Meter</p><p>• Team-Viewer 14.0 or higher (NON-Commercial Free) - https://www.teamviewer.com/en-us/</p><p>• Zoom installed on Techs Phone</p><p>• Velcro Straps</p><p>• X-over cable</p><p>• Standard screwdriver and security bits</p><p>• Thermal paste</p><p>• Alcohol Wipes</p><p>• 9 pin serial cable</p><strong>Reimbursement Rates:</strong>Cabling Materials<ul><li>Cat6 indoor cable (non‑plenum), including connectors: <strong>$0.20 per ft</strong></li><li>Cat6 indoor cable (plenum), including connectors: <strong>$0.29 per ft</strong></li></ul>Hardware<ul><li>Surface‑mount box with keystone jack: <strong>$9.00 each</strong></li></ul>Patch Cables<ul><li>1 ft: <strong>$3.50</strong></li><li>3 ft: <strong>$2.00</strong></li><li>5 ft: <strong>$4.50</strong></li><li>10 ft: <strong>$6.50</strong></li></ul>Cable Management<ul><li>Cable management supplies (zip ties, screw‑mount ties, etc.): <strong>$2.00 per drop</strong></li></ul>Cabling Job Requirements<ul><li>All cabling must be secured using zip ties and screw‑mount cable ties.</li><li>Each drop must be patched to the patch panel and completed with a jack or faceplate.</li><li>All installation debris must be cleaned before leaving the site each day, including multi‑day work orders.</li></ul><p> </p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Site Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Part(s) must be dropped off at the FedEx Location – DO NOT leave the part on the site.</li><li>If MOD or Support request part to be left onsite. Call <del>*** ******** ****** * ************* </del><del>*** *** ****</del> and confirm before leaving site. Support representative&#39;s name will be required.</li><li>Duration of the site visit should not be more than 1.5 hours – If additional time required onsite, call WO Manager for extended duration approval:</li><li>Record the client employee&#39;s First name of who provided approval of extended time frame.</li><li>Approval must be documented in the work order’s correct Custom Field or payment will be denied.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong> </p><ul><li>Government-issued photo ID required  </li><li>Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance  </li><li>Background check is required</li><li>Check-in with site contacts as representing<del>********</del></li><li>The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment  </li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire  </li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\nScope of Work:\n\nTech to replace Entrance PVM, once replaced please call Shyft Services National Tech Support at 800-282-7928, opt 3, opt 4 to configure, test and verify new PVM\n\nDevice/Camera Information:\n\nEntrance PVM IP: 192.168.130.5\n\nCamera location and Link: Entrance PVM\n\nPart Number: TJX-SMT-3231PV-CS\n\nDescription: SMT-3231PV-CS PUBLIC VIEW MONITOR AI version\n\nReplacement Default IP: 192.168.130.200\n\nCamera Height: 12'\n\nCeiling Height:\n\n*Site Security Code included in confidential section*\n\n**Re-package the Old Device - Use FedEx Return Label ONLY:**\n\n- If there is no return shipping label, or the return shipping label provided is not shipping call Pivital WO Manager ONLY for a new shipping label.\n- The New Return label will be Pre Printed in the box (do not lose)\n- Write the RO number on anywhere in address field on the preprinted label.\n- Take a photo of the label and upload it to the work order\n- Drop the package off at any FedEx location, FOR US Sites\n- For CANADA locations- there will a Return shipping label from Purolator\n\n*Review attached client work order for equipment details and client work order #. Remember to print the client work order for the POC sign-off.*\n\n**Do not log multiple site visits on this work order.**\n\n**Each site visit will require its own work order.**\n\n**If a revisit is needed or requested by support, close out this work order and contact Pivital ASAP to notify that a revisit will be required.**\n\n*Device installs may also include troubleshooting, configuration, or working with support to confirm device is on the customer’s network.*\n\n All NTS support phone calls will be routed directly to a support technician i.e., L1 or L2. **ALL engineers will call 800-282-7928 #3 for NTS support**.\n\n- A second menu will be presented so the FE tech can select what support they require.\n  - #1 - POS, Registers, Terminal Support – calls route to NTS L1 and transfer to L2 if needed.\n  - \\#2 - Network and cabling Support – calls route to NTS L1 and transfer to L2 if needed.\n  - \\#3 - Server Support – calls will route directly to NTS L2.\n  - \\#4 - Cameras Support – calls will route to a dedicated camara team.\n  - \\#5 - Audio Support – calls will route to a dedicated audio team.\n\n**Tool Requirement:**\n\n• Anti Static Wrist Strap or Static Mat\n\n• Laptop\n\n• USB to serial connector\n\n• NetTerm 5.6 or higher - <http://www.securenetterm.com/html/downloads.html>\n\n• Putty\n\n• NULL Modem cable\n\n• Ethernet cable\n\n• Laptop Power pack\n\n• Cell Phone capable of setting up a personal Hotspot for your laptop to connect to the internet\n\n• Set of Torx Screw Drivers from 2.5 to 30\n\n• Flash light\n\n• Digital Volt Meter\n\n• Team-Viewer 14.0 or higher (NON-Commercial Free) - <https://www.teamviewer.com/en-us/>\n\n• Zoom installed on Techs Phone\n\n• Velcro Straps\n\n• X-over cable\n\n• Standard screwdriver and security bits\n\n• Thermal paste\n\n• Alcohol Wipes\n\n• 9 pin serial cable\n\n**Reimbursement Rates:**Cabling Materials- Cat6 indoor cable (non‑plenum), including connectors: **$0.20 per ft**\n- Cat6 indoor cable (plenum), including connectors: **$0.29 per ft**\n\nHardware- Surface‑mount box with keystone jack: **$9.00 each**\n\nPatch Cables- 1 ft: **$3.50**\n- 3 ft: **$2.00**\n- 5 ft: **$4.50**\n- 10 ft: **$6.50**\n\nCable Management- Cable management supplies (zip ties, screw‑mount ties, etc.): **$2.00 per drop**\n\nCabling Job Requirements- All cabling must be secured using zip ties and screw‑mount cable ties.\n- Each drop must be patched to the patch panel and completed with a jack or faceplate.\n- All installation debris must be cleaned before leaving the site each day, including multi‑day work orders.\n\n**Site Requirements:**\n\n- Part(s) must be dropped off at the FedEx Location – DO NOT leave the part on the site.\n- If MOD or Support request part to be left onsite. Call \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* and confirm before leaving site. Support representative's name will be required.\n- Duration of the site visit should not be more than 1.5 hours – If additional time required onsite, call WO Manager for extended duration approval:\n- Record the client employee's First name of who provided approval of extended time frame.\n- Approval must be documented in the work order’s correct Custom Field or payment will be denied.\n\n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n- Government-issued photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians attending the site must be provided in advance\n- Background check is required\n- Check-in with site contacts as representing\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- The job requires workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T07:00","end":"2026-10-29T09:00"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":70},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":12.452119272408169},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00: