{"job":{"id":20248106,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"Adara Alexander Place - Network & Cable Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>Air Communities - Adara Alexander Place - Network Troubleshooting</p><p></p><p><strong>PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS PRO SERVICES (PHONES RING THROUGH IN THE ORDER): <del>************</del></strong></p><p></p><p><strong>TECHNICAL CONTACT:</strong> <del>****************************</del></p><p><strong>LOCAL CONTRACT:</strong> <del>*****************</del></p><p> </p><p><strong>SOW</strong></p><p><strong>We need a tech to assist in the following: </strong></p><ul><li>Check in with CIS</li><li>Check in with TCON</li><li>Check in with the LCON</li><li>Adara Alexander Place has a Meraki network in the resident clubhouse. </li><li>Users are reporting slow connectivity to our guest network. </li><li>TCON see&#39;s no issues on the network side and neither does the ISP. </li><li>There was some work done there recently and maybe CAT5 became compromised.</li><li>Please check the site and work with TCON to determine the issue</li><li>Be ready to run a new cable, re-terminate existing cable, or to test existing runs</li><li>Take a photos of work done onsite and label photos for WO upload</li><li>Check out with TCON before leaving site</li><li>Check out with the LCON - Get Manager signature on FN Survey form</li><li>Check out with CIS</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong>Equipment required</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop w/Charger</li><li>Cell Phone w/Charger</li><li>Console Cable</li><li>Cable Tester</li><li>Fish Tape</li><li>Toner</li><li>Crimper</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>10&#39; Ladder</li><li>POTS</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Materials Required: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">(Techs are responsible for providing materials unless otherwise stated in the scope)</strong></p><p><strong>**Please have extras of all the below:</strong></p><ul><li>Cat6 Plenum cable (at least 250’)</li><li>Single Port Surface Mount Boxes</li><li>Cat5e Keystone Jacks</li><li>Cat6 Patch Cables (Varying Lengths)</li><li>Velcro Strips</li></ul><p></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">****NOTE: ALL PHOTOS ARE REQUIRED TO BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THEY ARE BEFORE UPLOADING TO WO OR SENDING TO CIS VIA TEXT. FAILURE TO DO SO WILL RESULT IN PENTALTY FEES****</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Deliverable Photos Needed:</strong> </p><ul><li>PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO <del>************</del></li><li>WORKMAN&#39;S COMP WAIVER (ATTACHED)</li><li>MANAGERS SIGN OFF (ATTACHED)</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">***Please note if you do not call for check out before leaving the site we will apply a $75 penalty fee***</strong></p><p></p><p></p>","markdown":"Air Communities - Adara Alexander Place - Network Troubleshooting\n\n**PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS PRO SERVICES (PHONES RING THROUGH IN THE ORDER): \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**TECHNICAL CONTACT:** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**LOCAL CONTRACT:** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**SOW**\n\n**We need a tech to assist in the following:**\n\n- Check in with CIS\n- Check in with TCON\n- Check in with the LCON\n- Adara Alexander Place has a Meraki network in the resident clubhouse.\n- Users are reporting slow connectivity to our guest network.\n- TCON see's no issues on the network side and neither does the ISP.\n- There was some work done there recently and maybe CAT5 became compromised.\n- Please check the site and work with TCON to determine the issue\n- Be ready to run a new cable, re-terminate existing cable, or to test existing runs\n- Take a photos of work done onsite and label photos for WO upload\n- Check out with TCON before leaving site\n- Check out with the LCON - Get Manager signature on FN Survey form\n- Check out with CIS\n\n**Equipment required**\n\n- Laptop w/Charger\n- Cell Phone w/Charger\n- Console Cable\n- Cable Tester\n- Fish Tape\n- Toner\n- Crimper\n- Label Maker\n- 10' Ladder\n- POTS\n\n**Materials Required:** **(Techs are responsible for providing materials unless otherwise stated in the scope)**\n\n**\\*\\*Please have extras of all the below:**\n\n- Cat6 Plenum cable (at least 250’)\n- Single Port Surface Mount Boxes\n- Cat5e Keystone Jacks\n- Cat6 Patch Cables (Varying Lengths)\n- Velcro Strips\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*NOTE: ALL PHOTOS ARE REQUIRED TO BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THEY ARE BEFORE UPLOADING TO WO OR SENDING TO CIS VIA TEXT. FAILURE TO DO SO WILL RESULT IN PENTALTY FEES\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Deliverable Photos Needed:**\n\n- PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- WORKMAN'S COMP WAIVER (ATTACHED)\n- MANAGERS SIGN OFF (ATTACHED)\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Please note if you do not call for check out before leaving the site we will apply a $75 penalty fee\\*\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T10:00","end":"2026-10-28T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":130,"max":260},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":130},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":65}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":2.7669103158842137},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-