{"job":{"id":20249167,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Integral Tech Services","title":"Meraki Network Refresh: Replace 3x Meraki Switches & 7 Access Points","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Summary:</u></strong></p><p>Arrive at 2PM to begin swapping out 7x old Meraki access points with new Meraki APs. Installation and cutover of 3x new Meraki switches will be at 5:15PM. Work with remote engineer to replace 3x Meraki switches. Install new patch cables and complete cable management of new MDF. Take before and after pictures. Work with remote engineer to test and confirm connectivity.</p><p>**New patch cables are being shipped**</p><p>**You are leaving the old equipment in the network closet for the site contact.**</p><p>**You are there on behalf of <strong><del>************</del></strong>.**</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required</u></strong>:</p><p>Laptop + console cable</p><p>Cable tester</p><p>Bill of Materials</p><p>7x Meraki 9164 Model Access Points </p><p>2x Meraki MS150 24 Port PoE+ Switches </p><p>1x Meraki MS150 48 Port PoE+ Switches </p><p><strong><u>﻿Scope</u>:</strong></p><ol><li><u>Check-in</u>: <strong><u>Text</u></strong> ITS Contact, John, to check in and then check in with the site contact and remote engineer.</li><li>Locate the 3x new Meraki Switches &amp; 7x Meraki Access Points.</li><li>Replace existing Meraki APs with new Meraki 9164 APs</li><li>5:15PM Cutover: Work with remote engineer to power down and remove the existing Meraki MS120 switches and install the 3x new Meraki Switches as replacements. <strong><em>**Notify site contact <u>before</u> bringing down network.** </em></strong><em>Work with Remote engineer to install and test replacement access point. </em></li><li>Reconnect all applicable network and uplink connections to the new switches.</li><li>Power on the new equipment and verify normal operation.</li><li>Work with remote engineer to test network connectivity to ensure all connected devices and services are functioning as expected.</li><li>Perform final testing to confirm the new switches are operating normally and the network is fully functional.</li><li>Text the ITS contact the before and after pictures (and speed test results if applicable).</li><li>Check out with all 3 contacts.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Contact Info</u>:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>ITS Contact:</strong> <del>**** ************</del></li><li><strong>On-site Contact:</strong> TBD</li><li><strong>Remote <del>************ ********* </del></strong><del>**** ********* ************</del></li></ul><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"**Summary:**\n\nArrive at 2PM to begin swapping out 7x old Meraki access points with new Meraki APs. Installation and cutover of 3x new Meraki switches will be at 5:15PM. Work with remote engineer to replace 3x Meraki switches. Install new patch cables and complete cable management of new MDF. Take before and after pictures. Work with remote engineer to test and confirm connectivity.\n\n\\*\\*New patch cables are being shipped\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*You are leaving the old equipment in the network closet for the site contact.\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*You are there on behalf of **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***.\\*\\*\n\n**Required**:\n\nLaptop + console cable\n\nCable tester\n\nBill of Materials\n\n7x Meraki 9164 Model Access Points\n\n2x Meraki MS150 24 Port PoE+ Switches\n\n1x Meraki MS150 48 Port PoE+ Switches\n\n**﻿Scope:**\n\n1. Check-in: **Text** ITS Contact, John, to check in and then check in with the site contact and remote engineer.\n2. Locate the 3x new Meraki Switches &amp; 7x Meraki Access Points.\n3. Replace existing Meraki APs with new Meraki 9164 APs\n4. 5:15PM Cutover: Work with remote engineer to power down and remove the existing Meraki MS120 switches and install the 3x new Meraki Switches as replacements. ***\\*\\*Notify site contact before bringing down network.\\*\\**** *Work with Remote engineer to install and test replacement access point.*\n5. Reconnect all applicable network and uplink connections to the new switches.\n6. Power on the new equipment and verify normal operation.\n7. Work with remote engineer to test network connectivity to ensure all connected devices and services are functioning as expected.\n8. Perform final testing to confirm the new switches are operating normally and the network is fully functional.\n9. Text the ITS contact the before and after pictures (and speed test results if applicable).\n10. Check out with all 3 contacts.\n\n**Contact Info:**\n\n- **ITS Contact:** \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- **On-site Contact:** TBD\n- **Remote \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00","end":"2026-11-04T20:00"},"payRange":{"min":350,"max":400},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":5,"amount":350},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":6.275870879010521},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $400 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00