{"job":{"id":20243069,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nova Remote IT LLC","title":"Network Installation","description":{"html":"<p>Install FortiGate and CradlePoint.</p><p>Connect and test with remote engineer.</p><p><br></p><p><ul><li><strong>You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge</strong></li><li><strong>Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens</strong></li><li><strong>Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.</strong></li></ul></p><p><strong>Required Tools: Laptop (YOU MUST HAVE A 1G ETH ADAPTOR) with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.</strong></p><p><strong>Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.</strong></p><p>Please review confidential section for site specific details</p><p><ol><li>Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - <strong>join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.</strong></li><li>Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.</li><li>Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.</li><li>Clean up work area and close out.</li></ol></p>","markdown":"Install FortiGate and CradlePoint.\n\nConnect and test with remote engineer.\n\n- **You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge**\n- **Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens**\n- **Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.**\n\n**Required Tools: Laptop (YOU MUST HAVE A 1G ETH ADAPTOR) with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.**\n\n**Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.**\n\nPlease review confidential section for site specific details\n\n1. Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - **join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.**\n2. Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.\n3. Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.\n4. Clean up work area and close out.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T07:30","end":"2026-11-03T09:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":13.18537289011862},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974878-The Warehouse-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.