{"job":{"id":20249501,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SOS GEEK LLC","title":"Samsung TV 57'' not turning ON","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in&nbsp;Samsung TV 57'' not turning ON</li><li>Tech is required to&nbsp;Diagnose &amp; Fix the Samsung 57 inch TV which is not turning On. It was having the same issue in the past but started working again &amp; now the same issue has arose once again since yesterday. There are no symptoms of physical damage.</li><li>Estimated duration will be&nbsp;2 Hours</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Professional Attire</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>All Basic Hand Tools</li><li>As per the WO</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Pre-Site Requirements</em></strong></p><ol><li>Contact WO manager to confirm Scope of Work and Scheduling</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Call the client 1 hour before check in to confirm availability and ensuring client is reminded about your arrival</li><li>Call SOS GEEK to Confirm whether client answered or call went unanswered.</li><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent SOS GEEK while onsite</li><li>Call to Check in / Call before Check out - 1855-551-7665</li><li>Take a Print out of the WO and Get it signed buy the client</li></ol><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ul><li>Tech needs to diagnose the issue properly and check for the parts properly which has malfunctioned. if required open the device to check for proper diagnosis of the device.</li><li>If in case it has a part replacement issue then the tech needs to help the client place the order of the required part which has malfunctioned during the time of diagnosis only so as the client can place the order for the same.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Communication Directory:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with WO manager&nbsp;</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to WO manager</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Any additional hours and expenses must be pre approved by WO manager</li><li>Any additional hours and expenses incurring without pre approval will be denied</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Samsung TV 57'' not turning ON\n- Tech is required to Diagnose &amp; Fix the Samsung 57 inch TV which is not turning On. It was having the same issue in the past but started working again &amp; now the same issue has arose once again since yesterday. There are no symptoms of physical damage.\n- Estimated duration will be 2 Hours\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Professional Attire\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- All Basic Hand Tools\n- As per the WO\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***Pre-Site Requirements***\n\n1. Contact WO manager to confirm Scope of Work and Scheduling\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Call the client 1 hour before check in to confirm availability and ensuring client is reminded about your arrival\n2. Call SOS GEEK to Confirm whether client answered or call went unanswered.\n3. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent SOS GEEK while onsite\n4. Call to Check in / Call before Check out - 1855-551-7665\n5. Take a Print out of the WO and Get it signed buy the client\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n- Tech needs to diagnose the issue properly and check for the parts properly which has malfunctioned. if required open the device to check for proper diagnosis of the device.\n- If in case it has a part replacement issue then the tech needs to help the client place the order of the required part which has malfunctioned during the time of diagnosis only so as the client can place the order for the same.\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with WO manager\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to WO manager\n\n**Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Any additional hours and expenses must be pre approved by WO manager\n- Any additional hours and expenses incurring without pre approval will be denied","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-27T12:00","end":"2026-10-27T14:00","latestStart":"2026-10-27T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":90},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":120.75677224248916},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-27T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","summary":"BirthDay"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-27T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04546900 Preiss Co View at Legacy Oaks Cutover/Test Install Wizard (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Ork