{"job":{"id":"2950563486","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05899945 Toyota TBMNC EPIK Install Revisit","description":"DESCRIPTION: \"POTS Line\tBuilding\tLocation\tFunction<br>336 685-4185\t801 HEV Building\t801-149 Security Dispatch\tSecurity Emergency Phone<br>337 685-4186\t601 Fire House\tSecurity Dispatch\tSecurity Emergency Phone<br>338 685-4187\t602 Child Care Center\tReception Desk\tEmergency Phone<br>339 685-4188\t602 Child Care Center\tMovement Matters\tEmergency Phone<br>340 685-4189\t503 Utilities/Facilities\tDispatch Area\tEmergency Phone\"<br>SOW - EPIK Cutover &amp; Test<br>*************************************************************************************<br>Before Arrival<br>Call the LCON 30 minutes before arrival.<br>Review the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK:<br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo<br>Arrive with all required tools and materials listed below.<br>On Arrival<br>Check in on WorkMarket.<br>Locate the customer contact and confirm the install location.<br>Review the Special Instructions before starting work.<br>EPIK Install Requirements<br>Mount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik.<br>If EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location. <br>Power on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard.<br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on.<br>If applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions.<br>Log into the EPIK Install Wizard:<br>https://wizard.epik.io<br>Follow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned.<br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES<br>Checkout Requirement<br>Confirm Activations has released you.<br>Submit all WorkMarket deliverables.<br>Enter the checkout code in WorkMarket.<br>Check out on WorkMarket.<br> <br>The install is not considered valid unless the checkout code is entered in WorkMarket.<br> <br>Required Deliverables<br>Submit all required deliverables in WorkMarket before checkout:<br>Photo of completed EPIK install.<br>Photo of labeled 66 block / harmonica block.<br>List of existing TNs and the new number that replaced each TN, if applicable.<br>Customer signed sign-out sheet.<br>Any additional deliverables listed in Special Instructions.<br> <br> <br>Required Tools<br>•    Laptop<br>•    Smartphone with hotspot<br>•    Tone generator and wand<br>•    66/110 punch tool<br>•    Butt set<br>       Infrared Temperature Gun <br>•    Electrician scissors<br>•    Step ladder<br>•    Flashlight/headlamp<br>•    RJ11/RJ45 crimper<br>•    Ethernet cable tester<br>•    Impact drill / cordless drill<br>•    Masonry bits<br>•    Screwdrivers / driver bits<br>•    Needle-nose pliers<br>•    Label maker and label tape<br>•    Cat3 or better cable<br>•    Cat6 Ethernet cable<br>•    Cross-connect wire<br>•    Gel-crimp connectors<br>•    Cable ties and mounting hardware<br>•    RJ11/RJ45 plugs and keystone jacks<br>•    Console cables: USB to DB9 PL2303 and USB to USB-mini<br>*************************************************************************************","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-26T11:00","end":"2026-10-26T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":510},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":52.7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/26/2026, 11:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-26T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T13:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-26T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-26T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-27T21:30:00.000Z","end":"