{"job":{"id":20251798,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nova Remote IT LLC","title":"Network Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p>Install Cradlepoint router shipped to site.</p><p>Confirm connectivity after install.</p><p>Be ready to provide remote console access if needed.</p><p><br></p><p>Network Device Troubleshooting.</p><p></p><p>You are to represent yourself as working on behalf of GTT. The equipment being installed is for GTT. No mention of Field Nation or Nova Remote IT please.</p><p>Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer. Any additional travel expense not preapproved through a counter will not be approved.</p><p>Required Tools:Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables (including a Cisco specific console cable), Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.</p><p></p><p>Provide detailed pictures before and after.</p><p></p><p>SOW:</p><p></p><p>Arrive on site and contact LCON. Locate equipment and dial into Support Queue</p><p>Work with Support Team for direction and instructions.</p><p>Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code from Support Agent</p><p>Clean up work area, leave it cleaner than you arrived and close out.</p><p></p>","markdown":"Install Cradlepoint router shipped to site.\n\nConfirm connectivity after install.\n\nBe ready to provide remote console access if needed.\n\nNetwork Device Troubleshooting.\n\nYou are to represent yourself as working on behalf of GTT. The equipment being installed is for GTT. No mention of Field Nation or Nova Remote IT please.\n\nAny travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer. Any additional travel expense not preapproved through a counter will not be approved.\n\nRequired Tools:Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables (including a Cisco specific console cable), Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.\n\nProvide detailed pictures before and after.\n\nSOW:\n\nArrive on site and contact LCON. Locate equipment and dial into Support Queue\n\nWork with Support Team for direction and instructions.\n\nEngineer will release you when completed. Capture close code from Support Agent\n\nClean up work area, leave it cleaner than you arrived and close out.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T11:00","end":"2026-10-28T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":52.69116536594997},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control