{"job":{"id":20251990,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"WatchMeGrow","title":"WatchMeGrow - WMG TV Micro Media Player Replacement","description":{"html":"<p><strong>You are required to follow CDC guidelines to protect against spreading the Covid-19 Virus: </strong>https://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus/2019-ncov/community/index.html\\</p><p><strong>Equipment Needed:</strong>&nbsp;Standard PC repair tools, Laptop with Ethernet Port, Step Ladder, Screw Drivers, Drill, Network Cable Tester<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">, Monitor w/ VGA Adapter</span>, HDMI Monitor</p><p><strong>Description:</strong>&nbsp;The WatchMeGrow TV Micro Media Player at this location needs to be replaced. Please swap the media player with the replacement that we have shipped to the childcare center. It will be available onsite. There will be a few configuration steps to complete with help from WatchMeGrow technical support. WatchMeGrow technical staff is on hand during the repair to assist in any configuration or troubleshooting needed. You will be required to call to check in upon arrival and call to check out before leaving.</p><p><strong>!!IMPORTANT!!</strong></p><ul><li><strong>WatchMeGrow will not pay for out-of-scope work without prior approval by the Project Manager.</strong></li><li><strong>WatchMeGrow works on agreed/fixed budgets prior to technician arriving onsite. If any additional time or charges are needed by the technician they MUST be requested and approved prior to completing onsite visit.</strong></li><li><strong>WatchMeGrow will NOT pay for any additional charges that have not been approved by Project Manager prior to technician leaving the worksite.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Licensing and Permits:</strong>&nbsp;Must obtain or hold licensing and permits as required by the service area. It is your responsibility to verify these requirements with the GC, Superintendant or local authorities.</p><p><strong>Safety</strong>: If children are in the immediate vicinity of your ladder, no work can be done until the center's staff has removed the children from your workspace.</p><p>If you must work in the attic space above a classroom, you need to coordinate with the center staff to have the children removed from the classroom prior to accessing the ceiling, or at the very least, have the teacher in that room move the children to the opposite side from which you will be working. If the center staff cannot accommodate that request, please halt work immediately and notify WatchMeGrow.</p><p><strong>Photos:</strong>&nbsp;Please send us photos of your work upon completion. Photographs are required prior to payment processing. When interacting with fragile, customer-owned equipment such as a TV, please turn it on and take a picture BEFORE handling it.</p><p><strong>Return Hardware:</strong> Please box up any old or unused hardware from this service call and leave it at the front desk for a return shipment. Do not discard any hardware without consulting with WMG first.</p><p><strong>Call to Sign In/Out:</strong>&nbsp;Please call <del>***** ********</del> to sign in upon arrival and out before departure.</p><p><strong>Required Troubleshooting:</strong></p><ol><li>Call WatchMeGrow (360-359-4708) to check in when on-site.</li><li>Shut down the WMG TV media player and disconnect the cables.</li><li>Uninstall and replace the server with the media player provided onsite.</li><li>Install the 3 port surge protector behind the TV.</li><li>Then, replace cables.</li><li>Boot and configure with help from WatchMeGrow Technical Support.</li><li>Call WatchMeGrow to make sure everything is functioning correctly.</li><li>Troubleshoot to resolve any lingering issues.</li><li>Call WatchMeGrow to check out when finished.</li></ol><p><strong>Sign Off:</strong>&nbsp;Please print off work order and bring to work site for client sign off. Please also sign below client signature.</p>","markdown":"**You are required to follow CDC guidelines to protect against spreading the Covid-19 Virus:** <https://www.cdc.gov/coronavirus/2019-ncov/community/index.html>\\\\\n\n**Equipment Needed:** Standard PC repair tools, Laptop with Ethernet Port, Step Ladder, Screw Drivers, Drill, Network Cable Tester, Monitor w/ VGA Adapter, HDMI Monitor\n\n**Description:** The WatchMeGrow TV Micro Media Player at this location needs to be replaced. Please swap the media player with the replacement that we have shipped to the childcare center. It will be available onsite. There will be a few configuration steps to complete with help from WatchMeGrow technical support. WatchMeGrow technical staff is on hand during the repair to assist in any configuration or troubleshooting needed. You will be required to call to check in upon arrival and call to check out before leaving.\n\n**!!IMPORTANT!!**\n\n- **WatchMeGrow will not pay for out-of-scope work without prior approval by the Project Manager.**\n- **WatchMeGrow works on agreed/fixed budgets prior to technician arriving onsite. If any additional time or charges are needed by the technician they MUST be requested and approved prior to completing onsite visit.**\n- **WatchMeGrow will NOT pay for any additional charges that have not been approved by Project Manager prior to technician leaving the worksite.**\n\n**Licensing and Permits:** Must obtain or hold licensing and permits as required by the service area. It is your responsibility to verify these requirements with the GC, Superintendant or local authorities.\n\n**Safety**: If children are in the immediate vicinity of your ladder, no work can be done until the center's staff has removed the children from your workspace.\n\nIf you must work in the attic space above a classroom, you need to coordinate with the center staff to have the children removed from the classroom prior to accessing the ceiling, or at the very least, have the teacher in that room move the children to the opposite side from which you will be working. If the center staff cannot accommodate that request, please halt work immediately and notify WatchMeGrow.\n\n**Photos:** Please send us photos of your work upon completion. Photographs are required prior to payment processing. When interacting with fragile, customer-owned equipment such as a TV, please turn it on and take a picture BEFORE handling it.\n\n**Return Hardware:** Please box up any old or unused hardware from this service call and leave it at the front desk for a return shipment. Do not discard any hardware without consulting with WMG first.\n\n**Call to Sign In/Out:** Please call \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* to sign in upon arrival and out before departure.\n\n**Required Troubleshooting:**\n\n1. Call WatchMeGrow (360-359-4708) to check in when on-site.\n2. Shut down the WMG TV media player and disconnect the cables.\n3. Uninstall and replace the server with the media player provided onsite.\n4. Install the 3 port surge protector behind the TV.\n5. Then, replace cables.\n6. Boot and configure with help from WatchMeGrow Technical Support.\n7. Call WatchMeGrow to make sure everything is functioning correctly.\n8. Troubleshoot to resolve any lingering issues.\n9. Call WatchMeGrow to check out when finished.\n\n**Sign Off:** Please print off work order and bring to work site for client sign off. Please also sign below client signature.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T09:00","end":"2026-11-02T10:00","latestStart":"2026-11-02T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":11.443743508476778},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end"