{"job":{"id":20251963,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NETFOR","title":"Troubleshoot Marketspark Equipment Maximus NCEB","description":{"html":"<p>Location Name: Maximus 5001 Hospitality Ct, Morrisville NC 27560</p>\n<p>Signal Check Link</p>\n<p>https://location.marketspark.com/#0daf9c19-c407-49fe-b568-3b8eb62b62cc</p>\n<p>Site POC name and contact info: Joseph at <del>***** ********</del>.</p>\n<p><del>***************************</del></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>MS Work Order Number: WO-00025263</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>MS ZenDesk Ticket Number: 318409.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>MS equipment is in located in the electrical closet on outside back of building.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Detailed Scope of Work: Customer wants a vendor meetup with their alarm tech since their lines for the alarm were never cutover to our new lines +<del>* ***** ********</del> and <del>** ***** ********</del> and the panel is communicating like it should. Please work with the customers alarm tech and cutover our lines that are on biscuits and labeled with our lines and test with the monitoring company to make sure the lines are dialing out like they should.</p>\n<p>Alarm Line 1 Burglar Alarm <del>***** ******** ***** ********</del></p>\n<p>Alarm Line 2 Burglar Alarm <del>***** ******** ***** ********</del></p>\n<p>Materials Needed – Tech will need to bring the following tools:</p>\n<p>1) Butt set w/RJ11 adaptor;</p>\n<p>2) Punch Tool;</p>\n<p>3) Tone &amp; Probe;</p>\n<p>4) Cable in case a new run is needed;</p>\n<p>5) Laptop w/AnyDesk &amp; ethernet cable in case we need to console into any device;</p>\n<p>6) Any other telecom tools.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Checkout with MarketSpark Support: Prior to leaving site, call MarketSpark support at <del>***** ********</del> to properly validate equipment and note key service details.</p>","markdown":"Location Name: Maximus 5001 Hospitality Ct, Morrisville NC 27560\n\nSignal Check Link\n\n<https://location.marketspark.com/#0daf9c19-c407-49fe-b568-3b8eb62b62cc>\n\nSite POC name and contact info: Joseph at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nMS Work Order Number: WO-00025263\n\nMS ZenDesk Ticket Number: 318409.\n\nMS equipment is in located in the electrical closet on outside back of building.\n\nDetailed Scope of Work: Customer wants a vendor meetup with their alarm tech since their lines for the alarm were never cutover to our new lines +\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and the panel is communicating like it should. Please work with the customers alarm tech and cutover our lines that are on biscuits and labeled with our lines and test with the monitoring company to make sure the lines are dialing out like they should.\n\nAlarm Line 1 Burglar Alarm \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nAlarm Line 2 Burglar Alarm \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nMaterials Needed – Tech will need to bring the following tools:\n\n1\\) Butt set w/RJ11 adaptor;\n\n2\\) Punch Tool;\n\n3\\) Tone &amp; Probe;\n\n4\\) Cable in case a new run is needed;\n\n5\\) Laptop w/AnyDesk &amp; ethernet cable in case we need to console into any device;\n\n6\\) Any other telecom tools.\n\nCheckout with MarketSpark Support: Prior to leaving site, call MarketSpark support at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* to properly validate equipment and note key service details.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T10:00","end":"2026-10-29T13:00","latestStart":"2026-10-29T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":225},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":4.256735443477329},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $225 (countered: $225) is below minimum threshold $300"},"ava