{"job":{"id":20252832,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Install Workstations | 11/2 | Tech 4","description":{"html":"<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Required On-site time/window: 11/2 8AM</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Equipment:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Make/Model: PALOALTO</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Serial Number: {SRM_FN.SERIAL}</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csB4A3870F\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Problem Description:</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> </span><span class=\"cs2928F796\">&nbsp;Please see below request from United Therapeutics for the Warp 10 location in the first week of November.</span></p><p class=\"csB4A3870F\"><span class=\"cs2928F796\">For the scope of work, it will be very similar to the work done in Houston, such as physically taking the workstation equipment (i.e., monitor, keyboard, mouse, headset, etc.) out of the boxes they were delivered in, and setting them up on the tables, making sure they are plugged in, tested, and working.</span></p><p class=\"csB4A3870F\"><span class=\"cs2928F796\">The quantity at this location is 73 desk setups.</span></p><p class=\"csB4A3870F\"><span class=\"cs2928F796\">Is the work expected to take place only from 11/02 through 11/06? Yes, the team is ready for the technicians starting next Monday, 11/2. The equipment is currently being held in an easy spot on the first floor office.<br/>Are all workstations located in the same building? If so, what floor will the installations be on? Yes, all of the equipment is in the same building. Floors 1 and 2</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs2928F796\">Onsite contact&rsquo;s phone number: Ted Kerr (tedk@dpr.com). 804-298-5340</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Scope/Customer Information:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Any changes to ETA&rsquo;s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED.&nbsp;You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Required Tools:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Standard hand tools</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Upon Arrival at site:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Introduce yourself as ePlus technician</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Confirm functionality with remote support &amp; provide their name upon closure</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns</span></p>","markdown":"IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.\n\nYOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU \\*\\*MUST\\*\\* HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.\n\nRequired On-site time/window: 11/2 8AM\n\nEquipment:\n\nMake/Model: PALOALTO\n\nSerial Number: {SRM\\_FN.SERIAL}\n\nProblem Description:  Please see below request from United Therapeutics for the Warp 10 location in the first week of November.\n\nFor the scope of work, it will be very similar to the work done in Houston, such as physically taking the workstation equipment (i.e., monitor, keyboard, mouse, headset, etc.) out of the boxes they were delivered in, and setting them up on the tables, making sure they are plugged in, tested, and working.\n\nThe quantity at this location is 73 desk setups.\n\nIs the work expected to take place only from 11/02 through 11/06? Yes, the team is ready for the technicians starting next Monday, 11/2. The equipment is currently being held in an easy spot on the first floor office.  \nAre all workstations located in the same building? If so, what floor will the installations be on? Yes, all of the equipment is in the same building. Floors 1 and 2\n\nOnsite contact’s phone number: Ted Kerr (tedk@dpr.com). 804-298-5340\n\nImportant Scope/Customer Information:\n\nAny changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone.\n\nIf you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.\n\nIf additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED. You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.\n\nAll times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.\n\nIf additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.\n\nRequired Tools:\n\nStandard hand tools\n\nUpon Arrival at site:\n\nIntroduce yourself as ePlus technician\n\nUpon Completion/Closeout Requirements:\n\nConfirm functionality with remote support &amp; provide their name upon closure\n\nCall Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out\n\nProvide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T08:00","end":"2026-11-02T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":30,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":7.6837571634185355},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{