{"job":{"id":20253113,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Teceze","title":"Modem Relocation, Wall/Cabinet Mounting & Cable Management","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><ul><li>Locate existing broadband/network hardware placed on the floor</li><li>Safely relocate and mount devices to wall or cabinet</li><li>Perform cable re-routing, extension, or termination if required</li><li>Ensure proper cable management and labeling</li><li>Validate connectivity post-move (no service disruption)</li><li>Coordinate with remote support team if required.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n- Locate existing broadband/network hardware placed on the floor\n- Safely relocate and mount devices to wall or cabinet\n- Perform cable re-routing, extension, or termination if required\n- Ensure proper cable management and labeling\n- Validate connectivity post-move (no service disruption)\n- Coordinate with remote support team if required.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T06:30","end":"2026-10-28T11:30"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":30,"estLaborHours":5,"distance":28.69468313918245},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No in-hours counter slot available\nRequested: Wed, Oct 28, 6:30 AM\nChecked: Wed, Oct 28, Thu, Oct 29, Fri, Oct 30 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-28T1