{"job":{"id":20253700,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NETFOR","title":"Journeys Relocation**3 days**","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">BY ACCEPTING THIS ASSIGNMENT, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLETE THE WO, UPLOAD ALL DELIVERABLES WHILE ON SITE AND COMPLETE THE CHECK IN/OUT PROCESS FULLY.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tech will need to check-in via text chat - </span>text “Start” to <del>************</del>.You will receive 2 messages back. First will confirm you have been connected and the second will ask if you are onsite for 1 - New Installation or 2 - Service, you will always respond back \"1\". <strong>**review PDF attached on process &amp; directions to escalate if support not responsive within 20 minutes (Step 2) </strong></p><p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK:</strong></p><p>Day 1: 11/5/2026 @ 9AM</p><p>Pre-wire with Digital Portal x8 Data Drops</p><p>&nbsp;Day 2: 11/12/2026 @ 9AM</p><p>Cashwrap Rewire</p><p>&nbsp;Day 3: 11/16/2026 @ 9AM</p><p>NET CAB Relo</p><p><br></p><p>Installation guide: </p><p>https://interfacesystems.mcoutput.com/genig/Content/Network%20Installation%20Guides/Genesco/Individual%20Scopes/Prior%20to%20Entering.htm</p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">NOTE:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> *** WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT A RELEASE CODE FROM THE REMOTE SUPPORT TECHNICIAN ***</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">REQUIRED DELIVERABLES</strong></p><ul><li>Work Order Signed by POC with Accurate date and Check In/Out times (attached document or electronically).</li><li>Picture of any equipment work was completed on, damaged cables/equipment, etc</li><li>Picture of RMA form &amp; return label applied; if applicable</li><li>Release Code</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Prepare tool bag/box with the following:</span></p><ul><li>Laptop (Windows 11)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Operating system must be fully licensed and updated</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">· Administrative rights required for software installation and troubleshooting</li><li>Basic IT Tools</li><li>Buttset</li><li>Network Testing Tools/Cable Testers</li><li>Drill</li><li>12\" bit for wood/medal/or possibly concrete</li><li>12' Ladder</li><li>Phone/Ethernet Wiring</li><li>Digital Camera / Camera Phone with this ability to send pictures before leaving site</li><li>Copy of work order and job information</li><li>Any other tools/materials you may think you need to complete the job on the first visit.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ensure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:</span></p><ul><li>Long pants</li><li>Collared shirt</li><li>Netfor name badge</li><li>Close toe shoes</li><li>Review SOW and inform Netfor of any question prior to arriving on site.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Contact Name &amp; Number: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Monthly Password: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)</strong></p>","markdown":"BY ACCEPTING THIS ASSIGNMENT, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLETE THE WO, UPLOAD ALL DELIVERABLES WHILE ON SITE AND COMPLETE THE CHECK IN/OUT PROCESS FULLY.\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nTech will need to check-in via text chat - text “Start” to \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*.You will receive 2 messages back. First will confirm you have been connected and the second will ask if you are onsite for 1 - New Installation or 2 - Service, you will always respond back \"1\". **\\*\\*review PDF attached on process &amp; directions to escalate if support not responsive within 20 minutes (Step 2)**\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\nDay 1: 11/5/2026 @ 9AM\n\nPre-wire with Digital Portal x8 Data Drops\n\n Day 2: 11/12/2026 @ 9AM\n\nCashwrap Rewire\n\n Day 3: 11/16/2026 @ 9AM\n\nNET CAB Relo\n\nInstallation guide:\n\n<https: