{"job":{"id":20248989,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"P3 Global Services","title":"**ELSINORE** standee assembly - PLEASE, READ THE SERVICE DESCRIPTION COMPLETELY","description":{"html":"<p>IF YOU DO NOT AGREE WITH THE BELOW INFORMATION, DO NOT TAKE THE JOB.</p><p><strong><em><u>By accepting this work order you are agreeing to discount to $20 if you do not do the install for any reason out of your control. THIS INCLUDES IF A THEATRE HAS ALREADY ASSEMBLED PRIOR TO YOU ARRIVING, OR YOU CANNOT ASSEMBLE DUE TO DAMAGED OR MISSING PIECES.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Any request for travel pay MUST be made as a counter-offer before job is accepted. Payment will only be made if you complete the job or if you are unable for any reason out of your control.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Please do not call concerning schedule changes, missing pieces, etc. Only call if urgent, all other issues please send a message within Field Nation.&nbsp;ALMOST ALL ISSUES ARE NOT URGENT AND SHOULD BE SENT VIA MESSAGE.</u></em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES ARE YOU TO REMOVE THE STANDEE FROM THEATRE PREMISES.</u></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>We cannot give you an estimate of the time it will take you to build this standee as everyone is different. You must review the attached instructions and estimate the time yourself.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Please upload only ONE photo... either the completed standee or the manager's signature. Please do not upload ANY other photos.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>ANY delays beyond the stated schedule MUST be reported to P3 as soon as you know you will be late.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><u>Please, do not send counter offers via message. All counter offers must be sent using the counter offer option in Field Nation.</u></em></strong></p><p><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p><strong>A standee is a free-standing, mostly or all cardboard display. 