{"job":{"id":20234887,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"DG: Printer Cable Swap (30min per site)","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><u>Scope of work</u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><u> The expected time to complete is about 30 minutes.</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Install a twenty (20) foot Ethernet cable connecting the back-office printer to the designated network switch in the IT cabinet. Route the cable cleanly and safely along existing wall paths; no drilling, wall penetrations, or structural modifications are in scope. Do not disconnect the printer's existing USB connection. Installation is complete when the cable is installed cleanly and safely, link/activity lights are confirmed on both the printer and the switch port, an IP address displays on the printer screen, and the device is reachable on the network.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">This work order applies to network-capable printer models only (</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Lexmark MX510de, MX522adhe, MX532adwe</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">). </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Note: </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">s</span>ome of the MX520 printer models do not have the IP assigner app on them. IP address is displayed at the top centre of the screen and the Home button is a physical button located next to the display (example photo available within WO docs). If not networked, it will show 0.0.0. </p><p>The IP assigner app will not be locked behind a code, but if the settings app on the printer is, use the code is <del>******</del></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Legacy printers are out of scope: if the on-site printer is a legacy model, stop, take a photo of the printer, and contact Work Order Manager before proceeding (this is unlikely).</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Work must be completed Monday through Friday between 8:00 am and 5:00 pm local time. Dress Code: Business casual. Maintain a professional appearance.</span></p><p><strong><u>Technical Escalations</u></strong></p><p>If no light appears when the cable is connected or for any connectivity issues call <strong>T2 support <del>* ************</del></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><u>Cable Availability</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Client has shipped a Cat5/6 Ethernet cable to every site; it should be affixed to the printer itself. Confirm the cable is on site before starting work. If it is not, contact Work Order Manager for approval to expense a cable: use your own if you have one, or purchase locally (Cat5/6) if it won't affect the rest of the day's schedule, and expense it (up to $14).</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><u>Required Items to Bring:</u></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"> Basic tool set (no specific tools required). Letter of Authorization (in the document section). If the pre-shipped cable is not on site when you arrive, contact Pomeroy Dispatch before purchasing or substituting your own cable.</span></p>","markdown":"**Scope of work**\n\n **The expected time to complete is about 30 minutes.** Install a twenty (20) foot Ethernet cable connecting the back-office printer to the designated network switch in the IT cabinet. Route the cable cleanly and safely along existing wall paths; no drilling, wall penetrations, or structural modifications are in scope. Do not disconnect the printer's existing USB connection. Installation is complete when the cable is installed cleanly and safely, link/activity lights are confirmed on both the printer and the switch port, an IP address displays on the printer screen, and the device is reachable on the network.\n\nThis work order applies to network-capable printer models only (**Lexmark MX510de, MX522adhe, MX532adwe**). **Note:** some of the MX520 printer models do not have the IP assigner app on them. IP address is displayed at the top centre of the screen and the Home button is a physical button located next to the display (example photo available within WO docs). If not networked, it will show 0.0.0.\n\nThe IP assigner app will not be locked behind a code, but if the settings app on the printer is, use the code is \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nLegacy printers are out of scope: if the on-site printer is a legacy model, stop, take a photo of the printer, and contact Work Order Manager before proceeding (this is unlikely).\n\nWork must be completed Monday through Friday between 8:00 am and 5:00 pm local time. Dress Code: Business casual. Maintain a professional appearance.\n\n**Technical Escalations**\n\nIf no light appears when the cable is connected or for any connectivity issues call **T2 support \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Cable Availability**\n\nClient has shipped a Cat5/6 Ethernet cable to every site; it should be affixed to the printer itself. Confirm the cable is on site before starting work. If it is not, contact Work Order Manager for approval to expense a cable: use your own if you have one, or purchase locally (Cat5/6) if it won't affect the rest of the day's schedule, and expense it (up to $14).\n\n**Required Items to Bring:** Basic tool set (no specific tools required). Letter of Authorization (in the document section). If the pre-shipped cable is not on site when you arrive, contact Pomeroy Dispatch before purchasing or substituting your own cable.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-17T08:00","end":"2026-11-17T08:30","latestStart":"2026-11-17T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":0.5,"distance":35.15847828336067},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-18T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-19T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-19T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-20T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-21T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineering (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1793127013727}
