ork-capable printer models only (**Lexmark MX510de, MX522adhe, MX532adwe**). **Note:** some of the MX520 printer models do not have the IP assigner app on them. IP address is displayed at the top centre of the screen and the Home button is a physical button located next to the display (example photo available within WO docs). If not networked, it will show 0.0.0.\n\nThe IP assigner app will not be locked behind a code, but if the settings app on the printer is, use the code is \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nLegacy printers are out of scope: if the on-site printer is a legacy model, stop, take a photo of the printer, and contact Work Order Manager before proceeding (this is unlikely).\n\nWork must be completed Monday through Friday between 8:00 am and 5:00 pm local time. Dress Code: Business casual. Maintain a professional appearance.\n\n**Technical Escalations**\n\nIf no light appears when the cable is connected or for any connectivity issues call **T2 support \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Cable Availability**\n\nClient has shipped a Cat5/6 Ethernet cable to every site; it should be affixed to the printer itself. Confirm the cable is on site before starting work. If it is not, contact Work Order Manager for approval to expense a cable: use your own if you have one, or purchase locally (Cat5/6) if it won't affect the rest of the day's schedule, and expense it (up to $14).\n\n**Required Items to Bring:** Basic tool set (no specific tools required). Letter of Authorization (in the document section). If the pre-shipped cable is not on site when you arrive, contact Pomeroy Dispatch before purchasing or substituting your own cable.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T08:00","end":"2026-11-09T08:30","latestStart":"2026-11-09T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":0.5,"distance":7.8831071851800525},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEY