{"job":{"id":"6311801762","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"INT13880944   T0755 – Fayetteville, NC Check sound Player Iamges  Ladder needed","description":"<p>Ladder needed </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>T0755 - Image sound Player showing offline .</p><p>Target Summary&nbsp;INT13880944&nbsp;&nbsp;T0755 – Fayetteville, NC Check sound Player Ladder needed&nbsp;</p><p>\\*\\*\\*TECH MUST PERFORM CABLE CHECK BEFORE REPLACING CAMERA\\*\\*\\*</p><p>- Camera in redin red UPON ARRIVAL:\\*\\* TECH MUST CALL GRANITE TARGET SUPPORT BRIDGE&nbsp;929-229-2436,,6261761#&nbsp;&nbsp;TO CHECK IN AND REVIEW SOW \\\\\\*\\\\\\*\\\\\\*&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Proceed to the Guest Service Desk, provide Identification and ask for a Designated Leader Juan San Miguel</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;When meeting designated leader, provide the above incident number and reason for the service call, determine location of service call. Designated Store Lead will direct you to the package with replacement part that was delivered \\(see below for tracking details\\)&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If the store refuses the technician and work, the technician should ask the store leader/designated leader to call the CSC with the above incident number and service call number SR0087053</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If Control Room Access is required, please reach out to CSC 612-304-4357 to obtain code – Tech Must read the attached Control Room Access and Regulations documents before requesting access.</p><p>- Summary&nbsp;INT13880944&nbsp;&nbsp;T0755 – Fayetteville, NC Check sound Player Ladder needed&nbsp;\\*\\*TECH MUST PERFORM CABLE CHECK BEFORE REPLACING</p><p><br></p><p>REQUIRED</p><p>\\\\\\*\\\\\\*\\\\\\*\\*\\*UPON ARRIVAL VS - t1218cam0107.stores.target.com &lt; AXIS P3354&gt; - dome heater/blower issue</p><p>\\*\\* TECH MUST CALL GRANITE TARGET SUPPORT BRIDGE&nbsp;929-229-2436,,6261761#&nbsp;&nbsp;TO CHECK IN AND REVIEW SOW \\\\\\*\\\\\\*\\\\\\*&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Proceed to the Guest Service Desk, provide Identification and ask for a Designated Leader</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;When meeting designated leader, provide the above incident number and reason for the service call, determine location of service call. Designated Store Lead will direct you to the package with replacement part that was delivered \\(see below for tracking details\\)&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If the store refuses the technician and work, the technician should ask the store leader/designated leader to call the CSC with the above incident number and service call number</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If Control Room Access is required, please reach out to CSC 612-304-4357 to obtain code – Tech Must read the attached Control Room Access and Regulations documents before requesting access.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;\\(see attached Target Cable Check Doc\\) upload a picture of cable test –Take old Camera to switch/port to confirm camera is DOA, \\(could be cable run AND camera\\)&nbsp;&nbsp;DO NOT REPLACE Camera without approval from your Granite Rep.&nbsp;</p><p>Summary&nbsp;INT13880944&nbsp;&nbsp;T0755 – Fayetteville, NC Check sound Player Ladder needed&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Store confirmed music playing through speakers. However Imagesound Player is still showing off line</p><p>Outbound Tracking: tech cable check</p><p>Return Tracking Provided: Tech cable check</p><p>Outbound UPN\\(s\\): Tech cable check</p><p>NOTE: Tech is responsible for returning any old or unused equipment.&nbsp;DO NOT leave onsite.&nbsp;&nbsp;Use provided return label and take it to a nearby UPS location to be returned.</p><p><br></p><p>Closeout Checklist:&nbsp;Confirm ALL devices online with designated leader.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Call GRANITE TARGET SUPPORT BRIDGE&nbsp;929-229-2436,,6261761#&nbsp;&nbsp;check out BEFORE leaving.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Provide before and after pictures of devices worked on</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Picture of SN#\\(s\\) one of existing/old and one of new/replaced equipment</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pictures of certified cable tests</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pictures of termination points</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Record first and last name of site contact and support contact you worked with</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If equipment was shipped, Box up unused equipment \\(old or new\\) with return label provided and TECH is responsible for dropping off at a UPS location, a picture of the return label and the receipt from UPS at drop off is a required deliverable</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>REQUIRED MATERIALS /TOOLS: Tech MUST have the following:</p><p>Laptop with power supply</p><p>Cat5/Cat6 cable tester</p><p>Min 500ft CAT6 cable \\(White preferred\\)</p><p>Security bits – Torx AND Hex</p><p>CAT6 Jacks</p><p>CAT6 Patch cords various lengths</p><p>Basic hand tools</p><p>Pliers</p><p>Assorted screwdrivers</p><p>Precision screwdriver set</p><p>Drill</p><p>Velcro for cable management</p><p>Label maker \\(P touch or equivalent\\)</p><p>Patch cables</p><p>Cable tester</p><p>&nbsp;Toner and Probe</p><p>Camera/Smart phone</p><p>8-10' Ladder&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>REQUIRED DELIVERABLES/Closing Info:</p><p>Failure to provide the following may result in delayed payment.</p><p>Before and after photos showing device\\(s\\) worked on</p><p>Capture Clear Pictures SN#'s of existing equipment and replacement equipment</p><p>Manage cables neatly and cleanup work area\\(s\\).</p><p>Confirm all devices are online and working properly before leaving site</p><p>Picture of the return label AND the receipt from UPS at drop off</p><p>Record name of site contact that has verified work completed at closing</p><p>SIGNED work order.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>If Issue/SOW is unable to be resolved, take necessary photos showing device\\(s\\), cable test results and any other problems preventing resolution, please describe findings and what was done on site.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-30T06:00","end":"2026-10-30T08:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":100},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":57.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.00