{"job":{"id":20255388,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Xeal","title":"Firmware Update to Xeal EV Chargers // Smartphone Required","description":{"html":"<p><strong>**Smartphone with the Xeal mobile app is required. Please verify your phone is compatible with the Xeal app prior to accepting this work order.**</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Prior to arrival</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Provide a valid email to Xeal </span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Password reset email will be sent to activate the user account and will be sent to the email provided, (Check spam folder for email if not received.)</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Download Xeal mobile app and login (internet or cell service is required to download app and login, but not for the update itself)</span></li></ul><p><em style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">NOTE: Do not create your own account within the mobile app. The Xeal Mobile App allows you to perform all your Admin/Maintenance duties, login is for the Mobile App ONLY - there is no desktop functionality. If you have signed into the Xeal mobile app before, a PW reset or account setup is not required. You can use the same credentials as last time you accessed the Xeal mobile app.</em></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Upon Arrival:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">If it is not apparent where the chargers are located, check in with the front desk or leasing office for charger location and access to the parking garage if applicable</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope:</strong></p><ul><li>Follow attached Firmware Update Guide for step-by-step instructions, to complete firmware update on each charger</li><li>Take a screenshot of each quick report to show that the firmware is updated and include in attachments section</li><li>Notify Xeal immediately if you encounter any of the following:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">If any charger does not have the power light on, or if any red fault lights are on (Power Fault or Charging Fault)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">If any chargers are in use (plugged into a car) upon arrival (DO NOT unplug charger from any vehicle, contact front desk/leasing office if any are plugged in for them to reach out to the driver to unplug)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">If update was not able to be completed for any reason and on which charger(s)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">If test session is unsuccessful, as well as any error messages you encounter</li><li>If chargers are visibly dirty, wipe them down with a damp cloth or cleaning wipe.</li><li>If cords are not wrapped, wrap cord neatly around charger and plug end into the designated holster</li><li>Take pictures of chargers once everything is complete</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Note: Showing up to site without the proper device type (smartphone compatible with Xeal mobile app) will result in incomplete/nonpayment for the work order. </em></strong></p>","markdown":"**\\*\\*Smartphone with the Xeal mobile app is required. Please verify your phone is compatible with the Xeal app prior to accepting this work order.\\*\\***\n\n**Prior to arrival**\n\n- Provide a valid email to Xeal\n- Password reset email will be sent to activate the user account and will be sent to the email provided, (Check spam folder for email if not received.)\n- Download Xeal mobile app and login (internet or cell service is required to download app and login, but not for the update itself)\n\n*NOTE: Do not create your own account within the mobile app. The Xeal Mobile App allows you to perform all your Admin/Maintenance duties, login is for the Mobile App ONLY - there is no desktop functionality. If you have signed into the Xeal mobile app before, a PW reset or account setup is not required. You can use the same credentials as last time you accessed the Xeal mobile app.*\n\n**Upon Arrival:**\n\n- If it is not apparent where the chargers are located, check in with the front desk or leasing office for charger location and access to the parking garage if applicable\n\n**Scope:**\n\n- Follow attached Firmware Update Guide for step-by-step instructions, to complete firmware update on each charger\n- Take a screenshot of each quick report to show that the firmware is updated and include in attachments section\n- Notify Xeal immediately if you encounter any of the following:\n- If any charger does not have the power light on, or if any red fault lights are on (Power Fault or Charging Fault)\n- If any chargers are in use (plugged into a car) upon arrival (DO NOT unplug charger from any vehicle, contact front desk/leasing office if any are plugged in for them to reach out to the driver to unplug)\n- If update was not able to be completed for any reason and on which charger(s)\n- If test session is unsuccessful, as well as any error messages you encounter\n- If chargers are visibly dirty, wipe them down with a damp cloth or cleaning wipe.\n- If cords are not wrapped, wrap cord neatly around charger and plug end into the designated holster\n- Take pictures of chargers once everything is complete\n\n***Note: Showing up to site without the proper device type (smartphone compatible with Xeal mobile app) will result in incomplete/nonpayment for the work order.***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T10:15","end":"2026-10-29T12:15","latestStart":"2026-10-29T14:45"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":170},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":85,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.001772844060529},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 (countered: $170) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11