{"job":{"id":20255606,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TRCA","title":"292113 - Dogtopia 1650 - NC Holly Springs Equipment Installation - New Store - CoO 11/6/26","description":{"html":"<p>Our insurance requires all providers dispatched to our jobsites to have Worker’s compensation coverage.&nbsp;If you do not provide proof of this coverage, TRCA will provide this for your site visit, and the cost (listed as a penalty charge) will be applied to all work orders.&nbsp;Work orders will have 1% of labor only deducted from the total pay.&nbsp;Note: travel or materials cost do not apply, the deduction is for labor only.&nbsp;If you have a COI with workers compensation, please let the work order manager know, so we can get a copy of the COI and waive this deduction.&nbsp;The CoI must be received before the work order is placed on Work Done in order for the penalty to be removed.</p><p><br></p><p>TECH MUST CHECK IN AND OUT WITH TRCA at 940-323-2600.</p><p><br></p><p>***Any overages or deviations from the approved scope of work MUST be approved in advance.  Failure to notify TRCA may result in non-payment.  Failure to check in and out everyday may result in non-payment.  TRCA will pay actual time on site up to the approved time on site unless Change Orders are approved.  No flat rate bids will be accepted without additional approval.***</p><p><br></p><p>Onsite Contact: GC</p><p>Approved Time on Site: UP TO  28 man hours </p><p><br></p><p>PRIOR TO STARTING WORK, TECH MUST USE THE EQUIPMENT LIST AND INTENT PLAN TO CONFIRM ALL EQUIPMENT IS ONSITE. IF ANYTHING IS MISSING TECH NEEDS TO CALL TRCA IMMEDIATELY AND REPORT IT.</p><p><br></p><p>Reference attached documents:</p><p>- Equipment Installation Guide</p><p>- Menu Board Installation Guide </p><p>- TRCA Technology Intent Plan</p><p>- TRCA Tech Pages from construction documents</p><p>- Equipment List</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Installation Scope:</strong></p><p>TRCA first visit -</p><p>• Install rack</p><p>• Complete 