{"job":{"id":20255713,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Insight Enterprises Inc.","title":"Insight | Hilton SD-WAN | Router Install | Schedule date/time is FIRM","description":{"html":"<p><strong>**IMPORTANT** MUST Call into Hilton Bridge BEFORE starting Install. If this is not done, a 10% penalty will be applied. Hilton Support will email you the Bridge Line number before you arrive on site. Please check your spam messages if you have not received this email before arrival on site.</strong></p><p><strong>Please Note: These workorders require back-end support for the routers to be configured and as such the start times are unable to be changed. Please do not request the workorder if you are unable to support the existing schedule. If you determine you will not be able to support the existing schedule, please remove yourself from the workorder. If you need assistance in removing yourself from the workorder please see: </strong>Cannot Make Assignment (fieldnation.com). <strong>Early arrival to site is not available without prior approval from Insight.</strong> Also, Once the workorder is assigned and if you have not done a Hilton SD-WAN workorder in the past a 5-to-10-minute screening call will be made to you.</p><p><strong>Scope:</strong>&nbsp;Install one (1) Meraki Router</p><p><strong>Dress</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Code:</strong>&nbsp;Business Casual</p><p><strong>Tools Needed:</strong></p><p>• Copy of this Field Procedure document </p><p>• Smart Phone fully charged with charger</p><p>• Hands Free Headset (Bluetooth capable)</p><p><strong>•&nbsp;Windows 10/11 Intel compatible Laptop fully charged with Ethernet port enabled and power supply</strong></p><p>• Cat 5 cable(s)</p><p>• Sharpie, Pen &amp; note pad</p><p>• Snips (Scissors)</p><p>• Box Cutters</p><p><strong>Penalties/Deductions</strong>:</p><p>10% Deduction for 15 minutes or more late.</p><p>10% Deduction for being unprepared.</p><p>Tech swaps MUST be approved in advance. Failure to do so will result in no pay of WO.</p><p>Unauthorized assistants are prohibited from all Insight work. Those assistants will be asked to leave and wait offsite for you to complete the job.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Terms for Travel:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Payment amount listed on this WO is an all-in rate</p><p>If provider is seeking additional compensation for travel time due to distance from work order, this must be requested as a counter-offer PRIOR to assignment</p><p>If submitted post-assignment, pay increase requests for travel time will not be approved</p><p>Tolls or Parking fees will only be eligible for reimbursement if receipt is attached to the work order when closed out</p><p><strong>Terms for Additional Time Required Onsite</strong>:</p><p>Technician must call buyer contact listed in WO immediately upon realizing additional time over max hours in WO will be required</p><p>If additional time required is due to factors agreed to by buyer as outside of tech control; technician may submit request for pay increase for time onsite over max in WO&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IMPORTANT: Pay increase for additional time must be requested and Approved by buyer while tech is onsite; additional time logged by tech on WO or pay increase requests will only be paid if tech obtained pre-approval from buyer POC while onsite</p><p>Tech must enter name of buyer contact who approved increase to ensure any approval questions are directed accordingly</p>","markdown":"**\\*\\*IMPORTANT\\*\\* MUST Call into Hilton Bridge BEFORE starting Install. If this is not done, a 10% penalty will be applied. Hilton Support will email you the Bridge Line number before you arrive on site. Please check your spam messages if you have not received this email before arrival on site.**\n\n**Please Note: These workorders require back-end support for the routers to be configured and as such the start times are unable to be changed. Please do not request the workorder if you are unable to support the existing schedule. If you determine you will not be able to support the existing schedule, please remove yourself from the workorder. If you need assistance in removing yourself from the workorder please see:** Cannot Make Assignment (fieldnation.com). **Early arrival to site is not available without prior approval from Insight.** Also, Once the workorder is assigned and if you have not done a Hilton SD-WAN workorder in the past a 5-to-10-minute screening call will be made to you.\n\n**Scope:** Install one (1) Meraki Router\n\n**Dress** **Code:** Business Casual\n\n**Tools Needed:**\n\n• Copy of this Field Procedure document\n\n• Smart Phone fully charged with charger\n\n• Hands Free Headset (Bluetooth capable)\n\n**• Windows 10/11 Intel compatible Laptop fully charged with Ethernet port enabled and power supply**\n\n• Cat 5 cable(s)\n\n• Sharpie, Pen &amp; note pad\n\n• Snips (Scissors)\n\n• Box Cutters\n\n**Penalties/Deductions**:\n\n10% Deduction for 15 minutes or more late.\n\n10% Deduction for being unprepared.\n\nTech swaps MUST be approved in advance. Failure to do so will result in no pay of WO.\n\nUnauthorized assistants are prohibited from all Insight work. Those assistants will be asked to leave and wait offsite for you to complete the job.\n\n**Terms for Travel:**\n\nPayment amount listed on this WO is an all-in rate\n\nIf provider is seeking additional compensation for travel time due to distance from work order, this must be requested as a counter-offer PRIOR to assignment\n\nIf submitted post-assignment, pay increase requests for travel time will not be approved\n\nTolls or Parking fees will only be eligible for reimbursement if receipt is attached to the work order when closed out\n\n**Terms for Additional Time Required Onsite**:\n\nTechnician must call buyer contact listed in WO immediately upon realizing additional time over max hours in WO will be required\n\nIf additional time required is due to factors agreed to by buyer as outside of tech control; technician may submit request for pay increase for time onsite over max in WO\n\n IMPORTANT: Pay increase for additional time must be requested and Approved by buyer while tech is onsite; additional time logged by tech on WO or pay increase requests will only be paid if tech obtained pre-approval from buyer POC while onsite\n\nTech must enter name of buyer contact who approved increase to ensure any approval questions are directed accordingly","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T11:00","end":"2026-11-05T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":135},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":90},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":45}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":5.702347152226621},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $135 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-28T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-28T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity S