{"job":{"id":20255425,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Mattress Firm - Troubleshoot Music System","description":{"html":"<p>Check-in Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Check in with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>While Onsite:</p>\n<p>-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed</p>\n<p>-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW</p>\n<p>-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>What is believed to be the issue: No music at the store-Music Player is offline.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Is replacement device required: TBD</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Specific device description: No music at the store</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Will Tech be required: Yes</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Description of trouble: Please dispatch Technician to troubleshoot Music system at the store</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>MFI Escalations/Contacts:</p>\n<p>8552343755</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>================================</p>\n<p>On-Site Technician Scope-of-Work:</p>\n<p>================================</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Technician Scope-of-Work:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Technician to troubleshoot issue with music system at the store.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**If determined the issue is with the music player, please engage Mood Media (Tel: 1-800-345-5000)</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Technician must bring a laptop (portable hotspot preferred), tone and probe kit, cable tester, buttset, and spare patch cables with RJ45 and RJ11 modular plugs.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Technician must bring a tall ladder (10 ft or higher), and extra audio cabling.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**Wire run for Music system:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- This is for both the MV players and the Profusion players.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Cable run from speakers to Atlas Sound Amp, to Profusion iS muzak player.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Tap speakers using the 70V connection, and set at 1.5 watts.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Only 1 connection is required: From the Muzak Player's white RCA jack to the amp.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Red audio jack output: Standard FM 1 Mood Media content.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- White audio jack output: Mattress Firm content.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>-Tech to locally source RCA to connect both Amplifier and Media player.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>- Fine tune the amp levels as needed.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**All cable management and equipment operation must be verified prior to On-Site Technician receiving check-out code from Store Systems Support.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Checkout Requirements:</p>\n<p>-Check out with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755</p>\n<p>-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1</p>\n<p>-Tech must document store manager's name and Mattress Firm IT support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout</p>\n<p>-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Required Tools:</p>\n<p>-Basic Cabling Tools</p>\n<p>-Butt set</p>\n<p>-Cable toner</p>\n<p>-Cable Tester</p>\n<p>-Label Maker</p>\n<p>-CAT 6 cabling</p>\n<p>-fiber tester</p>\n<p>-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends</p>\n<p>-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights</p>","markdown":"Check-in Requirements:\n\n-Check in with Spencer Service 877-541-0547 opt 1\n\n-Check in with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755\n\nWhile Onsite:\n\n-Tech must take before and after photos of all work performed\n\n-Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW\n\n-Tech support: Tech to call Spencer Support at 877-541-0547 opt 2 if needed onsite\n\nWhat is believed to be the issue: No music at the store-Music Player is offline.\n\nIs replacement device required: TBD\n\nSpecific device description: No music at the store\n\nWill Tech be required: Yes\n\nDescription of trouble: Please dispatch Technician to troubleshoot Music system at the store\n\nMFI Escalations/Contacts:\n\n8552343755\n\n================================\n\nOn-Site Technician Scope-of-Work:\n\n================================\n\nTechnician Scope-of-Work:\n\n\\*\\*Technician to troubleshoot issue with music system at the store.\n\n\\*\\*If determined the issue is with the music player, please engage Mood Media (Tel: 1-800-345-5000)\n\n\\*\\*Technician must bring a laptop (portable hotspot preferred), tone and probe kit, cable tester, buttset, and spare patch cables with RJ45 and RJ11 modular plugs.\n\n\\*\\*Technician must bring a tall ladder (10 ft or higher), and extra audio cabling.\n\n\\*\\*Wire run for Music system:\n\n\\- This is for both the MV players and the Profusion players.\n\n\\- Cable run from speakers to Atlas Sound Amp, to Profusion iS muzak player.\n\n\\- Tap speakers using the 70V connection, and set at 1.5 watts.\n\n\\- Only 1 connection is required: From the Muzak Player's white RCA jack to the amp.\n\n\\- Red audio jack output: Standard FM 1 Mood Media content.\n\n\\- White audio jack output: Mattress Firm content.\n\n-Tech to locally source RCA to connect both Amplifier and Media player.\n\n\\- Fine tune the amp levels as needed.\n\n\\*\\*All cable management and equipment operation must be verified prior to On-Site Technician receiving check-out code from Store Systems Support.\n\nCheckout Requirements:\n\n-Check out with Mattress Firm IT support, 855-234-3755\n\n-Check out with Spencer Service : 877-541-0547 opt 1\n\n-Tech must document store manager's name and Mattress Firm IT support Name you worked with while onsite at checkout\n\n-Provide all Photos Taken during the time on site to Spencer Service when checking out\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n-Basic Cabling Tools\n\n-Butt set\n\n-Cable toner\n\n-Cable Tester\n\n-Label Maker\n\n-CAT 6 cabling\n\n-fiber tester\n\n-Crimping tool with RJ 45 ends\n\n-Laptop with console cable Teamviewer/Putty/Admin rights","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T11:00","e