{"job":{"id":"6490079668","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"XTIUM","title":"Install new Fortigate firewall","description":"<p><strong>Brief Summary of Work to Be Performed and Time Onsite Expectations</strong></p><p><strong>The estimated time on site for this service event is 2 hours, but varies from site to site.&nbsp;</strong>XTIUM&nbsp;<strong>expects the tech to remain on site until the work is complete or tech is released by customer or&nbsp;</strong>XTIUM&nbsp;<strong>Technical Support Center.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Timely arrival to site is mandatory. If a problem prevents you from arriving on time you must call prior to the scheduled time &amp; advise of your status.</strong></p><p><u>READ AND FOLLOW INSTRUCTIONS IN THIS TICKET AS FAILURE TO DO&nbsp;SO MAY RESULT IN NON PAYMENT FOR THE VISIT</u></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Skills Required and ‘Highlighted’ Tools Required</strong></p><ul><li><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Cisco routers require a USB to DB9 serial adapter and DB9 to RJ45 Cisco console cable</li><li>Adtran routers require a USB to DB9 serial adapter and DB9 male to DB9 female serial cable</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>High Level Work Flow</strong></p><ol><li>Tech will arrive on the work order.<ol><li>You <strong><u>DO NOT</u></strong> need to call us if you checked in on the platform.</li></ol></li><li>Tech will check in with the store manager on duty</li><li>Show manager on duty the work order and a valid photo ID</li><li>Tech to contact TSC by calling into bridge line provided in the work order messages or support number provided in Confidential Information Section if there is no bridge number in the messages.</li><li>TSC and/or Customer and Tech will complete scope of work (including as-built documentation) with customer, as detailed below in work order</li><li>Upon completion of call, Tech will close call with TSC, PRIOR to leaving site and provide closing information.</li><li>While on site if you have any issues, call