{"job":{"id":20257261,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Field Advantage","title":"Internet Connection Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview</strong></p><ul><li>Troubleshoot Internet . Verify all units are operational</li></ul><p><br></p><p>​<strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Dress code is business casual (no t-shirt, no jeans, no sandals)</li><li>Communication with&nbsp;Dispatch prior to arrival is a must!!!</li><li>removed parts must be returned with the provided label, and drop off receipt shown to receive payment</li></ul><p><strong>Equipment</strong></p><ul><li>Powered and functional cell phone</li><li>Laptop Computer</li><li>Velcro and Zip ties</li><li>​Working device for taking pictures</li></ul><p><strong>Pre-Site</strong></p><ul><li>Acknowledge requirements, dress code, and work window</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>On-Site</strong></p><p>Call the FAST number. FA Support Team #&nbsp;<del>*************</del>&nbsp;This is a textable number and they may respond quicker via text.</p><ul><li>​Call into tech support to be assisted throughout the service call</li><li><strong>DO NOT</strong>&nbsp;begin any work until you have called located remote support</li><li>Insure network is operational.</li><li>Work with tech support to reconnect devices to network</li><li>Verify site result by filling out custom fields</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Post-Site</strong></p><ul><li>Ensure deliverables for each site are uploaded before visiting the next site​</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Escalations</strong></p><ul><li>​Always communicate with tech support while onsite</li><li>Check in with&nbsp;immediately should a site be unprepared, turn you away, or if all units have not been replaced when you are leaving site</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Additional Hour and Expenses</strong></p><ul><li>Any additional hours or expenses must be approved by Field Advantage</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview**\n\n- Troubleshoot Internet . Verify all units are operational\n\n​**Requirements**\n\n- Dress code is business casual (no t-shirt, no jeans, no sandals)\n- Communication with Dispatch prior to arrival is a must!!!\n- removed parts must be returned with the provided label, and drop off receipt shown to receive payment\n\n**Equipment**\n\n- Powered and functional cell phone\n- Laptop Computer\n- Velcro and Zip ties\n- ​Working device for taking pictures\n\n**Pre-Site**\n\n- Acknowledge requirements, dress code, and work window\n\n**On-Site**\n\nCall the FAST number. FA Support Team # \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* This is a textable number and they may respond quicker via text.\n\n- ​Call into tech support to be assisted throughout the service call\n- **DO NOT** begin any work until you have called located remote support\n- Insure network is operational.\n- Work with tech support to reconnect devices to network\n- Verify site result by filling out custom fields\n\n**Post-Site**\n\n- Ensure deliverables for each site are uploaded before visiting the next site​\n\n**Escalations**\n\n- ​Always communicate with tech support while onsite\n- Check in with immediately should a site be unprepared, turn you away, or if all units have not been replaced when you are leaving site\n\n**Additional Hour and Expenses**\n\n- Any additional hours or expenses must be approved by Field Advantage","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T08:00","end":"2026-10-28T11:00","latestStart":"2026-10-28T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":120},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":80},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":67.39355934026445},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-28T21:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end"