{"job":{"id":"3045730236","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Mosaic Health | Raleigh | Turn Up","description":"DIA TURN UP/TESTING SOW<br><br>Please contact Kelsey Boucher @ 401-955-9463 if you have any questions about the scope of work.<br><br>REQUIRED EQUIPMENT <br><br>•    Laptop PC (Windows 2000 or higher) with administrator login<br>•    AC power adapter &amp; internet access (cell/mobile card or hotspot)<br>•    DB-9 serial cable &amp; serial port on laptop or USB-to-serial adapter <br>•    Console Cable<br>•    4G card<br>•    AC extension cord <br>•    Cell phone with charger<br>•    Butt Set <br>•    Punch down tool <br>•    Crimp tool <br>•    Min. 500ft CAT5E cabling <br>•    RJ45 jacks and plugs <br>•    Biscuit jacks <br>•    Surface mount box<br>•    NID splitter <br>•    DSL filters<br><br>SITE SURVEY<br><br><br>Locate the DIA circuit and the equipment.<br><br><br>•    CID: 26/KRGN/404623//SB<br><br>EQUIPMENT<br><br>Tracking: 1Z7X569X0137512947<br><br>•    GFLEX-4C8R-1000-8CP-LTE<br>•    SFP1G-LX-31<br>•    GFLEX-EPIK-4P-LTE<br>•    PRO-SC-LC-5M9SMF<br>•    UMC-GA1F1T<br>•    USB2TYPEM<br><br>CIRCUIT ACTIVATION <br><br>At the scheduled time, please call into the activations line.<br><br>•    877-855-1146/Option 2<br>•    Ticket Number: 7098962 <br><br><br>*CIRCUIT DETAILS *<br>Circuit Type: On-Net DIA<br>Carrier: AT&amp;T<br>Bandwidth: 500M<br>DMARC: 2 INDOOR UTILITY ROOM  PORT 1<br>IP: 134.204.31.26<br>Gateway: 134.204.31.25<br>Subnet: 255.255.255.252<br><br>Please install the Granite provided router inside the customer’s data rack.<br><br>If an extension is required, please survey for scope, labor, and materials, and be prepared to generate an estimate / cost proposal for the extension work.<br><br>Work with Granite provisioning to activate and test the circuit AT THE CARRIER HAND-OFF.<br><br>Tech will need to run Speed Tests and Document the Speed/Duplex setting directly from the router interface. (INCLUDE IN CLOSE OUT NOTES)<br><br><br>Once the DIA activation has been completed, please continue with completing the EPIK activation.<br><br><br>•    Epik Activations: 877-855-1146/ Option 2<br><br><br>After the EPIK activation has been completed, please ensure that the Edgeboot is connected to the DIA circuit, and up and running.<br><br><br>•    Tracking: 1Z7X569X0327982526<br>•    Serial Number: 2035260085<br><br><br>CLEAN UP AND CLOSE OUT <br><br><br>Take photos of circuit hand-off, circuit location, telco room, MPOE, customer’s data rack, related equipment, cabling, etc.<br><br><br>END SOW","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T11:00","end":"2026-10-29T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":3.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Thu, Oct 29, 11:00 AM\nChecked: Thu, Oct 29, Fri, Oct 30, Mon, Nov 2 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-10-29T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start