{"job":{"id":20257646,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Call Forwarding System – Troubleshooting – Q-buster **Call Helpdesk once on site**","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p><em>Scope of Work: <del>******** ******* ******* ** ******* * ************</del> for q-buster system M-F 8-5 Eastern</em></p>\n<p><em>Need Tech on site to check on the call forwarding system (Q-buster) site was supposed to update the system with a thumb drive but failed, and system is now down. Tech will need to remove the USB drive from Q-buster PC and unplug it for 10 seconds and then reboot it. Once the PC is back up, test all of the CF buttons at each register, confirming the register light lights up, and the speaker, main monitor is working.</em></p>\n<p><em>• Please remember to note the name of the Manager on duty in log notes. Call cannot be closed without MOD noted. Please be specific in log notes.</em></p>\n<p><em>• IF PARTS ARE REQUESTED/NEEDED, DO NOT CLOSE TICKET – LEAVE OPEN AS PENDING OR CANNOT COMPLETE. TICKET WILL BE ESCALATED WITH TRACKING INFO.</em></p>\n<p><em>• Text Jess a picture of the part needed and button for confirmation of system version</em></p>\n<p><em>Site Security Code #<del>******</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Customer Incident#<del>**********</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Clients present issue:</em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Part shipped to the site: NO</em></p>\n<p><em>Other Instructions: If additional assistance is needed, please call NTS Remote support <del>************** *** ** *** *</del> for retail</em></p>\n<p><em>Required Tool List: FE Tool Kit, DVM to measure power,</em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><strong>Completion Requirements:</strong></p>\n