{"job":{"id":20246941,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Insight Enterprises Inc.","title":"Large Financial Institution | Device Refresh | High Volume Opportunity","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>READ STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS BEFORE REQUESTING/COUNTERING </u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Insight has been engaged by PNC Bank to execute a nationwide PC and currency counter refresh across its retail locations. The selected resource must possess the necessary skills to perform the work, adhere to provided instructions, and report directly to Insight.</span></p><p><strong><u>10% Unprepared and 10% Late Arrival (without prior approval) Deduction is being actively used on this project, un-prepared = not reading the instructions, not having the correct tools, etc.</u></strong></p><p><strong><u><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span></u>Each tech is assigned their own job under their own FN profile. You may NOT bring a helper with you.</strong></p><p><strong>Scope: (refer to full install instructions attached)&nbsp;</strong>Inventory PCs that are on site and validate they are at the correct branch. <u>Report to the Bridge and provide site readiness status. Report any damaged/missing boxes or equipment issues.&nbsp;</u></p><ul><li>Locate the PC or currency counter to be replaced</li><li>Replace PC or currency counter using the installation instructions</li><li>Perform cable management</li><li>Perform basic PC validation (required only for Universal) - Verify network connection, login capability, and browser connectivity</li><li>Box the old PC (old keyboard, old mouse, and old power cable for shipping) or currency counter</li><li>Affix return shipping label on return equipment and place boxed equipment in designated location</li></ul><p><strong>Tools:</strong></p><ul><li>Photo ID</li><li>Letter of Authorization which is attached to this ticket (Can be printed or on your smart phone)</li><li>Fully charged mobile phone and charger</li><li><u>A printed cop