{"job":{"id":20263324,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Zones LLC","title":"Food Lion 341 ZEBULON, NC - Install Antenna L-Bracket Mount in Meat Cooler","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope Notes</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">L-bracket needs to be installed to mount the antenna located in the </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">meat cooler</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. Photos attached.</span></p><p>Technician needed install existing antenna<strong> in the Meat cooler </strong>to newly provided L-Bracket.</p><p>L-Brackets are already on site.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Skill Set &amp; Tools Required:</strong></p><p>Label Maker</p><p>Silicone Sealer</p><p>Self-Tapping Screws for Metal Cooler</p><p>Hand tools (Ratchets, pliers, etc.)</p><p><strong><em>WhatsApp </em></strong>for efficient group communication&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>More Required Tools</strong></p><p>PPE - Hi-Vis shirt or vest and face mask if required by site</p><p>Steel Toe Boots, Safety Glasses, Lift Harness (This is required, if you don't own one, they are sold for about $20 at HD.)</p><p>Adjustable Ladder or 10' A-Frame</p><p>Standard RJ45 hand tools - Stripper, crimps, cat6a Mod Ends</p><p>Smartphone for communication while onsite</p><p>Network Equipment Experience Required</p>","markdown":"**Scope Notes**\n\nL-bracket needs to be installed to mount the antenna located in the **meat cooler**. Photos attached.\n\nTechnician needed install existing antenna **in the Meat cooler** to newly provided L-Bracket.\n\nL-Brackets are already on site.\n\n**Skill Set &amp; Tools Required:**\n\nLabel Maker\n\nSilicone Sealer\n\nSelf-Tapping Screws for Metal Cooler\n\nHand tools (Ratchets, pliers, etc.)\n\n***WhatsApp*** for efficient group communication\n\n**More Required Tools**\n\nPPE - Hi-Vis shirt or vest and face mask if required by site\n\nSteel Toe Boots, Safety Glasses, Lift Harness (This is required, if you don't own one, they are sold for about $20 at HD.)\n\nAdjustable Ladder or 10' A-Frame\n\nStandard RJ45 hand tools - Stripper, crimps, cat6a Mod Ends\n\nSmartphone for communication while onsite\n\nNetwork Equipment Experience Required","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T08:00","end":"2026-11-04T09:00","latestStart":"2026-11-04T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":24.04588222021277},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $65 (countered: $65) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineering (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1793214584783}
{"job":{"id":20263641,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"Coupon Kiosk Printer Paper Reload","description":{"html":"<p>The MVP Savings Center Coupon Kiosk has run out of paper and needs to be refilled however store staff is having difficulty doing so. Contact EPC upon arrival to the work site at <strong>(860) 524-8717</strong> and check in with EPC helpdesk staff. Check in with store staff and request paper roll to load printer with. Follow attached instructions on loading paper into printer. Call EPC for any assistance or once printer has been filled and printer tested good. </p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span></p>","markdown":"The MVP Savings Center Coupon Kiosk has run out of paper and needs to be refilled however store staff is having difficulty doing so. Contact EPC upon arrival to the work site at **(860) 524-8717** and check in with EPC helpdesk staff. Check in with store staff and request paper roll to load printer with. Follow attached instructions on loading paper into printer. Call EPC for any assistance or once printer has been filled and printer tested good.\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-10-28T09:00","end":"2026-10-28T10:00","latestStart":"2026-10-28T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":8.642370657807263},"result":{"el