{"job":{"id":20264730,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"Air Communities - Brizo - Projector Troubleshooting","description":{"html":"<p>Air Communities - Brizo - Projector Troubleshooting</p><p></p><p><strong>PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS PRO SERVICES (PHONES RING THROUGH IN THE ORDER): <del>************</del></strong></p><p></p><p><strong>TECHNICAL CONTACT:</strong> <del>**************************</del></p><p><strong>LOCAL CONTRACT:</strong> <del>********************</del></p><p> </p><p><strong>SOW</strong></p><p><strong>We need a tech to assist in the following: </strong></p><ul><li>Check in with CIS</li><li>Check in with TCON</li><li>Check in with the LCON - Please have them direct you to the proper location</li><li>Site is having issues with projector in the movie room</li><li>Troubleshoot with the TCON<ul><li>Projector may need the bulb replaced inside of it</li></ul></li><li>Take a photos of work done onsite and label photos for WO upload</li><li>Check out with TCON before leaving site</li><li>Check out with the LCON - Get Manager signature on FN Survey form</li><li>Check out with CIS</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong>Equipment required</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop w/Charger</li><li>Cell Phone w/Charger</li><li>Console Cable</li><li>Cable Tester</li><li>Fish Tape</li><li>Toner</li><li>Crimper</li><li>Label Maker</li><li>10&#39; Ladder</li><li>POTS</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Materials Required: </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">(Techs are responsible for providing materials unless otherwise stated in the scope)</strong></p><p><strong>**Please have extras of all the below:</strong></p><ul><li>Cat6 Plenum cable (at least 200’)</li><li>Single Port Surface Mount Boxes</li><li>Cat5e Keystone Jacks</li><li>Cat6 Patch Cables (Varying Lengths)</li><li>Velcro Strips</li></ul><p></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">****NOTE: ALL PHOTOS ARE REQUIRED TO BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THEY ARE BEFORE UPLOADING TO WO OR SENDING TO CIS VIA TEXT. FAILURE TO DO SO WILL RESULT IN PENTALTY FEES****</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Deliverable Photos Needed:</strong> </p><ul><li>PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO <del>************</del></li><li>WORKMAN&#39;S COMP WAIVER (ATTACHED)</li><li>MANAGERS SIGN OFF (ATTACHED)</li></ul><p></p><p></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">***Please note if you do not call for check out before leaving the site we will apply a $75 penalty fee***</strong></p><p></p><p></p>","markdown":"Air Communities - Brizo - Projector Troubleshooting\n\n**PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS PRO SERVICES (PHONES RING THROUGH IN THE ORDER): \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**TECHNICAL CONTACT:** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**LOCAL CONTRACT:** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**SOW**\n\n**We need a tech to assist in the following:**\n\n- Check in with CIS\n- Check in with TCON\n- Check in with the LCON - Please have them direct you to the proper location\n- Site is having issues with projector in the movie room\n- Troubleshoot with the TCON\n  - Projector may need the bulb replaced inside of it\n- Take a photos of work done onsite and label photos for WO upload\n- Check out with TCON before leaving site\n- Check out with the LCON - Get Manager signature on FN Survey form\n- Check out with CIS\n\n**Equipment required**\n\n- Laptop w/Charger\n- Cell Phone w/Charger\n- Console Cable\n- Cable Tester\n- Fish Tape\n- Toner\n- Crimper\n- Label Maker\n- 10' Ladder\n- POTS\n\n**Materials Required:** **(Techs are responsible for providing materials unless otherwise stated in the scope)**\n\n**\\*\\*Please have extras of all the below:**\n\n- Cat6 Plenum cable (at least 200’)\n- Single Port Surface Mount Boxes\n- Cat5e Keystone Jacks\n- Cat6 Patch Cables (Varying Lengths)\n- Velcro Strips\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*NOTE: ALL PHOTOS ARE REQUIRED TO BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THEY ARE BEFORE UPLOADING TO WO OR SENDING TO CIS VIA TEXT. FAILURE TO DO SO WILL RESULT IN PENTALTY FEES\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Deliverable Photos Needed:**\n\n- PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- WORKMAN'S COMP WAIVER (ATTACHED)\n- MANAGERS SIGN OFF (ATTACHED)\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Please note if you do not call for check out before leaving the site we will apply a $75 penalty fee\\*\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-30T10:00","end":"2026-10-30T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":130,"max":260},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":130},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":65}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.621359576717831},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-30T17:15:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:15:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"20