{"job":{"id":"1769073914","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Concert Technologies","title":"Urgent - 1 Technician Needed to work with remote support to check the connection between the sites cradlepoint and router.  Job 747613","description":"<p>Please dispatch 1 Technician Thursday 10/29 after 11:30 AM</p><p><br></p><p>Tech to work with remote support to check the connection between the sites cradlepoint and router.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>*** Tech MUST have laptop, USB to DB9 serial adapter, DB9 console cable, and mobile hotspot ***</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Tech will need to bring all tools and materials needed to complete (ie:&nbsp;Spare cat5e or cat6 cable, RJ45 jacks, RJ 45mod ends, spare patch cords, punch down and crimper tools, cable continuity tester, Butt in Test Set, etc.)</p><p><br></p><p>Tech will need to bring a laptop, usb to db-9 adapter, Cisco console cable, fully-pinned micro USB type B console cable, a 6-8’ ladder and have Teams, Quick Assist, WEBEX &amp; Putty Installed on the laptop.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T11:30","end":"2026-10-29T14:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":64.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":95,"payStructure":null},"reason":"TRAVEL_REQUIRED","rejectDetails":"Travel required (64.5mi reported + 10mi padding = 74.5mi > 20mi)"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T