{"job":{"id":20265478,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Insight Enterprises Inc.","title":"Insight | JPMC MaCD | Pin Pads","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Opportunities for Badged techs on projects, MACD and B/F work</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>We are seeking Badged techs to qualify for ongoing work at branch locations for a bank, one of Insight's largest clients. This badge is a mandatory requirement for techs to be eligible for this work.</strong></li><li><strong>By becoming a badged tech for this end-customer you'll gain access to a consistent stream of work routed by Insight. If you're not yet badged, you can start the process today through this program page: </strong><u>https://fieldnation.com/work/insight</u></li><li><strong>Newly badged techs are eligible for a one-time bonus upon receiving your badge. Details are available through the recruitment link.</strong></li></ul><p>Insight has been engaged by <del>**** </del>to assist with their Ad Hoc needs. Please make sure to read all standard instructions before accepting OR requesting this workorder.</p><p>Please see tracking before going to site or call <del>******* *************</del> Tracking is added to the ticket the morning of the job if applicable. Look in the shipments section.</p><p>**<strong>CHECK YOUR EMAIL THE MORNING OF REGARDING YOUR ASSIGNED WO **</strong></p><p><strong><u>SCOPE:</u></strong></p><p>Insight | JPMC MaCD | See Scope In Service Description<br/><br/>\"***BEFORE you mark yourself ONSITE It is essential that you call the Insight team - 1-800-215-8968.<br/>Do not leave the site UNTIL you call the Insight team.  Contact Insight for instruction***<br/><br/>Date: 11/17/26<br/><br/>Scope - Follow the instructions in the process guide you will be emailed before the site visit. There is no tier 2 check in or out unless you need technical assistance. Please read entire guide paying special attention to the troubleshooting steps. If the steps do not work, please call the number for tie