{"job":{"id":"2773934601","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"JTI NETWORK LLC","title":"0018957 | Network Troubleshooting","description":"<p><strong>Good, clean and constant communication before the activity and while work on site is essential.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em><u>Note: Field Engineer needs to carry photo identity proof (Driving license or any govt affiliated photo ID).</u></em></strong></p><p>====================================================</p><p><br></p><p><strong>ONLY LEAVE THE SITE AFTER COMPLETING THE TASK.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>The store is completely offline. The Field Engineer (FE) is required to troubleshoot the Meraki MX appliance and other network devices to identify and resolve the connectivity issue.</p><p><br></p><p>Tasks:</p><ul><li>Inspect the MX appliance, network devices, and physical cabling.</li><li>Check power, modem status, and network connections.</li><li>Verify cable connections and reseat cables as needed.</li><li>Troubleshoot WAN 2, which had been online but not passing traffic for over a month, and investigate the subsequent complete outage.</li><li>Coordinate with the GNOC (Global Network Operations Center) and follow remote troubleshooting instructions.</li><li>Perform basic connectivity checks and report findings and device status to the remote team.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Required Equipment:</p><ul><li>Windows laptop with a working Ethernet (LAN) port and internet connection.</li><li>Microsoft Teams installed.</li><li>Extra LAN cable.</li><li>Console cable compatible with the network equipment.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Expected Outcome:</strong> Identify the cause of the outage, assist with restoring connectivity as directed by the remote team, and provide a status update on any unresolved issues.</p><p><br></p><p>=====================================================</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>This is all that you need to bring with you for the activity</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1- Laptop;</p><p>1.0- Laptop with charger (should be fully charged);</p><p>1.1- Windows OS installed laptop ( No MacBook );</p><p>1.2- Some activities need to perform some tests on the equipment or link and it is necessary to turn off Anti-virus and Firewall from the laptop, make sure that your laptop can accomplish this. Note: Some company laptop does not allow it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2- Mobile phone;</p><p>2.1-&nbsp;Mobile phone with charger (should be fully charged) and take pictures with good resolution;</p><p>2.2-&nbsp;Mobile data connection (3G or 4G) on the mobile phone and share the connection to the laptop</p><p>3- Console Cable and USB x Serial converter;</p><p>- HDE USB to Serial Interface Cable with Serial to RJ45 Console Adapter Cable for Cisco Routers.</p><p>4- Cables Straight RJ45 - CAT5</p><p>5- USB Pendrive (minimum 8GB);</p><p>6- Kit Screw Driver and Philips;</p><p>7- Labelling machine;</p><p>8- Headset.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>The technician needs to have WhatsApp application installed on his smartphone. If no, please install, we use this to facilitate the communication. - It's free to download&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/download/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.whatsapp.com/download/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>PLEASE, DURING THE TASK KEEP YOUR CELL PHONE CLOSE TO YOU IN CASE WE NEED TO CALL OR TEXT YOU, TO KNOW ABOUT THE TASK STATUS.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-29T11:00","end":"2026-10-29T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":36.36,"max":145.44},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":36.36,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":35.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $145.44 (countered: $65) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-0