{"job":{"id":"5063499482","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Naranjo Company","title":"Cary, NC - HARD START - Fortinet Firewall Installation with remote support","description":"⚠ SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS<br>BEFORE THE VISIT — install our remote software (required)<br><br>- Download Nardex Connect from: https://www.naranjocompany.com/downloads<br>- Run the installer. If Windows shows \"Windows protected your PC,\" click More info → Run anyway (publisher: Naranjo Company Corp — this is correct).<br>- Bring a laptop with an Ethernet (RJ45) port and Wi‑Fi, and your own internet (phone hotspot is fine).<br>- We'll confirm the appointment by our official WhatsApp Account.<br>- Estimated time onsite: 3 hrs<br><br>⚠️ MUST ARRIVE ON TIME – NO LATE ARRIVALS<br><br>A third-party remote team is scheduled to support this activity at the same start time. The engineer must be onsite and ready to begin at the scheduled time to avoid delays to the deployment.<br><br>─── Scope of work ───<br>ONSITE TASKS<br><br>- Check in at reception as EXN engineer and join the bridge call (link sent before arrival).<br>- Install (2) Fortinet FG‑61F in the rack — connect power and the LAN / WAN / Management cables as directed.<br>- Our engineer upgrades and configures them remotely; you label them Primary / Secondary.<br>- Stay 30 minutes to verify.<br>- When asked by remote team, remove the legacy firewalls and handed over to the onsite contact<br>- Take Pictures of the completed install.<br><br>Bring: screwdrivers, label maker, mobile phone, PPE (if required).<br><br>COMPLETE WHEN: both devices respond at their assigned IPs and the customer signs off (mobile sign‑off link to be provided).","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T07:45","end":"2026-11-03T10:45"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $1