{"job":{"id":"1853370336","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Everyday Coffee - Router Install & Turn Up","description":"CHECK IN<br>Check in and out with Chris Nunes 401-288-1842<br><br>BEGIN SCOPE OF WORK<br>Locate tenant Dunking Donuts / Everyday Coffee at the front of the store<br>Call LCON for access to Dunkin space OR locate Walmart Store Manager for assistance <br><br>ROUTER INSTALL<br>Locate Granite edge router on network shelf<br>-    Verify Granite Jack is patched into in WAN port ETH 0/1<br>-    Test out of Customer Lan port ETH 0/2<br>Call Granite Activations to verify port assignment, connectivity, run a speed test, and troubleshoot as required<br>-    Inform them that you are installing a Granite router for a Walmart Tenant (DO NOT mention 'EPIK' )<br>-    If unable to surf, you may need to go to the local IDF closet to verify if the extension is connected to the correct switch and port.<br>Router should be installed and left on silver shelf on the back service wall neat the outlets and data plug<br>-    If there is no shelf leave on the cabinet to the right. <br>-    If the end user space is not ready, please leave router within the respective IDF closet for safe-keeping<br><br>DELIVERABLES<br>INCLUDE IN CLOSE OUT NOTES:<br>- Router Successfully Tested: Yes or No<br>- Location of where NID was placed: Customer Suite OR IDF (in case site not ready)<br><br>TAKE PHOTOS OF:<br>- Location of biscuit jack in tenant space<br>- Speed tests<br>- Final location of Granite edge router<br><br>CHECK OUT<br>Call Chris Nunes to check out<br><br>END SCOPE OF WORK<br><br>Provisioning Info: <br>Demarc: s-grc: Grocery Switch<br>Circuit ID: TCS000617<br>IP: 156.89.240.52<br>GW: 156.89.240.49<br>SN: 255.255.255.248<br>Switch/Port Info: s-grc-2.s02845.us.wal-mart.com.ge-0/0/27<br>NID / CPE ID: CPEVYS0000003524<br>NID Tracking: 1Z7X569X0234137017<br>Granite Activations: 888-860-1159 Option 2, Reference Ticket# 7108182","isRequestedWindow"