{"job":{"id":20268896,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NETFOR","title":"JOHNSTON & MURPHY New Store Installation **3 DAYS**","description":{"html":"<p>BY ACCEPTING THIS ASSIGNMENT, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLETE THE WO, UPLOAD ALL DELIVERABLES WHILE ON SITE AND COMPLETE THE CHECK IN/OUT PROCESS FULLY.</p>\n<p><strong>SITE INFORMATION</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Site ID</strong>: GEN01547JMR</p>\n<p><strong>Service Request Number(s):</strong> SR04380953 / SR04380952</p>\n<p><strong>Site Name</strong>:<strong>&nbsp;</strong>JOHNSTON &amp; MURPHY 071547_GEN01547JMR</p>\n<p><strong>Street Address</strong>: 4325 GLENWOOD AVE, STE 2106, RALEIGH, NC 27612</p>\n<p><strong>Parts Being Sent</strong>: To Tech</p>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p>\n<p>Tech will need to check-in via tect chat - text “Start” to <del>************</del>.You will receive 2 messages back. First will confirm you have been connected and the second will ask if you are onsite for 1 - New Installation or 2 - Service, you will always respond back \"1\".<strong>**review PDF attached on process &amp; directions to escalate if support not responsive within 20 minutes (Step 2)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK</strong>:</p>\n<p>See attached layout &amp; IG for full SOW – This is a “New Store” Installation.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Day 1: 10/30/2026 @ 9AM</p>\n<p>NET CAB Relo</p>\n<p>Day 2: 11/5/2026 @ 9AM</p>\n<p>Pre-wire</p>\n<p>Day 3: 11/12/2026 @ 9AM</p>\n<p>Cashwrap Rewire</p>\n<p>Installation Guide: https://interfacesystems.mcoutput.com/genig/Content/Network%20Installation%20Guides/Genesco/Individual%20Scopes/Prior%20to%20Entering.htm</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> *** WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT A RELEASE CODE FROM THE REMOTE SUPPORT TECHNICIAN ***</p>\n<p><strong>REQUIRED DELIVERABLES</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Work Order Signed by POC with Accurate date and Check In/Out times (attached document or electronically).</li>\n<li>Picture of any equipment work was completed on, damaged cables/