{"job":{"id":20268864,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Interface Security Systems","title":"MANAGED NETWORK / Day 1 Pre-wire with Digital Portal x8 Data Drops","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work</u>: THIS IS A 3 DAY INSTALL - 11/5, 11/12, &amp; 11/16 - PLEASE BE AVAILABLE FOR ALL 3 DAYS. WOS FOR DAY 2 &amp; 3 CREATED - PLEASE REQUEST ALL TO BE CONSIDERED.</strong></p><p><strong>PARTS NEED TO SHIP TO TECH - PLEASE PROVIDE SHIPPING ADDRESS UPON ASSIGNMENT. </strong></p><p>Upon arrival at the site—but before entering the location—initiate the check-in process by texting “Start” to 314-208-2475 to check in with your assigned NIS coordinator. Select INSTALL.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(7, 4, 13);\">Day 1: 11/5/2026 @ 9AM</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(7, 4, 13);\">Pre-wire with Digital Portal x8 Data Drops</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 4, 13);\">Day 2: 11/12/2026 @ 9AM</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 4, 13);\">Cashwrap Rewire</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 4, 13);\">Day 3: 11/16/2026 @ 9AM</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(7, 4, 13);\">NET CAB Relo</span></p><p><br></p><p>https://interfacesystems.mcoutput.com/genig/Content/Network%20Installation%20Guides/Genesco/Individual%20Scopes/Prior%20to%20Entering.htm</p><p><br></p><p><u>Please read this section</u></p><p>TECH MUST REQUEST EXPENSES ON THE FRONT END</p><p>TECH MUST REVIEW ALL ATTACHMENTS IN FULL BEFORE GETTING TO SITE</p><p>TECH MUST RECIEVE COMPLETION CODE BEFORE PAYMENT APPROVED.</p><p>TECH MUST CHECK IN AND WORK WITH INSTALL SUPPORT USING GUIDE IN ATTACHMENTS</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Tools Required</u>:</strong></p><p><u>IF Work Order is for \"Intrusion, Card Access, CCTV or Interactive\"</u></p><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Laptop Computer – with screen sharing application installed, (preference is AnyDesk)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Wireless Hot Spot Device</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Ladder, 8’ step ladder.</li><li class=\"ql-indent