 ends.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">7 level screw driver.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Fish Tape.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">18 Volt Cordless Drill and Drill Bits for all Materials.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">RJ45 Connectors and Crimp Tool.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tie Wraps.</li><li>10. Sharpie or Label Maker.</li><li>11. Network cable tester.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Escalation POCs</u>:</strong></p><ul><li>TECH MUST FOLLOW ATTACHED SOP/ CHOOSE INSTALL OPTION</li><li>PLEASE READ GUIDE IN FULL AS ESCALATION EMAILS ARE ON LAST PAGE</li></ul><p><strong><u>Dress Code:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Dress and look appropriate for the job.</li><li>No ripped/cut pants.</li><li>Boots recommended but no open-toed shoes.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Non-used Parts:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>If there are any parts that were shipped to site that weren't used. Please fill out Fed Ex return form included in the part shipment box. After this form has been filled out, please return package with form to the nearest FedEx Facility for the part to be returned to Interface Security. Please note the tracking number in close notes</strong></li></ul><p><br></p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work: THIS IS A 3 DAY INSTALL - 11/5, 11/12, &amp; 11/16 - PLEASE BE AVAILABLE FOR ALL 3 DAYS. WOS FOR DAY 2 &amp; 3 CREATED - PLEASE REQUEST ALL TO BE CONSIDERED.**\n\n**PARTS NEED TO SHIP TO TECH - PLEASE PROVIDE SHIPPING ADDRESS UPON ASSIGNMENT.**\n\nUpon arrival at the site—but before entering the location—initiate the check-in process by texting “Start” to 314-208-2475 to check in with your assigned NIS coordinator. Select INSTALL.\n\n**Day 1: 11/5/2026 @ 9AM**\n\n**Pre-wire with Digital Portal x8 Data Drops**\n\nDay 2: 11/12/2026 @ 9AM\n\nCashwrap Rewire\n\nDay 3: 11/16/2026 @ 9AM\n\nNET CAB Relo\n\n<https://interfacesystems.mcoutput.com/genig/Content/Network%20Installation%20Guides/Genesco/Individual%20Scopes/Prior%20to%20Entering.htm>\n\nPlease read this section\n\nTECH MUST REQUEST 