**\n\n- TECH MUST FOLLOW ATTACHED SOP/ CHOOSE INSTALL OPTION\n- PLEASE READ GUIDE IN FULL AS ESCALATION EMAILS ARE ON LAST PAGE\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Dress and look appropriate for the job.\n- No ripped/cut pants.\n- Boots recommended but no open-toed shoes.\n\n**Non-used Parts:**\n\n- **If there are any parts that were shipped to site that weren't used. Please fill out Fed Ex return form included in the part shipment box. After this form has been filled out, please return package with form to the nearest FedEx Facility for the part to be returned to Interface Security. Please note the tracking number in close notes**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T09:00","end":"2026-11-05T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":600,"max":600},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":4.558136427491954},"result":{"eligible":true,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"ELIGIBLE"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Granite GRID Lite router is offline. (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":