rity Standard Tool Kit, (Including, but not limited to):\n- \\#1, #2 and #3 Phillips Head Screwdrivers\n- 1/4”, 3/16 and 5/16” Flat-Blade Screwdrivers\n- Phillips and Flat-Blade “Tweaker” Screwdriver\n- 8” Torpedo Level\n- Diagonal Cuters\n- Wire Strippers, (capable to 22 gage stranded)\n- Adjustable wrench\n- Crimping tool – RJ45 Plug\n- Wire Tracer/Toner\n- 25’ Tape Measure\n- Fish Tape or “Green” Sticks\n- 3/8” 18-Volt Cordless Drill, w/ Spare Batery, (“Hammer” func�on recommended but not required)\n- Set of Standard Jobber and Masonry Drill Bits\n- Smart Phone\n- Required Materials and Supplies:\n- CAT6 Wire – Minimum 500’\n- RJ45 Jacks and Plugs\n- Fastener Assortment\n- Tie Wraps, (“ZIP Ties)\n- Splice Caps, (“B” Connectors\n\nIF Work Order is for \"Network and UcaaS\"\n\n- Smart Phone with WIFI Analyzer App.\n- For iPhone:\n- Download the \"Airport Utility\" app from the Apple App Store.\n- Enable \"WIFI Scanner\" in app settings.\n- For Android:\n- Download the \"WIFI Analyzer\" app from the Google Play Store.\n- Choose 2.4 GHz or 5 GHz and click the test icon.\n- Laptop with Ethernet Port or Adapter.\n- Console Cable or Adapter.\n- Ladder - 8' minimum.\n- Standard Networking Tool Kit.\n- Network Cable stripper\n- Network Cable crimper – for most 45 ends.\n- 7 level screw driver.\n- Fish Tape.\n- 18 Volt Cordless Drill and Drill Bits for all Materials.\n- RJ45 Connectors and Crimp Tool.\n- Tie Wraps.\n- 10. Sharpie or Label Maker.\n- 11. Network cable tester.\n\n**Escalation POCs:**\n\n- TECH MUST FOLLOW ATTACHED SOP/ CHOOSE INSTALL OPTION\n- PLEASE READ GUIDE IN FULL AS ESCALATION EMAILS ARE ON LAST PAGE\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Dress and look appropriate for the job.\n- No ripped/cut pants.\n- Boots recommended but no open-toed shoes.\n\n**Non-used Parts:**\n\n- **If there are any parts that were shipped to site that weren't used. Please fill out Fed Ex return form included in the part shipment box. After this form has been filled out, please return package with form to the nearest FedEx Facility for the part to be returned to Interface Security. Please note the tracking number in close notes**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-16T09:00","end":"2026-11-16T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":400,"max":400},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":4.558136427491954},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $400 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-18T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-19T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-19T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-20T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-21T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-29T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Granite GRID Lite router is offline. (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineering (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T1