ity. Call TDX Tech with questions on this\\***\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n***-TDX Work Order - Attached PDF - NOT Field Nation's***\n\n***-Cable Tester***\n\n***-Basic PC Tool Kit***\n\n***-Basic Cabling Tool Kit***\n\n***-Butt Set (if doing telco work)***\n\n***-Patch cables***\n\n***-Punch Down Tool***\n\n***-Any other tools needed to resolve***\n\n***-Digital Camera***\n\n***-Reliable Vehicle***\n\n***-Cat 5 and 6 Cable***\n\n***-RJ 45 connectors***\n\n***-Zip Ties / Cable Ties***\n\nThe technician must provide all tools and materials required to complete the installation. Materials will be reimbursed.\n\nIf the technician does not have the required skill set, tools, or materials, DO NOT accept the work order. If the technician arrives on site unprepared, they will be asked to leave and will not be paid.\n\n**Work Step Description:**\n\n-Check in with TDX Tech at **952-912-9205**\n\n-Check in with the customer's Provisioning Team at See confidential information for phone numbers.\n\n-Listen to the voicemail and press option 1 to reach Provisioning Team on-call team.\n\n-Check in with the manager on duty\n\n-Call Customer support before starting work to review the detailed scope and requested photos\n\n-Perform the desired scope\n\n-Test and confirm with customer support prior to leaving the site\n\n-Clean work area to pre-visit standards\n\n-Complete the work order with the manager on duty's signature\n\n-Upload all photos and signed work orders to Field Nation\n\n-Check out with the TDX help desk\n\nUpon completion, the work order and pictures must be submitted to your Field Nation ticket within 24 hours to receive payment.\n\nIf the technician does not submit the required deliverables, they will not be paid for the time on site, and penalties will be applied.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T09:00","end":"2026-11-05T11:00","latestStart":"2026-11-05T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"