{"job":{"id":20270272,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Comm-Works","title":"FIBER TECH - plugging in SFP","description":{"html":"<p>Tech to be on site Friday 10/30/26 at 1:30pm CST to plug new SFP into Adva in customer rack – call into Teams call at 2:00 for testing/activation</p><p>** Items required of the Technician (Laptop, Console Cable, etc.) / laptop; ability for internet via a hotspot or something; console cable (Cisco Blue); software to allow CCI Engineer to access hardware (teams meeting screen share or anydesk).</p><p><br></p><p>Equipment already on site; Adva NID, GLC-TE-IO Copper SFP;&nbsp;Tech will need to provide ethernet cable to go between AT&amp;T NID and Fidium NID</p><p>Site contact is Rick Houle / Rick.Houle@ISGInc.com / 919.800.7602</p><p>Fidium IPM contact: Tom Urban 612-787-3029</p><p><br></p><p>At 2pm CST call into teams meeting - Fidium engineers will be on the call.&nbsp;Will be connecting new AT&amp;T circuit to Adva that was racked during previous installation attempt on 7/29/26.&nbsp;This connection will consist of replacing the SFP that is currently plugged in to the handoff port of the Adva with the new SFP that was recently shipped to customer's location.&nbsp;This will require a 3-5ft ethernet cable.&nbsp;Fidium engineer will verify they have remote access to Adva.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Teams meeting info below:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>","markdown":"Tech to be on site Friday 10/30/26 at 1:30pm CST to plug new SFP into Adva in customer rack – call into Teams call at 2:00 for testing/activation\n\n\\*\\* Items required of the Technician (Laptop, Console Cable, etc.) / laptop; ability for internet via a hotspot or something; console cable (Cisco Blue); software to allow CCI Engineer to access hardware (teams meeting screen share or anydesk).\n\nEquipment already on site; Adva NID, GLC-TE-IO Copper SFP; Tech will need to provide ethernet cable to go between AT&amp;T NID and Fidium NID\n\nSite contact is Rick Houle / Rick.Houle@ISGInc.com / 919.800.7602\n\nFidium IPM contact: Tom Urban 612-787-3029\n\nAt 2pm CST call into teams meeting - Fidium engineers will be on the call. Will be connecting new AT&amp;T circuit to Adva that was racked during previous installation attempt on 7/29/26. This connection will consist of replacing the SFP that is currently plugged in to the handoff port of the Adva with the new SFP that was recently shipped to customer's location. This will require a 3-5ft ethernet cable. Fidium engineer will verify they have remote access to Adva.\n\nTeams meeting info below:","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-30T13:30","end":"2026-10-30T15:30"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.46898259041124},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $140) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-30T17:15:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:15:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Halloween"},{"start":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Daylight Saving Time ends"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-10-29T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-29T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Granite GRID Lite router is offline. (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z"