{"job":{"id":"2676094684","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance***","description":"\"Purpose of visit is to:<br><br>1) Confirm with local contact where existing Thermo Fisher network equipment resides (whether at demarc or individual room)<br>2) Locate and extend (if necessary) new service(s) from demarc to Thermo Fisher’s server rack/cabinet.<br>3) Install new Granite EdgebootPro device in Thermo Fisher’s server rack/cabinet.<br>4) Connect new Granite-provided circuit(s) AC power to EdgebootPro.<br>5) Connect new Granite-provided circuit(s) to EgebootPro via new Ethernet cabling for monitoring purposes in accordance to breakdown below.<br>6) Test/validate new service(s) with Granite Activations support.<br>7) Record speed test result<br>8) Verify useable static IPs<br>9) Tag and label each new cable run performed in accordance to requirements listed below.<br>10) PRODUCE FOLLOWING DELIVERABLES<br>  A) PHOTOS OF CIRCUIT EXTENDED<br>  B) PHOTOS OF SPEED TEST RESULTS<br>  C) PHOTOS OF CORRECT IPS USED FOR SUCCESSFUL TEST<br>  D) PHOTOS OF NEW GRANITE FLEXEDGE DEVICE AND/OR BROADBAND MODEM<br><br>***DEMARC EXTENSION TO THERMO FISHER SERVER ROOM REQUIRED IN ORDER TO DEEM APPOINTMENT SUCCESSFUL***<br><br>***PLEASE CONFIRM WITH THERMO FISHER LOCAL CONTACT WHERE EXISTING NETWORK EQUIPMENT RESIDES***<br><br>***FOR ANY CIRCUITS REQUIRING EXTENSION, PLEASE CONFIRM WITH THERMO FISHER LOCAL CONTACT IF THERE IS ANY AVAILABLE COPPER CABLING BETWEEN DEMARC AND TFS SERVER ROOM. IF ANY AVAILABLE CABLING IS UNUSED, PLEASE UTILIZE CABLING EXTEND SERVICE AND TERMINATE GRANITE FLEXEDGE DEVICE INSIDE TFS SERVER ROOM. IF NONE IS AVAILABLE AND EXTENSION CAN BE PERFORMED SAME-DAY, PLEASE PERFORM WORK SAME-DAY. IF EXTENSION IS UNABLE TO BE PERFORMED SAME-DAY, QUOTE NEW CABLE RUN***<br><br>Service details below:\"<br>Primary Contact:Paul Hawks<br>Primary LCON TN:9194566742<br>Granite Activation:877-855-1146 Option 1 (BB), Option 2 (DIA)<br>Granite Activations Ticket:7110445<br>Customer:Thermo Fisher Scientific<br>WAN 1 Details:<br>Type:DIA<br>ISP:Crown Castle<br>Bandwidth:2G<br>Circuit ID:445348-ENET-CCF<br>Handoff:SMF<br>Demarc:Demarc: 1st Fl / Carrier Rm 137 Rack: Rack: RR137-D03  Shelf: Shelf: LGX03  Port: Port: 27-28  Other CFA: Other CFA: SMF/SC Ethernet/Internet: 10 Gige (Single Mode) Ethernet/Internet: 10 Gige (Single Mode)<br>IP:143.170.26.242 - .246<br>GW:143.170.26.241<br>Subnet:255.255.255.248<br>DNS1:8.8.8.8<br>DNS2:8.8.4.4<br>Equipment UPS (DIA ORDER ONLY, PLEASE DISREGARD FOR BROADBAND PRODUCTS):1Z7X569X0229418438<br>Contents (DIA ORDER ONLY, PLEASE DISREGARD FOR BROADBAND PRODUCTS):Granite FlexEdge/Epik NID<br><br>\"***ONCE TESTING/VALIDATION IS COMPLETE, PLEASE PROCEED WITH STEPS BELOW FOR CROSS-CONNECTING AND/OR LABELING NEW CABLING***<br><br>Edgeboot AC/Ethernet Connections<br>WAN 1 power to AC port 1<br>WAN 2 power to AC port 2<br>WAN 1 interface to ETH1<br>WAN 2 interface to ETH0<br><br>WAN to Edgeboot labeling instructions:<br>WAN 1 to Edgeboot port ETH0<br>WAN 1 side: “Edgeboot ETH1”<br>Edgeboot side: “Circuit ID XXX”<br>WAN 2 to Edgeboot Port ETH1:<br>WAN 2 side: “Edgeboot ETH1”<br>Edgeboot side: “Circuit ID XXX”\"","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T09:00","end":"2026-11-05T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":11.9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":65,"baseAmount":195,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":30,"payStructure":null},"reason":"PAYMENT_INSUFFICIENT","rejectDetails":"Rate $60/hr is below base rate $65/hr"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","