{"job":{"id":20273740,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"BP Innovations, Inc.","title":"Need Smart hands to replace Network Equipment and test","description":{"html":"<p>TECH SUPPLIED MATERIALS TO INCLUDE (tech must also have standard materials list attached to WO):</p>\n<p>NOTE: ANY MATERIALS USED WE WILL REQUIRE A CLOSE-UP PHOTO OF THE MATERIALS.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>At least 500' of Cat 5e Cable</li>\n<li>RJ45 Jacks</li>\n<li>Faceplates/surface mounts</li>\n<li>Various sizes of Patch cords</li>\n<li>Termination tools</li>\n<li>Cable tester</li>\n<li>Labeler</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Tech Must have the following equipment available.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;1. Laptop with RJ45 connection</p>\n<p>&nbsp;2. Console cable and Putty (Team Viewer Software</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>REQUEST SUMMARY: Request dispatch to assist with network equipment refresh.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>SCOPE OF WORK:</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>1.) Please contact BP Innovations for Check-In and Check-Out, and with any questions; 877-611-3722. x210</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>2.) Arrive onsite and meet with the local contact. Have them hand you the network equipment that was delivered</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unbox the network equipment and when you are ready please contact the network engineer and follow their instructions in replacing the new network firewall and or new AP. Test with the engineer (contact info will be given once on site.)</li>\n<li>When completed please take photos of work completed and the sign out sheet and upload it to:https://bpinnovations.app.box.com/f/e19ad466b01c4e4c96d997519e0fef40</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Existing Access Points that will be replaced:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MR33 - Q2PD-5NZU-NWAY</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>New Access Points shipped to site:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MR46 - Q3KD-EBCY-JUGT</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tracking# for Equipment shipped to site: 879375100575</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>","markdown":"TECH SUPPLIED MATERIALS TO INCLUDE (tech must also have standard materials list attached to WO):\n\nNOTE: ANY MATERIALS USED WE WILL REQUIRE A CLOSE-UP PHOTO OF THE MATERIALS.\n\n- At least 500' of Cat 5e Cable\n- RJ45 Jacks\n- Faceplates/surface mounts\n- Various sizes of Patch cords\n- Termination tools\n- Cable tester\n- Labeler\n\nTech Must have the following equipment available.\n\n 1. Laptop with RJ45 connection\n\n 2. Console cable and Putty (Team Viewer Software\n\nREQUEST SUMMARY: Request dispatch to assist with network equipment refresh.\n\nSCOPE OF WORK:\n\n1.) Please contact BP Innovations for Check-In and Check-Out, and with any questions; 877-611-3722. x210\n\n2.) Arrive onsite and meet with the local contact. Have them hand you the network equipment that was delivered\n\n- Unbox the network equipment and when you are ready please contact the network engineer and follow their instructions in replacing the new network firewall and or new AP. Test with the engineer (contact info will be given once on site.)\n- When completed please take photos of work completed and the sign out sheet and upload it to:<https://bpinnovations.app.box.com/f/e19ad466b01c4e4c96d997519e0fef40>\n\nExisting Access Points that will be replaced:\n\n- MR33 - Q2PD-5NZU-NWAY\n\nNew Access Points shipped to site:\n\n- MR46 - Q3KD-EBCY-JUGT\n\n- Tracking# for Equipment shipped to site: 879375100575","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T09:00","end":"2026-11-06T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":140},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":70,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":40.08663166944832},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $140 (countered: $140) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"s