{"job":{"id":20273802,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"WORKSTATION INSTALLS | 11/16 | TECH 1","description":{"html":"<p class=\"cs95E872D0\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Required On-site time/window: 11/16 8AM</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Equipment:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Make/Model: PALOALTO</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Serial Number: {SRM_FN.SERIAL}</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Problem Description:</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> Please see below request from United Therapeutics for the RC Amenities location. For the scope of work, it will be very similar to Case 671988, such as physically taking the workstation equipment (i.e., monitor, keyboard, mouse, headset, etc.) out of the boxes they were delivered in, and setting them up on the tables, making sure they are plugged in, tested, and working. The scope includes the technicians cleaning up and moving the boxes to the necessary locations following install. Address: 79 TW Alexander Dr Bldg 4301 Durham, NC 27713 Preferred window for work to be completed: Can begin as early as 11/16. Would like to be complete no later than 12/3. How many technicians you are requesting for this visit? 4 installation technicians for 2 days of work, as long as the work is completed. Quantity: 75 desk setups. Are all workstations located in the same building? If so, what floor will the installations be on? Yes. All workstations will be on Floors 2 and 3. Onsite contact&rsquo;s phone number: Brenna Lentz | blentz@unither.com | M: 919.795.8922 Once technicians have been assigned please provide a list of their names and email addresses prior to the dispatch. We will relay this to the customer for access purposes once received. Please advise if we can provide any additional details.</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Scope/Customer Information:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Any changes to ETA&rsquo;s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED.&nbsp;You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer t