orking. The scope includes the technicians cleaning up and moving the boxes to the necessary locations following install. Address: 79 TW Alexander Dr Bldg 4301 Durham, NC 27713 Preferred window for work to be completed: Can begin as early as 11/16. Would like to be complete no later than 12/3. How many technicians you are requesting for this visit? 4 installation technicians for 2 days of work, as long as the work is completed. Quantity: 75 desk setups. Are all workstations located in the same building? If so, what floor will the installations be on? Yes. All workstations will be on Floors 2 and 3. Onsite contact’s phone number: Brenna Lentz | blentz@unither.com | M: 919.795.8922 Once technicians have been assigned please provide a list of their names and email addresses prior to the dispatch. We will relay this to the customer for access purposes once received. Please advise if we can provide any additional details.\n\nImportant Scope/Customer Information:\n\nAny changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone.\n\nIf you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.\n\nIf additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED. You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.\n\nAll times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms.\n\nIf additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.\n\nRequired Tools:\n\nStandard hand tools\n\nUpon Arrival at site:\n\nIntroduce yourself as ePlus technician\n\nUpon Completion/Closeout Requirements:\n\nConfirm functionality with remote support &amp; provide their name upon closure\n\nCall Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out\n\nProvide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-1