{"job":{"id":20274187,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"BBSC Corp","title":"Site Survey - Camera System - RALFOX","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">The purpose of this survey is to determine what equipment is currently on site. Provide pictures of the NVR/DVR systems that show the model numbers of the device OR submit the model number(s) through the Smartsheet form.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Obtain Admin credentials for DVR and any IP cameras. Confirm the credentials are correct and work. If not available, try to reset to factory and provide these credentials.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Confirm location of exiting DVR/NVR is adequate for new SoLink equipment. Confirm existing wires are safe and neat. If any cable management is needed or if a DVR Rack is suggested, please provide a quote for this work.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">Provide model numbers for individual cameras as well.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">Verify the number of cameras that are currently functional by taking a picture of the live monitor that is connected to the existing system. If no live monitor is present, connect a spot monitor to the system for verification.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29);\">Review the site map. Indicate which cameras are not currently online and provide a corresponding quote for replacing these cameras </span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">and/or wiring depending on what is wrong.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Provide site map of all existing cameras. Confirm total quantity</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Provide photos and make/model info on any other CCTV equipment (encoders, POE, etc)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Confirm there is an office camera that covers from behind the desk and coverage of the entrance door. If we need to add and/or relocate a camera(s), please provide a quote to do so</span></p><p><span style=\"color: inherit;\">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(238, 0, 0);\">Confirm there are cameras covering entrance/exit gates and dumpster. If not, please provide quote to add camera(s) covering these areas.</span></p>","markdown":"· The purpose of this survey is to determine what equipment is currently on site. Provide pictures of the NVR/DVR systems that show the model numbers of the device OR submit the model number(s) through the Smartsheet form.\n\n· Obtain Admin credentials for DVR and any IP cameras. Confirm the credentials are correct and work. If not available, try to reset to factory and provide these credentials.\n\n· Confirm location of exiting DVR/NVR is adequate for new SoLink equipment. Confirm existing wires are safe and neat. If any cable management is needed or if a DVR Rack is suggested, please provide a quote for this work.\n\n· Provide model numbers for individual cameras as well.\n\n· Verify the number of cameras that are currently functional by taking a picture of the live monitor that is connected to the existing system. If no live monitor is present, connect a spot monitor to the system for verification.\n\n· Review the site map. Indicate which cameras are not currently online and provide a corresponding quote for replacing these cameras and/or wiring depending on what is wrong.\n\n· Provide site map of all existing cameras. Confirm total quantity\n\n· Provide photos and make/model info on any other CCTV equipment (encoders, POE, etc)\n\n· Confirm there is an office camera that covers from behind the desk and coverage of the entrance door. If we need to add and/or relocate a camera(s), please provide a quote to do so\n\n· Confirm there are cameras covering entrance/exit gates and dumpster. If not, please provide quote to add camera(s) covering these areas.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-30T09:30","end":"2026-11-30T11:30","latestStart":"2026-11-30T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":10.985402247798058},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-30T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-01T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-05T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-12-01T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Datamax police departments"},{"start":"2026-10-30T13:01:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T16:01:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Lower School (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z"