ditional Notes:**\n\nPlease ensure all devices are fully charged and in good working order.\n\nThe technician should be familiar with basic network troubleshooting procedures.\n\n**Required Tools and Materials (**will be reimbursed for cables and connectors if used**):**\n\n- **(1) box of CAT6 Cable**\n- **RJ45's**\n- **Various Cat6 Patch Cables** (3' and/or 6' patch cables)\n- **Standard Hand Tools** (Screwdrivers, Drill, etc.)\n- **Standard Cabling Tools**\n- **Velcro for cable management**\n- **Laptop:** With a functioning LAN port and Teams installed.\n- **Console Cable**\n- **Mobile Hotspot**\n- **Cable Tester**\n- **Ladder** (8'-10' ladder)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T09:00","end":"2026-11-02T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":200},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":130.1523064390981},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"DISTANCE_TOO_FAR","rejectDetails":"Reported one-way distance 130.1523064390981mi exceeds 100mi limit"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-30T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity South Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)