{"job":{"id":20276499,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Retail Fixture/Display Installation and Replacement","description":{"html":"<strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scope of Work</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are seeking a reliable and professional technician to complete a retail display installation at a national retail location. The display will have already been assembled and shipped to the store prior to your arrival.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT </u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>***LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE***</u></strong></p><p>https://form.fillout.com/t/nGxecs1Y2Tus</p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Estimated Time on Site</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Approximately </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">45–90 minutes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, depending on the store layout and display location.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The selected technician will be responsible for transporting the display from the store's receiving area to its designated sales floor location, completing the installation, documenting the completed work, and leaving the work area clean and professional.</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check in with store management upon arrival.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Locate the shipped display in the receiving area.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Inspect the display for any visible damage prior to installation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Transport the display safely to the approved sales floor location.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Remove all protective packaging.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Position and level the display according to store management's direction.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Install any required display components or signage, if applicable.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Remove and properly dispose of all packaging and installation debris.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pair with Management to Print Return FedEx Label and place on returning units.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take required before-and-after photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the required digital completion report before leaving the site.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professionalism &amp; Appearance</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintain a clean, neat, and professional appearance.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Wear a plain collared shirt (no offensive language, graphics, or competitor branding), long pants or clean work shorts, and closed-toe shoes.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Follow all retailer policies and directions provided by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintain a clean and organized work area throughout the installation and remove all installation debris before leaving.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use professional language and conduct yourself in a professional manner</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Technician Requirements</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be professional and customer-focused.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Must be able to lift up to 50lbs and </span>maneuver in tight spaces.</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be comfortable working inside retail environments during business hours.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be able to safely move retail display fixtures using store-provided equipment when available.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have a smartphone capable of submitting photos and electronic documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have basic hand tools, including a utility knife.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What You'll Need</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Smartphone with camera</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Utility knife</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Closed-toe shoes</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ability to safely operate a pallet jack</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tape for FedEx Return Label</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Completion Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To receive payment, technicians must:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete all assigned work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submit all required photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the digital work order on platform **Installation reporting application will be sent upon acceptance**</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Important Information</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Work must be completed during the scheduled service window.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Displays must be installed only in the location approved by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The work area must be left clean and free of all installation materials.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professional appearance and communication are expected at all times.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>*** Installation Guide will be sent upon acceptance showing step-by-step instructions ***</u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT </u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>***LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE***</u></strong></p><p>https://form.fillout.com/t/nGxecs1Y2Tus</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</u></strong></p><br><strong><u>POLICIES AND PROCEDURES</u></strong><p><br></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. Work Order Terms &amp; Conditions</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By accepting and performing this work order, you (\"Producer\") acknowledge and agree to the following:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer acknowledges they are an independent Producer and not an employee of Finish Line Services LLC. The Producer is solely responsible for all applicable taxes, insurance, licenses, permits, and legal obligations associated with their business.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2. Responsibility for Safe Work Practices</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to perform all work in a safe and professional manner and in accordance with all applicable federal, state, local, retailer, and customer safety requirements. Producer shall immediately stop work if unsafe conditions exist and promptly notify Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3. Assumption of Risk</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The producer voluntarily assumes all risks associated with performing the work described in this work order, including travel to and from the work location and any activities necessary to complete the assignment. By accepting this work order, Producer acknowledges that Finish Line Services LLC and its client shall not be liable for any injury, loss, damage, or claim arising from the performance of the work, except as required by applicable law.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4. Equipment</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer is responsible for providing and maintaining all required tools, equipment, personal protective equipment (PPE), and transportation unless specifically stated otherwise within the work order.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. Property Damage</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The Producer is responsible for exercising reasonable care while performing services. Any accidental damage to customer property, merchandise, fixtures, equipment, or facilities falls under Producers \"Assumption Of Risk\" (3) and must be reported to Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">6. Compliance with Customer Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to comply with all customer site rules, store policies, check-in procedures, and instructions provided by authorized customer representatives.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7. Photographs &amp; Documentation</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees to accurately complete all required documentation, photographs, signatures, and reporting before submitting this work order. Submission of false, incomplete, misleading, or altered information may result in non-payment and removal from future assignments.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">8. Payment</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Payment is contingent upon:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Successful completion of the assigned scope of work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submission of all required documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Compliance with these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9. Changes to Scope</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer shall not perform additional work outside the authorized scope of work from posting without prior approval from Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10. Confidentiality</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer agrees not to disclose customer information, pricing, internal procedures, photographs, or proprietary information obtained during the course of the assignment.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">11. Insurance</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Producer represents that they maintain any insurance required by applicable law or by their Producer agreement and accepts responsibility for losses arising from their own acts or omissions to the extent permitted by law.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">12. No Employment Relationship</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Acceptance of this work order does not create an employment relationship, partnership, joint venture, or agency relationship between Producer and Finish Line Services LLC.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">13. Limitation of Liability</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Finish Line Services LLC shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages arising from or related to the performance of this work order. Nothing in these terms limits liability where such limitation is prohibited by law.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">14. Indemnification</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To the extent permitted by applicable law, Producer agrees to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Finish Line Services LLC and its officers, employees, and clients from claims, damages, liabilities, costs, and expenses arising out of Producer's negligent acts, omissions, or breach of these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">15. Acknowledgement</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By accepting this work order, completing this work order, and submitting the completion report, Producer certifies that:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">They have personally completed the work described.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All information submitted is true and accurate.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All required photographs accurately depict the completed work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">They have read and agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions.</span></li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work**We are seeking a reliable and professional technician to complete a retail display installation at a national retail location. The display will have already been assembled and shipped to the store prior to your arrival.\n\n**MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE\\*\\*\\***\n\n<https://form.fillout.com/t/nGxecs1Y2Tus>\n\n**Estimated Time on Site**Approximately **45–90 minutes**, depending on the store layout and display location.\n\nThe selected technician will be responsible for transporting the display from the store's receiving area to its designated sales floor location, completing the installation, documenting the completed work, and leaving the work area clean and professional.\n\n- Check in with store management upon arrival.\n- Locate the shipped display in the receiving area.\n- Inspect the display for any visible damage prior to installation.\n- Transport the display safely to the approved sales floor location.\n- Remove all protective packaging.\n- Position and level the display according to store management's direction.\n- Install any required display components or signage, if applicable.\n- Remove and properly dispose of all packaging and installation debris.\n- Pair with Management to Print Return 