{"job":{"id":20276667,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"buyer name hidden","title":"Retail Fixture/Display Installation and Replacement","description":{"html":"<strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Scope of Work</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">We are seeking a reliable and professional technician to complete a retail display installation at a national retail location. The display will have already been assembled and shipped to the store prior to your arrival.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>MUST SUBMIT DOCUMENTATION THAT INCLUDES PICTURES THROUGH FILLOUT PLATFORM (LINK BELOW) TO RECEIVE PAYMENT </u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>***LINK IS BELOW WITH PASSWORD SENT UPON ACCEPTANCE***</u></strong></p><p>https://form.fillout.com/t/nGxecs1Y2Tus</p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Estimated Time on Site</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Approximately </span><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">45–90 minutes</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">, depending on the store layout and display location.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The selected technician will be responsible for transporting the display from the store's receiving area to its designated sales floor location, completing the installation, documenting the completed work, and leaving the work area clean and professional.</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Check in with store management upon arrival.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Locate the shipped display in the receiving area.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Inspect the display for any visible damage prior to installation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Transport the display safely to the approved sales floor location.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Remove all protective packaging.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Position and level the display according to store management's direction.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Install any required display components or signage, if applicable.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Remove and properly dispose of all packaging and installation debris.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pair with Management to Print Return FedEx Label and place on returning units.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take required before-and-after photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the required digital completion report before leaving the site.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professionalism &amp; Appearance</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintain a clean, neat, and professional appearance.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Wear a plain collared shirt (no offensive language, graphics, or competitor branding), long pants or clean work shorts, and closed-toe shoes.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Follow all retailer policies and directions provided by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Maintain a clean and organized work area throughout the installation and remove all installation debris before leaving.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use professional language and conduct yourself in a professional manner</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Technician Requirements</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be professional and customer-focused.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Must be able to lift up to 50lbs and </span>maneuver in tight spaces.</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be comfortable working inside retail environments during business hours.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Be able to safely move retail display fixtures using store-provided equipment when available.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have a smartphone capable of submitting photos and electronic documentation.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Have basic hand tools, including a utility knife.</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What You'll Need</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Smartphone with camera</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Utility knife</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Closed-toe shoes</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ability to safely operate a pallet jack</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Tape for FedEx Return Label</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Completion Requirements</strong><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To receive payment, technicians must:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete all assigned work.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Submit all required photographs.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete the digital work order on platform **Installation reporting application will be sent upon acceptance**</span></li></ul><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Important Information</strong><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Work must be completed during the scheduled service window.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Displays must be installed only in the location approved by store management.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The work area must be left clean and free of all installation materials.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Professional appearance and communication are expected at all times.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>*** Installation Guide will be sent upon acceptance showing step-by-step instructions ***</u></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>MUST SU