ings</li><li>Player will reboot into a welcome screen</li><li>Power Off Player</li></ul><p><strong>Use SD Card 2 to put new software on device</strong></p><ul><li>Unplug player, and insert SD Card 2</li><li>A Series of screens will that it is booting up</li></ul><p><strong>Connect to WiFi</strong></p><ul><li>Connect the player to the WiFi using the credentials in the confidential information</li><li>Reboot player and verify in the admin screen that status's are green</li></ul><p><strong>Equipment Handling</strong></p><p>Toss the box in the dumpster behind the store if applicable</p><p><strong>Documentation &ndash; After Installation</strong></p><ul><li>Upload/take clear photos of the player itself as well as the fixture and the serial number</li><li>Upload/take a storefront photo</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Communication Directory</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on the work order, contact the <strong>WO Manager</strong>.</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated directly to the <strong>WO Manager</strong>.</li><li>WO Manager is Alan Gabe. If you have questions, you can contact him at 715-641-0369</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65);\">Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Any additional hours or expenses must be <strong>pre-approved</strong> by the WO Manager.</li><li>Any additional hours or costs incurred <strong>without prior approval will be denied</strong>.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Digital Signage and monitor installations.\n- A technician is required to acquire the digital signage player from the store and place it in the location called out in our video, plug it in, connect it to WiFi and wait for content to download.\n- The new digital signage player will be **on-site before the technician arrives.**\n- The estimated on-site duration is Less than 30 minutes.\n\n**Dress Code**\n\nBusiness Casual\n\n**Tools Required**\n\n- \\#2 and #3 Phillips bits\n\n**Pre-Site Requirements**\n\n- Watch 7 Minute Youtube Video explaining in what order to swap SD cards and how to connect to WiFi\n\n**Check-In**\n\n- Check in to the work order and introduce yourself to the on-site contact.\n- You are representing **Infinity Retail Services** while on-site.\n- Ask Manager on Duty for a 4x6 Yellow Bubble Mailer that says \"Hold for Infinity Installer\"\n\n**Locate the Digital Signage Player**\n\n- Locate the 15 Inch Bluefin BrightSign device on the Showroom Floor\n- If there isn't one, ask the manager for the device and place on showroom floor where power is available\n\n**Use SD Card 1 to Wipe current settings**\n\n- Unplug player, and insert SD Card 1\n- A Series of screens will appear that say wiping settings\n- Player will reboot into a welcome screen\n- Power Off Player\n\n**Use SD Card 2 to put new software on device**\n\n- Unplug player, and insert SD Card 2\n- A Series of screens will that it is booting up\n\n**Connect to WiFi**\n\n- Connect the player to the WiFi using the credentials in the confidential information\n- Reboot player and verify in the admin screen that status's are green\n\n**Equipment Handling**\n\nToss the box in the dumpster behind the store if applicable\n\n**Documentation – After Installation**\n\n- Upload/take clear photos of the player itself as well as the fixture and the serial number\n- Upload/take a storefront photo\n\n**Communication Directory**\n\n- If clarification is needed on the work order, contact the **WO Manager**.\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated directly to the **WO Manager**.\n- WO Manager is Alan Gabe. If you have questions, you can contact him at 715-641-0369\n\n**Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Policy**\n\n- Any additional hours or expenses must be **pre-approved** by the WO Manager.\n- Any additional hours or costs incurred **without prior approval will be denied**.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T10:0