{"job":{"id":20281013,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Academy File Server - Copy files to PC/install new server in rack (PC)","description":{"html":"For all technical troubleshooting or field support needs, call the Field Tech Support Team at 508.321.4060 for live assistance and guidance.<br/>For non-technical issues including site access, scheduling, store readiness, or scope clarification outside of technical execution, contact your assigned Project Team directly.<br/>Do not mark yourself as “Arrived” until you have physically entered and checked in at the client site.<br/><br/>Academy Sports - File Server Project<br/><br/>TECHNICIAN MUST HAVE:<br/>- FULLY CHARGED LAPTOP W/CHARGER<br/>- Printed copy of SOW<br/>- Standard tools<br/>- Spare patch cords, RJ45s, etc.<br/><br/>ASSIGNED TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK THEIR DESIGNATED EMAIL DAY BEFORE ASSIGNMENT FOR UPDATES AND INSTRUCTIONS AND MS TEAMS LINK FOR SUPPORT.<br/><br/>PRINT OUT CHECKLIST AND 2 x RETURN PAGE DOCS AND BRING TO SITE.<br/><br/>ON ARRIVAL:<br/>TECHNICIAN MUST CALL AND CHECK IN WITH SPENCER PM: Celeste Busconi / Ph. 508-509-1876 <br/>CHECK IN ON THE TEAMS BRIDGE LINK SUPPLIED ON PRE-EMAIL.<br/>PLEASE NOTE, THIS WILL SERVE AS TECHNICAL SUPPORT AND TESTING DURING INSTALL<br/><br/>Academy(ASO) will have a bridge for Tech Support - Please ALWAYS give the store # to the team on the bridge:<br/><br/>■ Unbox the new PC and connect in the training room area<br/>■ Work with ASO team to have the T drive files transferred to the new PC<br/>■ Go to IDF and install the new rack shelf for the new file server<br/>■ Disconnect the current file server and plug in the new server<br/>■ Work with ASO team so the server can be re-named to the correct name<br/>■ Box up the old server and prepare it for return shipment to ASO Headquarters<br/>■ Work with store to check T Drive access and price checker functionality\"   <br/><br/>COMPLETE DELIVERABLES:<br/>- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK IN WITH SPENCER PM UPON ARRIVAL.<br/>- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK IN WITH ACADEMY SPORTS SUPPORT ON MS TEAMS LINK.<br/>- Follow attached installation Guide to install all PCs<br/>- Work with Academy Sports Technical on MS Teams \"Bridge\" Link<br/>- Verify installation and testing complete<br/>- Complete installation of all PCs<br/>- Pack Up old PCs in the boxes the new PCs were shipped in.<br/><br/>- MUST take pictures - MUST BE LABELLED of:<br/>    - New shelf, file server in rack, picture of old server boxed.<br/>    - Send images and notes to: Academy@spencertech.com<br/>    - Cleanup send over pictures before you call to be released<br/><br/>- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK OUT WITH ACADEMY SPORTS SUPPORT BEFORE LEAVING STORE.<br/><br/>- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK OUT WITH SPENCER PM BEFORE LEAVING STORE.","markdown":"For all technical troubleshooting or field support needs, call the Field Tech Support Team at 508.321.4060 for live assistance and guidance.  \nFor non-technical issues including site access, scheduling, store readiness, or scope clarification outside of technical execution, contact your assigned Project Team directly.  \nDo not mark yourself as “Arrived” until you have physically entered and checked in at the client site.  \n  \nAcademy Sports - File Server Project  \n  \nTECHNICIAN MUST HAVE:  \n\\- FULLY CHARGED LAPTOP W/CHARGER  \n\\- Printed copy of SOW  \n\\- Standard tools  \n\\- Spare patch cords, RJ45s, etc.  \n  \nASSIGNED TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK THEIR DESIGNATED EMAIL DAY BEFORE ASSIGNMENT FOR UPDATES AND INSTRUCTIONS AND MS TEAMS LINK FOR SUPPORT.  \n  \nPRINT OUT CHECKLIST AND 2 x RETURN PAGE DOCS AND BRING TO SITE.  \n  \nON ARRIVAL:  \nTECHNICIAN MUST CALL AND CHECK IN WITH SPENCER PM: Celeste Busconi / Ph. 508-509-1876   \nCHECK IN ON THE TEAMS BRIDGE LINK SUPPLIED ON PRE-EMAIL.  \nPLEASE NOTE, THIS WILL SERVE AS TECHNICAL SUPPORT AND TESTING DURING INSTALL  \n  \nAcademy(ASO) will have a bridge for Tech Support - Please ALWAYS give the store # to the team on the bridge:  \n  \n■ Unbox the new PC and connect in the training room area  \n■ Work with ASO team to have the T drive files transferred to the new PC  \n■ Go to IDF and install the new rack shelf for the new file server  \n■ Disconnect the current file server and plug in the new server  \n■ Work with ASO team so the server can be re-named to the correct name  \n■ Box up the old server and prepare it for return shipment to ASO Headquarters  \n■ Work with store to check T Drive access and price checker functionality\"   \n  \nCOMPLETE DELIVERABLES:  \n\\- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK IN WITH SPENCER PM UPON ARRIVAL.  \n\\- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK IN WITH ACADEMY SPORTS SUPPORT ON MS TEAMS LINK.  \n\\- Follow attached installation Guide to install all PCs  \n\\- Work with Academy Sports Technical on MS Teams \"Bridge\" Link  \n\\- Verify installation and testing complete  \n\\- Complete installation of all PCs  \n\\- Pack Up old PCs in the boxes the new PCs were shipped in.  \n  \n\\- MUST take pictures - MUST BE LABELLED of:  \n\\- New shelf, file server in rack, picture of old server boxed.  \n\\- Send images and notes to: Academy@spencertech.com  \n\\- Cleanup send over pictures before you call to be released  \n  \n\\- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK OUT WITH ACADEMY SPORTS SUPPORT BEFORE LEAVING STORE.  \n  \n\\- TECHNICIAN MUST CHECK OUT WITH SPENCER PM BEFORE LEAVING STORE.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T08:00","end":"2026-11-09T10:30"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2.5,"distance":44.10467580585929},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00