{"job":{"id":20281039,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"ARK | Preventative Maintenance ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>This is a preventative maintenance project for Amazon to do a full cleaning and hardware check on the Amazon Returns Kiosk (ARK)</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>IMPORTANT:</strong>&nbsp;Please be respectful, courteous, and professional to our customer.</p><p><strong>-PM Kit:</strong> <strong><u>Will be shipped to a FedEx Holding Location near site via FedEx. Please see below shipping section. If parts are not available at the time of your WO, please call WO manager to reschedule for any reason.</u></strong></p><p><strong>NOTE: Call WO Manager and do not go to site if part has not delivered by your scheduled time.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>If you are late you automatically forfeit a portion of the pay. Do not check in until you are at the site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><p>Clean microfiber cloth / Electronic Safe Wipes</p><p>Canned Air&nbsp;</p><p>Screwdriver Kit</p><p>Nut Driver Kit</p><p>PM Kit</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><ol><li>Cleaning</li><li>Hardware Checks</li><li>Inspection for damages</li><li>Testing of ARK</li></ol><p><br></p><p>Complete PM Smartsheet: https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019c9b372f5d7888bb6b9813c93e4b16</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Upload all photos of any potential physical damage, hardware issues, and kiosk photos for completion to the Fieldnation Work Order.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); --darkreader-inline-color: var(--darkreader-text-444444, #bdb7af);\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">Check in and check out as well as scope readiness will be completed by the Patriot team.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); --darkreader-inline-color: var(--darkreader-text-444444, #bdb7af);\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">In an event where Kiosk Information Systems Support is required on site for issues or next step validations, please use the below number to reach the support line.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Kiosk Support Line</strong>: (303) 926-3154</p><p><strong>Company</strong>: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.</p><p>346 S Arthur Ave.</p><p>Louisville, CO 80027</p>","markdown":"**This is a preventative maintenance project for Amazon to do a full cleaning and hardware check on the Amazon Returns Kiosk (ARK)**\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Please be respectful, courteous, and professional to our customer.\n\n**-PM Kit:** **Will be shipped to a FedEx Holding Location near site via FedEx. Please see below shipping section. If parts are not available at the time of your WO, please call WO manager to reschedule for any reason.**\n\n**NOTE: Call WO Manager and do not go to site if part has not delivered by your scheduled time.**\n\n**If you are late you automatically forfeit a portion of the pay. Do not check in until you are at the site.**\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\nClean microfiber cloth / Electronic Safe Wipes\n\nCanned Air\n\nScrewdriver Kit\n\nNut Driver Kit\n\nPM Kit\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n1. Cleaning\n2. Hardware Checks\n3. Inspection for damages\n4. Testing of ARK\n\nComplete PM Smartsheet: <https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019c9b372f5d7888bb6b9813c93e4b16>\n\n**Upload all photos of any potential physical damage, hardware issues, and kiosk photos for completion to the Fieldnation Work Order.**\n\n**Check in and check out as well as scope readiness will be completed by the Patriot team.**\n\nIn an event where Kiosk Information Systems Support is required on site for issues or next step validations, please use the below number to reach the support line.\n\n**Kiosk Support Line**: (303) 926-3154\n\n**Company**: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.\n\n346 S Arthur Ave.\n\nLouisville, CO 80027","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-17T10:45","end":"2026-11-17T11:45","latestStart":"2026-11-17T11:45"},"payRange"