{"job":{"id":20281087,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"GTN Technical Staffing","title":"Dispatch Technician - High Point, NC","description":{"html":"<p>***MUST HAVE BACKGROUND CHECK IN THE LAST 24 MONTHS***</p><p>__________________________________________________________</p><p><br></p><p><u>Procedural Requirements (required for payment approval):</u></p><ol><li>Review \"Field Service Site Standards\" prior to visiting site.</li><li>Confirm with your coordinator day of (roughly 1 hour prior to scheduled visit) whether you will be onsite on time or not.</li><li>Confirm with your coordinator when you arrive onsite.</li><li>Must check in and out with the Queue Management Team when arriving onsite and prior to leaving site (contacts listed below).</li><li>SVR document (attached) must be complete and submitted to GTN for every visit</li><li>Check out with your coordinator prior to leaving site (confirm scope complete, if revisit needed, and all documentation is completed and signed, if required.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><u>Scope: </u></p><p><br></p><p><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span><span style=\"color: rgb(18, 51, 76);\">Requesting Tyry'n at High Point. All locations of service listed below. BAU will provide insight for when to go to each site.</span></p><p>Site Locations</p><p>Primary/Main Site:</p><p>English Road</p><p>1717 W English Rd, High Point, NC</p><p>Distance: 0 miles</p><p><br></p><p>Satellite Site 1:</p><p>Brevard Lab</p><p>2137 Brevard Rd, High Point, NC</p><p>Distance from primary site: 4 miles</p><p><br></p><p>Satellite Site 2:</p><p>Elm Warehouse</p><p>1908 S Elm St, High Point, NC</p><p>Distance from primary site: 4 miles</p><p><br></p><p>Satellite Site 3:</p><p>Design CTR</p><p>1823 W English Rd, High Point, NC</p><p>Distance from primary site: 300 ft</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Attached SVR must be completed and submitted to GTN on every visit. Technician will need to bring a laptop with them to site to complete the SVR.&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><u>If setting up equipment for an employee, closing notes must include: Employee Name, Device Serial Number, Device Model.</u></p><p><br></p><p>Additional documentation is attached below to assist with the issues you are dealing with onsite.</p><p><br></p><p>The HelpDesk will be available through Teams or Email. If you have been able to access your profile, please be sure to have WhatsApp installed on your phone.</p><p><br></p><p>GTN is your single point of contact for any issues including but not limited to, access, questions, injury, escalation of issues or any work related issue.</p><p>__________________________________________________________</p><p><br></p><p><u>JOB REQUIREMENT for all techs:</u></p><ul><li>Performs trouble shooting, parts replacement, system upgrades, and basic deployments &amp; repair on Client Assets.</li><li>Follows predefined procedures and tasks in everyday activities.</li><li>Provide technical assistance with computer hardware and software</li><li>Track customer issues and resolutions</li><li>Handle tickets in a timely manner</li><li>Experience with Service Now or large enterprise ticketing systems</li></ul><p><br></p><p><u>PHYSICAL REQUIREMENTS:</u></p><ul><li>In good physical condition</li><li>Ability to lift 50-70 pounds</li><li>Ability to walk 10,000 steps in a workday</li><li>Ability to climb a 14-foot ladder</li><li>Ability to work under desks, work units/cubicles and closets</li></ul><p><br></p><p><u>TOOL REQUIREMENTS:</u></p><ul><li>Comprehensive hand tool kit for use in the repair and placement of Information Technology equipment and cabling</li><li>Smartphone 100% Charged</li><li>WhatsApp on your phone</li></ul>","markdown":"\\*\\*\\*MUST HAVE BACKGROUND CHECK IN THE LAST 24 MONTHS\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nProcedural Requirements (required for payment approval):\n\n1. Review \"Field Service Site Standards\" prior to visiting site.\n2. Confirm with your coordinator day of (roughly 1 hour prior to scheduled visit) whether you will be onsite on time or not.\n3. Confirm with your coordinator when you arrive onsite.\n4. Must check in and out with the Queue Management Team when arriving onsite and prior to leaving site (contacts listed below).\n5. SVR document (attached) must be complete and submitted to GTN for every visit\n6. Check out with your coordinator prior to leaving site (confirm scope complete, if revisit needed, and all documentation is completed and signed, if required.\n\nScope:\n\n﻿Requesting Tyry'n at High Point. All locations of service listed below. BAU will provide insight for when to go to each site.\n\nSite Locations\n\nPrimary/Main Site:\n\nEnglish Road\n\n1717 W English Rd, High Point, NC\n\nDistance: 0 miles\n\nSatellite Site 1:\n\nBrevard Lab\n\n2137 Brevard Rd, High Point, NC\n\nDistance from primary site: 4 miles\n\nSatellite Site 2:\n\nElm Warehouse\n\n1908 S Elm St, High Point, NC\n\nDistance from primary site: 4 miles\n\nSatellite Site 3:\n\nDesign CTR\n\n1823 W English Rd, High Point, NC\n\nDistance from primary site: 300 ft\n\n**Attached SVR must be completed and submitted to GTN on every visit. Technician will need to bring a laptop with them to site to complete the SVR.**\n\nIf setting up equipment for an employee, closing notes must include: Employee Name, Device Serial Number, Device Model.\n\nAdditional documentation is attached below to assist with the issues you are dealing with onsite.\n\nThe HelpDesk will be available through Teams or Email. If you have been able to access your profile, please be sure to have WhatsApp installed on your phone.\n\nGTN is your single point of contact for any issues including but not limited to, access, questions, injury, escalation of issues or any work related issue.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nJOB REQUIREMENT for all techs:\n\n- Performs trouble shooting, parts replacement, system upgrades, and basic deployments &amp; repair on Client Assets.\n- Follows predefined procedures and tasks in everyday activities.\n- Provide technical assistance with computer hardware and software\n- Track customer issues and resolutions\n- Handle tickets in a timely manner\n- Experience with Service Now or large enterprise ticketing systems\n\nPHYSICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n\n- In good physical condition\n- Ability to lift 50-70 pounds\n- Ability to walk 10,000 steps in a workday\n- Ability to climb a 14-foot ladder\n- Ability to work under desks, work units/cubicles and closets\n\nTOOL REQUIREMENTS:\n\n- Comprehensive hand tool kit for use in the repair and placement of Information Technology equipment and cabling\n- Smartphone 100% Charged\n- WhatsApp on your phone","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-12-10T08:00","end":"2026-12-10T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":36,"max":288},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":36,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":71.86501867380696},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":60,"baseAmount":480,"estHours":8,"travelExpense":105,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-12-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-10T14:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-12-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-11T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-12T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-14T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-15T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-12-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11