{"job":{"id":"5143181739","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Budderfly - 171910 - BK-10775 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT","description":"<br>Budderly app must be downloaded from the App Store prior to arriving onsite. <br>Please call Budderfly Support - (475) 270-4895 upon arrival and prior to departure. **Work cannot begin without speaking to Budderfly support. If support doesn’t respond within 1 hour of tech’s arrival, tech is to leave site.*** A survey will need to be completed prior to departure as well; instructions are attached. The equipment is always stored in the enclosure. All Budderfly devices must be verified prior to departure.<br>Site may be experiencing additional issues not previously reported, please be prepared to address if requested by customer. Examples of common issues include but may not be limited to tracing cable for an AP, connecting and/or troubleshooting Budderfly thermostats and confirming if the Facility controller is connected  \"<br>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-30T09:00","end":"2026-10-30T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":235},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":20.5},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 10/30/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-30T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"Survey Epik"},{"start":"2026-10-30T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-10-30T17:15:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-30T20:15:00.000Z","summary":"Dana ortoped"},{"start":"2026-10-31T04:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-01T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Hallowe