{"job":{"id":20281843,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"Whole Foods Visual Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p>Dispatch Notes</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>SOW</p>\n<p>Troubleshoot the reported display in Seafood</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Display is not turning on.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>TM is unable to confirm that the power cable is plugged in - Connection is in the ceiling area.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Attempting to power it on using the power button did not work.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Hardware Information</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Location: Seafood</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>– Firestick Serial Number: G071R20714770DP2</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>–Mounting Type: Ceiling</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Ladder Needed: Y (Store has one).</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Specialty Tools Required: Unknown</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check In Requirements:</p>\n<p>1. Technician must be inside the store before Checking in with Spencer Service</p>\n<p>2. Technician must introduce themselves to the MOD</p>\n<p>3. Tech must check in with the Spencer at 508-635-2037</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>While Onsite:</p>\n<p>1. Tech is required to take Before/After photos -photos of make/model/SN/amps/watts for equipment needing to be replaced and email them to moodservice@spencertech.com and wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com. Tech must put the Spencer Request ID in the subject line. Tech will also need to provide this information to GHD agent as well as Spencer check out agent.</p>\n<p>2. For troubleshooting Mood Media devices use link provided. If extra assistance is needed, please call Spencer and ask for the Mood Media phone number. https://support.moodmedia.com/?utm_source=us_dot&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_campaign=client_portal&amp;utm_content=master_nav&amp;_gl=1%2A1pf7pkz%2A_gcl_au%2AMTkyOTIzNTU3OC4xNzQ2NDcwMDA4LjY1MDgzMzUyMi4xNzQ2NDcwMDA4LjE3NDY0NzAwMDg.%2A_ga%2AMTczOTA1NzY5MC4xNzQ2NDcwMDA4%2A_ga_4GG986SQ61%2AczE3NDc4NTE0MzIkbzE0JGcwJHQxNzQ3ODUxNDMyJGo2MCRsMCRoMCRkUmFPZkpDSFRUYjlRTWczZVdPakdBNnFzQl8xLVBVTUJsUQ</p>\n<p>3. Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW</p>\n<p>4.Tech MUST obtain over duration approval. Spencer will not approve extra time without a phone call.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Special Instructions:</p>\n<p>o All technicians must check in and out at the store’s front desk, with no exceptions.</p>\n<p>o Take before and after photos of the work done onsite. Screen manufacturer label is required.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check Out Requirements: (Upon completion of the job, BEFORE leaving the site)</p>\n<p>• Confirm work completion with the MOD.</p>\n<p>• Call Whole Foods Global Help Desk:</p>\n<p>Call 877-923-4263.</p>\n<p>Wait until you hear \"How can I help you today?\" Anything you say before that isn't heard.</p>\n<p>Say \"Vendor Checkout\" or \"Vendor Close Out\". Don't say just \"check out\" or \"close out\".</p>\n<p>When asked, press your company's number: 4 Mood Media</p>\n<p>Stay on the line for the next Service Desk agent.</p>\n<p>If the voice menu doesn't understand you: say \"Agent\", press 8, press 5, then your company number.</p>\n<p>Write down GHD agent name.</p>\n<p>• Call Spencer Service to check out: 508-635-2037</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>-Tech is responsible for providing thorough closeout notes with next steps which MUST include: photos of models, size, SN (if replacement is needed) and this information needs to be provided to GHD as well as the Spencer check out agent. No exceptions.</p>\n<p>Photos of MFG label are required. If unable to access MFG label, screen measurements are needed.</p>\n<p>Send completed forms and deliverables to: wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com, moodmediaservice@spencertech.com</p>\n<p>Tech is to complete their check out while still on site. Tech MUST NOT leave site until a spencer service agent approves the photos. TV specs are required for all replacements and must be given to Spencer check out agent.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Required Equipment:</p>\n<p>- Basic Hand Tools</p>\n<p>- Smartphone capable of taking and emailing photos</p>\n<p>- Laptop with Wireless Capabilities, Ethernet Port, and 2 Hour Battery Life</p>\n<p>- Cable Tester/Toner</p>\n<p>- Volt Meter</p>\n<p>- Tape Measure</p>\n<p>- Patch cable at least 6 ft in length</p>\n<p>- Consumables (Tie wraps, Velcro, Tape, Pull String, Labels, etc)</p>","markdown":"Dispatch Notes\n\nSOW\n\nTroubleshoot the reported display in Seafood\n\nDisplay is not turning on.\n\nTM is unable to confirm that the power cable is plugged in - Connection is in the ceiling area.\n\nAttempting to power it on using the power button did not work.\n\nHardware Information\n\nLocation: Seafood\n\n– Firestick Serial Number: G071R20714770DP2\n\n–Mounting Type: Ceiling\n\nLadder Needed: Y (Store has one).\n\nSpecialty Tools Required: Unknown\n\nCheck In Requirements:\n\n1\\. Technician must be inside the store before Checking in with Spencer Service\n\n2\\. Technician must introduce themselves to the MOD\n\n3\\. Tech must check in with the Spencer at 508-635-2037\n\nWhile Onsite:\n\n1\\. Tech is required to take Before/After photos -photos of make/model/SN/amps/watts for equipment needing to be replaced and email them to moodservice@spencertech.com and wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com. Tech must put the Spencer Request ID in the subject line. Tech will also need to provide this information to GHD agent as well as Spencer check out agent.\n\n2\\. For troubleshooting Mood Media devices use link provided. If extra assistance is needed, please call Spencer and ask for the Mood Media phone number. https://support.moodmedia.com/?utm_source=us_dot&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_campaign=client_portal&amp;utm_content=master_nav&amp;_gl=1%2A1pf7pkz%2A_gcl_au%2AMTkyOTIzNTU3OC4xNzQ2NDcwMDA4LjY1MDgzMzUyMi4xNzQ2NDcwMDA4LjE3NDY0NzAwMDg.%2A_ga%2AMTczOTA1NzY5MC4xNzQ2NDcwMDA4%2A_ga_4GG986SQ61%2AczE3NDc4NTE0MzIkbzE0JGcwJHQxNzQ3ODUxNDMyJGo2MCRsMCRoMCRkUmFPZkpDSFRUYjlRTWczZVdPakdBNnFzQl8xLVBVTUJsUQ\n\n3\\. Tech must perform all work detailed in SOW\n\n4.Tech MUST obtain over duration approval. Spencer will not approve extra time without a phone call.\n\nSpecial Instructions:\n\no All technicians must check in and out at the store’s front desk, with no exceptions.\n\no Take before and after photos of the work done onsite. Screen manufacturer label is required.\n\nCheck Out Requirements: (Upon completion of the job, BEFORE leaving the site)\n\n• Confirm work completion with the MOD.\n\n• Call Whole Foods Global Help Desk:\n\nCall 877-923-4263.\n\nWait until you hear \"How can I help you today?\" Anything you say before that isn't heard.\n\nSay \"Vendor Checkout\" or \"Vendor Close Out\". Don't say just \"check out\" or \"close out\".\n\nWhen asked, press your company's number: 4 Mood Media\n\nStay on the line for the next Service Desk agent.\n\nIf the voice menu doesn't understand you: say \"Agent\", press 8, press 5, then your company number.\n\nWrite down GHD agent name.\n\n• Call Spencer Service to check out: 508-635-2037\n\n-Tech is responsible for providing thorough closeout notes with next steps which MUST include: photos of models, size, SN (if replacement is needed) and this information needs to be provided to GHD as well as the Spencer check out agent. No exceptions.\n\nPhotos of MFG label are required. If unable to access MFG label, screen measurements are needed.\n\nSend completed forms and deliverables to: wfmspencerdispatch@moodmedia.com, moodmediaservice@spencertech.com\n\nTech is to complete their check out while still on site. Tech MUST NOT leave site until a spencer service agent approves the photos. TV specs are required for all replacements and must be given to Spencer check out agent.\n\nRequired Equipment:\n\n\\- Basic Hand Tools\n\n\\- Smartphone capable of taking and emailing photos\n\n\\- Laptop with Wireless Capabilities, Ethernet Port, and 2 Hour Battery Life\n\n\\- Cable Tester/Toner\n\n\\- Volt Meter\n\n\\- Tape Measure\n\n\\- Patch cable at least 6 ft in length\n\n\\- Consumables (Tie wraps, Velcro, Tape, Pull String, Labels, etc)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00","end":"2026-11-02T16:00","latestStart":"2026-11-02T20:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.289733404790823},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineering (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swa