{"job":{"id":20282505,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity, Inc","title":"Photo Lab System Install - 411945","description":{"html":"<h1>Call Direct: 888-443-4375 Option 0</h1><br><span>With as many open work orders currently on FN, there is a very long back order of requests. So if you call in they will work with you to get assigned.</span><br><br><h1>Job Description: </h1><br><li>Photo lab installation and training.. Install all photo lab equipment, test all equipment is working correctly, and train staff on use of photo equipment and software.</li><br><br><h1>Required Tools: </h1><li>Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability</li><li>Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available</li><li>WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability & working ETHERNET port</li><li>Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads</li><li>TORX T-10 and T-15 </li><li>Adjustable crescent wrench</li><li>Socket set</li>","markdown":"Call Direct: 888-443-4375 Option 0\n==================================\n\n  \nWith as many open work orders currently on FN, there is a very long back order of requests. So if you call in they will work with you to get assigned.  \n  \nJob Description: \n=================\n\n  \n4. Photo lab installation and training.. Install all photo lab equipment, test all equipment is working correctly, and train staff on use of photo equipment and software.\n  \n  \nRequired Tools: \n================\n\n6. Cell phone: With charger and photo taking ability\n7. Camera with USB cord: If phone with photo taking ability is not available\n8. WINDOWS OS Laptop Computer with charger: Must have Wi-Fi capability &amp; working ETHERNET port\n9. Set of screwdrivers that include Phillips and Regular flat heads\n10. TORX T-10 and T-15\n11. Adjustable crescent wrench\n12. Socket set","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T08:00","end":"2026-11-02T15:00","latestStart":"2026-11-0