{"job":{"id":20283796,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"CAVA - Networking / Cabling IMAC","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Job Summary:</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>IW Technologies needs a technician to go on-site and complete a networking/cabling task as described below. Must be ready to repair or re-run cables as needed. Be sure to have all tools and equipment, as well as experience, to complete the work.</li>\n<li><strong>Be sure to call client HD before starting any work. The number is in the CONFIDENTIAL Section of the work order</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><u>WORK DESCRIPTION:</u></strong></p>\n<p>All 4 data ports in 1 faceplate for Make printer and DO screen are damaged and not working. Need to fix it also there's chance that it needs to be patch again. May need to bring additional equipment for repairing a data port.</p>\n<p><strong>Tech Notes:</strong>Techs must contact the CAVA Technical Support Team (<del>**************</del> before beginning their work.</p>\n<p>CAVA Technical Support:<del>**************</del>, Press 2 for technician option</p>\n<p><strong><u>Job Requirements/Tools (Mandatory):</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<p>1. Laptop</p>\n<p>2.&nbsp;Console Cable</p>\n<p>3. Cisco console cables (for logging into Cisco switches/routers and Fortigate appliances)</p>\n<p>4. 110/66 Punch Down Tool</p>\n<p>5. RJ-45 Crimpers</p>\n<p>6. Cordless Drill with Miscellaneous Bits</p>\n<p>7. Cable Toner/Speaker</p>\n<p>8. Basic Cabling Tool Kit</p>\n<p>9. 150 Ft Cat5e ethernet cable and RJ-45 termination connecters</p>\n<p>10.&nbsp;Ladder (10-12 foot)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>11.&nbsp;<strong>P-touch labeler</strong></p>\n<p>12. Digital Camera or Cell phone capable of taking HD pictures</p>\n<p>13. Valid ID matching the name on your Field Nation profile</p>\n<p><em>Materials will be reimbursed at national standard pricing plus Field Nation Fees.</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>DETAILED WORK INSTRUCTIONS</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Pre-visit Instructions:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Confirm ETA in Field Nation within (24) hours of the appointment window&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Onsite Tasks:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check in with IW Dispatch @ 847-285-4198</li>\n<li>Check in with the location contact. Represent yourself as a technician from IW Technologies&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Take pictures of BEFORE the work is complete and upload to Field Nation</li>\n<li>Complete work as described</li>\n<li>Validate connectivity and test functionality</li>\n<li><strong>COMPLETE CABLE MANAGEMENT - Label all cables</strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Update work order notes and custom fields with the requested information. All updates should be made via the Field Nation app, directly into the work order.&nbsp;</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Take pictures of completed work and upload to Field Nation</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Provide serial numbers of the new equipment if applicable</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Manager Sign-off&nbsp;</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Tech is to stay onsite until all testing is complete</u></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Packing and Shipping Tasks:</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<p><u>IF PARTS HAVE BEEN SHIPPED</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Package all of the old equipment into the new boxes</li>\n<li>Apply return label and take to nearest FedEx location to drop off for delivery.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Record the tracking number in the available custom field and take a picture of the label.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Check out via the Field Nation app when complete&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Close-Out Tasks:</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure work order has been completed to specification&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Submit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours, assuming no issues.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Escalation Process:</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Send message to IW Technologies via work order Message. Messages will be monitored constantly and replied to quickly.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Call the IW Technologies team if messaging isn’t sufficient. Phone number available in the Contacts section of the work order.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Required Deliverables to be paid:</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You must set an ETA&nbsp;</li>\n<li>You must Read instructions and have the Field Nation app on your phone to allow for easy completion of tasks.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>You must check in&nbsp;</li>\n<li>You must collect signature from location Contact to confirm onsite work is complete.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Post Visit:</u></strong><u>&nbsp;</u></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You must check out upon completion of drop-off at FedEx.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Job Summary:**\n\n- IW Technologies needs a technician to go on-site and complete a networking/cabling task as described below. Must be ready to repair or re-run cables as needed. Be sure to have all tools and equipment, as well as experience, to complete the work.\n- **Be sure to call client HD before starting any work. The number is in the CONFIDENTIAL Section of the work order**\n\n**WORK DESCRIPTION:**\n\nAll 4 data ports in 1 faceplate for Make printer and DO screen are damaged and not working. Need to fix it also there's chance that it needs to be patch again. May need to bring additional equipment for repairing a data port.\n\n**Tech Notes:**Techs must contact the CAVA Technical Support Team (\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* before beginning their work.\n\nCAVA Technical Support:\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*, Press 2 for technician option\n\n**Job Requirements/Tools (Mandatory):**\n\n1\\. Laptop\n\n2\\. Console Cable\n\n3\\. Cisco console cables (for logging into Cisco switches/routers and Fortigate appliances)\n\n4\\. 110/66 Punch Down Tool\n\n5\\. RJ-45 Crimpers\n\n6\\. Cordless Drill with Miscellaneous Bits\n\n7\\. Cable Toner/Speaker\n\n8\\. Basic Cabling Tool Kit\n\n9\\. 150 Ft Cat5e ethernet cable and RJ-45 termination connecters\n\n10\\. Ladder (10-12 foot)\n\n11\\. **P-touch labeler**\n\n12\\. Digital Camera or Cell phone capable of taking HD pictures\n\n13\\. Valid ID matching the name on your Field Nation profile\n\n*Materials will be reimbursed at national standard pricing plus Field Nation Fees.*\n\n**DETAILED WORK INSTRUCTIONS**\n\n**Pre-visit Instructions:**\n\n- Confirm ETA in Field Nation within (24) hours of the appointment window\n\n**Onsite Tasks:**\n\n- Check in with IW Dispatch @ 847-285-4198\n- Check in with the location contact. Represent yourself as a technician from IW Technologies\n- Take pictures of BEFORE the work is complete and upload to Field Nation\n- Complete work as described\n- Validate connectivity and test functionality\n- **COMPLETE CABLE MANAGEMENT - Label all cables**\n- **Update work order notes and custom fields with the requested information. All updates should be made via the Field Nation app, directly into the work order.**\n- **Take pictures of completed work and upload to Field Nation**\n- **Provide serial numbers of the new equipment if applicable**\n- **Manager Sign-off**\n- **Tech is to stay onsite until all testing is complete**\n\n**Packing and Shipping Tasks:**\n\nIF PARTS HAVE BEEN SHIPPED\n\n- Package all of the old equipment into the new boxes\n- Apply return label and take to nearest FedEx location to drop off for delivery.\n- Record the tracking number in the available custom field and take a picture of the label.\n- Check out via the Field Nation app when complete\n\n**Close-Out Tasks:**\n\n- Ensure work order has been completed to specification\n- Submit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours, assuming no issues.\n\n**Escalation Process:**\n\n- Send message to IW Technologies via work order Message. Messages will be monitored constantly and replied to quickly.\n- Call the IW Technologies team if messaging isn’t sufficient. Phone number available in the Contacts section of the work order.\n\n**Required Deliverables to be paid:**\n\n- You must set an ETA\n- You must Read instructions and have the Field Nation app on your phone to allow for easy completion of tasks.\n- You must check in\n- You must collect signature from location Contact to confirm onsite work is complete.\n\n**Post Visit:**\n\n- You must check out upon completion of drop-off at FedEx.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T08:00","end":"2026-11-03T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":90},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6.980676747269153},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Gym (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 trinity Modular Building (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineering (WM)"