{"job":{"id":"4606949731","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Retail Tech Inc. - Deployment","title":"HARD START - Replace ESL Transceiver - (Lift Operation Required)","description":"<p>If needed, replace data cable and / or ESL Transceiver. Technicians must work with the end user support to restore functionality.</p><p><br></p><p>REQUIRED TOOLS</p><p>- https://www.rtisurl.com/?c=StandardTools</p><p>- Tone generator with probe</p><p>- Laptop with charger and console cable</p><p>- Punch down tool with 66/110 blades</p><p>- RJ45 Crimping tool</p><p>- DIGITAL Cable Tester (Must say \"PASS / FAIL\" on Screen)</p><p>- Console cable</p><p>- Hotspot</p><p><br></p><p>MATERIALS</p><p>- 3FT and 7FT patch cables</p><p>- Various jack for re-terminations</p><p>- RJ45 Modular Plug</p><p><br></p><p>DRESS CODE</p><p>- Polo shirt</p><p>- Jeans or khaki pants (no shorts)</p><p><br></p><p>DISPATCH GUIDELINES</p><p>- Only confirmed technicians are authorized to be onsite for an activity/dispatch.</p><p>- Any scheduling or tech assignment requests/changes must receive prior approval.</p><p>- All technicians must be over 18 years old</p><p>- Technicians who are not on the platform must send a photo of their legal identification to RTI prior to arrival on site.</p><p>- Furthermore, additional technicians and/or supervisors are not authorized to accompany assigned tech(s) onsite at any time without prior approval.</p><p><br></p><p>**MUST SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION SECTION / SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS FOR WORK INSTRUCTIONS**</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T08:00","end":"2026-11-03T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026