{"job":{"id":20279435,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"NewBold Technologies","title":"NBT: 858020 - Preventive Maintenance & Cleaning for (12 Zebra - ZT411) printer(s)","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: black;\">&gt;&gt; CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION below has been&nbsp;updated recently. Please read and understand once work order is assigned to you.&lt;&lt;</strong></p><p><strong>W/O#&nbsp;</strong>858020&nbsp;</p><p>Serial Numbers:</p><p>99J213102869</p><p>99J213102872</p><p>99J213104791</p><p>99J213104792</p><p>99J213104796</p><p>99J213104798</p><p>99J213104799</p><p>99J213104800</p><p>99J213104801</p><p>99J213104803</p><p>99J213104805</p><p>99J213104808</p><p><strong>Problem Description: </strong>Contract - PM and Cleaning of 12 Zebra - ZT411 Printers</p><p><strong>SLA: 11/3</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Authorization must be received from NewBold Dispatch (864-635-0351) <u>BEFORE</u> installing any parts. If you are onsite over 1.5 hours, you must call NewBold tech support at 864-635-0352.&nbsp;</p><p>Tech will need to return any unused/used parts to NewBold -- and the RMA processed by the Warehouse -- before payment can be approved.</p><p><strong>Penalties will be applied as follows:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Not calling the POC before going onsite (but allowed to work on printer[s]) = $10.00</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Not calling Dispatch to check in and check out of a site = $10.00</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Not calling the POC before going onsite and gets turned away = No Pay for that trip</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Missing test prints/config printout/PH test/etc = $10.00</span></li><li>Going o<span style=\"color: black;\">ver 24 hours (working days) without submitting completed paperwork = $10.00</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Forgetting laptop, firmware, or any other tools = No pay on return trip</span></li><li><span style=\"color: black;\">Forgetting to take photos of damaged parts =&nbsp;$10.00</span></li></ul>","markdown":"**&gt;&gt; CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION below has been updated recently. Please read and understand once work order is assigned to you.&lt;&lt;**\n\n**W/O#** 858020\n\nSerial Numbers:\n\n99J213102869\n\n99J213102872\n\n99J213104791\n\n99J213104792\n\n99J213104796\n\n99J213104798\n\n99J213104799\n\n99J213104800\n\n99J213104801\n\n99J213104803\n\n99J213104805\n\n99J213104808\n\n**Problem Description:** Contract - PM and Cleaning of 12 Zebra - ZT411 Printers\n\n**SLA: 11/3**\n\nAuthorization must be received from NewBold Dispatch (864-635-0351) BEFORE installing any parts. If you are onsite over 1.5 hours, you must call NewBold tech support at 864-635-0352.\n\nTech will need to return any unused/used parts to NewBold -- and the RMA processed by the Warehouse -- before payment can be approved.\n\n**Penalties will be applied as follows:**\n\n- Not calling the POC before going onsite (but allowed to work on printer\\[s\\]) = $10.00\n- Not calling Dispatch to check in and check out of a site = $10.00\n- Not calling the POC before going onsite and gets turned away = No Pay for that trip\n- Missing test prints/config printout/PH test/etc = $10.00\n- Going over 24 hours (working days) without submitting completed paperwork = $10.00\n- Forgetting laptop, firmware, or any other tools = No pay on return trip\n- Forgetting to take photos of damaged parts = $10.00","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T09:00","end":"2026-11-02T12:00","latestStart":"2026-11-02T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":625,"max":625},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":14.59973775558155},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/2/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1793628639188}
{"job":{"id":"3175131495","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Trinity Gym","description":"Survey Epik Wizard:<br><br>Contact Project Manager Scott Houston for instructions and support if you have any Questions 7143503455<br><br>Survey SOW: SOS must match dates and times that are in WorkMarket and MUST BE SIGNED BY THE CUSTOMER (LCON)<br>1.\tTECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL.<br>2.\tCheck in and out through Work Market. For any questions during the survey, please call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at: 833-479-4768<br>3.\tUpon arrival, departure, and for questions about your scope of work or if you are unclear on instructions before starting the Survey, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479-4768, otherwise Login to EPIK Wizard at https://wizard.epik.io to begin the Survey process. When you enter the Granite ticket number it will be recognized as a survey, and you will be taken to the Survey Wizard.  (Note: If you have completed a Wizard survey or install before, please be sure to refresh your browser window to ensure the current version is being used.)<br>4.\tFollow all instructions presented by the Survey Wizard.  If you run into any issues or have questions you may call the TC Team.  All sections of the survey are required and will require final sign off by Granite Technical Coordinator before you will be cleared to leave the site.  The Survey Wizard will guide you through this process.<br>5.\tBefore departure call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479- 4768 to review deliverables and receive approval on survey results.<br>6.\tOnce your survey results have been approved by the TC Team, a TC Team representative will give you a checkout code to enter into WorkMarket which you will use to check out upon completion of the survey. Failure to checkout will result in delay or nonpayment for services. <br><br>Materials/Tools Required: Laptop with ability to create hotspot, Smart Phone, Tone Generator and Wand, Punch Tool (66 &amp; 110) Electrician Scissors, Step Ladder, Flashlight and/or Headlamp, RJ11&amp;RJ45 Crimper, Ethernet Cable Tester, Masonry Bits, Impact Drill, Pencil and/or Marker, Level, Philips Driver Bits and Screwdriver Cordless Drill, Needle-Nose Pliers, Label-Maker, All-Purpose Screws (drywall, masonry, wood), Cable-Ties and Mountings, Cat3 or Better Cable (for analog devices), Cat6 Ethernet Cable (for data connections), CrossConnect Wire, Gel-Crimp Connecters, Label-Tape, RJ11 &amp; Cat6 Ethernet Keystone Jacks, RJ11 &amp; RJ45 Modular Plugs, Lineman’s Telephony Handset/Butt-Set<br>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T10:00","end":"2026-11-02T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":235},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":18.9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Mon, Nov 2, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Mon, Nov 2, Tue, Nov 3, Wed, Nov 4, Thu, Nov 5, Fri, Nov 6 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T01:00:00.000Z","summary":"Happy Birthday"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Ac