{"job":{"id":20273710,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AA Laser Printer Repair","title":"Rocky Mount, NC - troubleshoot error code, disable TPM if it is on - Ticket#1237095","description":{"html":"<p>Rocky Mount, NC - troubleshoot error code, disable TPM if it is on - Ticket#1237095</p><p><br></p><p>Model Number:HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M635</p><p>Serial Number:MXBCQ8207G</p><p>Asset Number:MPS145429</p><p>Device Location:Office LP16</p><p>Problem/Condition:Hard dive was replaced 10/7/26. Formatter replaced 10/27/26. This is a new error code from the previous 2 services. 81.09.00</p><p>Call Received:10/28/2026 07:44</p><p>Technician Notes:Tech togo onsite to troubleshoot. Disable TPM if it is on.</p><p>Notes/Parts Ordered:</p><p><strong>***ALL PARTS ARE TO BE INSTALLED UNLESS AUTHORIZED BY TECH SUPPORT***&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>***NO EQUIPMENT IS TO BE REMOVED FROM CUSTOMER SITE WITHOUT AUTHORIZATION FROM TECH SUPPORT***&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><p><u>Provider Qualification Requirements:</u></p><ul><li>Experience with printer service and repair</li><li>Track record of reliability and being on time</li><li>Do not request this work order unless you can commit to the exact scheduled start in this work order</li></ul><p><u>Service Manuals for Reference:</u></p><p><br></p><p>https://www.laserexpressinc.com/printer_manuals/</p><p><br></p><p>https://www.laserpros.com/technical-resources</p><p><br></p><p>http://www.feedroller.com/store/lexmark.php</p><p><br></p><p>http://allsmart.ru/resources/SM/Kyocera/FS-1030MFP-1035MFP-1130MFP-1135MFP-SM.pdf</p><p><br></p><p>Dell printers:&nbsp;</p><p>http://www.refurbisheddellprinters.com/content/manuals/service/Dell%202355dn%20Service%20Manual.pdf</p><p>https://www.printertec.com.br/arquivos_download/samsung/scx5835.pdf</p><p><u>Important Information:</u></p><ul><li>While onsite you are to be representing Supplies Network</li><li>D﻿ress Code: business casual</li><li>If work order requires performing replacement, you MUST confirm that parts have been received before going to site. There will be no compensation for trips if parts are not onsite.</li><li>Techs are REQUIRED to call in onsite/offsite or risk not being paid. </li></ul><p><br></p><p><u>Onsite Scope of Work Details:</u></p><ul><li>Call Work Order Manager to check-in upon arriving to site</li><li>Introduce yourself to end-user contact listed on this work order, introduce yourself as a representative of Supplies Network there to fix printer issues</li><li>Location printer that is experiencing issues and IMPORTANT - firstly confirm that the model number, serial number and asset tag (if applicable) match with work order. If serial number does not match, immediately call Work Order Manager to alert them of this</li><li>Complete service repair as detailed in description above</li><li>Print Configuration Page and upload to this work order</li><li>Please keep work area managed and provide as little intrusion as possible to EU business. All packaging and non-core parts must be discarded or removed from site.</li><li>Call Work Order Manager to check-out prior to leaving site</li><li>**Call tech support if any remote technical assistance is needed: ****﻿877-786-2870 Option 1****</li><li>If recommended parts do not correct issue, it is required that tech provide additional troubleshooting and call tech support to determine cause of problem.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>FOR RETURN SHIPMENTS:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>If parts being installed have core, there should be a return label included</li><li>All parts and material must returned using the shipping label provided</li><li>If shipping label is not onsite, please contact work order manager to obtain shipping label</li><li>IMPORTANT - you will be messaged in this work order with tracking and return instructions for shipping back part</li><li>Enter tracking number for return shipment on this work order</li></ul><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><u>Deliverables Required for Approval:</u></p><p>You must complete assignment and upload all necessary documentation&nbsp;within&nbsp;7 days&nbsp;of completion.&nbsp;Failure to do so will result in&nbsp;forfeiture of payment.</p><p><br></p><ol><li>Printer Configuration Page - photo of this page uploaded to the work order</li><li>Photo of work area upon completion - must show that area is cleaned up with no packaging left behind</li><li>Sign off from onsite point of contact&nbsp;</li><li>(if parts are being returned) Enter tracking number of return shipment - work order will not be approved until we verify that return shipment is in transit</li></ol>","markdown":"Rocky Mount, NC - troubleshoot error code, disable TPM if it is on - Ticket#1237095\n\nModel Number:HP LaserJet Enterprise MFP M635\n\nSerial Number:MXBCQ8207G\n\nAsset Number:MPS145429\n\nDevice Location:Office LP16\n\nProblem/Condition:Hard dive was replaced 10/7/26. Formatter replaced 10/27/26. This is a new error code from the previous 2 services. 81.09.00\n\nCall Received:10/28/2026 07:44\n\nTechnician Notes:Tech togo onsite to troubleshoot. Disable TPM if it is on.\n\nNotes/Parts Ordered:\n\n**\\*\\*\\*ALL PARTS ARE TO BE INSTALLED UNLESS AUTHORIZED BY TECH SUPPORT\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*NO EQUIPMENT IS TO BE REMOVED FROM CUSTOMER SITE WITHOUT AUTHORIZATION FROM TECH SUPPORT\\*\\*\\***\n\nProvider Qualification Requirements:\n\n- Experience with printer service and repair\n- Track record of reliability and being on time\n- Do not request this work order unless you can commit to the exact scheduled start in this work order\n\nService Manuals for Reference:\n\nhttps://www.laserexpressinc.com/printer_manuals/\n\n<https://www.laserpros.com/technical-resources>\n\n<http://www.feedroller.com/store/lexmark.php>\n\n<http://allsmart.ru/resources/SM/Kyocera/FS-1030MFP-1035MFP-1130MFP-1135MFP-SM.pdf>\n\nDell printers:\n\n<http://www.refurbisheddellprinters.com/content/manuals/service/Dell%202355dn%20Service%20Manual.pdf>\n\nhttps://www.printertec.com.br/arquivos_download/samsung/scx5835.pdf\n\nImportant Information:\n\n- While onsite you are to be representing Supplies Network\n- D﻿ress Code: business casual\n- If work order requires performing replacement, you MUST confirm that parts have been received before going to site. There will be no compensation for trips if parts are not onsite.\n- Techs are REQUIRED to call in onsite/offsite or risk not being paid.\n\nOnsite Scope of Work Details:\n\n- Call Work Order Manager to check-in upon arriving to site\n- Introduce yourself to end-user contact listed on this work order, introduce yourself as a representative of Supplies Network there to fix printer issues\n- Location printer that is experiencing issues and IMPORTANT - firstly confirm that the model number, serial number and asset tag (if applicable) match with work order. If serial number does not match, immediately call Work Order Manager to alert them of this\n- Complete service repair as detailed in description above\n- Print Configuration Page and upload to this work order\n- Please keep work area managed and provide as little intrusion as possible to EU business. All packaging and non-core parts must be discarded or removed from site.\n- Call Work Order Manager to check-out prior to leaving site\n- \\*\\*Call tech support if any remote technical assistance is needed: \\*\\*\\*\\*﻿877-786-2870 Option 1\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- If recommended parts do not correct issue, it is required that tech provide additional troubleshooting and call tech support to determine cause of problem.\n\nFOR RETURN SHIPMENTS:\n\n- If parts being installed have core, there should be a return label included\n- All parts and material must returned using the shipping label provided\n- If shipping label is not onsite, please contact work order manager to obtain shipping label\n- IMPORTANT - you will be messaged in this work order with tracking and return instructions for shipping back part\n- Enter tracking number for return shipment on this work order\n\nDeliverables Required for Approval:\n\nYou must complete assignment and upload all necessary documentation within 7 days of completion. Failure to do so will result in forfeiture of payment.\n\n1. Printer Configuration Page - photo of this page uploaded to the work order\n2. Photo of work area upon completion - must show that area is cleaned up with no packaging left behind\n3. Sign off from onsite point of contact\n4. (if parts are being returned) Enter tracking number of return shipment - work order will not be approved until we verify that return shipment is in transit","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-02T09:00","end":"2026-11-02T10:00","latestStart":"2026-11-02T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":50.44959579611385},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/2/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Epik Survey"},{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T01:00:00.000Z","summary":"Happy Birthday"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-