{"job":{"id":20286072,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Loopdrive LLC","title":"Smart Home Service W-1430945","description":{"html":"SMART HOME SERVICE\n<p><strong>You represent Diamond Property Services.</strong> Identify yourself to the resident and Smart Home Support as our contractor—not Field Nation or your own company.</p>\n<p><strong>Site Manager:</strong> (901) 675-6129<br><strong>Smart Home Support:</strong> 330-970-2020 (9 AM–5 PM ET)</p>\n\nYOUR ASSIGNED WORK\n<ul>\n<li>Pair existing 1 doorbell.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Smart Home Support handles pairing.</strong> Follow their reset/preparation instructions; do not pair devices on your own.</p>\n\nIF SOMETHING GOES WRONG\n<p><strong>Call the Site Manager immediately</strong> for late arrival, cancellation, no access, missing parts, wiring questions, damage, or anything preventing completion.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>No answer?</strong> Text immediately with the property address, issue, and ETA if late.</li>\n<li><strong>Access or site problem?</strong> Call/text while still on-site, BEFORE leaving.</li>\n<li><strong>Schedule changes?</strong> Site Manager approval required.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Field Nation messages and Smart Home Support calls do NOT replace contacting the Site Manager.</p>\n\nPAIRING &amp; CHECKOUT\n<p>Call Smart Home Support with the property address. They must confirm pairing, online status, and checkout.</p>\n<p>If support is unreachable, call/text the Site Manager immediately. Report unresolved issues before leaving.</p>\n<p><strong>Support is only available until 5 PM ET, Monday–Friday. Late arrival that prevents checkout before support closes may require a return visit.</strong></p>\n\nREQUIRED CLOSEOUT\n<p><strong>Photos / Evidence:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Timestamped arrival/departure photos showing the property/address.</li>\n<li>Before and after photos of EVERY device serviced.</li>\n<li>Support call-log screenshot.</li>\n<li>Photo of the resident’s app showing paired status.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Report each device on its own line:</strong><br>Device/location / Work performed<br>Example: Hall thermostat / Replaced and paired</p>\n\nPAYMENT &amp; REQUIREMENTS\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Additional devices:</strong> Document and photograph any out-of-scope work. Contact the Site Manager by call/text to discuss any requested change to billing. If we don’t agree to it over the phone or in FN, it will not be approved.</li>\n<li><strong>No access / site not ready / power outage / missing parts:</strong> $45 fee ONLY with a property photo from this visit AND proof of Site Manager contact before leaving. The total price must be discounted on your end to reach the $45 final price.</li>\n<li><strong>Conduct:</strong> Only the assigned technician may attend. Remain professional with residents and support staff. If you are rude to the resident or the support staff, you will be asked to leave and the order will be closed without payment.</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"SMART HOME SERVICE\n\n**You represent Diamond Property Services.** Identify yourself to the resident and Smart Home Support as our contractor—not Field Nation or your own company.\n\n**Site Manager:** (901) 675-6129  \n**Smart Home Support:** 330-970-2020 (9 AM–5 PM ET)\n\nYOUR ASSIGNED WORK - Pair existing 1 doorbell.\n\n**Smart Home Support handles pairing.** Follow their reset/preparation instructions; do not pair devices on your own.\n\nIF SOMETHING GOES WRONG **Call the Site Manager immediately** for late arrival, cancellation, no access, missing parts, wiring questions, damage, or anything preventing completion.\n\n- **No answer?** Text immediately with the property address, issue, and ETA if late.\n- **Access or site problem?** Call/text while still on-site, BEFORE leaving.\n- **Schedule changes?** Site Manager approval required.\n\nField Nation messages and Smart Home Support calls do NOT replace contacting the Site Manager.\n\nPAIRING &amp; CHECKOUT Call Smart Home Support with the property address. They must confirm pairing, online status, and checkout.\n\nIf support is unreachable, call/text the Site Manager immediately. Report unresolved issues before leaving.\n\n**Support is only available until 5 PM ET, Monday–Friday. Late arrival that prevents checkout before support closes may require a return visit.**\n\nREQUIRED CLOSEOUT **Photos / Evidence:**\n\n- Timestamped arrival/departure photos showing the property/address.\n- Before and after photos of EVERY device serviced.\n- Support call-log screenshot.\n- Photo of the resident’s app showing paired status.\n\n**Report each device on its own line:**  \nDevice/location / Work performed  \nExample: Hall thermostat / Replaced and paired\n\nPAYMENT &amp; REQUIREMENTS - **Additional devices:** Document and photograph any out-of-scope work. Contact the Site Manager by call/text to discuss any requested change to billing. If we don’t agree to it over the phone or in FN, it will not be approved.\n- **No access / site not ready / power outage / missing parts:** $45 fee ONLY with a property photo from this visit AND proof of Site Manager contact before leaving. The total price must be discounted on your end to reach the $45 final price.\n- **Conduct:** Only the assigned technician may attend. Remain professional with residents and support staff. If you are rude to the resident or the support staff, you will be asked to leave and the order will be closed without payment.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T11:00","end":"2026-11-05T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":90},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":22.450449653972377},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $90 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-