{"job":{"id":20270789,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Lander Construction, LLC","title":"Unifi Camera and Access Point Installation in Raleigh/Durham","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope:</strong></p>\n<p>Install 45 Unifi cameras and 12 Unifi access points. Cabling is already in place at every location. Technician will mount each device and rough-aim each camera as closely as possible according to the camera plans. Final aim of all cameras will be completed with the assistance of the onsite manager.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Specifications and Equipment:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ceilings are 10 ft.</li>\n<li>Required equipment: 6 ft and 8 ft ladders.</li>\n<li>All cameras and access points must be installed with the supplied Unifi hardware to exact specifications.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Connect and mount all cameras and access points.</li>\n<li>Rough-aim each camera per the camera plans, then complete the final aim with the onsite manager.</li>\n<li>Identify and report any missing camera or access point lines. Mark them on the plans and place blue tape on the corresponding ceiling tile.</li>\n<li>Clean up as you go (this is a large facility, it is required to clean up trash in each room before moving on to the next room/area).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provider must carry liability insurance. A certificate of insurance is required before work begins.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Site access is between 9:00 AM and 7:00 PM, Monday through Thursday, November 9–12, 2026. Meet with onsite manager upon arrival.</strong></p>","markdown":"**Scope:**\n\nInstall 45 Unifi cameras and 12 Unifi access points. Cabling is already in place at every location. Technician will mount each device and rough-aim each camera as closely as possible according to the camera plans. Final aim of all cameras will be completed with the assistance of the onsite manager.\n\n**Specifications and Equipment:**\n\n- Ceilings are 10 ft.\n- Required equipment: 6 ft and 8 ft ladders.\n- All cameras and access points must be installed with the supplied Unifi hardware to exact specifications.\n\n**Responsibilities:**\n\n- Connect and mount all cameras and access points.\n- Rough-aim each camera per the camera plans, then complete the final aim with the onsite manager.\n- Identify and report any missing camera or access point lines. Mark them on the plans and place blue tape on the corresponding ceiling tile.\n- Clean up as you go (this is a large facility, it is required to clean up trash in each room before moving on to the next room/area).\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n- Provider must carry liability insurance. A certificate of insurance is required before work begins.\n\n**Site access is between 9:00 AM and 7:00 PM, Monday through Thursday, November 9–12, 2026. Meet with onsite manager upon arrival.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T11:00","end":"2026-11-09T38:00"},"payRange":{"min":2300,"max":2300},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":27,"distance":6.116099531464301},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Mon, Nov 9, 11:00 AM\nChecked: Mon, Nov 9, Tue, Nov 10, Wed, Nov 11, Thu, Nov 12, Fri, Nov 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-