pan style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Survey/Install Rack and Stack/Testing Only - First Dispatch</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">EQUIPMENT RACK AND STACK + SURVEY</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">TECH TO BE PROVIDED BOXED METTEL EQUIPMENT</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">RACK AND STACK AT THE DMARC</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">ANTENNAS TO BE MOUNTED AND INSTALLED</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">TEST OVER LTE AND VERIFY DIAL TONE ON THE METTEL EQUIPMENT</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">WAN CONNECTION MAY BE REQUIRED</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">TECH TO SURVEY AND IDENTIFY THE FOLLOWING LINES</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">PIAB CONFIGURATION DETAILS: Specialty Line(s):</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">FXS1 - 2524460265</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">FXS2 - 2524464257</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">TECH WILL NEED: BUTT-SET, BRIDGE CLIPS, TONER, MULTI-METER AND LABEL MAKER</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">ADDITIONAL DISPATCH WILL BE REQUIRED FOR PORT/CUTOVER. SAME TECH WILL BE REQUIRED</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">PLEASE ASSIGN A TECH FAMILIAR WITH PIAB AND POTS CROSS CONNECTS</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">LOCAL CONTACT: Thierno Dieng</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">PHONE: 4048225539</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);\">Fully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port ,Multimeter wire tester ,Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches ,Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer) ,Biscuit jacks ,Crimpers &amp; Wirecutters ,4-6 ft’ ladder ,Butt Set ,RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors ,100’ extension cord ,Digital Camera ,100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device ,Cell phone w/Hotspot device ,Punch down tool</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Attach pics in Field Nation and send to contact if requested.</strong></p><p>*Copy of work order ---&gt;Must get signature from customer - If customer is NOT on site or able to sign, must clearly write that on work order</p><p>*Photos of work performed in field:</p><p>*If equipment installed - take photo of that with close ups and full room picture.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>*Any photos asked of by remote support</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Additional Technician Equipment/Materials:</u></strong></p><p>Cat 5E cable and cable ends (75ft-100ft)</p><p>cable crimper</p><p>Corded/cordless Drill</p><p>Misc mounting hardware</p><p>4-6ft ladder</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>ATTENTION:</u></strong></p><p><em>Please check in and out onsite using GPS on the Field Nation app. This is how time onsite is confirmed and it non-negotiable.&nbsp;Failure to do so will result in a penalty.</em></p><p><em>Please also complete your work order for payment same day by midnight. Delays may result in a denial of add-on costs (i.e materials, extra travel, extra time, etc.) and/or a penalty.</em></p><p><em>Please PRINT ANS SIGNOFF SHEET and have the onsite contact sign.</em></p><p><em>Please be prepared with technician equipment listed.</em></p>","markdown":"**Firm start time, please do not be late. Job should take roughly 2-3hrs**\n\n**-------PLEASE READ SCOPE OF WORK BEFORE REQUESTING OR ACCEPTING---**\n\n**Firm start time, please do not be late.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Upon arrival - tech to call remote support** **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**If you have trouble reaching assigned remote support, please call 844-905-9779 for assistance**\n\nProvide ANS # or TKT #...Do not mention **FIELD NATION** or provide Field Nation ID.\n\n**Do not Mention Field Nation!**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Tech must have valid Identification**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Tech must have Laptop with Ethernet adapter-Should have Team viewer loaded**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Tech must have Butt Sett with Toner and wand FOR ANY POTS RELATED SERVICES**\n\n **\\*\\*\\*Tech SHOULD have at least 100 Cat5e Cable in case a cable run is needed - all Materials used must be documented and will be reimbursed at industry rate or at cost with receipt.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*IMPORTANT - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED BUT YOU ARE UNABLE TO COMPLETE DUE TO DIFFICULTY OR TOTAL TIME IT WOULD TAKE, PLEASE PERFORM SURVEY, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*IMPORTANT - UPON COMPLETION - MUST SEND PHOTO OF SIGNED WORK ORDER TO REMOTE SUPPORT AS WELL AS UPLOAD TO FIELD NATION\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**The business you are visiting is** **\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*****\\*** **You have been hired by Applied Network Services who has been contracted for this job by** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**If you have ANY questions on this work order, need to make changes, extend time, etc DO NOT ASK THE ONSITE CUSTOMER and DO NOT ASK** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* **Please send us a note ON THE PLATFORM or TEXT Charles 914-355-9520 IF RESPONSE TIME IS SLOW**\n\n**On Site Instructions:**\n\n**Upon entry, introduce yourself to the on-site manager as** Applied Network Services for \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*and he/she will escort you to the work area.Please call upon arrival and work with contact on all connections. Local contact is **\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\nSEE INSTALLATION VIDEO FOR GUIDANCE\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zrqC_uOY1t8 -\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*PLEASE NOTE - IF A CABLE RUN IS REQUIRED FOR ANY WORK ON SITE, DO NOT SHARE PRICING WITH CUSTOMER. SURVEY THE WORK, PROVIDE QUOTE ON THE PLATE FORM AS TIME AND MATERIALS.**\n\nPlease call Bryant Espindola 212-359-5129 when you arrive on site. If not reachable, please call remote support toll free # 844-905-9779 for assistance. Provide bruin ticket site number 11565136 to MetTel Rep.\n\nMetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit <https://dispatch.bruin.com/> to manually lookup and start the dispatch.\n\nSurvey/Install Rack and Stack/Testing Only - First Dispatch\n\nEQUIPMENT RACK AND STACK + SURVEY\n\nTECH TO BE PROVIDED BOXED METTEL EQUIPMENT\n\nRACK AND STACK AT THE DMARC\n\nANTENNAS TO BE MOUNTED AND INSTALLED\n\nTEST OVER LTE AND VERIFY DIAL TONE ON THE METTEL EQUIPMENT\n\nWAN CONNECTION MAY BE REQUIRED\n\nTECH TO SURVEY AND IDENTIFY THE FOLLOWING LINES\n\nPIAB CONFIGURATION DETAILS: Specialty Line(s):\n\nFXS1 - 2524460265\n\nFXS2 - 2524464257\n\nTECH WILL NEED: BUTT-SET, BRIDGE CLIPS, TONER, MULTI-METER AND LABEL MAKER\n\nADDITIONAL DISPATCH WILL BE REQUIRED FOR PORT/CUTOVER. SAME TECH WILL BE REQUIRED\n\nPLEASE ASSIGN A TECH FAMILIAR WITH PIAB AND POTS CROSS CONNECTS\n\nLOCAL CONTACT: Thierno Dieng\n\nPHONE: 4048225539\n\nFully Charged Laptop with Ethernet port ,Multimeter wire tester ,Adjustable wrench and/or open end wrenches ,Standard mounting hardware and tools (screws, anchors, screw drivers, drill, level, hammer) ,Biscuit jacks ,Crimpers &amp; Wirecutters ,4-6 ft’ ladder ,Butt Set ,RJ11 and RJ45 cable connectors ,100’ extension cord ,Digital Camera ,100 of Cat 5e/6 cable for possible relocation of device ,Cell phone w/Hotspot device ,Punch down tool\n\n**Attach pics in Field Nation and send to contact if requested.**\n\n\\*Copy of work order ---&gt;Must get signature from customer - If customer is NOT on site or able to sign, must clearly write that on work order\n\n\\*Photos of work performed in field:\n\n\\*If equipment installed - take photo of that with close ups and full room picture.\n\n\\*Any photos asked of by remote support\n\n**Additional Technician Equipment/Materials:**\n\nCat 5E cable and cable ends (75ft-100ft)\n\ncable crimper\n\nCorded/cordless Drill\n\nMisc mounting hardware\n\n4-6ft ladder\n\n**ATTENTION:**\n\n*Please check in and out onsite using GPS on the Field Nation app. This is how time onsite is confirmed and it non-negotiable. Failure to do so will result in a penalty.*\n\n*Please also complete your work order for payment same day by midnight. Delays may result in a denial of add-on costs (i.e materials, extra travel, extra time, etc.) and/or a penalty.*\n\n*Please PRINT ANS SIGNOFF SHEET and have the onsite contact sign.*\n\n*Please be prepared with technician equipment listed.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T09:00","end":"2026-11-05T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":110},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":52.94550219208338},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $110 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-02T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Trinity Arts Engineerin