{"job":{"id":20287752,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Teceze","title":"IT Asset Inventory Technician – Laptop & Network Equipment","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>We are looking for one onsite IT technician to perform an inventory capture of laptops and network equipment at the client location.</p><p><strong>Responsibilities:</strong></p><ol><li>Perform a physical inventory of laptops and network equipment at the designated site.</li><li>Scan the barcode labels on each asset using the barcode scanner provided by HCL.</li><li>Record and verify the scanned asset information in the Excel inventory sheet as instructed by the onsite contact.</li><li>Ensure all required assets are scanned and the inventory details are accurately captured.</li><li>Identify and report any assets with missing, damaged, or unreadable barcode labels.</li><li>Review the completed inventory data for accuracy and completeness before leaving the site.</li><li>Share the completed Excel inventory file with the designated HCL contact.</li></ol><p><strong>Tools &amp; Equipment</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop will be provided by HCL.</li><li>Barcode scanner will be provided by HCL.</li><li>No additional tools are expected to be required for this activity.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\nWe are looking for one onsite IT technician to perform an inventory capture of laptops and network equipment at the client location.\n\n**Responsibilities:**\n\n1. Perform a physical inventory of laptops and network equipment at the designated site.\n2. Scan the barcode labels on each asset using the barcode scanner provided by HCL.\n3. Record and verify the scanned asset information in the Excel inventory sheet as instructed by the onsite contact.\n4. Ensure all required assets are scanned and the inventory details are accurately captured.\n5. Identify and report any assets with missing, damaged, or unreadable barcode labels.\n6. Review the completed inventory data for accuracy and completeness before leaving the site.\n7. Share the completed Excel inventory file with the designated HCL contact.\n\n**Tools &amp; Equipment**\n\n- Laptop will be provided by HCL.\n- Barcode scanner will be provided by HCL.\n- No additional tools are expected to be required for this activity.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T09:00","end":"2026-11-04T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":220,"max":220},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":5.242649831464301},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $220 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Network Refresh Tech 1"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1793640471073}
