DiverseNet at&nbsp;317-536-6000 opt 2 and reference case number&nbsp;00052166\n<ul>\n<li>Ask for&nbsp;<strong><u>DiverseNet&nbsp;Check in code</u></strong> (<u>Required for Payment</u>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Check in with&nbsp;<del>***** ******* ********* ************</del>&nbsp;to verify location of equipment</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Use the following escalation path for all issues onsite:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>If first&nbsp;contact is non-responsive call&nbsp;DiverseNet at&nbsp;317-536-6000 opt 2</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>DESCRIPTION OF WORK</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p>(3) network patch cables (that we have) ran from computers to wall ports thru the 8 foot drop ceiling at Kofile's Greensboro, NC office. I was told there is a ladder the technician can use.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>We also need some network patch cable cleanup performed at the office network and server room areas.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Service Address:</p>\n<p>Kofile (formerly HFGroup)</p>\n<p>1010 Arnold St</p>\n<p>Greensboro, NC 27405</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><del>****** *********</del></p>\n<p><del>***** ******* ********* ************</del></p>\n<p><del>******** ****** ******** ************</del></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Signed Work Order with Date and Times</li>\n<li>Pictures of Work Done</li>\n<li>Picture of Equipment&nbsp;Connected (if applicable, include Serial Number)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<p><strong>CHECK OUT INSTRUCTIONS</strong></p>\n<p>───────────────────────────────────────</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out with&nbsp;<del>***** ******* ********* ************</del> and verify equipment is working properly</li>\n<li>Check out&nbsp;with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 x2\n<ul>\n<li>Ask for <strong><u>DiverseNet Check Out code</u></strong>(Required for Payment)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**IMPORTANT NOTES**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Technician must upload all deliverables before calling DiverseNet to check out or leaving site\n- Technician must call to check in and out with DiverseNet to receive full payment\n- Technician must arrive during the given time frame to receive full payment\n- Any out of scope work, or time logged past the not to exceed amount, must be approved by DiverseNet to receive payment\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**SKILLS, TOOLS, MATERIALS AND DRESS CODE**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**Skills**\n\n- Low Voltage Cabling\n- Networking\n\n**Tools/Materials**\n\n- Laptop with a physical network port OR a USB network adapter (RJ45) and must have HDMI, VGA\n- Smartphone with camera\n- Cat5 Tester\n- Cable Toner and Wand\n- Multimeter\n- Crimper (Cat-5)\n- FlashLight\n- Network Termination Tools\n- Video Termination Tools\n- Basic Handtools\n- Spare VGA, DVI and Cat5 Patch Cables (for testing)\n- Extension Cord\n- Tape Measure\n- Velcro\n- 8ft Ladder\n- Coax Cable\n- Cat5e Data Cable\n\n**Dress Code**\n\n- Close toed shoes\n- Long pants\n- Collared shirt\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**CHECK IN INSTRUCTIONS AND ESCALATION**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- We will be representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* while on site.\n- Check in with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 opt 2 and reference case number 00052166 \n  - Ask for **DiverseNet Check in code** (Required for Payment)\n- Check in with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* to verify location of equipment\n\nUse the following escalation path for all issues onsite:\n\n1. If first contact is non-responsive call DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 opt 2\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**DESCRIPTION OF WORK**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n(3) network patch cables (that we have) ran from computers to wall ports thru the 8 foot drop ceiling at Kofile's Greensboro, NC office. I was told there is a ladder the technician can use.\n\nWe also need some network patch cable cleanup performed at the office network and server room areas.\n\nService Address:\n\nKofile (formerly HFGroup)\n\n1010 Arnold St\n\nGreensboro, NC 27405\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Signed Work Order with Date and Times\n- Pictures of Work Done\n- Picture of Equipment Connected (if applicable, include Serial Number)\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n**CHECK OUT INSTRUCTIONS**\n\n───────────────────────────────────────\n\n- Check out with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* and verify equipment is working properly\n- Check out with DiverseNet at 317-536-6000 x2 \n  - Ask for **DiverseNet Check Out code**(Required for Payment)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T09:00","end":"2026-11-04T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-04T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":50},"additional":{"units":3,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":59.08577924675283},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2