{"job":{"id":20289393,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"LITnetworking LLC","title":"DATA REMOTE INSTALL/ MUST HAVE BUTT-SET/MULTIMETER-DIS155022","description":{"html":"PLEASE CALL METTEL SUPPORT UPON ARRIVAL 212-359-5129 Ticket 11565136<br/><br/>Please call Bryant Espindola 212-359-5129 when you arrive on site. If not reachable, please call remote support toll free # 844-905-9779 for assistance. Provide bruin ticket site number 11565136 to MetTel Rep.<br/><br/>***MetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit https://dispatch.bruin.com/ to manually lookup and start the dispatch.<br/><br/>Survey/Install Rack and Stack/Testing Only - First Dispatch<br/><br/>EQUIPMENT RACK AND STACK + SURVEY<br/><br/>TECH TO BE PROVIDED BOXED METTEL EQUIPMENT<br/><br/>RACK AND STACK AT THE DMARC<br/><br/>ANTENNAS TO BE MOUNTED AND INSTALLED<br/><br/>TEST OVER LTE AND VERIFY DIAL TONE ON THE METTEL EQUIPMENT<br/><br/>WAN CONNECTION MAY BE REQUIRED<br/><br/>TECH TO SURVEY AND IDENTIFY THE FOLLOWING LINES<br/><br/>PIAB CONFIGURATION DETAILS: Specialty Line(s):<br/><br/>FXS1 - 2524460265<br/><br/>FXS2 - 2524464257<br/><br/>TECH WILL NEED: BUTT-SET, BRIDGE CLIPS, TONER, MULTI-METER AND LABEL MAKER<br/><br/>ADDITIONAL DISPATCH WILL BE REQUIRED FOR PORT/CUTOVER. SAME TECH WILL BE REQUIRED<br/><br/>PLEASE ASSIGN A TECH FAMILIAR WITH PIAB AND POTS CROSS CONNECTS<br/><br/>LOCAL CONTACT: Thierno Dieng<br/><br/>PHONE: 4048225539<br/><br/>MetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit https://dispatch.bruin.com/ to manually lookup and start the dispatch.<br/><br/>Please review the following requirements and protocols for your upcoming assignment with Lit Networking:<br/><br/>To ensure the successful completion of this site visit, you must arrive with the following tools and materials: - A fully charged laptop with an Ethernet port and a cellphone with a hotspot device. - Cabling tools: Multimeter wire tester, butt set, punch down tool, crimpers, and wire cutters. - Hardware: RJ11 and RJ45 connectors, biscuit jacks, and 100 feet of Cat 5e/6 cable for potential device relocation. - Standard mounting kit: Drill, level, hammer, screwdrivers, screws, and anchors. - General supplies: Adjustable or open-end wrenches, a 4–6 ft ladder, and a 100 ft extension cord.<br/><br/>Work Order and Payment Procedures All work orders must be signed by the onsite Point of Contact and must clearly list your arrival and departure times. Please upload the signed Lit Networking work order directly to Field Nation. Please be advised that any forged signatures will be reported to Field Nation and will result in non-payment. Adhering to these documentation requirements is essential to avoid any delays in your payment processing. If you encounter any issues while onsite, please leave a detailed message through the Field Nation platform.","markdown":"PLEASE CALL METTEL SUPPORT UPON ARRIVAL 212-359-5129 Ticket 11565136  \n  \nPlease call Bryant Espindola 212-359-5129 when you arrive on site. If not reachable, please call remote support toll free # 844-905-9779 for assistance. Provide bruin ticket site number 11565136 to MetTel Rep.  \n  \n\\*\\*\\*MetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit <https://dispatch.bruin.com/> to manually lookup and start the dispatch.  \n  \nSurvey/Install Rack and Stack/Testing Only - First Dispatch  \n  \nEQUIPMENT RACK AND STACK + SURVEY  \n  \nTECH TO BE PROVIDED BOXED METTEL EQUIPMENT  \n  \nRACK AND STACK AT THE DMARC  \n  \nANTENNAS TO BE MOUNTED AND INSTALLED  \n  \nTEST OVER LTE AND VERIFY DIAL TONE ON THE METTEL EQUIPMENT  \n  \nWAN CONNECTION MAY BE REQUIRED  \n  \nTECH TO SURVEY AND IDENTIFY THE FOLLOWING LINES  \n  \nPIAB CONFIGURATION DETAILS: Specialty Line(s):  \n  \nFXS1 - 2524460265  \n  \nFXS2 - 2524464257  \n  \nTECH WILL NEED: BUTT-SET, BRIDGE CLIPS, TONER, MULTI-METER AND LABEL MAKER  \n  \nADDITIONAL DISPATCH WILL BE REQUIRED FOR PORT/CUTOVER. SAME TECH WILL BE REQUIRED  \n  \nPLEASE ASSIGN A TECH FAMILIAR WITH PIAB AND POTS CROSS CONNECTS  \n  \nLOCAL CONTACT: Thierno Dieng  \n  \nPHONE: 4048225539  \n  \nMetTel TECH APP REQUIRED to complete this dispatch - A link will be sent via text message. If you do not receive the link, visit <https://dispatch.bruin.com/> to manually lookup and start the dispatch.  \n  \nPlease review the following requirements and protocols for your upcoming assignment with Lit Networking:  \n  \nTo ensure the successful completion of this site visit, you must arrive with the following tools and materials: - A fully charged laptop with an Ethernet port and a cellphone with a hotspot device. - Cabling tools: Multimeter wire tester, butt set, punch down tool, crimpers, and wire cutters. - Hardware: RJ11 and RJ45 connectors, biscuit jacks, and 100 feet of Cat 5e/6 cable for potential device relocation. - Standard mounting kit: Drill, level, hammer, screwdrivers, screws, and anchors. - General supplies: Adjustable or open-end wrenches, a 4–6 ft ladder, and a 100 ft extension cord.  \n  \nWork Order and Payment Procedures All work orders must be signed by the onsite Point of Contact and must clearly list your arrival and departure times. Please upload the signed Lit Networking work order directly to Field Nation. Please be advised that any forged signatures will be reported to Field Nation and will result in non-payment. Adhering to these documentation requirements is essential to avoid any delays in your payment processing. If you encounter any issues while onsite, please leave a detailed message through the Field Nation platform.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T09:00","end":"2026-11-05T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,