{"job":{"id":20290964,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"VCI","title":"Cabling Tech","description":{"html":"<p>Need technician to troubleshoot cable run for the rooms.</p><p>Technician must have prior experience in runing cat6 cable and other cables. Tech must have necessary tools to run the cables. Tech Must have a laptop with ethernet connector. Job will continue for multiple days.</p><p>Note: Any thing more than 6 hours, 30 mins lunch time will be deducted.</p>","markdown":"Need technician to troubleshoot cable run for the rooms.\n\nTechnician must have prior experience in runing cat6 cable and other cables. Tech must have necessary tools to run the cables. Tech Must have a laptop with ethernet connector. Job will continue for multiple days.\n\nNote: Any thing more than 6 hours, 30 mins lunch time will be deducted.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T10:00","end":"2026-11-03T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":30,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":30,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9.066788368071258},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Tue, Nov 3, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Tue, Nov 3, Wed, Nov 4, Thu, Nov 5, Fri, Nov 6 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T01:00:00.000Z","summary":"Happy Birthday"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start"