{"job":{"id":20292848,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"POS TERMINAL - NCR 7607 ( service/replace and confirm that register reports scale present)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>**WHILE ONSITE, YOU ARE TO REPRESENT POMEROY ONLY**</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>Technical Support :</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Pomeroy Technical Support - 704-414-5111 Open 8am-8pm EST</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Open and review the instructions for this scope of work, URL below:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>TRS Link:</strong>https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-82xrt-7606</p>\n<p>https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods/pos/terminal/realpos-xr8-7607</p>\n<p><strong>Note: Technician does not need to call ALDI Global Service Desk to check in on site, but DOES need to call the ALDI Global Service Desk - (866) 711-2534 - to check out..</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>SCOPE OF WORK:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Register 6 - Model 7607 register PC - will not communicate with scale - Scale has been serviced and replaced by pomeroy, as scale does not seem to be the issue. Check scale port on register PC, service/replace and confirm that register reports scale present.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>On Site Contact Name: Manager On Duty</p>\n<p>On Site Contact Phone:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On Site Contact Email:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Problem Type: NOT COMMUNICATING</p>\n<p>Location Subtype:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Lane Number (if applicable): 6</p>\n<p>Client Ticket Number/External Reference ID: REQ2948810</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Lane #:&nbsp;6</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Description of Parts:</strong> NCR ALD POS NCR 7607 TERM,4GB/120GB,BLK</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>UPS TRACKING</strong>: 1ZA33F200198745677</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>*In case the tracking number is not present in this WO, please contact Pomeroy Dispatch Center at 704-414-5131 or check messages.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Required Items:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multimeter</li>\n<li>VGA Monitor</li>\n<li>Keyboard (PS/2 or USB)&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Basic hand tools kit (pliers, screwdrivers, cutters etc)</li>\n<li>Paper Clip</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Only accept this job if you have all the required tools, and are able to make the required time frame.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Parts Handling Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>It is the responsibility of the assigned tech to track parts. Pomeroy will provide tracking numbers for any shipped parts when they become available.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- If no tracking number has been provided by 10am the morning of the assignment, it is up to <strong>YOU</strong>, the technician, to call the coordinators to get this tracking number.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- Pomeroy is NOT responsible for techs arriving before parts and will NOT compensate for unnecessary trips or wait time.</li>\n<li>Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned tech.<strong>DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE</strong> unless explicitly instructed by Pomeroy. The full name of the agent is required if you are advised to leave parts onsite.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- If parts are left onsite, tech will NOT get paid for the work order. We will not reimburse you to return and pick up the parts.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- Drop the shipment off at an authorized shipping facility within 3 business days.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- If you need additional return labels, please advise the Pomeroy Call Center to arrange for labels to be sent to you.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.</li>\n<li>&nbsp;- Technician may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.</li>\n<li><br /></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Communication Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><u>Any issues with scheduling, running late, unable to show up, etc. MUST BE CALLED IN TO THE POMEROY DISPATCH CENTER. Messages left on the platform are not acceptable forms of communication.</u>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>This will result in penalties, negative ratings, being unassigned from the work order, and may affect future work for our company.</li>\n<li>- Please be sure your Voicemail is functional should we need to leave a message.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Pomeroy Dispatch Center – <del>************</del></li>\n<li>Tech Support – <del>************</del></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Work Order Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Be prepared with all documentation and understanding for scope of work</li>\n<li>You MUST bring all the tools in the Required Tool List to site to avoid penalties</li>\n<li>All documentation needs to be printed or downloaded to a device accessible while onsite</li>\n<li>If you have any questions call Pomeroy before going onsite</li>\n<li>When parts arrive – go onsite</li>\n<li>Call the Stores Held Desk if applicable</li>\n<li>Advise the site that you are representing Pomeroy</li>\n<li>Ask for and record name of manager on duty</li>\n<li>Locate parts and start work</li>\n<li>Call Tech support as needed at <del>************</del></li>\n<li>Upon completion of work the following will be needed for check out:</li>\n<li>- Mangers name</li>\n<li>- Name of anyone you spoke with at the Help Desk if applicable</li>\n<li>- Serial number of Old and New parts</li>\n<li>- Rtags for Old and New Parts (if applicable)</li>\n<li>- UPS return tracking number</li>\n<li>Please update all the required information in the work order before marking it as work done.</li>\n</ol>","markdown":"**\\*\\*WHILE ONSITE, YOU ARE TO REPRESENT POMEROY ONLY\\*\\***\n\n**Technical Support :** **Pomeroy Technical Support - 704-414-5111 Open 8am-8pm EST**\n\n**Open and review the instructions for this scope of work, URL below:**\n\n**TRS Link:**<https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-82xrt-7606>\n\n<https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods/pos/terminal/realpos-xr8-7607>\n\n**Note: Technician does not need to call ALDI Global Service Desk to check in on site, but DOES need to call the ALDI Global Service Desk - (866) 711-2534 - to check out..**\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\nRegister 6 - Model 7607 register PC - will not communicate with scale - Scale has been serviced and replaced by pomeroy, as scale does not seem to be the issue. Check scale port on register PC, service/replace and confirm that register reports scale present.\n\nOn Site Contact Name: Manager On Duty\n\nOn Site Contact Phone:\n\nOn Site Contact Email:\n\nProblem Type: NOT COMMUNICATING\n\nLocation Subtype:\n\nLane Number (if applicable): 6\n\nClient Ticket Number/External Reference ID: REQ2948810\n\n**Lane #: 6**\n\n**Description of Parts:** NCR ALD POS NCR 7607 TERM,4GB/120GB,BLK\n\n**UPS TRACKING**: 1ZA33F200198745677\n\n**\\*In case the tracking number is not present in this WO, please contact Pomeroy Dispatch Center at 704-414-5131 or check messages.**\n\n**Required Items:**\n\n- Multimeter\n- VGA Monitor\n- Keyboard (PS/2 or USB)\n- Basic hand tools kit (pliers, screwdrivers, cutters etc)\n- Paper Clip\n\n**Only accept this job if you have all the required tools, and are able to make the required time frame.**\n\n**Parts Handling Requirements:**\n\n1. It is the responsibility of the assigned tech to track parts. Pomeroy will provide tracking numbers for any shipped parts when they become available.\n2. - If no tracking number has been provided by 10am the morning of the assignment, it is up to **YOU**, the technician, to call the coordinators to get this tracking number.\n3. - Pomeroy is NOT responsible for techs arriving before parts and will NOT compensate for unnecessary trips or wait time.\n4. Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned tech.**DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE** unless explicitly instructed by Pomeroy. The full name of the agent is required if you are advised to leave parts onsite.\n5. - If parts are left onsite, tech will NOT get paid for the work order. We will not reimburse you to return and pick up the parts.\n6. - Drop the shipment off at an authorized shipping facility within 3 business days.\n7. - If you need additional return labels, please advise the Pomeroy Call Center to arrange for labels to be sent to you.\n8. - Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.\n9. - Technician may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.\n10. \n\n**Communication Requirements:**\n\n1. Any issues with scheduling, running late, unable to show up, etc. MUST BE CALLED IN TO THE POMEROY DISPATCH CENTER. Messages left on the platform are not acceptable forms of communication.\n2. This will result in penalties, negative ratings, being unassigned from the work order, and may affect future work for our company.\n3. - Please be sure your Voicemail is functional should we need to leave a message.\n4. Pomeroy Dispatch Center – \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n5. Tech Support – \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Work Order Requirements:**\n\n1. Be prepared with all documentation and understanding for scope of work\n2. You MUST bring all the tools in the Required Tool List to site to avoid penalties\n3. All documentation needs to be printed or downloaded to a device accessible while onsite\n4. If you have any questions call Pomeroy before going onsite\n5. When parts arrive – go onsite\n6. Call the Stores Held Desk if applicable\n7. Advise the site that you are representing Pomeroy\n8. Ask for and record name of manager on duty\n9. Locate parts and start work\n10. Call Tech support as needed at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n11. Upon completion of work the following will be needed for check out:\n12. - Mangers name\n13. - Name of anyone you spoke with at the Help Desk if applicable\n14. - Serial number of Old and New parts\n15. - Rtags for Old and New Parts (if applicable)\n16. - UPS return tracking number\n17. Please update all the required information in the work order before marking it as work done.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T08:00","end":"2026-11-03T09:00","latestStart":"2026-11-03T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":11.208051473489085},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1793653625506}
