{"job":{"id":"9290156230","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"ASD","title":"Site survey","description":"<p><u>IMPORTANT- This assignment requires a form to be properly filled out and stamped upon job completion. Failure to do so forfeits pay.</u></p><p><br></p><p>Before starting this assignment, please log in to the ticket using the following link and use this platform to document and track all work performed for this service order:</p><p><br></p><p>https://flare.asd.direct</p><p><br></p><p>Use your work market email to access our app.</p><p><br></p><p>Ensure all updates, notes, and required information related to the job are entered into the ticket while completing the work.</p><p><u> </u></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>SOW:</p><p><br></p><p>SITE SURVEY: NEW WORKSTATION &amp; PHONE BUILD-OUT (DROP COUNT TBD)</p><p><strong>OBJECTIVE</strong> Conduct a preliminary <strong>SITE SURVEY</strong> to determine infrastructure, cabling, and pathway requirements for a proposed workstation and phone location. On-site details provided:</p><ul><li><strong>Underneath Counter:</strong> IG duplex, data jack(s), J-box, and conduit</li><li><strong>Above Counter (Phone):</strong> Data jack(s), J-box, and conduit</li></ul><p><em>Note: Total cable drop count is unconfirmed and must be verified on site based on active hardware needs (single, dual, quad, or multi-port setup).</em></p><p><strong>WHAT TO DO ON SITE</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Determine Scope &amp; Drop Count:</strong></li></ol><ul><li>Meet with site management/store contact to identify the exact counter location and confirm device inventory (PCs, printers, payment terminals, phones).</li><li>Confirm the total number of physical data drops required (under counter vs. above counter).</li><li>Identify the serving network rack/IDF and the designated power source for the IG duplex.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Measure Cable &amp; Conduit Pathways:</strong></li></ol><ul><li>Measure the linear distance from the IDF to the counter along the usable pathway.</li><li>Measure conduit distance from the electrical source to the under-counter box.</li><li>Note pathway capacity (existing conduit fill, J-hook space, ceiling type/height, and required wall penetrations).</li></ul><ol><li><strong>STOP &amp; CHECK IN:</strong> Send confirmed drop count, total run measurements, conduit routing notes, and photos of the counter area and IDF before leaving the site.</li></ol><p><br></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T10:00","end":"2026-11-04T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":130},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":12.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Network Refresh Tech 1"}],