{"job":{"id":"9290156230","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"ASD","title":"SITE SURVEY: NEW WORKSTATION &amp; PHONE DROPS (2 LINES TO MDF)","description":"<p><u>IMPORTANT- This assignment requires a form to be properly filled out and stamped upon job completion. Failure to do so forfeits pay.</u></p><p><br></p><p>Before starting this assignment, please log in to the ticket using the following link and use this platform to document and track all work performed for this service order:</p><p><br></p><p>https://flare.asd.direct</p><p><br></p><p>Use your work market email to access our app.</p><p><br></p><p>Ensure all updates, notes, and required information related to the job are entered into the ticket while completing the work.</p><p><u> </u></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>SOW:</p><p><br></p><p><strong>OBJECTIVE</strong> Conduct a <strong>SITE SURVEY</strong> to map pathway distances and verify infrastructure for two (2) new network data lines running from the <strong>MDF</strong> to a new counter area:</p><ul><li><strong>Workstation:</strong> One (1) data drop underneath the counter.</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> One (1) data drop mounted on the adjacent side wall above the counter.</li><li><strong>Conduit:</strong> Newly installed conduit is already in place at the counter location.</li></ul><p><strong>WHAT TO DO ON SITE</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Trace Route &amp; Measure Distances:</strong></li></ol><ul><li>Measure the total linear cable run distance from the <strong>MDF</strong> to the counter area for two (2) Cat6 lines.</li><li>Inspect the newly installed conduit at the counter to verify diameter, pull string availability, and clean transition from the ceiling/wall down to both the under-counter box and above-counter side wall location.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Assess Pathway &amp; Rack Capacity:</strong></li></ol><ul><li>Check overhead pathways (J-hooks, trays, ceiling access) between the MDF and the conduit drop point.</li><li>Locate the designated patch panel and verify two (2) available ports in the MDF.</li><li>Verify the mounting surface on the side wall for the phone jack/faceplate and under the counter for the workstation drop.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>STOP &amp; CHECK IN:</strong> Send the exact run measurements, photos of the newly installed conduit (both ends), side wall mounting spot, and available MDF patch panel space before leaving the site.</li></ol>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00","end":"2026-11-06T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":130},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":12.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","summary":