{"job":{"id":"7434340527","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"nscglobal","title":"REQ. TWO TECHS WOR0156869 Raleigh, NC 1 of 2/ Any Day Between Mon-Fri / 65\" Display/TV Replacement","description":"<p>*** Please don't do any other work which is not listed in the work order details. You are allowed to perform any other work if its approved by the CarMax remote EUC support. Please note in case the work could not be completed because of missing parts or hardware items, please do not purchase or use your own parts or hardware items to complete the job. In such case, please reach out to us via email&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com</a>&nbsp;or call : Amol Sawant phone: +1 (646) 4999049 OR Mazo <strong>+1 (513) 8498716</strong> &amp; notify us about the situation &amp; then you are good to leave the site.***</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Dispatch 2 NSC Techs for Display Installation&nbsp;</p><p> Model of TV (LG/SAMSUNG): 65 Inch</p><p> How many technicians will be needed :2</p><p>NSC Dispatch: Amol Sawant</p><p>phone: +1 (646) 4999049</p><p>OR Mazo +1 (513) 8498716</p><p><a href=\"mailto:nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please thoroughly read the instructions given below before going onsite to service the ticket.</p><p>Please update <u>detailed resolution notes &amp; pictures</u> to justify your job completion time.</p><p>Please don't do any other work which is not listed in the work order details. You are allowed to perform any other work if its approved by the CarMax remote EUC support technician.</p><ul><li>Please note that you are not allowed to go onsite on weekends.</li><li>Make sure that you call <u>NSC Dispatch Coordinator – Amol Sawant phone: +1 (646) 4999049</u> &amp; then <u>CarMax Technology Support (contact # listed in WM assignment details)</u> from the parking lot before entering the site to let us know that you have arrived. After completion of work make sure that you <u>call CarMax Technology Support</u> so that they will verify your work &amp; release you from the site. Make sure that you call NSC Dispatch Coordinator – Amol Sawant to check out. These <u>calls are mandatory</u> to record &amp; verify your check in &amp; check out times.</li><li><u>CarMax Technology Support can approve changes or additions to initial WM instructions.</u>&nbsp;On-site managers or site contacts <u>do not have</u> that authority.&nbsp;You should call CarMax Technology Support if you run into problems or if the site contact tries to change the work instructions.</li><li><u>No work can be performed after 4.30 pm Eastern.</u>&nbsp;If you determine requested work cannot be completed by that deadline CarMax Technology Support needs to be notified immediately.&nbsp;<u>You must check-out by 4.30 pm Eastern by calling CarMax Technology Support.</u>&nbsp;&nbsp;Timestamp of that call will be used to validate check-out time.&nbsp;</li><li>In case the work can’t be completed because of missing parts or hardware items, please <u>do not purchase or use your own parts or hardware items to complete the job</u>. In such case, please reach out to us via email <a href=\"mailto:nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com</a> or call : Amol Sawant phone: +1 (646) 4999049 &amp; notify us about the situation &amp; then you are good to leave the site.</li><li><u>No expenses will be reimbursed</u> without prior approval from <u>NSC.</u></li><li><u>Do not discuss payment</u> with the on-site CarMax employees or the CarMax Technology Support Team. Please forward billing concerns to <a href=\"mailto:nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com</a>.</li><li>If there is an issue with the work, site, or with contacting the CarMax Technology Support, please email <a href=\"mailto:nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">nsc.carmaxdispatch@nscglobal.com</a> or call : Amol Sawant phone: +1 (646) 4999049. We will make sure your situation or issue is taken care of and will send an SOS out to the EUC team if necessary. <u>You need to call Amol Sawant phone: +1 (646) 4999049 within 1 hour </u>if you cannot locate the site contact or contact CarMax Technology Support. If possible, please try to message us earlier so that we can get an SOS out.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>When checking out, please include pictures that you have taken (such as the complete PC at its location) so that we may include that in the notes on CarMax’s side of the tickets. Make sure that your notes and pictures capture as much detail as is pertinent.</li></ul>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T10:00","end":"2026-11-03T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":90},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T01:00:00.000Z","summary":"Happy Birthday"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z",