{"job":{"id":"3747918827","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Buchanan Technologies","title":"Pick up and Ship Equipment  - Residential - Tech to confirm date and time with Onsite Contact Prior","description":"<p>Please read this description carefully.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Description:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tech needs to contact end user and agree to a time to meet to pick up equipment, call, email or text.</strong></li><li><strong>Once ETA is confirmed please leave a note for dispatch on the work order so that we can update Corporate</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>SCOPE:</p><p><strong>Please dispatch tech to pick up equipment and return to our Corporate office.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>**IMPORTANT:&nbsp;Please make sure the computer is labeled with the&nbsp;user’s name and the ticket number is listed in the subject line.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>The internal ticket number for this request is <em>9003-</em>Alysia Martin,&nbsp;. Please use this number to confirm authorization to pick up the equipment if requested by the customer. Tech will need to reach out to the local contact to confirm a date and time to schedule pick up.</p><p><br></p><p>You will be picking up <u>some or all </u>of the following, This list varies user to user:</p><p><br></p><ul><li>Laptop -&nbsp;should be labeled with the users’ name.&nbsp;(PICS)</li><li>Monitor</li><li>Dock</li><li>Printer</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Pick up @:</p><p>Alysia Martin</p><p>3412 Red Bay Dr</p><p>Raleigh, NC 27616</p><p><br></p><p>Once the equipment is collected, it must be dropped off at a FedEx location using the following address:</p><p><br></p><p>PrimeLending</p><p>ATTN: HTH IT Inventory - Terminations</p><p>18111 Preston Road Suite 500</p><p>Dallas, Texas 75252</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>**Technician must use corporate account number. FedEx will box and prepare shipment (Technician DOES NOT need to pay for shipping material or shipping cost)</p><p>Prime Lending FedEx Acct: 3434-5568-2 - MUST USE THIS ACCOUNT</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Insurance = 1st $100 is free, then $0.75 for each $100 with a minimum of $2.25 ($100.00 - $400.00 insurance is $2.25) (Use your own discretion on how much to insure)</p><p><br></p><p>Please provide tracking receipt upon completion -</p><ul><li>(FedEx will box the equipment for you, there is no need to provide packing supplies. all of this can be billed to the client using the FedEx account number provided)</li></ul>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T09:00","end":"2026-11-03T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-03T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T01:00:00.000Z","summary":"Happy Birthday"},{"start":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Election Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:0