{"job":{"id":20298006,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Eye Catch","title":"INSTALLATION OF 2 X 32in TVs Horizontal Installed  to a KIOSK","description":{"html":"<p><strong>***VERY IMPORTANT **** </strong></p><ul><li><strong>Must have WhatsApp app installed on phone</strong>&nbsp;to maintain active communication during installation (progress photos are required, every 25 - 35 minutes).</li><li><strong>This is a One Person Job</strong>. In case a helper is taken, the assigned provider will cover the extra person's cost.</li><li>No cables should be visible</li><li>The installer responsible for the installation&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;be the person in the profile; a third party is NOT acceptable.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work &amp; Assigned Tasks</strong></p><p>INSTALLATION OF 2 X 32in TVs Horizontal Installed&nbsp;to a KIOSK + 1 PC AS DIGITAL MENU BOARDS</p><p><br></p><p><strong>NOTE: Installer must provide an extension cord if needed*</strong></p><ol><li>Review Attached Pictures &amp; Documents</li><li>Review Install Guide for Measurements of Digital Menu Boards</li></ol><p><strong>ON SITE</strong></p><ol><li>Send Pictures of Site Prior to install for Before &amp; After gallery</li><li>Check Packing List</li><li>Using adhesive tape, please mark the limits of televisions &amp; Take pictures of it</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Note: TVs Should be Identified from Left to Right ( Tv1,Tv2 ,Tv3..etc) - As if you were the CUSTOMER- Check the drawing provided&nbsp;</li><li>PLEASE DOUBLE CHECK FINAL POSITION OF THE TV WITH CLIENT ON SITE</li><li>Install Mount plates on the wall- Take picture of it</li><li>(Take Pictures of Mounts without TVs with Level Ruler with Bubble Centered)</li><li>Complete the Cable Management needed – Cable must be not visibly&nbsp;</li><li>Connect Internet/Data Port to PC (Bring Cat 5/6 Cable)- Note installer must provide Patch cord to connect Digital Media Player To Ethernet Hardware</li><li>Confirm with EyeCatch Team Internet Connectivity (Through WhatsApp Group)</li><li>Please label the TVs from Left to Right ( TV1 TV2 TV3 TV4) &amp; Take pictures of it. Take a clear picture of TV SERIAL NUMBER.</li><li>Install the mounting bracket to TVs</li><li>TVs Installation <strong>(Provide pictures every 25 to 35 minutes during this Task through WhatsApp Group)</strong></li><li>Connect TV1-TV2-TV3-TV4 to the Labeled port on PC (1,2,3,4) respectively- Make them match the ports on the digital media player label with the TVs according to the order mentioned. -Numbers depend on Scope-</li><li>Turn Off ECO Friendly Features &amp; Auto Dim backlights Feature &amp; Set up Clock/time according to the instructions of EyeCatch Team ( On each TV)</li><li>Make final adjustment needed on TVs- Must be perfectly leveled (no gap between them)&nbsp;</li><li>Take pictures of the Screens according to the instructions of the EyeCatch Team</li><li>Upload FINAL Installation Pictures and Videos Through this Google Form https://forms.gle/rju8nVqLy6Dws1GC9</li></ol><p><strong><em>** Bring tools and hardware (Ladder, drills, screws, drywall anchors/butterflies, screwdrivers, leveling tools, tie wraps,</em> Patch Cord</strong>, <strong>mount spacers,<em>etc.) **</em></strong></p><p><strong>******PLEASE DOUBLE CHECK FINAL POSITION OF THE TV WITH CLIENT ON SITE******</strong></p><p>***Do not throw away the boxes until the installations are completed.****</p><p><strong>****DRAWINGS NOT TO SCALE********</strong></p><p><strong>****WHATSAPP will be used for comunication purposes before and during the installation****</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>MAKE SURE ALL ITEMS HERE ARE RESPONDED TO IN THE REPORT&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>******CALL EYECATCH BEFORE LEFT THE SITE*********</strong></p>","markdown":"**\\*\\*\\*VERY IMPORTANT \\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n- **Must have WhatsApp app installed on phone** to maintain active communication during installation (progress photos are required, every 25 - 35 minutes).\n- **This is a One Person Job**. In case a helper is taken, the assigned provider will cover the extra person's cost.\n- No cables should be visible\n- The installer responsible for the installation **MUST** be the person in the profile; a third party is NOT acceptable.\n\n**Scope of Work &amp; Assigned Tasks**\n\nINSTALLATION OF 2 X 32in TVs Horizontal Installed to a KIOSK + 1 PC AS DIGITAL MENU BOARDS\n\n**NOTE: Installer must provide an extension cord if needed\\***\n\n1. Review Attached Pictures &amp; Documents\n2. Review Install Guide for Measurements of Digital Menu Boards\n\n**ON SITE**\n\n1. Send Pictures of Site Prior to install for Before &amp; After gallery\n2. Check Packing List\n3. Using adhesive tape, please mark the limits of televisions &amp; Take pictures of it\n4. Note: TVs Should be Identified from Left to Right ( Tv1,Tv2 ,Tv3..etc) - As if you were the CUSTOMER- Check the drawing provided\n5. PLEASE DOUBLE CHECK FINAL POSITION OF THE TV WITH CLIENT ON SITE\n6. Install Mount plates on the wall- Take picture of it\n7. (Take Pictures of Mounts without TVs with Level Ruler with Bubble Centered)\n8. Complete the Cable Management needed – Cable must be not visibly\n9. Connect Internet/Data Port to PC (Bring Cat 5/6 Cable)- Note installer must provide Patch cord to connect Digital Media Player To Ethernet Hardware\n10. Confirm with EyeCatch Team Internet Connectivity (Through WhatsApp Group)\n11. Please label the TVs from Left to Right ( TV1 TV2 TV3 TV4) &amp; Take pictures of it. Take a clear picture of TV SERIAL NUMBER.\n12. Install the mounting bracket to TVs\n13. TVs Installation **(Provide pictures every 25 to 35 minutes during this Task through WhatsApp Group)**\n14. Connect TV1-TV2-TV3-TV4 to the Labeled port on PC (1,2,3,4) respectively- Make them match the ports on the digital media player label with the TVs according to the order mentioned. -Numbers depend on Scope-\n15. Turn Off ECO Friendly Features &amp; Auto Dim backlights Feature &amp; Set up Clock/time according to the instructions of EyeCatch Team ( On each TV)\n16. Make final adjustment needed on TVs- Must be perfectly leveled (no gap between them)\n17. Take pictures of the Screens according to the instructions of the EyeCatch Team\n18. Upload FINAL Installation Pictures and Videos Through this Google Form <https://forms.gle/rju8nVqLy6Dws1GC9>\n\n***\\*\\* Bring tools and hardware (Ladder, drills, screws, drywall anchors/butterflies, screwdrivers, leveling tools, tie wraps,* Patch Cord**, **mount spacers,*etc.) \\*\\****\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*PLEASE DOUBLE CHECK FINAL POSITION OF THE TV WITH CLIENT ON SITE\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n\\*\\*\\*Do not throw away the boxes until the installations are completed.\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*DRAWINGS NOT TO SCALE\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*WHATSAPP will be used for comunication purposes before and during the installation\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**MAKE SURE ALL ITEMS HERE ARE RESPONDED TO IN THE REPORT**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*CALL EYECATCH BEFORE LEFT THE SITE\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T10:00","end":"2026-11-10T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":320,"max":320},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":5,"distance":50.109235941203806},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TVs\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veter