{"job":{"id":20282184,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"PDC - Aldi - Kyocera Printer (Please repair /replace printer.)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>**WHILE ONSITE, YOU ARE TO REPRESENT POMEROY ONLY**</u></strong></p><p><strong><u>Technical Support :</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Pomeroy Technical Support - 704-414-5111 Open 8am-8pm EST</strong></p><p><strong>Open and review the instructions for this scope of work, URL below:</strong></p><p><strong>TRS Link: </strong>https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods/printer/laser/multifunction/m2640</p><p>https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods/printer/laser/multifunction/ma4000</p><p><strong>Note: Technician does not need to call ALDI Global Service Desk to check in on site, but DOES need to call the ALDI Global Service Desk - (866) 711-2534 - to check out. </strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>SCOPE OF WORK:</u></strong></p><p>Paper jam on Kyocera office printer.</p><p>Please repair /replace printer.</p><p>Paper gets cleared out and printer restarted; issue is still present.</p><p>If replacing printer please configure and test printer with manager on duty.</p><p><br></p><p>On Site Contact Name: Manager on Duty</p><p>On Site Contact Phone: 8667112534</p><p>On Site Contact Email:&nbsp;</p><p>Problem Type: PAPER JAM</p><p>Location Subtype: Office Printer</p><p>Lane Number (if applicable):&nbsp;</p><p>Client Ticket Number/External Reference ID: REQ2957987</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Lane #:&nbsp; NA</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Description of Parts: </strong>KYOC PRT KYO M2640IDW,LASER</p><p><br></p><p><strong>UPS TRACKING</strong>: To be updated</p><p><br></p><p><strong>*In case the tracking number is not present in this WO, please contact Pomeroy Dispatch Center at 704-414-5131 or check messages.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required Items:</strong></p><ul><li>Basic hand tools kit (pliers, screwdrivers, cutters etc)</li><li>Paper Clip</li></ul><p><strong>Only accept this job if you have all the requ