{"job":{"id":20298600,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Voxiant Technology Partners","title":"Kildaire Reserve","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Please send a tech to tone the CD office and see if the switch has a bad port.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">We did a direct plug from the wall to the PC, and it failed to resolve an IP address.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Also bring longer network cables and help her arrange her gear better.&nbsp; We need to create some slack in the network wires and the power cables.&nbsp; She had to dance around the desk to assist with troubleshooting.&nbsp; She couldn't move anything.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><strong>UPON ARRIVAL PLEASE CONTACT THE HELPDESK / Howard Wilson @ 214-561-1277. </strong></p><p><strong>If they don't answer, please leave a message with your contact information.</strong></p><p><strong>If you are having issues contact the helpdesk, please call me directly @ 972-833-4002</strong></p><p><br></p>","markdown":"Please send a tech to tone the CD office and see if the switch has a bad port.\n\nWe did a direct plug from the wall to the PC, and it failed to resolve an IP address.\n\nAlso bring longer network cables and help her arrange her gear better. We need to create some slack in the network wires and the power cables. She had to dance around the desk to assist with troubleshooting. She couldn't move anything.\n\n**UPON ARRIVAL PLEASE CONTACT THE HELPDESK / Howard Wilson @ 214-561-1277.**\n\n**If they don't answer, please leave a message with your contact information.**\n\n**If you are having issues contact the helpdesk, please call me directly @ 972-833-4002**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-03T12:00","end":"2026-11-03T14:00","latestStart":"2026-11-03T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":110},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":12.78841727