{"job":{"id":20298707,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Netcom Business IT Solutions","title":"NC18 - Install Outdoor Verkada Camera Covering Outdoor Kiosk","description":{"html":"<p><strong>PLEASE READ THIS CAREFULLY BEFORE APPLYING!</strong></p><p>This is an <strong>on-site Verkada camera installation or relocation</strong> at retail store locations throughout the US.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Only experienced low-voltage / network technicians should apply.</strong></p><p>Failure to follow <strong>set hours, scheduling rules, or assignment requirements</strong> will result in <strong>negative feedback</strong>.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><p>The technician will be responsible for<strong> Verkada camera system </strong>and<strong> </strong>point-to-point (PTP) wireless bridges in <strong>this commercial site</strong>.</p><p><strong>New Camera Installation</strong></p><ul><li>Install 2<strong> Verkada camera</strong> and 1 wireless AP aimed at:</li><li>Customers</li><li>Most locations will require a <strong>new Cat6 network drop</strong>.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Network &amp; Cabling Requirements</strong></p><p><strong>If Site Has an IT / Network Rack</strong></p><ul><li>Run Cat6 neatly (above ceiling, wall, or conduit as required)</li><li>Terminate cable <strong>properly at the patch panel</strong></li><li>Use a <strong>patch cable</strong> from patch panel to <strong>existing PoE switch</strong></li><li>Professional cable management is <strong>required</strong></li></ul><p><strong>If Site Does NOT Have an IT Rack</strong></p><ul><li>Network equipment may be:</li><li>Under a desk</li><li>In a closet</li><li>Near a modem/router</li><li>If <strong>no available PoE port exists</strong>, technician must:</li><li>Purchase a <strong>small PoE switch (4–5 ports)</strong></li><li><strong>This will be reimbursed</strong> (receipt required)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ceiling / Mounting Conditions</strong></p><p>Technicians must be prepared for <strong>any environment</strong>, including:</p><ul><li>Drop ceiling</li><li>Drywall</li><li>Concrete / masonry</li></ul><p>Proper anchors, hardware, and mounting methods are required.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tools &amp; Materials (Technician Must Bring)</strong></p><p>Technicians must arrive <strong>fully equipped</strong>, including but not limited to:</p><p><strong>Required Tools</strong></p><ul><li>Tall ladders (as needed for ceiling height)</li><li>Drill (with concrete, masonry and drywall bits)</li><li>Fish tape / glow rods</li><li>Stud finder</li><li>Labeling tools (recommended)</li></ul><p><strong>Networking Tools</strong></p><ul><li>RJ45 crimpers</li><li>Punch-down tool</li><li>Network cable tester</li><li>Cable stripper</li><li>Keystone jacks</li><li>RJ45 connectors</li><li>Patch cables</li><li>Network couplers (for relocation scenarios)</li></ul><p><strong>Materials</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cat6 cable (technician supplied, reimbursable)</strong></li><li>Anchors, screws, zip ties, Velcro, J-hooks as needed</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Verification &amp; Support</strong></p><ul><li><strong>ALL technicians must contact our Help Desk</strong> to:</li><li>Confirm camera placement</li><li>Verify camera view alignment before leaving site</li><li>Support hours:</li><li><strong>8:30 AM – 5:30 PM Eastern Standard Time (EST)</strong></li><li>Even if the store is in another time zone, <strong>support hours remain EST</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Important Time Zone Example</strong></p><ul><li>If a store is in <strong>Pacific Standard Time</strong></li><li>Technician starts work at <strong>4:00 PM PST</strong></li><li>This equals <strong>7:00 PM EST</strong></li><li>❌ <strong>Support will NOT be available</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scheduling Rules (Very Important)</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Hard start time: 10:00 AM (local store time)</strong></li><li><strong>DO NOT request any start time earlier</strong></li><li>Stores are closed</li><li>No access to unlock doors</li><li>Store hours:</li><li><strong>10:00 AM – 6:00 PM</strong></li></ul><p>Failure to follow scheduling rules may result in <strong>negative feedback</strong>.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Experience Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>This is <strong>NOT an entry-level job</strong></li><li>Only technicians experienced with:</li><li>IP cameras</li><li>Network cabling</li><li>PoE switching</li><li>Commercial environments</li><li>should apply.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Additional Notes</strong></p><ul><li>A <strong>CompanyCam link</strong> will be provided as a <strong>reference example ( </strong>https://app.companycam.com/projects/117479500/photos )</li><li>The example site <strong>may not match</strong> the exact layout of your assigned location</li><li>It is provided <strong>for general expectations only</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>COMPANYCAM LINK TO VIEW SAMPLE PRIME STORAGE STORES</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Professional Etiquette &amp; Representation:</strong></p><ul><li>You are representing <strong>NETCOM</strong> while on-site.</li><li><strong>Do not</strong> mention Field Nation, third-party platforms, or your independent contractor status to the site staff or manager. If asked, you are a field technician dispatching on behalf of NETCOM.</li></ul>","markdown":"**PLEASE READ THIS CAREFULLY BEFORE APPLYING!**\n\nThis is an **on-site Verkada camera installation or relocation** at retail store locations throughout the US.\n\n**Only experienced low-voltage / network technicians should apply.**\n\nFailure to follow **set hours, scheduling rules, or assignment requirements** will result in **negative feedback**.\n\n**Scope of Work**\n\nThe technician will be responsible for **Verkada camera system** and point-to-point (PTP) wireless bridges in **this commercial site**.\n\n**New Camera Installation**\n\n- Install 2 **Verkada camera** and 1 wireless AP aimed at:\n- Customers\n- Most locations will require a **new Cat6 network drop**.\n\n**Network &amp; Cabling Requirements**\n\n**If Site Has an IT / Network Rack**\n\n- Run Cat6 neatly (above ceiling, wall, or conduit as required)\n- Terminate cable **properly at the patch panel**\n- Use a **patch cable** from patch panel to **existing PoE switch**\n- Professional cable management is **required**\n\n**If Site Does NOT Have an IT Rack**\n\n- Network equipment may be:\n- Under a desk\n- In a closet\n- Near a modem/router\n- If **no available PoE port exists**, technician must:\n- Purchase a **small PoE switch (4–5 ports)**\n- **This will be reimbursed** (receipt required)\n\n**Ceiling / Mounting Conditions**\n\nTechnicians must be prepared for **any environment**, including:\n\n- Drop ceiling\n- Drywall\n- Concrete / masonry\n\nProper anchors, hardware, and mounting methods are required.\n\n**Tools &amp; Materials (Technician Must Bring)**\n\nTechnicians must arrive **fully equipped**, including but not limited to:\n\n**Required Tools**\n\n- Tall ladders (as needed for ceiling height)\n- Drill (with concrete, masonry and drywall bits)\n- Fish tape / glow rods\n- Stud finder\n- Labeling tools (recommended)\n\n**Networking Tools**\n\n- RJ45 crimpers\n- Punch-down tool\n- Network cable tester\n- Cable stripper\n- Keystone jacks\n- RJ45 connectors\n- Patch cables\n- Network couplers (for relocation scenarios)\n\n**Materials**\n\n- **Cat6 cable (technician supplied, reimbursable)**\n- Anchors, screws, zip ties, Velcro, J-hooks as needed\n\n**Verification &amp; Support**\n\n- **ALL technicians must contact our Help Desk** to:\n- Confirm camera placement\n- Verify camera view alignment before leaving site\n- Support hours:\n- **8:30 AM – 5:30 PM Eastern Standard Time (EST)**\n- Even if the store is in another time zone, **support hours remain EST**\n\n**Important Time Zone Example**\n\n- If a store is in **Pacific Standard Time**\n- Technician starts work at **4:00 PM PST**\n- This equals **7:00 PM EST**\n- ❌ **Support will NOT be available**\n\n**Scheduling Rules (Very Important)**\n\n- **Hard start time: 10:00 AM (local store time)**\n- **DO NOT request any start time earlier**\n- Stores are closed\n- No access to unlock doors\n- Store hours:\n- **10:00 AM – 6:00 PM**\n\nFailure to follow scheduling rules may result in **negative feedback**.\n\n**Experience Requirements**\n\n- This is **NOT an entry-level job**\n- Only technicians experienced with:\n- IP cameras\n- Network cabling\n- PoE switching\n- Commercial environments\n- should apply.\n\n**Additional Notes**\n\n- A **CompanyCam link** will be provided as a **reference example (** <https://app.companycam.com/projects/117479500/photos> )\n- The example site **may not match** the exact layout of your assigned location\n- It is provided **for general expectations only**\n\n**COMPANYCAM LINK TO VIEW SAMPLE PRIME STORAGE STORES**\n\n**Professional Etiquette &amp; Representation:**\n\n- You are representing **NETCOM** while on-site.\n- **Do not** mention Field Nation, third-party platforms, or your independent contractor status to the site staff or manager. If asked, you are a field technician dispatching on behalf of NETCOM.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T10:00","end":"2026-11-04T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":40.64528042438343},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-02T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-03T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Network Refresh Tech 1"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1793718871773}
