{"job":{"id":20299372,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Inverse Technology Solutions","title":"Switch Replacement - NETGEAR M4300-52G-PoE+ (2IDF/3IDF)","description":{"html":"<p>Two network switches (2IDF South and 3IDF) have failed and are being replaced with new NETGEAR M4300-52G-PoE+ units. Replacement switches are shipping directly to the community and are expected onsite by end of day 11/3.</p><p><strong>Technician Will:</strong></p><ul><li>Check in with site maintenance contact (Robert Provencal) on arrival.</li><li>Locate the failed switch in 2IDF South; power down, disconnect all cabling (photograph port/cable layout before disconnecting), remove unit, and install the new NETGEAR M4300-52G-PoE+ in its place, reconnecting all cabling exactly as documented.</li><li>Repeat the swap for the failed switch in 3IDF.</li><li>Power on both new switches and confirm uplinks/ports show link lights and pass traffic.</li><li>Photograph both completed installs before departing.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Business casual, clean attire and presentable.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Contact Project Manager if the following are true:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, please contact&nbsp;<strong>Project Manager</strong></li><li><strong>Any issues or questions should be escalated to the Project Manager</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p>Necessary Telecom Tools: Camera/Phone, Buttset, Toner, 66/110 Punch Down Tools, etc.</p><p>Tasks are listed below.</p>","markdown":"Two network switches (2IDF South and 3IDF) have failed and are being replaced with new NETGEAR M4300-52G-PoE+ units. Replacement switches are shipping directly to the community and are expected onsite by end of day 11/3.\n\n**Technician Will:**\n\n- Check in with site maintenance contact (Robert Provencal) on arrival.\n- Locate the failed switch in 2IDF South; power down, disconnect all cabling (photograph port/cable layout before disconnecting), remove 