{"job":{"id":"3371807188","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT","description":"This is a VTM/CUT OVER<br><br>Technician will arrive at 10 am local and meet with Segra technician. <br>Verify with Segra why not traffic can pass through with their equipment and cut over circuit with activations.<br><br>CID: APEXNCVN/UNI00AA/APEXNCVN<br>IP: 134.6.249.74 - 134.6.249.78<br>GW: 134.6.249.73<br>SN: 255.255.255.248<br>DMARC: DEMARC: 1st floor | Wall mount | Cisco 540 | Port 0 VLAN 320<br><br>Activations ticket: <br>Must verify with Sophia Hou for Cut over 251.661.1275<br>Activations: 888-860-1159, Option 2<br><br>Materials needed: <br>Laptop (Windows XP or higher with admin rights) with PuTTY installed, a 10/100 network card or better, and Wi-Fi capability<br>Laptop charger<br>Console cable<br>Extension cord<br>Hotspot and hotspot charger<br>Minimum 25 ft. Cat6 cabling<br>1-foot and 6-foot Cat6 patch cords<br>6 ft. ladder<br>Cable wall mounts<br>Torque wrench and screws<br>Cable ties<br><br>Please clean up and take pictures of circuit and speed tests after cut over is complete.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-05T10:00","end":"2026-11-05T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":11.8},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Thu, Nov 5, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Thu, Nov 5, Fri, Nov 6, Mon, Nov 9 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000