{"job":{"id":20301464,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"CMOS Battery Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>Dispenser's computer has lost it's BIOS settings and now won't boot properly.&nbsp;We need the 2032 battery replaced on the motherboard, and then the settings entered in.&nbsp;<strong>Purchase a 2032 coin battery, upload a copy of the receipt and put in an expense request.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Be sure to bring a keyboard with you, as we do not know for sure if this dispenser will still have it's keyboard.</strong>&nbsp;A guide to the BIOS settings are attached to&nbsp;this work order.&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span></p>","markdown":"Dispenser's computer has lost it's BIOS settings and now won't boot properly. We need the 2032 battery replaced on the motherboard, and then the settings entered in. **Purchase a 2032 coin battery, upload a copy of the receipt and put in an expense request.** **Be sure to bring a keyboard with you, as we do not know for sure if this dispenser will still have it's keyboard.** A guide to the BIOS settings are attached to this work order.\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T09:00","end":"2026-11-04T10:00","latestStart":"2026-11-04T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":11.753265063373444},