{"job":{"id":20302742,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Wand Corporation","title":"Install (4) 43\" Digital Menu Board Displays - Tech 1 - 5710 Moe's Southwest Grill","description":{"html":"<p>Customer has existing signage that is failing. Replacing with new 43\" displays mounted horizontally on rail wall mount. New mounts and install kits have been sent to the site. </p><p>Screens are pre-assigned in the following order from Left to Right, please make sure to install in order so content plays correctly: </p><p>Display 1: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">608RMCJ7G587</span></p><p>Display 2: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">608RMEN7G524</span></p><p>Display 3: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">608RMQK7G588</span></p><p>Display 4: <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">608RMHR7G585</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Please provide counteroffers for additional pay/travel if needed and will be reviewed during assignment process.</strong></p><p><strong><em><u>DO NOT call or message us requesting&nbsp;work orders&nbsp;or with any questions about work orders.&nbsp;They are available to provide support for onsite techs.&nbsp;Anything additional should be done through the Field Nation portal and&nbsp;may result in you being removed from our provider network or totally blocked.&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"> </strong><strong>**Rate includes all travel related expenses (fuel, tolls, etc.).&nbsp;Submit a counteroffer if additional is required.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"> </strong><strong>**Tech assigned on Field Nation must be primary tech onsite for the job or payment may be withheld.&nbsp;Any exceptions must be approved by us first through the portal.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Failure to complete all work listed in description/SOW may result in reduced payment for work order.</strong></p><p><strong><em>Please use the FN counteroffer system if any issues with dates and/or pricing and we will