 review among all qualifying bids.&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"> REQUIRED TOOLS:</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Metal cutting tools in case you need to shorten a bracket mostly aluminum rail.&nbsp;</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Drill Bit sets - Please note Diamond Drill bits required for Tile wall installs.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;USB Keyboard and Mouse</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Ladder (2 ladders. Standard as well as step ladder)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Tool bag/carrier&nbsp;with standard installation equipment (drills, tape measure, screw driver, masking tape etc)</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Drop cloth to cover onsite surfaces and equipment.</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hard Hat, Safety Glasses, Vest, Field Boots (May be used for new construction)</p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"> </strong><em>Thank&nbsp;you for your interest and we look forward to working with you!</em></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em><u> *****************************************************************************</u></em></strong></p>","markdown":"Customer has existing signage that is failing. Replacing with new 43\" displays mounted horizontally on rail wall mount. New mounts and install kits have been sent to the site.\n\nScreens are pre-assigned in the following order from Left to Right, please make sure to install in order so content plays correctly:\n\nDisplay 1: 608RMCJ7G587\n\nDisplay 2: 608RMEN7G524\n\nDisplay 3: 608RMQK7G588\n\nDisplay 4: 608RMHR7G585\n\n**Please provide counteroffers for additional pay/travel if needed and will be reviewed during assignment process.**\n\n***DO NOT call or message us requesting work orders or with any questions about work orders. They are available to provide support for onsite techs. Anything additional should be done through the Field Nation portal and may result in you being removed from our provider network or totally blocked.***\n\n **\\*\\*Rate includes all travel related expenses (fuel, tolls, etc.). Submit a counteroffer if additional is required.**\n\n **\\*\\*Tech assigned on Field Nation must be primary tech onsite for the job or payment may be withheld. Any exceptions must be approved by us first through the portal.**\n\n**Failure to complete all work listed in description/SOW may result in reduced payment for work order.**\n\n***Please use the FN counteroffer system if any issues with dates and/or pricing and we will review among all qualifying bids.***\n\n **REQUIRED TOOLS:**\n\n· Metal cutting tools in case you need to shorten a bracket mostly aluminum rail.\n\n· Drill Bit sets - Please note Diamond Drill bits required for Tile wall installs.\n\n· USB Keyboard and Mouse\n\n· Ladder (2 ladders. Standard as well as step ladder)\n\n· Tool bag/carrier with standard installation equipment (drills, tape measure, screw driver, masking tape etc)\n\n· Drop cloth to cover onsite surfaces and equipment.\n\n· Hard Hat, Safety Glasses, Vest, Field Boots (May be used for new construction)\n\n *Thank you for your interest and we look forward to working with you!*\n\n ***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\****","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T07:00","end":"2026-11-12T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9.935732570718498},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"displays\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:00