ic Onsite Technician Documentation – via SharePoint Folder Link [VERY IMPORTANT]</strong><strong>:</strong>&nbsp;<del>***********************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************************</del></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong><del>***</del>_Install Guides</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Link (DO NOT PRINT, JUST DOWNLOAD TO LAPTOP/TABLET as the guide is too large to print):&nbsp;</strong>https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004hWdR/SsXKY4rG0i77fuyiNWtICR2utNJzPdwNCmrjgveVreQ</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong><del>*** </del>Remodel - Tool &amp; Material List</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Link</strong>:&nbsp;https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004hWdT/6tK9AbDXiMXWQ3ErLSVIvgM6TU7k.3gQB3jSDp6dXR8</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong><del>*** ***</del>_Remodel_MOODLE Coursework Training Link</strong>:&nbsp;https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004hWdS/13XUqDuiwiOPWUoTws4Mopf0J7a9KOE09wftrGrGCM8</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(234, 8, 8);\"><em><u>Important: IF THIS IS YOUR FIRST TIME ASSIGNED TO COMPLETE THIS SCOPE OF WORK FOR TJX REMODELS:</u></em></strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong><u>Tech&nbsp;</u>MUS</strong>T&nbsp;<strong>complete</strong>&nbsp;<strong><del>*** ***</del> Frontline Installation Pre-Training Coursework via Moodle</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Training/Coursework takes ~45 Minutes</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Training Coursework&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;be completed at least&nbsp;<strong>2 Days PRIOR</strong>&nbsp;to your first night onsite</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>For Registration &amp; Login Information to complete the course</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>refer to this document&nbsp;</strong>-download to view full document:&nbsp;<strong><del>*** ***</del>_Remodel_MOODLE Coursework Training.v1</strong>&nbsp;<strong>L