mp; provide the **SECURITY CODE to gain access**\n- **Call &amp; Check-In with the \\*\\*\\* RTC Remote Technician Team via the provided Bridge Line**\n\n**ONSITE: Work with \\*\\*\\* Remote RTC Team while onsite &amp; refer to the Store Specific and General Project Level Technician Documentation.**\n\n- Perform a Walkthrough with MOD - refer to the install guide / other technical documentation for more details / full process\n- Perform Inventory - refer to install guide / other technical documentation for more details / full process\n- Work with Remote Bridge Line to determine if Site is ready to begin work for the night or if the night’s work needs aborted.\n- Continue to work with / provide updates to the Remote Bridge Line, closure to the end of the night you may be required to provide more frequent updates.\n- Some nights and/or mornings you will be working with the General Contractor Onsite and Store MOD to obtain/provide updates and/or complete specific task.\n\n**CLOSING OUT | COMPLETE BEFORE LEAVING SITE:**\n\n- **Complete Nightly Completion Items** - Refer to the Install Guide for nightly completion items. \\[I.E. nightly clean up / trash disposals, photos needing captured / provided to the bridge line, check-out requirements.\n- **Store Completion Deliverables \\[Not Nightly but At Frontline Completion and Overall Store Remodel Completion\\]:**\n- FLUIX Online Deliverable – Lead Technician will need to complete two various deliverables at / towards the completion of the STORE \\[ FRONTLINE COMPLETION &amp; FULL STORE COMPLETION\\]. Technician will need to submit these and have them reviewed by the **\\*\\*\\* REMOTE RTC BRIDGELINE.** \\[If deliverable session is interrupted, choose “In progress” to avoid losing work.\\]\n- **Check-Out with \\*\\*\\* Remote RTC Team via Bridge Line**\n- **Check-Out** with Manager On Duty / Onsite POC\n- **Call** - Essintial Project Team @ 855-612-2183 opt 2 to perform your final check out\n- **Check-Out on your WO** - if you are unable to do so then you **MUST** call Essintial @ 855-612-2183 to check in. **NOTE**: Your Check In and Check Out times must all match *(Work Order Platform and Final Check Out with Essintial)*\n\n**Closing / Completion Notes:**\n\n- Detailed Description of the Work that took Place, including any issues.\n\n**ESCALATION:**\n\n- Support Related / Issues Onsite related to the Scope of Work / Support should be escalated directly to the \\*\\*\\* Remote RTC Team via the provided Bridge Line\n- All other issues should be escalated directly to the Essintial Project Team @ 855-612-2183 opt 2\n\n**PHYSICAL REQUIREMENTS:** Must be able to bend, kneel, stand and lift, carry 50lbs repeatedly for extended periods of time.\n\n**DRESS CODE:** Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no T-Shirts, Jeans or holes - A collared or button-down shirts (no t-shirts), slacks, and nice shoes.\n\n**Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy:**\n\n- All expenses such as tolls, parking, materials must be pre-approved and accompanied by a receipt. Reimbursements will not be increased to cover markups of any kind.\n- Technicians must contact Essintial for any deviations from the scheduled service date or time. No payment will be granted for work performed prior to the scheduled start time.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T05:45","end":"2026-11-06T11:45"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":210},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":57.54261305786768},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},