parts.</p><p>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.</p><p>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.</p><p>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.</p><p>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.</p><p>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T08:00","end":"2026-11-04T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":39},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $72.4910836 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T20:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-04T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"2 Granite ticket"},{"start":"2026-11-04T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"Kinettix Inc, Direct Onboarding - Vinson Services LLC -"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 11/05/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-1