{"job":{"id":20304792,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"Stryker - Small Site Visit (2 hours)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>*All work order deliverables must be completed same day to prevent payment issues and possible penalties</u></strong></p><p>**While onsite, you are to represent Pomeroy Only**, Upon arrival, please be sure to properly identify yourself. Providers may be turned away if they fail to provider identification. Provider may need to have a driver's license for identification.</p><p>***Providers need to call Pomeroy Dispatch 704-414-5131, to report any delays, issues, or if they are going beyond the allotted time in the work order, to obtain approval. All expenses must be preauthorized prior to accepting work order</p><p>***Provider must contact site contact prior to arrival***</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Information from Client Ticket:</u></strong></p><p>DURHAM NC</p><p>THIS IS TO SCHEDULE A SINGLE VISIT ANY WEEKDAY DURING THE WEEK OF 11/9</p><p><br></p><p>follow attached checklist while on site</p><p><br></p><p>. DO NOT SCHEDULE ON WEDNESDAY</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>ASSIGNED TECH WILL NEED TO CONFIRM DATE AND TIME OF SCHEDULED VISIT WITH LISTED POC</p><p><br></p><p>STL: BELINDA.BREYTENBACH@STRYKER.COM P: 1 919-433-3325</p><p><br></p><p>On Site Contact Name:&nbsp;</p><p>On Site Contact Phone:&nbsp;</p><p>On Site Contact Email:&nbsp;</p><p>Problem Type: DEPLOYMENT PROJECT - SEE NOTES</p><p>Location Subtype:&nbsp;</p><p>Lane Number (if applicable):&nbsp;</p><p>Client Ticket Number/External Reference ID:&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>This is for mid-month visit to for a duration of 2 hours</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">1) Arrive at site and immediately check in site contact to see if there are any issues needing attention. If yes, attend to those issues.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">2) Perform an active check on all conference rooms</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">a. Are you able to connect your computer to display screen?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">b. Are you able to make an audio call?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">c. Are you able to join Teams meeting?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">i. Can you share your screen?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">ii. Can you hear audio on both sides?</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">d. If any issues with conference room equipment, try troubleshooting to best of ability but if issues persists, please report to regional service manager to have a ticket opened. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">4) Check to ensure that printers are online and not presenting an error on the display screen.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">a. If displaying error, troubleshoot to best of ability and report if it continues to display an error.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">5) Do a generic walk though of the building to capture any remaining last minute issues.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Communication Requirements:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Any issues with scheduling, running late, unable to show up, etc. MUST BE CALLED IN TO THE Pomeroy Dispatch Center. Messages left on the platform are not acceptable forms of communication. This will result in penalties, negative ratings, being unassigned from the work order, and may affect future work for our company.</li><li>Please be sure your Voicemail is functional as if we need to leave a message it needs to be accessible.</li><li>You must capture and report the name of any Customer and or Pomeroy staff spoken with while servicing this work order in your close out notes.</li></ol>","markdown":"**\\*All work order deliverables must be completed same day to prevent payment issues and possible penalties**\n\n\\*\\*While onsite, you are to represent Pomeroy Only\\*\\*, Upon arrival, please be sure to properly identify yourself. Providers may be turned away if they fail to provider identification. Provider may need to have a driver's license for identification.\n\n\\*\\*\\*Providers need to call Pomeroy Dispatch 704-414-5131, to report any delays, issues, or if they are going beyond the allotted time in the work order, to obtain approval. All expenses must be preauthorized prior to accepting work order\n\n\\*\\*\\*Provider must contact site contact prior to arrival\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Information from Client Ticket:**\n\nDURHAM NC\n\nTHIS IS TO SCHEDULE A SINGLE VISIT ANY WEEKDAY DURING THE WEEK OF 11/9\n\nfollow attached checklist while on site\n\n. DO NOT SCHEDULE ON WEDNESDAY\n\nASSIGNED TECH WILL NEED TO CONFIRM DATE AND TIME OF SCHEDULED VISIT WITH LISTED POC\n\nSTL: BELINDA.BREYTENBACH@STRYKER.COM P: 1 919-433-3325\n\nOn Site Contact Name:\n\nOn Site Contact Phone:\n\nOn Site Contact Email:\n\nProblem Type: DEPLOYMENT PROJECT - SEE NOTES\n\nLocation Subtype:\n\nLane Number (if applicable):\n\nClient Ticket Number/External Reference ID:\n\n**This is for mid-month visit to for a duration of 2 hours**\n\n1\\) Arrive at site and immediately check in site contact to see if there are any issues needing attention. If yes, attend to those issues.\n\n2\\) Perform an active check on all conference rooms\n\na. Are you able to connect your computer to display screen?\n\nb. Are you able to make an audio call?\n\nc. Are you able to join Teams meeting?\n\ni. Can you share your screen?\n\nii. Can you hear audio on both sides?\n\nd. If any issues with conference room equipment, try troubleshooting to best of ability but if issues persists, please report to regional service manager to have a ticket opened.\n\n4\\) Check to ensure that printers are online and not presenting an error on the display screen.\n\na. If displaying error, troubleshoot to best of ability and report if it continues to display an error.\n\n5\\) Do a generic walk though of the building to capture any remaining last minute issues.\n\n**Communication Requirements:**\n\n1. Any issues with scheduling, running late, unable to show up, etc. MUST BE CALLED IN TO THE Pomeroy Dispatch Center. Messages left on the platform are not acceptable forms of communication. This will result in penalties, negative ratings, being unassigned from the work order, and may affect future work for our company.\n2. Please be sure your Voicemail is functional as if we need to leave a message it needs to be accessible.\n3. You must capture and report the name of any Customer and or Pomeroy staff spoken with while servicing this work order in your close out notes.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T10:00","end":"2026-11-13T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":35,"max":70},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":35,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8.333959233179199},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 11/05/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000