{"job":{"id":"1088626603","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Concert Technologies","title":"Install ADVA and Test out with NOC Engineer","description":"<p>**START TIME IS HARD-START. PLEASE DO NOT APPLY IF YOU ARE UNABLE TO ARRIVE ON-SITE BY THE SLATED TIME**</p><p>Need a smart Hands technician to install and ADVA router and test out with a NOC engineer</p><p>Tools Required to complete Installation. Network/ Computer SAVVY technician required – This is a requirement!</p><p>- Laptop w/ Windows 10 or better</p><p>- USB-RJ45 female rollover</p><p>- RJ45-DB9 cable</p><p>- DB9-USB cable</p><p>- Blue Cisco console cable</p><p>- USB-A - USB-A</p><p>- Cat6 Ethernet patch cord for PC connection to equipment</p><p>- Emulator Software (Putty or Tera Term)</p><p>- Hot-Spot or wireless access (Not the customers)</p><p>- Remote Access Computer Software (Quick Assist and/or AnyDesk)</p><p>- Label maker</p><p>Technicians must conform to the following requirements:</p><p>1. Must have and be able to produce a State issued Driver?s License while onsite for Concert Technologies</p><p>2. Must bring the Concert Technologies Work Order/Packet to site</p><p>3. Must not bring any contraband, weapons, or illegal items to site</p><p>4. Must present and maintain a professional manner while onsite for Concert Technologies</p><p>5. If you are being shipped materials/equipment, you will be responsible for it until it?s installed on site or sent back to the Concert Warehouse</p><p>***PLEASE WEAR A FACEMASK***</p><p>**Tech must also call for any reason that may delay prompt arrival. Failure to do so may result in modified or non -payment</p><p>&nbsp;</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T09:00","end":"2026-11-09T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":61.34332443,"max":184.02997329},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":61.34332443,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":91.4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $184.0