{"job":{"id":20308842,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spectrotel","title":"Install 2 Network Cables","description":{"html":"<p><strong><em>Please read the below before accepting this work order. There is a very strict timeline for this work order that needs to be followed. There will be no exceptions unless it has been worked out before dispatch with work order manager. Tech must have all materials below before reporting to site.</em></strong></p><p><strong>TECH IS TO CALL ONCE ON SITE TO CHECK AND REVIEW SCOPE OF WORK. </strong></p><ol><li><strong>TECH MUST BRING TWO BOXES OF CAT 6 CABLE WITH MINIMUM OF 500FT AND 2 - 2 PORT BACK BOXES WITH KEYSTONE JACKS. CABLE RUNS WILL BE BETWEEN 70-250 FT. TECH WILL </strong></li><li><strong>ALSO NEED TO BRING ADHESIVE - TWO SIDED TAPE FOR THE FLOOR MOLDING THAT HAS BEEN SHIPPED TO SITE IF FLOOR MOLDING WILL NEED TO BE USED.</strong></li><li><strong>TECH MUST BRING 8FT LADDER.</strong></li></ol><p>Tech is to install 2 new cables from back of store modem/ camera area to front cash wrap. If the tech cannot run cables, tech is to perform site survey and provide written quote for labor and materials on form attached to work order.</p><ol><li>Locate IOC/IOF modem and test for connection and speeds.Depending on modem location, modem may need to be extended or moved to the camera area.</li><li>Install, terminate, test and label 2 new cat6 cables from modem/camera area to under front cash wrap below network firewall which is located under POS terminal on front counter.</li><li>Tech will secure cables along existing conduit/cable pathway based on store layout.</li><li>Floor molding if needed will be on site.</li><li>Misc: Zip Ty's,Velcro, Scres, etc.</li></ol><p><strong>TECH IS TO PROVIDE PHOTOS OF ALL WORK PERFORMED ON SITE.</strong></p><p><strong>***If tech is not able to run cable a site work becomes a site survey, tech is expected for a return visit to complete the cabling work***</strong></p><p><strong>Tech is to survey a run of 2 new cables from the back office, where camera equipment and modems are located, to the front cash wrap. </strong></p><p><strong>Tech must fill out the attached site survey pricing form and complete work order with-in 48 hours or the tech will not be paid for work order. </strong></p><p><strong>TECH IS TO PROVIDE PHOTOS DETAILING WHERE CABLE AND SURFACE MOUNT BOXES ARE TO BE INSTALLED INCLUDING NETWORK EQUIPMENT.</strong></p><p><strong>****Tech MUST return to site to complete the cabling work for the pricing provided to Spectrotel.***</strong></p><p><strong>FAILURE TO COMPLETE ALL PARTS OF THE DELIVERABLES WILL RESULT IN CANCELATION OF THE WORK ORDER AND WILL FORFEIT ANY PAYMENT TO PROVIDER.</strong></p><p><p>Scope of Work:</p></p>","markdown":"***Please read the below before accepting this work order. There is a very strict timeline for this work order that needs to be followed. There will be no exceptions unless it has been worked out before dispatch with work order manager. Tech must have all materials below before reporting to site.***\n\n**TECH IS TO CALL ONCE ON SITE TO CHECK AND REVIEW SCOPE OF WORK.**\n\n1. **TECH MUST BRING TWO BOXES OF CAT 6 CABLE WITH MINIMUM OF 500FT AND 2 - 2 PORT BACK BOXES WITH KEYSTONE JACKS. CABLE RUNS WILL BE BETWEEN 70-250 FT. TECH WILL**\n2. **ALSO NEED TO BRING ADHESIVE - TWO SIDED TAPE FOR THE FLOOR MOLDING THAT HAS BEEN SHIPPED TO SITE IF FLOOR MOLDING WILL NEED TO BE USED.**\n3. **TECH MUST BRING 8FT LADDER.**\n\nTech is to install 2 new cables from back of store modem/ camera area to front cash wrap. If the tech cannot run cables, tech is to perform site survey and provide written quote for labor and materials on form attached to work order.\n\n1. Locate IOC/IOF modem and test for connection and speeds.Depending on modem location, modem may need to be extended or moved to the camera area.\n2. Install, terminate, test and label 2 new cat6 cables from modem/camera area to under front cash wrap below network firewall which is located under POS terminal on front counter.\n3. Tech will secure cables along existing conduit/cable pathway based on store layout.\n4. Floor molding if needed will be on site.\n5. Misc: Zip Ty's,Velcro, Scres, etc.\n\n**TECH IS TO PROVIDE PHOTOS OF ALL WORK PERFORMED ON SITE.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*If tech is not able to run cable a site work becomes a site survey, tech is expected for a return visit to complete the cabling work\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Tech is to survey a run of 2 new cables from the back office, where camera equipment and modems are located, to the front cash wrap.**\n\n**Tech must fill out the attached site survey pricing form and complete work order with-in 48 hours or the tech will not be paid for work order.**\n\n**TECH IS TO PROVIDE PHOTOS DETAILING WHERE CABLE AND SURFACE MOUNT BOXES ARE TO BE INSTALLED INCLUDING NETWORK EQUIPMENT.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*Tech MUST return to site to complete the cabling work for the pricing provided to Spectrotel.\\*\\*\\***\n\n**FAILURE TO COMPLETE ALL PARTS OF THE DELIVERABLES WILL RESULT IN CANCELATION OF THE WORK ORDER AND WILL FORFEIT ANY PAYMENT TO PROVIDER.**\n\nScope of Work:","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-16T10:00","end":"2026-11-16T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14.322271471881747},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-18T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-19T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-19T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-20T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11