{"job":{"id":20242508,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ImageQuest Managed Services","title":"NC-ABERDEEN-58524: Install 3 APs [SR-2652151]","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Tech will need:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Laptop with ethernet port and CAT6 cable</li>\n<li>A fully charged mobile phone.</li>\n<li>Box of Cat6 cable with RJ45s/48s, if needed, to replace any bad cables/plugs (or a variety of new CAT6 cables of various lengths)</li>\n<li>Cable tester, toner w/ probe, crimper</li>\n<li>10-12' Ladder</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TECH SOW:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tech will need to install APs</li>\n<li>Tech will need to Work with MSP: Viking Cloud (877-556-8279) to confirm device is online and configured correctly. Reference ticket#:&nbsp;<strong>9861450</strong></li>\n<li>Tech will need to assist with any additional IT needs.</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Tech will need:**\n\n- Laptop with ethernet port and CAT6 cable\n- A fully charged mobile phone.\n- Box of Cat6 cable with RJ45s/48s, if needed, to replace any bad cables/plugs (or a variety of new CAT6 cables of various lengths)\n- Cable tester, toner w/ probe, crimper\n- 10-12' Ladder\n\n**TECH SOW:**\n\n- Tech will need to install APs\n- Tech will need to Work with MSP: Viking Cloud (877-556-8279) to confirm device is online and configured correctly. Reference ticket#: **9861450**\n- Tech will need to assist with any additional IT needs.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T10:00","end":"2026-11-04T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-04T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":88,"max":264},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":88,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":65.36597727113677},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/4/2026, 10:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-04T20:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-04T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-0