{"job":{"id":20306961,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Scarsdale Security Systems Inc","title":"Scarsdale Ticket #849951 - Technician to provide & replace (1) CR123A battery at ZN 12 \"Service Room Motion\" (sn 0169924, Loop 1).   MUST CALL TO HAVE ZN 12 PROGRAMMED BACK INTO PANEL - test operation  See notes for details.","description":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Technician to provide &amp; replace (1) CR123A battery at ZN 12 \"Service Room Motion\" (sn 0169924, Loop 1). MUST CALL TO HAVE ZN 12 PROGRAMMED BACK INTO PANEL - test operation See notes for details.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>YOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS IN THE CONFIDENTIAL INFO SECTION OF THIS WORK ORDER !! Thank You.</strong></li>\n<li>IF A PART NEEDS TO BE REPLACED, DOCUMENT THE MAKE, MODEL AND SERIAL NUMBER OF DEVICE. PROVIDE NOTES AS TO WHY PART MUST BE REPLACED. UPLOAD PICTURE TO WORK ORDER.</li>\n<li>***IMPORTANT** If a part needs to be replaced DOCUMENT the make, model, serial #. MUST PROVIDE NOTES as to WHY the part needs replaced (I.E. Damaged? Physically missing? Remodeling? Provide these DETAILS and upload picture to work order and/or email to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com Use provided return label to return ship any unused parts.</li>\n<li>FOR SYSTEM ON-TEST OR TECHNICAL SUPPORT WHEN ON SITE CALL 914-722-2933 BETWEEN 8 AM AND 7:30 PM EST MON - FRI.</li>\n<li>**BEFORE LEAVING SITE*** Technician MUST email notes/resolution to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com OR call 914-722-2933 and speak to one of our National Account Team Members</li>\n<li>RF BATTERY REPLACEMENT -- a) Verify transmitter serial number to ensure it is correct detector/transmitter, b) Replace CR123A, press transmitter reset button. c) Ensure transmitter housing is properly closed/seated and test operation. d) Ensure detector resumes normal operation and that Restore signals are received at central station. (Must perform Sensor Reset) ** *DMP wireless systems REQUIRE Sensor Reset at keypad before restore signal is sent. Extreme cases may also require J16 panel reset. ** * Ademco/Honeywell system may require reset to restore wireless (CODE + OFF two times in a row at keypad) ** * INOVONICS - Requires receiver reset - Press/Release RESET button on Inovonics receiver, replace cover. **--Call Scarsdale 914-722-2933 to verify signals and for programming assistance &amp; support --**</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"- **Technician to provide &amp; replace (1) CR123A battery at ZN 12 \"Service Room Motion\" (sn 0169924, Loop 1). MUST CALL TO HAVE ZN 12 PROGRAMMED BACK INTO PANEL - test operation See notes for details.**\n- **YOU MUST FOLLOW THE INSTRUCTIONS IN THE CONFIDENTIAL INFO SECTION OF THIS WORK ORDER !! Thank You.**\n- IF A PART NEEDS TO BE REPLACED, DOCUMENT THE MAKE, MODEL AND SERIAL NUMBER OF DEVICE. PROVIDE NOTES AS TO WHY PART MUST BE REPLACED. UPLOAD PICTURE TO WORK ORDER.\n- \\*\\*\\*IMPORTANT\\*\\* If a part needs to be replaced DOCUMENT the make, model, serial #. MUST PROVIDE NOTES as to WHY the part needs replaced (I.E. Damaged? Physically missing? Remodeling? Provide these DETAILS and upload picture to work order and/or email to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com Use provided return label to return ship any unused parts.\n- FOR SYSTEM ON-TEST OR TECHNICAL SUPPORT WHEN ON SITE CALL 914-722-2933 BETWEEN 8 AM AND 7:30 PM EST MON - FRI.\n- \\*\\*BEFORE LEAVING SITE\\*\\*\\* Technician MUST email notes/resolution to nationalservice@scarsdalesecurity.com OR call 914-722-2933 and speak to one of our National Account Team Members\n- RF BATTERY REPLACEMENT -- a) Verify transmitter serial number to ensure it is correct detector/transmitter, b) Replace CR123A, press transmitter reset button. c) Ensure transmitter housing is properly closed/seated and test operation. d) Ensure detector resumes normal operation and that Restore signals are received at central station. (Must perform Sensor Reset) \\*\\* \\*DMP wireless systems REQUIRE Sensor Reset at keypad before restore signal is sent. Extreme cases may also require J16 panel reset. \\*\\* \\* Ademco/Honeywell system may require reset to restore wireless (CODE + OFF two times in a row at keypad) \\*\\* \\* INOVONICS - Requires receiver reset - Press/Release RESET button on Inovonics receiver, replace cover. \\*\\*--Call Scarsdale 914-722-2933 to verify signals and for programming assistance &amp; support --\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-11T10:00","end":"2026-11-11T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.481675342033638},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $85 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 11/05/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summar