{"job":{"id":20306300,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pursuant Health","title":"Replace Touchscreen and Configure/Calibrate New Screen, Replace Monitor Cable(s) and PM Kiosk","description":{"html":"<ul><li>A Release Code must be obtained upon completion of the work order, prior to leaving the site. <strong>Failure to obtain Release Code</strong> will result in deduction and/or cancellation of the work order.</li><li>CAUTION: Do not plug any power tools or cleaning devices into the kiosk’s internal power strips. Doing so may result in blown fuses and system failure. Use only approved connections as directed.</li><li>CONNECT to WIFI - Poor connection may result in difficulties accessing work instructions and contacting support. If you are having connectivity issues please connect to the site&#39;s WIFI connection.</li><li>REMOVE MIRROR BOX (FM kiosks only) - Is a mirror box currently installed in kiosk? If so, remove and set aside for disposal. Instructions: https://bit.ly/KioskMirrorBox</li><li><strong>Replace the Kiosk Touchscreen Monitor and Configure/Calibrate New Screen</strong><br /><ul><li>Please refer to the step-by-step guide in the link below:</li><li>https://bit.ly/MAVDisplay</li></ul></li><li><strong>Replace the Touchscreen Power Brick</strong><br /></li><li><strong>Replace the Touchscreen USB Cable and Configure/Calibrate Display</strong><br /><ul><li>Please refer to the step-by-step guide in the link below:</li><li>https://bit.ly/MAVDisplay</li></ul></li><li>STOP BUTTON PHOTO (FM and PH kiosks only) - Verify the stop button is wired and secured correctly, then take a clear photo showing the wiring/mounting hardware. This photo will be needed during the checkout process to obtain your release code.</li></ul>","markdown":"- A Release Code must be obtained upon completion of the work order, prior to leaving the site. **Failure to obtain Release Code** will result in deduction and/or cancellation of the work order.\n- CAUTION: Do not plug any power tools