{"job":{"id":20306794,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"S-Net Communications","title":"Marcos Pizza 8678 SDWAN INSTALL","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seeking a technician with experience in: Network hardware installation and remote support collaboration.</li>\n<li><strong>Tech is required to:&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Estimated duration will be:&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Dress Code:&nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tools Required</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard networking hand tools (screwdrivers, crimpers, etc.).</li>\n<li>Console cable and laptop for remote session assistance.</li>\n<li>Cell phone for communication with S-NET Engineer.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>(SEE TASKS section For Job Checklist)</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pre-Site Requirements:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><br /></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>On-Site Tasks:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact, <strong><del>*** ******</del></strong><del>*</del> You represent S-NET Communications while onsite.</li>\n<li>Call the S-NET Engineer immediately upon arrival at<del>*******</del> <del>*****</del></li>\n<li>Install and assist in testing the SDWAN Appliance, Switch, and Access Point.</li>\n<li>Install Cabinet.</li>\n<li>Connect the equipment to the existing circuit as directed by the S-NET Engineer.</li>\n<li>Follow all specific technical directions provided by the S-NET Engineer.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Required On-Site Deliverables:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><br /></li>\n<li>Check-out of work order.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Communication Directory</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with:<del>***** ***********</del></li>\n<li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to: <del>***** ****** ** *************</del></li>\n<li>IF you're unable to reach WO Manager, back up contact: S-NET Engineer (as contacted upon arrival).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Any travel expenses must be applied as a counter-offer when requesting the work in order to get approved.</li>\n<li>Any additional hours must be requested and approved by WO Manager.</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**Overview**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in: Network hardware installation and remote support collaboration.\n- **Tech is required to:**\n- **Estimated duration will be:**\n- **Dress Code:**\n\n**Tools Required**\n\n- Standard networking hand tools (screwdrivers, crimpers, etc.).\n- Console cable and laptop for remote session assistance.\n- Cell phone for communication with S-NET Engineer.\n\n**Scope of Work**\n\n***(SEE TASKS section For Job Checklist)***\n\n**Pre-Site Requirements:**\n\n- \n\n**On-Site Tasks:**\n\n- Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact, **\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\\* You represent S-NET Communications while onsite.\n- Call the S-NET Engineer immediately upon arrival at\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Install and assist in testing the SDWAN Appliance, Switch, and Access Point.\n- Install Cabinet.\n- Connect the equipment to the existing circuit as directed by the S-NET Engineer.\n- Follow all specific technical directions provided by the S-NET Engineer.\n\n**Required On-Site Deliverables:**\n\n- \n- Check-out of work order.\n\n**Communication Directory**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with:\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- IF you're unable to reach WO Manager, back up contact: S-NET Engineer (as contacted upon arrival).\n\n**Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Any travel expenses must be applied as a counter-offer when requesting the work in order to get approved.\n- Any additional hours must be requested and approved by WO Manager.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T08:00","end":"2026-11-06T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":12.660789785066118},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $195 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 11/05/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19: