{"job":{"id":"6050337373","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1133023.1 HP CLJ M479FDN - Constant jamming","description":"<p>Customer Reference: 49650 --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- STARGEL OFFICE SOLUTIONS</p><p><br></p><p>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---</p><p>ETA pending parts delivery, Dispatch will update you with parts tracking once tracking becomes available.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must confirm the serial number and the Stargel ID number.</p><p><br></p><p>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.</p><p><br></p><p>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.</p><p>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)</p><p><br></p><p>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.</p><p><br></p><p>Initial notes: HP CLJ M479FDN - Constant jamming</p><p><br></p><p>Parts Order: RM2-5881-000CNHP CLJ M452/M477 550 SHEET FEEDER SEPERATION ROLLER ASSY</p><p>RM2-5577-000CNHP CLJ M452/M477 550 SHEET FEEDER FEED ROLLER ASSY</p><p>RM2-5576-000CNHP CLJ M452/M477 550 SHEET FEEDER PAPER PICK UP ROLLER ASSY</p><p>CF388-69008(C) HP CLJ M45X FUSER ASSY 110V</p><p><br></p><p>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.</p><p>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login&nbsp;</p><p>techlink user name and password are the call number 1133023</p><p><br></p><p>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**</p><p><br></p><p>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.</p><p><br></p><p>General Instructions for All Calls-</p><p>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.</p><p>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.</p><p>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.</p><p>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.</p><p>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.</p><p>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.</p><p>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T08:00","end":"2026-11-06T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":39},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $72.4910836 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher Scientific | WAN Activations Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.00