{"job":{"id":20312581,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity Tech Solutions","title":"access control install for 1","description":{"html":"<p>SCOPE</p><p><strong>***All deliverables must be uploaded before marking complete***</strong></p><p>Get with POC find new hardware and have them show you the doors/gates that need to be installed on</p><p>Site has 1 warehouse door they need new locking hardware and access controls installed on.</p><p>TASK</p><p>1 Check in with PM</p><p>2 Check in with POC</p><p>3 Locate parts for install</p><p>4 Have POC show you location of doors/gates for install</p><p>5 Take before pics of doors/gates</p><p>6 Install new hardware and wire up</p><p>7 Take after pics of hardware installed and wired</p><p>8 Check with POC that install meets there expectations</p><p>9 Clean up area</p><p>10 Check out with PM</p><p>11 Send in deliverables</p><p>DELIVERABLES</p><p>Pics before and after of doors and gates</p><p>Pics of hardware wired</p><p>Pics of system installed and wired</p><p>Upload VTS sign off sheet</p><p>No expenses paid with out prior approval</p>","markdown":"SCOPE\n\n**\\*\\*\\*All deliverables must be uploaded before marking complete\\*\\*\\***\n\nGet with POC find new hardware and have them show you the doors/gates that need to be installed on\n\nSite has 1 warehouse door they need new locking hardware and access controls installed on.\n\nTASK\n\n1 Check in with PM\n\n2 Check in with POC\n\n3 Locate parts for install\n\n4 Have POC show you location of doors/gates for install\n\n5 Take before pics of doors/gates\n\n6 Install new hardware and wire up\n\n7 Take after pics of hardware installed and wired\n\n8 Check with POC that install meets there expectations\n\n9 Clean up area\n\n10 Check out with PM\n\n11 Send in deliverables\n\nDELIVERABLES\n\nPics before and after of doors and gates\n\nPics of hardware wired\n\nPics of system installed and wired\n\nUpload VTS sign off sheet\n\nNo expenses paid with out prior approval","actions":