{"job":{"id":20312843,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Package Solutions Inc","title":"Rack 3 LED Board Troubleshooting and Parts Install - Remote Support - EST 2 Hrs","description":{"html":"<p>Overview:</p><p>Return visit for Zendesk ticket 591360 at Candour House, Durham, NC. Priority is the Rack 3 LED board, which is currently NOT CONNECTED. The rack's scales work fine; only the LEDs are out. Troubleshoot the LED board and, only if needed, install the reshipped USB powered hub and UL Rated Power Supply 5V 10A that arrive Friday, November 6.</p><p>Estimated Duration:</p><p>2 hours, single visit</p><p>Dress Code:</p><p>Business casual. Clean, professional appearance. No shorts, no open-toed shoes, and no clothing with offensive language or images.</p><p>Tools Required:</p><p>Laptop with internet access and phone for remote support calls.</p><p>Standard hand tools for low-voltage work, including a screwdriver set.</p><p>Multimeter for voltage and continuity checks (Optional but preferred).</p><p>Spare Ethernet cable for troubleshooting (Optional but preferred).</p><p>Scope of Work:</p><p>Before Arrival:</p><p>1. Review the work order and the shipment tracking, and confirm the parts have arrived at the Candour House leasing office before starting. The reshipped USB powered hub and UL Rated Power Supply 5V 10A are due Friday, November 6 - UPS 2nd Day Air, tracking 1Z9V3V690224961855.</p><p>2. Call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 before starting work on site to confirm the priority and process.</p><p>On-Site Tasks:</p><p>1. Check in on the Field Nation app upon arrival and take before photos of the rack and the Rack 3 LED board.</p><p>2. Work the Rack 3 LED board first: press its reset button, reseat and check its connections and power, and try to bring it back online. The rack's scales work fine; only the LEDs are out.</p><p>3. Call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm the LED board is back online.</p><p>4. Install the reshipped USB powered hub and UL Rated Power Supply 5V 10A ONLY if the LED board work shows they are needed.</p><p>5. Before leaving, coordinate with HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm the LED board shows connected and the Rack 3 LEDs are working.</p><p>6. Take after photos of the rack and the LED board, and enter detailed closeout notes.</p><p>Deliverables:</p><p>Rack 3 LED board shows connected and the Rack 3 LEDs are working, confirmed with HelloPackage Support before leaving.</p><p>Reshipped USB powered hub and power supply installed only if needed.</p><p>After photos of the rack and the LED board, and detailed closeout notes.</p><p>Check-Out:</p><p>Complete all assigned tasks in the Field Nation app.</p><p>Call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm the LED board shows connected and the Rack 3 LEDs are working.</p><p>Submit after-visit photos and detailed closeout notes.</p><p>Escalation Process:</p><p>Contact Robert Reyes at 470-825-3222 for on-site issues.</p><p>Technical issues: Contact HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 and provide the work order number and any error codes observed.</p><p>Extra Time:</p><p>Stay on site and help with additional troubleshooting only if requested and approved by HelloPackage Support, and you have been authorized to stay. Extra time will be paid at $75 per hour. Maximum of 2 hours for this work order (no more than $150).</p>","markdown":"Overview:\n\nReturn visit for Zendesk ticket 591360 at Candour House, Durham, NC. Priority is the Rack 3 LED board, which is currently NOT CONNECTED. The rack's scales work fine; only the LEDs are out. Troubleshoot the LED board and, only if needed, install the reshipped USB powered hub and UL Rated Power Supply 5V 10A that arrive Friday, November 6.\n\nEstimated Duration:\n\n2 hours, single visit\n\nDress Code:\n\nBusiness casual. Clean, professional appearance. No shorts, no open-toed shoes, and no clothing with offensive language or images.\n\nTools Required:\n\nLaptop with internet access and phone for remote support calls.\n\nStandard hand tools for low-voltage work, including a screwdriver set.\n\nMultimeter for voltage and continuity checks (Optional but preferred).\n\nSpare Ethernet cable for troubleshooting (Optional but preferred).\n\nScope of Work:\n\nBefore Arrival:\n\n1\\. Review the work order and the shipment tracking, and confirm the parts have arrived at the Candour House leasing office before starting. The reshipped USB powered hub and UL Rated Power Supply 5V 10A are due Friday, November 6 - UPS 2nd Day Air, tracking 1Z9V3V690224961855.\n\n2\\. Call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 before starting work on site to confirm the priority and process.\n\nOn-Site Tasks:\n\n1\\. Check in on the Field Nation app upon arrival and take before photos of the rack and the Rack 3 LED board.\n\n2\\. Work the Rack 3 LED board first: press its reset button, reseat and check its connections and power, and try to bring it back online. The rack's scales work fine; only the LEDs are out.\n\n3\\. Call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm the LED board is back online.\n\n4\\. Install the reshipped USB powered hub and UL Rated Power Supply 5V 10A ONLY if the LED board work shows they are needed.\n\n5\\. Before leaving, coordinate with HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm the LED board shows connected and the Rack 3 LEDs are working.\n\n6\\. Take after photos of the rack and the LED board, and enter detailed closeout notes.\n\nDeliverables:\n\nRack 3 LED board shows connected and the Rack 3 LEDs are working, confirmed with HelloPackage Support before leaving.\n\nReshipped USB powered hub and power supply installed only if needed.\n\nAfter photos of the rack and the LED board, and detailed closeout notes.\n\nCheck-Out:\n\nComplete all assigned tasks in the Field Nation app.\n\nCall HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 to confirm the LED board shows connected and the Rack 3 LEDs are working.\n\nSubmit after-visit photos and detailed closeout notes.\n\nEscalation Process:\n\nContact Robert Reyes at 470-825-3222 for on-site issues.\n\nTechnical issues: Contact HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 and provide the work order number and any error codes observed.\n\nExtra Time:\n\nStay on site and help with additional troubleshooting only if requested and approved by HelloPackage Support, and you have been authorized to stay. Extra time will be paid at $75 per hour. Maximum of 2 hours for this work order (no more than $150).","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T09:00","end":"2026-11-10T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":5.64806120878976},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey an