{"job":{"id":20312875,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Tip N Ring Inc.","title":"Test / repair cabling from IP phone and PC to switch - no network connection","description":{"html":"<p>SOW:</p><p><strong>WORK NEEDED</strong>: &nbsp;POSSIBLY MORE THAN ONE PC DOWN BASED ON NETWORK TEAM NOTES.&nbsp;TEST / REPAIR CABLING FROM IP PHONE AND PC TO SWITCH. USER IS NOT CONNECTING TO THE NETWORK. IP PHONE SHOULD HAVE NETWORK CONNECTION TO WALL, WITH PC CONNECTING THROUGH PHONE'S PC PORT. TEST AND VERIFY ALL CABLING AND CONNECTIONS END TO END. REPAIR / REPLACE AS NEEDED. PLEASE ADVISE WHICH SWITCH AND PORT USER IS CONNECTED TO. WORK WITH TNR NETWORK SUPPORT FOR FURTHER TROUBLESHOOTING. VERIFY CONNECTIVITY WITH USER ON SITE.</p><p><br></p><p><del>**** **** ***** ********** ** ***** ****** ************** **** **</del></p><p><br></p><p><strong>REQUIRED PICTURES</strong>: NETWORK JACK, SWITCH,&nbsp;ANY DAMAGE / REPAIRS</p><p><strong><em>**********************************************************************</em></strong></p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE:&nbsp;<u>ALL REQUIRED PHOTOS MUST BE UPLOADED AND APPROVED BY TIP-N-RING&nbsp;BEFORE&nbsp;LEAVING SITE.</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;IF YOU FAIL TO UPLOAD THE PHOTOS AND/OR FAIL TO CALL US TO CONFIRM THAT THEY WERE RECEIVED BEFORE YOU LEAVE THE SITE, YOU WILL&nbsp;<strong><u>NOT BE PAID</u></strong>&nbsp;FOR ANY TIME ONSITE.&nbsp;WE ALLOW FOR UP TO 15 MINUTES TO CLEAN THE AREA, TAKE PHOTOS, AND UPLOAD THEM TO US.&nbsp;IF YOU NEED ADDITIONAL TIME PAST THE 15 MINUTES ALLOWED, YOU MUST NOTIFY US BEFORE THAT TIME HAS ELAPSED, OR ANYTIME PAST THE 15 MINUTES WILL NOT BE APPROVED.</p><p><strong>**YOU ARE&nbsp;<u>NOT&nbsp;</u>ALLOWED TO COMMUNICATE DIRECTLY WITH OUR CLIENTS OR PROVIDE THEM WITH YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION. ALL COMMUNICATION NEEDS TO BE THROUGH TIP N RING - NO EXCEPTIONS!!**</strong></p><p><strong><em>***********************************************************************</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>YOUR ACCEPTANCE OF THIS WORK ORDER SERVES AS YOUR SPECIFIC AGREEMENT MADE TO ABIDE BY ALL MANDATES OF THE FIELD NATION QUALITY ASSURANCE POLICY. IF FOR ANY REASON, THE PROVIDER WHO REPORTS TO SITE IS DIFFERENT THAN THE ONE ASSIGNED, THE WORK ORDER WILL BE CANCELLED. SHOULD THIS OCCUR, NO CANCELLATION FEE&nbsp;OR PRE-AGREED TRAVEL EXPENSES WILL BE PAID, AND THE VIOLATION OF THE PROVIDER QUALITY ASSURANCE POLICY WILL BE REPORTED TO FIELD NATION. IF YOU ARE A SERVICE COMPANY AND WISH TO SEND A DIFFERENT PROVIDER THAN THE ONE ASSIGNED, YOU MUST REQUEST A SWAP, AND THAT SWAP MUST BE ACCEPTED PRIOR THE SERVICE WINDOW.&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>CALL&nbsp;<del>*** * ************</del>, OPTION 1 UPON ARRIVAL ON SITE. TECH MUST LIST ON WORK ORDER MATERIALS USED WHILE ON SITE.</p><p>WO AUTHORIZED FOR 1 HR MAX, IF MORE TIME IS NEEDED PLEASE CALL<strong>&nbsp;</strong><del>**** **** ** ******************</del>TO ADVISE AND FOR APPROVAL OF ADDITIONAL TIME.</p><p>TECH MUST HAVE:</p><ul><li>LAPTOP</li><li>CABLE TONER</li><li>CAT 5 CABLE TESTER, CERTIFIER OR WIRE MAP TESTER</li><li>CAT5E OR 6 CABLING</li><li>CAT5E JACKS AND WALL PLATES</li><li>110 PUNCH TOOL</li><li>STANDARD TECH TOOLS</li><li>ASSORTED PATCH CORDS</li></ul><p><br></p><p>TECH MUST BE ABLE TO PROVIDE STANDARD CAT 5E CABLING MATERIALS. It is the technician's responsibility to add all materials on the paperwork and list them as expenses on the website. If listed on the paperwork and website, technician will be reimbursed for them in line with industry standards; receipts may be requested. It is not the buyer's responsibility to reimburse for materials not listed on the website.</p><p><br></p><p>Before any tech is dispatched to site, tech should read over the service order and review the work being requested and&nbsp;<strong>arrive onsite with all appropriate tools</strong>, fully prepared to perform the work being&nbsp;requested</p><p>Required tools:</p><ul><li>a butt set available for each call</li><li>basic telephony/data tools</li><li>necessary tools for the work requested: CAT 5E cable,&nbsp;jacks, etc. (will be reimbursed per itemization, pre-approval&nbsp;of materials expense required)&nbsp;</li><li>Standard ladder</li></ul><p>A copy of the service request order (paperwork) must be:</p><ul><li>taken to site by your technician(s)</li><li>filled out completely, including but not limited to the&nbsp;tech’s check in and out times and any materials supplied</li><li>signed by the site contact</li><li>uploaded into the Work Order before checking out</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Provider will need to upload, or email to buyer, pictures of their work while still on site.&nbsp;Once a tech is released from site, we will allow 15 minutes for clean-up and the uploading of paperwork and photos. Any time beyond this will not be approved for payment without prior authorization from support.&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Pictures will need to be reviewed and verified by WO Manager/ RMAT&nbsp;<strong>before&nbsp;</strong>checking out. The following pictures are required:</p><ul><li>The termination that has an issue</li><li>Any cabling that you troubleshot/touched</li><li>Any cabling that was reterminated</li></ul><p>Once provider marks work order as 'Work Done', buyer will then process order for payment and approval could take a maximum of 14 days.</p>","markdown":"SOW:\n\n**WORK NEEDED**: POSSIBLY MORE THAN ONE PC DOWN BASED ON NETWORK TEAM NOTES. TEST / REPAIR CABLING FROM IP PHONE AND PC TO SWITCH. USER IS NOT CONNECTING TO THE NETWORK. IP PHONE SHOULD HAVE NETWORK CONNECTION TO WALL, WITH PC CONNECTING THROUGH PHONE'S PC PORT. TEST AND VERIFY ALL CABLING AND CONNECTIONS END TO END. REPAIR / REPLACE AS NEEDED. PLEASE ADVISE WHICH SWITCH AND PORT USER IS CONNECTED TO. WORK WITH TNR NETWORK SUPPORT FOR FURTHER TROUBLESHOOTING. VERIFY CONNECTIVITY WITH USER ON SITE.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\n\n**REQUIRED PICTURES**: NETWORK JACK, SWITCH, ANY DAMAGE / REPAIRS\n\n***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\****\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: ALL REQUIRED PHOTOS MUST BE UPLOADED AND APPROVED BY TIP-N-RING BEFORE LEAVING SITE.** IF YOU FAIL TO UPLOAD THE PHOTOS AND/OR FAIL TO CALL US TO CONFIRM THAT THEY WERE RECEIVED BEFORE YOU LEAVE THE SITE, YOU WILL **NOT BE PAID** FOR ANY TIME ONSITE. WE ALLOW FOR UP TO 15 MINUTES TO CLEAN THE AREA, TAKE PHOTOS, AND UPLOAD THEM TO US. IF YOU NEED ADDITIONAL TIME PAST THE 15 MINUTES ALLOWED, YOU MUST NOTIFY US BEFORE THAT TIME HAS ELAPSED, OR ANYTIME PAST THE 15 MINUTES WILL NOT BE APPROVED.\n\n**\\*\\*YOU ARE NOT ALLOWED TO COMMUNICATE DIRECTLY WITH OUR CLIENTS OR PROVIDE THEM WITH YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION. ALL COMMUNICATION NEEDS TO BE THROUGH TIP N RING - NO EXCEPTIONS!!\\*\\***\n\n***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\****\n\n***YOUR ACCEPTANCE OF THIS WORK ORDER SERVES AS YOUR SPECIFIC AGREEMENT MADE TO ABIDE BY ALL MANDATES OF THE FIELD NATION QUALITY ASSURANCE POLICY. IF FOR ANY REASON, THE PROVIDER WHO REPORTS TO SITE IS DIFFERENT THAN THE ONE ASSIGNED, THE WORK ORDER WILL BE CANCELLED. SHOULD THIS OCCUR, NO CANCELLATION FEE OR PRE-AGREED TRAVEL EXPENSES WILL BE PAID, AND THE VIOLATION OF THE PROVIDER QUALITY ASSURANCE POLICY WILL BE REPORTED TO FIELD NATION. IF YOU ARE A SERVICE COMPANY AND WISH TO SEND A DIFFERENT PROVIDER THAN THE ONE ASSIGNED, YOU MUST REQUEST A SWAP, AND THAT SWAP MUST BE ACCEPTED PRIOR THE SERVICE WINDOW.***\n\nCALL \\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*, OPTION 1 UPON ARRIVAL ON SITE. TECH MUST LIST ON WORK ORDER MATERIALS USED WHILE ON SITE.\n\nWO AUTHORIZED FOR 1 HR MAX, IF MORE TIME IS NEEDED PLEASE CALL \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*TO ADVISE AND FOR APPROVAL OF ADDITIONAL TIME.\n\nTECH MUST HAVE:\n\n- LAPTOP\n- CABLE TONER\n- CAT 5 CABLE TESTER, CERTIFIER OR WIRE MAP TESTER\n- CAT5E OR 6 CABLING\n- CAT5E JACKS AND WALL PLATES\n- 110 PUNCH TOOL\n- STANDARD TECH TOOLS\n- ASSORTED PATCH CORDS\n\nTECH MUST BE ABLE TO PROVIDE STANDARD CAT 5E CABLING MATERIALS. It is the technician's responsibility to add all materials on the paperwork and list them as expenses on the website. If listed on the paperwork and website, technician will be reimbursed for them in line with industry standards; receipts may be requested. It is not the buyer's responsibility to reimburse for materials not listed on the website.\n\nBefore any tech is dispatched to site, tech should read over the service order and review the work being requested and **arrive onsite with all appropriate tools**, fully prepared to perform the work being requested\n\nRequired tools:\n\n- a butt set available for each call\n- basic telephony/data tools\n- necessary tools for the work requested: CAT 5E cable, jacks, etc. (will be reimbursed per itemization, pre-approval of materials expense required)\n- Standard ladder\n\nA copy of the service request order (paperwork) must be:\n\n- taken to site by your technician(s)\n- filled out completely, including but not limited to the tech’s check in and out times and any materials supplied\n- signed by the site contact\n- uploaded into the Work Order before checking out\n\n**Provider will need to upload, or email to buyer, pictures of their work while still on site. Once a tech is released from site, we will allow 15 minutes for clean-up and the uploading of paperwork and photos. Any time beyond this will not be approved for payment without prior authorization from support.**\n\nPictures will need to be reviewed and verified by WO Manager/ RMAT **before** checking out. The following pictures are required:\n\n- The termination that has an issue\n- Any cabling that you troubleshot/touched\n- Any cabling that was reterminated\n\nOnce provider marks work order as 'Work Done', buyer will then process order for payment and approval could take a maximum of 14 days.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T09:00","end":"2026-11-06T11:00","latestStart":"2026-11-06T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":80},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":50},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":30}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.785007345244376},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $80 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 11/05/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Net