{"job":{"id":"3122312523","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"05913238 - 9377 N US Highway 301 | EPIK Survey","description":"\"Survey SOW: SOS must match dates and times that are in WorkMarket and MUST BE SIGNED BY THE CUSTOMER (LCON)<br>1. TECH MUST CALL LCON, 30 MINUTES BEFORE ARRIVAL.<br>2. Check in and out through Work Market. For any questions during the survey, please call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at: 833-479-4768<br>3. Upon arrival, departure, and for questions about your scope of work or if you are unclear on instructions before starting the installation, check in with the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479-4768, otherwise Login to EPIK Wizard at https://wizard.epik.io to begin the Survey process. When you enter the Granite ticket number it will be recognized as a survey, and you will be taken to the Survey Wizard.  (Note: If you have completed a Wizard survey or install before, please be sure to refresh your browser window to ensure the current version is being used.)<br>4. Follow all instructions presented by the Survey Wizard.  If you run into any issues or have questions you may call the TC Team.  All sections of the survey are required and will require final sign off by Granite Technical Coordinator before you will be cleared to leave the site.  The Survey Wizard will guide you through this process.<br>5. Before departure call the EPIK Technical Coordination (TC) Team at 833-479- 4768 to review deliverables and receive approval on survey results.<br>6. Once your survey results have been approved by the TC Team, a TC Team representative will give you a checkout code to enter into WorkMarket which you will use to check out upon completion of the survey. Failure to checkout will result in delay or nonpayment for services. <br> <br>Materials/Tools Required: Laptop with ability to create hotspot, Smart Phone, Tone Generator and Wand, Punch Tool (66 &amp; 110) Electrician Scissors, Step Ladder, Flashlight and/or Headlamp, RJ11&amp;RJ45 Crimper, Ethernet Cable Tester, Masonry Bits, Impact Drill, Pencil and/or Marker, Level, Philips Driver Bits and Screwdriver Cordless Drill, Needle-Nose Pliers, Label-Maker, All-Purpose Screws (drywall, masonry, wood), Cable-Ties and Mountings, Cat3 or Better Cable (for analog devices), Cat6 Ethernet Cable (for data connections), CrossConnect Wire, Gel-Crimp Connecters, Label-Tape, RJ11 &amp; Cat6 Ethernet Keystone Jacks, RJ11 &amp; RJ45 Modular Plugs, Lineman’s Telephony Handset/Butt-Set\"","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T09:00","end":"2026-11-09T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":195},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":56.4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Mon, Nov 9, 9:00 AM\nChecked: Mon, Nov 9, Tue, Nov 10, Wed, Nov 11, Thu, Nov 12, Fri, Nov 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans D