{"job":{"id":20314495,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Lingo Telecom","title":"Lingo - VoIP Hosted Phone Install and Port","description":{"html":"<p>Scope of Work: </p><p>Commercial VOIP 5 Cloud Hosted PBX, 5 YeaLink T34w, 5 NEW DID, Premium Installation</p><p><strong><u>Short Description: </u></strong></p><ul><li>Perform Pre-install activities</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Locate phone equipment and ensure (with activations) all pieces are accounted for</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Identify Network topology</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Perform VoIP Readiness test - www.voipreadiness.com</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Identify if there are any Fire, Life, Safety lines that are shared with the porting voice lines.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Ensure that all locations where phones will be placed has either a wired or wireless (if phone is compatible) internet connection.</li><li>Unbox and connect each phone to the Internet</li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Perform Pre-testing phone. (Outbound call, inbound call from Lingo activations, Caller ID, Hunt group, toll free, hold, transfer, Voicemail access (*98 if ordered)</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Ensure checklist (attached) is complete</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p>See attached SOW for full install instructions and expectations.</p>","markdown":"Scope of Work:\n\nCommercial VOIP 5 Cloud Hosted PBX, 5 YeaLink T34w, 5 NEW DID, Premium Installation\n\n**Short Description:**\n\n- Perform Pre-install activities\n- Locate phone equipment and ensure (with activations) all pieces are accounted for\n- Identify Network topology\n- Perform VoIP Readiness test - www.voipreadiness.com\n- Identify if there are any Fire, Life, Safety lines that are shared with the porting voice lines.\n- Ensure that all locations where phones will be placed has either a wired or wireless (if phone is compatible) internet connection.\n- Unbox and connect each phone to the Internet\n- Perform Pre-testing phone. (Outbound call, inbound call from Lingo activations, Caller ID, Hunt group, toll free, hold, transfer, Voicemail access (\\*98 if ordered)\n- Ensure checklist (attached) is complete\n\nSee attached SOW for full install instructions and expectations.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T10:00","end":"2026-11-06T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":6.553578446571455},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Equipment Install | Priority 3 | 11/05/2026 | Hard Start (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"sta