{"job":{"id":20314559,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Scila Technologies Inc.","title":"Site survey, Low voltage Cable Run and conduit install - ***PLEASE READ THE SOW CAREFULLY***","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Please read before you apply:</strong></p><p><strong>Requires MS Teams, TeamViewer, AnyDesk, Cables , etc . You need to have these apps and you should fully know how to work with them.</strong></p><p><strong>We will need you to return the signed off SVR (Site Visit Form) upon completion of task. All the documents and pictures should be uploaded here on the portal.</strong></p><p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p><p><strong>All WOs will be reviewed and approved within 5 business days of FEs loading all final deliverables into the WO.</strong></p><p><strong>align FE on this week to complete cabling for LUMEN circuit. The distance is approximately 180’ from the IRM DEMARC. Please have this completed in 1 visit.</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>IRM DEMARC :</strong></p><p><strong>VELO A or B located @ Main BLDG-1 on 1st floor, IT room</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Supplier (LUMEN DEMARC) :</strong></p><p><strong>1ST Floor, Telephone Room Near Outside FACP Room, Lumen Rack, ASR 920 (DRHM377SZP001), Port 0/0/9</strong></p><p><strong><u>Scope of work:</u> Need FE forcompletion of DMARC extension from supplier – LUMEN DMARC to IRM rack</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>### Your Primary Objective</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Your first priority is to complete a **thorough site survey** and gather all the information needed for us to determine the correct materials for the installation.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>### Please verify and document the following:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>* **Starting Point (LUMEN Demarc):** MPOE at the back of the warehouse, wall-mounted, handoff on **VE Panel Position 1 (Tagged)**.</strong></p><p><strong>* **End Point (IRM Rack):** First floor, next to the office (VELO devices).</strong></p><p><strong>* The best cable route between both locations.</strong></p><p><strong>* Whether an existing duct/conduit can be used.</strong></p><p><strong>* If not, how the cable should be routed.</strong></p><p><strong>* Whether new conduit will be required.</strong></p><p><strong>* The estimated cable length.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>### Cable Selection</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The cable type depends on the measured distance:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>* **Less than 300 ft:** CAT6 Ethernet.</strong></p><p><strong>* **More than 300 ft:** Fiber.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The customer believes the distance is **over 300 ft**, but please verify this during your survey.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>### Same-Day Installation (Preferred)</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The customer has asked whether the **survey and cable installation can be completed during the same visit**.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>If, after completing the survey, you have confirmed the cable type and all required materials are available from a local supplier, please contact **SCILA immediately** before purchasing anything.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Once approved, if it's practical to do so, we would like you to purchase the required materials locally and complete the installation during the same visit to avoid a return visit.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>**Please do not purchase any materials or proceed with the installation without SCILA's approval.**</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>### While On Site</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>* Keep SCILA updated throughout the survey.</strong></p><p><strong>* Before leaving, review the completed survey with us to ensure nothing has been missed.</strong></p><p><strong>* Take clear photos of:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>* LUMEN Demarc</strong></p><p><strong>* IRM Rack</strong></p><p><strong>* Proposed cable route</strong></p><p><strong>* Existing ducts/conduits</strong></p><p><strong>* Any obstacles or special installation requirements</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>If you encounter any issues, unexpected site conditions, or have any doubts, **stop and contact SCILA before proceeding.**</strong></p><ul><li><br></li><li><br></li></ul>","markdown":"**Please read before you apply:**\n\n**Requires MS Teams, TeamViewer, AnyDesk, Cables , etc . You need to have these apps and you should fully know how to work with them.**\n\n**We will need you to return the signed off SVR (Site Visit Form) upon completion of task. All the documents and pictures should be uploaded here on the portal.**\n\n**Payment Terms**\n\n**All WOs will be reviewed and approved within 5 business days of FEs loading all final deliverables into the WO.**\n\n**align FE on this week to complete cabling for LUMEN circuit. The distance is approximately 180’ from the IRM DEMARC. Please have this completed in 1 visit.**\n\n**IRM DEMARC :**\n\n**VELO A or B located @ Main BLDG-1 on 1st floor, IT room**\n\n**Supplier (LUMEN DEMARC) :**\n\n**1ST Floor, Telephone Room Near Outside FACP Room, Lumen Rack, ASR 920 (DRHM377SZP001), Port 0/0/9**\n\n**Scope of work: Need FE forcompletion of DMARC extension from supplier – LUMEN DMARC to IRM rack**\n\n**\\### Your Primary Objective**\n\n**Your first priority is to complete a \\*\\*thorough site survey\\*\\* and gather all the information needed for us to determine the correct materials for the installation.**\n\n**\\### Please verify and document the following:**\n\n**\\* \\*\\*Starting Point (LUMEN Demarc):\\*\\* MPOE at the back of the warehouse, wall-mounted, handoff on \\*\\*VE Panel Position 1 (Tagged)\\*\\*.**\n\n**\\* \\*\\*End Point (IRM Rack):\\*\\* First floor, next to the office (VELO devices).**\n\n**\\* The best cable route between both locations.**\n\n**\\* Whether an existing duct/conduit can be used.**\n\n**\\* If not, how the cable should be routed.**\n\n**\\* Whether new conduit will be required.**\n\n**\\* The estimated cable length.**\n\n**\\### Cable Selection**\n\n**The cable type depends on the measured distance:**\n\n**\\* \\*\\*Less than 300 ft:\\*\\* CAT6 Ethernet.**\n\n**\\* \\*\\*More than 300 ft:\\*\\* Fiber.**\n\n**The customer believes the distance is \\*\\*over 300 ft\\*\\*, but please verify this during your survey.**\n\n**\\### Same-Day Installation (Preferred)**\n\n**The customer has asked whether the \\*\\*survey and cable installation can be completed during the same visit\\*\\*.**\n\n**If, after completing the survey, you have confirmed the cable type and all required materials are available from a local supplier, please contact \\*\\*SCILA immediately\\*\\* before purchasing anything.**\n\n**Once approved, if it's practical to do so, we would like you to purchase the required materials locally and complete the installation during the same visit to avoid a return visit.**\n\n**\\*\\*Please do not purchase any materials or proceed with the installation without SCILA's approval.\\*\\***\n\n**\\### While On Site**\n\n**\\* Keep SCILA updated throughout the survey.**\n\n**\\* Before leaving, review the completed survey with us to ensure nothing has been missed.**\n\n**\\* Take clear photos of:**\n\n**\\* LUMEN Demarc**\n\n**\\* IRM Rack**\n\n**\\* Proposed cable route**\n\n**\\* Existing ducts/conduits**\n\n**\\* Any obstacles or special installation requirements**\n\n**If you encounter any issues, unexpected site conditions, or have any doubts, \\*\\*stop and contact SCILA before proceeding.\\*\\***\n\n- \n-","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T10:00","end":"2026-11-06T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":90},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":4.980035077028364},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $90 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-