{"job":{"id":20303617,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Multimedia Cinema Services, Inc.","title":"A24: Club Kid SEG Graphic Display","description":{"html":"<p>BE SURE TO CHECK SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL, QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT OPEN FOR THE DAY.</p><p><br></p><p>PROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>If the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or can not locate the standee.</strong></p><p>If the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for&nbsp;<strong>HALF&nbsp;</strong>of the installation rate.</p><p><br></p><p>Scope of Work:</p><p>A24 is looking to replace You Can See Everything graphics with Club Kid. The location assigned has been approved by the theatres corporate office and should be allowed for immediate display. Display can be placed anywhere convenient for the theatre, up against a wall in the main lobby or main hallway is preferred.</p><p><br></p><p>Frames should be on site already. <strong>If they are not, email sam@qualitysignandmarquee.com to request one.</strong></p>","markdown":"BE SURE TO CHECK SHOW TIMES PRIOR TO ARRIVAL, QSM WILL NOT PAY FOR VISITS WHERE THE THEATRE WAS NOT OPEN FOR THE DAY.\n\nPROVIDER ACCEPTING THE WORK MUST BE THE PROVIDER COMPLETING THE TASK.\n\n**If the provider is unable to complete the standee for any reason, they agree to reduce the work order to a total trip charge of $30.00, this includes if the theatre refuses the installation or can not locate the standee.**\n\nIf the provider arrives and finds the standee is already installed, they must inspect to make sure it is built properly, take the necessary photos and submit for **HALF** of the installation rate.\n\nScope of Work:\n\nA24 is looking to replace You Can See Everything graphics with Club Kid. The location assigned has been approved by the theatres corporate office and should be allowed for immediate display. Display can be placed anywhere convenient for the theatre, up against a wall in the main lobby or main hallway is preferred.\n\nFrames should be on site already. **If they are not, email sam@qualitysignandmarquee.com to request one.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-04T12:00","end":"2026-11-06T22:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":50},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":10.483092916078247},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-04T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-05T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-05T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","summary":"2 Granite ticket"},{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-1