{"job":{"id":20315683,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"OvationCXM","title":"OvationCXM - Square POS - Installation","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Square Installation</strong></p><p>PLEASE SCROLL DOWN FOR COMPLETE JOB INFO</p><p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK:</strong></p><ul><li>Pay Rate: Listed Rate for the duration of the job</li><li>Est. Hours: 5</li><li><strong>Cabling</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Est. Cabling: 300ft CAT5</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Est. Runs &amp; Notes: Exact cabling is unknown. Please be prepared to cable as needed for the Square hardware </li><li class=\"ql-indent-2\">If any major complications come up please alert the project manager asap</li><li><strong>Expected Hardware from Partner:</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Tablets: *4* - 1x Square Register + 3x Handhelds</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Receipt Printers: *3* - Receipt Printer</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Kitchen Printers: *2* - Kitchen Printer</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Cash Drawers: *1*</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">KDS: *2* - KDS W/ Wall Mount</li><li>Additional Information</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Please have a laptop w/ charger on site</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Please have a 5port switch available (reimbursable if used) </li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">You will need to work with support to configure/test hardware at 877-662-2666 ext 2</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">INSTALLATION PROCESS</strong></p><ul><li>Prior to installing any hardware, please take pictures of the following:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Each device being installed/serviced (for inventory).</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Each location you are installing/servicing (including existing POS/networking/cabling).</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Complete all installation tasks required, contact *OvationCXM* with any issues.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Notate if any equipment is missing.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Once completed, take pictures of the following items:</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Locations for equipment being installed</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any existing networking</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Equipment that is currently on site</span></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Any other pictures deemed necessary</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Get Merchant signature</span></li><li>Contact *OvationCXM Implementation Manager* to complete close out procedure.</li><li>If App is unresponsive, please send an email to pics@ovationcxm.com with any issues you encountered, any materials used, and/or any tolls or fees you acquired.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>MANUALS AND INFORMATION</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Square Guide</strong>: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bnpFs3U324I6IZHtC9O-tfHozlUa_G9-/view?usp=sharing</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Square Register FAQ: </strong>https://squareup.com/help/us/en/article/6179-square-register-faqs</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Connect Recommended Hardware to Square Register:</strong>https://squareup.com/help/us/en/article/6261-connect-recommended-hardware-to-square-register</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2025 Technician Standard Reimbursement Cost Sheet: </strong>https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SpiT3I2Oy4M3GHMA-iPF7jWUDlzSGbzg/view?usp=sharing</li><li><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">ALL Materials will be paid out at </strong><strong>OvationCXM</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">'s Standard Rates unless a receipt is provided.</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">DO NOT replace nor recommend hardware to Merchants prior to speaking with </strong><strong>OvationCXM</strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">.</strong></li><li>If App is unresponsive, please send an email to pics@ovationcxm.com with any issues you encountered, any materials used, and/or any tolls or fees you acquired</li></ul><p><strong>ANY TOLLS OR FEES WILL NOT BE REIMBURSED IF A RECEIPT IS NOT PROVIDED.</strong></p><p><strong>FAILURE TO COMPLY WITH SITE SURVEY PROCESS MAY LEAD TO DELAY OF PAYMENT</strong></p><p><br></p><p><em>PER THE PROVIDER QUALITY ASSURANCE POLICY (PQAP) - ANY UNAUTHORIZED SUBSTITUTION OF ASSIGNED PROVIDER IS NOT PERMITTED. UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCE IS AN ASSIGNED PROVIDER ALLOWED TO SUBSTITUTE ANOTHER INDIVIDUAL WITHOUT PRIOR APPROVAL FROM THE BUYER. FAILURE TO FOLLOW THIS REQUIREMENT MAY RESULT IN REMOVAL WITHOUT PAY AND BEING BLOCKED FROM ANY FUTURE WORK.</em></p>","markdown":"**Square Installation**\n\nPLEASE SCROLL DOWN FOR COMPLETE JOB INFO\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK:**\n\n- Pay Rate: Listed Rate for the duration of the job\n- Est. Hours: 5\n- **Cabling**\n- Est. Cabling: 300ft CAT5\n- Est. Runs &amp; Notes: Exact cabling is unknown. Please be prepared to cable as needed for the Square hardware\n- If any major complications come up please alert the project manager asap\n- **Expected Hardware from Partner:**\n- Tablets: \\*4\\* - 1x Square Register + 3x Handhelds\n- Receipt Printers: \\*3\\* - Receipt Printer\n- Kitchen Printers: \\*2\\* - Kitchen Printer\n- Cash Drawers: \\*1\\*\n- KDS: \\*2\\* - KDS W/ Wall Mount\n- Additional Information\n- Please have a laptop w/ charger on site\n- Please have a 5port switch available (reimbursable if used)\n- You will need to work with support to configure/test hardware at 877-662-2666 ext 2\n\n**INSTALLATION PROCESS**\n\n- Prior to installing any hardware, please take pictures of the following:\n- Each device being installed/serviced (for inventory).\n- Each location you are installing/servicing (including existing POS/networking/cabling).\n- Complete all installation tasks required, contact \\*OvationCXM\\* with any issues.\n- Notate if any equipment is missing.\n- Once completed, take pictures of the following items:\n- Locations for equipment being installed\n- Any existing networking\n- Equipment that is currently on site\n- Any other pictures deemed necessary\n- Get Merchant signature\n- Contact \\*OvationCXM Implementation Manager\\* to complete close out procedure.\n- If App is unresponsive, please send an email to pics@ovationcxm.com with any issues you encountered, any materials used, and/or any tolls or fees you acquired.\n\n**MANUALS AND INFORMATION**\n\n- **Square Guide**: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bnpFs3U324I6IZHtC9O-tfHozlUa_G9-/view?usp=sharing\n- **Square Register FAQ:** <https://squareup.com/help/us/en/article/6179-square-register-faqs>\n- **Connect Recommended Hardware to Square Register:**<https://squareup.com/help/us/en/article/6261-connect-recommended-hardware-to-square-register>\n- **2025 Technician Standard Reimbursement Cost Sheet:** <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SpiT3I2Oy4M3GHMA-iPF7jWUDlzSGbzg/view?usp=sharing>\n- **ALL Materials will be paid out at** **OvationCXM****'s Standard Rates unless a receipt is provided.**\n- **DO NOT replace nor recommend hardware to Merchants prior to speaking with** **OvationCXM****.**\n- If App is unresponsive, please send an email to pics@ovationcxm.com with any issues you encountered, any materials used, and/or any tolls or fees you acquired\n\n**ANY TOLLS OR FEES WILL NOT BE REIMBURSED IF A RECEIPT IS NOT PROVIDED.**\n\n**FAILURE TO COMPLY WITH SITE SURVEY PROCESS MAY LEAD TO DELAY OF PAYMENT**\n\n*PER THE PROVIDER QUALITY ASSURANCE POLICY (PQAP) - ANY UNAUTHORIZED SUBSTITUTION OF ASSIGNED PROVIDER IS NOT PERMITTED. UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCE IS AN ASSIGNED PROVIDER ALLOWED TO SUBSTITUTE ANOTHER INDIVIDUAL WITHOUT PRIOR APPROVAL FROM THE BUYER. FAILURE TO FOLLOW THIS REQUIREMENT MAY RESULT IN REMOVAL WITHOUT PAY AND BEING BLOCKED FROM ANY FUTURE WORK.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T09:00","end":"2026-11-10T14:00"},"payRange":{"min"