{"job":{"id":20316948,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Package Solutions Inc","title":"Network Troubleshooting - Package Room Offline - Remote Support - EST 3 Hrs","description":{"html":"<p>No weekend work. Our office and HelloPackage Support are closed on weekends, so the visit must take place on a weekday within the window.</p><p>Ticket #602059 - The Keaton at Brier Creek, 3930 Macaw Street, Raleigh, NC 27617</p><p>The package room is offline. All 10 HelloPackage devices at the property (server, 3 racks, human tracker, node, carrier kiosk, resident kiosk, 2 outdoor kiosks) lost connection at the same time on November 3, 2026 at 9:36 AM and have not reconnected. The room had also dropped offline on October 27 and October 29 and self-restored. Property staff report the door is not unlocking and they are letting residents and drivers in manually. Denise Burtz has approved this dispatch.</p><p>Work to perform:</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><ol><li>Two network cables run from the package room back to the network closet. Verify that the correct cable is the one plugged in and carrying the connection; test both runs if needed and leave the working run connected and labeled.</li><li>Check the Spectrum modem and the Pepwave router (Router is in Rack 1). Power cycle both in order (modem first, then router) and confirm stable internet.</li><li>Check power to the racks and network gear. If the room's network gear or racks have lost power, restore it and note what was found.</li></ol><p>Verify the local server (Rack 2) and the human tracker (Rack 3) come back online and stay online. 5. Test both entry doors: confirm the strike locks release from the door kiosk and the QR pin pad, and that the doors re-secure.  6..Run a test carrier check-in and confirm the room is fully operational. 7. If internet will not stay up, call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 while on site before leaving.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Completion requirements: detailed closeout notes stating what was found (which cable, modem/router state, power state) and photos of the network connections and rack gear. The room must be confirmed online with HelloPackage Support before leaving site.</p><p><br></p>","markdown":"No weekend work. Our office and HelloPackage Support are closed on weekends, so the visit must take place on a weekday within the window.\n\nTicket #602059 - The Keaton at Brier Creek, 3930 Macaw Street, Raleigh, NC 27617\n\nThe package room is offline. All 10 HelloPackage devices at the property (server, 3 racks, human tracker, node, carrier kiosk, resident kiosk, 2 outdoor kiosks) lost connection at the same time on November 3, 2026 at 9:36 AM and have not reconnected. The room had also dropped offline on October 27 and October 29 and self-restored. Property staff report the door is not unlocking and they are letting residents and drivers in manually. Denise Burtz has approved this dispatch.\n\nWork to perform:\n\n1. Two network cables run from the package room back to the network closet. Verify that the correct cable is the one plugged in and carrying the connection; test both runs if needed and leave the working run connected and labeled.\n2. Check the Spectrum modem and the Pepwave router (Router is in Rack 1). Power cycle both in order (modem first, then router) and confirm stable internet.\n3. Check power to the racks and network gear. If the room's network gear or racks have lost power, restore it and note what was found.\n\nVerify the local server (Rack 2) and the human tracker (Rack 3) come back online and stay online. 5. Test both entry doors: confirm the strike locks release from the door kiosk and the QR pin pad, and that the doors re-secure. 6..Run a test carrier check-in and confirm the room is fully operational. 7. If internet will not stay up, call HelloPackage Support at (470) 825-3255 while on site before leaving.\n\nCompletion requirements: detailed closeout notes stating what was found (which cable, modem/router state, power state) and photos of the network connections and rack gear. The room must be confirmed online with HelloPackage Support before leaving site.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T09:00","end":"2026-11-11T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":225},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":2.7398769100617852},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":75,"baseAmount":225,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T18:30:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z