{"job":{"id":20317829,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Diagnose & Repair/Replace - Tech needs to pick up old equipment and return**","description":{"html":"<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">No unauthorized persons allowed on site. Any swaps or helpers must be approved by Essintial.</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9924E932\">IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES. </span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Required On-site time/window: 11/06/2026</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Equipment:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Make/Model: E541463</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Serial Number: K25WEC0998</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Problem Description: </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Kiosk Gen X | New Kiosk 4 Not Working</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">S/N K25WEC0998</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tracking # 1ZY1A3490194419062 1ZY1A3490193378671</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Replacement device:</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">E541463_C &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;S/N &nbsp;&nbsp;E26WEC0495</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Panera Store: 609270</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">WILLIAM Danner</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">416 Chapel Drive, West Union Building</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Durham NC 27708</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">(919) 213-6623</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">SO1602798/ WOT0245970</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Important Tech Requirements / Call Outs</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Technicians MUST Verify STORE is open prior to going onsite</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Technicians MUST Verify Parts Shipped are onsite PRIOR to going onsite</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Technicians MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> represent themselves as a </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">TRG Technician</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> and carry </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">TRG Badge</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> (badge template attached to your work order)</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Technicians </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST Check-In</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> with Onsite POC</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"csB54904E9\">Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting</span><span class=\"cs2E101AC8\">: </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"><span class=\"csE40EB262\">https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004k7ll/ONBV1EkeBBy7Tig.FtJFxva3KlJZLfwIkdVmi7uHUTQ</span></span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Techs MUST CALL Panera Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a Case # &amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to </span><span class=\"csB54904E9\">[ Panera Support Helpdesk @ 314-984-3000 </span><span class=\"cs2E101AC8\">(Tip: Dial (314) 984-3000 &rarr; Option 7 &rarr; Special Code = &#39;#&#39; ) </span><span class=\"csB54904E9\">]</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen [ Refer to Guide for assistance)</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Techs </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> verify operational with Onsite POC &amp; obtain customer sign-off prior to leaving site, this will be captured via online deliverable.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Techs </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> complete the Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving the site&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX. </span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Return Labels </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">- should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs3232DC9D\">Important Scope/Customer Information:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business.&nbsp;Technicians are required to dress and conduct themselves in a suitable manner, including treating all people with dignity and respect and refrain from wandering into areas that do not pertain to your designated area of work.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Dress Code:&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no T-Shirts, Jeans or holes, A plain collared or button-down shirts, slacks, and nice shoes. (No Jeans, T-Shirts/Hoodies and NO Graphics or HOLES in clothing)</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">You will be required to obtain customer sign-off - this will be captured via online deliverable</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Any changes to ETA&rsquo;s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">via phone. </span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED.&nbsp;You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms / online deliverables</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Required Tools:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Government Issued ID</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">MUST</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;carry/wear a&nbsp;</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">TRG Badge</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;while onsite [ use the provided Badge template]</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Standard Tool Kit </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">- screwdrivers, cutters, pliers, and wrenches</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Cell Phone or other device that has phone, camera, and internet ability (for online deliverable)</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial&nbsp;PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE):&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Deliverable Link:&nbsp;<span class=\"cs893A72B8\">https://essintial.jotform.com/260955561516967</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to confirm site/location details</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide Check-In &amp; Check-Out Times</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide completion notes</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide a photo of the completed device powered on</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide a photo showing a successful test transaction</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Serial Number</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Tag</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide the Panera Case # that was provided by Panera Support validating device is active&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide photo of return shipment sealed with return label visible.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to enter return tracking number(s)</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to obtain sign-off from onsite manager&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Tech will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverable&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Upon Arrival at site:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER &ndash; if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check in.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Check-In with Onsite POC - Introduce yourself as a TRG technician</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"csB54904E9\">Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting [Mounting Display &amp; Troubleshooting will be most useful]</span><span class=\"cs2E101AC8\">: </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"><span class=\"csE40EB262\">https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004k7ll/ONBV1EkeBBy7Tig.FtJFxva3KlJZLfwIkdVmi7uHUTQ</span></span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions on how to run a test transaction.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen [ Refer to Guide for assistance)</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements (PRIOR TO LEAVING THE SITE)</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Confirm functionality with Onsite POC</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">CALL Panera Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk with - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a </span><span class=\"csB54904E9\">Case #</span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\"> &amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to </span><span class=\"csB54904E9\">[ Panera Support Helpdesk @ 314-984-3000 </span><span class=\"cs2E101AC8\">(Tip: Dial (314) 984-3000 &rarr; Option 7 &rarr; Special Code = &#39;#&#39; ) </span><span class=\"csB54904E9\">]</span><span class=\"cs2E101AC8\">&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Complete Online Deliverable PRIOR</span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\"> to leaving site - </span><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">you MUST obtain customer sign-off</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX. </span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Return Labels </span><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">- should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created</span></li></ul>\n\t\t<p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"csC583D0C8\"><span class=\"cs72F7C9C5\">Completion Notes&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;\">\n\t\t\t<li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Did you complete the Essintial Online Deliverable? Please provide Deliverable Confirmation Code (found at the end of the survey)&nbsp;</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Name of the Onsite Contact who verified operational?</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Detailed recap of the work that took place:</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Other important details about your visit?</span></li><li class=\"cs4FC7BF42\"><span class=\"cs9D249CCB\">Return Tracking #s</span></li></ul>","markdown":"No unauthorized persons allowed on site. Any swaps or helpers must be approved by Essintial.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.\n\nYOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU \\*\\*MUST\\*\\* HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.\n\nRequired On-site time/window: 11/06/2026\n\nEquipment:\n\nMake/Model: E541463\n\nSerial Number: K25WEC0998\n\nProblem Description: Kiosk Gen X | New Kiosk 4 Not Working\n\nS/N K25WEC0998\n\nTracking # 1ZY1A3490194419062 1ZY1A3490193378671\n\nReplacement device:\n\nE541463\\_C S/N E26WEC0495\n\nPanera Store: 609270\n\nWILLIAM Danner\n\n416 Chapel Drive, West Union Building\n\nDurham NC 27708\n\n(919) 213-6623\n\nSO1602798/ WOT0245970\n\nImportant Tech Requirements / Call Outs\n\n- Technicians MUST Verify STORE is open prior to going onsite\n- Technicians MUST Verify Parts Shipped are onsite PRIOR to going onsite\n- Technicians MUST represent themselves as a TRG Technician and carry TRG Badge (badge template attached to your work order)\n- Technicians MUST Check-In with Onsite POC\n- Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting: <https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004k7ll/ONBV1EkeBBy7Tig.FtJFxva3KlJZLfwIkdVmi7uHUTQ>\n- Techs MUST CALL Panera Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a Case # &amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to \\[ Panera Support Helpdesk @ 314-984-3000 (Tip: Dial (314) 984-3000 → Option 7 → Special Code = '#' ) \\]\n- Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions\n- Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen \\[ Refer to Guide for assistance)\n- Techs MUST verify operational with Onsite POC &amp; obtain customer sign-off prior to leaving site, this will be captured via online deliverable.\n- Techs MUST complete the Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving the site\n- Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX.\n- Return Labels - should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.\n- Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.\n- Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns\n- If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number\n- If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created\n\nImportant Scope/Customer Information:\n\n- These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business. Technicians are required to dress and conduct themselves in a suitable manner, including treating all people with dignity and respect and refrain from wandering into areas that do not pertain to your designated area of work.\n- Dress Code: Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no T-Shirts, Jeans or holes, A plain collared or button-down shirts, slacks, and nice shoes. (No Jeans, T-Shirts/Hoodies and NO Graphics or HOLES in clothing)\n- You will be required to obtain customer sign-off - this will be captured via online deliverable\n- Any changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial via phone.\n- If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.\n- If additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED. You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.\n- All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms / online deliverables\n- If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.\n\nRequired Tools:\n\n- Government Issued ID\n- Tech MUST carry/wear a TRG Badge while onsite \\[ use the provided Badge template\\]\n- Standard Tool Kit - screwdrivers, cutters, pliers, and wrenches\n- Cell Phone or other device that has phone, camera, and internet ability (for online deliverable)\n\n   Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE): Deliverable Link: <https://essintial.jotform.com/260955561516967>\n\n- Tech will be asked to confirm site/location details\n- Tech will be asked to provide Check-In &amp; Check-Out Times\n- Tech will be asked to provide completion notes\n- Tech will be asked to provide a photo of the completed device powered on\n- Tech will be asked to provide a photo showing a successful test transaction\n- Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Serial Number\n- Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Tag\n- Tech will be asked to provide the Panera Case # that was provided by Panera Support validating device is active\n- Tech will be asked to provide photo of return shipment sealed with return label visible.\n- Tech will be asked to enter return tracking number(s)\n- Tech will be asked to obtain sign-off from onsite manager\n- Tech will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverable\n\nUpon Arrival at site:\n\n- CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER – if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check in.\n- Check-In with Onsite POC - Introduce yourself as a TRG technician\n- Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting \\[Mounting Display &amp; Troubleshooting will be most useful\\]: <https://essintial.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/300000000D47/a/Ua000004k7ll/ONBV1EkeBBy7Tig.FtJFxva3KlJZLfwIkdVmi7uHUTQ>\n- Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions on how to run a test transaction.\n- Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen \\[ Refer to Guide for assistance)\n\nUpon Completion/Closeout Requirements (PRIOR TO LEAVING THE SITE)\n\n- Confirm functionality with Onsite POC\n- CALL Panera Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk with - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a Case # &amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to \\[ Panera Support Helpdesk @ 314-984-3000 (Tip: Dial (314) 984-3000 → Option 7 → Special Code = '#' ) \\]\n- Complete Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving site - you MUST obtain customer sign-off\n- Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out\n- Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX.\n- Return Labels - should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.\n- Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.\n- Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns\n- If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number\n- If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created\n\nCompletion Notes\n\n- Did you complete the Essintial Online Deliverable? Please provide Deliverable Confirmation Code (found at the end of the survey)\n- Name of the Onsite Contact who verified operational?\n- Detailed recap of the work that took place:\n- Other important details about your visit?\n- Return Tracking #s","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T09:00","end":"2026-11-06T12:00","latestStart":"2026-11-06T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":135},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":100},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":35}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":13.773599507077158},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T1