{"job":{"id":20318165,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Spencer Technologies","title":"GAP - Troubleshooting/Checking REG 401-402","description":{"html":"Check In Requirements: (Upon arrival to the site)<br/>-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN<br/>-Technician must be onsite before checking into the Mobile app<br/>-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a Mobile App, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1<br/>- TECH NEEDS TO ENSURE TO READ THE BELOW RETURN PROCESS FOR DEFECTIVE C620 PRINTERS<br/><br/>SOW:<br/><br/>Title: Troubleshooting/Checking REG 401-402<br/><br/>Description: Send out an experienced technician to check and troubleshoot all Registers for any Issue<br/>Please bring extra ethernet cable<br/>*Hardware check*<br/>> check for any physical damage (iPad, Printer, Cashdrawer, Customer Terminal, Scanner)<br/>> check devices functionality<br/>> check for any cable damage (All Ethernet Cables and Power Cables)<br/>\\*Error Message Check\\*<br/>> Check iPad and Pinpad for any error message<br/>\\*Reseat Cable Connections\\*<br/>> Ethernet Cables from iPad to WallJack or 8-Port Switch.<br/>> Ethernet Cables from Printer to WallJack or 8-Port Switch.<br/>> Ethernet Cables from m400 to WallJack or 8-Port Switch.<br/>> Cables from Printer to Scanner<br/>> Cables from Printer to Cash Drawer<br/>> Power Cables from Power Source to Printer<br/>> Power Cables from Power Source to Pinpad (IceCube)<br/>> Power Cables from Power Source to InVue Stand<br/> <br/>NOTES TO TECHNICIAN:<br/>1. Call the Store Tech Support  before leaving the store : 1-800-241-2626<br/>2. Document hours spent and provide resolution notes.<br/><br/>**Multiple Work Orders – Time Documentation Requirement**<br/>When multiple work orders are completed during the same onsite visit, time must be documented separately for each W/O. Do not duplicate the full onsite time acr