\\\\\\*  \n&gt; Check iPad and Pinpad for any error message  \n\\\\\\*Reseat Cable Connections\\\\\\*  \n&gt; Ethernet Cables from iPad to WallJack or 8-Port Switch.  \n&gt; Ethernet Cables from Printer to WallJack or 8-Port Switch.  \n&gt; Ethernet Cables from m400 to WallJack or 8-Port Switch.  \n&gt; Cables from Printer to Scanner  \n&gt; Cables from Printer to Cash Drawer  \n&gt; Power Cables from Power Source to Printer  \n&gt; Power Cables from Power Source to Pinpad (IceCube)  \n&gt; Power Cables from Power Source to InVue Stand  \n   \nNOTES TO TECHNICIAN:  \n1\\. Call the Store Tech Support before leaving the store : 1-800-241-2626  \n2\\. Document hours spent and provide resolution notes.  \n  \n\\*\\*Multiple Work Orders – Time Documentation Requirement\\*\\*  \nWhen multiple work orders are completed during the same onsite visit, time must be documented separately for each W/O. Do not duplicate the full onsite time across multiple tickets. Ensure the time entered for each work order accurately reflects the time spent on that specific task.  \n  \nRequired tools  \nBasic Tools  \nIf Network Scope Need the Following:  \nworking laptop with the updated driver  \nConsole Cables  \nCat5 Cable   \nCable tester  \nInternet dongle  \n   \nCheck in Requirements:  \n-TECHNICIANS WHO HAVE ACCESS TO SIGN INTO A MOBILE APP NO LONGER NEED TO CALL SPENCER SERVICE TO CHECK IN  \n-Technician must be onsite before checking into their mobile app  \n-If you have any questions or issues while on site, or if you do not have access to sign in via a mobile app, contact Spencer Service 508-635-2100 opt 1  \n-Tech to take before photo  \n   \nWhile Onsite:  \n   \nCheckout Requirements:  \n-Tech must check-out with the Spencer Service Department (877-541-0547, opt 1)  \n-Tech to take after photo  \n   \nDeliverables:  \n-Tech must send before and after photos to both QCPictures@spencertech.com; FTD@spencertech.com  \n-MOD email for Survey","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"