{"job":{"id":"6527492888","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"GOS Technical Services","title":"IAA Indoor access point Install (Graham, NC)","description":"<p>Install an indoor access point in the hallway. There is a cable already ran to the location. We are not sure if this cable works or not. If it doesn't work, we will need you to run a new cable to this location.</p><p><br></p><p>Make sure the cable is patched into the switch in the IT room and confirm that the AP works. You may need to work with our network engineer to confirm it works properly. Here is the contact info for the network engineers:</p><p><br></p><p>Attached is a picture of the hallway where we want the indoor AP installed. We are shipping out the indoor AP along with the mount today. </p><p><br></p><p>Tech will need an A-frame ladder.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T09:00","end":"2026-11-10T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":40.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $180 (countered: $195) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z"