{"job":{"id":"7403003204","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Kinettix","title":"FSDP-2617-276599 : Three (3) Screen Replacements for McDonalds Outdoor Menu Boards,2  techs needed (Hard Start Date/Time)","description":"<p><strong><u>***KINETTIX IS A FAST FUND APPROVED VENDOR</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>***THIS TICKET HAS A HARD START DATE/TIME. RESCHEDULE REQUESTS WITH LESS THAN 24HRS NOTICE WILL RESULT TO THE CANCELLATION OF THE TICKET.</u></strong></p><p><em><u>The Tech must call KINETTIX DISPATCH TEAM&nbsp;upon arrival and before leaving the site.</u></em></p><p><strong><u>Failure to do so will result in the tech or work order NOT be paid.</u></strong></p><p><strong>Scope of Work: </strong>WORK DESCRIPTION: Technician to be onsite to replace three ODMB displays (212, 214, and 215). Replacement screens are expected to be available onsite at the time of service. Technician must bring all tools required to safely access the menu board enclosures, remove the existing displays, and install the replacement units. Additional troubleshooting may be required if any issues are encountered during the replacement process. Upon completion of the installation, technician must verify that all three ODMBs are fully operational and displaying content correctly. Before leaving the site, technician must contact Coates Technical Support to review the results, confirm system functionality, and report any findings or concerns. Technician should also document the serial numbers of the installed displays and any relevant observations from the service visit.</p><p>Expected time on site (Additional troubleshooting steps and additional on site may be required): 4</p><p><br></p><p><strong>REMINDER: tech must secure a release code before checking out from the site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Another REMINDER: </strong>Technicians are required to follow the approved schedule and arrive only on the agreed date and time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If there is a need to arrive earlier than the approved schedule date, prior approval must be obtained from Kinettix before proceeding.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please note that any onsite time incurred without prior authorization and outside the agreed schedule will not be recognized for billing purposes and will not be processed for payment.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>SCREEN REPLACEMENTS SOW ONLY</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>•&nbsp;Old Screens that are replaced must be boxed up in the packaging the new screen came in and turned over to the&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;manager on duty.&nbsp;No exceptions to this.&nbsp;Photo of old screens boxed up inside the building are required for release</p><ul><li>under no circumstances is a tech to remove or dispose of a screen.&nbsp;Even if Coates and/or the Manager on duty requests removal of old screen</li><li>must collect photo of old Serial Number and the Serial Number of the newly installed screen</li><li>must provide photo of replaced screen at the location that they leave onsite. it is McD or Coates responsibilities to dispose of it</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Location: </strong>ODMB</p><p><strong>Required Tech: 2 techs </strong></p><p><strong>Tools: </strong>Basic tools,<strong> </strong>9mm socket, Allen Tools, needle nose pliers, security T40 and security T20 bit, deep socket kit, Adjustable Wrench capable of 1/2”-1” sizes, Cones/Safety Cones.</p><p><strong>Parts Shipped: </strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>\"All parts requested for installation must be completed as requested unless specifically requested otherwise by Coates Support. Under no other circumstance should it be determined that parts requested for installation are not necessary\"</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Note:</em></strong><em> Please take before and after photos and give a short summary of the work done.</em></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T09:00","end":"2026-11-10T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":88.85290895,"max":177.7058179},"pa