{"job":{"id":20319496,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Ovation Workplace Services","title":"Network Support Required (Filling the Service Visit Report is Mandatory)","description":{"html":"<p><strong><em>FILLING THE SITE VISIT REPORT IS MANDATORY BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE AND MUST BE UPLOADED BEFORE CLOSING THE WO</em></strong></p><p><strong>**The technician should NOT suggest purchasing any new equipment or materials while onsite, and should not discuss any issues that need to be fixed with the Store Manager. The technician must strictly follow the instructions provided during the Teams meeting.**</strong></p><p><br></p><p>The technician must join the meeting as soon as they arrive onsite. (The meeting details will be shared before arrival.) If there is any issue joining the meeting, or if no one is present in the meeting, please call the Wipro phone number provided in the confidential information. Select option 1 and provide the INC number or the location (as mentioned in the Work Order description). or call your WO manager from ovation.</p><p>POC details are available in the confidential information.</p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong> Hard Down</p><p><strong><em>(Any additional tools or cable purchased onsite should be approved by the Field nation work order manager. If you are getting no response please send an email on sd@ovationwps.com)</em></strong></p><p><strong>Required Tools &amp; Equipment:</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop with Windows operating system and Ethernet port(s)</li><li>Console cables (RJ45 to USB, USB to Serial converter)</li><li>Basic tool kit</li><li>USB drive (32GB)</li><li>Internet data (hotspot)</li><li>PuTTY application</li><li>MS Teams (installed on both phone and laptop)</li><li>Phone with a reliable hotspot</li><li>Patch cables (copper or fiber)</li></ul>","markdown":"***FILLING THE SITE VISIT REPORT IS MANDATORY BEFORE LEAVING THE SITE AND MUST BE UPLOADED BEFORE CLOSING THE WO***\n\n**\\*\\*The technician should NOT suggest purchasing any new equipment or materials while onsite, and should not discuss any issues that need to be fixed with the Store Manager. The technician must strictly follow the instructions provided during the Teams meeting.\\*\\***\n\nThe technician must join the meeting as soon as they arrive onsite. (The meeting details will be shared before arrival.) If there is any issue joining the meeting, or if no one is present in the meeting, please call the Wipro phone number provided in the confidential information. Select option 1 and provide the INC number or the location (as mentioned in the Work Order description). or call your WO manager from ovation.\n\nPOC details are available in the confidential information.\n\n**Scope of Work:** Hard Down\n\n***(Any additional tools or cable purchased onsite should be approved by the Field nation work order manager. If you are getting no response please send an email on sd@ovationwps.com)***\n\n**Required Tools &amp; Equipment:**\n\n- Laptop with Windows operating system and Ethernet port(s)\n- Console cables (RJ45 to USB, USB to Serial converter)\n- Basic tool kit\n- USB drive (32GB)\n- Internet data (hotspot)\n- PuTTY application\n- MS Teams (installed on both phone and laptop)\n- Phone with a reliable hotspot\n- Patch cables (copper or fiber)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T11:30","end":"2026-11-06T14:30"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":43.44587446778212},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"hourly","counterRate":60,"baseAmount":180,"estHours":3,"travelExpense":70,"payStructure":null,"counterDate":{"start":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T20:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":60,"mode":"hours","reason":"arrival_window"}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000