{"job":{"id":"5633666460","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Retail Tech Inc. - Deployment","title":"Extend network circuit to rack, connect, and test circuit with support - 12' LADDER AND MATERIALS REQUIRED!","description":"<p>SCOPE SUMMARY</p><p>Technician to extend the network circuit from the back room to the network rack. Approx 150' run. Once done, tech to work with support to complete the new circuit activation. Once the new circuit is connected, the technician will work with support to validate that the store is fully functional.</p><p><br></p><p>REQUIRED TOOLS</p><p>- 12' LADDER REQUIRED*****************</p><p>- https://www.rtisurl.com/?c=StandardTools</p><p>- Standard Data Cabling Tools</p><p>- Digital cable tester w/Pass &amp; Fail</p><p>- Toner w/ probe</p><p>- Punchdown tool w/ 110 blade</p><p>- Laptop</p><p>- Console Cable</p><p><br></p><p>MATERIALS</p><p>- 150-200' CAT6 cable</p><p>- (2) CAT6 data jacks</p><p>- (2) side entry/biscuit boxes</p><p>- Velcro</p><p>- Various length patch cables</p><p><br></p><p>**MUST SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION / SPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS SECTION FOR WORK INSTRUCTIONS**</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T09:00","end":"2026-11-09T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":31.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $240 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T1