{"job":{"id":20320043,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Essintial","title":"Diagnose & Repair/Replace -Kiosk","description":{"html":"<p><strong>No unauthorized persons allowed on site. Any swaps or helpers must be approved by Essintial.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU **MUST** HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.</u></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Required On-site time/window: Upon parts arrival</u></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><u>Equipment:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Make/Model: KIOSK</p>\n<p><strong><u>Problem Description:</u></strong> Please have the Tech capture the old Kiosk 1 S/N Issues: GEN X| KIOSK 1 | JLOD | Error code 01-2103 Tracking # 792646942146</p>\n<p>Replacement device: E541463_C S/N I25WEC1092</p>\n<p>Panera Store: 606143 Justin Long 5158 NC Hwy 42 Garner NC 27529 Phone Number: (919) 334-5930 SO1568983/ WOT0244436</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Important Tech Requirements / Call Outs</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Technicians MUST Verify STORE is open prior to going onsite</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Technicians MUST Verify Parts Shipped are onsite PRIOR to going onsite</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Technicians MUST</strong> represent themselves as a<strong><del>***</del> Technician</strong> and carry<strong><del>*** *****</del></strong> (badge template attached to your work order)</li>\n<li>Technicians <strong>MUST Check-In</strong> with Onsite POC</li>\n<li><strong>Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting</strong>:<strong><del>*****************************************************************************************************************</del></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Techs MUST CALL <del>******</del> Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a Case # &amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to</strong> <strong>[ <del>****** ******* ******** * ************</del></strong> <del>***** **** ***** ******** *** ****** * *** ******* **** * *** *</del> <strong>]</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen [ Refer to Guide for assistance)</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Techs <strong>MUST</strong> verify operational with Onsite POC &amp; obtain customer sign-off prior to leaving site, this will be captured via online deliverable.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Techs <strong>MUST</strong> complete the Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving the site&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Return Labels</strong> - should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns</li>\n<li>If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number&nbsp;</li>\n<li>If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Important Scope/Customer Information:</u></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business.&nbsp;Technicians are required to dress and conduct themselves in a suitable manner, including treating all people with dignity and respect and refrain from wandering into areas that do not pertain to your designated area of work.&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Dress Code:&nbsp;</strong>Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no T-Shirts, Jeans or holes, A plain collared or button-down shirts, slacks, and nice shoes. (No Jeans, T-Shirts/Hoodies and NO Graphics or HOLES in clothing)</li>\n<li>You will be required to obtain customer sign-off - this will be captured via online deliverable</li>\n<li>Any changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial <strong>via phone.</strong></li>\n<li>If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>If additional parts are needed there will be another trip&nbsp;REQUIRED.&nbsp;You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li>All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms / online deliverables</li>\n<li>If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Required Tools:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Government Issued ID</li>\n<li>Tech&nbsp;<strong>MUST</strong>&nbsp;carry/wear a&nbsp;<strong><del>***</del> Badge</strong>&nbsp;while onsite [ use the provided Badge template]</li>\n<li><strong>Standard Tool Kit</strong> - screwdrivers, cutters, pliers, and wrenches</li>\n<li>Cell Phone or other device that has phone, camera, and internet ability (for online deliverable)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial&nbsp;PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE):&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Deliverable Link:&nbsp;https://essintial.jotform.com/260955561516967</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tech will be asked to confirm site/location details</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide Check-In &amp; Check-Out Times</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide completion notes</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide a photo of the completed device powered on</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide a photo showing a successful test transaction</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Serial Number</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Tag</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide the <del>******</del> Case # that was provided by <del>******</del> Support validating device is active&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide photo of return shipment sealed with return label visible.</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to enter return tracking number(s)</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to obtain sign-off from onsite manager&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Tech will be asked to provide the confirmation code received upon completion of your online deliverable&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Upon Arrival at site:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>CHECK IN TO YOUR WORK ORDER – if you are unable to do so then you MUST call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check in.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Check-In with Onsite POC - Introduce yourself as a <del>***</del> technician</li>\n<li><strong>Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting [Mounting Display &amp; Troubleshooting will be most useful]</strong>:<strong><del>*****************************************************************************************************************</del></strong><del>******</del></li>\n<li><strong>Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions on how to run a test transaction.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen [ Refer to Guide for assistance)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Upon Completion/Closeout Requirements (PRIOR TO LEAVING THE SITE)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Confirm functionality with Onsite POC</li>\n<li><strong>CALL <del>******</del> Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk with - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a</strong><strong>Case #</strong> <strong>&amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to</strong> <strong><del>* ****** ******* ******** * ************</del></strong> <del>***** **** ***** ******** *** ****** * *** ******* **** * *** *</del> <strong><del>*</del></strong><del>******</del></li>\n<li><strong>Complete Online Deliverable PRIOR</strong> to leaving site - <strong>you MUST obtain customer sign-off</strong></li>\n<li>Call Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to check-out</li>\n<li>Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Return Labels</strong> - should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns</li>\n<li>If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number</li>\n<li>If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Completion Notes&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Did you complete the Essintial Online Deliverable? Please provide Deliverable Confirmation Code (found at the end of the survey)&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Name of the Onsite Contact who verified operational?</li>\n<li>Detailed recap of the work that took place:</li>\n<li>Other important details about your visit?</li>\n<li>Return Tracking #s</li>\n</ul>","markdown":"**No unauthorized persons allowed on site. Any swaps or helpers must be approved by Essintial.**\n\n**IMPORTANT: Please use your Field Nation App to update your work order real time &amp; only call Essintial for additional expenses, return labels or to have another work order opened for another trip to site.**\n\n**YOUR WORK ORDER ONLY COVERS ONE VISIT TO SITE. IF CUSTOMER REQUIRES A RETURN VISIT YOU \\*\\*MUST\\*\\* HAVE ANOTHER WORK ORDER. TIME LOGGED FOR ADDITIONAL DAYS ONSITE WILL BE REJECTED FOR NOT FOLLOWING PROCESSES.**\n\n**Required On-site time/window: Upon parts arrival**\n\n**Equipment:**\n\nMake/Model: KIOSK\n\n**Problem Description:** Please have the Tech capture the old Kiosk 1 S/N Issues: GEN X| KIOSK 1 | JLOD | Error code 01-2103 Tracking # 792646942146\n\nReplacement device: E541463\\_C S/N I25WEC1092\n\nPanera Store: 606143 Justin Long 5158 NC Hwy 42 Garner NC 27529 Phone Number: (919) 334-5930 SO1568983/ WOT0244436\n\n**Important Tech Requirements / Call Outs**\n\n- **Technicians MUST Verify STORE is open prior to going onsite**\n- **Technicians MUST Verify Parts Shipped are onsite PRIOR to going onsite**\n- **Technicians MUST** represent themselves as a**\\*\\*\\* Technician** and carry**\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** (badge template attached to your work order)\n- Technicians **MUST Check-In** with Onsite POC\n- **Refer to this Installation Guide for swaps, testing, and troubleshooting**:**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n- **Techs MUST CALL \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Support to confirm active conditions of the kiosk - Tech MUST obtain/ask for a Case # &amp; Name of the Support Agent they spoke to** **\\[ \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\* \\* **\\]**\n- **Techs MUST complete &amp; take a photo of a successful Test Transaction confirming Kiosk is working properly and add to deliverable - see installation guide for instructions**\n- **Techs MUST obtain/capture the 6-Digit Cafe Kiosk Code and add to deliverable - code is located in the top-right corner of the Kiosk App Home Screen \\[ Refer to Guide for assistance)**\n- Techs **MUST** verify operational with Onsite POC &amp; obtain customer sign-off prior to leaving site, this will be captured via online deliverable.\n- Techs **MUST** complete the Online Deliverable PRIOR to leaving the site\n- Used/Unused Devices - box up using the box the new equipment was shipped in, apply the provided return label, and drop off at nearest UPS/FEDEX.\n- **Return Labels** - should be located on the outside of the box the new equipment was shipped in.\n- Upload copy of return receipt to your work order.\n- Provide Return Tracking for all used/not used returns\n- If any whole units were replaced you are REQUIRED to provide the old &amp; new serial number\n- If additional parts are needed and/or another visit is needed - CONTACT Essintial ASAP to request parts and/or have another ticket/wo created\n\n**Important Scope/Customer Information:**\n\n- These are live environments, and technician must act in a professional manner, taking care not to disrupt business. Technicians are required to dress and conduct themselves in a suitable manner, including treating all people with dignity and respect and refrain from wandering into areas that do not pertain to your designated area of work.\n- **Dress Code:** Professional appearance is mandatory. Business casual attire required: no T-Shirts, Jeans or holes, A plain collared or button-down shirts, slacks, and nice shoes. (No Jeans, T-Shirts/Hoodies and NO Graphics or HOLES in clothing)\n- You will be required to obtain customer sign-off - this will be captured via online deliverable\n- Any changes to ETA’s MUST be relayed to the End User and Essintial **via phone.**\n- If you are unfamiliar with the equipment or a particular repair needed, do not tell the customer this. Call Essintial Support for assistance.\n- **If additional parts are needed there will be another trip REQUIRED. You MUST CALL Essintial @ 800-326-6999 to advise. This ticket should be closed and a new work order will be opened.**\n- All times provided to Essintial MUST MATCH what is listed in your work order as well as any required sign off forms / online deliverables\n- If additional pay/expenses are required - please refer to Policies &amp; Procedures #6.\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n- Government Issued ID\n- Tech **MUST** carry/wear a **\\*\\*\\* Badge** while onsite \\[ use the provided Badge template\\]\n- **Standard Tool Kit** - screwdrivers, cutters, pliers, and wrenches\n- Cell Phone or other device that has phone, camera, and internet ability (for online deliverable)\n\n**Online Deliverable (Due back to Essintial PRIOR TO LEAVING SITE):**\n\nDeliverable Link: <https://essintial.jotform.com/260955561516967>\n\n- Tech will be asked to confirm site/location details\n- Tech will be asked to provide Check-In &amp; Check-Out Times\n- Tech will be asked to provide completion notes\n- Tech will be asked to provide a photo of the completed device powered on\n- Tech will be asked to provide a photo showing a successful test transaction\n- Tech will be asked to provide photos of Old &amp; New Kiosk Serial Number\n- Tech will be asked to 