imilar taxes on behalf of the Contractor on this Work Order. The Buyer on this Work Order shall not cover Contractor on this Work Order under any worker’s compensation policy the Buyer on this Work Order may obtain. To the fullest extent permitted by law, the Contractor on this work order shall indemnify the Buyer on this work order from all damages, losses, or expenses, including attorney’s fees, from any claims or damages for bodily injury, sickness, disease, or death, or form claims for damages to tangible property, other than the Work itself. This indemnification shall extend to claims resulting from performance of this Work Order and shall apply only to the extent that the claim or loss is caused in whole or in part by any negligent act or omission of Contactor on this Work Order or any of its agents, employees, or subcontractors. This indemnity shall be effective regardless of whether the claim or loss is caused in some part by a party to be indemnified. The Contractor on this Work Order agrees to hold the Buyer on this Work Order harmless in the event of damages or injuries due to any negligence of the Contractor on this Work Order’s part, and that the Contractor on this Work Order will pay all legal and defense costs associated with any damage or injury claims.*\n\n*For the duration of this agreement and for a period of (12) twelve months after the completion/ termination of this agreement; the Contractor will not directly or indirectly, for himself or on behalf of any other person, company, partnership, corporation or other entity, solicit or attempt to solicit, for the purposes of engaging in competition with Gable Company. This includes but is not limited to:*\n\n- *The solicitation of Gable Company’s customers/clients, architects and engineers*\n- *The solicitation of Gable Company's customer/client employees*\n- *The solicitation of Gable Company's employees*\n- *The enticement, diversion or any other act that would otherwise damage, divert business, take away from Gable Company's business or patronage of any customer/client*\n- *The solicitation or inducement of any customer to terminate its relationship with Gable Company*\n\n*Unless expressly authorized in writing by the Gable Company, contractor agrees to retain the Confidential Information in confidence and shall not copy or disclose the Confidential Information to or use the Confidential Information for the benefit of any third party. Confidential Information shall only be disclosed to the contractor’s employees and, even then, only to the extent that such employees have a specific need to know of the Confidential Information, for the evaluation of the proposed transaction. Before receiving any part of the Confidential Information, contractor’s employees shall be required to read this Non-disclosure Agreement and, by receiving such Confidential Information, such employee shall acknowledge and agree to abide by the contractor’s obligations hereunder.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-11T11:00","end":"2026-11-11T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":11.389263909071666},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGat