{"job":{"id":20325237,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"Sleep Number - IFit Projector Replacement","description":{"html":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">SOW: </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">PLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS (PHONES RING THROUGH IN THE ORDER LISTED BELOW)</span><del>**************</del></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">TECHNICAL CONTACT: </span><del>****************************</del></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">LOCAL CONTACT: </span><del>**************</del><del>**************</del></p><p></p><p>We need a technician to complete the following: <span style=\"color: rgb(230, 0, 0);\">(INSTERT CUSTOMER REQUEST SUMMARY HERE)</span></p><p></p><ul><li>CHECK IN WITH CIS</li><li>CHECK IN WITH LCON</li><li>CHECK IN WITH TCON</li><li>Please send a tech to replace the store&#39;s IFit projector. </li><li>The projector will be mounted upside down, set in Ceiling Mode, rear projection. </li><li>The projected image must be sized to fit the frosted glass at the foot of the bed with no overhang.</li><li>Take away the old projector for e-waste recycling.</li><li>CHECK OUT WITH TECHNICAL CONTACT</li><li>CHECK OUT WITH LOCAL MANAGER</li><li>TAKE REQUIRED PHOTOS - <strong>ALL PHOTOS MUST BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THE PHOTO IS WHEN UPLOADED TO FN WO</strong></li><li>CHECK OUT WITH CIS</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Equipment required</span></p><ol><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Laptop</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Laptop Charger</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Console Cable</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Cable Tester</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Fish Tape</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Toner</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Crimper</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Label Maker</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">10&#39; Ladder</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Required Materials To Have On-Hand:</span></p><ol><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Cat6 Cable</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Surface Mount Box</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Keystone Jacks</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Cat6 Patch Cables</span></li><li>Zip Ties/Velcro Strips</li></ol><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">DELIVERABLES:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO </span><del>************</del></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- WORKMAN&#39;S COMP WAIVER </span><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(ATTACHED)</em></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">- MANAGERS SIGN OFF </span><em style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(ATTACHED)</em></p><p></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><em>*****NOTE: </em></strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">ALL PHOTOS MUST BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THE PHOTO IS WHEN UPLOADED TO FN WO*****</strong></p><p></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Before the tech leaves the site, they MUST call to check out with CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM prior to leaving site in order to close the work order out.</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">***Please note if you do not call for check out we may need to deny payment***</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 39, 65); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> </span></p>","markdown":"SOW:\n\nPLEASE CHECK IN / OUT WITH CIS (PHONES RING THROUGH IN THE ORDER LISTED BELOW)\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nTECHNICAL CONTACT: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nLOCAL CONTACT: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nWe need a technician to complete the following: (INSTERT CUSTOMER REQUEST SUMMARY HERE)\n\n- CHECK IN WITH CIS\n- CHECK IN WITH LCON\n- CHECK IN WITH TCON\n- Please send a tech to replace the store's IFit projector.\n- The projector will be mounted upside down, set in Ceiling Mode, rear projection.\n- The projected image must be sized to fit the frosted glass at the foot of the bed with no overhang.\n- Take away the old projector for e-waste recycling.\n- CHECK OUT WITH TECHNICAL CONTACT\n- CHECK OUT WITH LOCAL MANAGER\n- TAKE REQUIRED PHOTOS - **ALL PHOTOS MUST BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THE PHOTO IS WHEN UPLOADED TO FN WO**\n- CHECK OUT WITH CIS\n\nEquipment required\n\n1. Laptop\n2. Laptop Charger\n3. Console Cable\n4. Cable Tester\n5. Fish Tape\n6. Toner\n7. Crimper\n8. Label Maker\n9. 10' Ladder\n\nRequired Materials To Have On-Hand:\n\n1. Cat6 Cable\n2. Surface Mount Box\n3. Keystone Jacks\n4. Cat6 Patch Cables\n5. Zip Ties/Velcro Strips\n\nDELIVERABLES:\n\n\\- PHOTOS OF WORK DONE - TEXTED TO \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\- WORKMAN'S COMP WAIVER *(ATTACHED)*\n\n\\- MANAGERS SIGN OFF *(ATTACHED)*\n\n***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*NOTE:*** **ALL PHOTOS MUST BE LABELED AS TO WHAT THE PHOTO IS WHEN UPLOADED TO FN WO\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Before the tech leaves the site, they MUST call to check out with CIS PRO SERVICE TEAM prior to leaving site in order to close the work order out.**\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Please note if you do not call for check out we may need to deny payment\\*\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T11:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":120},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":8.527591948635466},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $120 (countered: $120) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end