{"job":{"id":"6749621087","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"TOGA TECHNOLOGY","title":"Office Depot – In-home Technology Consultation","description":"<ul><li><strong>Service Description: </strong>A Technician will discuss and guide basic technical questions around the Customers hardware and or topic requested by the Customer. Demonstrate the usage of their computer, Smart Home Device, Windows, Office Suite, Mac, iOS, Android, or Chrome. If asked, the technician will assist the Customer in using the basic features of the Customers network or printer. <strong>If the job is not able to be completed meaning, there was NO WORK COMPLETED and you are at the customer's house, Payment will be reduced to time and travel at $40</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong>Service Procedure:</strong></p><p><strong>﻿Upon completing a 15-minute on-site visit and having attempted contact through both phone and door knocking, kindly reach out to our office.</strong> We will promptly provide guidance on the appropriate course of action moving forward. Your prompt communication is greatly appreciated.</p><p>The Field Technician will perform the following tasks:</p><ul><li>Assist Customers with any basic questions about selected hardware or software topics.</li><li>Demonstrate the usage of their computer, Windows, Chrome, Office Suite, Mac OS, iOS, Android, or Chrome.</li><li>If requested, the technician can demonstrate basic features usage of their Network or Printer.</li><li>Service complete.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Service Scope: In-Scope</strong></p><ul><li>Support for Windows 10, 11, Android, iOS, Mac OS, and Chrome</li><li>Up to 60 minutes of a technical/instructional session</li><li>Smart Home devices</li><li>Answer basic questions about software or hardware</li><li>Demonstrate basic features if requested of the Customers computer, network, or printer</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Out-of-Scope </strong></p><ul><li>Support for Windows, XP, Vista, and 7</li><li>Windows 8.1 once its been clarified</li><li>Support for Linux</li><li>Tax and accounting software consultation</li><li>Computer setup, printer setup, network setup, and software installation (Add-on available at an additional fee)</li><li>Removal of unwanted programs, malware, and viruses</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Customer Responsibilities</strong></p><ul><li>An adult (18+) must always be present at the installation site&nbsp;</li><li>Usernames and passwords</li><li>Network names and passwords</li><li>Make and model numbers</li><li>All needed cables or accessories</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>CODE OF CONDUCT:</strong></p><p>Your acceptance of our<strong> Agilant Solutions</strong> assignment (work order) is your agreement to comply with our code of conduct. Failure to comply can result in a reduction in payment or nonpayment, being placed on probation for a period, and the violation can include removal from the talent pool and/or being blocked from future dispatches. Contract Field Technicians (Service Pros) are expected to act in a polite, ethical, and professional manner at all times.</p><ul><li>All technicians must be dressed professionally in clean work pants (or jeans in good condition) and shirts with sleeves (and in good repair), socks, and closed-toe shoes.</li><li>Maintain good personal hygiene.</li><li>Avoid any non-assignment-related conversations with our Customers (e.g. opinion of product quality, personal issues, payment status, politics, etc.).</li><li>DO NOT solicit our Customers for any reason.&nbsp;If additional work is requested call 1-(844)-276-7263</li><li>The unauthorized use, possession, solicitation for, or sale of narcotics or other illegal drugs, alcohol, or prescription medication on Company or customer premises or while performing an assignment is strictly prohibited.</li><li>Being impaired or under the influence of legal or illegal drugs or alcohol on the Company or Customer premises.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>By accepting this assignment, you agree:</strong></p><ul><li>You have the skills, knowledge, experience, and tools to successfully complete the scope of work.</li><li>You agree to <u>follow COVID-19 CDC safety guidelines</u> found at www.cdc.gov</li><li>To represent the Customer, you are a Service Pro selected by <strong>Office Depot In-Home Support team</strong> to complete the assignment</li><li>You will <u>contact the Customer upon acceptance</u> and confirm the appointment date, time and clarify any scope of work questions necessary to prepare for the appointment</li><li>You will contact the Customer when in route and provide an approximate arrival time</li><li>You will contact&nbsp;<strong>Office Depot In-Home Support team</strong> at 1-(844)-276-7263&nbsp;if additional work is requested, resolving issues during the initial appointment or requests by the customer to return to complete the original installation.</li><li>You will not share personal contact information such as email address, business card, website, or social media account with the customer</li><li>By accepting this job, you are acknowledging and agreeing to the flat rate that has been accepted. We do not operate on an hourly rate basis. Therefore, if the task extends beyond the estimated time, please contact us immediately</li><li>You will close out the assignment for payment no more than 24 hours of dispatch completion</li><li>If the job is not able to be completed meaning, there was NO WORK completed and you are at the customer's house, Payment will be reduced to time and travel at $40</li></ul>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-11T16:00","end":"2026-11-11T20:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":55},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":72.3},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $55 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14: