{"job":{"id":20324284,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Run cable from KDS to Wall patch or Dlink","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><br/><p>Needs to do a cable run from KDS to Wall patch or Dlink</p><br/><p>- Check other cables for any signs of damage (For other printer in store)</p><br/><p>- Check other cable issues with POC</p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p><br></p><br/><p> </p><br/><p>Please provide images of all work completed onsite.</p><br/><p>Provide detailed close out notes including all work done onsite, any issues or delays, MOD&#39;s name, Support&#39;s name, and if a revisit is needed.</p><br/><p>Must provided receipt or invoice for all expenses or materials</p><br/><p> </p><br/><p><em>Review the “Confidential Section” listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch.</em></p><br/><p>Do not log multiple site visits on this work order.</p><br/><p>Each site visit will require its own work order.</p><br/><p>If a revisit is needed, close out this work order and contact Pivital ASAP to notify that a revisit will be required.</p><br/><p> </p><br/><p><strong><u>Tool Requirement:</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li>300 Feet Cat 6 (Will be reimbursed up to $0.35 per/foot)</li><li>RJ45 connectors (Will be reimbursed up to $0.50 per/connector)</li><li>RJ45 crimping tool</li><li>Wire stripper / Cable scissors</li><li>Faceplates and Cat 6 jacks</li><li>Cable/Continuity Tester</li><li>8-10 foot Ladder</li><li>Spare patch cables</li><li>Zip ties / Velcro for cable management</li><li>Standard Tool Kit - including flat and Phillips screwdrivers in various sizes and needle nose pliers</li><li>Permanent marker</li><li>Digital Camera/Phone</li><li>Label maker</li></ul><p> </p><br/><p><strong><u>Site Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li>Do Not Post Any Customer Photos On Social Media</li></ul><p> </p><br/><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><br/><ul><li>Govern