{"job":{"id":20322669,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Service Point","title":"Assistant Tech PC/Workstation Overnight Refresh","description":{"html":"<p><strong>PRIOR TO ARRIVAL ONSITE:</strong></p><p>Step 1. Before entering the site, CHECK IN with the Insight Command Center (ICC).</p><ul><li>Call 1.800.359.2620 option 1</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:&nbsp;</u></strong></p><p><strong>(YOU WILL BE HELPING THE MAIN TECH WITH THE FOLLOWING, LEAD TECH WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR COMMUNICATING ALL ISSUES AND PROVIDING DELIVERABLES)</strong></p><ul><li>Complete Pre-Refresh walk thru document/walkthrough with GM</li><li>Take Inventory and collect Serial Numbers of new PCs</li><li>Replace Server, UBS Battery, desktop computer, Printer, Monitor, keyboard, mouse, and any associated cables</li><li>Remove and setup new worksations, adding devices to the domain</li><li>Wipe old workstations, package them to prep for shipping</li><li>Setup and remove printers, adding them to the domain</li><li>Clean all work areas ensure everything is left clean</li><li>Perform Office-Style cable management</li><li>Collect required deliverables and check out with Support&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools/Materials</u></strong></p><ul><li>Standard computer tool kit to include:</li><li>Philips screwdriver</li><li>Flat head screwdriver</li><li>Flashlight</li><li>Charged Cell phone preferably an Android or iPhone w/ charger</li><li>Box Cutter</li><li>Pen</li><li>Laptop or Tablet with MS Word or equivalent to edit documents</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>Flat rate covers up to 4hrs onsite. Any additional time will be paid at $25 an hour</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment. All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum. If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate, subsequent days scheduled will be considered 'Cancelled', not 'Aborted'.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.</em></strong></p>","markdown":"**PRIOR TO ARRIVAL ONSITE:**\n\nStep 1. Before entering the site, CHECK IN with the Insight Command Center (ICC).\n\n- Call 1.800.359.2620 option 1\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n**(YOU WILL BE HELPING THE MAIN TECH WITH THE FOLLOWING, LEAD TECH WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR COMMUNICATING ALL ISSUES AND PROVIDING DELIVERABLES)**\n\n- Complete Pre-Refresh walk thru document/walkthrough with GM\n- Take Inventory and collect Serial Numbers of new PCs\n- Replace Server, UBS Battery, desktop computer, Printer, Monitor, keyboard, mouse, and any associated cables\n- Remove and setup new worksations, adding devices to the domain\n- Wipe old workstations, package them to prep for shipping\n- Setup and remove printers, adding them to the domain\n- Clean all work areas ensure everything is left clean\n- Perform Office-Style cable management\n- Collect required deliverables and check out with Support\n\n**Required Tools/Materials**\n\n- Standard computer tool kit to include:\n- Philips screwdriver\n- Flat head screwdriver\n- Flashlight\n- Charged Cell phone preferably an Android or iPhone w/ charger\n- Box Cutter\n- Pen\n- Laptop or Tablet with MS Word or equivalent to edit documents\n\n***Flat rate covers up to 4hrs onsite. Any additional time will be paid at $25 an hour***\n\n***Technicians are responsible for requesting a budget increase or expense reimbursement as well as closing out their own assignment for payment. All budget increases or expense reimbursements must be requested within 48 hours after check out,otherwise they will not be approved.***\n\n***Aborted sites with hourly payment terms will be paid per the terms for actual time onsite with a one hour minimum. If a site is aborted and there is a flat rate for the payment terms, the ticket will be closed out for 50% of the contracted rate, subsequent days scheduled will be considered 'Cancelled', not 'Aborted'.***\n\n***All site aborts MUST be approved by ServicePoint.***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-12-14T19:45","end":"2026-12-14T31:45"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":360},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":4,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":8,"amount":30}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":12,"distance":6.116817228127499},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"monitor\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-12-14T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-15T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-16T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-18T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-19T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC 