{"job":{"id":"7183623632","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"04048455-Humacyte INC-EPIK Survey and Install","description":"DESCRIPTION: \"\"9193613121 not sure<br>9193613122 not sure<br>9193613123 elevator<br>9193613126 elevator<br>9193613127 elevator<br>9193613128 utility room\"\"<br>\"\"\"SOW - EPIK Single Visit Install<br>*************************************************************************************<br>Before Arrival<br>1.\tCall the LCON 30 minutes before arrival.<br>2.\tReview the EPIK install video if you are unfamiliar with EPIK:<br>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n7ZkeVrRRCo<br>3.\tArrive with all required tools and materials listed below.<br>On Arrival<br>1.\tCheck in on WorkMarket.<br>2.\tLocate the customer contact and confirm the install location.<br>3.\tReview the Special Instructions before starting work.<br>EPIK Install Requirements<br>1.\tMount the Epik device in the approve install location and EPIK 66 block or connect harmonica to RJ 21X on Epik.<br>2.\tIf EPIK device mounting location is not in a cool, clean, secure area reach out to Activation for an updated location. <br>3.\tPower on the EPIK device before starting the Wizard.<br>Do not log into the Wizard until the device is powered on.<br>4.\tIf applicable connect the EPIK device to the customer network using the information provided in the Special Instructions.<br>5.\tLog into the EPIK Install Wizard:<br>https://wizard.epik.io<br>6.\tFollow the Wizard steps and complete the installation with the assigned Activations Representative. A member of the Activations team will reach out by text once assigned.<br>DO NOT CALL INTO THE QUEUE FOR WIZARD RELATED ISSUES<br>7.\tIf not already stated in the TNs to be wired section of your ticket, confirm with site contact if there are fire alarm, security alarm, elevator or e911 lines on site. If so, notify activations of any port configuration changes that need to be made and complete testing with the fire, security or elevator monitoring companies.<br>8.\tFor any lines that cannot be found, complete test calls on the number and notify activations of what end device, person or monitoring service answers the call. If it is ring no answer, run a new line to a biscuit jack and label it with the new Epik number.<br>9.\tIf any of the TNs are voice or fax lines, confirm with the site contact if they need to keep the same numbers. If so, run a line to a biscuit jack and confirm dial tone at the jack. We will complete a revisit to complete the cross connection once the port order is ready.<br>Checkout Requirement<br>1. \tProvide a cut sheet to activations noting the old telephone number with the new number provided by Epik for each line.<br>2.\tConfirm Activations has released you.<br>3.\tSubmit all WorkMarket deliverables.<br>4.\tEnter the checkout code in WorkMarket.<br>5.\tCheck out on WorkMarket.<br><br>The install is not considered valid unless the checkout code is entered in WorkMarket.<br><br>Required Deliverables<br>Submit all required deliverables in WorkMarket before checkout:<br>1.\tPhoto of completed EPIK install.<br>2.\tPhoto of labeled 66 block / harmonica block.<br>3.\tList of existing TNs and the new number that replaced each TN, if applicable.<br>4.\tCustomer signed sign-out sheet.<br>5.\tAny additional deliverables listed in Special Instructions.<br><br><br>Required Tools<br>•\tLaptop<br>•\tSmartphone with hotspot<br>•\tTone generator and wand<br>•\t66/110 punch tool<br>•\tButt set<br>•\t       Infrared Temperature Gun <br>•\tElectrician scissors<br>•\tStep ladder<br>•\tFlashlight/headlamp<br>•\tRJ11/RJ45 crimper<br>•\tEthernet cable tester<br>•\tImpact drill / cordless drill<br>•\tMasonry bits<br>•\tScrewdrivers / driver bits<br>•\tNeedle-nose pliers<br>•\tLabel maker and label tape<br>•\tCat3 or better cable<br>•\tCat6 Ethernet cable<br>•\tCross-connect wire<br>•\tGel-crimp connectors<br>•\tCable ties and mounting hardware<br>•\tRJ11/RJ45 plugs and keystone jacks<br>•\tConsole cables: USB to DB9 PL2303 and USB to USB-mini<br>*************************************************************************************<br><br>Special Instructions<br>Install Location<br>Enter where the EPIK device should be installed, including MDF/IDF/telco room location, wall/rack/shelf mounting instructions, and access notes.<br>________________________________________<br>Cable Runs<br>Enter any required cable runs, cable type, distance, start/end points, and whether ladder, lift, ceiling access, or special tools are needed.<br>________________________________________<br>Netwo\"","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-06T09:00","end":"2026-11-06T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":225},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":11.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/6/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-07T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-06T16:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"