{"job":{"id":20328813,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PurTeraIT","title":"POS equipment install ","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Overview</u></strong></p><p>Level 10 technician will be on site to install new POS equipment, Bump Bar&nbsp;</p><p>systems, a tablet, and a SAVI Edge device. The technician will validate and test&nbsp;</p><p>the new POS equipment with Adora support and validate and test the SAVI Edge&nbsp;</p><p>device with SAVI support. If necessary, toning and tracing of cables may be&nbsp;</p><p>required.</p><p>Prior to techs arrival:</p><p>- Site will be wired with the jacks and patch panel labeled.</p><p>- Network equipment will be installed and patched in awaiting</p><p>&nbsp;equipment installation.</p><p>- Equipment will be shipped to site.</p><ul><li><strong><u>Please see the attached runbook document for detailed install instructions and tool requirements </u></strong></li></ul><p><strong><u>Before You Begin</u></strong></p><p>• Call Level 10 Support to check in 800-807-1733.</p><p>• Introduce yourself to the manager on duty.</p><p>• Find and audit the equipment/materials for the installation. Use the&nbsp;</p><p>packing slip attached to the box. It will be located on the box in the plastic&nbsp;</p><p>pocket sleeve or on a printed receipt attached to a piece of hardware&nbsp;</p><p>inside one of the boxes. Please escalate to Level 10 support if anything is&nbsp;</p><ul><li>damaged or cannot be found at 800-807-1733.</li></ul><p>Notifications</p><p>Pay close attention to these icons throughout this documentation, each icon&nbsp;</p><p>highlights something important, required, or specific as it relates to the scope of</p>","markdown":"**Overview**\n\nLevel 10 technician will be on site to install new POS equipment, Bump Bar\n\nsystems, a tablet, and a SAVI Edge device. The technician will validate and test\n\nthe new POS equipment with Adora support and validate and test the SAVI Edge\n\ndevice with SAVI support. If necessary, toning and 