mediately and call the Ascent Operations Center (AOC) for direction on how to proceed. The AOC will reach out for further direction from USCC personnel.\n\n8\\. Information Specific to Escort Requests: a. While onsite, the vendor technician will not touch any critical equipment. b. While the escorting vendor technician is onsite, they will act as the lead personnel and have the authority to act in the best interest of the site to ensure the safety and security of the site and people within. Completion of Work\n\n9\\. Upon successful completion of the request, please ensure that the access card is returned to the lockbox, the lights are turned off and all doors and gates are secured.\n\n10\\. Upon completing all requested work for the client, the vendor technician will follow the directions on the sign-in reply from Step 4 to sign out with USCC.\n\n11\\. The vendor technician will then call out to the \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*to close out the WO.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T12:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":45,"max":45},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":45,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":66.9432234407795},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $45 (countered: $60) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","su