{"job":{"id":20328189,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"URGENT - VIP SITE!! NEED DONE ASAP!! Kiosk Service - Break/Fix - Troubleshoot Carousel","description":{"html":"<p>**KIOSK #: NS8259**</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Overview:</p>\n<p>Troubleshoot issues with the carousel.</p>\n<p>It appears to be dragging or has an obstruction preventing smooth movement.</p>\n<p>Check each magazine for any cracks, breaks, missing hooks attaching it to the carousel (black bracket), or partially ejected key.</p>\n<p>Also remove any loose keys or debris/shavings and test if possible</p>\n<p>Kiosk carousel is experiencing motion issues and needs troubleshooting.</p>\n<p>Investigate carousel movement, check for drag or obstruction, and confirm smooth rotation before leaving site.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check out with SSN.</p>\n<p>SUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables**</p>\n<p>**Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app**</p>\n<p><strong>**Call into SSN to check in/ out to confirm arrival and departure from site**</strong></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*KIOSK #: NS8259\\*\\*\n\nOverview:\n\nTroubleshoot issues with the carousel.\n\nIt appears to be dragging or has an obstruction preventing smooth movement.\n\nCheck each magazine for any cracks, breaks, missing hooks attaching it to the carousel (black bracket), or partially ejected key.\n\nAlso remove any loose keys or debris/shavings and test if possible\n\nKiosk carousel is experiencing motion issues and needs troubleshooting.\n\nInvestigate carousel movement, check for drag or obstruction, and confirm smooth rotation before leaving site.\n\nCheck out with SSN.\n\nSUBMIT TICKET BEFORE LEAVING SITE!!\n\n\\*\\*All techs must download our company's app for submission of field notes and photo deliverables\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*Complete the scope of work outlined in the SSN app\\*\\*\n\n**\\*\\*Call into