{"job":{"id":20330205,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CIS","title":"Sarku Japan - AP & Cable Installation","description":{"html":"<p>Technician to install a new Cat 6 cable run from the existing PoE switch (Port 23, or next available PoE port as directed by CIS engineering) to the front counter, and mount, connect, and turn up the AP at the designated front counter ceiling/wall location in coordination with CIS engineering. Some locations will be an AP only installation which will not require any cable installation.</p><p> </p><p>Required Materials</p><ul><li>1000&#39; of Cat6</li><li>Surface Mount Box</li><li>Cat 6 Keystone Jacks</li><li>Cat6 Patch Cables</li><li>Zip Ties</li><li>Velcro Strips</li></ul><p> </p><p>Required Tools</p><ul><li>Laptop</li><li>Laptop Charger</li><li>Console Cable</li><li>Cable Tester/ Toner</li><li>Fish Tape</li><li>Crimper</li><li>Drill and assorted drill bits</li><li>10&#39; Ladder</li></ul><p> </p><p>Cable &amp; AP Installation: </p><p>1.1. Install Qty. 1 – Cat 6 Plenum Cable from the existing PoE Switch (Port 23, or next available PoE port as directed by CIS engineering) to the front counter ceiling/wall location. </p><p>1.1.1. Terminate the AP end to a Cat 6 data jack installed in a surface mount box. </p><p>1.1.2. Terminate the switch end at an available port on the existing patch panel and patch to the PoE switch with the supplied patch cord. </p><p>1.1.3. Test continuity and label cabling to industry standards/customer labeling scheme. </p><p>1.1.4. Install using existing pathways and use required J-hooks spaced no more than 5 ft apart where no pathway exists to ensure cable meets local and building codes. </p><p>1.2. Install Qty. 1 – CIS provided AP, mounted at the designated front counter ceiling/wall location. </p><p>1.3. Connect the AP to the network and coordinate with CIS engineering for configuration. </p><p>1.3.1. AP hardware configuration will need to be set to SarkuNET2</p><p>1.3.2. Test and turn up the device with CIS engineering. </p><p>1.3.3. Record the MAC address or Serial Number, if required. </p><p>1.4. CIS will provide an engineer for technical support while our technician is onsite. </p><br><br><p>Required Materials</p><ul><li>1000&#39; of Cat6</li><li>Surface Mount Box</li><li>Cat 6 Keystone Jacks</li><li>Cat6 Patch Cables</li><li>Zip Ties</li><li>Velcro Strips</li></ul><p> </p><p>Required Tools</p><ul><li>Laptop</li><li>Laptop Charger</li><li>Console Cable</li><li>Cable Tester/ Toner</li><li>Fish Tape</li><li>Crimper</li><li>Drill and assorted drill bits</li><li>10&#39; Ladder</li></ul><p></p>","markdown":"Technician to install a new Cat 6 cable run from the existing PoE switch (Port 23, or next available PoE port as directed by CIS engineering) to the front counter, and mount, connect, and turn up the AP at the designated front counter ceiling/wall location in coordination with CIS engineering. Some locations will be an AP only installation which will not require any cable installation.\n\nRequired Materials\n\n- 1000' of Cat6\n- Surface Mount Box\n- Cat 6 Keystone Jacks\n- Cat6 Patch Cables\n- Zip Ties\n- Velcro Strips\n\nRequired Tools\n\n- Laptop\n- Laptop Charger\n- Console Cable\n- Cable Tester/ Toner\n- Fish Tape\n- Crimper\n- Drill and assorted drill bits\n- 10' Ladder\n\nCable &amp; AP Installation:\n\n1.1. Install Qty. 1 – Cat 6 Plenum Cable from the existing PoE Switch (Port 23, or next available PoE port as directed by CIS engineering) to the front counter ceiling/wall location.\n\n1.1.1. Terminate the AP end to a Cat 6 data jack installed in a surface mount box.\n\n1.1.2. Terminate the switch end at an available port on the existing patch panel and patch to the PoE switch with the supplied patch cord.\n\n1.1.3. Test continuity and label cabling to industry standards/customer labeling scheme.\n\n1.1.4. Install using existing pathways and use required J-hooks spaced no more than 5 ft apart where no pathway exists to ensure cable meets local and building codes.\n\n1.2. Install Qty. 1 – CIS provided AP, mounted at the designated front counter ceiling/wall location.\n\n1.3. Connect the AP to the network and coordinate with CIS engineering for configuration.\n\n1.3.1. AP hardware configuration will need to be set to SarkuNET2\n\n1.3.2. Test and turn up the device with CIS engineering.\n\n1.3.3. Record the MAC address or Serial Number, if required.\n\n1.4. CIS will provide an engineer for technical support while our technician is onsite.\n\n  \n  \nRequired Materials\n\n- 1000' of Cat6\n- Surface Mount Box\n- Cat 6 Keystone Jacks\n- Cat6 Patch Cables\n- Zip Ties\n- Velcro Strips\n\nRequired Tools\n\n- Laptop\n- Laptop Charger\n- Console Cable\n- Cable Tester/ Toner\n- Fish Tape\n- Crimper\n- Drill and assorted drill bits\n- 10' Ladder","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-11T08:30","end":"2026-11-11T11:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":180},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":57.27526635093491},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $180 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericsson"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-11T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"POS equipment install"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dream Finders - Site Survey - Networking"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1794232407050}
