 Business casual. Need to maintain a Professional appearance.\n\n**Required Items to bring:**\n\n- Basic Tool Set\n\n**\\*Only accept this job if you have all the required tools and are able to make the required time frame.\\***\n\n**Technical Documentation**\n\n**Technical Resource Site:** <https://trs.pomeroy.com/trader-joes/pos/terminal/ncr-realpos-xr7-7703>\n\n**Login ID:** fieldnation@client.pomeroy.com\n\n**Login PW:** If not provided in Messages section, please call Pomeroy Dispatch Center\n\n**Parts Shipment:**\n\n- Parts (if required) will be couriered to the site; arrival is typically within 4 hours of ticket creation. Please verify with the Pomeroy Dispatch Center that any part(s) has been delivered to resolve issue.\n- You may be scheduled to arrive prior to part arrival, due to SLA, please troubleshoot in advance to determine if part is actually required.\n\n**Parts Handling Requirements:**\n\n1. Parts return is the responsibility of the assigned Provider. DO NOT LEAVE PARTS ONSITE, unless authorized by Pomeroy.\n2. If parts are left onsite, work order will not be approved until parts are confirmed shipped.\n3. Required part must be dropped off asap to UPS: If work order was serviced during business hours, required part must be dropped off the same day until 7PM local time or UPS closing time. If work order was serviced during non-business hours, required part must be dropped off the next day by 12:00PM (noon) local time.\n4. You must use the return label that comes inside the box shipped by Pomeroy, for additional return labels, please advise Pomeroy Dispatch Center to arrange for label(s) to be sent to you.\n5. Save shipment drop off receipts in case there are issues tracking or recovering the equipment after it is dropped off.\n6. Provider may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.\n7. Ship parts to Pomeroy using return label. Parts must be taken from the store and shipped, unless specified by Pomeroy. Do not leave parts onsite even if asked by TDJ Staff/Service Desk.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T11:30","end":"2026-11-09T13:30"},"payRange":{"min":70,"max":70},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":7.881727086177862},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $70 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericsson"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-11T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"POS equipment install"},{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"Dream Finders - Site Survey - Networking"}],"action":"SKIP","ts":1794233479646}
{"job":{"id":20330340,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Retail Imaging Management Group, Inc.","title":"Walgreens - Fuji CX3240F Duplex Printer - Image Quality Troubleshooting - 2 Hours Onsite","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>OVERVIEW:</u>&nbsp;</strong>Seeking a technician to represent Fujifilm Technical Services at Walgreens locations servicing the CX3240F xerography printer located in the Photo Center. This will include troubleshooting the operations of the printer with our support team based on the specific service notes below and replacement of any parts sent that we determine are needed to resolve the issue.</p><p><strong><u>SERVICE NOTES:</u></strong></p><p>CX3240F<br />FIN: 303022<br />Printer was replaced on 11/7 but had some image quality issues that need to be fixed.<br />Ordered Drums and Belt to have onsite if needed.<br /><br />Call Support before installing any parts to troubleshoot.<br /><br />PARTS SHIPPED: DO NOT ARRIVE ONSITE WITHOUT VERIFYING ON THE FEDEX WEBSITE THAT PART IS DELIVERED!!! Tracking will be added to \"Shipments\" once it becomes available. </p><p><strong><u>PARTS CONFIRMATION:</u></strong></p><p>Parts Being Shipped See Shipment Field for Tracking.</p><p><strong><u>LICENCES/CERTIFICATIONS/CHECKS REQUIRED:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Background Check with No Warrants</li></ul><p><strong><u>TOOLS/SUPPLIES REQUIRED:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Fujifilm CX3240F Printer Support Documents (Attached to Work Order)</li><li>Screwdriver Set (#1 and #2 Phillips)</li><li>Pliers</li><li>Gloves</li><li>Microfiber Cleaning Cloth</li><li>Basic Tool Kit</li><li>Toner Vacuum (preferred but not required)</li><li>Parts (located at the store)</li><li>Badge ID (document attached to work order)</li></ul><p><strong><u>JOB SCOPE:</u></strong></p><p><em>Pre-Visit Tasks</em></p><ol><li>Within 24 hours of the visit contact the location to notify them of your ETA.</li><li><strong>IF</strong>&nbsp;the \"<strong>PARTS CONFIRMATION</strong>\" section at the top of 