{"job":{"id":20330516,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pomeroy","title":"PDC - ALDI IMAC SUPPORT (INSERT TASK)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>NEW - It is required to have this work order,&nbsp;as well as the page with your name badge,&nbsp;printed and taken with you to site. It is highly suggested that you add a photo so that the store can see it Is you with your State ID.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Tech must check in and out with the Aldi Global Service Desk @&nbsp;866-711-2534 and with POMEROY DISPATCH CENTER -- 704-414-5131.</strong></p><p><strong><u>Technical Support :</u></strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Pomeroy Technical Support - 704-414-5111 Open 8am-8pm EST</strong></p><p><strong>TRS: </strong>https://trs.pomeroy.com/aldi-foods</p><p><strong>Description of issue:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Please replace the POE injector on the EFT at Lane 3, unit not communicating</p><p>Replacement onsite</p><p>Once replaced, test with MOD and call the GSD to checkout</p><p>Thank you</p><p><br></p><p>On Site Contact Name:&nbsp;</p><p>On Site Contact Phone:&nbsp;</p><p>On Site Contact Email:&nbsp;</p><p>Problem Type: PROBLEM DESCRIBED IN NOTES</p><p>Location Subtype:&nbsp;</p><p>Lane Number (if applicable): 3</p><p>Client Ticket Number/External Reference ID: REQ2978945</p><p><strong>Description of Parts Shipped by Pomeroy:</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;Part onsite </p><p><br></p><p><strong>UPS Tracking #</strong>: Part Onsite </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Parts Tracking:&nbsp;</strong>Tech is responsible for tracking parts (if applicable).&nbsp;If parts have not arrived by 5 pm local time, please call Pomeroy Call Coordinators to report tracking issues <strong><em>BEFORE</em></strong> visiting site. <strong><em>Pomeroy&nbsp;is not responsible for techs arriving before parts.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Arrival Time:&nbsp;</strong>If parts are shipped then track parts and run call within 2 hours of delivery. If no parts are needed for the call,&nbsp;run the call between 9 am and 3 pm the day the call is due.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Required Items:</strong></p><ul><li>Basic Set of Tools (pliers screw drivers, cutters, etc.)</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Only accept this job if you have all the required tools, and are able to make the required time frame.</strong></p><p><strong>Required Items:</strong></p><ul><li>Basic hand tools kit (pliers, screwdrivers, cutters etc)</li><li>Paper Clip</li></ul><p><strong>Only accept this job if you have all the required tools, and are able to make the required time frame.</strong></p><p><strong>Parts Handling Requirements:</strong></p><ol><li>It is the responsibility of the assigned tech to track parts. Pomeroy will provide tracking numbers for any shipped parts when they become available.</li><li>&nbsp;- If no tracking number has been provided by 10am the morning of the assignment, it is up to <strong>YOU</strong>, the technician, to call the Pomeroy Dispatch Center to get this tracking number.</li><li>&nbsp;Pomeroy is NOT responsible for techs arriving before parts and will NOT compensate for unnecessary trips or wait time.</li><li>&nbsp;- Technician may also be held financially responsible for equipment lost due to negligence or failure to follow instruction.</li></ol><p><strong>Communication Requirements:</strong></p><ol><li><u>Any issues with scheduling, running late, unable to show up, etc. MUST BE CALLED IN TO THE POMEROY DISPATCH CENTER. Messages left on the platform are not acceptable forms of communication.</u>&nbsp;</li><li>This will result in penalties, negative ratings, being unassigned from the work order, and may affect future work for our company.</li><li>- Please be sure your Voicemail is functional should we need to leave a message.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Pomeroy Dispatch Center – <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************</del></span></li><li>Tech Support – <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>************</del></span></li></ol><p><strong>Work Order Requi