{"job":{"id":20331023,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Comm-Works","title":"Replace Cable - Work with Support","description":{"html":"<p>**Please contact New Era BEFORE contacting customer support with any questions about the scope of work**</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>SCOPE OF WORK: Need to check cable connectivity between MX port 1 and ISP modem. Tech must carry a SIM card ejector tool, laptop, cables, and all other necessary tools.</p><p>Device name: <del>************</del></p><p>Serial number: <del>**************</del></p><p>Model no: <del>********</del></p><p><br></p><p>-- Be prepared with a SIM ejector tool, laptop, ladder, and cabling materials to replace/repair cabling as needed.</p><p>-- Contact <del>*** ***** *** ****</del> upon arrival.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>CABLING DISPATCH EXPECTATIONS:</p><p>--If a new cable run is needed but can't be completed, call New Era.</p><p>--Technicians are expected to leave each area so that it looks like a new installation.</p><p>--Technicians should inspect all areas, and it is approved to replace anything that looks worn or broken such as jacks, faceplates, SMB's, patch cords, etc.</p><p>--If you observe any cables that are loose, laying across the floor or hanging, please use Velcro to service loop or replace with shorter cables as needed (NO ZIPTIES).</p><p>--If needed, cable manage the rack (without taking the store down).&nbsp;</p><p>--If there are any questions about what is approved, please call New Era immediately to discuss.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NEW ERA CONTACT INFORMATION:</p><p><del>***** ***** ************ ** ******************************</del></p><p><del>********** ******** ************ ** **************************</del></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>**CALL CUSTOMER SUPPORT FOR TESTING AND CHECKOUT PRIOR TO DEPARTURE**</p><p>Support Team &amp; Checkout Phone Number: <del>*** ***** *** ****</del></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS:</u></strong></p><p>**DELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 12 HOURS OF SITE COMPLETION**</p><p>Tech is required to take CLEAR quality photos of the following AT A MINIMUM:</p><p>--Work area and Network Rack, BEFORE STARTING THE WORK</p><p>--Work area and Network Rack, AFTER WORK IS COMPLETE</p><p>--If ANY Network Cabling was worked on or ran new:</p><p>----Photos of any new hardware installed (keystones, SMBs, faceplates, etc.)</p><p>----Photos of cable test (MUST be a clear picture of the cable tester)</p><p>--ANY OTHER PHOTOS CALLED OUT SPECIFICALLY IN THE SCOPE OF WORK</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"color: windowtext;\"><u>Tech Requirements:</u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Technician must attain a professional demeanor while onsite. Failure to do so will result in No Payment and further repercussions.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Technician must abide by the directions of MOD. Failure to do so will result in further repercussions.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Technician must submit travel requests PRIOR to work order assignment. Any travel requests submitted after assignment may be denied.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Tech must be dressed business casual - no shorts, t-shirts, or open toed shoes.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">You are representing New Era Technologies / Comm-Works while onsite.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Instructions MUST be followed, if support isn't contacted for release, payment may be denied.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Deliverables MUST be uploaded within 12 hours of site completion, if not payment may be denied.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">By accepting this work order, you are agreeing to these terms.&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: windowtext;\">**DELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 12 HOURS OF SITE COMPLETION**</strong><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">&nbsp;</span></p>","markdown":"\\*\\*Please contact New Era BEFORE contacting customer support with any questions about the scope of work\\*\\*\n\nSCOPE OF WORK: Need to check cable connectivity between MX port 1 and ISP modem. Tech must carry a SIM card ejector tool, laptop, cables, and all other necessary tools.\n\nDevice name: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nSerial number: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nModel no: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\-- Be prepared with a SIM ejector tool, laptop, ladder, and cabling materials to replace/repair cabling as needed.\n\n\\-- Contact \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* upon arrival.\n\nCABLING DISPATCH EXPECTATIONS:\n\n\\--If a new cable run is needed but can't be completed, call New Era.\n\n\\--Technicians are expected to leave each area so that it looks like a new installation.\n\n\\--Technicians should inspect all areas, and it is approved to replace anything that looks worn or broken such as jacks, faceplates, SMB's, patch cords, etc.\n\n\\--If you observe any cables that are loose, laying across the floor or hanging, please use Velcro to service loop or replace with shorter cables as needed (NO ZIPTIES).\n\n\\--If needed, cable manage the rack (without taking the store down).\n\n\\--If there are any questions about what is approved, please call New Era immediately to discuss.\n\nNEW ERA CONTACT INFORMATION:\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*CALL CUSTOMER SUPPORT FOR TESTING AND CHECKOUT PRIOR TO DEPARTURE\\*\\*\n\nSupport Team &amp; Checkout Phone Number: \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**DELIVERABLE REQUIREMENTS:**\n\n\\*\\*DELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 12 HOURS OF SITE COMPLETION\\*\\*\n\nTech is required to take CLEAR quality photos of the following AT A MINIMUM:\n\n\\--Work area and Network Rack, BEFORE STARTING THE WORK\n\n\\--Work area and Network Rack, AFTER WORK IS COMPLETE\n\n\\--If ANY Network Cabling was worked on or ran new:\n\n\\----Photos of any new hardware installed (keystones, SMBs, faceplates, etc.)\n\n\\----Photos of cable test (MUST be a clear picture of the cable tester)\n\n\\--ANY OTHER PHOTOS CALLED OUT SPECIFICALLY IN THE SCOPE OF WORK\n\n**Tech Requirements:**\n\nTechnician must attain a professional demeanor while onsite. Failure to do so will result in No Payment and further repercussions.\n\nTechnician must abide by the directions of MOD. Failure to do so will result in further repercussions.\n\nTechnician must submit travel requests PRIOR to work order assignment. Any travel requests submitted after assignment may be denied.\n\nTech must be dressed business casual - no shorts, t-shirts, or open toed shoes.\n\nYou are representing New Era Technologies / Comm-Works while onsite.\n\nInstructions MUST be followed, if support isn't contacted for release, payment may be denied.\n\nDeliverables MUST be uploaded within 12 hours of site completion, if not payment may be denied.\n\nBy accepting this work order, you are agreeing to these terms.\n\n**\\*\\*DELIVERABLES ARE DUE WITHIN 12 HOURS OF SITE COMPLETION\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T10:00","end":"2026-11-09T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-09T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":80,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":50.86138995361887},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/9/2026, 10:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:0