{"job":{"id":20331489,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"SWTCH Energy","title":"EV Charger Troubleshooting (Tue Nov 10) - Address East End, Raleigh NC","description":{"html":"<p>Troubleshoot one EV charger (LITE-ON 32A Level 2 wall unit, ID LA2996) mounted on a pedestal next to a second unit (LA2995). LA2996 is completely dark (no lights or display) even after the breaker was reset, while LA2995 on the same breaker powers up normally, so this is a power supply or charger hardware issue. Locate the EV Charger breaker (circuits 81/83, Panel HPB1, Building B electrical room), confirm it is on, then check for incoming power at LA2996 (voltage at the unit's supply terminals) and the wiring/connections between the breaker and LA2996. Take photos of the ID sticker and the serial label on both units. Someone from SWTCH will call you at 9:00 AM ET to work live with you on the booked troubleshooting call, so please share the best phone number to reach you onsite in the work order messages. Record LEDs, readings and photos. Bring a laptop with an Ethernet port, an Ethernet cable, a screwdriver and a multimeter. Do not replace or rewire anything without prior approval.</p>","markdown":"Troubleshoot one EV charger (LITE-ON 32A Level 2 wall unit, ID LA2996) mounted on a pedestal next to a second unit (LA2995). LA2996 is completely dark (no lights or display) even after the breaker was reset, while LA2995 on the same breaker powers up normally, so this is a power supply or charger hardware issue. Locate the EV Charger breaker (circuits 81/83, Panel HPB1, Building B electrical room), confirm it is on, then check for incoming power at LA2996 (voltage at the unit's supply terminals) and the wiring/connections between the breaker and LA2996. Take photos of the ID sticker and the serial label on both units. Someone from SWTCH will call you at 9:00 AM ET to work live with you on the booked troubleshooting call, so please share the best phone number to reach you onsite in the work order messages. Record LEDs, readings and photos. Bring a laptop with an Ethernet port, an Ethernet cable, a screwdriver and a multimeter. Do not replace or rewire anything without prior approval.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T08:45","end":"2026-11-10T10:45"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":300},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":150,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.586568851243541},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericsson"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Contro