{"job":{"id":20330623,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Replace pin pad on Reg 4","description":{"html":"<p>Need Ross trained tech(s) pin pad refresh project to replace pin pad on Reg 4.</p>\n<p>Tech will download vendor authorization letter, tech checkin-checkout document, and pin pad install guide and review before arrival.</p>\n<p>Text Shyft PM confirming your arrival, contact store MOD, show vendor authorization letter and government issued ID (drivers license), &amp; call command center upon arrival.</p>\n<p>Working with MOD and Command Center representative, confirm POS lane is fully functional before leaving site. Phone #'s and conference ID# can be found in confidential information of your work order.</p>\n<p>At completion of work order tech must check out with Ross IT hotline and text Shyft PM before leaving site.</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DO NOT</strong>leave messages in the work order as they may not be viewed in a timely manner. Especially if you are requesting something...instead, give us a call.</li>\n<li><strong>Please do not request a schedule change. Schedule change requests cannot be accommodated. If you are not able to make it to the site as scheduled. Please Report a Problem within the work order and remove yourself.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Travel must be requested prior to assignment by counteroffer or by speaking with us., or it will be declined.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Please message any rate counter offers, but do not request bundle as-is unless you are in agreement with the rate and schedule</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>","markdown":"Need Ross trained tech(s) pin pad refresh project to replace pin pad on Reg 4.\n\nTech will download vendor authorization letter, tech checkin-checkout document, and pin pad install guide and review before arrival.\n\nText Shyft PM confirming your arrival, contact store MOD, show vendor authorization letter and government issued ID 