{"job":{"id":"8572383716","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"CDW","title":"Assistance with Workstation Move - Raleigh, NC","description":"<p>Looking to have a technician to assist with moving a workstation and cisco phone for office space located in Raleigh, NC.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Monday November 16th 10AM</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<strong><u>Task</u></strong></p><ol><li>Arrive onsite and check-in with local point of contact and/or remote customer support team.</li><li>Confirm access to the work site and ensure all equipment and materials needed to complete the job are present</li><li>Unbox and pre-stage equipment for installation/migration.</li><li>Upon approval of onsite contact and remote staff, perform physical installation steps by following customer-provided documentation and/or remote real-time guidance to:</li></ol><ul><li>Remove existing devices, if applicable.</li><li>Physically install new devices.</li><li>Connect power and patch cables to new devices as required.</li></ul><p>5.Validate completion of work with local/remote customer personnel.</p><p>6.Place un-installed and/or unused equipment at customer designated location on site.</p><p>7.Clean-up workspace and take photo(s) of completed work.</p><p>8.Manager's Sign Off for Completed work.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools-</u></strong></p><ul><li>Standard rack and stack tools (screwdriver set, etc.)</li><li>Laptop w/ hotspot</li><li>Cable ties or Velcro straps</li><li>Console cable</li><li>Government issued ID.</li></ul>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-16T10:00","end":"2026-11-16T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":260},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":5.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21