{"job":{"id":"7633700864","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Computacenter United States Inc.","title":"Amazon - DPS AP Swap - Spotter - DRT9 - Morrisville NC","description":"<p><strong>1 Hour Minimum Provided&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br></p><p>The person assigned to the ticket must be the person going to site, with exceptions by ticket owner.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>*** Please do one AP at a time and wait for approval before going to the next AP and leaving the site. ***</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>SCOPE:</strong></p><p>o Remove and re-attach existing safety cable or add safety cable if not present currently at the AP to ensure AP and its mounting bracket are secured to the currently installed mounting assembly</p><p>o Document pertinent information using barcode scanner (Old MAC address, New MAC address, Claim Code, etc.)</p><p>o Perform basic troubleshooting to ensure all APs are online prior to exiting site (re terminate cable at AP location and/or power cycling APs)</p><p>o Note: All tasks are to be tracked and reported in Fieldwire. The tech is responsible for updating and annotating tasks as appropriate throughout the process of implementation.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Lift Certification is Mandatory and will need to have it on you at all times on site.</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress code:</strong> Clean pressed, Khaki type pants, solid color Polo shirt without company logos, closed toe shoes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>PPE:</strong> <strong><em>Lift Harness, steel toe shoes, Hard hat, vest, hearing protection.</em></strong></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>NO EXPENSES WILL BE REIMBURSED UNLESS AGREED TO BEFOREHAND BY THE ASSIGNMENT OWNER&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>You should not discuss your rate of pay with the customer or show them any documents that contain the pay rate.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-13T12:00","end":"2026-11-13T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":44.42645447,"max":177.70581788},"payType":"ho