and Install the Phones &amp; Phone Base, then complete all testing and validations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 17, 17);\">&nbsp;Installation Guide: </span>https://interfacesystems.mcoutput.com/genig/Content/Network%20Installation%20Guides/Genesco/Individual%20Scopes/Prior%20to%20Entering.htm</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">NOTE:</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> *** WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT A RELEASE CODE FROM THE REMOTE SUPPORT TECHNICIAN ***</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">REQUIRED DELIVERABLES</strong></p><ul><li>Work Order Signed by POC with Accurate date and Check In/Out times (attached document or electronically).</li><li>Picture of any equipment work was completed on, damaged cables/equipment, etc</li><li>Picture of RMA form &amp; return label applied; if applicable</li><li>Release Code</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TOOLS/MATERIALS</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Prepare tool bag/box with the following:</span></p><ul><li>Laptop (Windows 11)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Operating system must be fully licensed and updated</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">· Administrative rights required for software installation and troubleshooting</li><li>Basic IT Tools</li><li>Buttset</li><li>Network Testing Tools/Cable Testers</li><li>Drill</li><li>12\" bit for wood/medal/or possibly concrete</li><li>8' Ladder</li><li>Phone/Ethernet Wiring</li><li>Digital Camera / Camera Phone with this ability to send pictures before leaving site</li><li>Copy of work order and job information</li><li>Any other tools/materials you may think you need to complete the job on the first visit.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ensure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:</span></p><ul><li>Long pants</li><li>Collared shirt</li><li>Netfor name badge</li><li>Close toe shoes</li><li>Review SOW and inform Netfor of any question prior to arriving on site.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Contact Name &amp; Number: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)</strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Monthly Password: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)</strong></p>","markdown":"BY ACCEPTING THIS ASSIGNMENT, YOU ARE AGREEING TO COMPLETE THE WO, UPLOAD ALL DELIVERABLES WHILE ON SITE AND COMPLETE THE CHECK IN/OUT PROCESS FULLY.\n\n**SITE INFORMATION**\n\n**Site ID**: GEN01868JM\n\n**Service Request Number(s):** SR04379417 / SR04379416\n\n**Site Name**: Johnston &amp; Murphy\n\n**Street Address**: 6910 FAYETTEVILLE RD, SPC 1170, DURHAM, NC 27713\n\n**Parts Being Sent**: To Tech – Please advise shipping address\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nTech will need to check-in via tect chat - text “Start” to \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*.You will receive 2 messages back. First will confirm you have been connected and the second will ask if you are onsite for 1 - New Installation or 2 - Service, you will always respond back \"1\". **\\*\\*review PDF attached on process &amp; directions to escalate if support not responsive within 20 minutes (Step 2)**\n\n**SCOPE OF WORK**: See attached IG for full SOW – This is a “New Store” Installation. PM will provide layout ahead of install once customer provides.\n\nRemaining SOW: Install Dual 4G and Install the Phones &amp; Phone Base, then complete all testing and validations.\n\n Installation Guide: <https://interfacesystems.mcoutput.com/genig/Content/Network%20Installation%20Guides/Genesco/Individual%20Scopes/Prior%20to%20Entering.htm>\n\n**NOTE:** \\*\\*\\* WE CANNOT PAY YOU FOR YOUR WORK WITHOUT A RELEASE CODE FROM THE REMOTE SUPPORT TECHNICIAN \\*\\*\\*\n\n**REQUIRED DELIVERABLES**\n\n- Work Order Signed by POC with Accurate date and Check In/Out times (attached document or electronically).\n- Picture of any equipment work was completed on, damaged cables/equipment, etc\n- Picture of RMA form &amp; return label applied; if applicable\n- Release Code\n\n**TOOLS/MATERIALS**\n\nPrepare tool bag/box with the following:\n\n- Laptop (Windows 11)\n- Operating system must be fully licensed and updated\n- · Administrative rights required for software installation and troubleshooting\n- Basic IT Tools\n- Buttset\n- Network Testing Tools/Cable Testers\n- Drill\n- 12\" bit for wood/medal/or possibly concrete\n- 8' Ladder\n- Phone/Ethernet Wiring\n- Digital Camera / Camera Phone with this ability to send pictures before leaving site\n- Copy of work order and job information\n- Any other tools/materials you may think you need to complete the job on the first visit.\n\nEnsure a clean and wrinkle free uniform is ready:\n\n- Long pants\n- Collared shirt\n- Netfor name badge\n- Close toe shoes\n- Review SOW and inform Netfor of any question prior to arriving on site.\n\n**Contact Name &amp; Number: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)**\n\n**Monthly Password: (SEE CONFIDENTIAL INFO)**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T09:00","end":"2026-11-12T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":150},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":11.24984582774906},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericsson"},{"start":"2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ericcson"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay b