{"job":{"id":20333470,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Black Box Network Services","title":"Raleigh (Closing Wipe Phones)","description":{"html":"<p>This request is to dispatch a technician, to wipe the existing phones on 12/14 @9am.</p><p><br></p><p>SPECIAL REQUESTS: Dispatch FSS, Senior.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Office: Senator Tillis</p><p>Location: 310 New Bern Avenue Suite #122 Raleigh, NC 27601 (New Location)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Task: Wipe Phones</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>- Task List:</p><p>1. Please dispatch a tech to wipe the existing phones, the soft reset wipes out all the call directories, call logs etc. from the phones, getting them ready for the new users.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>POC:</p><p>Kim Barnes&nbsp;</p><p>(919) 602-7096</p><p><br></p><p>Debra Jarrett&nbsp;</p><p>(202) 224-2490</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Attached: SAA Work Order</p><p><br></p><p>BLACK BOX – Please email Michael_Hicks@scc.senate.gov Michael_Clark@scc.senate.gov; when technician is sourced and scheduled so that we can notify the Senate office contact.</p><p><br></p><p>BLACK BOX TECHNICIAN – You MUST CONTACT us when you arrive and PRIOR TO YOUR DEPARTURE from the Senate office. Mike Hicks Office 202-309-0950 or Mike Clark 202-228-8798 to Provide the status. Also contact for any issues</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Mike Hicks</p><p>ITSC State Telephony</p><p>Michael_Hicks@scc.senate.gov</p><p>Cell: 202-309-0950</p>","markdown":"This request is to dispatch a technician, to wipe the existing phones on 12/14 @9am.\n\nSPECIAL REQUESTS: Dispatch FSS, Senior.\n\nOffice: Senator Tillis\n\nLocation: 310 New Bern Avenue Suite #122 Raleigh, NC 27601 (New Location)\n\nTask: Wipe Phones\n\n\\- Task List:\n\n1\\. Please dispatch a tech to wipe the existing phones, the soft reset wipes out all the call directories, call logs etc. from the phones, getting them ready for the new users.\n\nPOC:\n\nKim Barnes\n\n(919) 602-7096\n\nDebra Jarrett\n\n(202) 224-2490\n\nAttached: SAA Work Order\n\nBLACK BOX – Please email Michael\\_Hicks@scc.senate.gov Michael\\_Clark@scc.senate.gov; when technician is sourced and scheduled so that we can notify the Senate office contact.\n\nBLACK BOX TECHNICIAN – You MUST CONTACT us when you arrive and PRIOR TO YOUR DEPARTURE from the Senate office. Mike Hicks Office 202-309-0950 or Mike Clark 202-228-8798 to Provide the status. Also contact for any issues\n\nMike Hicks\n\nITSC State Telephony\n\nMichael\\_Hicks@scc.senate.gov\n\nCell: 202-309-0950","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-12-14T09:00","end":"2026-12-14T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":260},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9.320345344984016},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 (countered: $260) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-12-14T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-15T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-16T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-12-18T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-19T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-09T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T22:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z",