{"job":{"id":20333344,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"F2Onsite","title":"Network Technician - Revisit work","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Network Technician - Revisit work</u></strong></p><p><strong>Site Specific Notes/Action Items: </strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Bridge Information:</strong> Details will be provided in the messages section of your work order.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p>Technicians will perform network equipment installation, replacement, configuration, and troubleshooting at retail locations. Work may include Meraki, Cradlepoint, Grandstream, SIM cards, WAN connectivity, telephone systems, and remediation of existing issues.</p><ul><li>Refer to Site-Specific Notes for exact scope and remaining tasks.</li><li>Join the bridge immediately upon arrival and follow remote engineer instructions.</li><li>For site access issues, contact the remote team through the bridge.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools &amp; Equipment:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Mobile phone with a camera and charger</li><li>Driver's license or state-issued photo ID</li><li>Laptop with Ethernet (RJ45) and USB connections (Required console drivers installed)</li><li>Console cable (DB9) with USB adapter</li><li>Micro USB-to-USB-B console cable for router connection (must be tested with your laptop before arrival)</li><li>&nbsp;2 x Cat5e patch cables (1 x 10-meter and 1 x 3-meter)</li><li>Engineer to take a Cisco console cable CAP-CONSOLE (RH45-DB9 Female)</li><li>Remote access software: Microsoft Teams / AnyDesk</li><li>Standard technician toolkit </li><li>Cage nuts, screws, and screw drivers.</li><li>Labels/Label maker </li></ul><p>Failure to bring required tools or equipment may result in non-payment.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Scheduling &amp; Time Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>2-hour minimum per site. Any time beyond 2 hours requires prior approval from your Work Order Manager before exceeding.</li><li>You must remai