{"job":{"id":20310618,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Velocity Tech Solutions","title":"Dream Finders - Site Survey - Networking","description":{"html":"<p><strong><em><u>Site specific Sow -</u></em></strong></p>\n<p>We need to have a tech dispatched to our Raleigh office to do a site survey for additional network cabling and provide a quote. They are expanding the office and network cables will need to be pulled into new furniture, conference rooms, etc. I have attached a floorplan. Please let me know when this is scheduled so I can communicate to the office. We will need to be sure there is available space on the patch panels and network switches to support this.</p>\n<p>***Please include a quote for labor and materials in your closing notes</p>\n<p>*** Install to be completed at a later date</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure Documentation</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Document the current network layout, including locations of new workstations, network equipment, and cabling routes.</li>\n<li>Take clear, detailed photos of all workstations and network equipment, ensuring visibility of cabling connections and placements.</li>\n<li>Take photos of their network rack and note the IT room location on a markup map.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Ceiling and Pathway Assessment</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Assess the ceiling structure throughout the site:</li>\n<li>Record ceiling height in each area.</li>\n<li>Identify ceiling material (e.g., drop ceiling, drywall).</li>\n<li>Note the presence and accessibility of crawl spaces.</li>\n<li>Identify potential pathways for routing new CAT6 cabling.</li>\n<li>Ensure pathway suggestions consider minimal disruption to existing infrastructure and ease of installation.</li>\n<li>Floorplan Markup w/clear and concise map key, show all recommended/requested drop locations, and what they are for. I.E. workstations/printers/ap</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Detailed Documentation</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Thorough and detailed notes on the site</li>\n<li>Ceiling and infrastructure conditions that may impact cable runs.</li>\n<li>Length of the runs to each of the new work stations and printer</li>\n<li>Whether or not a new switch is needed</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Client Communication</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Summarize any critical findings that may impact the running of the new cabling, including any major issues with existing infrastructure</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Deliverables</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Detailed answers to all questions in work order:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Length of runs</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Time/effort/materials</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure documentation</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Whether or not a new switch is needed</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Visual Documentation:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Photos of the location</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Pathway Assessment Report:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Recommendations for feasible pathways to install new CAT6 cabling, including any structural considerations noted (ceiling type, crawl space availability, etc.).</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Summary of Key Findings:</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A concise summary of findings, highlighting any immediate issues, blockers, recommended replacements, and infrastructure constraints that may impact future phases.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Do not leave without checking out with work order manager. They must review and release you from site.</strong></p>","markdown":"***Site specific Sow -***\n\nWe need to have a tech dispatched to our Raleigh office to do a site survey for additional network cabling and provide a quote. They are expanding the office and network cables will need to be pulled into new furniture, conference rooms, etc. I have attached a floorplan. Please let me know when this is scheduled so I can communicate to the office. We will need to be sure there is available space on the patch panels and network switches to support this.\n\n\\*\\*\\*Please include a quote for labor and materials in your closing notes\n\n\\*\\*\\* Install to be completed at a later date\n\n1. **Infrastructure Documentation**\n\n- Document the current network layout, including locations of new workstations, network equipment, and cabling routes.\n- Take clear, detailed photos of all workstations and network equipment, ensuring visibility of cabling connections and placements.\n- Take photos of their network rack and note the IT room location on a markup map.\n\n1. **Ceiling and Pathway Assessment**\n\n- Assess the ceiling structure throughout the site:\n- Record ceiling height in each area.\n- Identify ceiling material (e.g., drop ceiling, drywall).\n- Note the presence and accessibility of crawl spaces.\n- Identify potential pathways for routing new CAT6 cabling.\n- Ensure pathway suggestions consider minimal disruption to existing infrastructure and ease of installation.\n- Floorplan Markup w/clear and concise map key, show all recommended/requested drop locations, and what they are for. I.E. workstations/printers/ap\n\n1. **Detailed Documentation**\n\n- Thorough and detailed notes on the site\n- Ceiling and infrastructure conditions that may impact cable runs.\n- Length of the runs to each of the new work stations and printer\n- Whether or not a new switch is needed\n\n1. **Client Communication**\n\n- Summarize any critical findings that may impact the running of the new cabling, including any major issues with existing infrastructure\n\n**Deliverables**\n\n1. **Detailed answers to all questions in work order:**\n\n- **Length of runs**\n- **Time/effort/materials**\n- **Infrastructure documentation**\n- **Whether or not a new switch is needed**\n\n1. **Visual Documentation:**\n\n- **Photos of the location**\n\n1. **Pathway Assessment Report:**\n\n- **Recommendations for feasible pathways to install new CAT6 cabling, including any structural considerations noted (ceiling type, crawl space availability, etc.).**\n\n1. **Summary of Key Findings:**\n\n- **A concise summary of findings, highlighting any immediate issues, blockers, recommended replacements, and infrastructure constraints that may impact future phases.**\n\n**Do not leave without checking out with work order manager. They must review and release you from site.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T10:00","end":"2026-11-09T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":144,"max":144},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":2,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":5.22452629584597},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/9/2026, 10:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-13T