{"job":{"id":20335567,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Comm-Works","title":"CVS - RX Pickup WKS","description":{"html":"<p>Scope of work per site:</p><p>When onsite contact CVS ROC</p><p>Obtain permission from the Pharmacist to locate the equipment that was shipped to the store.</p><p>Inventory the equipment and notify the ROC of your findings.</p><p>Obtain permission from the Pharmacist to go behind the Rx counter to survey the existing Rx pick-up workstations.</p><p>Work with the ROC to identify which existing Rx pick-up workstations will be replaced.</p><p>Follow the Redbook instructions to de-install and install the equipment, one workstation at a time.</p><p>Notify the ROC that the equipment has been installed.</p><p>Have the Pharmacist or Pharmacy Tech test the workstation.</p><p>After the Pharmacist or Pharmacy Tech confirms everything is working, support the ROC while they complete their equipment testing.</p><p>Per the Redbook, pack all old equipment and affix the tracking labels sent with the equipment so it is picked up and shipped out of the store.</p><p>Check out with CVS ROC</p>","markdown":"Scope of work per site:\n\nWhen onsite contact CVS ROC\n\nObtain permission from the Pharmacist to locate the equipment that was shipped to the store.\n\nInventory the equipment and notify the ROC of your findings.\n\nObtain permission from the Pharmacist to go behind the Rx counter to survey the existing Rx pick-up workstations.\n\nWork with the ROC to identify which existing Rx pick-up workstations will be replaced.\n\nFollow the Redbook instructions to de-install and install the equipment, one workstation at a time.\n\nNotify the ROC that the equipment has been installed.\n\nHave the Pharmacist or Pharmacy Tech test the workstation.\n\nAfter the Pharmacist or Pharmacy Tech confirms everything is working, support the ROC while they complete their equipment testing.\n\nPer the Redbook, pack all old equipment and affix the tracking labels sent with the equipment so it is picked up and shipped out of the store.\n\nCheck out with CVS ROC","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T09:00","end":"2026-11-12T10:00","latestStart":"2026-11-12T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":45.31718945126504},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: WO 2026 Nov 16 SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"