{"job":{"id":20336160,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"PIVITAL","title":"Rack mount, FW troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Refer to attached Scope of Work document - MUST adhere to the steps in the doc exactly and in order - see attached &amp; confidential section for document</strong></li><li><strong>MUST print the Scope of Work document before going to site</strong></li><li><strong>Tools and Materials Required - see requirements below</strong></li><li><strong>Business Casual dress required, Polite, Professional and Courteous at all times</strong></li></ul><p> </p><p><strong><u>Tools/Material Requirements:</u></strong></p><p> </p><ul><li>Cell Phone – with Charger. </li><li>WIN10 Laptop – with Charger</li><li>Console Cable (DB9 male to RJ45)</li><li>Standard Tool Kit</li><li>Cat 6 cables</li><li>Cable Tester</li><li>Hotspot or Internet Dongle</li><li>Black Ink Pens (for documentation)</li></ul><p> </p><p> </p><p><em>Review the </em><strong><em><u>“Confidential Section”</u></em></strong><em> listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch including</em></p><ul><li>Circuit location and ID</li><li>Equipment details</li><li>Icon info</li><li>Bridge line #</li></ul><p>Please bring a NEWER working Windows laptop (Win10 or higher) with a 1gb Ethernet port (or 1gb Ethernet dongle), a hotspot and team viewer already installed with the ability to log into a network device using a Console connection AND Ethernet connection. This is required for all techs at the minimum.</p><p> </p><p><strong><u>Site Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Mandatory to be released from the site by the Remote Engineer once the equipment is confirmed online &amp; photos are verified.</li></ul><p> </p><p><strong><u>Site Security Requirements:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Photo ID required</li><li>Names of all technicians going to the site must be provided in advance</li><li>Check-in with site contacts representing <del>*******</del></li><li>Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment</li><li>Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire</li><li>If PPE required: professional environment expecting professional conduct, clean work attire with appropriate PPE</li></ul>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n- **Refer to attached Scope of Work document - MUST adhere to the steps in the doc exactly and in order - see attached &amp; confidential section for document**\n- **MUST print the Scope of Work document before going to site**\n- **Tools and Materials Required - see requirements below**\n- **Business Casual dress required, Polite, Professional and Courteous at all times**\n\n**Tools/Material Requirements:**\n\n- Cell Phone – with Charger.\n- WIN10 Laptop – with Charger\n- Console Cable (DB9 male to RJ45)\n- Standard Tool Kit\n- Cat 6 cables\n- Cable Tester\n- Hotspot or Internet Dongle\n- Black Ink Pens (for documentation)\n\n*Review the* ***“Confidential Section”*** *listed at the bottom of the work order for specific detailed information regarding this dispatch including*\n\n- Circuit location and ID\n- Equipment details\n- Icon info\n- Bridge line #\n\nPlease bring a NEWER working Windows laptop (Win10 or higher) with a 1gb Ethernet port (or 1gb Ethernet dongle), a hotspot and team viewer already installed with the ability to log into a network device using a Console connection AND Ethernet connection. This is required for all techs at the minimum.\n\n**Site Requirements:**\n\n- Mandatory to be released from the site by the Remote Engineer once the equipment is confirmed online &amp; photos are verified.\n\n**Site Security Requirements:**\n\n- Photo ID required\n- Names of all technicians going to the site must be provided in advance\n- Check-in with site contacts representing \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Workers to be fully equipped to complete all work without the need for any customer tools or equipment\n- Professional environment expecting professional conduct and clean business casual attire\n- If PPE required: professional environment expecting professional conduct, clean work attire with appropriate PPE","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-09T19:00","end":"2026-11-09T23:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":240},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":3.638945398666239},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Mon, Nov 9, 7:00 PM\nChecked: Mon, Nov 9, Tue, Nov 10, Wed, Nov 11, Thu, Nov 12, Fri, Nov 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-09T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T16:30:00.000Z","summary":"Survey FN"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-09T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-09T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summ