{"job":{"id":20336165,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"DecisionPoint Technologies Inc","title":"Retail POS Service Dispatch -NETWORK Tech- Installation of the new circuit, bring a 10' ethernet patch cable   (On-site Est. 2 hrs)","description":{"html":"<p><strong>INTRODUCTION:</strong></p>\n<p>On-site visit requires tech to work with the assistance of a Network representative.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>**BRING A PATCH CABLE*</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Seeking technician who will present himself/herself in a professional and confident manner, with solid hands-on experience in installation, maintenance and repair of Retail/POS and networking equipment. Ability to effectively resolve customer questions and issues.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>REQUIRED EQUIPMENT:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cable Tester</li>\n<li>Cordless impact driver or drill</li>\n<li>Screwdriver Set</li>\n<li>Velco wraps / velcro fastners</li>\n<li>Patch Cable 5ft</li>\n<li>Label maker and wrapping tape</li>\n<li>Datavac <u>and</u> Compressed Air</li>\n<li>Working laptop with Console Cable</li>\n<li>Working cell phone with clear photo capability</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>OVERVIEW: POS Equipment Swap - Repair/Installation</strong></p>\n<p>1 - TEXT <del>*************</del> Project Coordinator to check-in upon arrival. See Confidential Information section for phone number.</p>\n<p>2 - Ask for Store Manager when you arrive to:<strong><em>AEROPOSTALE</em></strong></p>\n<p>2a - Review the scope of your visit: <strong><em>We recently installed a new Granite GRID circuit at this location that needs to be plugged into Cisco Router MX67 PORT 1; there's currently a cable into PORT 1 which we need to swap out with newly installed circuit.</em>Requesting tech dispatch to assist us with swapping and connecting new circuit.</strong></p>\n<p>3 - Call Network tech <del>****** *************</del></p>\n<p>4 - Install new equipment and test devices to confirm working properly.</p>\n<p>6a - FINAL STEPS - Please obtain the store manager's or associate's signature after testing is completed and they confirm that everything is working properly.</p>\n<p>6b - FINAL STEPS - Upload photos of the equipment and/or items worked on during store visit.</p>\n<p>7 - TEXT <del>*************</del> Project Coordinator to close-out and be released from the site. See Confidential Information section for phone number.</p>","markdown":"**INTRODUCTION:**\n\nOn-site visit requires tech to work with the assistance of a Network representative.\n\n\\*\\*BRING A PATCH CABLE\\*\n\nSeeking technician who will present himself/herself in a professional and confident manner, with solid hands-on experience in installation, maintenance and repair of Retail/POS and networking equipment. Ability to effectively resolve customer questions and issues.\n\n**REQUIRED EQUIPMENT:**\n\n- Cable Tester\n- Cordless impact driver or drill\n- Screwdriver Set\n- Velco wraps / velcro fastners\n- Patch Cable 5ft\n- Label maker and wrapping tape\n- Datavac and Compressed Air\n- Working laptop with Console Cable\n- Working cell phone with clear photo capability\n\n**OVERVIEW: POS Equipment Swap - Repair/Installation**\n\n1 - TEXT \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Project Coordinator to check-in upon arrival. See Confidential Information section for phone number.\n\n2 - Ask for Store Manager when you arrive to:***AEROPOSTALE***\n\n2a - Review the scope of your visit: ***We recently installed a new Granite GRID circuit at this location that needs to be plugged into Cisco Router MX67 PORT 1; there's currently a cable into PORT 1 which we need to swap out with newly installed circuit.*Requesting tech dispatch to assist us with swapping and connecting new circuit.**\n\n3 - Call Network tech \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n4 - Install new equipment and test devices to confirm working properly.\n\n6a - FINAL STEPS - Please obtain the store manager's or associate's signature after testing is completed and they confirm that everything is working properly.\n\n6b - FINAL STEPS - Upload photos of the equipment and/or items worked on during store visit.\n\n7 - TEXT \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Project Coordinator to close-out and be released from the site. See Confidential Information section for phone number.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T12:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-10T13:30"},"payRange":{"min":66,"max":66},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":66,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":4.484559479858812},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $66 (countered: $66) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"Veterans Day"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"20