{"job":{"id":20336613,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"CPT Network Solutions, Inc.","title":"Porting phone numbers to Spectrum | Tech to connect inside wiring to their equipment, test dial tone and check for faxes","description":{"html":"<p>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: <strong>CPT REQUEST OVERVIEW</strong> ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</p><p><strong><u>This service request is for our client. </u></strong>You are required to communicate&nbsp;directly with CPT <strong><u>ONLY</u></strong> for questions, scheduling, etc.</p><ul><li>Do <strong><u>NOT</u></strong> call the store/site/customer.</li><li>You <strong><u>MUST</u></strong> communicate with our office via phone call for any delays or issues. Do not message through the platform.</li></ul><p>Only the assigned technician should be present on this request.<strong> </strong></p><ul><li>If you are sending another rep. from your company to this request, please inform us.</li></ul><p>Business casual dress is <strong><u>required. </u></strong>Button-down shirt, polo, plain t-shirt, dockers, work pants, work shoes, neat gym shoes are acceptable.</p><p>A copy of our internal work order will be provided in the documents section on assignment</p><ul><li>This is to be used for sign-off with the customer.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Billing materials used (if any):</u></strong></p><ul><li>Any materials provided during this request <strong><u>MUST</u></strong> be advised to our Tech Support team at check-out and should not be billed ABOVE average field tech prices.</li><li>Pricing <strong><u>MUST</u></strong> be itemized in expense tab description (Example: (1) Jack @ 3.50,etc.)</li><li>Anything billed above what a standard price will be reviewed and possibly require adjustments.</li><li>If you purchased a specific item(s) to be used on this request, you <strong><u>MUST</u></strong> include the receipt.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Base pay and time onsite:</u></strong></p><ul><li>1 hour Minimum<strong><em> </em><u>unless otherwise