{"job":{"id":"6114458730","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Granite Telecommunications","title":"Site Survey (GOV- REAL ID or US Passport Required)","description":"<p>Please survey location on 4th floor to see what would be necessary to bring existing AP''s online with the current network.&nbsp;Please see if those AP''s would work or if we would need to bring new AP''s to connect to the existing WiFi solution that is currently on floors 1-3.&nbsp;Work with local contact Jennifer Gantt @ 910-303-3442 for instructions and access.&nbsp;Once survey is concluded, we''ll need details on the access points and where they are located.&nbsp;We will also need a quote to confirm costs to get that floor online on our Network.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please call into Granite NOC at 844-478-4688 if there are any issues or questions.</p><p><br></p><p>***I’ve attached the diagram and can answer any questions during dispatch as needed.</p><p><br></p><p>- Please locate Fortigate switch and equipment on first 3 floors&nbsp;</p><p>- Please locate 4th floor access points and existing cabling to see if that could be used to connect to existing WiFi network.</p><p>- Tech will survey wiring as necessary.&nbsp;</p><p>- Tech will work with NOC to go over results and any issues</p><p>- Once confirmed working. tech will check out with MOD and granite before leaving.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Additional materials needed: Buttset, cable tester/certifier, laptop PC (Windows 7 or higher) with serial and Ethernet ports, console cable, administrator login, AC power adapter, PUTTY, extension cord (25’ min), ability to create a wireless hotspot for us to remote to laptop if necessary, 500ft cat5e/cat6 cable, 400ft rj11, min 10 male rj-11 heads, min 10 female to female rj-11 connectors&nbsp;4 rj-11 wall jacks and plates&nbsp;min 4 rj-45 wall jacks and plates, at least 4 Biscuit Jacks, extension ladder.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T09:00","end":"2026-11-12T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":55,"max":165},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":55,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":52.1},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Thu, Nov 12, 9:00 AM\nChecked: Thu, Nov 12, Fri, Nov 13, Mon, Nov 16 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 investigate intermittent connectivity (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05636592 - 1013 Classic Rd | VTM CUT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro installation - Raleigh, NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"[INC#: WO 2026 Nov 16 SITE#: RTP/DC3]   To Be Updated"},{"start":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T20:00