{"job":{"id":20337774,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Brandpoint Services","title":"CVS Service Call","description":{"html":"<p>Scope of Work</p><p>Description:</p><p>WAS, TC1, TC2, and TC3 screens are showing offline. ONE Tech requested to restore functionality and network connectivity to the system.</p><p><br></p><p>Required equipment:</p><p>Cutters, Zip ties wire management supplies, screwdrivers (varying sizes)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Required Tools / Materials:</p><p><br></p><p>Tall ladder</p><p>Wire management supplies</p><p>Basic hand toolkit incl. Phillips screwdrivers of varying sizes</p><p>Zip ties</p><p>Work order with technician's name</p><p>Valid ID</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>SOW:</p><p>-Check in with Brandpoint: 856-382-2645 TEXT ONLY or email checkoutteam@brandpointservices.com</p><p>-Check in with the store manager to explain SOW - Present Letter of Authorization</p><p><br></p><p>-Locate the WAS, TC1/2/3 screens</p><p>-Check for power and confirm the media player has power.</p><p>-Confirm good status on the player</p><p>-If the device is powered on, power cycle the player and allow it to boot/verify content afterward.</p><p>-Once the screen is on/showing content, contact PRN/Stratacache support that the system is back/showing content.</p><p>-If time permits, check other systems onsite (Device name will be provided when tech is onsite). Confirm they are all playing their proper programming</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>On completion of work and to receive the release code:</p><p>-Contact Brandpoint at 856-382-2645 TEXT ONLY to verify the device(s) is/are online, and to make sure no further troubleshooting needs to be done.</p><p><br></p><p>-Check out with the manager on duty to confirm that they are happy with the work.</p><p>-Send photos of the concepts that were serviced, showing the system powered on with valid content.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools / Materials:</u></strong></p><p>Tall ladder (at least 6')</p><p>Universal remote or USB keyboard,</p><p>Wire management supplies,</p><p>Basic hand toolkit incl. Phillips screwdrivers of varying sizes</p><p>Zip ties,</p><p>Work order with technician's name,</p><p>Valid ID</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Before leaving make sure all other PRN devices are online and working.</p><p><br></p><p>Must check in and out with Brandpoint support team. If no one reaches out to you then please call 856-382-2645 via TEXT ONLY (this # cannot receive calls)</p>","markdown":"Scope of Work\n\nDescription:\n\nWAS, TC1, TC2, and TC3 screens are showing offline. ONE Tech requested to restore functionality and network connectivity to the system.\n\nRequired equipment:\n\nCutters, Zip ties wire management supplies, screwdrivers (varying sizes)\n\nRequired Tools / Materials:\n\nTall ladder\n\nWire management supplies\n\nBasic hand toolkit incl. Phillips screwdrivers of varying sizes\n\nZip ties\n\nWork order with technician's name\n\nValid ID\n\nSOW:\n\n-Check in with Brandpoint: 856-382-2645 TEXT ONLY or email checkoutteam@brandpointservices.com\n\n-Check in with the store manager to explain SOW - Present Letter of Authorization\n\n-Locate the WAS, TC1/2/3 screens\n\n-Check for power and confirm the media player has power.\n\n-Confirm good status on the player\n\n-If the device is powered on, power cycle the player and allow it to boot/verify content afterward.\n\n-Once the screen is on/showing content, contact PRN/Stratacache support that the system is back/showing content.\n\n-If time permits, check other systems onsite (Device name will be provided when tech is onsite). Confirm they are all playing their proper programming\n\nOn completion of work and to receive the release code:\n\n-Contact Brandpoint at 856-382-2645 TEXT ONLY to verify the device(s) is/are online, and to make sure no further troubleshooting needs to be done.\n\n-Check out with the manager on duty to confirm that they are happy with the work.\n\n-Send photos of the concepts that were serviced, showing the system powered on with valid content.\n\n**Required Tools / Materials:**\n\nTall ladder (at least 6')\n\nUniversal remote or USB keyboard,\n\nWire management supplies,\n\nBasic hand toolkit incl. Phillips screwdrivers of varying sizes\n\nZip ties,\n\nWork order with technician's name,\n\nValid ID\n\nBefore leaving make sure all other PRN devices are online and working.\n\nMust check in and out with Brandpoint support team. If no one reaches out to you then please call 856-382-2645 via TEXT ONLY (this # cannot receive calls)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T08:00","end":"2026-11-12T10:00","latestStart":"2026-11-12T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":21.41803414826936},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 investigate intermittent connectivity (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18