{"job":{"id":20337165,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"POSRG Remarketing Group","title":"Imbox Installation","description":{"html":"<p>***TECH WILL NEED ALL EQUIPMENT FROM REQUIRED LIST BELOW***</p><p><strong><em>Please read the entire work order before requesting this job.</em></strong></p><p><strong>Please read the attached documentation and print out the installation check list as needed before service.</strong></p><p>Technician will follow the detailed installation guide to unpack and setup the Imbox shoe protection unit.</p><p><strong><u>Scope of Work Overview</u></strong></p><p>This install will require DEO system to be moved from the removal unit, into the new installed unit. </p><p>Please follow provided installation guide.</p><p>Tool requirements in guide.</p><p>Test spray video required after completing installation. (pg 14 in install guide)</p><p><br></p><p><em>If any pieces are missing from the shipped unit please inform the work order manager immediately.</em></p><p><strong><del>***</del>Failure to check in may result in a loss of compensation and any travel expenses.</strong></p><p><strong><u>Required Deliverables to be Paid</u></strong></p><p><strong>MUST </strong>check in/out with POSRG work order manager.</p><p>The Imbox has been tested and is functioning before departure.</p><p>Complete the check list and attach photos to the work order.</p><p>Leave detailed closing notes.</p><p><strong><u>Duration on Site</u></strong></p><p>An experienced technician can be done in about 2 hours.If more time is needed the technician is required to call the work order manager to get approval. Failure to get approval will result in nonpayment.</p><p><strong><u>Required Tools</u></strong></p><p>Tools:</p><ul><li>Torx bit bet (T8 – T30)</li><li>Precision screwdriver set</li><li>Screwdriver set</li><li>Socket set (5.5mm, 10mm, etc.)</li><li>Adjustable wrench</li><li>&nbsp;Hand Truck or Dolly</li></ul>","markdown":"\\*\\*\\*TECH WILL NEED ALL EQUIPMENT FROM REQUIRED L