{"job":{"id":20329720,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"EPC","title":"Food Lion  PC Replacement","description":{"html":"<p>This work order is for the MVP Saving Center Kiosk.The kiosk's computer has a problem and needs to be replaced.&nbsp;EPC has shipped a replacement computer to the store via FedEx.&nbsp;Check FedEx and confirm package delivery. Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff.&nbsp;When replacing the computer <strong>do not use the blue 3.0 USB ports to the right of the video connections.</strong></p><p>When the computer boots, you will be prompted to scan in dispenser bar codes that were enclosed in the box. Additionally we have attached a pdf of the bar code sheet to the work order, the scanner is configured to read them off of a phone. <strong>Scan in order of: IP, GW, MASK, MAC and DISP. Avoid scanning the bar codes multiple times, after you hear the beep wait for the value to populate on the screen before going to the next bar code. </strong> Call EPC to confirm it is online and that we can ping it.&nbsp;The computer update takes approximately 10 minutes, check back with us to confirm functionality.</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Take a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.</span></p><p>Finally ship the faulty computer back to EPC using the enclosed&nbsp;FedEx return label by dropping it off at a FedEx location. <strong> EPC's policy is that we can't approve payment until the return package shows up in FedEx tracking.</strong></p>","markdown":"This work order is for the MVP Saving Center Kiosk.The kiosk's computer has a problem and needs to be replaced. EPC has shipped a replacement computer to the store via FedEx. Check FedEx and confirm package delivery. Call EPC when onsite and check in with store staff. When replacing the computer **do not use the blue 3.0 USB ports to the right of the video connections.**\n\nWhen the computer boots, you will be prompted to scan in dispenser bar codes that were enclosed in the box. Additionally we have attached a pdf of the bar code sheet to the work order, the scanner is configured to read them off of a phone. **Scan in order of: IP, GW, MASK, MAC and DISP. Avoid scanning the bar codes multiple times, after you hear the beep wait for the value to populate on the screen before going to the next bar code.**  Call EPC to confirm it is online and that we can ping it. The computer update takes approximately 10 minutes, check back with us to confirm functionality.\n\nTake a wide angle picture of kiosk that includes the main entrance to the store with no boxes, tool bags or obstructions and email it to helpdesk@epc-instore.com subject should include the store number. Please note payment will not be issued without a picture of how the kiosk is placed in the store.\n\nFinally ship the faulty computer back to EPC using the enclosed FedEx return label by dropping it off at a FedEx location.  **EPC's policy is that we can't approve payment until the return package shows up in FedEx tracking.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T10:30","end":"2026-11-10T11:30","latestStart":"2026-11-10T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":85,"max":85},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":40.62779342316351},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/10/2026, 10:30:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"star