{"job":{"id":"4153403986","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Agilityarc Tech","title":"IT Support specialist","description":"<p><strong>Job Title:</strong> IT Support Specialist</p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Cary, North Carolina</p><p><strong>Work Model:</strong> Onsite – Part-Time Scheduled Support</p><p><strong>Work Schedule:</strong> Every Tuesday and Thursday (2 days per week)</p><p><strong>Engagement:</strong> Long-Term Assignment</p><p>Job Summary</p><p>We are looking for a skilled and customer-oriented IT Support Specialist to provide onsite technical support at our client's Cary office twice a week (Tuesday and Thursday).</p><p>The engineer will be responsible for providing end-user support, troubleshooting hardware and software issues, maintaining workplace IT equipment, and ensuring smooth day-to-day IT operations.</p><p>This is a long-term engagement requiring a dedicated engineer. The same engineer must attend every scheduled visit to maintain consistency, build familiarity with the client's IT environment, and provide reliable IT support.</p><p><br></p><p>Roles and Responsibilities</p><ul><li>Provide onsite desktop and end-user technical support.</li><li>Troubleshoot Windows desktops, laptops, printers, and other IT peripherals.</li><li>Install, configure, and maintain computer hardware and software.</li><li>Provide support for Microsoft 365, Outlook, Teams, and other business applications.</li><li>Troubleshoot network connectivity, Wi-Fi, VPN, and basic LAN-related issues.</li><li>Assist with Active Directory user accounts, password resets, and access management.</li><li>Support employee onboarding and offboarding activities.</li><li>Diagnose and resolve hardware, software, and operating system issues.</li><li>Log, track, update, and resolve incidents and service requests through the IT ticketing system.</li><li>Coordinate with remote infrastructure and application teams for issue escalation.</li><li>Maintain IT asset records and technical documentation.</li><li>Ensure timely resolution of user issues and deliver excellent customer service.</li></ul><p>Technical Skills Required</p><ul><li>Windows 10/11 troubleshooting and administration.</li><li>Desktop and laptop hardware troubleshooting.</li><li>Microsoft 365, Outlook, and Microsoft Teams support.</li><li>Active Directory and user administration.</li><li>Basic networking concepts: TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP, LAN, and Wi-Fi.</li><li>VPN and remote connectivity troubleshooting.</li></ul><p><br></p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-16T08:00","end":"2026-11-16T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":29.58579882,"max":236.68639056},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":29.58579882,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":6.4},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No in-hours counter slot available\nRequested: Mon, Nov 16, 8:00 AM\nChecked: Mon, Nov 16, Tue, Nov 17, Wed, Nov 18, Thu, Nov 19, Fri, Nov 20 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-21T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-18T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-20T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"2 day Raleigh office"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 investigate intermittent connectivity (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 