{"job":{"id":20339028,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"A+ Mobile","title":"Wilson, NC-- Starlink Commercial Installation","description":{"html":"<p><strong>ADDITIONAL TRAVEL PAY AVAILABLE WHEN MERITED</strong></p><p><strong>THIS WO IS&nbsp;<u>STARLINK SITE SURVEY PHASE ONLY</u></strong>&nbsp;(time onsite estimate: &lt;5-7 hrs)</p><p><strong>You will be representing&nbsp;ProSat Networks (</strong>a sister company of A+ Mobile Techs<strong>)</strong>&nbsp;at all times during this WO and customer interactions.</p><p><strong><u><del>********</del></u><del>*</del></strong><del>******* ***** ******** ***** ********</del></p><p><del>**** ********</del><strong><del>****** ** ******** ***** ************</del></strong></p><p><strong><del>***** ** ****** </del></strong><del>** ** *** *** ****</del></p><p><strong><u>ProSat Networks' WO Manager(s)</u>:</strong></p><p><strong>Teddy </strong><strong style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>*** **** ************* ************************</del></strong></p><p><strong>Joan</strong> <strong><del>*** **** ************* ******************************</del></strong></p><p><strong>Haley <del>** ***** **** ************* *******************************</del></strong></p><p><strong>Rocky <del>******** **** ************* *******************************</del></strong></p><p>*****************************************</p><p><strong>SOW (scope of work): <u>SOW (scope of work):</u></strong></p><p><strong>Network Implementation&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Supervise the entire installation from start to finish (onsite tech will handle the work)</li><li>Assist the onsite team with the cable run&nbsp;</li><li>Assist the onsite team in installing the Cradlepoint S700 device</li></ul><p><strong>Configuration, Test &amp; Turn-Up (for x2 FHP units):&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Connect the Starlink cable to the Cradlepoint router’s WAN port.</li><li>Connect the technician’s laptop to a LAN port on the Cradlepoint for configuration access.</li><li>Expereo will configure the Cradlepoint remotely and access the technician’s laptop via TeamViewer.</li><li>Instruct the technician to enable a hotspot on their laptop and connect it to their phone to facilitate a manual firmware update through the Starlink app.</li><li>Open the Starlink app, skip setup, and initiate the firmware update. Starlink will reboot automatically upon completion.</li><li>Verify Cradlepoint access via the Expereo management portal.</li><li>Disconnect the phone hotspot and switch the laptop back to DHCP for testing.</li><li>Complete the remote configuration of the Cradlepoint and confirm speed and connectivity via tests.</li></ul><p>**********************************************************************************************************************************</p><p><strong>SITE REQUIREMENTS:</strong></p><p><strong>TECH MUST HAVE</strong></p><ul><li>Hard hat with chin strap, Type 2</li><li>Safety glasses Z87 rated</li><li>Safety vest</li><li>Gloves cut level 4</li><li>Long pants</li><li>Safety toe shoes</li></ul><p>Submit final invoice, photos, and closeout notes detailing work performed immediately via email or text deliverables to:</p><p><del>************************ * **** **********</del></p>","markdown":"**ADDITIONAL TRAVEL PAY AVAILABLE WHEN MERITED**\n\n**THIS WO IS STARLINK SITE SURVEY PHASE ONLY** (time onsite estimate: &lt;5-7 hrs)\n\n**You will be representing ProSat Networks (**a sister company of A+ Mobile Techs**)** at all times during this WO and customer interactions.\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*** \\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**ProSat Networks' WO Manager(s):**\n\n**Teddy** **\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Joan** **\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Haley \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n**Rocky \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\***\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**SOW (scope of work): SOW (scope of work):**\n\n**Network Implementation**\n\n- Supervise the entire installation from start to finish (onsite tech will handle the work)\n- Assist the onsite team with the cable run\n- Assist the onsite team in installing the Cradlepoint S700 device\n\n**Configuration, Test &amp; Turn-Up (for x2 FHP units):**\n\n- Connect the Starlink cable to the Cradlepoint router’s WAN port.\n- Connect the technician’s laptop to a LAN port on the Cradlepoint for configuration access.\n- Expereo will configure the Cradlepoint remotely and access the technician’s laptop via TeamViewer.\n- Instruct the technician to enable a hotspot on their laptop and connect it to their phone to facilitate a manual firmware update through the Starlink app.\n- Open the Starlink app, skip setup, and initiate the firmware update. Starlink will reboot automatically upon completion.\n- Verify Cradlepoint access via the Expereo management portal.\n- Disconnect the phone hotspot and switch the laptop back to DHCP for testing.\n- Complete the remote configuration of the Cradlepoint and confirm speed and connectivity via tests.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**SITE REQUIREMENTS:**\n\n**TECH MUST HAVE**\n\n- Hard hat with chin strap, Type 2\n- Safety glasses Z87 rated\n- Safety vest\n- Gloves cut level 4\n- Long pants\n- Safety toe shoes\n\nSubmit final invoice, photos, and closeout notes detailing work performed immediately via email or text deliverables to:\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-16T10:00","end":"2026-11-16T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":550,"max":550},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":6,"distance":42.86031912668995},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"starlink\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-21T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-18T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-20T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"2 day Raleigh office"},{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 P1 investigate intermittent connectivity (WM)"},{"start":"2026-12-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-01T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 AXON - Wilson Police Department - NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T