{"job":{"id":20339533,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Integral Tech Services","title":"Installation of 3x Meraki Access Points in Shop (Lift Cert Required)","description":{"html":"<p>PPE REQUIRED- Lift Harness Required / Reflective vest / Eye Protection </p><p><strong><u>SUMMARY:</u></strong></p><p>One tech is needed to Install (3) Meraki Access Points in warehouse. Lift will be required. Lift certification and harness are required 100% of time while operating lift. </p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>REQUIRED/Bring with you</u></strong>:</p><ul><li>Cable tester</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>SCOPE:</u></strong></p><ol><li>Text ITS Project Manager once onsite</li><li>Check in with local onsite contact and call remote IT support</li><li>Install 3x New Meraki Access Points &amp; Test connectivity with remote engineer. </li><li>Take photos of completed work and share with ITS project manager</li><li>Clean up and collect signature from BRANCH Manager. Check out with BM, remote contact and ITS contact.</li></ol><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Contact info:</u></strong></p><ul><li>ITS Contact:<del> **** * ************</del></li><li>Site Contact: Josh Dennstedt</li><li>Remote IT: <del>***** ******* ************</del></li></ul>","markdown":"PPE REQUIRED- Lift Harness Required / Reflective vest / Eye Protection\n\n**SUMMARY:**\n\nOne tech is needed to Install (3) Meraki Access Points in warehouse. Lift will be required. Lift certification and harness are required 100% of time while operating lift.\n\n**REQUIRED/Bring with you**:\n\n- Cable tester\n\n**SCOPE:**\n\n1. Text ITS Project Manager once onsite\n2. Check in with local onsite contact and call remote IT support\n3. Install 3x New Meraki Access Points &amp; Test connectivity with remote engineer.\n4. Take photos of completed work and share with ITS project manager\n5. Clean up and collect signature from BRANCH Manager. Check out with BM, remote contact and ITS contact.\n\n**Contact info:**\n\n- ITS Contact: \\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n- Site Contact: Josh Dennstedt\n- Remote IT: \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-18T09:00","end":"2026-11-18T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":260},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":200},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":6.275870879010521},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $260 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[],"busyBlocks":[],"action":"SKIP","ts":1794327948924}
