{"job":{"id":20340277,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"Talbots - P400 Pin Pad and Stand Replacement","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Summary of Work:</strong></p>\n<p>IW Technologies is in need of a technician to go onsite at a local clothing retailer and swap out pin pads. You are to follow the attached documentation to replace the unit, then box up the defective parts using the label provided. Leave defective parts onsite</p>\n<p>Register #: <em>&nbsp;1</em></p>\n<p>Tech must power down the register before installation. You must stay on site for pin pad updates to complete, which can take up to an hour.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Call the Service Desk at 740-951-3911, Option 3, upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not begin work without talking to the Service Desk.</p>\n<p>Technician to replace the Register 1 pin pad and input the IP configuration info if needed.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;Physical Drivers License or State Issued ID</li>\n<li>&nbsp;USB Keyboard</li>\n<li>USB Mouse</li>\n<li>Velcro</li>\n<li>Termination equipment</li>\n<li>Punchdown equipment</li>\n<li>Cable tester</li>\n<li>Variety of Phillips screwdrivers</li>\n<li>Adhesive removal tools (razor blade, rubbing alcohol, etc)&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Pre-Visit Instructions:</strong></p>\n<p>Be sure to read and understand all of the instructions and download/print all documentation attached to work order</p>\n<p>Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.</p>\n<p><strong>Onsite Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check in on the Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198</p>\n<p>Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as a technician from IW Technologies.</p>\n<p>Locate parts shipped to location</p>\n<p>Install new parts/equipment utilizing the attached documentation.</p>\n<p>Validate Connectivity and/or Functionality with the store manager.</p>\n<p>You will only call the Premium Brands Help Desk if you need assistance or need help with installing the new pin pad. The help desk can be reached at 740-951-3911 Option 3 then option 2 for On-site Hardware Technicians, give them their internal ticket number&nbsp;(insert ticket number here)</p>\n<p><strong>Clean up Area</strong></p>\n<p>Call IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site - 847-285-4198. Be prepared to hand your phone to the store manager so we can verify with the manager that the pin pad is fully functional.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check In Time: (local)</p>\n<p>Check Out Time: (local)</p>\n<p>Store Contact Name:</p>\n<p>Help Desk Contact Name (if you call the help desk):</p>\n<p>Description of Issue Observed by Tech Upon Arrival:</p>\n<p>Description of Troubleshooting / Resolution: (concise, bulleted format)</p>\n<p>Parts Installed: Product Name, SN</p>\n<p>Parts Removed: Product Name, SN</p>\n<p>Return Tracking #:</p>\n<p>Return Authorization #:</p>\n<p>Store Check Out Contact:</p>\n<p>Picture of Completed Work:</p>\n<p><strong>Close-Out Tasks:</strong></p>\n<p>Check out on the Field Nation App</p>\n<p>Ensure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables</p>\n<p>Leave defective parts onsite</p>\n<p>Submit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.</p>\n<p><strong>Special Instructions for technician:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>The Register MUST be shut off prior to replacement.</li>\n<li>If you notice the display showing “Form Agent - USB” for more than a minute at any point, to please call the help desk immediately (number is below).</li>\n<li>You must remain on site while the pin pad’s software is being updated, which can take an hour or longer.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><em>(Include any pertinent information from the case here)</em></p>","markdown":"**Summary of Work:**\n\nIW Technologies is in need of a technician to go onsite at a local clothing retailer and swap out pin pads. You are to follow the attached documentation to replace the unit, then box up the defective parts using the label provided. Leave defective parts onsite\n\nRegister #:  *1*\n\nTech must power down the register before installation. You must stay on site for pin pad updates to complete, which can take up to an hour.\n\nCall the Service Desk at 740-951-3911, Option 3, upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not begin work without talking to the Service Desk.\n\nTechnician to replace the Register 1 pin pad and input the IP configuration info if needed.\n\n- Physical Drivers License or State Issued ID\n- USB Keyboard\n- USB Mouse\n- Velcro\n- Termination equipment\n- Punchdown equipment\n- Cable tester\n- Variety of Phillips screwdrivers\n- Adhesive removal tools (razor blade, rubbing alcohol, etc)\n\n**Pre-Visit Instructions:**\n\nBe sure to read and understand all of the instructions and download/print all documentation attached to work order\n\nConfirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours of the appointment.\n\n**Onsite Tasks:**\n\nCheck in on the Field Nation app and call IW Technologies to check in - 847-285-4198\n\nLocate onsite contact and introduce yourself as a technician from IW Technologies.\n\nLocate parts shipped to location\n\nInstall new parts/equipment utilizing the attached documentation.\n\nValidate Connectivity and/or Functionality with the store manager.\n\nYou will only call the Premium Brands Help Desk if you need assistance or need help with installing the new pin pad. The help desk can be reached at 740-951-3911 Option 3 then option 2 for On-site Hardware Technicians, give them their internal ticket number (insert ticket number here)\n\n**Clean up Area**\n\nCall IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site - 847-285-4198. Be prepared to hand your phone to the store manager so we can verify with the manager that the pin pad is fully functional.\n\nCheck In Time: (local)\n\nCheck Out Time: (local)\n\nStore Contact Name:\n\nHelp Desk Contact Name (if you call the help desk):\n\nDescription of Issue Observed by Tech Upon Arrival:\n\nDescription of Troubleshooting / Resolution: (concise, bulleted format)\n\nParts Installed: Product Name, SN\n\nParts Removed: Product Name, SN\n\nReturn Tracking #:\n\nReturn Authorization #:\n\nStore Check Out Contact:\n\nPicture of Completed Work:\n\n**Close-Out Tasks:**\n\nCheck out on the Field Nation App\n\nEnsure the work order has been completed to specification and upload deliverables\n\nLeave defective parts onsite\n\nSubmit the work order for payment and it will be approved within 24 hours assuming there are no issues.\n\n**Special Instructions for technician:**\n\n1. The Register MUST be shut off prior to replacement.\n2. If you notice the display showing “Form Agent - USB” for more than a minute at any point, to please call the help desk immediately (number is below).\n3. You must remain on site while the pin pad’s software is being updated, which can take an hour or longer.\n\n*(Include any pertinent information from the case here)*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T12:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:30","latestStart":"2026-11-10T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.5,"distance":11.280311299471906},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"display\" in description"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"20