{"job":{"id":20340273,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Resolute Partners, LLC","title":"Crescent Gardens Apartments - LPR camera replacement","description":{"html":"<p>SOW:</p><p>The property has a bullet camera (LPR) that is catching license plates. We will need to replace that camera and aim the camera over the phone with me (Tim), at tech support.</p><p>This is an Avigilon POE camera. Important Notes :</p><p>I have attached a picture of the map in the client documents section, and a physical picture of where the camera is located. <strong><u>BRING A LADDER TALL ENOUGH TO SERVICE THIS CAMERA.</u></strong></p><p>Basic Tools, tools to crimp ethernet and test ethernet, ladder that is tall enough</p>","markdown":"SOW:\n\nThe property has a bullet camera (LPR) that is catching license plates. We will need to replace that camera and aim the camera over the phone with me (Tim), at tech support.\n\nThis is an Avigilon POE camera. Important Notes :\n\nI have attached a picture of the map in the client documents section, and a physical picture of where the camera is located. **BRING A LADDER TALL ENOUGH TO SERVICE THIS CAMERA.**\n\nBasic Tools, tools to crimp ethernet and test ethernet, ladder that is tall enough","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-17T09:00","end":"2026-11-17T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":60,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":60,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":47.48566149572356},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $180 (countered: $180) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-21T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-18T05:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-20T05:00:00.000Z","summary":"2 day Raleigh office"},{"start":"2026-12-01T13: