{"job":{"id":20340473,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Convergis Technologies","title":"Program Centralize Voicemail on Phone System at Hotel and Add Additional HD to DVR","description":{"html":"<p>Phone system voicemail programming. I have provided detailed instructions to use for programming. This will be done from the console phone at the front desk. Please follow the instructions provided to program the voicemail feature. Only if you have issues with programming please call Tim Woods for remote support 678-521-4671.</p><p><br></p><p>I have provided the numbers you will need for voicemail programming below</p><p>Money line-919-645-4700</p><p>Cell Phone-919-593-9013</p><p>Voicemail Access Number-919-578-6869</p><p>Voicemail Caller ID-678-404-6077</p><p><br></p><p>Also while onsite corporate has sent a hard drive addition to add to their DVR for more storage. Please add additional hard drive to DVR. </p><p>Site opens at 11am</p>","markdown":"Phone system voicemail programming. I have provided detailed instructions to use for programming. This will be done from the console phone at the front desk. Please follow the instructions provided to program the voicemail feature. Only if you have issues with programming please call Tim Woods for remote support 678-521-4671.\n\nI have provided the numbers you will need for voicemail programming below\n\nMoney line-919-645-4700\n\nCell Phone-919-593-9013\n\nVoicemail Access Number-919-578-6869\n\nVoicemail Caller ID-678-404-6077\n\nAlso while onsite corporate has sent a hard drive addition to add to their DVR for more storage. Please add additional hard drive to DVR.\n\nSite opens at 11am","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T11:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-10T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":235},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":150},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":85}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":9.448579