{"job":{"id":20306849,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"TRCA","title":"Frame TV Swap - Ticket# 305482 *2 TECHS* ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>IMPORTANT INFORMATION:</strong></p><p><strong>Our insurance requires all providers dispatched to our jobsites to have Worker’s compensation coverage.&nbsp;If you do not provide proof of this coverage, TRCA will provide this for your site visit, and the cost (listed as a penalty charge) will be applied to all work orders.&nbsp;Work orders will have 1% of labor only deducted from the total pay.&nbsp;Note: travel or materials cost do not apply, the deduction is for labor only.&nbsp;If you have a COI with workers compensation, please let the work order manager know, so we can get a copy of the COI with TRCA listed as the Certificate Holder and waive this deduction.&nbsp;The COI must be received before the work order is placed on Work Done in order for the penalty to be removed.</strong></p><p>-------------------------------------------</p><p>**Tech must call TRCA @ 940-565-5000 when arriving onsite to receive a check in code**</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE NOTE THAT DISPATCHES MUST TAKE PLACE BEFORE THE FACILITY OPENS.</p><p><br></p><p>- IF THE TECH FORESEES THIS REQUEST GOING OVER 2 HOUR(S) AND/OR CHANGE IN THE BELOW SOW, THEY MUST CALL THE CLIENT FOR APPROVAL, AND WILL NEED TO UPDATE TRCA WITH THE APPROVAL.&nbsp;</p><p>- FAILURE TO DO SO, MAY RESULT IN FAILURE OF PAYMENT.</p><p><br></p><p><del>*******</del> Tech Support: TBD</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Tools:</u></strong></p><p>- Cable tester with a display to show cable test results.</p><p>- Laptop w/ console cable</p><p>- At least 8-10ft ladder</p><p>- CAT6 cabling/material/RJ45/patch cables, etc</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>SOW:</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p>We have a new Samsung FrameTV that needs to replace the old Samsung FrameTV installed at our Durham location. The new TV is already at the store, the old TV can be recycled.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We would also like to request the tech send us the serial numbers of the old TV and the new TV in their report. It is a 55 inch TV, in case two techs are necessary for installation.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>BEFORE checking out with TRCA, the tech must call Gorjana support to confirm all is well.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Required Deliverables Within (24) Hours of Completion:</u></strong></p><p>- If any cables are ran/re-terminated/tested - the tech must upload their test results showing each cable they touched has passed.</p><p>* Cable test results- the cable tests must include the labeling to show which cable was tested and passed</p><p>* The tech can do this by taking a picture of their cable tester showing 'pass'.</p><p>- Completion pictures of any adds/moves/changes.</p><p>- If there is defective hardware; TRCA will need the make, model, and a picture of the device(s).</p><p>- Customer sign off.</p>","markdown":"**IMPORTANT INFORMATION:**\n\n**Our insurance requires all providers dispatched to our jobsites to have Worker’s compensation coverage. If you do not provide proof of this coverage, TRCA will provide this for your site visit, and the cost (listed as a penalty charge) will be applied to all work orders. Work orders will have 1% of labor only deducted from the total pay. Note: travel or materials cost do not apply, the deduction is for labor only. If you have a COI with workers compensation, please let the work order manager know, so we can get a copy of the COI with TRCA listed as the Certificate Holder and waive this deduction. The COI must be received before the work order is placed on Work Done in order for the penalty to be removed.**\n\n\\-------------------------------------------\n\n\\*\\*Tech must call TRCA @ 940-565-5000 when arriving onsite to receive a check in code\\*\\*\n\nPLEASE NOTE THAT DISPATCHES MUST TAKE PLACE BEFORE THE FACILITY OPENS.\n\n\\- IF THE TECH FORESEES THIS REQUEST GOING OVER 2 HOUR(S) AND/OR CHANGE IN THE BELOW SOW, THEY MUST CALL THE CLIENT FOR APPROVAL, AND WILL NEED TO UPDATE TRCA WITH THE APPROVAL.\n\n\\- FAILURE TO DO SO, MAY RESULT IN FAILURE OF PAYMENT.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Tech Support: TBD\n\n**Required Tools:**\n\n\\- Cable tester with a display to show cable test results.\n\n\\- Laptop w/ console cable\n\n\\- At least 8-10ft ladder\n\n\\- CAT6 cabling/material/RJ45/patch cables, etc\n\n**SOW:**\n\nWe have a new Samsung FrameTV that needs to replace the old Samsung FrameTV installed at our Durham location. The new TV is already at the store, the old TV can be recycled.\n\nWe would also like to request the tech send us the serial numbers of the old TV and the new TV in their report. It is a 55 inch TV, in case two techs are necessary for installation.\n\nBEFORE checking out with TRCA, the tech must call Gorjana support to confirm all is well.\n\n**Required Deliverables Within (24) Hours of Completion:**\n\n\\- If any cables are ran/re-terminated/tested - the tech must upload their test results showing each cable they touched has passed.\n\n\\* Cable test results- the cable tests must include the labeling to show which cable was tested and passed\n\n\\* The tech can do this by taking a picture of their cable tester showing 'pass'.\n\n\\- Completion pictures of any adds/moves/changes.\n\n\\- If there is defective hardware; TRCA will need the make, model, and a picture of the device(s).\n\n\\- Customer sign off.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T11:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-10T14:00"},"payRange":{"min":140,"max":280},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":140,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":11.254476211371424},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"BLOCKED_KEYWORD","rejectDetails":"Blocked keyword \"TV\" in title"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-