{"job":{"id":20340909,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Convergis Technologies","title":"Program Centralize Voice Mail for Phone System","description":{"html":"<p>Phone system voicemail programming. I have provided detailed instructions to use for programming. This will be done from the console phone at the front desk. Please follow the instructions provided to program the voicemail feature. Only if you have issues with programming please call Tim Woods for remote support 678-521-4671. </p><p>I have provided the numbers you will need for voicemail programming below </p><p>Money line-919-662-0101 </p><p>Cell Phone-919-389-9822 </p><p>Voicemail Access Number-919-999-3717 </p><p>Voicemail Caller ID-678-404-6077 </p><p>Site opens at 11am</p>","markdown":"Phone system voicemail programming. I have provided detailed instructions to use for programming. This will be done from the console phone at the front desk. Please follow the instructions provided to program the voicemail feature. Only if you have issues with programming please call Tim Woods for remote support 678-521-4671.\n\nI have provided the numbers you will need for voicemail programming below\n\nMoney line-919-662-0101\n\nCell Phone-919-389-9822\n\nVoicemail Access Number-919-999-3717\n\nVoicemail Caller ID-678-404-6077\n\nSite opens at 11am","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T11:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-10T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":150,"max":235},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":150},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":85}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":12.248117740519197},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/10/2026, 11:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00: