{"job":{"id":20340813,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Pinnacle Communication Corporation","title":"N53075 - Cable Issue HLT-RDUKN-36-RM210-AP015","description":{"html":"<p>Technician to call tech support at 301-339-7855 upon&nbsp;arrival and before departure from site.</p><p>Customer reports cable issue HLT-RDUKN-36-RM210-AP015</p><p>Remote technician determined we need a tech on site to work with remote support to complete the following scope of work:</p><p>Need tech onsite to assist with troubleshooting hardwired data connection in guest room at hotel.&nbsp;</p><p>Tech should be familiar working with networking equipment such as network switches and routers, as well as tracing out and testing cat 5/6 cabling.&nbsp;</p><p>Tech may be required to re-terminate data ends for network cable either at patch panel or making new ethernet connectors. Tech should bring basic networking tools such as (laptop, cat5 cable tester, toner/probe, punch down tool, cat 5 cable crimps, etc..).</p><p>Tech will troubleshoot cable / jack / patch cables / MDF-IDF connections / switch port and restore HSIA service</p><p><strong><em>Technician must take the following tools to the jobsite: </em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Windows Laptop</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Tools needed to Tone/Test/Repair ethernet cables</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Wireless Hotspot</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\"><em>Standard tools such as screwdrivers etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">TECH MUST RECORD NAME OF PCC TECH THEY ARE CHECKING IN AND OUT WITH.</strong></p>","markdown":"Technician to call tech support at 301-339-7855 upon arrival and before departure from site.\n\nCustomer reports cable issue HLT-RDUKN-36-RM210-AP015\n\nRemote technician determined we need a tech on site to work with remote support to complete the following scope of work:\n\nNeed tech onsite to assist with troubleshooting hardwired data connection in guest room at hotel.\n\nTech should be familiar working with networking equipment such as network switches and routers, as well as tracing out and testing cat 5/6 cabling.\n\nTech may be required to re-terminate data ends for network cable either at patch panel or making new ethernet connectors. Tech should bring basic networking tools such as (laptop, cat5 cable tester, toner/probe, punch down tool, cat 5 cable crimps, etc..).\n\nTech will troubleshoot cable / jack / patch cables / MDF-IDF connections / switch port and restore HSIA service\n\n***Technician must take the following tools to the jobsite:***\n\n***Windows Laptop***\n\n***Tools needed to Tone/Test/Repair ethernet cables***\n\n***Wireless Hotspot***\n\n***Standard tools such as screwdrivers etc.***\n\n**TECH MUST RECORD NAME OF PCC TECH THEY ARE CHECKING IN AND OUT WITH.**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T09:00","end":"2026-11-12T11:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14.151809407583116},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $150) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-12-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-01T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 AXON - Wilson Police Department - NC (WM)"}