{"job":{"id":20341619,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"IW Technologies","title":"Talbots - POS Cabling","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Summary of Work:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>﻿The technician assigned to the work order MUST be the technician onsite NO EXCEPTIONS. Any violations will be taken very seriously and escalated to Field Nation and the work order will not be approved for payment.</strong></p>\n<p>IW Technologies is in need of a technician to go onsite at a Talbots, register 1 goes offline a lot. Need tech to check cable run from register to router. May need to re-terminate cables</p>\n<p>Call Alex 740-951-5409 or the Store Network Support Team at 740-951-5800 upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not perform any work without calling Store Network Support.</p>\n<p><strong>Required Tools (ALL REQUIRED)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Laptop</li>\n<li>Console Cable</li>\n<li>Cisco Console Cables (Cisco switches/routers &amp; Fortigate)</li>\n<li>110 / 66 Punch Down Tool</li>\n<li>RJ‑45 Crimpers</li>\n<li>Cordless Drill w/ Misc. Bits</li>\n<li>Cable Certifier (Fluke or equivalent)</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">NOT a toner or multimeter</li>\n<li>Cable Toner / Speaker</li>\n<li>Basic Cabling Tool Kit</li>\n<li>150 ft Cat5e Cable + RJ‑45 Termination Ends</li>\n<li>Ladder (10–12 ft)</li>\n<li>P‑Touch Labeler</li>\n<li>Digital Camera or HD‑capable Cell Phone</li>\n<li>Valid ID <strong>matching your Field Nation profile name</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ensure you have the <strong>correct drivers for Cisco console access</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Pre‑Visit Instructions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Review <strong>ALL attached documentation</strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Download / print required files before arrival</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Confirm ETA in</u> Field Nation within 24 hours</strong> of appointment</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Onsite Tasks</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Check in using <strong>Field Nation App</strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Call</u> IW Technologies</strong> to check in</li>\n<li>847‑285‑4198</li>\n<li>Call <strong>Store Network Team</strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>740‑951‑5800</u></strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Provide their <strong>internal ticket number</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as an</li>\n<li><strong>IW Technologies Technician</strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Perform required tasks per documentation</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Validate connectivity/functionality with Support</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Clean up work area</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Call</u> Store Network Team</strong> to confirm resolution or status</li>\n<li>Call <strong>IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site</strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>847‑285‑4198</u></strong></li>\n<li><strong><u>Submit work order for payment</u></strong></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Approval within <strong>24 hours</strong>if no issues</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Special Instructions for Technician</strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>(Insert any case‑specific notes here)</u></strong></p>","markdown":"**Summary of Work:**\n\n**﻿The technician assigned to the work order MUST be the technician onsite NO EXCEPTIONS. Any violations will be taken very seriously and escalated to Field Nation and the work order will not be approved for payment.**\n\nIW Technologies is in need of a technician to go onsite at a Talbots, register 1 goes offline a lot. Need tech to check cable run from register to router. May need to re-terminate cables\n\nCall Alex 740-951-5409 or the Store Network Support Team at 740-951-5800 upon arrival and departure from the store. Do not perform any work without calling Store Network Support.\n\n**Required Tools (ALL REQUIRED)**\n\n- Laptop\n- Console Cable\n- Cisco Console Cables (Cisco switches/routers &amp; Fortigate)\n- 110 / 66 Punch Down Tool\n- RJ‑45 Crimpers\n- Cordless Drill w/ Misc. Bits\n- Cable Certifier (Fluke or equivalent)\n- NOT a toner or multimeter\n- Cable Toner / Speaker\n- Basic Cabling Tool Kit\n- 150 ft Cat5e Cable + RJ‑45 Termination Ends\n- Ladder (10–12 ft)\n- P‑Touch Labeler\n- Digital Camera or HD‑capable Cell Phone\n- Valid ID **matching your Field Nation profile name**\n\nEnsure you have the **correct drivers for Cisco console access**.\n\n**Pre‑Visit Instructions**\n\n- Review **ALL attached documentation**\n- **Download / print required files before arrival**\n- **Confirm ETA in Field Nation within 24 hours** of appointment\n\n**Onsite Tasks**\n\n1. Check in using **Field Nation App**\n2. **Call IW Technologies** to check in\n3. 847‑285‑4198\n4. Call **Store Network Team**\n5. **740‑951‑5800**\n\n- Provide their **internal ticket number**\n\n1. Locate onsite contact and introduce yourself as an\n2. **IW Technologies Technician**\n3. **Perform required tasks per documentation**\n4. **Validate connectivity/functionality with Support**\n5. **Clean up work area**\n6. **Call Store Network Team** to confirm resolution or status\n7. Call **IW Technologies to check out BEFORE leaving site**\n8. **847‑285‑4198**\n9. **Submit work order for payment**\n\n- Approval within **24 hours**if no issues\n\n**Special Instructions for Technician**\n\n**(Insert any case‑specific notes here)**","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-11T10:00","end":"2026-11-11T12:00","latestStart":"2026-11-11T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":130},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":90},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":50.40970276198723},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z",