{"job":{"id":20343986,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"National Loss Prevention Solutions","title":"Replace 1 Interior IP Camera - J7795","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Must call Project Manager prior to entering the service location. If no response from PM's direct line please call 737-284-9228.</u></strong></li><li>Seeking a technician with experience in Local Low Voltage and Security Industry Licenses/Certifications skilled in Structured Data cabling installation, Camera and Alarm system installation, Access Control System installation</li><li>Tech is required to Check in upon Arrival, Unpack inventory materials, Provide materials listed per site scope of work and Verify installation layout and plans with either remote support or project Management.</li></ul><p><strong><u>Replace 1 IP Camera</u></strong></p><ol><li><strong>Replace \"Mop Sink\" with shipped camera</strong></li><li><strong>Confirm cameras online with WO manager</strong></li><li><strong>Focus Camera Angle with WO manager</strong></li><li><strong>Ship bad camera via UPS with label provided by WO manager</strong></li><li><strong>Upload UPS Drop Off Receipt to WO(WO will not be approved until receipt is uploaded)</strong></li></ol><p><strong><u>Clean Camera Lenses where necessary</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Reimbursements</u></strong></p><ul><li>All wire will be reimbursed at .$35/FT</li><li>This is a fixed rate job. All materials(with the exception of wire) are included in the initial rate unless discussed and approved by WO Manager.</li><li>Exceeding the \"Approximate Hours to Complete\" # will not be reimbursed for a fixed rate job with the exception of outlying circumstances discussed and approved by WO Manager.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong> Clean Shirt and Pants, Industry standard PPE as required</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li><em>﻿L</em>adder</li><li>Basic hand tools</li><li>RJ45 Cable Tester/Toner</li><li>Laptop with ethernet port or RJ45-USB Dongle and Patch Cable</li><li>Hotspot</li><li>RJ45 Crimper with RJ45s</li><li>CAT6 cable</li><li><u>Additional items per SOW</u></li><li><u>Caulk</u></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p>Check in arrival with PM. <strong><u>PLEASE CALL WO Manager for check-in</u></strong></p><p>Unpack and Inventory materials, Provide materials as listed per site scope of work.</p><p>Verify installation layout and plans with remote support/project management.</p><p><strong><u>Replace 1 IP Camera</u></strong></p><ol><li><strong>Replace \"Mop Sink\" with shipped camera</strong></li><li><strong>Confirm cameras online with WO manager</strong></li><li><strong>Focus Camera Angle with WO manager</strong></li><li><strong>Ship bad camera via UPS with label provided by WO manager</strong></li><li><strong>Upload UPS Drop Off Receipt to WO(WO will not be approved until receipt is uploaded)</strong></li></ol><p><strong><u>Clean Camera Lenses where necessary</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Cleanup</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong><u>Put all ceiling tiles back up and sweep up any drilling dust or insulation on the floor from your installation</u></strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Upload/email images of installed materials.</p><p>Verify system online/functionality with remote support.</p><p>Provide cable and miscellaneous hardware for installation as details in SOW.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks</em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent National Loss Prevention Solutions while onsite.</li><li>&nbsp;Check in time with PM</li><li>&nbsp;Upload/Email photos of installation once completed.</li></ol><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables</em></strong></p><ol><li>Upload/email images of installed materials.</li><li>Check out time with PM&nbsp;</li><li>Check-out of work order</li></ol><p><strong>Directory Process:</strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Call Project Manager or Remote Support</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to Call Project Manager or Remote Support</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;As approved by Work Order/Project Manager</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- **Must call Project Manager prior to entering the service location. If no response from PM's direct line please call 737-284-9228.**\n- Seeking a technician with experience in Local Low Voltage and Security Industry Licenses/Certifications skilled in Structured Data cabling installation, Camera and Alarm system installation, Access Control System installation\n- Tech is required to Check in upon Arrival, Unpack inventory materials, Provide materials listed per site scope of work and Verify installation layout and plans with either remote support or project Management.\n\n**Replace 1 IP Camera**\n\n1. **Replace \"Mop Sink\" with shipped camera**\n2. **Confirm cameras online with WO manager**\n3. **Focus Camera Angle with WO manager**\n4. **Ship bad camera via UPS with label provided by WO manager**\n5. **Upload UPS Drop Off Receipt to WO(WO will not be approved until receipt is uploaded)**\n\n**Clean Camera Lenses where necessary**\n\n**Reimbursements**\n\n- All wire will be reimbursed at .$35/FT\n- This is a fixed rate job. All materials(with the exception of wire) are included in the initial rate unless discussed and approved by WO Manager.\n- Exceeding the \"Approximate Hours to Complete\" # will not be reimbursed for a fixed rate job with the exception of outlying circumstances discussed and approved by WO Manager.\n\n**Dress Code:** Clean Shirt and Pants, Industry standard PPE as required\n\n·\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- *﻿L*adder\n- Basic hand tools\n- RJ45 Cable Tester/Toner\n- Laptop with ethernet port or RJ45-USB Dongle and Patch Cable\n- Hotspot\n- RJ45 Crimper with RJ45s\n- CAT6 cable\n- Additional items per SOW\n- Caulk\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\nCheck in arrival with PM. **PLEASE CALL WO Manager for check-in**\n\nUnpack and Inventory materials, Provide materials as listed per site scope of work.\n\nVerify installation layout and plans with remote support/project management.\n\n**Replace 1 IP Camera**\n\n1. **Replace \"Mop Sink\" with shipped camera**\n2. **Confirm cameras online with WO manager**\n3. **Focus Camera Angle with WO manager**\n4. **Ship bad camera via UPS with label provided by WO manager**\n5. **Upload UPS Drop Off Receipt to WO(WO will not be approved until receipt is uploaded)**\n\n**Clean Camera Lenses where necessary**\n\n**Cleanup**\n\n- **Put all ceiling tiles back up and sweep up any drilling dust or insulation on the floor from your installation**\n\nUpload/email images of installed materials.\n\nVerify system online/functionality with remote support.\n\nProvide cable and miscellaneous hardware for installation as details in SOW.\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent National Loss Prevention Solutions while onsite.\n2. Check in time with PM\n3. Upload/Email photos of installation once completed.\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Upload/email images of installed materials.\n2. Check out time with PM\n3. Check-out of work order\n\n**Directory Process:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with Call Project Manager or Remote Support\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to Call Project Manager or Remote Support\n\n**Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- As approved by Work Order/Project Manager","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T12:30","end":"2026-11-12T13:30"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":65},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":7.337963158126022},"result":{"eligible":fa