{"job":{"id":20344870,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"AVT Technology Solutions LLC","title":"Reg Jewelry Register #50 Pin Pad - Troubleshoot - Check network connection","description":{"html":"<p>1. <strong>Scope of Work</strong> <strong>includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.</strong></p>\n<p>Reg Jewelry Register #50 Pin Pad - Troubleshoot - Check network connection</p>\n<p><em>Scope of Work: • Need tech on site to troubleshoot Pin Pad on Reg 50</em></p>\n<p><em>• Tech will need confirm network cable connections between port on pin pad cable data block (ETHER 1) and mini data hub</em></p>\n<p><em>• Tech should confirm that the connector on the bottom of the pin pad is securely in place.</em></p>\n<p><em>• If mini network hub is offline, confirm USB cable is seated into USB port on register IO Hub.</em></p>\n<p><em>• Tech will need network line tester/toner to possibly check home run to patch panel</em></p>\n<p><em>• If issue is related to the pin pad or the pin pad cable, inform the manager that they will have to request a replacement from their help desk.</em></p>\n<p><em>• If technical support is needed, please call Shyft/AVT National Tech Support at <del>************* **** ** **** *</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>**** ******** **** *******</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>******** *******************</del></em></p>\n<p><em>Clients present issue: reg 50 Pin Pad</em></p>\n<p><em>Estimated time: 2 hours</em></p>\n<p><em>Part shipped to the site?:(y/n)</em></p>\n<p><em>Please review the repair plans in the link below</em></p>\n<p><em>(put the direct link here)</em></p>\n<p><em>Other Instructions:</em></p>\n<p><em>If assistance is needed, please call: 8<del>*********** ****** * *</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>******** **** *****</del></em></p>\n<p><em><del>***************************************************************************************************************</del></em></p>\n<p><strong>Completion Requirements:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>Closing Notes are required to be provided before leaving the location.</em></strong> <em>These notes should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only.&nbsp;If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be</em> <strong><em>a detailed and concise statement about the work performed</em></strong><em>.</em><strong><em>Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.</em></strong></p>\n<p><em>2.</em> <strong>Part Information</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Unused Parts</strong>: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Used Parts</strong>: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.</p>\n<p><strong>Missing Return Label</strong>: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.</p>\n<p><strong>General Rules</strong>: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.</p>","markdown":"1\\. **Scope of Work** **includes returning parts as detailed in the Part Module and in #2 Part Information below.**\n\nReg Jewelry Register #50 Pin Pad - Troubleshoot - Check network connection\n\n*Scope of Work: • Need tech on site to troubleshoot Pin Pad on Reg 50*\n\n*• Tech will need confirm network cable connections between port on pin pad cable data block (ETHER 1) and mini data hub*\n\n*• Tech should confirm that the connector on the bottom of the pin pad is securely in place.*\n\n*• If mini network hub is offline, confirm USB cable is seated into USB port on register IO Hub.*\n\n*• Tech will need network line tester/toner to possibly check home run to patch panel*\n\n*• If issue is related to the pin pad or the pin pad cable, inform the manager that they will have to request a replacement from their help desk.*\n\n*• If technical support is needed, please call Shyft/AVT National Tech Support at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\**\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*Clients present issue: reg 50 Pin Pad*\n\n*Estimated time: 2 hours*\n\n*Part shipped to the site?:(y/n)*\n\n*Please review the repair plans in the link below*\n\n*(put the direct link here)*\n\n*Other Instructions:*\n\n*If assistance is needed, please call: 8\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\* \\**\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\**\n\n**Completion Requirements:**\n\n***Closing Notes are required to be provided before leaving the location.*** *These notes should pertain to the SOW of this workorder only. If working multiple tickets, please keep closing remarks specific to the scope of this workorder. This should be* ***a detailed and concise statement about the work performed****.****Please do not include personal opinions, jargon, statements about pay or travel or any other feedback not directly related to the specifics of the repair; These other issues should be addressed directly with the Shyft Services Work Order Manager.***\n\n*2.* **Part Information**:\n\n**Unused Parts**: - Must be returned. - Use the return label included in the box.- Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Used Parts**: - If marked Returnable = Yes → Return required. - Photos required: Serial Number + Asset Tag of installed and removed parts.\n\n**Missing Return Label**: - Within the Part module, select the part usage code from the drop-down list. You will then be asked \"Do you have the return shipping label\". Click the slider to No and Save. A Problem Report will be created requesting the label.\n\n**General Rules**: - Return all returnable unused parts and all returnable used parts to FedEx with 24 hours of Check Out. - Parts belong to AVT/Shyft Services. - Do not leave parts onsite. Parts left onsite are subject to an Admin Process fee.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T07:00","end":"2026-11-10T08:45","latestStart":"2026-11-10T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":80,"max":80},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1.75,"distance":2.902714882195444},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/10/2026, 7:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Pro