{"job":{"id":20344899,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Alert SRC Newco LLC","title":"Intrusion/ Surveillance System Site Survey- Henderson, NC","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in&nbsp;CCTV and Intrusion.</li></ul><p>The primary scope is to survey for:</p><ul><li>1. Intrusion: New systems or takeovers/panel swaps.</li><li>2.Cameras: Not a current priority, but a brief look at any existing systems while on site would help us identify opportunities to discuss with the client.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li><li>Fire: New systems if there is nothing in place already. If the site has a system, then we would just be doing monitoring takeovers. Would also need zone list for annual T&amp;I. a. 3. Specific request to check if systems have CO2 detectors already installed too</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1 hour.</li></ul><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>On-Site Tasks </em></strong></p><ol><li>Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent UAS while onsite</li><li>Take Pictures</li></ol><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><em>Required On-Site Deliverables </em></strong></p><ol><li>Complete and submit survey.  https://form.jotform.com/262583992679176</li></ol><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Communication Directory: </strong></p><ul><li>If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with&nbsp;sales rep</li><li>Any issues or questions should be escalated to&nbsp;sales rep.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in CCTV and Intrusion.\n\nThe primary scope is to survey for:\n\n- 1. Intrusion: New systems or takeovers/panel swaps.\n- 2.Cameras: Not a current priority, but a brief look at any existing systems while on site would help us identify opportunities to discuss with the client.\n- Fire: New systems if there is nothing in place already. If the site has a system, then we would jus