{"job":{"id":20344885,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Life Station","title":"Medical Alert Unit Installation & Test","description":{"html":"<strong>Job Title</strong><p>Medical Alert Device Installation &amp; Testing</p><strong>Job Description</strong><p>Install and activate a medical alert device in a member’s home. Device <strong>must be successfully tested with the monitoring center</strong> to complete the job.</p><strong>Scope of Work</strong><ul><li>Install and power on assigned medical alert unit</li><li>Test device with monitoring center (2-way voice required)</li><li>Educate member on basic device operation</li><li>Collect required paperwork and documentation</li></ul><strong>Pre-Dispatch Requirements</strong><ul><li>Confirm <strong>equipment delivery</strong> using provided tracking number</li><li>Contact member to <strong>schedule a confirmed appointment</strong></li><li><strong>DO NOT</strong> go onsite without a scheduled appointment</li><li>Use assigned <strong>translator service</strong> if noted on work order</li><li>Print paperwork before arrival:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">(2) Service Agreements</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">(1) Installer Checklist</li><li>Appointments allowed <strong>Mon–Sat, 9:00 AM–7:00 PM</strong></li><li><strong>NO Sunday installs</strong></li></ul><strong>Onsite Requirements</strong><ul><li>Install medical alert device</li><li>Perform a <strong>live test with monitoring center</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Member must communicate via 2-way speaker</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Test is internally verified prior to payment</li><li>Confirm and document:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Member address</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Member phone number</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Emergency contact name &amp; phone number</li><li>Answer member questions before leaving</li><li>If it says <strong>FALL DETECTION</strong> you must read attached script</li></ul><strong>Documentation Required (Upload to Work Order)</strong><ul><li>Photo of <strong>signed Installer Checklist</strong></li><li>Photo of <strong>signed Service Agreement</strong></li><li>Photo of installed unit showing <strong>unit number</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Signing Instructions</strong></p><ul><li>Member or authorized representative may sign</li><li>If someone signs for the member:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Write member’s name</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Note signee name and reason</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Initials acceptable if needed</li></ul><strong>Paperwork Handling</strong><ul><li>Mail original signed documents using provided <strong>prepaid envelope</strong></li><li>Member keeps second Service Agreement copy</li><li>If member says paperwork was already mailed, <strong>re-sign and upload again</strong></li></ul><strong>Missed Appointments / Reschedules</strong><ul><li>Confirm appointment <strong>day of install</strong></li><li>If no one is home:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">One-time <strong>$20 trip fee</strong> may be paid (company discretion)</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No multiple revisit fees</li><li>If member cancels/reschedules:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Upload details to work order</li><li>If tech cannot meet scheduled time:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Contact member and document reschedule</li></ul><strong>Service Refusal / Cancellation</strong><ul><li>Notify company immediately</li><li>Retrieve old unit if applicable</li><li>Return retrieved units promptly (return label provided)</li><li>Cancellation fee paid at our discretion.</li><li>No cancellation fee is paid if the member requests cancellation before going out to the home.</li></ul><strong>Support &amp; Escalation</strong><ul><li>Test issues or assistance:</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Call <strong>800-998-2400</strong></li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Identify yourself as a <strong>Field Nation Technician</strong></li><li>After 6 PM EST: Use Customer Service or message the work order</li><li>Pricing questions → Member’s Case Manager</li></ul><strong>IMPORTANT</strong><ul><li><strong>Payment requires a verified successful test</strong></li><li><strong>Do NOT go onsite without confirmed delivery &amp; appointment</strong></li><li><strong>Failure to follow instructions may result in non-payment</strong></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>&nbsp;**THIS SERVICE IS A FREE SERVICE TO THE USER AND IS PAID FOR BY THEIR </strong><strong style=\"color: red;\">MEDICAID</strong><strong> PROVIDER**</strong></p>","markdown":"**Job Title**Medical Alert Device Installation &amp; Testing\n\n**Job Description**Install and activate a medical alert device in a member’s home. Device **must be successfully tested with the monitoring center** to complete the job.\n\n**Scope of Work**- Install and power on assigned medical alert unit\n- Test device with monitoring center (2-way voice required)\n- Educate member on basic device operation\n- Collect required paperwork and documentation\n\n**Pre-Dispatch Requirements**- Confirm **equipment delivery** using provided tracking number\n- Contact member to **schedule a confirmed appointment**\n- **DO NOT** go onsite without a scheduled appointment\n- Use assigned **translator service** if noted on work order\n- Print paperwork before arrival:\n- (2) Service Agreements\n- (1) Installer Checklist\n- Appointments allowed **Mon–Sat, 9:00 AM–7:00 PM**\n- **NO Sunday installs**\n\n**Onsite Requirements**- Install medical alert device\n- Perform a **live test with monitoring center**\n- Member must communicate via 2-way speaker\n- Test is internally verified prior to payment\n- Confirm and document:\n- Member address\n- Member phone number\n- Emergency contact name &amp; phone number\n- Answer member questions before leaving\n- If it says **FALL DETECTION** you must read attached script\n\n**Documentation Required (Upload to Work Order)**- Photo of **signed Installer Checklist**\n- Photo of **signed Service Agreement**\n- Photo of installed unit showing **unit number**\n\n**Signing Instructions**\n\n- Member or authorized representative may sign\n- If someone signs for the member:\n- Write member’s name\n- Note signee name and reason\n- Initials acceptable if needed\n\n**Paperwork Handling**- Mail original signed documents using provided **prepaid envelope**\n- Member keeps second Service Agreement copy\n- If member says paperwork was already mailed, **re-sign and upload again**\n\n**Missed Appointments / Reschedules**- Confirm appointment **day of install**\n- If no one is home:\n- One-time **$20 trip fee** may be paid (company discretion)\n- No multiple revisit fees\n- If member cancels/reschedules:\n- Upload details to work order\n- If tech cannot meet scheduled time:\n- Contact member and document reschedule\n\n**Service Refusal / Cancellation**- Notify company immediately\n- Retrieve old unit if applicable\n- Return retrieved units promptly (return label provided)\n- Cancellation fee paid at our discretion.\n- No cancellation fee is paid if the member requests cancellation before going out to the home.\n\n**Support &amp; Escalation**- Test issues or assistance:\n- Call **800-998-2400**\n- Identify yourself as a **Field Nation Technician**\n- After 6 PM EST: Use Customer Service or message the work order\n- Pricing questions → Member’s Case Manager\n\n**IMPORTANT**- **Payment requires a verified successful test**\n- **Do NOT go onsite without confirmed delivery &amp; appointment**\n- **Failure to follow instructions may result in non-payment**\n\n **\\*\\*THIS SERVICE IS A FREE SERVICE TO THE USER AND IS PAID FOR BY THEIR** **MEDICAID** **PROVIDER\\*\\***","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T09:00","end":"2026-12-04T19:00"},"payRange":{"min":100,"max":100},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":60.53084035612711},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $100 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availab