t be doing monitoring takeovers. Would also need zone list for annual T&amp;I. a. 3. Specific request to check if systems have CO2 detectors already installed too\n- Estimated duration will be 1 hour.\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n1. Check-in to work order and introduce yourself to the onsite contact. You represent UAS while onsite\n2. Take Pictures\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n1. Complete and submit survey. <https://form.jotform.com/262583992679176>\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- If clarification is needed on work order, discuss with sales rep\n- Any issues or questions should be escalated to sales rep.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-13T08:15","end":"2026-11-13T09:15","latestStart":"2026-11-13T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":200,"max":200},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":35.198615249849105},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $200 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-18T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-11T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Dispatch for ticket #7121628 | 11/10/26, 12:00 PM (WM)"},{"start":"2026-12-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-01T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 AXON - Wilson Police Department - NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 ***Thermo Fisher | Network Cutover Assistance*** (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z