{"job":{"id":"4629748449","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"Logical Maintenance Solutions","title":"1133181.1 HP E77830Z Printer fails to turn on. Customer has attempted different outlets and power cords.","description":"Customer Reference: 1133181   --- YOU ARE REPRESENTING --- ABM FEDERAL<br> <br> <br>--- INSTRUCTIONS ---<br><br>*MUST SPEAK WITH THE USER TO SET AN APT. <br>Tech needs an appointment with the end user, no Voicemail. <br>Need to provide the name of the tech so the site can put him on the security list.<br><br><br> <br> <br>Tech must confirm ETA with POC before arrival. If no work is performed after confirmed ETA, travel rate will be discussed with TAG.<br> <br> <br>Technician must take clear photos before and after service of the unit and surrounding area (before service starts and after service is completed) to document site condition and parts installed.<br>(Photos are required for checkout and serve as proof of service and site condition.)<br> <br> <br>For any onsite issues (model mismatch, part direction, or completion), contact dispatch at 714-549-1608 Opt 2.<br> <br> <br>Initial notes:  HP E77830Z Printer fails to turn on. Customer has attempted different outlets and power cords. <br> <br> <br>Parts Ordered: RM3-7241-000CN       Low-voltage power supply (110-127V) <br><br>Per Support:Called EU at the number provided and left a vm to verify the printer issue and printer location on base.<br> <br>Nick called and confirmed the issue and the site location. Please provide him with tracking information at nicholas.flaherty@us.af.mil<br> <br>A techlink has been set up. Please make sure you download the manual and take it with you to the site if needed.<br><br>https://axiom.falconsystem.com/tech-link/login <br>techlink user name and password are the call number- 1133181<br> <br> <br>**It is required to update POC/EU of next Plan of Action before leaving site, Please provide name of POC/EU you provided the update to**<br> <br> <br>**Technicians are required to provide all deliverables and update/closing notes before leaving the site. Prior to departure, technicians must contact Dispatch at 714-549-1608, Option 2, to provide a final status update and receive checkout approval.***The technician is required to work with LMS/Axiom Tech Support while on-site. (7145491608 extn 3)***<br> <br> <br>General Instructions for All Calls-<br>Verify parts arrival and access Tech Link if needed.<br>Confirm the serial number and troubleshoot before replacing any parts.<br>If a formatter is replaced, reset the serial number and page count.<br>Do not discuss toner issues with the user — report them to LMS instead.<br>If the serial number or model doesn’t match, call dispatch for approval before proceeding.<br>After service completion, call Parts Recovery (Opt 5) for payment confirmation and inform dispatch who signed the FSR.<br>If facing any issue onsite (printer, parts, or user not found), or waiting on dispatch instructions, contact LMS after 10–15 minutes.","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-10T09:00","end":"2026-11-10T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":72.4910836},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":53.6},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 11/10/2026, 9:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-11T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"