{"job":{"id":20347585,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"DarTex Technical Services","title":"Trouble shoot All of our conference rooms  were kicked off-line ","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Scope of work:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Client Room: SFL+a Architects -</p><p>Fayetteville, NC - Main Conference&nbsp;</p><p>Room 335</p><p>Issue: All of our conference rooms&nbsp;</p><p>were kicked offline yesterday&nbsp;</p><p>afternoon. We were able to get most&nbsp;</p><p>rooms back online, but our Big&nbsp;</p><p>Training Room and a small Teams&nbsp;</p><p>room are still showing offline and&nbsp;</p><p>cannot get connected. We’ve done&nbsp;</p><p>multiple troubleshooting steps with&nbsp;</p><p>our IT team.</p><p>Support Contact: Kyle Buzalek&nbsp;888 454-6863, Option 2&nbsp;</p><p>Cenero Work Order - WON1034485&nbsp;</p><p>WORK ORDER RESOLUTION SUMMARY: Please provide work order resolution details and provide the completed form to the Cenero Support Contact listed above. Required fields are represented by “*”. Be as thorough as possible in providing steps taken to resolve the client’s issue.&nbsp;</p><p>**DISPATCH INSTRUCTIONS (Updated 11/6): Client is requesting a technician be dispatched to assist with reviewing the connection status of the Training Room (334) on-site. Once the fix/next steps are determined, information will need to be provided to the on-site team to review remaining rooms that are not currently under service coverage. The technician will only be reviewing Training Room 334 while on-site. (Follow-up dispatch can be scheduled based on findings to review remaining rooms.)</p>","markdown":"**Scope of work:**\n\nClient Room: SFL+a Architects -\n\nFayetteville, NC - Main Conference\n\nRoom 335\n\nIssue: All of our conference rooms\n\nwere kicked offline yesterday\n\nafternoon. We were able to get most\n\nrooms back online, but our Big\n\nTraining Room and a small Teams\n\nroom are still showing offline and\n\ncannot get connected. We’ve done\n\nmultiple troubleshooting steps with\n\nour IT team.\n\nSupport Contact: Kyle Buzalek 888 454-6863, Option 2\n\nCenero Work Order - WON1034485\n\nWORK ORDER RESOLUTION SUMMARY: Please provide work order resolution details and provide the completed form to the Cenero Support Contact listed above. Required fields are represented by “\\*”. Be as thorough as possible in providing steps taken to resolve the client’s issue.\n\n\\*\\*DISPATCH INSTRUCTIONS (Updated 11/6): Client is requesting a technician be dispatched to assist with reviewing the connection status of the Training Room (334) on-site. Once the fix/next steps are determined, information will need to be provided to the on-site team to review remaining rooms that are not currently under service coverage. The technician will only be reviewing Training Room 334 while on-site. (Follow-up dispatch can be scheduled based on findings to review remaining rooms.)","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T09:00","end":"2026-11-12T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-12T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":185,"max":245},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":3,"amount":185},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":60}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":9.414188827254131},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $245 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-