{"job":{"id":20348253,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Package Solutions Inc","title":"Restore Network to Package Room - Remote Support - EST 4 Hrs","description":{"html":"<strong>Overview</strong><p>The package room is currently offline and requires an on-site technician to confirm and restore network connectivity. The technician will need to bring a laptop with either a built-in Ethernet port or a USB-to-Ethernet adapter to test the connection directly. The goal of this visit is to determine if the package room is receiving internet service from the ISP modem, confirm cable connectivity, and assist <del>************</del> Support in bringing the system back online.</p><p>Support will provide remote guidance during troubleshooting, including the exact location of the network router and ISP modem. The technician will be expected to perform direct connectivity testing, document findings, and work with Support until the issue is resolved or the root cause is identified. Photos and notes of the work performed will be required.</p><p><br></p><strong>Requirements</strong><ul><li>Laptop with Ethernet port or USB-to-Ethernet adapter</li><li>LAN tester/toner (recommended)</li><li>Phone to stay in contact with <del>************</del> Support</li></ul><strong>Onsite Steps</strong><ol><li><strong>Contact Support:</strong> Call <del>************</del> Support (<del>************</del>) upon arrival.</li><li><strong>Locate Network Equipment:</strong> Support will direct you to the router and ISP modem for testing.</li><li><strong>Confirm Connectivity:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Unplug the Ethernet cable currently connected to the <strong>WAN port on the router</strong>.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Plug that cable directly into your laptop’s network port.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Attempt to access the internet (e.g., open google.com) to confirm internet connectivity directly from the ISP modem.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Report findings back to Support.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Cable Tracing (if needed):</strong> Use LAN tester/toner to verify cable continuity and confirm labeling.</li><li><strong>Work With Support:</strong> Follow the troubleshooting instructions step by step until the package room is restored or the issue is escalated.</li><li><strong>Document Work:</strong> Take photos of router/modem connections, cable labeling, and any changes made.</li><li><strong>Close Out:</strong> Confirm with Support that all systems are operational before leaving the site.</li></ol><strong>Deliverables</strong><ul><li>Verification of internet restored OR confirmation of identified issue</li><li>Photos of connections, labeling, and equipment</li><li>Detailed notes of testing performed and results</li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview**The package room is currently offline and requires an on-site technician to confirm and restore network connectivity. The technician will need to bring a laptop with either a built-in Ethernet port or a USB-to-Ethernet adapter to test the connection directly. The goal of this visit is to determine if the package room is receiving internet service from the ISP modem, confirm cable connectivity, and assist \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Support in bringing the system back online.\n\nSupport will provide remote guidance during troubleshooting, including the exact location of the network router and ISP modem. The technician will be expected to perform direct connectivity testing, document findings, and work with Support until the issue is resolved or the root cause is identified. Photos and notes of the work performed will be required.\n\n**Requirements**- Laptop with Ethernet port or USB-to-Ethernet adapter\n- LAN tester/toner (recommended)\n- Phone to stay in contact with \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Support\n\n**Onsite Steps**1. **Contact Support:** Call \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Support (\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*) upon arrival.\n2. **Locate Network Equipment:** Support will direct you to the router and ISP modem for testing.\n3. **Confirm Connectivity:**\n\n- Unplug the Ethernet cable currently connected to the **WAN port on the router**.\n- Plug that cable directly into your laptop’s network port.\n- Attempt to access the internet (e.g., open google.com) to confirm internet connectivity directly from the ISP modem.\n- Report findings back to Support.\n\n1. **Cable Tracing (if needed):** Use LAN tester/toner to verify cable continuity and confirm labeling.\n2. **Work With Support:** Follow the troubleshooting instructions step by step until the package room is restored or the issue is escalated.\n3. **Document Work:** Take photos of router/modem connections, cable labeling, and any changes made.\n4. **Close Out:** Confirm with Support that all systems are operational before leaving the site.\n\n**Deliverables**- Verification of internet restored OR confirmation of identified issue\n- Photos of connections, labeling, and equipment\n- Detailed notes of testing performed and results","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-11T10:00","end":"2026-11-12T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":90,"max":180},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":90,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":14.15060334150807},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE","rejectDetails":"📅 No available schedule slot\nRequested: Wed, Nov 11, 10:00 AM\nChecked: Wed, Nov 11, Thu, Nov 12, Fri, Nov 13 · 9:00 AM–8:00 PM\nNo block long enough was found."},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11