{"job":{"id":20348306,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Site Services Now","title":"TWO / 48-Bay Kiosk Relocation on 11/12 (Tech #2)","description":{"html":"<p>Scope: TWO technicians needed to relocate QTY TWO 48 bay kiosks inside this Sam’s Club. Read all instructions below and attachments before arriving.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Check in/out is mandatory:</p>\n<p>Call Tech Support at <del>***** *** ****</del> on arrival and again before leaving to confirm the work is complete. No calls, no payment.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>***** TIMING: ALLOCATE TWO HOURS PER KIOSK *****</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Requirements:</p>\n<p>Follow all site safety guidelines.</p>\n<p>Fill the old mounting holes with Quikrete or equivalent.</p>\n<p>Reinstall the kiosks using their original bolts.</p>\n<p>DO NOT leave site without completing bolting.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>DATE: Thursday Nov 12th, 2026</p>\n<p>POC: <del>**** **** ***** ******* ************</del></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>Additional Site requirements:</p>\n<p>Tools needed (at least one tech must bring) :</p>\n<p>Impact/hammer drill rated for 3\" concrete</p>\n<p>7/16\" drill bit</p>\n<p>3/4\" socket with the correct chuck adapter (SDS if needed) to drive anchor bolts</p>\n<p>2 four wheel furniture dollies or 1 hand truck</p>\n<p>Cordless drill with Phillips bit</p>\n<p>Compressed air and vacuum for concrete dust</p>\n<p>Eye protection and face mask</p>\n<p>Standard socket set</p>\n<p>Adjustable wrench or open end wrench set</p>\n<p>Sharpie</p>\n<p>Tape measure</p>\n<p>Level</p>\n<p>Razor blade or utility knife</p>\n<p>Microfiber cloth</p>\n<p>Quikrete or equivalent</p>","markdown":"Scope: TWO technicians needed to relocate QTY TWO 48 bay kiosks inside this Sam’s Club. Read all instructions below and attachments before arriving.\n\nCheck in/out is mandatory:\n\nCall Tech Support at \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* on arrival and again before leaving to confirm the work is complete. No calls, no payment.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* TIMING: ALLOCATE TWO HOURS PER KIOSK \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nRequirements:\n\nFollow all site safety guidelines.\n\nFill the old mounting holes with Quikrete or equivalent.\n\nReinstall the kiosks using their original bolts.\n\nDO NOT leave site without completing bolting.\n\nDATE: Thursday Nov 12th, 2026\n\nPOC: \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nAdditional Site requirements:\n\nTools needed (at least one tech must bring) :\n\nImpact/hammer drill rated for 3\" concrete\n\n7/16\" drill bit\n\n3/4\" socket with the correct chuck adapter (SDS if needed) to drive anchor bolts\n\n2 four wheel furniture dollies or 1 hand truck\n\nCordless drill with Phillips bit\n\nCompressed air and vacuum for concrete dust\n\nEye protection and face mask\n\nStandard socket set\n\nAdjustable wrench or open end wrench set\n\nSharpie\n\nTape measure\n\nLevel\n\nRazor blade or utility knife\n\nMicrofiber cloth\n\nQuikrete or equivalent","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T08:00","end":"2026-11-12T13:00","latestStart":"2026-11-12T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":210},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":1,"amount":50},"additional":{"units":4,"amount":40}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":5,"distance":9.14027850365992},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $210 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end"