{"job":{"id":20348368,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Smart Choice Commnunications","title":"Dunn -2nd Day of support after install - Order 35434-35438","description":{"html":"<p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Scope for All Sites</strong></p><ul><li>Verify all new telephone handsets are powered on and operational.</li><li>Confirm phones are registered with the telephone system.</li><li>Verify users are assigned to the correct extensions and telephone numbers.</li><li>Assist employees with becoming familiar with their new telephone handsets.</li><li>Provide basic instruction on phone features and functionality.</li><li>Assist users with placing and receiving calls.</li><li>Verify internal extension-to-extension calling.</li><li>Verify inbound and outbound external calling.</li><li>Test call transfers and call holds.</li><li>Verify voicemail access and basic voicemail functionality.</li><li>Confirm speakerphone, mute, volume, and headset functionality.</li><li>Assist with speed dial, call forwarding, and other standard features, where applicable.</li><li>Troubleshoot initial connectivity or registration issues.</li><li>Escalate phone system programming or configuration issues to the appropriate support team.</li></ul><p><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: black;\">Equipment Needed:</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Laptop/console cable with power supply</span></p><p><span style=\"color: black;\">Cell phone with charger and earbuds</span></p>","markdown":"**Scope for All Sites**\n\n- Verify all new telephone handsets are powered on and operational.\n- Confirm phones are registered with the telephone system.\n- Verify users are assigned to the correct extensions and telephone numbers.\n- Assist employees with becoming familiar with their new telephone handsets.\n- Provide basic instruction on phone features and functionality.\n- Assist users with placing and receiving calls.\n- Verify internal extension-to-extension calling.\n- Verify inbound and outbound external calling.\n- Test call transfers and call holds.\n- Verify voicemail access and basic voicemail functionality.\n- Confirm speakerphone, mute, volume, and headset functionality.\n- Assist with speed dial, call forwarding, and other standard features, where applicable.\n- Troubleshoot initial connectivity or registration issues.\n- Escalate phone system programming or configuration issues to the appropriate support team.\n\n**Equipment Needed:**\n\nLaptop/console cable with power supply\n\nCell phone with charger and earbuds","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-20T08:00","end":"2026-11-20T10:00"},"payRange":{"min":65,"max":130},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":65,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":40.037987031855565},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $130 (countered: $130) is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-20T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-21T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-23T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-24T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-24T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-25T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-23T03:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-23T04:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay Bills"},{"start":"2026-11-11T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Dispatch for ticket #7121628 | 11/10/26, 12:00 PM (WM)"},{"start":"2026-12-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-12-01T15:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 AXON - Wilson Police Department - NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 The Preiss Company-05974911-Epik Cutover & Test (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Advance Auto Parts - Phone Swap - 4810 Raleigh  NC (WM)"},{"start":"2026-11-17T17:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T20:30:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Rollins/Orkin Pest Control - FortiGate Swap & edgebootPro inst