{"job":{"id":20349162,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Ovation Workplace Services","title":"Network tech required","description":{"html":"<p>8.Short description of the reported issue: Tech to get cordless phones back on line (tech will work with Matt F.), tech will also inspect and test to see if there are data jacks in the Lobby and conference rooms.</p><p><br></p><p>9.If L1/L2 is required: L2</p><p><br></p><p>10.Mandate Action required:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bomgar software to be installed in every dispatch engineer laptop.</p><p>Upload an image of Kronos clock during the Entry time and Exit time.</p><p>Engineers are required to contact the Dispatch Team before leaving the clinic.</p><p>Ovation engineer should introduce himself in the clinic saying he/she is from Fresenius IT support</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>11.Engineers are required to carry the following equipment:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Personal Cell phone and Laptop with Microsoft Teams access and PuTTY (For being able to contact each other and possibly hotspot).</p><p>-A Screwdriver and Allen wrench.</p><p>-10 ft data cable.ac</p><p>-Console Cable for Cisco / HP Router, Switch</p><p>-Cable tester&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>-Tone generator&nbsp;</p><p>-Toner</p><p>- USB of 2GB empty space</p><p>-Network sockets and Network cables needs to be inspected and if required to replace</p><p>and tech should have at least 20 cables and Sockets with Tech, if required have to use.</p><p>-If clinic is having the required equipment to use or else tech have to use their own.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>12.After the completion of Visit:</p><p>Update the SVR with Resolution Steps</p><p>&nbsp;</p>","markdown":"8.Short description of the reported issue: Tech to get cordless phones back on line (tech will work with Matt F.), tech will also inspect and test to see if there are data jacks in the Lobby and conference rooms.\n\n9.If L1/L2 is required: L2\n\n10.Mandate Action required:\n\nBomgar software to be installed in every dispatch engineer laptop.\n\nUpload an image of Kronos clock during the Entry time and Exit time.\n\nEngineers are required to contact the Dispatch Team before leaving the clinic.\n\nOvation engineer should introduce himself in the clinic saying he/she is from Fresenius IT support\n\n11.Engineers are required to carry the following equipment:\n\n-Personal Cell phone and Laptop with Microsoft Teams access and PuTTY (For being able to contact each other and possibly hotspot).\n\n-A Screwdriver and Allen wrench.\n\n-10 ft data cable.ac\n\n-Console Cable for Cisco / HP Router, Switch\n\n-Cable tester\n\n-Tone generator\n\n-Toner\n\n\\- USB of 2GB empty space\n\n-Network sockets and Network cables needs to be inspected and if required to replace\n\nand tech should have at least 20 cables and Sockets with Tech, if required have to use.\n\n-If clinic is having the required equipment to use or else tech have to use their own.\n\n12.After the completion of Visit:\n\nUpdate the SVR with Resolution Steps","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-11-12T10:00","end":"2026-11-12T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":50,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":50,"estLaborHours":3,"distance":60.80553468975719},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $150 (countered: $180) is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-13T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-13T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-16T21:30:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-11-17T00:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-11-12T14:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Progitech"},{"start":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Pay bills BoA + Amex"},{"start":"2026-11-11T17:00:00.0